window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2901,"title":"Chapter 2901 Is This a Pretend Weakness Scheme?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2901 Is This a Pretend Weakness Scheme?","In Wen Yu and Liu Jie’s minds, Listen was a very prideful person. He might not show this on the surface but it was clear from his actions!","For Listen to recommend Gu Lang, it meant that he had attained Listen’s acknowledgment and that Listen genuinely believed that Gu Lang was stronger than him!","Wen Yu’s eyes flashed. She had always been Sky City’s main manager. Yet, she never noticed anything special about Gu Lang. This made her reflect on whether she had lost her sharp eye because of how busy she had been of late.","Listen rarely recommended anyone to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was silent for a moment before he replied, “Listen, you, Gu Lang, and Endless Summer are a team. Until now, you’ve been the one leading this team. You can decide for yourself how this team should develop from now on.","“If you need anything, let Wen Yu know and she’ll make things easier for you. If you come up against any external obstacles, go ahead and remove them.”","After Su Yiren and Luo Lan arrived, they conversed with Lin Yuan for a while as well.","They did not talk about their struggles, but they seriously told Lin Yuan about the issue that Wen Yu had just highlighted.","The two of them let out sighs of relief when Lin Yuan said that he could resolve the issue.","With the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, Lin Yuan could continue to control everything in Sky City even while he was traveling.","With Lin Yuan making the decisions, Sky City developed even faster than before.","...","Jin Chen completed the trade with the Andra clan and brought back a large amount of blood-type spiritual ingredients for Lin Yuan.","As a native expert from the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Jin Chen knew which side had the advantage in a trade.","The Andra clan had been very sincere in the trade and were willing to absorb some losses if it meant that they could demonstrate their goodwill to Lin Yuan.","However, Jin Chen was very unhappy with the Andra clan. During the trade, he sensed that the two Elders he had been trading with had made several attempts to gain information from him. They had even hinted that they could give him some benefits.","If Jin Chen was not completely under Lin Yuan’s control, to the point that Lin Yuan even decided whether he lived or died, Jin Chen might have taken the bait that the Andra clan had dangled in front of him!","Jin Chen told all of this to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was not bothered when he heard that. He never assumed he was truly on good terms with the Andra clan just because they held a banquet to receive him.","It was true that the Andra clan wanted to be on good terms with him ever since witnessing his power. However, it would be more accurate to say that they wanted to use him.","Lin Yuan had only ever intended to make use of the Andra clan as well.","Suddenly, Jin Chen remembered something. Before trading with the Andra clan, he saw Feng Xuan, who had brought Lin Yuan to the Andra clan.","Feng Xuan had said that he really wanted to meet with Lin Yuan. However, Jin Chen was not in a position to make a decision and had not responded to Feng Xuan.","Now that the memory had surfaced, he told Lin Yuan about this.","Jin Chen sensed that Feng Xuan had been injured. His roots were seriously damaged as well.","If injured roots were not treated in time, there would be serious consequences.","It was likely that Feng Xuan had ended up in this state because of what he had done at the banquet. The Andra clan had expressed their anger to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. In order to appease them, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ leader had abandoned Feng Xuan.","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow. He had communicated with Fan Lou twice. Just like how Feng Qing had allowed Fan Lou to decide Feng Xuan’s fate, Lin Yuan allowed Fan Lou to decide the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ fate.","Fan Lou’s final decision was to eliminate the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and use them as a springboard.","With such a goal, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were definitely headed for death!","But now, Feng Xuan’s actions could not drag down the entire Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Hence, he needed a larger stage.","“Jin Chen, since Feng Xuan wants to see me, bring him to me. I also want to thank him for bringing me to the Andra clan.”","Jin Chen froze momentarily before bowing respectfully to Lin Yuan and backing out of the room.","Jin Chen had a feeling that there was nothing in this world that Lin Yuan would not be able to calculate or plan for!","Since Lin Yuan was willing to meet Feng Xuan, it meant that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ fate was sealed.","...","Feng Xuan had been taken away by members of the Andra clan before receiving Lin Yuan’s response.","Out of consideration for their dignity, the Andra clan would not go over the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ heads to handle Feng Xuan. It was likely that Feng Xuan would be sent back to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","There was no way that Feng Xuan would have a good time back with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves!","Without Lin Yuan’s response, it was as though he had rejected his connection to Feng Xuan. This caused Feng Xuan to become useless to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","It was just as Jin Chen had predicted. The Andra clan had delivered Feng Xuan back to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Andre had been the one who delivered Feng Xuan to Feng Qing.","Andre had not mistreated Feng Xuan. He saw him as lowly but did reproach Feng Qing fiercely.","Feng Qing’s face transitioned through shades of red and white, but he had no choice but to apologize continuously to Andre.","Feng Qing never intended to let Feng Xuan go free. But now that he had been insulted because of Feng Xuan, Feng Qing’s heart burned with killing intent.","Andre did not think much of Feng Qing. The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were nothing more than one of the Bloodians’ dependent species. The Bloodians were also the ones who decided whether the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves lived or died.","Andre thought that after handing Feng Xuan over to Feng Qing and giving him a scolding, Feng Qing would remember his lesson. However, Feng Qing had not listened to anything he had said at all!","Apart from the scolding, Andre’s tone became increasingly insulting.","After hearing what Andre told Feng Qing, Feng Xuan’s heart pounded. He felt utterly hopeless.","Feng Xuan thought back to how Feng Qing had treated him. It was likely that it was because of another insulting scolding that Feng Qing had received from Andre.","Feng Qing did not decide to kill Feng Xuan outright. Since he had made a promise to Fan Lou, he would not go back on his word.","Feng Qing regretted not imprisoning Feng Xuan after the last incident. He should not have given Feng Xuan the chance to move freely.","Feng Xuan had completely ignored his words and had not reflected on his actions at all.","Feng Qing placed Feng Xuan in a prison and thought that this messy event would finally come to an end. However, in just a few hours, Andre came back and furiously asked where Feng Xuan was.","Feng Xuan was imprisoned. There was no way he had caused more trouble, right?","Feng Qing humbled himself completely in front of Andre. He did not come across as the leader of a species at all.","“Your Excellency, Andre. Why have you come back to see me? When Feng Xuan angered you, he had been acting on his own, and I’ve taught him a lesson. He won’t be interfering with the Andra clan’s plan again!”","Andre’s current attitude was far more aggressive than it had been when he sent Feng Xuan back.","Andre always saw Feng Xuan as a trivial character. This trivial character did not even catch the eye of the Andra clan, much less someone like Lin Yuan.","While interacting with Lin Yuan, Andre had sensed Lin Yuan’s prideful air. It could even be described as arrogance!","There was no way that Lin Yuan had come to see Feng Xuan because he was scheming and trying to target Feng Xuan. It was likely that Feng Xuan had used a certain method to attract Lin Yuan’s attention. He truly did not know his place!","Andre scanned Feng Qing’s expression to try and discern something.","Feng Qing had even been willing to hurt Feng Xuan’s roots. Was this a pretend weakness scheme?","To any large species, exchanging a few members for an opportunity was a reliable and beneficial choice.","As this thought occupied more of Andre’s mind, his gaze became increasingly wicked.","“The plan has already been interfered with. Feng Qing, let me warn you one last time. Don’t forget how the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves managed to become linked with the Andra clan. The Andra clan is willing to nurture the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, yet you harbor thoughts of mutiny.","“Do you think the Andra clan are saints? When a dog bites its owner, it has to be killed. Do you really think that the Elise clan, which doesn’t come from the Scarlet Territory in the first place, will offend a Bloodian clan for the sake of another species?”","From Andre’s words, Feng Qing could tell that Andre was extremely upset. At the same time, he managed to guess Andre’s reason for saying such things. He had misunderstood the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","If he truly wanted to curry favor with that young member of the Elise clan, he could not use such a dumb method!","Feng Qing had always cared about how the Andra clan viewed the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","In truth, if the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves wanted to move forward, they needed to establish a positive connection to the four major species of the Lonely River. This would not affect the Andra clan’s profits.","Feng Qing knew what kind of species the Bloodians were. They never tolerated any mistakes made by their dependent species.","Feng Qing hastily said, “I can swear on the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ ancestors that we have never wanted to leave the Andra clan. Please look into this carefully! This is a small gesture from me, I hope you will accept it!”","Feng Qing took out a fang-shaped spatial equipment and handed it to Andre.","Andre’s expression became more pleasant.","After receiving Feng Qing’s spatial equipment, he said coldly, “Feng Qing, the Andra clan has always treated the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves well. Do not forget this! Let the one who I sent back take me around. Black Elise wants to see him!”","Andre’s attitude toward Feng Qing changed because of the resources he had been gifted. If Feng Qing had not made any gestures, he would have been further berated by Andre!","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves ancestors had been a branch of the Moon-Worshiping Wolves. It was not a glittering legacy.","To a species like the Bloodians who valued legacy, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were a very lowly species. Even if the species with long legacies were weaker than the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, they would receive much better treatment from the Bloodians than the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves did.","Feng Qing assumed that Feng Xuan had only bumped into the young Bloodian named Black Elise by chance and that Black Elise couldn’t care less about Feng Xuan. He assumed that the Andra clan were angered by Feng Xuan trying to use this to bolster his status.","So why was the Bloodian named Black Elise asking to see Feng Xuan?","The gears in Feng Qing’s mind began turning, and he began trying to come up with ways to curry favor with the Elise clan.","A careful person like Feng Qing was thinking this way because he had been repeatedly pressured by the Andra clan.","Feng Qing could clearly sense that the Andra clan’s treatment of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves was worsening, and this made him very anxious.","Alas, he did not know how to improve the situation.","If Andre wanted to take Feng Xuan away, he could not say no.","All he could do was hope that Feng Xuan did not do something stupid again. Even if he failed to make contact with Black Elise, he did not want to increase the displeasure that the Andra clan felt toward the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Given Feng Qing’s understanding of Feng Xuan, he knew that Feng Xuan would do everything he could to gain the favor of Black Elise and increase his value.","Feng Qing did not expect his actions to have wholly disappointed Feng Xuan. In fact, Feng Xuan resented his own bloodline now.","Feng Xuan’s disappointment in Feng Qing triggered him more than his envy of Fan Lou did.","When Andre received Feng Xuan from Feng Qing, a sour expression appeared on his face.","“Feng Qing, do you expect me to take this injury-ridden fellow to meet with Black Elise? Hurry up and heal him before changing into some clean and presentable clothes!”","After completing the trade with Lin Yuan through Jin Chen, the Andra clan seemed to have suffered a loss after giving up a large amount of blood-type spiritual ingredients. However, the Creator resources that Lin Yuan had given them were of an extremely high level and would be very useful for them.","With Lin Yuan’s Creator resources, the Andra clan would be able to increase their power within a very short span of time.","In the thousands of years they had spent in the Scarlet Territory, the Andra clan had accumulated a large amount of blood-type spiritual ingredients but had been unable to do the same with Creator resources.","Only five of the Andra clan’s members were Creators, and only one of them had reached Grade 4. The remaining four were Grade 2 and were a distance away from reaching the next grade.","If not for their lack of Creator resources, the Andra clan would have been able to reach the top 40 king clans and would not be awkwardly stuck at the 83rd position like they currently were!"]},{"number":2902,"title":"Chapter 2902 How Are Your Injuries Related to Me?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2902 How Are Your Injuries Related to Me?","Andre was treating Feng Xuan with such consideration because of Lin Yuan’s importance to the Andra clan. If this was an unimportant figure, Andre would not care about whether Feng Xuan was injured.","The Bloodians’ arrogance was usually directed at extended relatives. When only Bloodians were present, the weaker parties humbled themselves in front of the powerful parties. Unless there was fundamental friction, the Bloodians would never turn on each other.","During his trade with the Andra clan, Lin Yuan had given them practical benefits. This was already a fact. Hence, the Andra clan were especially attentive when they tended to him.","If Feng Qing could lead the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves in breaking free from the Andra clan’s control, he would definitely give Andre a ringing slap.","Back then, Andre had clearly hinted to him that he needed to properly punish Feng Xuan in order to appease the Andra clan. If not for that hint, he would not have planned to take Feng Xuan’s life.","You were the one who wanted me to punish Feng Xuan. Now, you want me to heal him?!","Feng Xuan’s organs were severely injured and difficult to heal. Even a Grade 4 Creator would not be able to help. Even if he was healed, his motor functions would be seriously affected.","However, Feng Qing was in no position to say no to Andre. He had no choice but to gnash his teeth and say, “I will personally bring Feng Xuan to be treated. Please give me one to two hours. I will do my best to heal him during that time!”","Feng Qing was harboring his own schemes. He intended to use the time he was taking Feng Xuan for treatment to give him advice on what to do.","When Andre heard that he would have to wait for one to two hours, he bellowed, “The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves are so slow. I might be able to wait for two hours, but will Black Elise be able to?”","Andre sneered at Feng Xuan, who had been brought to him, and raised his hand to cover his nose.","“Since the injury can’t be treated, change into a clean set of clothes and come with me. I can’t let Black Elise wait and become impatient!”","Andre cut off all possibility of Feng Qing giving Feng Xuan advice. Based on Andre’s attitude toward this young Bloodian, the Elise clan had to be much stronger than the Andra clan! Otherwise, there would be no need for Andre to go to such lengths to stay in the good books of the Elise clan!","Feng Xuan did not care about Andre’s scorn toward him. His eyes filled with the light of hope.","From the moment he was imprisoned, Feng Xuan saw his future. He could tell that Feng Qing had completely abandoned him and had no intention of allowing him to continue to live.","Otherwise, Feng Qing would not have been unwilling to give him even a small amount of healing resources.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ pride was their speed. He had been punished after failing to make contact with Black Elise’s subordinates. As a result, his left leg had been broken by Feng Qing. Now, he could still walk with some struggle, but it was impossible for him to move swiftly again!","But now that Black Elise wanted to see him, his fate was taking a turn.","At that moment, Feng Xuan was determined to do whatever he could to find the chance to change his fate. He would never allow himself to become a sacrificial lamb!","Feng Xuan caught the look that Feng Qing was shooting at him, and he could guess what Feng Qing was thinking.","Feng Qing had handed despair to Feng Xuan. Hence, he turned his nose up at Feng Qing and ignored him.","When he met Black Elise, he would either be protected by the Elise clan and be elevated to a position so high that he no longer needed to fear Feng Qing or would be sent back and imprisoned while he waited for Feng Qing to deal with him.","Nothing could be kept a secret forever. Feng Xuan had already heard that Feng Qing had planned to hand him over to Fan Lou. However, Fan Lou had shied away from this task. If Fan Lou had wanted to kill him, he would likely have already been a corpse.","After Feng Xuan ignored him, Feng Qing almost lost control of himself in front of Andre and unleashed his deadly fury.","Feng Xuan’s actions violated the code of an inferior. How dare Feng Xuan treat him in such a way!","Andre did not notice the looks that Feng Qing and Feng Xuan were throwing each other. All he wanted was for Feng Qing to hurry up and change. If they made Black Elise wait and the latter became displeased, things would become very bad!","Regardless of how angry Feng Qing was, he would not dare to do anything to Feng Xuan. He would only be able to touch Feng Xuan if Feng Xuan was deemed useless and sent back.","This time, Feng Qing would not hand Feng Xuan over to Fan Lou again. He intended to deal with Feng Xuan personally and make him aware of the consequences of his violation!","After Feng Xuan changed in front of Andre, the latter led him away.","Feng Xuan acted respectfully toward Andre, but he actually hated him bitterly!","But while he dared to ignore and turn his nose up at Feng Qing, he did not dare to offend Andre.","This was firstly because Feng Xuan had feared the Bloodians for a long time. Being part of the Bloodians’ dependent species, this was how he had been brought up.","Secondly, Feng Xuan knew that Feng Qing did not dare to do anything to him.","However, it was possible that the Andra Elders would target him after he was summoned by Black Elise.","Feng Xuan had been guessing why Black Elise had asked for him. If he could guess Black Elise’s intentions in advance, he might be able to leave a positive impression on Black Elise!","Feng Xuan had been proclaiming himself as Black Elise’s guide. But in actuality, he knew that he was insignificant to Black Elise. He was utterly unimportant.","...","Jin Chen and Kani guarded the door to Lin Yuan’s room.","Andre clasped his fists in front of him to greet Kani and Jin Chen.","Kani and Jin Chen were true Holy Spirit experts and Lin Yuan’s servants. From all angles, Andre needed to be courteous to them.","“I have brought the person Black wants to see. Please pass on the message for me!”","Kani said, “Since you’ve brought him, we’ll take him in. There’s no need to pass on the message. Thank you for your hard work!”","Kani looked at Feng Xuan and gestured at him to follow her.","Feng Xuan did not hesitate to enter the room.","Andre chuckled awkwardly.","Jin Chen was much more aware of etiquette than Kani was. He clasped his hands in front of Andre.","“You can leave first. Feng Xuan will leave once our Young Master is done talking to him. You don’t have to be worried.”","Jin Chen’s words caused Andre’s face to sink. He had not been worried about Feng Xuan’s safety at all. What did Feng Xuan’s life have to do with him?","Andre was worried that Feng Xuan would run his mouth. It would not be beneficial for the Andra clan if they either offended Black Elise or if Feng Xuan joined him.","Feng Xuan steeled himself the moment he laid eyes on Lin Yuan and fell to his knees.","“Lord Black, I have been misunderstood by the Andra clan because I brought you to them. As a result, I was punished. I no longer have any status among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Please allow me to follow you!”","Feng Xuan kept his head low while speaking. He knew that his actions were rash but had no other option at the moment.","Given that he was unaware of Lin Yuan’s situation, he could only gamble on such an impulsive method. Although this chance was very slim, he needed to give it a shot.","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow. He knew that Feng Xuan did not have a good time among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Feng Xuan would definitely be a helpful source of support among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Lin Yuan had been trying to come up with a way to convince Feng Xuan to join him. But in the end, without him having to say anything, Feng Xuan willingly wanted to join him.","Lin Yuan went with the flow and asked, “How are your injuries related to me? If you think that I am linked to your injuries, please tell me why. If they really are because of me, I will take responsibility for treating your injured roots.”","In truth, Lin Yuan had already guessed the reason. Feng Xuan had ended up in such a state because he had wanted to show off in front of Lin Yuan and crossed a line with the Andra clan.","It was only natural that the Andra clan would assume that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had become mutinous. Otherwise, there was no reason for them to target a trivial character like Feng Xuan.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ leader had been worried of being misunderstood by the Andra clan. Once the Andra clan misunderstood the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, it would negatively impact the entire species.","As a result, Feng Xuan had been sacrificed.","It went without saying that Feng Xuan also received this treatment because he was distrusted by the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ leader.","The leader of a faction needed to be extremely cautious when they acted. This was the only way the faction they led would be able to survive for a long time in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Dangers were abound in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Any misstep would cause their species to fall into peril and doom!","Feng Xuan’s words had essentially put all his eggs into one basket. It was an enormous gamble. He would only be able to survive if Lin Yuan agreed to what he said.","Thankfully, this elite true Bloodian did agree. The hopeless Feng Xuan was manic and spilled everything he knew to Lin Yuan.","Feng Xuan did not have to embellish his story for him to come across as weak.","Feng Xuan became increasingly choked up as he described everything that Feng Qing had done to him.","It was clear that Feng Xuan now saw Lin Yuan as his shelter.","Perhaps from Feng Xuan’s perspective, everything he saw was just as he said.","Until now, Feng Xuan had yet to think about the repercussions a stranger like Lin Yuan would have on the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves!","Lin Yuan did not respond to what Feng Xuan said. This made Feng Xuan slightly antsy. He wondered if something he said had displeased Lin Yuan.","However, Lin Yuan did not stop him, so he could only continue speaking.","Just as Feng Xuan was done speaking and did not know what to say next, he saw a beam of vitality enter his body. This energy not only healed his injuries but also fixed his damaged organs and returned him to a state of full health.","Before this, Feng Xuan had lost all hope of regaining his health. Even his broken leg had been fixed.","Feng Xuan had never experienced such a healing ability that came with no side effects.","Once Lin Yuan was done healing him, Feng Xuan hurriedly thanked him.","“Lord Black, thank you for taking mercy on me after hearing my story. Are you willing to allow me to join you?”","Lin Yuan smiled and shook his head in response.","“I am about to lead the Andra clan to the Elisa clan to take control of the blood tide. Even if you join me, I won’t be able to take you with me. I have already expressed my stance by healing your injured roots. When you go and see Andre, tell him that you’ve joined me and that he should deliver you safely to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.”","Lin Yuan did not give Feng Xuan the chance to respond. He waved his hand to gesture at Feng Xuan to leave the room.","There was nothing wrong with what Lin Yuan said. Even if someone used a tracing divine kingdom ability or confounding ability on him, nothing would be revealed!","From the moment Feng Xuan left Lin Yuan, the plan was considered complete.","He was working with the Andra clan. If the Andra clan wanted to form a positive relationship with him, they would follow what he said and show Feng Xuan the appropriate courtesy. At the very least, they would tolerate Feng Xuan before they fell out with him.","Feng Xuan’s words were not to be trusted. There was no reason for Andre to trust him.","Feng Xuan leaving Lin Yuan with all his injuries healed would be enough to prove to Andre that Feng Xuan was not lying.","With the protection of Lin Yuan’s words, Feng Xuan would have the means to save himself within the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Going forward, Feng Qing would not dare to take revenge on him nor would he have the means to do so. Still, he would definitely take his revenge on Fan Lou and make him suffer.","The more Fan Lou suffered, the easier it would be for him to reap benefits from the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Even if Feng Qing did not step in and allowed him to make Fan Lou suffer, he would not allow him to kill Fan Lou because Feng Qing believed that the Four Species Overlords of Lonely River were the easiest partners.","Collaborating with the Four Species Overlords would bring profits to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves without putting them through too much pressure.","...","Lin Yuan did not care about the chaos that would ensue. Instead, he and the leader of the Andra clan began traveling to the Elisa clan.","During this time, in order to become closer to Lin Yuan, Yi Xue told him about other king clans with similar levels of power to the Andra clan. These clans were all very interested in Lin Yuan who came from the Elise clan."]},{"number":2903,"title":"Chapter 2903 A Dispute that Could Break Out At Any Moment!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2903 A Dispute that Could Break Out At Any Moment!","A faction with the bloodline of a queen was undoubtedly nobler than a faction with the bloodline of a king.","The Andra clan had maintained such an attitude toward Lin Yuan in the beginning because his appearance was too sudden.","Feng Xuan had brought Lin Yuan to the Andra clan. If the Andra clan had not suspected Lin Yuan at the start and had believed in his identity instead, a stupid existence like theirs would not be able to last for tens of thousands of years. However, with the Andra clan as a guarantor, the other clans with the king’s bloodline did not question Lin Yuan’s identity.","One of the female clan leaders coveted Lin Yuan’s pure Bloodian bloodline and repeatedly expressed her goodwill to him.","Spring, Winter, Jin Chen, and Kani were extremely humble as they followed Lin Yuan. Their attitudes were exactly the same as how the other blood servants treated their masters.","The female Bloodian leader, who had been expressing her goodwill to Lin Yuan, gracefully invited him, “Your Excellency Black Elise, are you willing to visit our Allen clan? Our Allen clan hopes to obtain the friendship of the Elise clan. I will prepare the best feast for you!”","Before Lin Yuan could react, Yi Xue said unhappily, “What’s the meaning of this? Black Elise is a guest of our Andra clan. Are you trying to snatch him from us?!”","The female Bloodian leader, Shi Mei, looked doubtfully at Yi Xue and asked, “I extended an invitation to His Excellency Black Elise. Are you suggesting that you can assume authority over Black Elise and limit his movements? His Excellency Black Elise is a free individual with the capacity to make his own decisions! Yi Xue, I don’t think you disagree with what I said, right?”","Shi Mei was speechless at Yi Xue’s behavior. The Allen and Andra clans had always cooperated closely, while the Andra clan had obviously just established ties with the Elise clan. If the Allen clan could establish a relationship with the Elise clan, it would also deepen the bond between the Andra and Allen clans to a certain extent.","Yi Xue’s protective behavior did not align with the relationship between the two allies. Yi Xue’s actions made Shi Mei understand one thing. Yi Xue must have obtained great benefits from this pureblood Bloodian named Black Elise. Otherwise, there was no reason for him to do that. If that was the case, Shi Mei wanted to get to know Black Elise even more.","Upon hearing Shi Mei’s words, Yi Xue’s breath choked in his chest, but he didn’t make a sound for a long time.","Yi Xue indeed wanted to use Lin Yuan to bind the Elise clan. Previously, the Elise clan was not a Bloodian faction in the Scarlet Territory. Upon returning to the Scarlet Territory, they had to find a few allies. However, Shi Mei’s words made it seem like he had ulterior motives. Yi Xue was afraid that Lin Yuan would misunderstand him.","Now that several clan leaders were traveling with him, Yi Xue found himself unable to explain Shi Mei’s words to Lin Yuan. Once he did that, the Andra clan would lose all face. Shi Mei was really despicable and loved to stir up trouble. From the way Shi Mei looked at Lin Yuan, Yi Xue knew Shi Mei’s motive.","“I naturally agree with what you said. It’s His Excellency Black Elise’s freedom to go wherever he wants. Why would I interfere? However, our Andra clan has been treating His Excellency Black Elise with all our heart. I think His Excellency Black Elise can feel it too! Our Andra clan has already regarded His Excellency Black Elise as our closest ally!”","Since he could not refute Shi Mei’s words, Yi Xue could only use this method to express his feelings to Lin Yuan. Yi Xue’s words caused surprise among several leaders, including Shi Mei, who possessed the bloodline of a prince.","At present, Yi Xue completely adopted an attitude of having found a powerful support. It could be said that he had almost no bottom line for this support that he had painstakingly earned.","Initially, the others merely felt that Yi Xue had obtained some benefits from Lin Yuan. Now, it appeared it was not as simple as just obtaining some benefits.","Apart from Shi Mei, the other Bloodian leaders also wanted to use this opportunity to befriend Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan appeared very calm. He was neither servile nor overbearing when the other leaders tried to rope him in. He put on the posture of an elegant pure-blooded Bloodian.","Knowing Lin Yuan’s plan, Kani and Jin Chen thought to themselves that Yi Xue really dared to say anything! Yi Xue had regarded Lin Yuan as his closest ally with the statement that he made. It remained unknown how much trouble it would bring to the Andra clan in the future.","...","While Lin Yuan and the others were on their way, Andre sent Feng Xuan back to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Andre asked Feng Xuan a few times but couldn’t find out how he was qualified to be chosen by Lin Yuan. Could such an insignificant figure really catch his attention?!","However, reality proved that Feng Xuan had established a connection with him. Otherwise, the injuries on his body that had damaged his roots would not have completely recovered after seeing Lin Yuan. The cost of healing his injuries was more valuable than Feng Xuan himself.","Feng Xuan had also personally said that he was following Lin Yuan.","Under such circumstances, Andre naturally could not treat Feng Xuan with the same attitude as before. As the saying went, while powerful entities might seem formidable, it was often the lesser figures that posed the real trouble. If Andre were to do something wrong and offend Lin Yuan, the latter might not care at all. However, if he offended Feng Xuan, who knew what Feng Xuan would say about him to Lin Yuan!","Although Andre did not pay much attention to Feng Xuan, he was extremely polite to him. Feng Xuan keenly sensed the change in Andre’s attitude towards him. This made Feng Xuan’s heart, which had been suppressed for a long time, swell uncontrollably.","If Andre, an Andra Elder, treated him in such a manner, then Feng Qing, a leader of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, likely had to maintain a respectful attitude toward him as well. Otherwise, it would be disrespectful to Lin Yuan. If that was the case, even without Lin Yuan’s intervention, the Andra clan would still seek trouble with Feng Qing.","With such a mindset, Feng Xuan encountered Fan Lou, who was also en route to meet Feng Qing, before reaching Feng Qing’s residence in the Andra clan.","Fan Lou greeted Andre respectfully as usual, then greeted Feng Xuan.","As Feng Qing’s most trusted subordinate, Fan Lou often came to report to Feng Qing every day. Even if Feng Qing didn’t have anything planned for him, Fan Lou would still come to pay his respects to him every day. Even if Feng Qing did not specifically look for Fan Lou, there was nothing wrong with Fan Lou coming to Feng Qing’s place.","No one would suspect that Fan Lou’s coincidental encounter with Feng Xuan and Andre was actually planned by Fan Lou!","Fan Lou knew very well what kind of personality Feng Xuan had. In Feng Xuan’s heart, it was entirely because of Fan Lou that he had ended up like that. If he hadn’t been given an important position by Feng Qing, Feng Xuan wouldn’t have been treated so coldly by Feng Qing. Feng Xuan had never fully accepted him and had always harbored resentment toward him.","If Feng Xuan hadn’t realized that he couldn’t compete with Fan Lou, he wouldn’t have taken the initiative to express his goodwill.","After expressing his goodwill, Feng Xuan continued to make things difficult for him behind the scenes. In fact, Feng Xuan made contact with the Dark Pufferfish envoy, hoping to form a good cooperative relationship with the Dark Pufferfish like him.","He had also deliberately expressed to the Dark Pufferfish many times that Fan Lou was not a direct descendant of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, but rather an impure wolf who had absorbed their blood essence before transforming into one.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the majority of species valued bloodlines highly. Feng Xuan’s statement was likely intended to belittle Fan Lou. He also aimed to make use of the situation to make Fan Lou relinquish his role as the spokesperson between the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and the Dark Pufferfish.","Unfortunately, his relationship with the Dark Pufferfish was not what Feng Xuan had imagined. Despite his efforts, he couldn’t disrupt the amicable relationship between Fan Lou and the Dark Pufferfish.","Now that Feng Xuan had suddenly gained power, Fan Lou understood Feng Xuan well enough to anticipate that Feng Xuan would likely find trouble for him.","At this stage, the more he severed ties with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, the less he would be implicated by them after this. Fan Lou was a little regretful. If he had been able to suppress Feng Xuan previously, the latter would have definitely looked for trouble with him thoroughly once and for all.","Feng Xuan frowned when he saw Fan Lou and went up to him. “Fan Lou, are you here to see Lord Feng Qing? I have something important to discuss with Lord Feng Qing. You should leave first! Come over after I finish talking to Lord Feng Qing.”","At present, it was not suitable for Fan Lou to put on any deliberate acting. Fan Lou only needed to treat Feng Xuan as usual.","However, Feng Xuan was actively finding trouble with him. Even if he didn’t respond, Feng Xuan would still make a move. If Fan Lou deliberately put on a show, it was very likely that Andre would notice something amiss. Once Andre saw through it, all of Fan Lou’s efforts would be in vain!","“Feng Xuan, I should pay my respects to Lord Feng Qing at this time. With your current status, if you want to see Lord Feng Qing, you need to inform him! You only have the chance to see Lord Feng Qing if he wants to see you. I’ll help you inform him!”","Fan Lou’s attitude was very natural, to the point that even the most critical person couldn’t find any faults in his demeanor.","At the very least, Andre admired Fan Lou’s style of handling things. Despite Feng Xuan’s previous actions that had implicated him and caused him to be punished by Feng Qing, Fan Lou didn’t hold it against Feng Xuan or adopt a hostile attitude.","On the contrary, Feng Xuan felt that Fan Lou was mocking him. Fan Lou’s words instantly ignited Feng Xuan’s anger. “Heh, I’m now Lord Black Elise’s subordinate. Do you know who you’re talking to? Do I need you to inform Lord Feng Qing that I’m going to see him?!”","Upon hearing Feng Xuan’s words, Andre’s hatred for Feng Xuan increased greatly. In Andre’s heart, Feng Xuan was merely an idiot who had gained power because of good luck.","First of all, Feng Xuan had addressed Black Elise and Feng Qing as Lords. This meant that Feng Xuan had placed Feng Qing and Black Elise on the same level. However, Feng Qing’s status could not compare to that of Black Elise.","Furthemore, as a leader of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, how could Feng Qing accept his subordinates placing others in the same position as him? It was true that there was a difference in status, but a smart individual should at least understand how to address others appropriately.","It was a normal procedure for Fan Lou to communicate with Feng Qing. Once Feng Qing learnt that Feng Xuan had formed a relationship with the Elise clan, he would naturally get close to Feng Xuan.","Feng Xuan’s intention to bypass this step was no different from challenging Feng Qing’s authority. Feng Xuan wouldn’t truly believe that he had become a significant figure in Feng Qing’s eyes just because he had gained the favor of the Elise clan, would he?","The leader of a clan held absolute authority and would never tolerate other members within the clan to exert control over them.","Fan Lou said firmly, “It’s still necessary for me to inform Lord Feng Qing. If you want to see Lord Feng Qing, wait outside for a while. It won’t take long for me to inform Lord Feng Qing, then you’ll be able to see him!","Lord Feng Qing has yet to personally meet with the Black Elise that you mentioned. Furthermore, as far as I know, Lord Feng Qing’s focus has always been on matters concerning the Andra clan. The other Bloodian clans don’t have much to do with our Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. I hope you can understand this!”","Fan Lou’s words left Andre with a positive impression of him. Previously, Andre did not regard Fan Lou seriously. Andre took a fancy to Fan Lou not because Fan Lou could serve as a bridge for communication between the Andra clan and the Dark Pufferfish. If the Andra clan wanted to cooperate with the Dark Pufferfish, Fan Lou wouldn’t necessarily have to be there. At present, Fan Lou could only save some trouble for the Andra clan.","Andre valued Fan Lou because Fan Lou could assert his own position and was loyal to his own species. Such a person was worthy of being placed in an important position in a huge faction.","When Feng Xuan heard Fan Lou’s words, he immediately became animated. Fan Lou said that the other Bloodian clans had nothing to do with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. In Feng Xuan’s ears, it was equivalent to Fan Lou denying his credit. This was something that Feng Xuan could not tolerate no matter what.","Feng Xuan even suspected that he had ended up in such a miserable state because of Fan Lou. All his misfortunes seemed to be linked to Fan Lou’s appearance. With this in mind, Feng Xuan immediately resorted to violence against Fan Lou, staging a full-blown confrontation in front of Andre.","Feng Xuan’s actions had greatly exceeded Andre’s expectations. Feng Xuan was slightly stronger than Fan Lou. Within the same species, lifeforms with stronger bloodline intensity exerted significant dominance over those with weaker bloodline in battles. Feng Xuan suppressed Fan Lou and attacked him frequently, causing Fan Lou to be injured continuously.","Andre couldn’t be bothered to interfere in the internal strife of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. However, he also did not wish for the ongoing strife between the two sides to continue, as any unexpected occurrences would bring no benefits to the Andra clan.","Fan Lou was no longer just related to the Dark Pufferfish of the Lonely River. He also had a close relationship with the other Three Species Overlords of the Lonely River.","The Andra clan was currently cooperating with the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords. As for Feng Xuan, Andre still hadn’t figured out the nature of the relationship between Feng Xuan and Black Elise."]},{"number":2904,"title":"Chapter 2904 Plan Begins!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2904 Plan Begins!","What if Lin Yuan had truly taken a liking to Feng Xuan and was willing to stand up for him? If Lin Yuan returned and discovered that Feng Xuan, whom he had previously healed, was injured again, it would lead to him having an issue with the Andra clan. It wouldn’t be good if it affected Lin Yuan’s relationship with the Andra clan.","Andre didn’t want either side of the conflict to end in fatalities. However, Feng Xuan’s attacks were fatal, making it abnormally difficult for Andre.","Anger kept surging in Andre’s heart. The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were merely a dependent species. How could their affairs affect the Andra clan at every turn. If so, what was the use of nurturing such a dependent species!? Even without the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, the Andra clan still had many choices when it came to dependent species.","At present, Feng Xuan was in a very strange state. While he was relentlessly targeting Fan Lou, he experienced not only anger and satisfaction but also a sense of liberation. Feng Xuan was not as blinded by anger as Andre had thought. On the contrary, Feng Xuan’s mind was exceptionally clear.","Over the years, besides himself, Feng Qing had solely relied on Fan Lou. If Fan Lou were to perish, he who was favored by the Elise clan, would be Feng Qing’s first choice. Feng Xuan decided to kill Fan Lou now.","Feng Xuan was much stronger than Fan Lou. His fierce attacks had already hurt Fan Lou’s core. While Feng Xuan was attacking Fan Lou, Andre sent a message to Feng Qing. It was best to leave the matter to him to settle.","Andre had already made plans to completely kick out the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves when the Andra and Elise clans officially established relations and deepened their cooperation with the four major species of the Lonely River. At that time, it would be time to properly judge the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Through his understanding, Andre had already clarified that Fan Lou was mainly involved in the relationship between the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River and he had little to do with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Fan Lou was not a member of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. He was taken in as one of them. If the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves could take in Fan Lou, so could the Bloodians. For the sake of the relationship with the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords, transforming Fan Lou into a Bloodian was quite worth it.","During this period of time, Feng Qing had been feeling uneasy. Originally, Feng Qing loved to admire and play with his collection of decorative vases in his spare time. Now, Feng Qing no longer had the mood to admire and play with them. A quiet person like Feng Qing was pacing back and forth in the room, thinking about how to regain the Andra clan’s favor. Previously, the dependent species’ leader, who was not valued by the Andra clan, had become close to the Andra clan’s leader. This was a very bad sign for the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Feng Xuan was taken away by Andre. Feng Qing did not expect Feng Xuan to do anything for the Andra clan. He only hoped that Feng Xuan wouldn’t bring trouble to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves anymore.","Right after Feng Qing had this thought, he received a message from Andre. Upon reading the message, fury engulfed Feng Qing, filling his heart with boundless anger.","Feng Xuan actually dared to attack Fan Lou for no reason. Wasn’t Feng Xuan clearly using this opportunity to vent his dissatisfaction toward him!","Strong winds condensed around Feng Qing’s body, and his figure swept into the distance with the strong winds. As soon as he arrived at the place Andre pointed at, he saw Feng Xuan’s sharp claws reaching for Fan Lou’s heart.","Fan Lou, who was covered in blood, found himself unable to resist.","Despite his anger, Feng Qing knew one thing in his heart. Andre must have his reasons for not killing Feng Xuan directly. If Feng Xuan dared to do this, it must have something to do with the Elise clan. Therefore, when Feng Qing stopped Feng Xuan, he did not kill him. Instead, he blocked Feng Xuan’s attack.","Feng Qing hurriedly enveloped Fan Lou in wind-elemental energy. Through the energy, Feng Qing could sense that Fan Lou’s aura had already weakened considerably. He hurriedly took out some top-notch medicinal herbs and fed them to Fan Lou, saving his life.","At present, Feng Qing was not in the mood to care about the problem of Fan Lou’s roots. It appeared that Fan Lou’s roots must have been severely damaged.","Feng Qing first bowed to Andre.","Andre said coldly, “Your Chaos Wind Demon Wolves are really troublesome. How dare you commit murder on the Andra clan’s territory! Feng Qing, you specially brought your two subordinates to our Andra clan. These two must be your right-hand men! However, they didn’t appear to be very submissive.”","With that, Andre turned around and left. He couldn’t be bothered to continue talking nonsense with Feng Qing. Andre would report this matter to the Elders of the clan. The replacement of the dependent species had now become an urgent matter.","Feng Qing wanted to explain to Andre but did not know how to explain everything that was happening in front of him!","Feng Qing looked at Feng Xuan with a malicious expression and asked coldly, “Feng Xuan, why are you doing this? I need you to give me an explanation for attacking Fan Lou!”","Feng Xuan felt very regretful that he did not manage to kill Fan Lou. He was fully aware of the gravity of his actions and that the injuries sustained by Fan Lou were beyond the need for treatment. In any case, it was very difficult for the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ resources to heal Fan Lou’s damaged roots. Even if they could treat Feng Qing, they would not be willing to invest such resources.","Feng Xuan knew Feng Qing too well. The Chaos Wind Demon Wolf’s high-quality resources had always been reserved exclusively for Feng Qing’s use. On the other hand, Lin Yuan, who had healed his damaged roots, was capable of healing Fan Lou’s injuries.","However, since he had already hooked up with Lin Yuan, there was no chance for Fan Lou to establish any connection with the Elise clan.","No matter how grateful the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords were to Fan Lou, it was impossible for them to fork out resources to treat his injuries.","“Lord Feng Qing, I made a move on Fan Lou because he has been suppressing me all along. This is a personal grudge between Fan Lou and me. I’m sorry. I didn’t expect to bring trouble to Lord Feng Qing again. I hope you can understand!”","Feng Xuan was still addressing Feng Qing as Lord, but his words were no longer as respectful as before. The respect Feng Xuan previously showed toward Feng Qing was not only because of his bloodline, but also largely rooted in fear. Now that he had Lin Yuan to rely on, he no longer feared Andre and thus had no reason to fear Feng Qing either.","Upon hearing Feng Xuan’s words, Feng Qing was so angry that he laughed. He narrowed his eyes, looked at Feng Xuan, and his tone turned from cold to calm. “Why do I have to understand you after what you’ve done? Feng Xuan, do you know how badly your actions in the Andra clan have affected our Chaos Wind Demon Wolves?","“You have parents, family, and siblings in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Shouldn’t you take them into consideration before taking such actions?”","Feng Qing’s words seemed to resonate with Feng Xuan, stirring up a sense of excitement. “Lord Feng Qing, do you believe that my intention in reaching out to the Elise clan was not in consideration of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves?! If we could establish a relationship with the Elise clan, our species would be able to obtain more opportunities. Why would we remain completely under the control of the Andra clan as we are now? Not only do you not understand me, but you also punished me for this!","“Lord Feng Qing, my injuries were healed by Black Elise. I’ve already established a relationship with the Elise clan. Didn’t you see that even the Andra Elders can’t do anything to me?!”","Feng Qing was surprised to learn that pureblood Bloodian youth from the Elise clan could heal Feng Xuan’s injuries. However, establishing a relationship with the Elise clan was not a reason for Feng Xuan to make the Andra clan unhappy.","The Andra clan had already made it clear that they did not like the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves interacting with the Elise clan. Even if they really wanted to interact with the Elise clan, it should be done discreetly, not in a blatant manner like Feng Xuan did.","Even if Lin Yuan had healed Feng Xuan’s injuries, there was no guarantee that he would really use Feng Xuan again.","The Andra clan was also in contact with the Elise clan. They definitely had a much higher chance of gaining the favor of the Elise clan than Feng Xuan. Even if it was to give face to the Andra clan, the Elise clan would never take in a dependent species from the Andra clan. It was precisely because of this that Feng Qing was so against contact with the Elise clan.","“Feng Xuan, since you’re back, stay by my side for now. I’ll arrange for someone to treat Fan Lou’s injuries. Afterward, you are not allowed to scheme against Fan Lou again!","“Fan Lou is related to the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River. They are extremely beneficial to our Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Because we traded resources with these four species, the strength of our Elders has increased.","“If you can maintain a good relationship with the Elise clan in the future and persuade them to accept our Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, not only will I hand over the original guards to you again, but I will also make you the Outer Court Supervisor of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.”","Given Feng Qing’s temper, if he didn’t clearly know that Feng Xuan had a relationship with the Elise clan, coupled with the fact that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had lost the Andra clan’s favor, and the chances of the Andra clan putting them in an important position again were slim, Feng Qing would have never made such a compromise.","Because Fan Lou had obtained the resources provided by Lin Yuan, he was much stronger than before. However, Fan Lou had been hiding his strength and had not revealed his power.","In order to ensure that he could be taken in by the Bloodians in the future, Fan Lou’s injuries were not fake. Fan Lou had indeed fallen into a state of unconsciousness for a while, but the medicinal herbs that Feng Qing had fed him had allowed him to recover a portion of his vitality. Even though his breathing was weak, he could hear the conversation between Feng Qing and Feng Xuan.","Fan Lou was surprised because Feng Qing didn’t punish Feng Xuan for treating him like this. Instead, he returned the power that he had just been conferred to Feng Xuan. His current situation was very similar to Feng Xuan’s.","Fan Lou’s heart turned cold toward the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves again.","...","Lin Yuan had always been in the Scarlet Territory and could receive Fan Lou’s message through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","Upon learning about Fan Lou’s situation, Lin Yuan immediately assured him. “Fan Lou, your injuries won’t be in vain. Although I won’t allow you to establish a connection with my Bloodian bloodline and I am unable to heal the source of your injuries, after you transform into a Bloodian, I can help you enhance your bloodline and let you become a pureblood Bloodian step by step. You were the one who suggested the plan to join the Bloodians to me. The suffering you’re going through now can help you evolve better in the future!”","Upon reading Lin Yuan’s message, Fan Lou, who was lying on the bed, felt a warm feeling in his heart. Lin Yuan would not be like Feng Qing, who would always make empty promises to him. However, every time Lin Yuan rewarded him, he would give him what he needed the most. His current injuries were not for Lin Yuan’s sake but for his own.","His injuries were like a pledge of allegiance, showing the Andra clan that he, an outsider, was abnormally miserable in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Only then might the Andra clan consider taking him in as a Bloodian.","...","Lin Yuan had already arrived at Elisa clan’s territory. The Bloodians who were traveling with Lin Yuan gave up on going on when they reached the edge of Elisa’s territory because going further was equivalent to provoking the Elisa clan.","Most of the clans in the Scarlet Territory that had the bloodline of a king maintained a respectful attitude toward those clans that had the bloodline of a queen. This was especially true for a clan like the Elisa clan, which was about to have another queen.","Lin Yuan was still with the Andra clan’s leader, Yi Xue. Since the blood pool had yet to open, it would be useless for Lin Yuan to infiltrate the Elisa clan’s territory. Furthermore, the blood tide would dissipate from the Elisa clan’s territory.","With the dissipating blood tide, he could then determine the exact location of the Elisa clan’s blood pool. By that time, Liu Yao and Liu Chen would take action according to Lin Yuan’s plan.","After Liu Chen and Liu Yao gained control of the star pirates, they understood how the star pirates communicated with each other. Liu Chen and Liu Yao discovered that there were a large number of star pirates near the Scarlet Territory, who would plunder the merchant groups that entered and left the Scarlet Territory.","The star pirates who dared to attack the Bloodians were much stronger than the ones who had besieged Treasure City.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao gathered these star pirates and surrounded the territory of the Elisa clan from the outside. Then, they gradually narrowed the encirclement.","It was impossible for the Bloodians who were preparing to share the blood tide outside the Elisa clan’s territory to help the Elisa clan fight those powerful star pirates. They would definitely retreat into the Elisa clan.","The Bloodian clans were not united to begin with, so the major clans would prioritize protecting their own interests. Once the Andra clan was in chaos, Lin Yuan could take the opportunity to take action.","Unfortunately, because they did not have enough time, Liu Chen and Liu Yao were not well-prepared and did not have enough star pirates under their command.","Despite that, it was sufficient for Lin Yuan to carry out the plan!"]},{"number":2905,"title":"Chapter 2905 I’ll Hold on for You!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2905 I’ll Hold on for You!","On the way, Shi Mei kept in contact with Lin Yuan. She was trying to get as much information as possible from Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was exceptionally adept at dealing with such subtle inquiries. He subtly informed Shi Mei of the information he wanted to reveal to her. Since Shi Mei herself intended to gather information from Lin Yuan, his opportunistic behavior helped minimize others’ guard against him to the fullest extent possible.","Along the way, Lin Yuan continuously displayed his superiority, and the resources he casually took out broadened Shi Mei’s understanding.","No matter how much Yi Xue disliked Shi Mei currying favor with Lin Yuan, the Allen clan was still an ally of the Andra clan. If Shi Mei was offended by his actions, it wouldn’t be beneficial to the Andra clan. Yi Xue secretly told Shi Mei that Lin Yuan’s blood servants were extremely powerful.","Lin Yuan’s strength, bloodline, and resources made it impossible to question his identity, even if one desired to do so. After all, it was impossible for non-Bloodians to obtain Lin Yuan’s pure Bloodian bloodline.","“Your Grace Black, I have a favor to ask of you. When we absorb the blood tide later, can you ask your blood servants to attract more blood tide to our side? Don’t worry, we will only absorb the blood tide after ensuring that you have sufficient absorption!”","Shi Mei wasn’t the only one who wanted to befriend Lin Yuan. In fact, several Bloodian leaders also had the intention of forming connections with him. However, these Bloodian leaders lacked Shi Mei’s skill in ingratiating themselves. Thus, they never found an opportunity to communicate with Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan’s stance also made him difficult to approach.","Shi Mei’s words carried implications of representing the other Bloodian clans. If Lin Yuan’s blood servants really helped to gather the blood tide, it would be only natural for Lin Yuan to absorb the blood tide first.","Still, Shi Mei should not use this as a favor. A few clan leaders wanted to remind Shi Mei not to make decisions for everyone.","However, when they thought about how Shi Mei’s suggestion was beneficial to Lin Yuan and realized that advising Shi Mei could potentially lead to misunderstandings from Lin Yuan, they gave up on the idea.","Shi Mei knew very well that her words would cause dissatisfaction among the other clans. However, Shi Mei believed that doing so to establish a connection with Lin Yuan was worthwhile, but Lin Yuan’s behavior disappointed her greatly. He did not respond to her attempts to please him in any way and only nodded lightly.","It left Shi Mei feeling extremely embarrassed. At the same time, she was certain that the Elise clan was not simple. This was the problem with the Bloodians. The higher their stance, the more formidable they appeared. If they were to adopt a humble stance, they might risk being looked down upon by other Bloodians.","Kani, who was following behind Lin Yuan, said, “Everyone, if our Young Master is in charge of everything, we are naturally willing to help! But if anyone interferes with our Young Master’s absorption of the blood tide, we won’t be polite either!”","The various Bloodian leaders did not take Kani and Jin Chen seriously. Any experts who had stepped into the Holy Spirit level could sense Kani and Jin Chen’s strength. The truly powerful people beside Lin Yuan were the woman and the old man who had been protecting him.","The various clan leaders, including Yi Xue, expressed their opinions.","“Don’t worry, we’re all very willing to be friends with the Elise clan. No one will interfere with Black Elise’s absorption of the blood tide! Whoever makes a move will be our enemy!”","As everyone spoke, an energy ripple suddenly erupted in the distance. Right on the heels of that, dense blood energy began to spread in all directions from the place where the commotion had occurred. This meant that the Elisa clan had already begun to activate the blood pool.","Once the blood pool was activated, its location could no longer be concealed. When the blood tide further expanded, it would be Liu Chen and Liu Yao’s turn to attack. The star pirates they had gathered were already ready to take action at any time.","Originally, the Elisa clan had ignored the Bloodians from the various clans. However, they had already changed their stance now and dispatched numerous members to verify the identities of the various Bloodians visitors. It was to ensure that no one would cause any trouble when the blood pool opened and affect the Lord’s evolution to the level of a queen.","Once they had noted visiting clans and who represented each clan, they could directly track down the corresponding clan to settle it through if problems were to arise.","The Elisa clan had made extensive preparations for a major event like the blood pool opening.","When Yi Xue discovered that the people from Elisa’s clan were investigating the identities of the members present, he had a bad feeling. Lin Yuan, a member of the Bloodians who had always lived outside Scarlet Territory, was an extremely unstable factor for the Elisa clan. If they could not be sure of Lin Yuan’s identity, they would most likely not allow him to stay here. If that was the case, it would be difficult.","Yi Xue definitely wanted to stay there to share the energy in the blood tide, but it was one thing if Lin Yuan was chased away by the Elisa clan and it led to conflicts.","If he wanted to advance and retreat with Lin Yuan, he would have to be prepared to exit alongside him. However, Yi Xue did not want to give up this rare opportunity to absorb the blood tide. The Elisa clan had always been domineering, and it was very likely that they would blame him for bringing an unknown Bloodian like Lin Yuan.","Yi Xue watched as the people investigated by the Elisa clan walked toward him. Just as Yi Xue was about to think of a way to deal with them, he felt several powerful auras coming from afar.","Yi Xue looked in the direction of the aura and saw a group of non-Bloodians. These people had a very fierce aura. It was obvious that they were not the Bloodians’ dependent species as they would not allow their spawns to bare their teeth like tigers. As a dependent species, being as docile and cute as a kitten was a must-have quality!","The aura on this group of people was very similar to the star pirates who plundered outside the Scarlet Territory. These star pirates were extremely ruthless. Basically, every Bloodian clan’s merchant groups had been plundered by these star pirates.","The Bloodians had once sent people to annihilate these star pirates, but every one of them was as slippery as a loach. Even if they could occasionally capture and destroy a few star pirates, it did not stop the star pirates from rampaging outside the Scarlet Territory. After all, there were huge benefits to be gained from plundering near the Scarlet Territory.","If these star pirates dared to cause trouble in the Elisa clan’s territory at this time, they would definitely anger them.","These star pirates most likely had a plan. This was because it was impossible for them not to know what it meant to target a Bloodian clan that was about to have a queen.","Upon seeing the star pirates, the Elisa members in charge of verification immediately gathered and began to resist them.","The woman with a red mole on her forehead said coldly. “Do you know the consequences of causing trouble on the territory of the Elisa clan? Today is an important day for us. If you make any moves, just wait to be slaughtered by our Elisa Clan!”","Upon hearing the female Bloodian’s threat, the star pirates groaned inwardly. If possible, these star pirates also didn’t want to attack the Elisa clan at this time. The Elisa clan had opened a blood pool, and the blood tide that surged out of the blood pool could not be stored. Not only were the blood tides useless to the star pirates, but even the blood pool opened by the Elisa clan held little significance for them.","There were almost no Bloodians among the star pirates present. It was obvious that a new king was about to appear in the Scarlet Territory.","The star pirates who had previously roamed the Scarlet Territory all understood one thing—the probability of a Bloodian queen appearing in the Elisa clan was extremely high.","These star pirates would rather hide from the Elisa clan. How could they dare to take the initiative to find trouble with them?! If not for the coercion of those two bigshots, the star pirates present would certainly have stayed as far away from the Elisa clan’s territory as possible.","However, under the coercion of the two bigshots, it was impossible for them to do nothing. If the two bigshots were dissatisfied, they would definitely die.","Moreover, the two bigshots had given them a chance. As long as they acted according to the arrangements of the two demon groups, it was not impossible for them to escape from the Scarlet Territory. As long as they were far away from the Scarlet Territory, the Elisa clan would not have the energy to cause trouble for them even if they wanted to!","After this matter was over, the Elisa clan would most likely have a huge pile of things to deal with. This was also the main reason the star pirates were working so hard.","The Elisa experts must be near the blood pool, protecting its safety to prevent any accidents from happening there. The more chaotic it was outside, the stronger the Elisa clan’s defense of the blood pool would be.","Right now, what these Elisa members wanted to do was not to kill the star pirates, but to expel them. The combined power of more than ten star pirates was not something the people from the Elisa clan present could deal with.","“Tsk, tsk, tsk, your Elisa clan has opened the blood pool. If there’s an opportunity, we naturally have to claim our share of the loot! I heard that there are a large number of rare spiritual ingredients planted in the blood pool. If we snatch these spiritual ingredients, we will definitely make a fortune!”","Upon hearing those words, the Elisa member with a red mole on her forehead acted as if she had heard the greatest joke in the world. “Pfft! You think you can enter the blood pool? You’re really dreaming! What right do you have to take your share of the loot in my Elisa clan’s territory?! Even the leftovers thrown out by my Elisa clan are not something trash like you can dream of! Scram now, or I’ll join forces with the Bloodians from the other clans to wipe you out!”","This woman’s aura was astonishing, and her words were filled with a sense of superiority and disdain. As a member of an ancient Bloodian clan, this female Bloodian indeed had the right to be arrogant!","In fact, this female Bloodian had already realized that the situation was a little tricky. Since these star pirates dared to come to the Elisa clan’s territory to cause trouble at this time, they must have been prepared.","They were the only manpower the clan had assigned to this place. If these star pirates did not invade the Elisa clan’s territory from other directions, it was likely that the experts of the clan were still unaware of the situation.","At the thought of this, the female Bloodian’s heart was in a mess. In any case, they could only respond effectively once they understood the situation.","When this female Bloodian spoke, the other Bloodians frowned. She tied them to the Elisa clan’s chariot with just a few words, expressing their willingness to advance and retreat alongside the Elisa clan. No Bloodian who was not from the Elisa clan wanted to sacrifice themselves for them.","“Clear us out? Why don’t you take a look at how many men we have! Brothers, the treasures in the blood pool must be extraordinary. Let’s explore the Bloodians’ sacred space. At most, we’ll stay away from the Scarlet Territory in the future. The further away we are from the Scarlet Territory, the better the price we could get for those blood-type spiritual ingredients!”","Having said that, the star pirates started to attack rapidly. Apart from the people from Elisa’s clan, various other Bloodian clans retreated.","Upon seeing this, the female Elisa member said in panic, “You came to my clan’s territory to share the blood tide in our blood pool, so you have the duty to protect us!","“You—”","Before the woman could finish her sentence, two star pirates attacked her. The female Bloodian hurriedly defended herself, but her left shoulder was smashed into pieces by the star pirate’s attack, and her left hand hung limp like a noodle, swaying weakly.","Just as the female Bloodian thought that it was over, a handsome pureblood Bloodian stood in front of her and said, “Leave this to me. Inform the experts in the clan to calm down this storm caused by the star pirates as soon as possible. I have a feeling that these star pirates have an ulterior motive!”","She looked up at the tall figure of the young Bloodian in front of her, feeling as if she had seen a savior. “Thank you. My name is Elisa Helena. I have a communication fey with me. I need some time to communicate with the clan. Hold on for me. My Elisa clan will definitely express deep gratitude to you afterward!”","The corners of Lin Yuan’s mouth curled up. He was highly confident in Liu Chen and Liu Yao’s capabilities. Liu Chen and Liu Yao’s plan to organize star pirates to attack Elisa’s clan was devised by Lin Yuan.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao’s capabilities had exceeded Lin Yuan’s expectations. He did not expect them to do things so well. These star pirates would definitely lure out the experts guarding the blood pool of the Elisa clan.","The Elisa experts would assess the situation and act accordingly. If they did not come out to stop these star pirates, the latter could potentially charge all the way to the main area of their clan.","The other Bloodian clans had no intention of protecting the Elisa clan. Some members of the Bloodian clans had already retreated into the territory of the Elisa clan.","When these star pirates attacked, their intent was to take lives. Many clans had lost their members under the attacks of the star pirates. The more ruthless these star pirates were, the more isolated and vulnerable the Elisa clan became."]},{"number":2906,"title":"Chapter 2906 Blood Pool Opened!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2906 Blood Pool Opened!","None of the Bloodians who came to the Elisa clan’s territory were willing to use their lives to deal with the calamity that the Elisa clan had suffered.","Spring and Winter, who were beside Lin Yuan, did not make a move. Kani and Jin Chen continued to kill the star pirates.","Kani and Jin Chen’s attacks were extremely fierce. The average strength of these star pirates was at World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, so it was difficult for them to resist Kani and Jin Chen’s attacks.","Lin Yuan’s protection allowed Helena to spread the news successfully. The Elisa Elders were already aware of the invasion of the star pirates.","Under normal circumstances, these star pirates would have risked their lives to prevent her from transmitting the message because once the Elisa Elders learned of the news, they would definitely send people to eliminate them. However, these star pirates didn’t target Helena too much. They didn’t notice this detail, as well as the other Bloodians of the Elisa clan.","After sending the message to the clan, Helena quickly expressed her gratitude to Lin Yuan, “Thank you for buying me time so that I could spread the news to the Elders! They will send people to eliminate these star pirates soon. Why don’t you follow me to the interior of the territory? We can’t hold on here anymore!”","Helena had a favorable impression of the pure-blooded Bloodian youth standing before her. Bloodians were all obsessed with looks, and Lin Yuan’s appearance matched the Bloodians’ aesthetic standards.","Furthermore, Helena could sense a noble and unique aura emanating from Lin Yuan. It was the kind of aura that could only be exuded by those truly of high status. Even in the current environment, Helena couldn’t help but wear a faint blush due to his charm.","Lin Yuan nodded and said, “We really can’t hold on here anymore. I wonder why the star pirates gathered together and chose this time to invade the Elisa clan. Even if they know that the Elisa clan is about to open the blood pool, these star pirates shouldn’t have targeted you! The Elisa clan is about to have a queen. Moreover, the blood pool doesn’t seem to be of much value to these star pirates.”","As Lin Yuan spoke, he revealed a contemplative expression as if he was seriously helping the Elisa clan think about the reason.","Lin Yuan’s words were exactly what Helena was thinking. These star pirates had been roaming around the periphery of the Scarlet Territory, and they would often snatch resources from the Bloodians’ merchant groups.","However, they did not dare to offend any powerful Bloodian clans for fear of being retaliated. These star pirates should be afraid of the Elisa clan.","Before opening the blood pool, the Elisa clan had considered many possible scenarios that could occur, but they had never anticipated that these star pirates would target them. Therefore, the Elisa clan had never conducted any similar rehearsals.","These star pirates had severely disrupted the Elisa clan’s blood pool opening ceremony. Helena was very afraid that the other Bloodian factions would take advantage of the situation to cause trouble and sabotage the Elisa clan. It could be said that the Elisa clan had made a huge decision to open the blood pool. If something went wrong, they would lose a thousand years of accumulation at the very least.","Lord Qin Yu was only a step away from becoming a queen. At this stage of bloodline evolution, he was at his most vulnerable. This vulnerability did not refer to losing his strength. Rather, it would be very difficult to obtain another chance to undergo bloodline transformation if he were to fail.","If Lord Qin Yu missed the opportunity, it was likely that the Elisa clan would not have another king bloodline capable of attempting to ascend to queen for the next few hundred years. Such a lack of foundation would cause the Elisa clan to fall by at least three ranks in the Scarlet Territory’s Bloodian rankings!","“These damned star pirates, I really don’t know who gave them the courage. No matter how many star pirates there are, we have to kill them all! Otherwise, it’s really difficult to appease the hatred in the hearts of my Elisa clan!”","Lin Yuan ignored the ruthless words of the female Bloodian in front of him. Most of these star pirates would leave the Scarlet Territory after completing this operation. It would not be so easy for the Elisa clan to seek revenge on them.","Furthermore, Liu Chen and Liu Yao had not sent out all the star pirates they had gathered at once. The number of star pirates participating in this operation was far more than what was visible now. Hopefully, these star pirates could exert some force and draw out more members of the Elisa clan.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to follow Helena into the Elisa clan’s territory, he received a voice transmission from Spring, “Young Master, according to the current situation, once something goes wrong with the blood pool, the Elisa clan will definitely investigate the Bloodians who entered the territory one by one. If the energy in the blood pool is forcefully absorbed by the other Bloodians, the Elisa clan will definitely not let it go. They will definitely go mad.","“By then, you probably won’t be able to maintain your current identity as a Bloodian! You will definitely be listed as a suspect by the Elisa clan. Instead of that, it’s better to stay on the outskirts of the Elisa clan’s territory and help them fight the star pirates. This way, you can also obtain a favor from the Elisa clan.","“If the Elisa clan falls into a state of madness, the Andra clan will definitely be implicated. It’s even possible that it will affect Fan Lou! Maintaining your identity as a Bloodian, especially this one that you’ve used for a long time, can only be beneficial to you!","“Once your identity as a Bloodian becomes sensitive, it will be difficult for you to interact with the other Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory for a long time to come!”","Since Lin Yuan had given up on recovering his previous life’s memories in the Returning Saint Pool and was no longer bound by them, everything about Lin Yuan must undergo a process of renewal and growth.","If Spring got too involved, it would affect Lin Yuan’s growth. Under such circumstances, she would only express her opinions to Lin Yuan at a critical moment. As for whether Lin Yuan would accept her opinions or not, that was up to him.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan’s thoughtful expression, Spring said, “A pinnacle king bloodline Bloodian is indeed stronger than Liu Chen and Liu Yao, but he does not pose a threat to Winter and me. We can control or kill him if we head to the blood pool. If you help resist the star pirates on the outskirts, the Elisa clan can’t suspect you, no matter how much they try. Furthermore, you’re already helping them now. In the end, the Elisa clan still has to express their gratitude!”","Upon hearing Spring’s words, Lin Yuan immediately made a decision and followed Spring’s method. The Bloodian identity that Lin Yuan currently established could be said to be extremely successful.","In addition to being on good terms with the Andra clan, he had also established connections with at least five other Bloodian clans that had the king bloodline. These Bloodian clans also had plans to be on good terms with Lin Yuan.","Under such circumstances, if Lin Yuan gave up on his current identity, all his previous relationships would be in vain.","Moreover, this incident would surely serve as a warning for these Bloodians. In the future, when Lin Yuan wanted to befriend these factions as a new Bloodian, they would definitely be wary of him.","Lin Yuan looked up at Helena and said in a clear voice, “I come from a clan that doesn’t belong to the Scarlet Territory. Since I’m here to share the blood tide of the Elisa clan, I should help you with something. Someone has to resist these star pirates outside. I have a few experts under me who can stop them. Return to the Elisa clan as soon as possible. You’re not a match for these star pirates with your strength.”","Lin Yuan patted Helena’s shoulder gently before leading Jin Chen, Kani, and the others toward the star pirates.","Jin Chen and Kani used their strength to kill a large number of star pirates.","Lin Yuan did not give Helena a chance to react as he flashed and collided with the group of star pirates. Otherwise, under the relentless pursuit of these star pirates, Helena couldn’t be certain if she was faster than them.","In Helena’s eyes, Lin Yuan was sacrificing himself to create an opportunity for her. Helena took a deep look at Lin Yuan’s back, and her eyes were slightly reddening.","At this moment, Helena felt like she had been saved by Lin Yuan. As everyone fled into the Elisa clan, Lin Yuan was willing to defend them against the star pirates.","Regardless of whether Lin Yuan was from the Scarlet Territory or not, the clan behind him was very worthy of the Elisa clan’s friendship. The clan behind Lin Yuan was definitely not weak. Otherwise, Lin Yuan’s Bloodian bloodline would not be so pure!","“Let’s retreat!”","Helena prayed in her heart that Lin Yuan would be able to survive! Even if the Elisa clan received the news of the star pirates’ invasion, they could no longer seal the blood pool once the blood tide had been released.","...","A male Bloodian with long golden hair was looking into the distance with a cold expression, his eyes filled with deep hatred. His monstrous hatred seemed capable of tearing apart everything in the distance!","Most of the Bloodians were handsome or beautiful, and even those who may not be conventionally attractive tended to maintain a youthful appearance. However, the two Bloodians beside the long-haired male Bloodian both looked senile, with deeply lined faces and furrowed skin. It was a state that a Bloodian would only display in a few months when their lifespan was about to run out.","“Lord Qin Yu, don’t worry. Go into the blood pool and absorb the energy. I will settle the matters outside. Even if I have to risk my life, I won’t let anyone affect you, Lord Qin Yu. It’s my honor to be able to protect Lord Qin Yu until my lifespan runs out!”","Qin Yu pursed his lips and said coldly, “Rula, Fan Qia, the two of you must have followed me for nearly 140,000 years. Back then, the three of us were all Chosens, chosen by the Elisa clan. Because my talent is slightly higher than yours, you gave me all the opportunities and willingly followed me.","“Apart from wanting to evolve my bloodline and continue the glory of the Elisa clan, the reason I decided to open the blood pool this time was also to bestow my blood to the two of you after my bloodline transformed so that your lifespans could be extended. If you fight now, it will consume your remaining lifespan. Why don’t the two of you enter the blood pool with me?”","Upon hearing Qin Yu’s words, the elderly Rula and Fan Qia were a little moved. Qin Yu had never been one to openly display his emotions. Qin Yu’s words were an affirmation of their friendship of more than 100,000 years.","However, when they heard Qin Yu say that he wanted to bring the two of them into the blood pool, Rula and Fan Qia hurriedly rejected his suggestion, “Lord Qin Yu, you entered the blood pool to transform into the Bloodian Queen and become the queen. Your bloodline concerns the glory of the Elisa clan. The two of us have been protecting the glory of the Andra clan with our lives. If we enter the blood pool and delay the transformation of your bloodline, won’t the two of us become sinners of the Elisa clan?!","“After living for over 100,000 years, I’ve seen all the sights worth seeing. If I can contribute my last bit of strength to the Elisa clan in the last moments of my life, it would be considered loyalty!”","It was only at this moment that Rula and Fan Qia realized how much Qin Yu valued relationships. The two of them knew that Qin Yu was giving them a chance to live. As long as they entered the blood pool, they could obtain at least 20,000 years of lifespan. However, there were some things that Rula and Fan Qia would not do, even if they were beaten to death.","Rula said as he felt the blood tide become denser, “Lord Qin Yu’s blood pool has completely opened. Hurry up and go in! Get Fan Qia to guard you outside the blood pool. I will go alone to disperse those star pirates!”","Rula believed that Qin Yu could complete his bloodline metamorphosis and become a Bloodian Queen. In fact, Qin Yu’s bloodline had long reached the threshold of transformation. However, as a male Bloodian, he needed a large amount of pure spirit qi to support his body reconstruction.","It had taken nearly 20,000 years for the Elisa clan to trade with the other clans. Coupled with the production of his own Creators, he finally managed to save enough spiritual qi!","If not for the fact that Qin Yu wanted to keep Rula and Fan Qia alive, he would have accumulated more time.","The pure spirit qi in Qin Yu’s hands was still a little lacking.","Rula gave Fan Qia the chance to live at the final juncture. No matter what, someone had to guard Qin Yu to prevent any accidents from affecting the transformation of her bloodline.","Seeing that Fan Qia was about to speak, Rula continued, “Fan Qia, your divine kingdom ability in protection surpasses mine, while I excel more in combat and killing. There’s no need for us to fight over such things. If I’m not strong enough to defend against these star pirates, won’t I have to rely on you to protect Lord Qin Yu!?”","After saying that, Rula bowed to Qin Yu. Although Rula looked old, she looked very noble when she performed this etiquette. The bow carried a sense of mission of sacrifice.","Qin Yu moved his lips and did not say anything else. After Rula left, Qin Yu turned around and walked towards the blood pool.","A voice drifted behind Qin Yu, “If Rula dies, I’ll bury all the star pirates within 30,000 kilometers of the Scarlet Territory with her!”"]},{"number":2907,"title":"Chapter 2907 Do You Have the Qualifications?!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2907 Do You Have the Qualifications?!","Fan Qia had just sent Rula off, and now he was sending Qin Yu off to the blood pool. Qin Yu had always been a person who didn’t show his emotions easily, carrying the elegance befitting a Bloodian noble. The fact that he could say such words showed how furious he was.","Fan Qia’s heart sank to the bottom. It was not because of Qin Yu’s anger, nor was it because Rula was about to die. Fan Qia and Rula had long been prepared to sacrifice everything for the Elisa clan. The reason his heart sank was that he felt that these star pirates would not have attacked the Elisa clan for no reason.","Everything in the blood pool was a sacred object to the Bloodians, but to those non-Bloodian star pirates, it was merely ordinary resources. These star pirates had been in the Scarlet Territory for tens of thousands of years. It was impossible for them not to be aware of it.","Star pirates consistently prioritized cost-effectiveness and preferred low-risk and high returns. This was their way of survival. Fan Qia was very afraid that it was a Bloodian clan that was targeting Elisa’s clan this time, and they were hiding behind the star pirates and mobilizing them. If that was the case, there would definitely be follow-up actions.","Fan Qia looked worriedly in the direction of where Qin Yu had left. He secretly hoped that regardless of what would happen, it would not affect Lord Qin Yu’s bloodline evolution. As long as Lord Qin Yu successfully transformed into the Bloodian Queen, regardless of the severity of the injuries that the Elisa clan suffered, they would still be able to develop more prosperously than they were now.","Qin Yu’s thoughts were no less than Fan Qia’s. However, as the current leader of the Elisa clan, Qin Yu did not voice his worries. He was prepared to complete her bloodline transformation as soon as possible to put an end to this farce. If not for the fact that the blood pool could not be closed before its energy was depleted, Qin Yu would have already attacked the star pirates.","The moment Qin Yu entered the blood pool with a heavy heart, he realized that a young Bloodian was already soaking in the blood pool. The young Bloodian was not a member of the Elisa clan, yet he was immersing himself in the Elisa clan’s blood pool, resembling something out of a fantasy. Qin Yu almost thought that he had seen wrongly. However, reality proved that not only was Qin Yu not mistaken, but the Bloodian youth was also scrutinizing him.","Next to the Bloodian youth was a spider-species fey in camouflage, which was frantically absorbing the energy in the blood pool. The energy in the blood pool formed two huge whirlpools, spinning at high speed with the Bloodian youth and the spider-species fey at the core.","Just as Qin Yu was about to attack, two figures appeared behind the Bloodian youth. The auras released by the two figures directly sealed the blood pool. Under the envelopment of these two mighty forces, QIn Yu did not have the slightest room for resistance. Qin Yu went from anger to shock.","The strength of the two figures was significantly higher than his. Otherwise, he would definitely not be so powerless under the envelopment of their auras. Qin Yu struggled with all his might, but he could only move his limbs slowly.","The Bloodian youth and the spider-species fey did not move. Instead, they walked toward him. The elderly man grabbed his collar and dragged him to the Bloodian youth’s side.","Qin Yu moved his lips twice, but the words that surged to his throat did not find their way out. He wanted to ask the Bloodian youth in front of him who he was to dare to plot against the Elisa clan. However, since he had already done it, it indicated that he did not take the Elisa clan seriously at all.","Indeed, the Elisa clan did not have any chance to resist. At this moment, Fan Qia, who was outside the blood pool, was probably not aware of the situation inside. Qin Yu had already accepted his fate in silence. It was then that he heard the Bloodian youth before him chuckle and waved his hand, “You’re the Bloodian prince of the Elisa clan who’s preparing to transform your bloodline into a queen, right? Hello, my name is Black Elise. I’m from the Elise clan. I wonder if you’ve heard of the Elise clan? Our Elise clan hasn’t set foot in the Scarlet Territory for tens of thousands of years.”","Unless absolutely necessary, Lin Yuan didn’t intend to kill Qingyu. Instead, he harbored thoughts of manipulating Qing Yu from behind to control the Elisa clan. This way, his status as a Bloodian would be even more stable.","If Lin Yuan were to control the Bloodian prince before him with his human identity, he would probably refuse to comply under any circumstances. However, there was a possibility that the Bloodian prince would agree to comply if Lin Yuan were to control him as a fellow Bloodian, especially under the overwhelming pressure of absolute power.","Lin Yuan knew that Qin Yu had never heard of the Elise clan. It would be strange if he had heard of a clan that Lin Yuan had fabricated.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, waves surged in Qing Yu’s heart. It turned out that he was from a Bloodian faction from the Scarlet Territory. He was surprised to find out that the Bloodian faction outside the Scarlet Territory actually possessed such formidable strength.","Qin Yu had indeed never heard of the Elise clan, but he had already vaguely guessed the intention behind the Bloodian youth’s revelation of his identity. He didn’t disclose his identity just to exchange pleasantries, his aim was to gain control over the entire Elisa clan. Otherwise, if the Bloodian youth’s sole intention was to absorb the energy in the blood pool, he could have his two subordinates kill Qin Yu directly without sparing his life.","“My name is Elisa Qin Yu. I’m the 364th leader of the Elisa clan, on my way to the blood pool to undergo bloodline evolution.”","Qin Yu also revealed his identity to Lin Yuan. Be it as a Bloodian prince or as the leader, Qin Yu did not for the downfall of the Elisa clan. If he and the Elisa clan were unwilling to accept the control of the Elise clan, the only outcome would be destruction.","The Elise clan, a Bloodian faction that was not native to the Scarlet Territory, had come to the Scarlet Territory and interfered with the Elisa clan. They gathered star pirates to attack the Elisa clan in order to snatch their blood pool. The Elise clan definitely would not want such vile actions to be exposed.","Qin Yu hesitated for a moment before making the choice that was most beneficial to him and Elisa’s clan. At the very least, becoming a puppet would allow him to survive. It was better than having his entire clan wiped out.","Upon hearing Qin Yu’s response, the corners of Lin Yuan’s mouth curled up into an obvious arc. Lin Yuan greatly admired intelligent people, and Qin Yu was clearly an extremely intelligent person. Talking to intelligent people not only saved time and effort but also guaranteed that they could carry out arrangements effectively in the future.","“The overall strength of your Elisa clan is not bad, and you also have the potential to become the Bloodian Queen. My Elise clan is willing to take your clan under our wing. What is your opinion on this?”","Qin Yu had guessed Lin Yuan’s intention, but she had not expected him to be so straightforward. He asked tentatively, “If I lead the Elisa clan to submit to you, I wonder what benefits the Elise clan can offer us?”","As soon as Qin Yu finished speaking, he felt the grip on his collar tighten. A hand reached out and grabbed his neck, making it difficult for him to even breathe.","Winter’s cold voice rang out, “You want to negotiate with our Young Master? Do you have the qualifications?! Your Elisa clan has now become our captive. My young master can decide your life and death with a single word! As the leader of a Bloodian clan, I urge you to carefully consider the future of the Elisa clan and avoid making any mistakes!”","Winter was extremely dissatisfied with Qin Yu’s behavior. At such a time, Qin Yu was still negotiating with Lin Yuan. He did not have the qualifications to negotiate in the least bit.","Winter was very heavy-handed, yet Lin Yuan did not stop him from making a move. Lin Yuan felt that Qin Yu needed to be taken down a notch. Otherwise, even if he took Qin Yu under his wing, he would not submit to him in the future. What Lin Yuan wanted was absolute control over the Elisa clan. Elisa Qin Yu had to admit his identity as a king!","After teaching him a lesson, he could reward Qin Yu. This way would ensure that Qin Yu not only submitted to him out of fear but also worked hard for his future arrangements.","Qin Yu’s consciousness gradually became blurry from the torture of suffocation. He realized that his life was about to come to an end. Just then, a faint echo of the soothing voice he had just heard whispered in Qin Yu’s ear, “Winter, give him another chance. I believe he’s willing to bring the Elisa clan to submit to our Elise clan!”","As this light and pleasant voice sounded, the pair of large hands released their grip from his neck and pinched his collar instead. As a result, he recovered from his near-death state.","Qin Yu, who had just escaped death, hurriedly said, “I’m willing to bring the Elisa clan to submit to the Elise clan. As the clan leader, I can offer my loyalty to the Elise clan at any time!”","Lin Yuan immediately said, “Since you’re willing to offer your loyalty, hand over your holy spirit to me!”","Qin Yu had spoken those words because he was willing to let the leader of the Elise clan control him. In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, absolute control was the best way to demonstrate loyalty. In the end, after he finished speaking, the Bloodian youth actually wanted to accept his loyalty.","Qin Yu could sense that the Bloodian youth in front of him had only lived for less than fifty years. This Black Elise couldn’t be the leader of the Elise clan.","In the face of Lin Yuan’s request, Qin Yu did not dare to speak too much. He was afraid that if he said any word that incurred the dissatisfaction of the Bloodian youth before him, the elderly man who had restrained his throat would really kill him. Qin Yu obediently released his holy spirit and allowed Lin Yuan to control it.","Neither Lin Yuan nor Blood Love could make a correct estimation of the energy in the blood pool, as it was too vast. Less than five minutes after Blood Love entered the blood pool, its absorption of blood-type energy reached a saturation point.","The energy in the blood pool was meant for use by experts who had surpassed the Holy Spirit level. It was too much for the Blood Love, who had just reached the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, to absorb the energy in the blood pool.","On the other hand, Lin Yuan could absorb the blood pool’s energy at will. However, absorbing the blood-type energy to enhance his Bloodian bloodline was far less useful than controlling a genuine Bloodian Queen.","Prior to exerting control over Qin Yu, Lin Yuan had already decided that if he could control him, he would help Qin Yu in his bloodline transformation and allow him to become a true Bloodian Queen. With Qin Yu becoming a Bloodian Queen, he would lead the Elisa clan to prosperity and greatly increase their right to speak in the Scarlet Territory.","This increase in authority would allow the Elisa clan to take better care of Lin Yuan’s Bloodian identity and help him collect resources in the Scarlet Territory.","Qin Yu, who was under Lin Yuan’s control, was filled with frustration. He did not want to be controlled by anyone if he had a choice. Before deciding to open the blood pool, his intention was to enhance his strength and restore the Elisa clan to its former glory.","However, after stepping into the blood pool, not only did he become a prisoner, but the Elisa clan also found itself surviving at the mercy of others.","Just as Qin Yu’s frustration gradually turned into despair, Lin Yuan spoke, “The energy in this blood pool has been accumulated by the Elisa clan for generations. Since you’re willing to submit to me, you can absorb the energy in the blood pool! I’ll help your bloodline transform into a queen. You just have to work hard to improve!","Lin Yuan waved his hand at Winter, and Winter let Qin Yu enter the blood pool.","Qin Yu floated in the blood pool in a sorry state with an ecstatic expression. The energy in the blood pool was a great tonic for any Bloodian. Qin Yu could never have imagined that Lin Yuan would be willing to share it with him.","If he could become the Bloodian Queen, what if the Elisa clan became servants? His status in the Scarlet Territory would greatly increase.","Since this young Bloodian named Black Elise was so generous to him, it was very likely that he would give him more chances in the future.","Before absorbing the energy in the blood pool, Qin Yu thought of Rula, who had gone to fight the star pirates, and hurriedly said, “Lord, my Elisa clan has already become your servant clan. There are a total of three Bloodians with the bloodline of the Elisa clan that have reached the king level. Two of them are at the end of their lifespans.","“One of the Bloodian kings set out to fight the star pirates upon receiving the news. Lord, I wonder if you can stop those star pirates from continuing to invade the Elisa clan? Otherwise, this Bloodian king will definitely die. Lord, your subordinates will lose a decent combat power! If I can really become the Bloodian Queen, I can use my own blood to extend their lifespan by nearly ten thousand years!”","The moment Lin Yuan entered the blood pool, he had informed Liu Chen and Liu Yao to evacuate the star pirates. After he entered the blood pool, the star pirates ceased to have any purpose.","“The star pirates have already been informed to evacuate. As long as he doesn’t chase after these star pirates and sacrifices his lifespan to drag them down with him, there won’t be any casualties. What you have to do now is not to worry about others but to ensure that your bloodline can break through.","“The future value of the Elisa clan depends on whether or not your bloodline can break through.”"]},{"number":2908,"title":"Chapter 2908 Qin Yu’s Transformation!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2908 Qin Yu’s Transformation!","Qin Yu was relieved to hear Lin Yuan’s words.","Once the star pirates started dispersing, Rula would not chase after them.","After stabilizing the situation, he would definitely retreat to the vicinity of the blood pool to protect himself and prevent anyone from affecting him. If Rula truly did not care about his own life and chased after those star pirates, it would spell the end of his life.","Qin Yu calmed down and began focusing on absorbing the energy in the blood pool!","The blood pool formed a huge vortex with Qin Yu at the center. The blood-type energy in the blood pool transformed into blood-colored torrents that flowed into Qin Yu’s body, causing him to let out a soft moan of happiness. The feeling of blood-type energy pouring into his body to enable him to break through the bloodline barrier was wonderful!","This joy did not last long. After absorbing too much blood-type energy, Qin Yu’s body became bloated state due to the excessive energy. Every cell in Qin Yu’s body showed signs of tearing away.","There had been more than one Bloodian Queen in the Elisa clan. The Elisa clan’s records documented the process of how a king transformed into a queen.","Once the body entered this state, it needed to absorb pure spirit qi in order to absorb more blood-type energy!","Pure spirit qi existed in many forms. Every Creator had their own special methods of preparing pure spirit qi. Among them, the most common way to store spirit qi was through the preparation of potions.","Qin Yu absorbed this relatively pure spirit qi and drew more blood-type energy from the blood pool into his body.","The more spirit qi that Qin Yu, who was originally full of confidence, consumed, the more solemn his expression became.","Qin Yu realized that more than half of the pure spirit qi he had prepared in advance had already been consumed. However, his body had yet to show any signs of transforming.","He was a male Bloodian who had not even reached the stage of gender change. How could he become a true Bloodian Queen?","With the pure spirit qi being gradually exhausted, Qin Yu’s heart plummeted.","At this moment, Qin Yu realized that it was unknown if he could even survive, let alone become a Bloodian Queen!","Even if he was not controlled by the Elise clan, he would still end up dead and skeletonized at the bottom of the blood pool.","The process of advancing to Bloodian Queen could not stop once it began. The blood-type energy that had entered Qin Yu’s body would explode without the suppression of the blood pool. Qin Yu’s body would be blasted full of holes. It was just like how the blood pool could not be closed once it was activated!","Feeling the chaotic blood energy in the blood pool, Qin Yu closed his eyes in despair.","At this moment, Qin Yu felt himself enveloped by majestic pure spirit qi. The purity of this spirit qi was even higher than the one he had prepared.","Qin Yu realized that Lin Yuan was helping him complete his bloodline transformation.","Qin Yu looked at Lin Yuan gratefully and was about to thank him when he heard him shout in a serious tone, “Remember not to be distracted while advancing your bloodline. Have you realized that the speed at which you absorb blood energy is slower than the speed at which you absorb spirit qi?","“Even if I give you pure spirit qi, you will end up at a stalled stage where your body is broken. This is because the purity of the spirit qi you absorbed previously is too low. It caused your body to be filled with too many impurities!","“The only way to change this is to use spirit qi to temper your physique first. You don’t have to worry about the consumption of spirit qi. This is the only way your bloodline will be able to transform!”","As he spoke, Lin Yuan arrived behind Qin Yu and placed his palm on his back.","He circulated the Body of All Spirits and injected the pure spirit qi into Qin Yu’s body, thereby cleansing the impurities in his body.","Lin Yuan’s words exposed his predicament and allowed Qin Yu to discover his problem.","Lin Yuan injected more spirit qi into his body, allowing Qin Yu to use the spirit qi to expel the impurities from his body.","Qin Yu had always thought that the cleansing of the body recorded in the secret manual meant that one had to cleanse the body before entering the blood pool and that this prevented impure energies from polluting the blood pool.","But now, he understood that cleansing the body meant that there could not be any impurities in the body. This was an impossible task!","The Scarlet Territory did not lack blood-type energy but had always lacked spirit qi. It was no wonder that the current Bloodian Queen’s clan in the Scarlet Territory had been cooperating with factions outside the Scarlet Territory to hoard resources related to spirit qi.","Originally, Lin Yuan’s nightmare had robbed him of his freedom. Now, it seemed that Lin Yuan was actually saving him and giving him a chance to truly transform into a queen bloodline!","Qin Yu gathered his thoughts and accepted Lin Yuan’s help as he desperately washed away the impurities in his body.","The blood pool was turbulent, and the Elisa clan outside the blood pool had completely calmed down.","After Liu Chen and Liu Yao received Lin Yuan’s message, they immediately evacuated the star pirates.","Under Rula’s lead, the Elisa clan quickly took over the situation. The other Bloodian clans who had fled to the Elisa clan were all driven out.","While Helena and several core members of the Elisa clan were reporting the situation to Rula, one of the male members made a suggestion.","“Your Excellency Rula, not only did the other Bloodian clans not lend a helping hand when our Elisa clan faced the invasion of star pirates, but they also interfered with our resistance against the star pirates. I don’t think we should allow these clans to absorb the blood tide from our blood pool again. These people are not worthy of the Elisa clan’s benefits!”","Rula looked calmly at the male Bloodian who made the suggestion and rejected it outright.","“Think before you speak. The Elisa clan should prioritize Lord Qin Yu’s steady advancement to the queen bloodline now! Our forcefully dispersing of the other Bloodian clans will definitely cause a commotion. Investigate the factions that are currently outside our faction’s territory and pay attention to see if there are any suspicious individuals.”","Upon hearing Rula’s order, these core members immediately went to carry out the order, leaving only Helena behind.","Rula looked at Helena and asked, “You were the first to report the news of the star pirates’ invasion. When Lord Qin Yu’s bloodline advances, you will be rewarded. Do you have any more information to report?”","Hesitation flashed across Helena’s face, but it quickly turned into one of courage.","“Lord Rula, have you heard of the Elise clan? It was a young Bloodian from the Elise clan who helped me resist the star pirates’ attack. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have had the chance to report the news to the clan!”","Seeing that Helena was not done speaking, Rula waved his hand and flew towards the blood pool.","Rula was not in the mood to care about the young Bloodian from the Elise clan. Every second she spent listening to Helena’s report would be a second wasted.","The most important thing was to return to the blood pool to meet up with Fancha and protect Lord Qin Yu together!","Helena pursed her lips tightly as she watched Rula leave. Then, she headed in the direction where Lin Yuan and the star pirates were fighting.","She only wanted to know if Lin Yuan, who was fighting the star pirates, was still alive.","The Andra clan had not suffered any losses, and neither had the Allen clan.","Yi Xue and Shi Mei did not want to use their clans’ strength for the sake of the Elisa clan.","They wanted to befriend Lin Yuan but had lost sight of him.","Yi Xue and Shi Mei had both seen Lin Yuan lead his blood servants in fighting the star pirates and protecting the Elisa clan.","If Lin Yuan was still alive, he would definitely meet up with the two of them. Since Lin Yuan had yet to appear, it most likely meant that his group was dead.","Yi Xue had seen the strength of the two blood servants beside Lin Yuan. His own investigation had failed to break through the two blood servants’ seals.","If Lin Yuan had not taken the initiative to fight the star pirates, there would have been no problems with such powerful blood servants protecting Lin Yuan!","Fortunately, the members of the Elisa clan had seen Lin Yuan protecting them. Otherwise, someone would have tried to besmirch and frame Lin Yuan’s sudden disappearance.","The source of all this was Lin Yuan, a Bloodian who did not belong to the Scarlet Territory.","At that time, those who had brought Lin Yuan here would definitely be implicated!","Five whole days had passed, but the Elisa clan’s blood pool was still releasing the blood tide.","However, these blood tides were becoming thinner and thinner. Either the energy in the blood pool had been exhausted, or the blood pool was about to close.","Otherwise, under normal circumstances, the blood pool could be open and surging for months.","If the Blood Tide only lasted for three to five days, it would not be worth so many Bloodian clans traveling all the way here!","The energy in the blood pool was indeed about to be sucked dry by Qin Yu. He had already become a genuine Bloodian Queen a day ago, and his bloodline had undergone a complete transformation.","Qin Yu’s transformation had consumed nearly 600,000 of Lin Yuan’s spirit qi crystals.","Luckily, Morbius had been helping Lin Yuan collect spirit qi crystals in the faith country. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would not have been able to supply so many spirit qi crystals to help Qin Yu evolve her bloodline.","After transforming into a Bloodian Queen, Qin Yu originally wanted to stop absorbing the energy in the blood pool and give all the remaining energy to Lin Yuan.","However, Lin Yuan only took a portion of Qin Yu’s blood e and allowed her to continue absorbing the blood-type energy in the blood pool.","He also gave Qin Yu a large amount of spirit qi crystals to consolidate her realm and strengthen her bloodline.","Even if Qin Yu suffered injuries that threatened her roots, her bloodline would not be destabilized, and she would not transform back into a Bloodian king.","In the past five days, Qin Yu’s attitude and opinion of Lin Yuan had changed.","He had been forced to become Lin Yuan’s subordinate at the beginning but he was completely obedient to Lin Yuan now. Lin Yuan could give him much more benefits than he could create for himself.","The pure spirit qi provided by Lin Yuan had already far exceeded Qin Yu’s comprehension. The Elisa clan might not even be able to accumulate that much pure spirit qi in 100,000 years! Furthermore, this was even under the circumstances that the Elisa clan did not consume spirit qi daily.","While using the Body of All Spirits to help Qin Yu evolve, Lin Yuan gained a deep understanding of the Bloodian bloodline.","Lin Yuan could now confirm that compared to the mermaids, the Bloodians’ bloodline was indeed stronger!","The mermaids were only able to contend with the Bloodians because the Bloodians were always fighting with the mermaids in the sea. The mermaids had the geographical advantage. In the sea, water-element energy was inexhaustible.","The mermaid bloodline allowed the mermaids to replenish their energy from the sea.","At this moment, Qin Yu, whose bloodline had transformed into a queen, had shrunk. She was only about 1.7 meters tall now.","Her long golden hair fell to her waist, and her facial features and body proportions were exquisite.","Her blood-red eyes were soul-stirring. The three vertical pupils in the middle of her blood-red eyes made Qin Yu’s eyes appear very deep.","The two pairs of fangs in Qin Yu’s mouth were only revealed when she smiled.","Similar to the mermaids, the Bloodians were also humanoid creatures. Their beauty was similar, but the style was different.","Compared to absorbing blood-type energy to improve his bloodline, absorbing Qin Yu’s blood essence to improve his bloodline was much more convenient for Lin Yuan.","After leaving the blood pool and absorbing Qin Yu’s blood essence, Lin Yuan’s Bloodian bloodline would most likely reach the queen level. At that time, the Bloodian bloodline would become Lin Yuan’s strongest bloodline.","When Qin Yu depleted all the energy in the blood pool, Lin Yuan removed his hand from her back.","After using the Body of All Spirits continuously and without rest for the past few days, Lin Yuan was exceptionally tired.","Qin Yu knelt in front of Lin Yuan and offered him the highest etiquette of a Bloodian.","No Bloodian Queen had ever knelt on both knees before. Even a low-level Bloodian would only kneel on one knee when swearing allegiance to a high-level Bloodian!","“Young Master, I’ve successfully become a Bloodian Queen. I’ll be at your disposal in the future! May I ask if you have any plans for me? I will definitely try my best to finish the tasks you give me!”","Lin Yuan helped Qin Yu up from the ground and patted her shoulder.","“From now on, you only need to continue to be the queen of the Elisa clan in the Scarlet Territory. I’ll inform you through it if there’s anything you need to do in the future!”","As he spoke, Lin Yuan took out a ramet of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower and handed it to Qin Yu.","Qin Yu was very grateful for Lin Yuan’s kindness and was willing to do anything for him.","However, Qin Yu preferred to stay in the Elisa clan to develop the Elisa clan rather than leave with Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan’s words meant that he was willing to give her this chance.","Qin Yu stood up and examined her body. She was very satisfied with the new body she gained after becoming a queen."]},{"number":2909,"title":"Chapter 2909 New Ruler of the Scarlet Territory!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2909 New Ruler of the Scarlet Territory!","Before becoming a Bloodian Queen, Qin Yu had always admired the title.","Now that Qin Yu had completely transformed into a Bloodian Queen, she finally knew how powerful a Bloodian Queen was!","Now, she was at least ten times physically stronger than before. This body looked weak, but Qin Yu had never dared to dream of being this capable of manipulating her bloodline.","The Elisa clan was now a Bloodian clan with a queen.","Now that Lin Yuan had asked her to continue developing the Elisa clan, Qin Yu would make a show announcing the news of her promotion to Bloodian Queen in the entire Scarlet Territory!","After Qin Yu received the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, Lin Yuan nodded at Spring. Spring and Winter disappeared from the blood pool alongside Lin Yuan and Blood Love.","Qin Yu did not know where Lin Yuan had gone. As a servant, she had no right to ask about Lin Yuan’s actions.","Qin Yu left the blood pool, and she saw Fan Qia and Rula guarding the door.","Fan Qia and Rula had been extremely handsome Bloodian kings in their youth. But now, their aged appearances had lost all the glory of youth!","The moment she saw Rula, Qin Yu relaxed.","If Lin Yuan had not appeared, she would have become a skeleton at the bottom of the blood pool.","Based on Qin Yu’s understanding of Fan Qia and Rula, the two of them would have remained here until their lifespans ended and the Elisa clan withered to ruin.","This was because, apart from the resources provided to the outstanding juniors in the clan, all of the Elisa clan’s resources had been given to Qin Yu.","After advancing to Bloodian Queen, Qin Yu’s gender had changed.","This obvious change in appearance stunned Fan Qia and Rula when they saw Qin Yu. They started shedding hot tears of surprised joy.","Tears pricked Qin Yu’s eyes when she saw this scene. She was lucky to have assistants like Fan Qia and Rula by her side!","Due to the fact that Lin Yuan had given Qin Yu a large amount of spirit qi to enable her to absorb the rest of the blood-type energy in the blood pool even after she had evolved to a Bloodian Queen, Qin Yu was slightly stronger than the usual new Bloodian Queen.","It would be a strain for Qin Yu to give two portions of blood essence to Fan Qia and Rula, but the cost would not be too great!","Just as Qin Yu was about to condense two portions of the queen bloodline’s blood essence, Fan Qia and Rula hurriedly stopped her.","“Lord Qin Yu, you’ve just advanced to Bloodian Queen. There’s really no need to destabilize your condition for the two of us! We can continue living for a few more months. When your condition stabilizes, you can give us your blood essence then!”","Qin Yu waved her hand and forcefully handed two portions of queen blood essence to Fan Qia and Rula.","“I encountered a fortuitous opportunity in the blood pool. I agreed to give you these two portions of blood essence long ago. It won’t affect me much. You don’t have to worry! Go and seal the blood pool so it can continue to accumulate blood-type energy. Then, go into seclusion. I think you’ll be able to return to your youthful appearance once you come out of seclusion. I’ll be in charge of the clan’s matters. I’ve been lying low for so long. It’s time for me to show my face!”","Upon hearing Qin Yu’s words, Fan Qia and Rula took the blood essence from him. The Bloodian Queen’s blood essence was the most precious item among the Bloodians.","Qin Yu was willing to bestow the blood essence to them because of their many years of friendship.","Fan Qia and Rula went to seal the blood pool according to Qin Yu’s instructions. Then, they returned to their own residences and went into seclusion.","Not only could Qin Yu’s queen blood essence allow them to recover their lifespans, but their bloodlines could be improved as well!","The two of them did not know what kind of opportunity Qin Yu had obtained in the blood pool, but Qin Yu’s gift could definitely be considered a huge opportunity for them!","Helena, Yi Xue, Shi Mei, and the others were all worried about Lin Yuan.","It was fine if they found the corpses of Lin Yuan and the others, but they had not done so. It was as though Lin Yuan and the others had vanished into thin air.","Almost all the star pirates had dispersed. Those who had not managed to escape in time were executed.","Lin Yuan had been willing to help the Elisa clan fend off the star pirates at such a critical moment. If he was not dead, there was no reason for him not to appear!","Lin Yuan’s actions would most likely lead to a friendship with the Elisa clan.","The Elisa clan was a clan with many Bloodian kings. They were also about to have a true Bloodian Queen.","It was the best way for the Elise clan to return to the Scarlet Territory was to develop a friendship with the Elisa clan.","Helena wanted to search for Lin Yuan again, but she suddenly received an order for the clan to gather.","This was the Elisa clan’s highest level of directive. Despite wanting to investigate Lin Yuan’s whereabouts, Helena had to return to the clan to participate in the meeting.","Qin Yu was the only one in the entire Elisa clan who had the right to issue orders of this level.","Lord Qin Yu had already left the blood pool. Had he reached the queen bloodline? If the answer was no, he would definitely be in a bad mood, and Helena would not dare to tell Lord Qin Yu about this.","But if the answer was yes, Helena would tell him everything about Lin Yuan in the hopes that he would send more people out to search for Lin Yuan.","If Lin Yuan was seriously injured and in a comatose state, they might be able to save his life if they found him and treated him in time!","Helena asked Yi Xue, Shi Mei, and the others about Lin Yuan’s situation.","Although Lin Yuan’s Elise clan was not one of the Scarlet Territory’s native factions, it was a clan with a queen bloodline.","Lord Qin Yu found out about the situation, and he would likely be interested in Lin Yuan’s condition.","When Helena and the other members of the Elisa clan left, Yi Xue, Shi Mei, and the other leaders of king clans knew that the king from the Elisa clan who had entered the blood pool must have emerged. However, the exact situation had yet to be revealed.","The energy in the blood pool dried up in such a short period of time. Either the Elisa clan’s blood pool had not accumulated much energy, or the energy in the blood pool had been absorbed in this short period of time.","Based on the blood tide at the beginning, the Elisa clan’s blood pool was clearly overflowing. Otherwise, the blood tide could not have spread so far!","The king from the Elisa clan who had entered the blood pool had most likely successfully evolved into a Bloodian Queen. The Elisa clan could finally be considered one of the clans that held true power in the Scarlet Territory!","Just as Yi Xue, Shi Mei, and the others were sighing in wonder, Lin Yuan walked over with four servants.","There were no visible injuries on Lin Yuan and the others, but his aura had waned. It was as though he had been pushing himself for some time.","Under normal circumstances, they had to pretend to be as miserable as possible in order to obtain the Elisa clan’s friendship. The more miserable Lin Yuan and the others were, the more benefits they could obtain from the Elisa clan. This was because Lin Yuan’s group had been injured while they were protecting the Elisa clan!","Now that Lin Yuan had become the true ruler of the Elisa clan and the Bloodian Queen Qin Yu was his subordinate, there was no need for Lin Yuan to put on such an act!","King clans like the Andra and Allen clans were no longer important to Lin Yuan.","When Yi Xue, Shi Mei, and the others saw Lin Yuan, they hurriedly asked about his condition.","Their concern for Lin Yuan was not fake. Both the Andra and Allen clans were waiting to work with Lin Yuan. Lin Yuan could be said to be the best potential partner!","Yi Xue had already traded with Lin Yuan, so he knew what benefits came from doing so.","Lin Yuan responded to Yi Xue, Shi Mei, and the others’ concerns one by one. Lin Yuan’s plan to head to the Scarlet Territory had been completed, and it had far exceeded his expectations.","Because of Spring’s suggestion, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves would no longer be affected by his plan.","Fan Lou definitely needed to depart from the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","It was better for Fan Lou to stay with the Elisa clan than the Andra clan.","Although the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were not affected by his plan, Feng Xuan’s actions had completely offended the Andra clan.","Feng Xuan had made Fan Lou suffer greatly. Fan Lou’s damaged roots had yet to recover.","Since that was the case, Fan Lou would decide whether Feng Xuan and the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves lived or died!","Lin Yuan only needed to let Qin Yu know, and she could find a reason to take him from the Andra clan.","If the Bloodians wanted to attack the mermaids, the Dark Pufferfish’s venom would be very useful to them.","Regardless of how brave the Andra clan was, they would not refuse Qin Yu, the new Bloodian Queen, when she asked for a small fry like Fan Lou.","Qin Yu sat on her golden chair, which was encrusted with rubies. Looking at the core members of the Elisa clan who were present, thousands of thoughts ran through her mind and the thought of exhibiting her skills popped into her mind.","Qin Yu could sense that Lin Yuan was very interested in the Scarlet Territory. The stronger the Elisa clan became and the more authority she had in the Scarlet Territory, the more useful she would be to Lin Yuan!","At this moment, every member of the Elisa clan revealed was smiling as they internally celebrated the evolution of Qin Yu’s bloodline.","Helena was the only one who was worried about Lin Yuan’s safety.","As a female Bloodian, this was the first time Helena had encountered a male Bloodian member who could make her blush and her heart race.","Qin Yu raised her hand and bestowed a cup of blood wine to all the core members of the Elisa clan.","Qin Yu took a sip of the blood wine in her cup, stood up, and said loudly.","“Now, Elisa clan is wrapped in the glory of a queen. We’re no longer just a clan with a king bloodline. After I became a queen, I obtained hundreds of thousands of years of lifespan.","“As a new Bloodian Queen, I will lead the Elisa clan to prosperity! Go and prepare. Then, send invitations to all the Bloodian clans in the Scarlet Territory and our foreign allies to invite them to celebrate with us!”","The first thing Qin Yu wanted to do was to show off her identity as a Bloodian Queen. She believed that apart from the factions to whom sent the invitations, the other factions that had not received the invitations would also head to the Elisa clan’s territory of the Elisa clan with the intention of establishing ties with them.","Upon hearing Qin Yu’s arrangements, a proud expression appeared on the face of every Bloodian present.","Apart from informing the members of the clan that she had successfully evolved into a Bloodian Queen, Qin Yu also had to make arrangements for certain matters within the clan.","Over the years, Qin Yu had neglected to manage the Elisa clan while she focused on accumulating energy to evolve into a Bloodian Queen.","Qin Yu wanted to recapture all the authority she had allowed to slip away. She believed that none of the Elisa clan’s members would have any objections to her arrangements.","At the end of the meeting was the free time for the family clan members to discuss matters. One of the old Bloodians who did not have much lifespan left said, “Lordess Qin Yu, the other star pirates dared to attack the Elisa clan during the important stage of your bloodline transformation. That is unforgivable! I think we should eliminate all the star pirates within a 500-kilometer radius of the Scarlet Territory to show our might.”","Rula and Fan Qia were not the only Bloodians in the Elisa clan who were about to reach the end of their lifespans. The other Bloodians would also age and die after their bloodlines were exhausted.","However, only Rula and Fan Qia were qualified to be rewarded with Qin Yu’s blood essence.","If Qin Yu had evolved into a Bloodian Queen without Lin Yuan’s help, she would definitely not have let these star pirates off!","If Rula died while fighting the star pirates, Qin Yu would definitely keep her promise and exterminate all the star pirates within 30,000 kilometers of the Scarlet Territory.","However, Qin Yu now knew that the star pirates’ attack on Elisa’s clan was Lin Yuan’s doing.","If she did that, it was very likely that others would misunderstand that she had a problem with Lin Yuan. That would not be good!","Nothing terrified Qin Yu more than Lin Yuan misunderstanding her. She said in a low voice, “The dignity of the Elisa clan can’t be exhibited by getting rid of these star pirates. We have to prepare a banquet, and the buildings in our clan will undergo a large-scale renovation before the banquet. We don’t have time to get rid of the star pirates. If another star pirate dares to invade our territory, we can attack them then! Does anyone have anything else to say? If not, let’s end the meeting!”","The short-haired female Bloodian who was sitting beside Helena had been pressing Helena down with her hands and shooting her disapproving looks to stop her.","As Fan Qia’s former adjutant, Ronnie had interacted with Qin Yu in the past.","She could not say that she knew much about Qin Yu, but she knew that Qin Yu was extremely standoffish towards the other Bloodian clans.","With Qin Yu’s personality, she would not care about whether a Bloodian from another clan lived or died. If Helena made a suggestion to Qin Yu at this time, it would be equivalent to causing trouble for him!"]},{"number":2910,"title":"Chapter 2910 Abnormal Qin Yu!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2910 Abnormal Qin Yu!","Ronnie was much older than Helena. The age of Bloodians did not show through their appearance unless their lifespan was coming to an end.","Ronnie had previously been Helena’s mentor when she taught the Elisa clan’s young Bloodians combat skills.","Among the young Bloodians taught by Ronnie, Helena was the only one who stood out and became the core member of the Elisa clan.","If Helena made such a suggestion in front of Rula and Fan Qia, she might not be punished.","Rula and Fan Qia, had always been much more benevolent than Lordess Qin Yu. With his experience, Ronnie had already guessed why Helena spent so much effort on a young Bloodian from another clan. There was only one possibility of this, and that was that Helena had been attracted by the other party’s appearance and bloodline. She had developed feelings of attraction towards him! It was really stupid to make Lordess Qin Yu unhappy because of this attraction she had developed.","Ronnie did not want Helena to make a mistake, but Helena ignored his warning and pushed his hand away before standing up.","The moment Helena stood up, Ronnie knew that Helena was definitely going to tell Lordess Qin Yu about the other clans.","On one hand, Ronnie was a little angry that Helena had ignored her warnings. On the other hand, she hoped that Qin Yu would not vent her anger on Helena too much and kick her out of the group of core members.","Qin Yu looked up at Helena, who had stood up. Qin Yu did not recognize Helena.","For the past 200 years, Qin Yu had been focused solely on building up his own body and had left most of the clan’s affairs to Rula and Fan Qia.","It was likely that this female Bloodian was favored by Rula and Fan Qia. Otherwise, she would not be present at this meeting despite being less than 260 years old!","Qin Yu was patient when it came to young and exceptional members of the Elisa clan.","“If you have anything to report, go ahead. Given your age and power, you should be in charge of patrolling territories, right?”","Qin Yu did not have a bad temper, but it was not particularly good either.","Qin Yu was interacting with Helena now because she was an exceptional young clan member and because she had successfully transformed her bloodline!","After the past few days of being strengthened by Lin Yuan, Qin Yu could tell how generous Lin Yuan was. As such, not only was he not a form of restraint on the Elisa clan—he was an opportunity! If Fan Qia and Rula needed to evolve their bloodlines in the future, Lin Yuan would also likely be willing to help them as well!","The two powerhouses beside Lin Yuan, were also a form of protection for the Elisa clan.","Becoming a Bloodian Queen elevated her status among Bloodians and made it more convenient for her to improve her strength in the future.","It was still very difficult for Qin Yu to defeat higher-level experts. In the future, if such an expert came knocking, she could ask Lin Yuan for help without bearing the responsibility on her own! This greatly reduced the pressure on Qin Yu as the matriarch of the Elisa clan!","The Elisa clan would be at the center of attention in the Scarlet Territory for some time going forward.","Helena took a deep breath and said in a clear voice, “Lordess Qin Yu, I am indeed in charge of patrolling the territory. I am a newly promoted territory inspector. For the past twenty years, I’ve been in charge of patrolling the area around the Hidden Book Pavilion. I would like to report to you about what happened during the star pirates’ invasion when I was patrolling the territory and interacting with the other Bloodian clans!”","Ronnie sighed. He felt that Helena was not taking her current status and opportunity seriously!","Apart from her own efforts, Helena had also relied on Fan Qia’s recognition and rewards in order to reach her current position.","Helena’s actions were equivalent to letting Lord Fan Qia down!","Qin Yu frowned slightly when she heard Helena’s words. She had already been promoted to Bloodian Queen. What happened during the star pirates’ invasion was not important at all. There was no point in reporting such things to her now!","If Helena really wanted to report this, she could report it to an elder who would handle the situation instead.","Although she was a little unhappy, Qin Yu did not want to show her dissatisfaction at the end of the meeting.","“Oh? What could have happened when you were patrolling the territory with the other Bloodian clans?”","Since Helena had already decided to say it, she had to explain the situation clearly.","“Lordess Qin Yu, when the star pirates invaded, I couldn’t report the information to the clan immediately. It was a young Bloodian named Black Elise from the Elise clan who helped me fend off the star pirates, allowing me to report the information as soon as possible! However, Black Elise disappeared while resisting the star pirates. I hope that the clan can send a few more patrol teams to search for him!”","When Helena said this, many of the Elisa clan’s main members felt that she was very stupid. To think that she had reported such an unimportant matter to Lordess Qin Yu. She really did not take Lordess Qin Yu seriously!","Those who had come into contact with Qin Yu in the past were well aware of what kind of temper she had. Helena’s journey had been too smooth sailing, and it was time for her to be taught a lesson!","Qin Yu was surprised when she heard Helena’s words. She knew very well who Black Elise was.","In truth, Black Elise had helped Helena fend off the star pirates so that she would relay the information, thereby luring the enemy away. He had disappeared after that. Instead, he had gone to the blood pool and took a leisurely soak while he waited for Qin Yu.","If the result had turned out to be bad, Qin Yu would have personally punished Helena after learning that she was the one who gave Black Elise the chance to slip away.","However, the result had turned out to be positive and Helena had been an important factor in this event.","“Since the Elise clan helped us to fend off the star pirates, I naturally can’t ignore this matter. All patrol teams will be mobilized immediately to search the entire Elisa clan’s territory for anyone from the Elise clan! If we find them, we must treat them as distinguished guests!”","Helena was pleasantly surprised by Qin Yu’s words, but Ronnie and most of the other core members were stunned.","Had Lordess Qin Yu really uttered those words? Those words did not match their impression of Qin Yu. The only explanation was that Qin Yu felt that the evolution of her bloodline would be affected if the star pirates really invaded the Elisa clan.","Just as Helena was about to sit down, Qin Yu said gently, “You’ve been the captain of a patrol team for twenty years and are considered experienced. After Fan Qia finishes his seclusion, I’ll instruct him to arrange a few more patrol teams for you to supervise! If the rest of you have nothing else to report to me, the meeting is adjourned!”","While walking out of the conference hall, Helena said to Ronnie excitedly, “Teacher Ronnie, the chances of finding the members of the Elise clan are much higher now that Lordess Qin Yu is willing to conduct a large-scale search! Even if they’re seriously injured, they still have a chance of being healed in time.”","Ronnie could not understand why Qin Yu had acted so out of character. Helena was really lucky! If Qin Yu had been angered, Helena would probably have ended up in an extremely miserable state.","“Helena, if something like this happens again, you have to think for your own sake. Don’t put yourself in danger because of others!”","Ronnie knew that Helena was not concerned about the lives of the other members of the Elise clan at all. Helena was only concerned about Black Elise.","Now that the Elisa clan had a Bloodian Queen, their status in the Scarlet Territory would definitely increase greatly! The Elisa clan finally qualified to mine in the Scarlet Sacred Abyss!","Lin Yuan was currently conversing with Yi Xue and Shi Mei. Shi Mei knew that Lin Yuan would either leave the Scarlet Territory or return to the Andra clan. She would soon be separated from Lin Yuan. Shi Mei took this opportunity to invite Lin Yuan again.","“Your Excellency, I hope that the Allen clan will have the chance to establish a friendly relationship with the Elise clan. We would like to form an alliance with the Elise clan just like the Andra clan has done! I am being sincere. I hope you will consider this seriously!”","Although subduing Qin Yu was equivalent to controlling the Elisa clan, Lin Yuan was still willing to maintain friendships with other Bloodian clans. This would facilitate his future operations in the Scarlet Territory.","“Shi Mei, thank you for your invitation. We are very willing to form a friendship with the Allen clan! However, our main development area is not in the Scarlet Territory. There won’t be many opportunities for our clans to interact in the future. Even if we establish a partnership, it will be more focused on resource exchange. If the Allen clan is willing to trade with us, we are willing to exchange Creator resources for blood-type spiritual ingredients. We have already traded with the Andra clan. You can learn the details of the trade from Yi Xue!”","Shi Mei smiled and extended her hand to Lin Yuan.","“Since that’s the case, our two clans shall be friends from now on!”","As she spoke, Shi Mei discreetly glared at Yi Xue. Yi Xue had been hiding and unwilling to share details of the Elise clan. Yet, he had actually already traded with them!","Given that Lin Yuan was willing to trade Creator resources for blood-type spiritual ingredients, it was no wonder that Yi Xue had been secretly trying to gain Black Elise’s favor.","Clearly, they were afraid that if the Allen clan traded with the Elise clan, the Andra clan’s share of future trades would be reduced!","Shi Mei was extremely upset with Yi Xue, but she could understand Yi Xue’s actions. If the Allen clan had obtained this opportunity first, they would have tried their best to hide it as well.","At this moment, Feng Qing was still in the Andra clan. Recently, he had been having thoughts of leaving the Andra clan and returning to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ territory.","However, because of Feng Xuan’s connection with the Elise clan and the commotion caused by Feng Xuan’s attack on Fan Lou, Feng Qing had been forced to stay in the Andra clan until the Elise clan returned.","This feeling of having his movements restricted was not pleasant for Feng Qing at all.","Feng Qing was also unhappy because of the way Feng Xuan had been acting. While riding on the support of the Elise clan, Feng Xuan had completely stopped showing respect to Feng Qing.","Feng Xuan had been trying to use his relationship with the Elise clan to force Feng Qing to hand Fan Lou over.","Feng Qing was much more satisfied with Fan Lou than Feng Xuan. Feng Qing would prefer to keep Fan Lou by his side from now on.","Even without Fan Lou in the picture, Feng Qing would not let Feng Xuan stay by his side and cause trouble for him.","Feng Qing had not given Feng Xuan what he wanted.","Feng Qing had never come into contact with any members of the Elise clan, so he did not know how important Feng Xuan was to Black Elise.","If Feng Qing confirmed that Feng Xuan was important to the Elise clan and could obtain benefits for the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, he might eventually acquiesce and hand Fan Lou over.","Presently, Fan Lou could tolerate Feng Xuan, while Feng Xuan could not tolerate Fan Lou.","Feng Qing was afraid that Feng Xuan would be important to Black Elise and that Feng Xuan’s status in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf clan would rise in the future. If that happened, he would be controlled by Feng Xuan!","This prevented Feng Qing from using the species’ resources to heal Fan Lou.","Feng Qing felt a little guilty towards Fan Lou. Feng Qing resolved the guilt he felt by staying away from Fan Lou and keeping Fan Lou in a room used by the Forbidden Wolf Team.","According to the report from the Forbidden Wolf Team, Fan Lou’s injuries had already begun to fester because he had not been treated in time.","The chaotic wind within the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ bloodline was a contaminant. Without using specific spiritual ingredients to expel the contaminated wound would be impossible to heal!","Fan Lou lay on the bed all day staring at the wall, his back facing the members of the Forbidden Wolf Team. It was obvious that he had been dealt a blow, and both his mind and spirit were suffering.","Feng Qing sighed to himself. Fan Lou was pitiful!","Feng Qing valued Fan Lou more for the luck he brought rather than his ability.","The reason for Fan Lou facing the wall was completely different from what Feng Qing thought. At this moment, not only was Fan Lou not depressed, but he was abnormally excited.","When Fan Lou received Lin Yuan’s message, he knew that Lin Yuan’s plan was going smoothly.","Not only was his status and strength about to increase, but he also had the possibility of transforming into a Bloodian!","The Bloodians’ bloodline was of a much higher level than that of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Even at their peak, the Moon Worship Wolves could only barely compare to the Bloodians’ bloodline level."]},{"number":2911,"title":"Chapter 2911 The Dying Fan Lou!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2911 The Dying Fan Lou!","There were billions of species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, and many species had the same bloodline. This was because the same species presented differently in each of the four universes.","However, there was an obvious criterion when measuring bloodline level, which was the difficulty of increasing the bloodline’s strength and the upper limit of the bloodline’s strength.","On these two points, the Bloodians were much stronger than the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves!","Before meeting Lin Yuan, the Bloodians were a species that Fan Lou could never hope to cross paths with. Now, he finally had a chance to join their ranks! Fan Lou was looking forward to his future development.","With his bright future waiting for him, the grievances he suffered at the hands of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were nothing!","Before Fan Lou joined Kong Huan, he had not been a Boundary Patrol Envoy but an ordinary member of the Boundary Patrol Team.","Back then, the Boundary Patrol Envoy Fan Lou reported to had a habit of taking on private jobs. They treated the members of the Boundary Patrol Team as mercenaries.","Fan Lou was often injured during missions. The injuries he suffered were not as serious as the ones he had now, but the pain was almost the same.","Fan Lou was more afraid of mediocrity than a challenging life.","Moreover, Lin Yuan would make up for all the hardships he had suffered. Fan Lou only hoped that Feng Qing and Feng Xuan would not cause trouble for him before Lin Yuan returned to the Andra clan.","Fan Lou knew very well why Feng Qing had not used the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ resources to heal him.","Ha! There was no way that after what had happened, Feng Qing still thought that Feng Xuan was loyal, right?","Part of the reason why Feng Qing arranged for him to stay in the Forbidden Wolf Team’s residence was because he was afraid that Feng Xuan would harm him.","However, Feng Qing was more concerned about the attitude of the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords towards the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves than for his own safety.","The news of him being severely injured by Feng Xuan would definitely have spread. Once the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords found out, they would definitely exert immense pressure on Feng Qing.","The pressure from the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords would be enough to protect his life before Lin Yuan returned!","Fan Lou could not come up with a precise strategy without knowing what plans Lin Yuan had for him.","Fan Lou placed his hand on his chest. The wounds on his chest and left leg had already been corroded by the chaotic wind. If the corrosion spread, his heart would eventually be compromised!","Fan Lou believed that Lin Yuan would be able to save him even if his heart was affected. However, Fan Lou did not want to end up in such a sorry state. If he could not even protect himself, he would appear very incompetent in front of Lin Yuan.","Fan Lou, who had been facing the wall for the past few days, struggled to sit up.","Fan Lou’s actions immediately alarmed the two members of the Forbidden Wolf Team who were at the door. The Forbidden Wolf Team had worked with Fan Lou before. While working together, Fan Lou had brought benefits to the Forbidden Wolf Team. The Forbidden Wolf Team was relatively friendly to Fan Lou.","The Forbidden Wolf Team was Feng Qing’s direct subordinate. The leader of the Forbidden Wolf Team, Feng Nuo, was Feng Qing’s trusted aide.","Feng Nuo had clearly explained Fan Lou’s importance to the members of the Forbidden Wolf Team, who were in charge of watching over him. He told them that Fan Lou was linked to the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords. Without Fan Lou, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf clan would not have been able to become an esteemed guest of the Andra clan!","Feng Xuan was linked to a powerful Bloodian clan, but this powerful Bloodian clan’s attitude towards Feng Xuan was a mystery. It was true that they had cured Feng Xuan’s injured roots, but they had not confirmed Feng Xuan’s importance to them. Everything had been self-claimed by Feng Xuan.","Because of Feng Xuan, the Andra clan already had many issues with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had always relied on the Andra clan. For this reason, the","Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ main members were very upset with Feng Xuan.","Before the two members of the Forbidden Wolf Team could speak, Fan Lou said, “The wound on my chest is so deep that it’s about to damage my organs. I hope you will report this to Lord Feng Qing and ask him to give me some healing items!”","The two members of the Forbidden Wolf Team looked at each other but did not reject Fan Lou’s request.","“Alright, one of us will report to Lord Feng Qing while the other will continue standing guard here. You also have the bloodline of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. You can circulate your bloodline power to resist the corrosion.”","Fan Lou laughed bitterly.","“When Feng Xuan attacked me, he was ruthless and cut off many of my body’s spirit qi channels. I can’t circulate my bloodline at all now! If I could expel the chaotic wind, I wouldn’t have let it corrode my roots! It’s very likely that I’ll die if the chaos wind invades my heart. Please tell this to Lord Feng Qing!”","Fan Lou was not playing the emotional card against Feng Qing, nor was he holding out hope for Feng Qing. It was just that Fan Lou wanted to save himself.","Fan Lou needed something to heal his injuries. When Feng Xuan attacked him, he also took away his spatial equipment.","Once Fan Lou died, the locks on Fan Lou’s spatial equipment would be undone.","Fan Lou’s spatial equipment contained the spirit qi crystals he had received as rewards from Lin Yuan. Otherwise, he would have been able to retrieve healing items from his own spatial equipment.","Fortunately, Fan Lou had brought the Thoughts Letter Paper with him instead of storing it in his spatial equipment.","If Feng Qing was unwilling to give him healing supplies to save his life, Feng Xuan would use the Thoughts Letter Paper to contact the envoys of the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords and tell them to continue pressuring Feng Qing.","Just like how Feng Qing compromised when Feng Xuan pressured him, Feng Qing would also choose to compromise when he was pressured by the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords’ envoys!","If he ended up with no other choice, Fan Lou could still ask Lin Yuan for help.","Fan Lou stroked his wound and sighed to himself. He was still too weak! If he was stronger than Feng Xuan, Feng Xuan would not have been able to injure him!","Soon, the Forbidden Wolf Team member who had sent the news to Feng Qing returned.","This member of the Forbidden Wolf Team had bumped into Feng Xuan when he went to see Feng Qing.","After explaining Fan Lou’s situation, Feng Xuan disagreed with healing Fan Lou. He mentioned the Elise clan multiple times, giving Feng Qing a headache.","Feng Xuan did not stop emphasizing his relationship with the Elise clan.","Since Feng Qing was willing to trust Feng Xuan’s relationship with the Elise clan, it would not be good to make Feng Xuan unhappy because of Fan Lou.","Not only was Feng Xuan less respectful to Feng Qing than before, but he was even edging on arrogance. He constantly used the Elise clan to shoot down Feng Qing. As a result, Feng Qing wanted nothing more than to kill Feng Xuan!","If he had gotten rid of Feng Xuan after Andre brought Feng Xuan back and expressed his dissatisfaction, he would not only have appeased the anger of the Andra clan, but there would not be so many things happening now.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had already formed a good relationship with the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords, including the Dark Pufferfish.","Cooperating with species of similar strength and supporting each other could allow the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves to gain the dignity they deserved. Feng Qing preferred to form such relationships!","If Feng Xuan had really become close to the Elise clan, the Elise clan would only hold the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves in even more contempt than the Andra clan had!","Feng Qing sought out Feng Nuo, the leader of the Forbidden Wolf Squad, after Feng Xuan left.","He handed the medicine to Feng Nuo and told Feng Nuo to bring it to Fan Lou personally as a form of comfort to Fan Lou.","Fan Lou was unaware of Feng Qing’s plan. After Fan Lou found out about Feng Qing’s decision, he silently lay back on the bed with his back facing the Forbidden Wolf Team members.","The Forbidden Wolf Team, who had come to relay the news, sighed when he saw Fan Lou’s appearance.","Fan Lou had indeed been an outsider at the beginning. He had obtained the bloodline of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves because he was favored by Feng Qing.","At that time, Fan Lou could be said to have been hated by all the members of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves,","However, Fan Lou had indeed brought a lot of benefits to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves since then.","The deal with the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords could be said to have benefited every Chaos Wind Demon Wolf.","In particular, the Forbidden Wolf Team and Fan Lou had gone to the Lonely River together. As the leader of this mission, Fan Lou had taken full responsibility instead of shoving all the responsibility to the Forbidden Wolf Team.","The Forbidden Wolf Team had also collaborated with Feng Xuan before. When they did well, all credit went to Feng Xuan. When they did not do well, the Forbidden Wolf Team always took the blame!","Compared to Feng Xuan, Fan Lou was a diligent worker. It was a pity that Lord Feng Qing abandoned Fan Lou just like that!","The Dark Pufferfish had sent envoys to the Scarlet Territory to repay Fan Lou’s kindness. The members of the Forbidden Wolf Team were very worried that Fan Lou would affect the trade between the Dark Pufferfish and the Andra clan.","The two members of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf Forbidden Wolf Team sighed and returned to the door to continue guarding. Fan Lou’s roots had been injured so he was probably not long for this world.","Fan Lou had already used the Thoughts Letter Paper to contact the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords’ envoys. After explaining the situation, Fan Lou stored away the Thoughts Letter Paper that was stained with his blood and waited for Feng Qing to send someone over with the medicine.","The Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River would pressure Feng Qing first. If Feng Qing could withstand the pressure, the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River would go on to pressure the Andra clan.","No matter what, he would be able to protect his life.","The Andra clan and the Dark Pufferfish’s trade was involved with the Bloodian’s next major plan. It was not something that Feng Xuan could control!","Knowing this, Fan Lou was not worried at all!","Feng Qing forcefully suppressed his rage and said to Feng Xuan, “Feng Xuan, I understand your hatred for Fan Lou. You’ve always felt that Fan Lou had stolen for you and that he’s the reason for your current state! But don’t forget that Fan Lou is linked to the partnership between the Andra clan and the Lonely River’s four major species. As a Chaos Wind Demon Wolf, you should think about the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves whenever you encounter issues!”","Feng Xuan’s mind was filled with hatred for Fan Lou.","Fan Lou had almost gained control of his life. This feeling constantly disturbed Feng Xuan, making him exceptionally angry!","Rather than saying that Feng Xuan was envious of Fan Lou, it would be more accurate to say that he was envious of Feng Qing’s favoritism towards Fan Lou.","Feng Qing suppressed his deadly anger towards Feng Xuan, and the latter also suppressed his dissatisfaction with Feng Qing.","This dissatisfaction had already caused Feng Xuan to lose his respectful tone towards Feng Qing!","“I grew up under you. You taught me to prioritize the interests of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. I’ve always worked myself to the bone for this. But I’ve always had a question. I hope you can give me an explanation for this.","“I want to know why you started valuing Fan Lou so heavily from the moment he appeared. Could it be that I fell short of Fan Lou and disappointed you? If I really did something wrong, I hope you’ll tell me what it was.”","When Feng Qing heard Feng Xuan’s words, the anger that he had forcefully suppressed surged again.","He had the freedom to decide who he favored. Feng Xuan’s words sounded like he was questioning his choice. Feng Xuan had no say in who he valued.","If he had not given Feng Xuan a chance, how could Feng Xuan have achieved such a high status among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves? Could Feng Xuan actually think that he had been born with that status?","Feng Qing did not respond to Feng Xuan. Instead, he said in a casual tone, “Feng Xuan, you have to understand one thing. I have chosen you over Fan Lou and am going with your wish of not healing Fan Lou’s injured roots. If Fan Lou’s death affects the partnership between the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords, you will have to take responsibility!”","Feng Qing’s words made Feng Xuan’s heart skip a beat. Feng Xuan was a bystander who had been observing the attitude of the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords towards Fan Lou. It was precisely because of this that Feng Xuan felt so anxious now.","Even if the other three species did not react to Fan Lou’s death, the Dark Pufferfish would definitely pursue the matter!","While Feng Xuan was hesitating on whether he should give Fan Lou the medicine to heal his injuries, Feng Qing continued speaking, “Feng Xuan, there’s one more thing. You are the most aware of how you became acquainted with the Elise clan and the value you hold to them. Even if you’re indignant and want to prove yourself, you shouldn’t harm your species!","“This is my advice to you. If you harm the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, your branch of the species will be removed. You won’t be alone. Your entire branch will be considered sinners in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ history!”","Feng Qing’s words shocked Feng Xuan so much that he broke out in a cold sweat. But he soon calmed down.","He had indeed embellished his relationship with the Elise clan. There were many things that the Elise clan had not told him.","However, he would not have been able to achieve his goal if he had not said that. After all, it was a fact that Lord Black Elise had healed his injured roots and accepted his kowtow. He might not truly be considered part of Lord Black Elise’s camp, but he was still worthy of speaking in his presence."]},{"number":2912,"title":"Chapter 2912 - As long as Fan Lou was alive, Feng Qing would never stop comparing him to Fan Lou. Once Fan Lou died, Feng Qing would lose that option, and he would be the only one left!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2912 Pressure From the Lonely River!","As long as Fan Lou was alive, Feng Qing would never stop comparing him to Fan Lou. Once Fan Lou died, Feng Qing would lose that option, and he would be the only one left!","Even if Fan Lou’s death affected the cooperation between the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords, Fan Lou had to go!","Feng Xuan reaffirmed his decision.","“Lord Feng Qing, do you think I’m exaggerating my relationship with the Elise clan? You know how serious my injuries were. Isn’t it enough that Lord Black Elise was willing to spend resources to treat my injured roots? Although the Elise clan is not in the Scarlet Territory, they and the Andra clan are working together.","“If Lord Elise Black is really willing to take in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, the Andra clan would never compromise their cooperation with the Elise clan for the sake of our Chaos Wind Demon Wolves!”","Feng Xuan insisted on his relationship with Lin Yuan, for it was his biggest bargaining chip.","Feng Xuan could not care less that his words would mislead Feng Qing. He was already unhappy with Feng Qing, and the feeling had only intensified!","Since Feng Qing was threatening him with the survival of his branch, Feng Xuan could not allow him to make good on his threat. Feng Xuan did not want to become a sinner of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves!","At this moment, Feng Qing felt as if he was being shackled by Feng Xuan. This feeling made Feng Qing feel as though he had lost control of the situation.","The Dark Pufferfish envoy Ink Scar had been trying his best to get closer to Fan Lou. Lin Yuan’s trip to the Scarlet Territory was a secret, and Fan Lou would not tell the Lonely River’s four major species about it. This was despite the fact that doing so would elevate him and cause the Lonely River’s four major species to see him as being valued by Lin Yuan.","Ink Scar was well aware of the Dark Pufferfish’s circumstances. The leader of the Dark Pufferfish, Ink Thorn, had absolute authority, and he had become Lin Yuan’s puppet. Thus, the Dark Pufferfish were now Lin Yuan’s servants.","Lin Yuan could decide whether the Dark Pufferfish lived or died. Thus, it went without saying that he could raise the status of a Dark Pufferfish.","Ink Scar had always been unwilling to accept his position among the Dark Pufferfish, and Fan Lou was someone who could speak to Lin Yuan.","Ink Scar saw Fan Lou as a way for him to rise up the ranks. Furthermore, he had planned to cooperate with Fan Lou in this operation all along. Hence, Ink Scar followed Fan Lou’s instructions.","On this point, Ink Scar had the same sentiments as the envoys of the other three species.","They had been shocked when they found out that Fan Lou was with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. At the same time, they knew that this was an opportunity to show off in front of Fan Lou.","The envoys of the Lonely River’s four major species were all in the Andra clan’s territory. The four of them led their clan members and rushed to the courtyard where Feng Qing lived.","They wanted Feng Qing to provide an explanation pertaining to Fan Lou as well as force him to heal Fan Lou’s injuries.","The Andra clan was understandably alarmed when Ink Scar and the others rushed to Feng Qing’s residence.","Andre’s face turned black when he heard this news.","He really wanted to know what was going through Feng Qing’s head. Didn’t Feng Qing know that the Andra clan was already partners with the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords? Why was he angering the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords over the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ internal issues? The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were really troublemakers. They were unending problems!","The Andra clan was very concerned about their relationship with the Lonely River’s four major species. The Bloodians’ plan to attack the mermaids was already set.","The Andra clan was working with the Dark Pufferfish and would have a chance to obtain a large amount of venom from them in the future.","The Andra clan had obtained the venom from the Dark Pufferfish clan at a price and sold the venom to the other Bloodian clans at another price.","It was true that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ befriending of the Lonely River’s four major species had benefited the Andra clan’s development.","However, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves traded with the Lonely River’s four major species and obtained a large amount of resources from them.","If the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves did not carry out the trade, the Andra clan would be able to obtain the resources instead!","The deal between the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and the Lonely River’s four major species cut into the Andra clan’s benefits.","Due to the fact that the Lonely River’s four major species only recognized Fan Lou and because maintaining their relationship with the Lonely River’s four major species hinged on the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves as well, the Andra clan chose to turn a blind eye.","But now that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had displeased the Lonely River’s four major species, the Andra clan’s interests were severely affected as well.","“Let’s go. Come with me to see for yourself. Also, get someone to investigate how the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had angered the Lonely River’s four major species. Don’t tell me it’s because of that Feng Xuan again!”","The young member of the Andra clan who came to report the situation said, “Elder Andre, we’ve already asked about the situation before we came. The truth is that the Lonely River’s four major species found out that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves have disregarded Fan Lou’s survival. It is because of this that they are causing a stir! If we let them continue like this, it will definitely affect the cooperation between the Andra clan and the Lonely River’s four major species. However, Feng Xuan is linked to Black Elise. We can’t deal with Feng Xuan recklessly before we confirm his significance to Black Elise.”","Andre gritted his teeth when he heard the report. He was right that it was because of Feng Xuan again! This time, he could not let Feng Xuan off no matter what!","The clan leader was bringing the Elise clan’s members to the Elisa clan’s territory. Their relationship would definitely improve greatly along the way!","Andre could not ignore the opinions of the Elise clan.","After thinking for a moment, Andre used his communication item to contact Yi Xue and ask him how this matter should be dealt with.","As a last resort, he could tell Lin Yuan about what Feng Xuan had done. Lin Yuan would definitely understand the Andra clan’s decision!","When Yi Xue received Andre’s call, he thought that something serious had happened in the clan. With Yi Xue’s temper, he could not tolerate his clan members causing trouble!","After hearing Andre’s report, Yi Xue pondered for a moment. He believed that he had developed a good relationship with Lin Yuan and asked, “Your Excellency Black Elise, how are you related to Feng Xuan of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves?","“Feng Xuan is taking advantage of your power to tyrannize the Andra clan, and this has severely affected the relationship between the Andra clan and the Lonely River’s four major species.","“If you see Feng Xuan as your servant, we will leave Feng Xuan alone and hand him over to you when you return to the Andra clan with us. You can decide what to do with him then!”","Yi Xue did not say how he would deal with Feng Xuan if Lin Yuan said that Feng Xuan was inconsequential.","If Feng Xuan was inconsequential to Lin Yuan, the Andra clan would not only deal with Feng Xuan but the rest of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves as well.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ recent actions had violated the Andra clan’s requirements for their dependent species. After eliminating the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, it would not be difficult for the Andra clan to prop up another dependent species.","Lin Yuan knew of Fan Lou’s suffering. As per the plan, he had treated Feng Xuan’s injuries in order to make Feng Xuan take the blame. Feng Xuan had never been important to him.","However, Lin Yuan had not expected Feng Xuan to be so good at taking advantage of the situation and for things to progress to this state!","For Lin Yuan’s sake, Fan Lou had suffered a lot at the hands of Feng Xuan and was on the verge of death.","Lin Yuan could not tell Yi Xue about this as it would cause Yi Xue to think that he was plotting against the Andra clan! However, since Yi Xue was the one who asked him about this, Lin Yuan no longer had such concerns.","“Who is Feng Xuan? I don’t recall such a person.”","Yi Xue immediately knew that Lin Yuan could not care less about Feng Xuan. With Lin Yuan’s status, Feng Xuan was nothing more than a passerby.","Yi Xue was afraid that Lin Yuan would suddenly recall Feng Xuan after returning to the Andra clan. As such, he carefully explained to Lin Yuan,","“Your Excellency Black, Feng Xuan is a member of the dependent species that brought you to the Andra clan. Do you still remember him? Before you left, you treated his damaged roots.”","Lin Yuan plastered an expression of enlightenment on his face.","“If you put it that way, I do have some impression of this person. He’s a member of a dependent species and is very skilled at using unsavory methods to meet his goals.","“I healed his injured roots because he helped me once. Given that he’s a member of the Andra clan, it only makes sense for the Andra clan to get rid of him if he does something that affects their interests.","“Of course, I won’t have any objections. This is an internal matter of the Andra clan. Yi Xue, you really don’t have to ask for my opinion. Why would I interfere in the Andra clan’s internal affairs? An outsider is an outsider, after all.","“Those who aren’t members of my clan aren’t worth my effort. If your Andra clan wants to get rid of your disobedient dependent species, be my guest.”","Yi Xue informed Andre of Lin Yuan’s reply. Andre was very surprised to hear this! Feng Xuan had been relying on his relationship with Lin Yuan to do whatever he wanted. Andre thought that Feng Xuan did this because Lin Yuan had made him some promises. He had never thought that all of Feng Xuan’s talk had been nothing but hot air!","Andre would not be as angry as he was now if Feng Xuan was truly supported by Lin Yuan.","It was understandable for him to do whatever he wanted if he was truly supported by Lin Yuan. After all, the Elise clan was indeed stronger than the Andra clan! Otherwise, the Andra clan would not have asked for Lin Yuan’s opinion when dealing with their dependent species!","Feng Xuan spouted such nonsense despite lacking that support. Andre felt as though the entire Andra clan had been fooled.","Andre was prepared to personally kill Feng Xuan later to quench the hatred in his heart!","Ink Scar and the other members of the Lonely River’s four major species gathered in Feng Qing’s residence. Ink Scar went to Feng Xuan and gave him a tight slap.","Feng Qing frowned. Regardless, Feng Xuan was a core member of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Ink Scar’s slap was equivalent to slapping the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Ink Scar’s actions proved one thing to Feng Qing. To the Lonely River’s four major species, Fan Lou was still more important than the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves!","Even if Fan Lou survived, judging from the situation, the Lonely River’s four major species would most likely break off ties with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Cooperating with the Lonely River’s four major species was the biggest opportunity the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had gained in the past 300 years. This opportunity could even be described as something that could only be chanced upon by luck!","Now, this opportunity was about to be ruined. This was something that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves could not bear!","It could be said that there was no loss for the Lonely River’s four major species to not cooperate with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Most of the Bloodian clans were willing to cooperate with the Lonely River’s four major species.","However, as the leader of the clan, he could not lose his dignity!","Feng Qing forced himself to put on the appropriate airs and said, “The Lonely River’s four major species have already formed a partnership with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Why are you attacking our core members now?”","The Bloodians’ main partner was the Dark Pufferfish, so Ink Scar had always been the representative of the Lonely River’s four major species.","“Ha, so I see the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves are still aware that you’re our partners! We have long expressed that Fan Lou is our benefactor. Our species and the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves only have good relations because of him. Why else would the Dark Pufferfish cooperate with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves?","“We could have cooperated solely with the Andra clan! The Andra clan has promised us more benefits than the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves have! The other three species only collaborated with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves because of the Dark Pufferfish’s reputation.","“Don’t tell me you don’t know this as the leader of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves? Release our benefactor immediately. We will take him away so he doesn’t have to continue to be humiliated by you!”","Feng Qing did not know how Ink Scar knew about Fan Lou’s situation. Logically speaking, only the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ key members knew about Fan Lou’s situation.","There was only one possibility for the news to be leaked, and that was that a member of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had leaked the news.","Feng Qing felt that the only person who could possibly do this was the crazy Feng Xuan!","Speaking of which, Feng Qing had definitely hoped that Fan Lou would lose the support of the Dark Pufferfish. However, doing so would harm the interests of all the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves!","It had yet to be confirmed how important Feng Xuan was to the Elise clan, but this had already caused the Lonely River’s four major species to fall out with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","The Lonely River’s four species and the Andra clan were rather close. Both sides were going to launch a joint operation against the mermaids."]},{"number":2913,"title":"Chapter 2913 How Dare You Hit Me!?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2913 How Dare You Hit Me!?","Under normal circumstances, with the Dark Pufferfish’s strength, they would not have the qualifications to cooperate with the Bloodians due to their strength. However, their poison could create great value for the Bloodians.","With the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River falling out with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, the Andra clan would definitely attack the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves in order to appease the anger of the Four Species Overlords.","At present, Feng Qing no longer dared to put on airs. He turned to look at the newly promoted confidant behind him, “Bring Fan Lou here!”","As Feng Qing spoke, he shot a look at this member of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. However, this confidant, who had just been promoted by Feng Qing, was currently in a flustered state. Feng Qing could clearly feel that his newly promoted confidant had failed to grasp his intentions. If it were Fan Lou, he would definitely understand what his hint meant.","His newly promoted confidant proved ineffective. As the captain of the Forbidden Wolf Team, Feng Nuo should understand the importance of helping Fan Lou recover before bringing him there to ensure that the members of the Four Species Overlords wouldn’t notice anything amiss on the surface. This way, they could also appease the anger of the Dark Pufferfish to a certain extent.","There was no direct connection between the other three species of the Lonely River and Fan Lou. As long as the Dark Pufferfish did not pursue this matter, it would be considered over. That was what Feng Qing thought in his heart. However, looking at the Dark Pufferfish envoy’s behavior, it was obvious that this matter was not as simple as it seemed. Ink Scar’s stance made it clear that he wanted to support Fan Lou.","Feng Qing was furious that the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River had come to him to seek revenge for Fan Lou. After all, Fan Lou was also a member of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. It was only because he had been promoting Fan Lou that Fan Lou had so many opportunities.","Ink Scar’s actions had crossed the line. No matter what, the Dark Pufferfish should not interfere in the internal affairs of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Despite his rage, Feng Qing had to face the members of the Four Species Overlords with a smile.","Before Feng Qing could say anything, Feng Xuan, who had been slapped by Ink Scar, shouted angrily, “How dare you hit me?! Do the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River know whose territory the Scarlet Territory belongs to? I’ve already pledged allegiance to His Excellency Black Elise. Aren’t you afraid of offending His Excellency Black Elise and causing his dissatisfaction, leading to retaliation?! The Elise clan is a Bloodian clan with the bloodline of the queen!”","Since the Andra clan was already dissatisfied with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, Feng Qing could no longer abandon his relationship with the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River.","Before Feng Qing could say anything, Feng Xuan, who had been slapped by Ink Scar, shouted angrily, “How dare you hit me?! Do the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River know whose territory the Scarlet Territory belongs to? I’ve already pledged allegiance to His Excellency Black Elise. Aren’t you afraid of offending His Excellency Black Elise and causing his dissatisfaction, leading to retaliation?! The Elise clan is a Bloodian clan with the bloodline of the queen!”","Having obtained great benefits from Feng Qing under the Elise clan’s name, Feng Xuan had developed the habit of using the Elise clan’s name when he encountered trouble.","Fan Lou had already told him not to care about Feng Xuan’s backing. Even if they really offended the Elise clan, Ink Scar was willing to go to great lengths to support them.","Firstly, the life and death of the Dark Pufferfish was under Lin Yuan’s control and had nothing to do with the Elise clan. Furthermore, if he offended a powerful species for the sake of Lin Yuan’s plan, it would be equivalent to him having successfully helped Lin Yuan. The stronger the faction he offended, the more Lin Yuan would owe him a favor!","Ink Scar said with a sinister smile, “Our Dark Pufferfish has never had any contact with the so-called Elise clan. So what if the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River offended one of the Bloodians? It was the Bloodians who begged us to trade with us. You’re not a member of the Bloodians, yet you keep mentioning the Elise clan. Are you abandoning your identity as a Chaos Wind Demon Wolf?!”","Ink Scar looked down on Feng Xuan. It wasn’t a bad thing for Feng Xuan to find someone to rely on and climb up the ranks. However, Feng Xuan should never have, under any circumstances, jeopardized the interests of the clan. Yet, his actions against Fan Lou clearly showed a lack of regard for the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Ink Scar had interacted with Feng Qing more than once, and he could sense that Feng Qing had always wanted to be on good terms with the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords. If it wasn’t for the fact that Ink Scar had come over to coordinate with Fan Lou’s operation, he might really have been moved by Feng Qing’s sincerity.","Ink Scar’s words were targeted not only at Feng Xuan but also at Feng Qing. Feng Xuan’s outburst was one thing, but had Feng Qing been able to control Feng Xuan well, many of the problems wouldn’t have happened.","Feng Qing’s expression was already unpleasant to begin with, but Ink Scar’s words made it even worse.","Feng Xuan was stunned by Ink Scar’s words. This was the first time Feng Xuan had failed to achieve the desired effect using the Elise clan’s name.","Feng Xuan said fiercely, “Is your Dark Pufferfish challenging the authority of the Elise clan by saying this?”","If Feng Xuan wanted to seek protection from the Elise clan, he naturally had to involve the Elise clan in this matter. For the sake of prestige and reputation, the Elise clan would have no choice but to protect him.","Feng Xuan was not aware that Andre had already asked Lin Yuan through Yi Xue, nor was he aware that he had always been Lin Yuan’s pawn. The tiger had already bared its sharp claws at Feng Xuan, so he naturally could no longer seek shelter under its skin.","Upon receiving Lin Yuan’s reply, Andre immediately rushed to Feng Qing’s residence. As soon as Andre entered, he heard that Feng Xuan was using the Elise clan to threaten the Dark Pufferfish, both of whom were important partners of the Andra clan.","The energy in Andre’s body surged, and scarlet ripples surged from his body. All the blood in Feng Xuan’s body turned into a sharp sword, flowing backward into Feng Xuan’s heart and piercing it like a sieve.","With just one strike, Andre had ended Feng Xuan’s life. He did not want to give Feng Xuan a chance to quibble. Lin Yuan had no reason to lie. Hence, Feng Xuan must be lying.","Feng Xuan was originally questioning Ink Scar, putting on an extremely high stance. His sudden death shocked Feng Qing, Ink Scar, and the other members present.","Feng Qing had already sensed Andre’s presence when he came in. When Andre suddenly acted against Feng Xuan, he immediately grasped the situation. It meant that Feng Xuan did not have much of a relationship with the Elise clan. Otherwise, even if it was for the glory of the Elise clan, Andre would not have done anything to Feng Xuan.","Feng Qing had long noticed that the Andra clan’s relationship with the Elise clan was one-sidedly ambiguous. If the Andra clan did not care about the Elise clan, they wouldn’t have directed their anger towards the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves due to Feng Xuan’s attempts to gain favor with Lin Yuan.","This situation was the most disadvantageous for Feng Qing and the entire Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Feng Qing had been deceived by Feng Xuan, which meant that he had made all the wrong judgments. Just over an hour ago, Feng Qing had just offended the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River because of Feng Xuan’s deception.","Andre ignored Feng Xuan and addressed Ink Scar and the other members of the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River, “I wasn’t aware of the situation with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves previously. Now that I know, I’ll ensure that they give you an explanation! Why don’t you follow me to the meeting hall? I’ll personally bring Fan Lou to the meeting hall to meet you later! Even if it consumes the Andra clan’s resources, we will help Fan Lou recover from his injuries.”","Andre had witnessed with his own eyes how Feng Xuan attacked Fan Lou, giving him a basic understanding of Fan Lou’s injuries. Even if Feng Qing’s side was heartless and didn’t provide any medical supplies to Fan Lou, the Andra clan’s resources would still be sufficient to save him.","It turned out that Feng Qing had treated the benefactor of the Dark Pufferfish in such a manner. No wonder the Dark Pufferfish were so angry. If the Andra clan wanted to continue cooperating with the Dark Pufferfish, the best way was to appease them.","Although they were the benefactor of the Dark Pufferfish, the other three species of the Lonely River had also come to offer help. This was enough to prove that the rumors of discord among the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River were false, as they were clearly very united. It seemed like the Bloodians knew too little about the Lonely River.","Initially, Andre did not think much of Fan Lou and did not think that Fan Lou was of any value. However, Andre had changed his mind now. Fan Lou was a key figure that the Andra clan and the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River had befriended.","Ink Scar was still a little worried when he heard this and insisted, “In that case, bring me along to investigate the situation. This matter was done by the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. As an elder of the Andra clan, you personally killed the fellow who threatened the safety of our Dark Pufferfish’s benefactor. We are willing to owe the Andra clan a favor and won’t blame you for this!”","Upon hearing Ink Scar’s words, Andre no longer persisted. He knew that Fan Lou’s situation must be dire at this moment, as could be seen from Feng Qing’s actions. As long as Ink Scar didn’t blame it on the Andra clan, everything would be fine.","In any case, they were already prepared to abandon the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Even if the Andra clan didn’t use the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves to appease the Dark Pufferfish, the Andra clan would deal with them sooner or later.","Andre looked at Feng Qing with a sharp gaze, “Feng Qing, I think there are some things that I don’t need to say. You lead the way!”","Feng Qing wanted to stall for time, but he did not dare to disobey Andre’s orders. Andre, an elder of the Andra clan, was a Holy Spirit expert and was stronger than him. Given the Bloodians’ attitude towards their dependent species, if Andre dared to attack Feng Xuan, he would also dare to attack him.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were currently in an absolutely disadvantageous state. It was impossible for the Andra clan to offer support to them.","While the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River were now filled with hostility towards the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, their final stance would ultimately depend on Fan Lou’s attitude towards them.","As long as Fan Lou remained loyal to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, the relationship between them and the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords would be bound to improve.","Feng Qing knew that he had let Fan Lou down, but he did not have much of a choice back then. Feng Xuan had been using the Elise clan to suppress him, and he couldn’t afford to offend the entire Elise clan for Fan Lou’s sake.","Fan Lou would definitely choose to forgive him after knowing the whole story. Fan Lou had been extremely soft-hearted by his side before, always considering his interests and obeying his orders without question. This time, he would certainly prioritize the benefits of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves as well.","Fan Lou kept thinking about the rewards that Lin Yuan would give him after completing this mission. His longing for the future made him suppress the pain in his body.","Fan Lou had always been looked down upon because of his bloodline. It was not because Fan Lou’s bloodline was weak but because he was extremely ambitious and kept climbing up.","At the level that Fan Lou was in, his bloodline could barely scrape the threshold, and only with the support of others could he enter more deeply. Thus, Fan Lou wished for the enhancement of his bloodline. Obtaining the bloodline of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves could only increase Fan Lou’s bloodline, but it could not allow Fan Lou’s bloodline to undergo a transformation and reach his upper limit.","The Bloodian bloodline had an extremely strong infectious ability. It had the potential to transform Fan Lou’s life rank. It was not merely Fan Lou’s wishful thinking, as Lin Yuan had already made a promise to him.","Just as Fan Lou was thinking about the future, his door was opened from the outside. Feng Nuo walked in quickly. Upon smelling the rancid smell in the room, Feng Nuo frowned and said to Fan Lou in a friendly tone, “Brother Fan Lou, I have some spiritual ingredients here that can help you recover from your injuries. You can simply clean your wounds, and change your clothes. Lord Feng Qing has something to see you about.”","Feng Nuo indeed understood Feng Qing’s intentions. As the leader of the Forbidden Wolf Team, he had abundant resources at his disposal. Among them were these spiritual ingredients used for healing.","The precious spiritual ingredients in Feng Nuo’s hands could heal Fan Lou’s damaged roots. However, after considering it for a moment, Feng Nuo decided against giving the precious resources to Fan Lou to use.","Feng Nuo did not know what exactly had happened. The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ members who came to report did not explain the situation so clearly. Given the choice between Feng Xuan and Fan Lou, Feng Nuo was more optimistic about Feng Xuan. Feng Nuo’s bloodline and Feng Xuan’s bloodline often had marriage alliances. Feng Nuo could be considered half a cousin of Feng Xuan.","Judging from Feng Qing’s attitude towards Fan Lou, Feng Nuo assumed that Feng Qing was preparing to submit to the Elise clan and give up on Fan Lou. With Feng Xuan’s personality, he would definitely continue to ostracize Fan Lou, making it impossible for Fan Lou to have a place to stay.","Feng Nuo’s thoughts had always been very traditional. Although Fan Lou had the bloodline of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, he had always been an outsider in Feng Nuo’s heart. Feng Nuo acknowledged Fan Lou’s value to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, but he did not truly acknowledge Fan Lou’s identity from the bottom of his heart. Therefore, he felt that Fan Lou was not worthy of such good resources.","Fan Lou struggled to sit up from the bed and didn’t say anything to Feng Nuo. He took the spiritual ingredients from Feng Nuo’s hand and pointed at his tattered clothes. Fan Lou’s spatial equipment had been taken away by Feng Xuan, and he didn’t have any clothes to change into at all.","Feng Nuo felt that Fan Lou was acting strangely. Previously, Fan Lou had always been very amiable to him. However, his attitude towards him now could only be described as cold. Fan Lou’s coldness towards him made Feng Nuo very unhappy. It was one thing for Fan Lou to treat him like this when he was still favored by Feng Qing. What right did Fan Lou have to treat him like this now?!","Feng Nuo did not argue with Fan Lou. He took out a set of clothes and threw them in front of him before leaving the room where Fan Lou was imprisoned."]},{"number":2914,"title":"Chapter 2914 Don’t Even Think About Stalling for Time!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2914 Don’t Even Think About Stalling for Time!","The rotten smell in the room was really nauseating. It was not until Feng Nuo walked out of the room that his brows relaxed again. When Fan Lou used the medicine and changed into the clothes he had prepared for him, it wouldn’t be too impolite for him to present himself before Lord Feng Qing.","Initially, Feng Nuo looked down on Fan Lou. It was true that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves would bestow their blood essence to other wolves. However, Fan Lou could be said to be receiving the lowest bloodline among all those bestowed by the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Feng Nuo’s friendship with Fan Lou started when Fan Lou established connections with the Dark Pufferfish. His attitude towards Feng Nuo eased their relationship smoothly. However, Feng Nuo no longer thought highly of Fan Lou as before. He couldn’t help but feel that Fan Lou was about to be doomed. Due to the change in Feng Nuo’s opinion of Fan Lou, he was exceptionally dissatisfied with Fan Lou’s attitude.","If Fan Lou had no connection with Lin Yuan and merely allied with the Dark Pufferfish, he would be the benefactor of the Dark Pufferfish and would have their backing, just as Ink Scar had said.","Even if Fan Lou risked letting the chaotic wind energy enter his heart, he would not heal himself. The more miserable he was, the greater the reaction of the Dark Pufferfish would be. However, Lin Yuan had already decided on his reward. The envoys of the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords were under Fan Lou’s control. At a time like this, Fan Lou had to prioritize his health. The spiritual ingredients that Feng Nuo had given him were not sufficient to heal his injured roots, but they could mitigate the deterioration of his injuries, which was enough for Fan Lou.","As for the outfit that Feng Nuo had given him, Fan Lou had no intention of changing into it. Firstly, Ink Scar and the others were on their way here. There was no way he would be able to make it in time in his current state. Furthermore, Fan Lou felt that he had to let Ink Scar and the others see his miserable side. His misery would reach Lin Yuan’s ears through the words of Ink Scar and the others. Lin Yuan would know how much he had sacrificed, and at the same time, it would also agitate the Andra elders.","The Andra clan’s elder who had been communicating with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves was Andre. Andre was already very dissatisfied with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves because of Feng Xuan. Fan Lou played a pivotal role in the cooperation between the Bloodians and the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlord. When Andre saw him in such a state, he would definitely punish the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Fan Lou couldn’t be bothered to stage another act for Feng Nuo, and the same applied to Feng Qing as he no longer had any value for Fan Lou. It was also a good opportunity for him to change his attitude towards Feng Qing without alerting the Andra clan.","As a spy, Fan Lou knew very well not to attract the attention of others. If his unusual behavior attracted attention, it would be very easy for others to catch onto his vulnerabilities.","Feng Nuo, who was standing at the door, frowned. In Feng Nuo’s opinion, Fan Lou’s actions seemed rather slow, considering that Lord Feng Qing was waiting for him.","Just as Feng Nuo was about to rush Fan Lou, he saw a group of people rushing towards him. Not only was there Lord Feng Qing but there were also envoys from the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River and even an elder of the Andra clan. It was the most luxurious lineup that Feng Nuo could imagine.","It was impossible for these people to be looking for him. He had no connection with the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River, nor had he had any direct contact with the elder of the Andra clan. They could only be here to look for Fan Lou.","The moment Feng Nuo met Feng Qing’s gaze, he knew that he had messed up. What Lord Feng Qing wanted was to heal Fan Lou’s injuries. He did not want the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River and the Andra clan’s elder to be dissatisfied with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves because of Fan Lou’s injuries and let it affect their cooperation. Feng Nuo really did not expect Fan Lou to be of so much importance to the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River.","Feng Xuan was not among the group of people, which surprised Feng Nuo. Little did Feng Nuo know that Feng Xuan had just been killed by Andre, the elder of the Andra clan, with his own hands. In Feng Nuo’s heart, establishing a relationship with Feng Xuan was far more beneficial to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves than with Fan Lou.","Feng Qing lifted Feng Nuo up with one hand. The moment he saw the expression on Feng Nuo’s face, his heart sank to the bottom. Feng Qing glared fiercely at Feng Nuo. If the messenger didn’t understand what he meant, Feng Nuo should understand! Feng Nuo had done this because he looked down on Fan Lou. His arrogance had really brought great trouble to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Feng Qing looked at Feng Nuo, who was in front of him, and said, “Feng Nuo, these are the envoys of the Four Species Overlords from the Lonely River. You’ve met them before. This is Elder Andre. You probably didn’t have the chance to meet him before, right?”","Upon realizing his failure to handle the situation adequately, Feng Nuo immediately started to remedy the situation. He gestured for the other two members of the Forbidden Wolf Team guarding the door to enter the room.","Feng Qing noticed this and planned to stall for time. With every minute of delay, Fan Lou would be in a much better state. By the time Ink Scar saw Fan Lou, it would be much easier for him to calm down.","Andre could not be bothered to feign civility with Feng Qing here. However, after pondering for a moment, he did not stop Feng Qing from delaying. Instead, he chose to cooperate with him.","The life and death of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves was completely in the hands of the Andra clan. Andre did not have the slightest intention of showing consideration for the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Yet, he didn’t want the Dark Pufferfish to vent their anger on the Andra clan because of Fan Lou’s condition.","It was true that the Andra clan had first thought that the Dark Pufferfish’s venom was extremely effective against the mermaids, which was why they had decided to contact the mermaids. But now, the Dark Pufferfish had established contact with many Bloodian clans like the Allen clan. If they angered the Dark Pufferfish, the Dark Pufferfish could abandon the Andra clan at any time and collaborate with other Bloodian clans. If that happened, it would not affect the Dark Pufferfish, but it would severely affect the interests of the Andra clan.","After the Dark Pufferfish’s poison was confirmed to be effective against the mermaids, they had become highly sought after among the Bloodians. Many Bloodian factions were eager to establish ties with the Dark Pufferfish. This was the main reason why Andre would take Ink Scar’s attitude into careful consideration when handling this matter.","“It’s true that I’ve never had any contact with him before. Since you’re guarding here, I’d like to ask you how Fan Lou is doing now. Will the injuries he suffers affect his safety?”","Andre’s words made Feng Nuo’s expression freeze. In fact, Feng Nuo didn’t know how to reply to Andre. Ever since Fan Lou was injured by Feng Xuan, he had been lying on the bed without saying a word. His roots had been severely injured from the beginning. It was under the circumstance of saving his own life that he spoke up to ask for resources.","If he refused to hand over the medical resources to Fan Lou, Fan Lou would lose his life in less than half a day. His injuries were beyond serious, but Feng Nuo clearly could not directly reveal Fan Lou’s current situation. However, if he were to lie and say that Fan Lou’s injuries were not serious, it would be equivalent to lying to the Andra clan. As a dependent species, deceiving a high-ranking species was a grave offense punishable by extinction.","Before Feng Nuo could contemplate the matter further, he needed to figure out the best course of action that would most benefit the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Ink Scar, who was standing at the side, snorted unhappily, “Don’t think we can’t tell you’re stalling.”","With that, Ink Scar waved his hand, and the envoys from the other three species of the Lonely River walked past Feng Nuo and opened the door.","The members of the Forbidden Wolf Team were all in front of the house. Upon knowing that the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River were cooperating with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, they did not stop the envoys of the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River without Feng Qing and Feng Nuo’s orders.","The moment the door opened, Andre keenly caught the rotten smell coming from the room. The putrid smell carried the vibrant scent of blood, indicating that the decay wasn’t from dead things but rather from living things. The five senses of the Bloodians were stronger than other species because of their bloodline.","However, the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom envoys led by the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords would certainly also be able to tell whether the rotten smell came from a living thing or a dead thing.","Regardless of the circumstances, Fan Lou had contributed greatly to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Feng Qing was so ruthless to the extent that he didn’t even attend to Fan Lou’s injuries.","As a witness, Andre knew how badly Fan Lou had been injured by Feng Xuan. If he had not been treated, Fan Lou would probably be on the verge of death. If it weren’t for the fact that Feng Qing was still a member of the Honor Absent Parliament, Andre would have beaten him up so badly that he would be as severely injured, so he would also experience the feeling of being denied treatment.","Ink Scar was well aware that Fan Lou was Lin Yuan’s favorite. Although he had expected Fan Lou to be in a bad condition after being attacked by Feng Xuan, he had not expected Fan Lou to be in such a miserable state. Ink Scar and the others harbored no feelings towards Fan Lou. They weren’t angry because of what had happened to Fan Lou. The anger they displayed was purely an act to please Fan Lou.","Real anger involved forbearance and decisiveness, yet the anger they feigned appeared frantic and aggressive.","Ink Scar saw that the Mantis Stone Crabs and the Hidden Fog Turtles had entered the house before him to provide Fan Lou with medical supplies that could heal his damaged roots. He knew that there would not be much of an effect if he went in now.","Fan Lou must be extremely dissatisfied with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves after suffering such a huge grievance. Having understood this point, Ink Scar directly fired at Feng Qing, “Feng Qing, you’ve been emphasizing the sincerity between you and our Dark Pufferfish. Is the way you treat our Dark Pufferfish’s benefactor a sign of your sincerity?”","Ink Scar’s anger could only be described as hysteria. Even Andre, who was beside him, was a little frightened. Even if Fan Lou had saved an important core member of the Dark Pufferfish, did they really owe Fan Lou such a debt of gratitude?","The Andra clan had already thoroughly investigated Fan Lou’s background, and it was rather complicated. First, he followed the Alluring Foxes, and then he was recruited by Feng Qing. However, Fan Lou had never had any prior contact with the factions there before he went to the Lonely River.","Because of the thorough investigation, Andre did not suspect that there was something suspicious between Fan Lou and the Dark Pufferfish. He simply believed that the Dark Pufferfish placed a high value on relationships.","This fact made Andre very happy. It was more beneficial for the Andra clan to establish a connection with a faction that valued relationships than a faction that was hostile to them.","Ink Scar immediately vented all his anger on Feng Qing. He had to somehow find an outlet to vent the anger in his heart, after all. Andre provided Ink Scar with ample opportunity to vent his anger, preventing him from directing his fury toward the Andra clan.","Actually, no matter how much Ink Scar wanted to show off in front of Fan Lou, he would not vent his anger on the Andra clan.","Many of Fan Lou’s plans were intertwined with the Andra clan. It was not suitable for him to jeopardize the relationship between Fan Lou and the Andra clan. If he disrupted Lin Yuan’s plan, not only would he not be able to curry favor with him, but he would also incur punishment from Lin Yuan. That would not be good!","Feng Qing was also taken aback by Ink Scar’s words. He had never expected Ink Scar to choose to confront him directly on the spot. He assumed that even if Ink Scar was dissatisfied with him, he would only hinder the cooperation with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves in the future. It was because it was not a wise choice for an insignificant figure like Fan Lou to offend the entire Andra clan, no matter how one looked at it! The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were not the only ones who benefited from the trade. The Dark Pufferfish also reaped significant benefits.","Feng Qing valued his dignity greatly. At present, he felt embarrassed and humiliated by Ink Scar’s words. However, the current situation did not allow Feng Qing to quibble. The truth was there, and even if Feng Qing were to try to argue, nobody would believe him.","If it weren’t for the fact that the Dark Pufferfish was cooperating with the Andra clan, and given the Andra clan high regard for their cooperation with the Dark Pufferfish, Feng Qing would probably confront Ink Scar’s targeted remarks directly.","Who was Feng Qing, and who was Ink Scar? Feng Qing was the leader of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, but Ink Scar was only an envoy of the Dark Pufferfish.","Even if the overall strength of the Dark Pufferfish were not much different from the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, the Dark Pufferfish were ultimately just a species on the Lonely River’s side.","The leader of the Dark Pufferfish didn’t hold a position in the Honor Absent Parliament like he did. From a multidimensional perspective, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were superior to the Dark Pufferfish. Even the leader of the Dark Pufferfish shouldn’t speak to him in such a manner. Yet, Ink Scar, a mere envoy, actually dared to question him!","Feng Qing forcefully suppressed the anger in his heart and said sincerely, “I really didn’t handle this matter well! I have always valued Fan Lou very much. Fan Lou was not a member of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. It was I who bestowed the blood essence of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves to him, giving him the chance to become one of us.","“I know that you Dark Pufferfish are very grateful for Fan Lou’s help, but if I hadn’t sent Fan Lou to your territory to negotiate with you, I don’t reckon Fan Lou would have the opportunity to save an important figure of the Dark Pufferfish!","“The friendship between the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and the Dark Pufferfish indeed began because of Fan Lou, but we cannot attribute all of it solely to Fan Lou.”"]},{"number":2915,"title":"Chapter 2915 Is Your Heart Really That Ruthless?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2915 Is Your Heart Really That Ruthless?","Feng Qing emphasized his tone, “Our two species will continue to cooperate in the future. I believe that the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River have also obtained sufficient benefits from the trade with our Chaos Wind Demon Wolves!”","Andre knew very well that the Andra clan had already harbored the intention to abandon the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. However, because of Feng Qing’s status as a member of Honor Absent Parliament, the Andra clan needed to make some preparations if they wanted to abandon them. The most basic step was to remove Feng Qing’s identity as an Honor Absent Parliament member before making a move against the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","While the Andra clan was only handling their own internal affairs, they were cautious not to let Honor Absent Palace misunderstand. If any faction were to take advantage of the situation, it could spell trouble for the Andra clan.","In the East Universe, any species that disrespected the Honor Absent Palace would be punished without exception, even if it was a powerful species on the Species Ranking. While it wouldn’t cause serious physical harm, it would lead to a long period of dejection. The species on the Species Ranking that provoked the Honor Absent Palace were living examples.","If not for the fact that he was worried about the Honor Absent Palace, Andre really wanted to teach Feng Qing a lesson and let him know that regardless of how he perceived himself, he was merely a servant of the Andra clan. To put on airs in the Andra clan’s territory was equivalent to disregarding the Andra clan. Moreover, the four species of the Lonely River were targets that the Andra clan wanted to befriend. Furthermore, Feng Qing’s words were too shameless.","Fan Lou was not the only one sent to the Lonely River by the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. The Forbidden Wolf Team was also sent to the Lonely River by Feng Qing. Why wasn’t there anyone in the Forbidden Wolf Team who possessed the ability to save an important member of the Dark Pufferfish?!","Feng Qing insisted on attributing the credit of Fan Lou’s contribution to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, which not only belittled Fan Lou’s contribution to them but it also came across as arrogant. Andre could not bear to listen to these words. Ink Scar was so angry that he laughed at Feng Qing’s words, “Cooperation? What cooperation? Don’t tell me your Chaos Wind Demon Wolves really think that you’re in such high demand that the Dark Pufferfish insist on associating with you?!","“The transaction with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves was sought after by Fan Lou. Otherwise, wouldn’t it be better for us to use these resources to trade with other Bloodian clans? Why do I have to trade with your Chaos Wind Demon Wolves!?","“I will inform the leader about what happened to Fan Lou. From now on, our Dark Pufferfish and your Chaos Wind Demon Wolves will either have no dealings or become enemies. There will be no third option.","Ink Scar’s words left no room for negotiation. Before coming, Ink Scar had repeatedly confirmed with Fan Lou through the Thoughts Letter Paper twice, wanting to determine how he was going to deal with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Ink Scar didn’t want to misinterpret Fan Lou’s intentions and end up flattering too much. It was a small matter to make Fan Lou unhappy, but if it jeopardized Lin Yuan’s plan, he would unquestionably meet his demise.","In Feng Qing’s opinion, he had already made a huge concession to ease the situation. However, it seemed as though Ink Scar did not understand his words at all. He actually directly broke off relations with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, which made Feng Qing somewhat lose his judgment. The Dark Pufferfish’s actions were against their own interests. How could Fan Lou possibly bring such a significant value to the Dark Pufferfish that they actually severed ties with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves just because of Fan Lou?","Feng Qing subconsciously looked at Andre. Ink Scar had the same reaction.","Ink Scar said to Andre in an unusually serious tone, “Elder Andre, our Dark Pufferfish are now in a cooperative relationship with the Andra clan. In terms of cooperation, we have always been generous. When the Bloodians first established contact with the Dark Pufferfish, we were indeed unwilling to trade resources with you. But after working with the Andra clan, apart from the poison secreted by my clan, we have also shared resources from the Lonely River with you.","“The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves are the dependent species of the Andra clan. I hope that the Andra clan can give the Dark Pufferfish an explanation on this matter! I believe that the request I am making is not something that your Andra clan cannot fulfill! The Dark Pufferfish aren’t being unreasonable. You’ve already seen how the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves treat our benefactor.","“We can’t tolerate the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves no matter what. If Elder Andre isn’t willing to provide us with an explanation, I believe there is no reason for the Dark Pufferfish and the Andra clan to continue cooperating. Although the Dark Pufferfish come from a remote area like the Lonely River, we still uphold our dignity!”","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, each species had significant differences in personality and the way they handled things because of the difference in bloodline. Andre could understand why the Dark Pufferfish were so unyielding.","However, even though Andre had already placed Fan Lou in an extremely important position, he had still underestimated Fan Lou’s status in the hearts of the Dark Pufferfish. The Dark Pufferfish had actually become Fan Lou’s backing in this matter, showing such strong protection for him and helping him regain his position. This was not a bad thing in Andre’s heart. If the Andra clan took in Fan Lou in the future, they could use Fan Lou to strengthen their relationship with the Four Species of the Lonely River.","“Feng Qing, bring your Chaos Wind Demon Wolves back to your territory first. You’ve offended our Andra clan’s esteemed guests. It’s really not appropriate for you to stay in the Andra clan’s territory. Afterward, if the Andra clan makes any decisions, you will be summoned. Take this time to reflect deeply and recognize the issues within your Chaos Wind Demon Wolves when you go back. Do you understand what I just said?”","Andre’s serious tone did not give Feng Qing a chance to turn the situation around at all. Feng Qing’s words were stuck in his throat. The Andra clan couldn’t eliminate the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves at the moment, but they had to convey a stance to the Dark Pufferfish. This was the best way to handle the situation. The Andra clan’s actions also did not indicate to Feng Qing that they wanted to abandon the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. They only asked him to bring the people back to reflect.","In order to ease the relationship with the Andra clan, Feng Qing would definitely bring a large amount of resources to apologize to the Andra clan after he returned.","Their leader, Yi Xue, was still in the territory of the Elisa clan. It would take some time for him to return. He should be able to obtain a lot of benefits from the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves before Yi Xue returned. While considering the well-being of the clan, Andre was more inclined to prioritize his own interests. The competition between members of the Bloodian clans was extremely harsh. Andre had fought for his current position and power with his own capability.","Upon seeing that Feng Qing did not want to leave, Andre said coldly, “Feng Qing, are you staying here with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves to continue causing trouble for the envoys of the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River? Let me give you a piece of advice. Don’t deceive yourself and the entire Chaos Wind Demon Wolves!”","Andre’s words were very ingenious, serving both as a deterrent to Feng Qing, and as a way to enlighten Feng Qing, forcing him to leave immediately.","In front of Feng Qing, Andre could not make a promise to Ink Scar to salvage the relationship between the Andra clan and the Dark Pufferfish. After Feng Qing left, Andre would be able to comfort Ink Scar.","Regardless of how low Feng Qing’s EQ was, he knew that Andre was not prepared to let him take Fan Lou away. Feng Qing had already offended the Dark Pufferfish and displeased the Andra clan, so he didn’t make a request to take Fan Lou away.","Feng Qing felt a sense of unease in his heart. Judging from the Andra clan’s attitude towards the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, Feng Qing grasped their current situation. In the eyes of the Andra clan, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were far inferior to the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River.","With the interests of the four species tied together, the other three species of the Lonely River would definitely choose to stand with the Dark Pufferfish. The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves weren’t as useful and valuable as the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River. If the Andra clan had to make a choice, Feng Qing was well aware of whom they would abandon.","Ink Scar, the envoy of the Dark Pufferfish, was targeting him not because there was some irreconcilable conflict between the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and the Dark Pufferfish.","All the key points revolved around Fan Lou. As long as Fan Lou was willing to speak up for the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, the Dark Pufferfish would still be willing to maintain a close relationship with them.","No matter what, the blood of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves flowed in his body. Hence, Fan Lou should take the development of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves into consideration.","When leading the members of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves away later, Feng Qing would personally find Fan Lou and explain to him. Fan Lou was an intelligent person, and there was no need for him to say too much. As long as Fan Lou knew that Feng Xuan was dead, Fan Lou would know that he would still be the most favored person by his side in the future.","However, after this incident, Feng Qing had already started to be wary of Fan Lou. Previously, he had entrusted Fan Lou with an important position because Fan Lou could bring him good luck. However, many events had unfolded within the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves since then. Although Feng Xuan caused these things, Fan Lou was also involved.","Ink Scar was very satisfied with Andre’s attitude. He did not want the Andra clan to do anything to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Everything Ink Scar did was to facilitate Fan Lou’s plan. Some things were better done with restraint than overdoing it. Exercising restraint would significantly increase the margin for error tolerance, allowing for more room for developments to unfold in the situation. Thus, Ink Scar did not stop Feng Qing from meeting Fan Lou.","Upon seeing that Ink Scar no longer insisted on targeting the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves after he let them leave, Andre heaved a sigh of relief. He was afraid that Ink Scar would go all out and insist that the Andra clan provide the Dark Pufferfish with an explanation immediately. This would definitely put the Andra clan in an extremely disadvantageous position.","When Feng Qing left, Andre would take the time to calm Ink Scar and, in passing, inquire about why the Dark Pufferfish were so supportive of Fan Lou.","The moment Feng Qing saw Fan Lou, he finally understood how pathetic he was.","The best spiritual ingredient to expel the invasion of the chaotic wind was called the Wind Expelling Grass.","The Wind Expelling Grass could absorb the energy in the chaotic wind, but it also had a certain disadvantage. Using the Wind Expelling Grass would activate the blood circulation and have the effect of removing the silt and decay from the body.","This caused the fresh blood gushing out of Fan Lou’s wound to mix with rotten flesh and dirty blood, making him look like a decaying, bloody man. Although the Wind Expelling Grass had made Fan Lou look extremely miserable, his injuries should have healed significantly with its help.","Based on Feng Qing’s understanding of Fan Lou, Fan Lou should be struggling to get up and bow to him at this moment. Feng Qing was already prepared to comfort Fan Lou and let him recuperate.","Fan Lou’s current attitude not only displeased Feng Qing but also instilled a sense of unease in Feng Qing’s heart. Based on past behavior, Feng Qing never thought that Fan Lou would be disappointed in him. He had always believed that Fan Lou owed him a debt of gratitude.","If it weren’t for his protection, Fan Lou would have fallen into Kong Huan’s hands long ago. Kong Huan had always treated her subordinates badly. Before this matter, he had treated Fan Lou much better than Kong Huan had treated Fan Lou.","Feng Qing knew very well that he did not have much time to communicate with Fan Lou. “Fan Lou, this problem has made you suffer a lot. It’s not convenient for you to travel a long distance now, so you can stay in the Andra clan’s territory for now. I’ll pick you up later. I already know everything that Feng Xuan did to you. I’ve already gotten rid of Feng Xuan for you. I’ll make it up to you for everything else!","“The Dark Pufferfish have a lot of misunderstandings about our Chaos Wind Demon Wolves because of you. During your time with the Andra clan, you need to reverse the Dark Pufferfish’s opinion of our clan!","“Apart from what I promised you previously, you will be the vice-captain of the Forbidden Wolf Team from now on as long as you do this well. You will be in charge of all the matters of the Forbidden Wolf Team with Feng Nuo!","Feng Qing felt that his current promise to Feng Qing was enough. To put it bluntly, Fan Lou was an outsider who had been bestowed with the blood of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, transforming him from a regular wolf into the esteemed figure he was today. Fan Lou shouldn’t have any complaints, even if he had to sacrifice himself. Moreover, he had already personally coaxed Fan Lou and even rewarded him with such a huge favor.","At this moment, Fan Lou was indeed too lazy to continue acting with Feng Qing.","However, Fan Lou’s words were indeed sincere. Saying these words was equivalent to bidding farewell to his identity as a member of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","“Lord Feng Qing, I’ve always been conscientious in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. I’ve always carried out all your orders like an imperial edict and have never made any mistakes. I’ve always tried my best to do my best. I’ve done my best to share your burdens for those things that others are unwilling to do.","“Even though you could have saved me, you chose to abandon me just because of Feng Xuan’s baseless accusations. Is your heart truly that ruthless?”"]},{"number":2916,"title":"Chapter 2916 Bloodians’ Recruitment!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2916 Bloodians’ Recruitment!","After saying the words, Fan Lou felt exceptionally happy. The Mantis Stone Crab and Hidden Fog Turtle envoys were beside him. Even if Feng Qing was dissatisfied with him, he would not do anything to him. His words were bound to reach Andre’s ears sooner or later.","Fan Lou wanted to officially break off ties with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and regain his freedom. Only then would he have a chance to join the Andra clan and become a true Bloodian. He nearly died because of Feng Qing’s decision.","Feng Qing truly did not value him enough, given that he was still able to utter such words under these circumstances. If Feng Qing cared about his emotions at all, he would not have made such an overboard request.","Fan Lou’s words made Feng Qing’s expression gradually freeze. Feng Qing did not expect Fan Lou to criticize him right away. If Feng Qing was not currently in the Andra clan and the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves couldn’t provoke the Andra clan and incur their dissatisfaction, he would have given Fan Lou a lesson to remind Fan Lou how he rose to power!","Feng Qing, who was on the verge of losing control of his emotions, revealed a strong killing intent. The Mantis Stone Crab and the Hidden Fog Turtle envoys immediately released their auras to confront Feng Qing.","Andre walked in quickly and said coldly, “I told you to leave with your Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Why are you still attacking the benefactor of the Dark Pufferfish here?! Feng Qing, you’ve really become more and more impudent since you became a member of the Honor Absent Parliament. Get lost with your men immediately!","“In the future, Fan Lou will stay in our Andra clan’s territory. I will report this to the leader. If Fan Lou is willing, we can let him become a Bloodian! From now on, Fan Lou will have nothing to do with your Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.”","Andre did not give Feng Qing any face this time because Feng Qing’s actions had completely angered Andre. Feng Qing actually dared to reveal his killing intent toward Fan Lou at this time, which showed that he did not take him and the Andra clan seriously at all!","He had already emphasized to Feng Qing many times the importance of cooperation between the Andra clan and the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River.","Feng Qing was a very intelligent person and would certainly understand the implications of his actions. No matter what the reason was, revealing his killing intent was disrespectful to the Andra clan. It seemed that Feng Qing had really forgotten about his identity as a member of the Honor Absent Parliament.","Compared to Feng Qing’s help and appreciation toward Fan Lou, the Andra clan’s help and appreciation to Feng Qing was much greater. Furthermore, Andre believed that this was a good opportunity to snatch Fan Lou. He had expressed his goodwill to Fan Lou by targeting Feng Qing. As an intelligent person, Fan Lou would surely understand what choice to make.","While he was trying to recruit Fan Lou into the Bloodians, he also had the intention of expressing his goodwill to the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River in order to alleviate their discontent.","Without these incidents, the Andra clan’s suggestion to keep could easily be interpreted as an attempt to poach Fan Lou. It wouldn’t be very dignified for the Andra clan to poach a fellow from a dependent species. Therefore, finding an entry point to do so would eliminate many concerns.","Feng Qing gritted his teeth and looked at Andre.","Andre’s killing intent was even stronger than Feng Qing’s. If he dared to speak up and disobey him, Andre would have no problem injuring Feng Qing. Still, it was inconvenient for him to kill Feng Qing due to his status as a member of Honor Absent Parliament. Disrespect from a dependent species to the ruling species was unacceptable, and Feng Qing’s disrespect would hold no ground wherever he went.","In the end, Feng Qing did not say anything. He just left the Andra clan with the Forbidden Wolf Team.","If Fan Lou was concerned about the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, he would have thought of a way to reject Andre when the latter sought to claim him. However, Fan Lou’s words were filled with displeasure toward the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Fighting with Andre for Fan Lou at this time would only force Andre to attack him. The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had lost the trust of the Andra clan. When Feng Qing returned, he had to think of a way to regain the trust of the Andra clan to secure the opportunity to be placed in an important position by them again. The best way was to prove the value of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Having been in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and a member of Honor Absent Parliament for so long, Feng Qing possessed both resources and connections.","A teleportation passageway that connected to the outer world appeared in the Wolin Mountains. It was connected to the outer world of the Abyssal Beast Kingdom. Launching a surprise attack on the Abyssal Beast Kingdom through this teleportation passageway could yield a significant amount of Abyssal Beast resources.","Every species had a huge demand for high-quality Abyssal Beast resources. Only with Abyssal Beast resources could they explore the outer world. The resources in the outer world might not be more abundant than the resources in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, but the resources produced there were indeed not what the Sky Beyond the Clouds could produce.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had a certain relationship with the Cloud Leopards. If they managed to persuade them to share these resources with the Andra clan, the Andra clan would likely reinstate the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves into a significant position once they got the benefits.","After Feng Qing left with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, Andre was about to comfort Fan Lou and ask him what he was thinking.","However, Ink Scar did not give Andre a chance to communicate with Fan Lou at all. Ink Scar immediately asked about Fan Lou’s well-being and expressed that he wanted to bring Fan Lou to the residence of the Dark Pufferfish in the Andra clan to slowly recuperate.","If Ink Scar’s previous attitude towards Fan Lou had made Andre understand the importance of Fan Lou to the Dark Pufferfish, his actions now made Andre wonder inwardly if the person Fan Lou had saved was related to him. Otherwise, Ink Scar wouldn’t have any reason to display such an attitude towards Fan Lou.","After Fan Lou responded to Ink Scar’s concern, he told Andre very respectfully, “Thank you, Andra clan, for thinking so highly of me! The bloodline of the Bloodians is really desirable. However, I was just abandoned by the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves that I’m loyal to and nearly died. I need time to recuperate. My physique is extremely poor now.","“I believe Your Excellency Andre can sense it. I hope you can give me a chance to recuperate in peace. When I’m done recuperating and my thoughts are no longer entirely consumed by the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, I will provide you with a response. I hope that the Andra clan won’t despise me when the time comes.”","Andre was very satisfied with Fan Lou’s attitude. His words were filled with respect for the Andra clan. As a member of the Andra clan, it was only appropriate that he treated it with such an attitude.","Andre thought for a moment and understood Fan Lou’s current state. The Andra clan had investigated what Fan Lou had done to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Fan Lou had not been a member of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves for long, but he had made a huge contribution to them.","Hence, Fan Lou must be very sad to be treated like this after sacrificing so much for them. If Andre were to encounter such a situation, it would probably be difficult for him to recover from his sad state.","Yi Xue had yet to return, and many matters within the clan still required Yi Xue’s judgment. If Andre took too many initiatives, Yi Xue might feel that he had overstepped his boundaries, and that wouldn’t be good. When Yi Xue returned, it was highly likely that Yi Xue would personally engage with Fan Lou to address the situation.","“Then go to the residence of the Dark Pufferfish and stay with them. I believe they will take care of you.”","After speaking to Fan Lou, Andre turned to Ink Scar. “If you need any resources to heal Fan Lou’s injuries, feel free to request them from the Andra clan. We will provide the best resources to help him recover from his injuries!”","Ink Scar rolled his eyes and said, “Fan Lou is our Dark Pufferfish’s benefactor. We do not lack medicine to heal injuries and recover roots. If your Andra clan really wants to provide help to Fan Lou, perhaps it’s time to consider how to deal with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves in the future. I’ve always heard that the Bloodians have strict management of their dependent species. Now, it appears that your management is only mediocre at best!”","Ink Scar’s words were filled with resentment and mockery, and Andre could hear it.","Previously, due to the presence of Feng Qing and the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, Andre had refrained from responding to Ink Scar regarding their way of handling the situation. Ink Scar had already requested the Andra clan to punish the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves several times.","Now that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had left, Andre said directly, “Our Andra clan will deal with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, but it will take some time. Feng Qing is a member of the Honor Absent Parliament. As long as Feng Qing remains a member, our Andra clan will not be able to do anything to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","“Feng Qing’s parliament status is managed by the Andra clan. If we can make him a member, then we can also make him lose his status. In order to befriend the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River, our Andra clan has shown great sincerity. Rest assured, the outcome of our handling of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves will not disappoint you. Everyone, just wait and see!”","Andre intended to demonstrate goodwill to the Four Species Overlords through their way of handling the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. However, neither Ink Scar nor Fan Lou would fall for Andre’s tricks. All of Ink Scar’s actions were to cooperate with Fan Lou.","Logically speaking, Fan Lou should have agreed to Andre’s invitation when Andre first suggested that he become a member of the Andra clan. Fan Lou had found an excuse to delay this matter because he was not sure about Lin Yuan’s specific arrangements and could not ask him about them. Fan Lou did not want Lin Yuan to misunderstand him. He would make a decision after asking Lin Yuan about his arrangements so that no unexpected occurrences would happen.","If Lin Yuan did not intend to let him stay in the Andra, agreeing to Andre’s invitation to become a member would disrupt Lin Yuan’s future plans. In that case, he would be doomed.","Lin Yuan was meticulously planning his future, and being an ordinary Bloodian might not be his limit. Fan Lou only needed to follow in Lin Yuan’s footsteps and improve step by step.","Fan Lou was brought to the Dark Pufferfish’s territory by Ink Scar. He was looking forward to his future while recovering from his injuries.","The Four Species Overlords were under Lin Yuan’s control and could be considered his subordinates. Fan Lou responded positively to them trying to curry favor with him. In the future, he would have many opportunities to interact with them as a Bloodian. Establishing a good relationship with one another was not only beneficial to the Four Species Overlords, but to Fan Lou as well.","In the future, many of the things that Fan Lou would need to do would undoubtedly require their strong support. Fan Lou was very clear about this.","Many of the things that the Four Species Overlords had done would eventually be credited to Fan Lou in Lin Yuan’s eyes. The Four Species Overlords would be earning merits for him.","When it came to those who could serve his interests, even if Fan Lou’s status evolved to a position far surpassing that of the Four Species Overlords, he would still seek to establish connections with individuals like Ink Scar.","...","Feng Nuo led the Forbidden Wolf Team and followed Feng Qing from the Andra clan’s territory to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ territory. Along the way, Feng Nuo wanted to say something but hesitated.","Feng Nuo had a lot to ask Feng Qing, but it was clear that Feng Qing did not have any intention of responding.","However, as a core member of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, Feng Nuo still had to ask those questions, “Lord Feng Qing, judging from Fan Lou’s current attitude, it’s impossible for him to submit to our Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. This is not a favorable situation for us.","“Being on good terms with the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River can indeed bring great benefits to our species. You’ve already witnessed the Andra clan’s attitude towards them.","“I think we need to humble ourselves and curry favor with the Dark Pufferfish to ease our relationship with the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River. Fan Lou is only the benefactor of the Dark Pufferfish. The other three Lonely River species are just cooperating with the Dark Pufferfish.”","Feng Nuo’s words made sense, but to Feng Qing, it was extremely ear-piercing. He had already yielded to the Dark Pufferfish envoy and said many good words, but Ink Scar did not care about his goodwill or submission at all. Fan Lou even questioned why he was so ruthless.","Fan Lou had already betrayed the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. From the perspective of a traitor like Fan Lou, he definitely would not want to rely on the Dark Pufferfish to reconcile with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves."]},{"number":2917,"title":"Chapter 2917 The Effect of 20,000-Year Blood Wine!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2917 The Effect of 20,000-Year Blood Wine!","Fan Lou would definitely interfere in the mediation between the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and the Dark Pufferfish.","While Fan Lou was obedient when following him, he was also an extremely capable existence. Feng Qing did not care about this previously. It was only when Fan Lou broke off relations with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves because of this matter that Feng Qing began to take this aspect seriously.","Fan Lou’s prowess lay not in his strength but in the fact that he could find the most harmonious way to get along with anyone.","During interactions, Fan Lou had the knack for making others instinctively want to get closer to him and develop a good impression of him. Fan Lou was one of the few people whom Feng Qing couldn’t find fault with after interacting with him.","With this trait of his, Fan Lou could subtly change the thoughts of the Dark Pufferfish members in the process of interacting with them.","If Fan Lou wanted to interfere and affect the reconciliation between the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and the Dark Pufferfish, it would be very easy. Fan Lou was a cautious person. He must have thought it through thoroughly before breaking away from his control and breaking off ties with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","It was because Feng Qing overly trusted Fan Lou that he didn’t spend too much effort on controlling Fan Lou. Otherwise, if he had controlled Fan Lou through the Faith Tree or the divine kingdom, there wouldn’t be so much trouble now.","In a situation where Fan Lou was unable to leave the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, no matter how sad he was, he would have to work for them in order to survive.","Feng Qing was aware he was not a person who lacked vigilance. The reason such a situation happened was that his interaction with Fan Lou had caused him to let down his guard. Of course, this was also because Feng Qing was conceited and thought he could completely control Fan Lou.","All along, Feng Qing had never taken Fan Lou seriously, let alone treated him as a threat to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Feng Qing was filled with remorse. Despite his efforts in nurturing Fan Lou, the latter was actually going against the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves now.","Upon seeing that Feng Qing did not speak, Feng Nuo continued. “Lord Feng Qing’s matter concerns the future of our species. We have to resolve it no matter what. If there’s really no other way, we might as well find a chance to interact with Fan Lou. I believe that our enmity with Fan Lou has not reached that irreconcilable level!”","Feng Qing sighed heavily and said, “Feng Nuo, you haven’t interacted much with Fan Lou, so you don’t know much about him. Fan Lou’s thoughts are meticulous. If not for the fact that he had made thorough preparations in his heart, Fan Lou would not have dared to break off ties with our species.","“We might as well hand over more resources to the Andra clan to appease Fan Lou. It’ll be more convenient to ease the relationship by paying tribute to the Andra clan. The Andra clan’s displeasure with our species mainly arose because of Feng Xuan’s overstepping behavior. It has little to do with us. Feng Xuan is dead now, and half of the Andra clan’s anger has dissipated.","“As long as the benefits promised later can satisfy the Andra clan, they won’t make things too difficult for us after weighing the pros and cons. It’s worth it to bleed this time in exchange for the stable development of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","“As long as my power can be enhanced further, I will find more support for the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves in the Honor Absent Parliament. Even if the Andra clan wants to settle scores with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves in the future, they will have to take a lot into consideration.","“The focus this time is not on Fan Lou nor the Dark Pufferfish. It’s on the Andra clan’s opinion of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Isn’t the Andra clan dissatisfied with us because we have affected the benefits that the clan can obtain? I’ll take care of this myself. You don’t have to worry.","“After you go, you’ll need to attend to many of the clan’s affairs. Apart from providing resources to the Andra clan to appease their anger, the most important thing is to demonstrate our sincerity. Among the direct members of Feng Xuan’s lineage, there isn’t any particularly outstanding individual. Go and get rid of his lineage completely. Send their corpses to the Andra clan personally and ask for their forgiveness.”","Feng Qing had not said anything previously because he was thinking about how to deal with this matter. He had already thought it through. If he wanted to change the current situation of the Andra clan, he had to be ruthless. Of course, making this decision was also directly related to Feng Qing’s anger toward Feng Xuan.","Upon hearing Feng Qing’s arrangement, Feng Nuo’s expression changed suddenly. He had guessed that Feng Qing might take action against Feng Xuan’s lineage but did not expect his determination to be so resolute.","Feng Xuan’s bloodline was very closely associated with his bloodline, and the two bloodlines had undergone many marriage alliances. It would be very difficult for Feng Nuo to justify his actions to the members of his bloodline if he got rid of Feng Xuan’s bloodline.","However, Feng Nuo also understood he could not question Feng Qing’s decision.","Feng Qing was already extremely furious. If he pleaded for leniency, Feng Qing would eventually vent his anger on himself!","“Lord Feng Qing, don’t worry. I’ll definitely take care of everything you’ve arranged. It’s just that before I go, I still need you to contact the Andra clan. I have absolutely no authority within the Andra clan.”","Feng Qing hummed and continued to fall into deep thought.","...","Lin Yuan was attending a banquet hosted by the Elisa clan and was being treated as a VIP. Yi Xue, Shi Mei, and the others were exceptionally surprised by the treatment Lin Yuan received. While it was undeniable that Lin Yuan had helped the Elisa clan, there was truly no necessity for them to treat him in such a manner.","The Elisa clan’s standards for Lin Yuan were too high. If the Elisa clan hadn’t just given birth to a Bloodian Queen, everything would have been understandable, yet they had just given birth to a Bloodian Queen and should be in the highest state of pride.","The Elisa clan was very arrogant to the outside world. There were only two possibilities for such a situation to happen. Firstly, Lin Yuan’s actions had genuinely benefited the Elisa clan. Secondly, the Elisa clan had heard of the Elise clan before.","The Elise clan was also a Bloodian clan with a queen in power, and the Elisa clan was doing this to establish ties with them. Compared to the former, Yi Xue and Shi Mei felt that the latter was more likely.","Lin Yuan remained calm amidst the Elisa clan’s hospitality. During this banquet, Helena had toasted Lin Yuan no less than three times. Basically, everyone could tell that Helena was interested in Lin Yuan. Under normal circumstances, a young female Bloodian should appear noble and reserved in front of others, not warm and forthright.","Under the gazes of the other Bloodians present, Lin Yuan conversed with Qin Yu. Many of the Bloodian clans present had never heard of the Elise clan. The Andra clan may not be qualified to endorse Lin Yuan’s status, but the new Bloodian Queen and the Elisa clan were certainly qualified to do so.","At the end of the banquet, Qin Yu personally invited Lin Yuan for a chat. After the banquet ended, the Elisa clan would hold a large-scale banquet that was not only for the Bloodians.","At that time, all the factions present would have a chance to come to the territory of the Elisa clan again.","The Bloodian clans should have dispersed by now, but Yi Xue and Shi Mei were waiting for Lin Yuan with the members of the Andra and Allen clans. Through this banquet, both of them were even more determined to establish ties with Lin Yuan and the Elise clan.","Yi Xue and Shi Mei were in a state where they disliked each other, with Yi Xue blaming Shi Mei for snatching opportunities from the Andra clan. On the other hand, Shi Mei blamed Yi Xue for not sharing such opportunities with her.","“Shi Mei, don’t waste your time. His Grace Black Elise will definitely return to the Andra clan with me. Our Andra clan still has a collaboration to discuss with His Grace!”","Upon hearing Yi Xue’s words, Shi Mei rolled her eyes so hard it seemed they might roll into the sky. “Yi Xue, I’ve already told you that our clans have a cooperative relationship. Our two clans have encountered many challenges together and have had many marriage alliances.","“By doing this, you are destroying the relationship between us. Your Andra clan has clearly completed the deal with Lord Black, but now you’re saying that you want to make another deal with Lord Black.","“Aren’t you doing this to prevent the Allen clan from establishing contact with His Grace Black? Do our two clans truly need to regard each other as competitors and be on guard against one another?","“I’ll only say what needs to be said once. If you don’t change your mind after listening to me, then there won’t be any reason for our Allen clan to be on good terms with the Andra clan in the future!”","Shi Mei’s words to Yi Xue were not a threat. The Allen clan was slightly stronger than the Andra clan in terms of strength. The two clans had always been supporting each other all along. On many occasions, the Allen clan had generously offered opportunities to the Andra clan to help them grow rather than hoarding them for themselves. This was what an allied Bloodian clan should be doing.","The Allen had always been generous to the Andra clan, yet the latter was unwilling to share opportunities with them at this juncture. If the two sides continued to cooperate, the Allen clan would be at a disadvantage.","Upon hearing Shi Mei’s words, Yi Xue’s expression changed. “Shi Mei, what are you talking about? If I regarded you as competitors, why would I let Black Elise appear in front of you?” You’re overthinking this. After we complete our cooperation with the Elise clan, I will personally send His Excellency Black Elise to your Allen clan.”","Shi Mei sneered. Lin Yuan was clearly interested in the Elisa clan and requested Yi Xue to bring him over. Under Lin Yuan’s request, Yi Xue had no way of rejecting him. Otherwise, Yi Xue would certainly prefer to keep Lin Yuan in the Andra clan.","Lin Yuan was not someone who would listen to Yi Xue’s arrangements and requests. Yi Xue did not have the ability to decide where Lin Yuan would go, let alone personally send him to the Allen clan.","“Yi Xue, since you put it that way, then let’s rely on our own capabilities!”","Shi Mei ignored Yi Xue and quietly waited for Lin Yuan with the Allen clan.","In Qin Yu’s private hall...","Qin Yu was bowing in front of Lin Yuan with a look of reverence and gratitude.","“Lord, try the blood wine that our Elisa clan has hidden for nearly 20,000 years. This jar of nearly 20,000-year-old blood wine will immediately be absorbed by the body to strengthen the body. Our Elisa clan only has two jars of this old blood wine left. If you like to drink it, I’ll pack the other jar for you before you leave!”","Lin Yuan took a sip of the blood wine in his cup. Its spiciness made his face turn red. However, as Qin Yu had said, this blood wine was indeed extremely beneficial to the body. Lin Yuan felt the energy in the blood wine spread from his abdomen to his entire body, cleansing it. His body was covered in sweat, and his physique had been strengthened.","There were no side effects to strengthening one’s physical fitness. Lin Yuan did not stand on ceremony with Qin Yu. He downed the blood wine in his cup and drank a few more.","After drinking three cups of blood wine, Lin Yuan realized that his body was rejecting the energy in the blood wine. This meant that the energy in the blood wine could not be absorbed by his body indefinitely. Many treasures had restrictions on the human body, especially those that could be used to increase lifespan.","Lin Yuan did not like the taste of blood wine, and his body’s need for blood wine had reached a saturation point. However, Lin Yuan still decided to take the two jars of blood wine, as they were very important to the members of Sky City.","With these two jars of blood wine, not only could Lin Yuan improve the physical fitness of all the members of the Sky City, but he could also select a few outstanding white-clothed followers to nurture.","Lin Yuan was now the actual controller of the Elisa clan, so there was no need to be polite with Qin Yu. If Lin Yuan wanted to repay the Elisa clan, it would be more useful to provide them with spirit qi crystals. With Lin Yuan in control of the Elisa clan, he would nurture them in the future.","“These two jars of blood wine are useful to me. Qin Yu, help me pack them before I leave. The Scarlet Territory is rich in blood-type spiritual ingredients. The Elisa clan doesn’t lack blood-type spiritual ingredients. What they lack is pure spirit qi.","“I’ll provide you with some pure spirit qi. You can stay behind to use it yourself or distribute it to the members you like. I remember you saying that you have two top Bloodian Kings under you who have the chance to step into the queen’s bloodline.","“If these two really have the opportunity to reach the juncture of bloodline enhancement in the future, I can help them transform like I helped you. However, before helping your two subordinates increase their bloodlines, you have to think about whether the increase in their bloodlines will affect you. If it affects you, then there’s no need for them to increase their bloodline. You have to guarantee that you can manage the Elisa clan for me!”"]},{"number":2918,"title":"Chapter 2918: Lin Yuan’s Reward!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2918: Lin Yuan’s Reward!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Qin Yu was overjoyed when she heard Lin Yuan’s words.","The Elisa clan had indeed produced a Bloodian Queen her. Their combat power had increased.","In the Scarlet Territory, the Elisa clan had an extremely high status, but in fact, it was still very difficult for them to rise to prominence. Apart from her, the other members were basically unchanged. As a Bloodian Queen, it was impossible for her to obtain external resources for the Elisa clan frequently.","Lin Yuan was willing to provide the Elisa clan with a large amount of pure spirit qi crystals. The spirit qi would be combined with the blood -type spiritual ingredients that the Elisa clan had meticulously collected.","The strength of the core members could be increased in a short period. This would allow the Elisa clan to snowball into power!","Lin Yuan had just spent a large amount of pure spirit qi to help her become a Bloodian Queen. He had also promised to give spirit qi to the Elisa clan and expressed his willingness to help Rula and Fan Qia improve their bloodlines. This was enough to show Lin Yuan’s generosity!","Lin Yuan would continue to provide the Elisa clan with spirit qi in the future!","Rula and Fan Qia served her willingly. Qin Yu, Rula, and Fan Qia were no longer ordinary friends. Theirs was a friendship that transcended life and death.","Even if Rula and Fan Qia became Bloodian Queens as well, they would still listen to her.","However, there were many things that could not be proven with words. It was useless to rely on words alone!","If Lin Yuan really helped Rula and Fan Qia to become Bloodian Queens, Qin Yu would suggest that Lin Yuan take control of them as well.","Qin Yu was very smart. She knew that if the Elisa clan wanted to continue receiving Lin Yuan’s support, they had to not let Lin Yuan feel that they were not worth investing in.","Once Lin Yuan felt that it was not worth it, it would be difficult for the Elisa clan to receive his resources in the future!","Qin Yu could sense that Lin Yuan possessed the Bloodian bloodline, but she felt that his bloodline was not an ordinary one.","Qin Yu no longer cared about Lin Yuan’s identity. She could see the future of the Elisa clan, which stuck by Lin Yuan’s side.","“Lord, don’t worry. Under my lead, the entire Elisa clan will offer our 100% loyalty to you!”","Lin Yuan drank a few more cups of blood wine. After confirming that the blood wine was no longer useful to him, he pondered for a moment and asked, “How much influence does the Elisa clan have in Honor Absent Palace? I need you to do something.”","Qin Yu did not ask Lin Yuan what he wanted her to do. Instead, she began introducing the Elisa clan’s situation in the Honor Absent Parliament.","Lin Yuan must have asked her this because he needed to have some influence in the Honor Absent Parliament to achieve his goal.","“Lord, to be honest, I’m a Class 2 Speaker in the Honor Absent Parliament. I manage hundreds of members. There are more than 100 Class 2 Speakers like me in the Honor Absent Parliament and more than 100 Class 3 Speakers. There are a total of 24 Class 1 Speakers. They are the ones who are truly in charge!","“I was originally a Class 3 Speaker. However, the lifespan of two pinnacle kings in my clan had decreased to the point that they decided to relinquish their responsibilities as Class 3 Speakers to me. It was then that I became a Class 2","Speaker. If my bloodline hadn’t evolved, I would have ended up falling back to a Class 3 Speaker during the next selection.","“There is a certain degree of freedom that comes with being a Class 2 Speaker.","Now that my bloodline has evolved, I will solidify my position as a Class 2","Speaker. If it’s not a serious matter, I should be of help to you!”","Lin Yuan had previously learned about the Honor Absent Parliament from Fan Lou and Kong Huan. His information was rather lacking due to Fan Lou and Kong Huan’s low positions.","Now, Lin Yuan had gained a rough understanding of the Honor Absent Parliament’s situation from Qin Yu.","There were at least hundreds of thousands of members in the Honor Absent Parliament. From this, it could be seen how huge the Honor Absent Parliament was.","As a Class 2 Speaker who could solidify her status, it should not be difficult for Qin Yu to promote Fan Lou to a member of parliament.","It would be more convenient for Fan Lou to develop in the future if he stayed with the Andra clan.","However, there was a drawback to doing this, which was that it bound the Andra clan and the Elisa clan together.","It was not a good thing for the only two Bloodian clans Lin Yuan had under him to be bound together.","Furthermore, Fan Lou was still completely unaffiliated with the Elisa clan.","Qi.on Yu rashly inviting Fan Lou to the Elisa clan and making him a member would definitely arouse speculation from the outside world.","At the same time, it would upset the Andra clan.","The Andra clan had already contacted Fan Lou in the hopes of recruiting him.","They wanted to use Fan Lou’s relationship with the Lonely River’s four major species to build a good relationship with them.","It was unlikely that the Andra clan would dare to utter any words of opposition if the Elisa clan fought with them for this opportunity. However, the Andra clan would definitely be critical of this!","It was better to let Fan Lou stay with the Andra clan before creating a suitable opportunity for him to build a relationship with the Elisa clan.","This way, the Elisa clan could provide help to Fan Lou!","Staying with the Andra clan would allow Fan Lou to understand the Bloodians from a different angle through Qin Yu. This would make it easier for Lin Yuan to learn everything about the Bloodians.","“Qin Yu, have you heard of the Lonely River’s four major species?”","Qin Yu hurriedly nodded.","The Lonely River’s four major species were the overlord species in the remote Lonely River. But to the Elisa clan, which now had a queen presiding over them, the four major species of Lonely River were nothing.","Even before Qin Yu became the Bloodian Queen, the Lonely River’s four major species had been trivial to the Elisa clan, which had three pinnacle kings.","Qin Yu had heard of the Lonely River’s four major species because of the Dark Pufferfish.","The Bloodians were preparing to attack the mermaids, and the venom produced by the Dark Pufferfish would be extremely useful to the Bloodians.","It was precisely because of this that Qin Yu paid attention to the Lonely River’s four major species.","“Master, I’ve heard about the Lonely River’s four major species. Their combined strength is only comparable to a Bloodian faction with a king bloodline. Does your plan target them? It seems like they are currently in the Scarlet Territory.” Lin Yuan smiled and shook his head.","“The Lonely River’s four major species are under my control. There’s no need for me to target them. I mentioned them because I intend to help you create an encounter to befriend Fan Lou, who is on good terms with the Lonely River’s four major species.","“Let Fan Lou build a relationship with your clan. This will make it easier for him to complete the mission I arranged for him! If the opportunity arises in the future, help Fan Lou become a member of the Honor Absent Parliament.” Qin Yu carefully took note of what Lin said.","For Lin Yuan to say this and deliberately mention Fan Lou meant that he valued Fan Lou very much!","Fan Lou was definitely not strong. Otherwise, he would not have been involved with the Lonely River’s four major species.","The fact that Lin Yuan valued Fan Lou so much in spite of his lack of strength was enough to show how important he was!","Qin Yu was now under Lin Yuan’s command as well. From now on, her potential depended on Lin Yuan’s appreciation of her.","The resources that Lin Yuan could provide her were very difficult for Qin Yu to obtain through her own abilities.","As such, Qin Yu planned to befriend Fan Lou and build a good relationship with the rest of Lin Yuan’s subordinates.","This might come in handy at some point!","“Master, it’s very easy for me to create such an opportunity. When I find out more about Fan Lou, I’ll choose a suitable opportunity to befriend him! If you want to become a member of the Honor Absent Parliament, you have to have strength. At the very least, you have to be World Emperor/Pinnacle Divine Kingdom! If, as you said, Fan Lou’s bloodline transforms into the Bloodian bloodline, I can help him increase their strength. Lord, you don’t have to worry about Fan Lou!”","Lin Yuan patted Qin Yu’s shoulder. With Qin Yu’s help, Lin Yuan did not need to worry about this matter anymore. He only needed to reward Fan Lou when he saw him.","Fan Lou had put in a lot of effort and suffered a lot for his plan. He was completely under Lin Yuan’s control, so there was no need to question loyalty.","Apart from demonstrating Fan Lou’s capabilities, this also showed his determination to work for Lin Yuan’s sake! If Fan Lou did not have this determination, he would not have allowed himself to remain in such a state after suffering such serious injuries!","After leaving the Elisa clan, Lin Yuan would return to the Andra clan before returning to Sky City.","The Bloodians’ plan against the mermaids was already set in stone, and Lin Yuan had no intention of saving them. He only needed to choose some mermaids and transfer them to the Spirit Lock spatial zone to be controlled by Dark Blue so they could supply faith power to it.","Lin Yuan told Qin Yu about this, and she would help him find a way to select and transfer that group of mermaids to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had been away from Sky City for too long. Even if he could contact the Moon Empress, Wen Yu, and the others through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, Sky City still needed him.","After returning to Sky City, Lin Yuan wanted to try evolving the Four Seasons Mountain into a higher faerie.","Regardless of whether the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons caused trouble for Lin Yuan, he had to get rid of them to prevent them from affecting the future development of the faith country.","The faith country concerned the future of all of Sky City’s members. There could be no mistakes!","Lin Yuan left everything to Qin Yu. He took the blood wine and left the Elisa clan’s territory.","Before meeting Qin Yu, Lin Yuan had already agreed to return to the Andra clan with Yi Xue.","Yi Xue was waiting for him at the entrance to the Elisa clan. Lin Yuan was certain that Yi Xue would not leave without him. This meeting between him and Qin Yu had shown the Andra clan how mighty the Elise clan was. Yi Xue definitely wanted to befriend him even more than before!","When Yi Xue saw Lin Yuan, he smiled. He had been afraid that Lin Yuan would leave without him.","Lin Yuan’s current attitude showed Yi Xue that he was willing to befriend him as well!","Shi Mei kept blaming herself for being insincere. No matter how unwilling Yi Xue was, he had to comfort Shi Mei.","“Your Excellency Black, the leader of the Allen clan, Shi Mei Allen, has been waiting for you. She wants to invite you to the Allen clan. Are you willing to go?","If you want to go to the Allen clan, I can show you around the Allen clan’s territory after you’re done visiting the Andra clan’s territory.”","When Shi Mei heard Yi Xue’s words, the hostility on her face decreased a little as she looked at Lin Yuan expectantly.","Shi Mei had been wanting to become acquainted with Lin Yuan. Now, she knew that Lin Yuan’s Elise clan was a Bloodian clan that could stand toe to toe with the Elisa clan.","The Elisa clan had just obtained a new queen. If she did her best and became acquainted with Lin Yuan, it would be a large opportunity for the Allen clan.","Otherwise, as the ruler of her clan, there was really no need for Shi Mei to do this!","Lin Yuan shook his head.","“My clan has other matters that I need to see to. I don’t have that much time to stay in the Scarlet Territory. I am already acquainted with Shi Mei. We might not be considered allies, but I don’t think we’ll mind helping each other out in a pinch!”","Yi Xue was delighted when he heard Lin Yuan’s words. In Yi Xue’s opinion, Lin Yuan was just being polite.","Compared to the Allen clan, Lin Yuan preferred to interact with the Andra clan.","This was great news for Yi Xue!","Shi Mei’s expression was filled with regret. She wanted to befriend Lin Yuan but had been rejected. If she pressed on, she would only become a nuisance.","Although Shi Mei was disappointed, she did not show it. Instead, she chose to leave with Lin Yuan.","She might not be able to befriend Lin Yuan now, but this did not mean that she would never have the chance to do so in the future.","Lin Yuan would come back to the Scarlet Territory sooner or later, and she would find an opportunity to befriend him.","She had successfully pressured Yi Xue to create an opening for her, but Shi Mei was not grateful at all. Her anger was still directed at Yi Xue, and she decided to stop helping the Andra clan from now on.","Shi Mei wanted to observe and find out Lin Yuan’s reason for coming to the Scarlet Territory.","The Allen clan could befriend Lin Yuan based on his needs and bypass the Andra clan.","In terms of overall strength, the Allen clan was stronger than the Andra clan. Lin Yuan had no reason to only befriend the Andra clan and not the Allen clan! Yi Xue recalled that Andre had sent him a message saying that Feng Xuan had been executed.","Although Lin Yuan said that he did not care about Feng Xuan, the latter was someone whom Lin Yuan had personally healed.","Yi Xue felt that it was necessary for him to inform Lin Yuan of the situation so that Lin Yuan would not vent his anger on the Andra clan.","“Your Excellency Black, Feng Xuan threatened the cooperation between the Andra clan and the Lonely River’s four major species, thereby jeopardizing the overall interests of the Bloodians. The Andra clan has executed him..”"]},{"number":2919,"title":"Chapter 2919: Falling Out with Lin Yuan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2919: Falling Out with Lin Yuan!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Yi Xue paused for a moment before continuing. “Feng Xuan is bold and reckless because of his link to you. Some of Feng Xuan’s actions have tarnished you.","Feng Xuan is a Chaos Wind Demon Wolf. The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves are a subsidiary of the Andra Clan. I plan to make the entire species apologize to you!”","The corners of Lin Yuan’s mouth twitched when he heard this, and he looked at Yi Xue speechlessly.","Yi Xue was really good at talking. The Andra clan had already gotten rid of Feng Xuan, yet he was still able to implicate him!","He did want to make use of Feng Xuan. But even if he did so, there was no relationship between him, the two of them, let alone a deep bond!","No matter what Feng Xuan did, it would not affect him.","Yi Xue wanted to get rid of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves because he felt that they were disobedient. However, he made it sound like it was for Lin Yuan’s sake!","Lin Yuan hated Yi Xue’s behavior. Did he really look like a fool?","Without needing Lin Yuan to say anything, Jin Chen released his aura, completely suppressing Yi Xue.","“Yi Xue, the puny Chaos Wind Demon Wolves can’t be considered related to the Elise clan. Do you have an issue with the Elise clan? Is that why you’re lumping us together with the likes of them?","“It’s up to you if you want to kill or torture your own dependent species. Our clan’s dependent species would never do anything that goes against the clan’s interests, much less interfere with our collaborations with other species!”","Jin Chen’s words were merciless, causing Yi Xue’s expression to change several times.","If this was any other time, Shi Mei would definitely speak up for Yi Xue. But this time, she did not do so. She would be delighted if Lin Yuan feuded with the Andra clan. Only then would the Allen clan have more opportunities to interact with Lin Yuan.","Yi Xue was rarely rebuked like this. He had assumed Spring, Winter, Kani, Jin Chen, and the others were Lin Yuan’s blood servants.","Lin Yuan had not stopped Jin Chen from contradicting him, meaning that Lin Yuan was definitely very unhappy with him.","Yi Xue knew his place and quickly admitted defeat, “Your Excellency Black, you’ve misunderstood me. No matter how capable the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves are, they could never be associated with the Elise clan. I misspoke just now. Please forgive me!”","Lin Yuan sneered in the way elites would. “Yi Xue, our clans are cooperating, but mutual respect is still necessary. If something like this happens again, the Elise clan will no longer consider the Andra clan as friends.","“I’ve always been curious about the distance between the Lonely River and the Scarlet Territory. How did the species from the Lonely River end up cooperating with the Andra clan?”","Yi Xue was originally shocked and furious by Lin Yuan’s words. But when Lin Yuan changed the topic, Yi Xue’s expression became more natural.","Yi Xue knew the answer to Lin Yuan’s question, so he quickly answered it truthfully.","In order to ameliorate his relationship with Lin Yuan, Yi Xue explained the situation in detail.","When he was done, Lin Yuan asked, “In that case, the Andra Clan and the","Lonely River’s four major species are also friends with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.”","When Yi Xue heard Lin Yuan mention Fan Lou, he thought that Lin Yuan wanted to target Fan Lou because of the Andra clan. As such, he hastily pulled away from Fan Lou.","“Your Excellency Black, you might not know this, but Fan Lou was originally an external member of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. But he was bestowed with the blood essence of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves because he made a huge contribution to the species.","“However, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves treated Fan Lou extremely badly. He almost died at their hands. The Andra clan intends to make Fan Lou a Bloodian.”","Lin Yuan’s expression changed slightly before he smiled and said, “Oh? I didn’t expect the Andra clan to think so highly of Fan Lou. You’re even willing to spend your blood essence to help him transform his bloodline. Hearing you say that, I really want to get to know this guy called Fan Lou! Let’s go. When we return to the Andra clan, introduce Fan Lou to me!”","Yi Xue was stunned when he heard this and instinctively wanted to refuse.He thought that Lin Yuan had taken a fancy to the Lonely River’s four major species and wanted to compete with the Andra clan for the opportunity to collaborate with them.","There was no doubt that the Elise clan was stronger than the Andra clan","The Andra clan could not compete with the Elise clan when it came to being a collaborative partner.","However, Yi Xue believed that Lin Yuan would not stay in the Andra clan for long.","Even if Lin Yuan took the initiative to befriend the Lonely River’s four major species, they would definitely be wary and not interact with him directly.","The Lonely River’s four major species were unaware of the Elisa clan. As long as he did not introduce Lin Yuan to them, it would be fine.","Ever since the Lonely River’s four major species came to the Scarlet Territory, they had been in contact with the Andra clan. It was likely that only the Andra clan could give them a sense of security.","With the strength of the Elise clan, they would not take the initiative to befriend the Lonely River’s four major species.","The strength of the Lonely River’s four major species was comparable to that of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. They were only at the level of dependent species.","The Andra clan had Holy Spirit experts, but the strongest expert of the Lonely River’s four major species was only at the pinnacle Divine Kingdom level. There was an insurmountable gap between them.","It would be degrading for the Elise clan to initiate a friendship with the Lonely River’s four major species!","Yi Xue did not have a good impression of the Lonely River’s four major species.","They were rather arrogant.","Such arrogance should not come into contact with the Andra clan.","The Lonely River’s four major species probably thought that the Bloodians needed the help of the Dark Pufferfish for their operation against the mermaids. But in truth, most of the Bloodian clans never counted on the venom produced by the Dark Pufferfish. A species without a Holy Spirit expert could only be considered a tool at best.","“Your Excellency Black, since you want to get to know Fan Lou, I would be glad to introduce him to you! However, I heard that Fan Lou is a bootlicker. You have to be careful not to be deceived when you interact with him!”","Lin Yuan raised his eyebrows. Fan Lou was indeed an insignificant figure in Yi Xue’s eyes.","However, Yi Xue had probably forgotten that he had just said that the Andra clan intended to turn Fan Lou into a Bloodian.","This could be said to be the greatest reward the Bloodians could give to their dependent species. Even Feng Qing had never received such kindness!","Yi Xue wanted to give this preferential treatment to Fan Lou because he saw Fan Lou’s potential value.","Yi Xue was afraid that the Lonely River’s four major species, whom he had gotten to know through Fan Lou, would be interested in Fan Lou and compete with the Andra clan!","From Yi Xue’s words, Lin Yuan could confirm that Yi Xue lacked foresight. Otherwise, as the leader of a clan, Yi Xue would not have done something so disjointed.","It would have been fine if he had been unaware of Yi Xue’s thoughts. However, Yi Xue had allowed him to see the scheme he was cooking up.","Lin Yuan did not always have to be the smartest person in the room, but he would not allow himself to be treated as a fool.","If others treated him as a fool, he would look stupid if he did not expose this person!","“Hehe, you sure know how to joke! You just said that you’re preparing to transform Fan Lou into a Bloodian. How could Fan Lou be as terrible as you said? If you are unwilling to introduce me, then forget it. I’m not interested in getting to know a fellow from your dependent species!”","It was, indeed, as Lin Yuan had said. There was no need for Lin Yuan to meet Fan Lou.","At most, Lin Yuan would have Winter secretly deliver the reward to Fan Lou.","The Andra clan’s members were not powerful enough to detect Winter’s presence.","Yi Xue’s face alternated between red and white. He looked at Shi Mei for help, clearly hoping she would speak up for him.","Shi Mei rolled her eyes at him. Yi Xue had not even been willing to introduce her to Lin Yuan. How did he have the gall to seek her help now? Could it be that he wanted her to stand up for him and tell Lin Yuan that he had no such intention?","She heard what Yi Xue had just said. Wasn’t Yi Xue afraid that Lin Yuan would vent his anger on him?","Shi Mei hated selfish collaborators the most. Alas, the Andra clan had been on good terms with the Allen clan for nearly a thousand years.","Shi Mei was extremely regretful. If she had not supported the Andra clan back then, the Allen clan would definitely be gaining another solid ally now!","Based on the Andra clan’s current attitude towards the Allen clan, the Andra clan would not help the Allen clan if anything were to happen in the future! Shi Mei did not want to help Yi Xue, but she would not kick Yi Xue when he was down.","There were many things that Shi Mei needed to attend to. It would not be too late to split the relationship between the two clans after she was done!","Yi Xue looked rather annoyed when Shi Mei failed to respond to his plea for help. He felt that Shi Mei was coveting the Andra clan’s opportunities.","He had indeed forgotten how Shi Mei had helped the Andra clan.","He was more willing to take sole credit for the rise of the Andra clan! Yi Xue had always flaunted himself as the one who helped the Andra clan rise and revive.","Yi Xue could hear the unhappiness in Lin Yuan’s words. Just as Yi Xue was about to defend himself, Lin Yuan spoke. “Since the Andra clan isn’t sincere at all, I’d better take a trip to the Allen clan! The deal with the Andra clan is the same as the one with the Allen clan.”","At first, Shi Mei felt that it was a pity that she could not befriend Lin Yuan. She had not expected such a huge reversal.","This reversal caused the ever-composed Shi Mei to look excited. She hurriedly said, “The Allen clan is very willing to trade with the Elise clan. We will definitely treat you as our most honorable guest!”","Yi Xue had not expected this.","Yi Xue did not care that what he was about to say would anger Shi Mei. He hurriedly said, “Your Excellency Black, you’ve misunderstood me. I didn’t mean that at all. I hope you can understand what I truly mean! The Andra clan has always treated you as our most honorable guest!”","Without needing Lin Yuan to say anything, Shi Mei snapped, “Words aren’t enough to prove that you see him as an honorable guest. His Excellency Black Elise can experience it himself! With your attitude just now, no one can sense your so-called sincerity! Now that he has decided to go to the Allen clan’s territory, you should respect his decision!”","Shi Mei warmly invited Lin Yuan. Her attitude toward Lin Yuan was many times more enthusiastic than Yi Xue’s!","Shi Mei could humble herself better than Yi Xue could, especially when she was trying to befriend someone. Shi Mei cared a lot about the deal with Lin Yuan. If she could trade with Lin Yuan once, she would be able to understand the benefits of being on good terms with the Elise clan.","Lin Yuan ignored Yi Xue and left with Shi Mei.","Up until now, Lin Yuan had never interacted with Fan Lou, so it would actually be good not to see him. This would allow him to completely separate himself from Fan Lou.","Lin Yuan had already informed Qin Yu of the development path that he had arranged for Fan Lou. She would find a suitable opportunity to promote Fan Lou.","Lin Yuan’s reward would be delivered to Fan Lou tonight. The Andra clan had severed their relationship with him and could no longer rely on the Elise clan.","They could only make friends with the Lonely River’s four major species through Fan Lou!","The Allen clan, who had always been on good terms with the Andra clan, had clearly detached themselves from the Andra clan.","Yi Xue needed a place to vent after suffering such a huge blow. The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves became his best punching bag.","In spite of the Allen clan’s warm welcome, Lin Yuan did not stay for long.","Lin Yuan traded a pure spirit qi for a large amount of blood-type spiritual ingredients with the Allen clan. These blood-type spiritual ingredients would be enough for the Blood Love for a long time.","Shi Mei regarded her relationship with Lin Yuan as the luckiest thing that had happened to the Allen clan in the past 300 years.","Shi Mei was going to use the pure spirit qi she had traded to improve her strength.","The Allen clan was indeed a king clan, but this did not mean that they would be stuck in such a state forever.. If she could strengthen past pinnacle king bloodline, the Allen clan would rewrite history and obtain the same glory as the Elisa clan!"]},{"number":2920,"title":"Chapter 2920 Fire Feathers Wild Lions!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2920 ?Fire Feathers Wild Lions!","Lin Yuan did not think much during his interactions with the Allen clan.","Lin Yuan traded with the Allen clan because he needed blood-type spiritual ingredients. Presently, he was fully focused on Sky City.","When he returned to Sky City, he would use the resources he had obtained on his journey to enable the main members to increase their strength quickly. These resources would improve the faith country as well.","...","Fan Lou initially assumed that he would be able to meet Lin Yuan. He was disappointed that this failed to happen.","Fan Lou saw Winter that night. He had just as deep of an impression of Winter as he did of Lin Yuan.","Winter was the one who had taken control of those who had gone to the Class 2 world, as well as the Abyssal Beast they rode on.","Winter gave Fan Lou a piece of spatial equipment before nodding and leaving without saying anything to him. In Winter’s eyes, Fan Lou was insignificant.","Winter’s nod to Fan Lou was already the greatest affirmation he could give.","Fan Lou did not care about Winter’s attitude towards him. When Fan Lou first came into contact with Winter, the latter’s attitude had been much harsher than it was now. The fact that Lin Yuan was willing to let Winter make this trip was enough to show how much he valued him.","Fan Lou checked the resources in the spatial equipment with anticipation. After checking, a shocked expression appeared on his face.","Fan Lou stood rooted to the ground in shock for a long time. Fan Lou had asked himself many times what he had done to deserve so many rewards from Lin Yuan.","Many of these rewards had already exceeded Fan Lou’s understanding.","The resources that Lin Yuan would use as rewards were all like this. If these resources were given to Qin Yu, a Bloodian Queen, she would also be excited and shocked.","Fan Lou had gained Lin Yuan’s recognition through his ability, which made Lin Yuan treat Fan Lou as a subordinate who was worth nurturing. Otherwise, Fan Lou would not be qualified to obtain so many high-quality resources!","Fan Lou did not know how to use the 3,000-odd spirit qi crystals and nearly 10,000 blood-type spiritual ingredients.","However, once Fan Lou became a Bloodian, these things would come in handy.","The resources that Lin Yuan had invested in Fan Lou allowed him to roughly understand Lin Yuan’s arrangements for him. He was extremely satisfied with Lin Yuan’s arrangements!","After becoming a Bloodian, not only would Fan Lou’s life be transformed, but it would also begin a new journey.","Fan Lou found out that Winter had not gone to see the Lonely River’s four major species. This meant that they had not managed to obtain Lin Yuan’s rewards.","In the future, Fan Lou would be relying on the envoys of the Lonely River’s four major species to do things for him.","Fan Lou still regarded himself as a superior in the sixth Boundary Patrol Team. He knew very well what a superior should do.","The Lonely River’s four major species were obediently helping him. He needed them to listen to his arrangements and follow his lead, so he felt he had to give them some benefits.","Those blood-type spiritual ingredients were useless to the envoys, but they were unable to get their hands on spirit qi crystals!","He would not be able to use up all these spirit qi crystals in a short period. As long as he worked for Lin Yuan, he would have a chance to obtain them again!","Fan Lou took out 400 spirit qi crystals. Four brocade boxes were filled with 100 spirit qi crystals each.","Since he had decided to reward them, he had to give them more. Otherwise, he might as well not reward them at all!","Since it was used as a reward, he had to be impartial.","Due to the fact that the Lonely River’s four major species were under Lin Yuan’s control, they were very close. The envoys would interact with each other through information. If they knew that their rewards were biased, the party that received the lesser rewards would definitely have objections.","Ink Scar was the one who supported him the most. He had almost become the spokesperson of the Lonely River’s four major species.","Fan Lou would secretly give Ink Scar a portion of the rewards that Lin Yuan had given him. He believed that Ink Scar would understand his intentions and work harder for him in the future.","...","Ink Scar received a total of 200 spirit qi crystals. Ever since he was born, he had never received so many rewards!","Ink Scar had only followed Fan Lou because he wanted to raise his status among the Dark Pufferfish. He had never thought that he would be able to obtain such a generous reward!","These practical benefits were much more important than raising his status. These 200 spirit qi crystals were enough to advance Ink Scar’s bloodline! Increasing his strength would increase Ink Scar’s status among the Dark Pufferfish.","“Lord Fan Lou, thank you for your nurturing. I’ll be relying on you in the future. I hope you won’t hold back from helping me! From today onwards, I am willing to be at your disposal. Every word you say will be treated as an imperial edict!”","Ink Scar’s words demonstrated his submission to Fan Lou. He had helped Fan Lou before but had never addressed Fan Lou as ‘Lord’.","Ink Scar could not get close to Lin Yuan, so he was treating Fan Lou this way because he felt he could also obtain a good future if he connected with Fan Lou!","For the sake of his future, Ink Scar was willing to offer his loyalty. He was even willing to go against the interests of the Dark Pufferfish!","In any case, the Dark Pufferfish had already submitted to Lin Yuan and were his subordinates. Fan Lou was well aware of this.","Since Fan Lou was also loyal to Lin Yuan, he naturally would not do anything to harm the interests of the Dark Pufferfish.","Ink Scar was very ambitious, and his ambition was targeted at the Dark Pufferfish and not Lin Yuan. This allowed Ink Scar’s ambitions to have no conflict with Fan Lou’s needs.","Fan Lou was willing to give Ink Scar a hand if he had the chance. As long as Ink Scar was someone who knew how to repay kindness, he would be able to give back what he wanted!","Fan Lou was very satisfied with Ink Scar’s current stance.","“Ink Scar, I work by Lord Lin Yuan’s side. Lord Lin Yuan has treated me well, so I will definitely treat you well, too! The two of us are now bound together for good or ill. If you know this clearly, you will know what to do in the future! Even if I don’t work with you anymore, our connection won’t be broken!”","Fan Lou’s words seemed to be a reminder to Ink Scar, but in fact, that was not Fan Lou’s intention because he knew that Lin Yuan planned to let him develop with the Bloodians in the future. His development would only get better and better!","As his development improved, Ink Scar would naturally cling tightly to him.","If one day, Fan Lou’s development became worse and worse, Fan Lou would no longer have any need for Ink Scar!","Fan Lou believed that at that time, Ink Scar would no longer obediently follow by his side and listen to his orders.","...","In the next few days, the members of the Andra clan frequently went to the residences in the Dark Pufferfish territory to see Fan Lou.","The Andra clan had lost their good relationship with the Elise clan. This was a situation that Yi Xue had never expected. Not only that, but the Allen clan, which was on good terms with them, also had a lot of issues with the Andra Clan. It had even reached the point where it would threaten the cooperation between the two clans!","The Andra clan could not break off their cooperation with the Allen clan because they still had to rely on the Allen clan in many aspects of cooperation.","Secondly, the Allen clan had been helping the Andra clan all this time.","If the Andra clan severed ties with the Allen clan, Shi Mei would definitely speak ill of the Andra clan outside and label them as ungrateful. If that was the case, the Andra clan would no longer be able to survive in the Scarlet Territory!","The Andra clan had developed rapidly over the years, and they had offended many other Bloodian clans.","Yi Xue understood this.","Andre could not make many decisions on his own. After Yi Xue returned, Andre told him everything that had happened in the clan during this period.","Yi Xue was already in a bad mood. Hearing Andre’s description made his mood worse.","The key was that he was the one who had suggested supporting the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves as a dependent species. Even if he wanted to blame someone, there was no one for him to blame!","No matter how bad the current situation of the Andra clan was, they could still choose another dependent species.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had already jeopardized the clan’s interests. There was no reason for the Andra clan to keep such a species!","“Andre, which species have the strength to replace the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves?”","Andre immediately knew that Yi Xue wanted to cripple the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Yi Xue’s idea could be said to coincide with Andre’s.","“Lord Yi Xue’s White Belly Sound Snakes and Fire Feather Wild Lions both have great potential. When the time comes, I will personally go to inspect them. The strength of these two species is about the same as the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","“In fact, they are much stronger than the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves in some aspects! In particular, the bloodline of the Fire-Feathered Wild Lions is even stronger than that of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves! This time, I will definitely choose a more obedient species than the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves!”","Yi Xue raised his hand and rubbed his chin. This was Yi Xue’s habit when he was thinking.","“Let’s first select the species that are suitable to be dependent species. After the selection, we’ll hold a meeting with the Elders to discuss it. Then, bring two jars of blood wine that has been brewing for more than 8,000 years and visit Speaker Black Wing. Let the leaders of the newly chosen dependent species replace Feng Qing!”","In the Andra clan, no one hated the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves more than Andre.","“Lord Yi Xue, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves sent someone over to seek forgiveness. Do you think there’s a need for us to give them a chance?”","Yi Xue waved his hand.","“Chance? How can a chance be given so easily? The Elise clan didn’t give us a chance! Before executing the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, tell them to scram and think about the past. Don’t let them come to the Andra Clan again, where they’ll just be an eyesore! If there’s such information in the future, don’t let it reach my ears.","“You said before that Fan Lou hasn’t replied yet. Meet him on my behalf and him that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves can be handed over to him to manage. Their life and death depend on his emotions.","“No matter what, we must strive to make Fan Lou a member of the Andra clan! As long as Fan Lou becomes a member of the Andra clan, not only will the Lonely River’s four major species no longer have any objections to the Andra clan, but they will even be of help to us!”","Yi Xue thought about it again and again and felt that it was really not suitable for him to meet Fan Lou personally as the leader of the Andra clan.","If he personally went to see Fan Lou, it would be fine if Fan Lou agreed.","If Fan Lou continued to stall, he would lose all his formidability. How could he lead the members of the Andra clan in the future?","Fan Lou had rejected Andre previously because he knew that Feng Qing had given up on him despite him working hard to contribute to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. His mindset had been skewed.","However, after such a long time, Fan Lou must have thought things through.","If Fan Lou refused again, there would only be one possibility, and that was that Fan Lou did not want to join the Andra clan.","Joining the Andra clan was an excellent opportunity for Fan Lou. As a smart person, Fan Lou should be very clear that if he joined the Andra clan, it would stabilize the cooperation between the Andra clan and the Dark Pufferfish.","Only then would the Dark Pufferfish take Fan Lou seriously!","Otherwise, if he wanted to build a relationship with the Dark Pufferfish based on kindness, the relationship would definitely not last!","Andre had been rejected by Fan Lou once before, so he did not think that Fan Lou would reject him again. He decisively accepted the mission Yi Xue had arranged for him.","Andre had been working hard to become Yi Xue’s trusted aide. During this period, he had worked extremely hard for Yi Xue.","Now that Yi Xue treated Andre as a trusted aide, Yi Xue would specify for Andre to do many things. This made Andre extremely happy! Based on the current situation, he would soon become Andra clan’s third Elder!","...","After much consideration, Fan Lou decided to contact Lin Yuan first.","There were some things that he needed Lin Yuan’s opinion on in order to ensure that he would not make any mistakes.","Coincidentally, Lin Yuan had given him so many rewards, so he had to thank him.","Fan Lou tried to contact Lin Yuan through the Thoughts Letter Paper and realized that he could no longer contact him.","Fan Lou knew that Lin Yuan must have already left the Scarlet Territory. As such, he contacted him through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower.","“Lord Lin Yuan, thank you very much for your gift. Now that the Andra clan wants to recruit me, should I accept their invitation?”","Lin Yuan knew that Fan Lou would definitely take the initiative to contact him after receiving the supplies from Winter. He had been waiting for news from Fan Lou!"]},{"number":2921,"title":"Chapter 2921: Kong Huan’s Plea!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2921: Kong Huan’s Plea!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","As Lin Yuan had expected, the Andra clan had invited Fan Lou to become a member of the Bloodians.","The Andra clan had cut off their connection with him and lost their friendship","with the Allen clan. Deepening their relationship with the Lonely River’s four major species became the best choice for them.","It was the most reasonable choice for Fan Lou to become a Bloodian through the Andra clan.","“Fan Lou, I arranged for you to become a member of the Bloodians. You should know the benefits of becoming a Bloodian. You’re the one negotiating with the Andra clan. You can use the Lonely River’s four major species as bargaining chips to fight for your own benefits!”","When Fan Lou took out the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower to contact Lin Yuan, he waited beside it, hoping that he would be the first to see it when Lin Yuan sent him a message.","Fan Lou was extremely excited that Lin Yuan had given him permission to accept the Andra clan’s invitation to become a pureblood Bloodian!","Knowing and confirming that he could become a Bloodian brought out two completely different sets of emotions in him.","However, Fan Lou was puzzled by Lin Yuan’s arrangement. Lin Yuan wanted him to become a Bloodian through the Andra clan because he wanted to be on good terms with them.","However, if he used the Lonely River’s four major species as a bargaining chip to obtain more benefits from the Andra clan, this would most likely anger the Andra clan. This would not be beneficial to his relationship with the Andra clan, and Lin Yuan definitely knew that!","Fan Lou tentatively asked Lin Yuan, “Master, if I bargain with the Andra clan, it’s very likely that they will be dissatisfied, and this will be detrimental to our future cooperation with them! Do you think I should curry favor with the Andra clan?”","Lin Yuan immediately understood what Fan Lou meant and replied, “The Andra clan is just a springboard for you. My arrangements for you are not mainly tied to the Andra clan. You don’t have to worry too much about their attitude towards you. Soon, you will leave the Andra clan. I will prepare a bigger stage for you.”","Lin Yuan’s words exhilarated Fan Lou.","Fan Lou had just left the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, and the Andra clan was already a behemoth to him.","However, Lin Yuan had clearly told Fan Lou that the Andra clan was just a springboard. This springboard was too high! Fan Lou found it hard to imagine where he could jump with this springboard!","It was obvious that Lin Yuan had never been to the Scarlet Territory before. During their conversation, Fan Lou had clearly realized that Lin Yuan had reached the Elisa clan through the Andra clan.","Apart from the Andra clan, Lin Yuan had probably only interacted with the Elisa clan.","A Bloodian Queen had just appeared in the Elisa clan.","Lin Yuan’s goal was the blood pool, which had the same amount of resources needed for that Bloodian Queen’s evolution.","The Bloodian Queen had already completed her evolution, and there was no further information from Lin Yuan. The meaning of this could not be more obvious!","Only a queen clan like the Elisa clan was worthy of using the Andra clan as a springboard.","Fan Lou suppressed his excitement and replied, “Lord, thank you for giving me such an opportunity. I will definitely not disappoint you!”","Lin Yuan smiled when he saw Fan Lou’s message. He was very satisfied with Fan Lou’s response.","Lin Yuan had paved the way for Fan Lou and he knew how far Fan Lou could go on this path he had laid out for him. Fan Lou only needed to show that he was working hard !","“Fan Lou, I didn’t give you many resources this time. In the future, the Elisa clan’s leader, Qin Yu, will provide you with the resources to increase your strength. You have to increase your strength as soon as possible after transforming into a Bloodian.","“If I want to push you to become a member of the Honor Absent Parliament, it will be necessary for you to possess a certain level of strength. If you don’t increase your strength, I won’t be able to help you even if I am capable and willing to do so! When your strength increases pinnacle World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, the Honor Absent Parliament will definitely have a seat for you!”","Lin Yuan’s every word struck Fan Lou’s nerves, causing his soul to tremble even more. Lin Yuan’s promise was a great opportunity for Fan Lou.","Fan Lou had only been by Lin Yuan’s side for a short period, but he was already on the cusp of becoming a member of Honor Absent Parliament!","Feng Qing and Kong Huan, to whom Fan Lou had pledged allegiance, were both members of Honor Absent Parliament. If he became a member of Honor Absent Parliament he would be of equal status to them.","Fan Lou was about to transform into the kind of person he yearned to be!","Fan Lou felt that he had not done enough to receive such a generous reward from Lin Yuan. If Fan Lou wanted to live up to Lin Yuan’s reward, all he could do was follow the path that Lin Yuan had paved for him.","Apart from excitement, Fan Lou was also nervous and afraid. He was afraid that he was not worthy of Lin Yuan’s appreciation.","Of course, Fan Lou was still looking forward to the future. He looked forward to his future development after becoming a member of the Honor Absent Parliament. At that time, he should have the capital to establish his own clan in the Scarlet Territory.","As long as he worked hard for Lin Yuan, Fan Lou believed that Lin Yuan would not be stingy with giving him such an opportunity!","On the way back, Lin Yuan asked Kani, Jin Chen, Liu Chen, and Liu Yao to search for traces of the star pirates. After discovering the star pirates, they were to get rid of them.","To a certain extent, Lin Yuan’s actions were equivalent to doing a good deed for the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds!","A well-established star pirate group would wipe out hundreds of millions of living beings in the Sky Beyond the Clouds each year while plundering. To a certain extent, the influence of the star pirate group on the Sky Beyond the Clouds was no less than that of the rat infestation.","While cleaning up these star pirates, the resources they plundered became Lin Yuan’s reserves for the development of Sky City.","If someone told the star pirates that their resources were about to be plundered by other forces, these star pirates would not believe it at all.","It snowed all year round in the cold mountainous area where the","Snow-covered Foxes lived in the North Universe. The area was not suitable for other types of foxes to live.","It was fine for the Alluring Foxes. The resources they needed to increase their strength had nothing to do with elements.","The Alluring Foxes was a species that mainly cultivated their spirit and soul. It was enough to train the mind accordingly.","Foxes that needed to absorb elemental energy, especially those that needed to absorb fire elemental energy, were not suitable to stay in the territory of the Snow-covered Foxes.","However, if they were not in the territory of the Snow-covered Foxes, it would be very difficult for them to have any contact with the Snow-covered Foxes. Those dependent species that were not appreciated were living extremely poorly. Once they become a dependent species of the Snow-covered Foxes, it would be very difficult for them to break free.","Kong Huan had led the Alluring Foxes to the North Universe. Because Lin Yuan had raised her bloodline to pinnacle Alluring Bones, she was able to take root in the territory of the Snow-covered Foxes.","After a few months of development, the foxes under Kong Huan’s command had become the noblest dependent species in this area.","In the beginning, Kong Huan would often be called to the palace of the leader. Now, he would personally come to the territory of the Alluring Foxes to interact with Kong Huan.","Putting on a show was a specialty of the Alluring Foxes. The Snow-covered Fox leader doted on Kong Huan more and more every day.","Kong Huan had learned that this leader named Xue Kang was a new elite among the Snow-covered Foxes.","With the lifespan of the Snow-covered Foxes, Xue Kang had already surpassed the Holy Spirit level before he reached middle age. There was still a high possibility that Xue Kang’s strength would improve further.","If the Alluring Foxes were not relying on Lin Yuan but Xue Kang, Kong Huan would definitely be very happy now!","However, Lin Yuan was the one they were relying on, and she needed to fulfill all of Lin Yuan’s requests.","Under such circumstances, they would be in a tough spot if Lin Yuan’s arrangements clashed with Xue Kang’s.","Kong Huan’s life was in Lin Yuan’s hands, so she would definitely listen to him.","However, Xue Kang would not lose his sense of propriety just because she fawned on him. Once her actions threatened Xue Kang’s interests, Xue Kang would feel betrayed and would not show mercy to her.","If her bloodline could evolve from pinnacle Alluring Bones to Alluring Soul, she might be able to affect Xue Kang’s emotions.","At the thought of this, Kong Huan subconsciously placed her hand on her stomach.","Kong Huan could feel that a life was being nurtured in her womb. This little life was a bargaining chip for her.","However, it was far from time to use this bargaining chip.","The stronger the Snow-covered Fox, the harder it was for them to have children. This especially applied to the Snow-covered Fox leaders.","There were at least 1,000 female foxes that Xue Kang doted on, but none of them could give birth to a son or a daughter for him.","If Xue Kang knew that she was pregnant with his child, he would definitely be overjoyed that his bloodline could now be passed on.","Kong Huan did want Xue Kang to direct all his joy on the child. Instead, she wanted him to direct more joy on her.","In order to do this, Kong Huan needed to plan more and increase her interaction with Xue Kang.","More importantly, she wanted to raise his bloodline to Alluring Soul and use her bloodline to mesmerize Xue Kang.","All foxes were very open-minded, especially the Snow-covered Fox leaders.","Kong Huan did not expect to have pure love between her and Xue Kang. The foxes could easily obtain the love of others through their bloodline, so they did not subscribe to true love.","Kong Huan had the jade that Winter had given her and could contact him if she landed in worst-case scenarios.","Kong Huan felt that this was the most suitable time to contact Lin Yuan through Winter.","If she could use this offspring to mesmerize Xue Kang, it would be equivalent to opening a channel for Lin Yuan in the Northern Universe.","Even if Lin Yuan could not help her improve her bloodline, it was time for her to let Lin Yuan see her results after such a long time!","For the next few days, Xue Kang would be using the coldness of the glacier to temper his body and would not come to Kong Huan.","After Kong Huan communicated with Lin Yuan about the situation, she could face Xue Kang more calmly.","Regardless of whether her bloodline could be improved, she had to find a suitable way to interact with Xue Kang.","Kong Huan contacted Lin Yuan.","In fact, Lin Yuan had already thought of contacting Kong Huan before coming to the Scarlet Territory.","Before Lin Yuan went to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the only people he controlled were Fan Lou and Kong Huan.","Lin Yuan had already contacted Fan Lou and given him significant help.","However, Kong Huan and Lin Yuan were still out of contact.","If not for the fact that there were too many things going on in the Scarlet Territory, Lin Yuan would have already contacted Kong Huan more than once.","After all, Winter had clearly said that communicating through the jade would not consume much energy.","These consumptions were not as fast as Winter’s self-recovery!","After greeting Lin Yuan, Kong Huan directly explained her situation and needs.","“Master, I’ve already explained the situation of the Snow-covered Foxes to you just now. I want to rely on this child to enter the upper echelons of the Snow-covered Foxes. I have to raise my bloodline to Alluring Soul! Otherwise, this leader might wipe out the Alluring Foxes out of loyalty to his offspring! ”","Lin Yuan raised his eyebrow. Kong Huan’s development speed in the Northern Universe was not inferior to Fan Lou’s. She had actually established herself among the Snow-covered Foxes so quickly.","Kong Huan treated her child as an opportunity.","It was not difficult for Lin Yuan to help Kong Huan evolve her bloodline. He only needed to give a portion of his Alluring Fox bloodline to Kong Huan to absorb.","Not to mention that his Alluring Fox bloodline came from Kong Huan. He had separated it through the Body of All Spirits so she could also absorb it directly.","Apart from the bloodline, Lin Yuan also needed to provide Kong Huan with another batch of resources.","Lin Yuan had asked Kong Huan to develop in the Northern Universe, so he definitely had to give her something in return.","It was Lin Yuan’s decision that Kong Huan gave up her status as a member of Honor Absent Palace and moved to the North Universe. Lin Yuan needed to be responsible for Kong Huan!","Lin Yuan turned around and said, “Winter, I’ll have to trouble you to make a trip to the North Universe!”","Winter said with a smile, “Young Master, I happen to have something to do in the North Universe. I can deliver the supplies and finish these things along the way. I’ll be back in three days by using mystic techniques. I can ensure that Kong Huan receives the bloodline and resources you bestowed in time.”","Lin Yuan replied to Kong Huan, “Kong Huan, you will be able to receive what you want in three days. Apart from improving your bloodline, I will also provide you with a batch of supplies so that you can accelerate the development of the Alluring Foxes!","“It’s inconvenient to use the jade to communicate. Winter will give you a communication fey this time. You can communicate with me at any time through this communication fey!”","Fortune Treasure Palace wasn’t just a faction in the East Universe of the Sky Beyond the Clouds- it extended its influence across all four universes and had special honor guests there.","Fortune Treasure Palace selected the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower as its chosen medium of communication due to its unique ability to transcend time and space.."]},{"number":2922,"title":"Chapter 2922: Frigid Frost Marrow!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2922: Frigid Frost Marrow!","After Lin Yuan nurtured the first Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower the first time, he no longer focused on nurturing it.","Lin Yuan had retracted his energy, but the entire Hundred Questions Beast army was constantly nurturing the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower.","The Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ramet had been raised to Immortal Breed and was able to communicate across universes.","If Lin Yuan wasn’t just one among many special honor guests at Fortune Treasure Palace, they wouldn’t treat him the same as the others. In that case, he wouldn’t need to bother Winter with this trip. He could simply ask Fortune Treasure Palace to teleport resources to Kong Huan.","Lin Yuan’s development in the East Universe had just begun, so he could not provide any more help to the Alluring Foxes.","Lin Yuan had already told Kong Huan about this.","Kong Huan was both happy and touched by Lin Yuan’s words. To Kong Huan, it was very difficult to teleport resources across time and space.","Since Lin Yuan had guaranteed that he would receive the resources within three days, he must have spent a lot of effort.","Kong Huan had only asked Lin Yuan to help her evolve her bloodline. Apart from that, Lin Yuan had also taken the initiative to provide her with a batch of resources.","Lin Yuan treated her much better than Xue Kang did. Although Xue Kang doted on him, he had yet to use his identity as the Speaker to make her a member of North Universe’s Heaven Guiding Palace’s parliament.","She had already made many open and hinted requests to Xue Kang, but the latter had always brushed her off.","Lin Yuan’s answer gave Kong Huan a sense of security.","Kong Huan could use Lin Yuan’s help to fight with Xue Kang and even control him.","If Kong Huan were to plot against Xue Kang alone, she was afraid that she would make a mistake and anger Xue Kang. This might even result in her implicating all the Alluring Foxes!","Until now, some people in the fox race still had their own schemes. This was because there were other Alluring Foxes who had also raised their bloodline to Alluring Bones.","By evolving her bloodline to Alluring Soul, Kong Huan could truly suppress the Alluring Foxes and become their absolute leader.","Only when the Alluring Foxes were united would they be able to obtain the greatest benefits from interacting with the Snow-covered Foxes.","Otherwise, Kong Huan was afraid that she would be stabbed in the back by the Alluring Foxes while she was working hard for their future!","After contacting Lin Yuan, Kong Huan only needed to quietly wait for him to provide her with resources to upgrade her bloodline!","Kong Huan received the resources that Lin Yuan had provided for her and met Winter again.","Winter’s aura was even more oppressive than Xue Kang’s. This meant that Winter was probably stronger than Xue Kang in terms of raw strength!","Kong Huan racked her brains but could not figure out Lin Yuan’s identity and which species he came from.","Kong Huan would never treat Lin Yuan as a native of that Class 2 world.","Kong Huan, who could not figure it out, stopped studying Lin Yuan’s identity. She only needed to know that Lin Yuan was her master. Lin Yuan did not only control her but would also provide her with real resources!","Kong Huan bowed deeply to Winter.","“Lord Winter, thank you for coming all this way for the Alluring Foxes. These are the resources that we have recently gathered in the Snow-covered Foxes’ territory. I’ll give these resources to you now!”","Kong Huan handed a spatial equipment to Winter while bowing to him.","Kong Huan knew that Winter was Lin Yuan’s true confidant.","Regardless of whether Winter was in Lin Yuan’s hands or was a free agent, Kong Huan wanted to use these resources to prove the speed of development of the Alluring Foxes since arriving at the North Universe. It proved to Lin Yuan that the Alluring Foxes were very capable and had obtained so many resources from the North Universe in such a short period!","In fact, most of these resources were not obtained by the Alluring Foxes with their own abilities. The Alluring Foxes received them because of Xue Kang’s affection for Kong Huan.","As a genuine leader of the Snow-covered Fox Clan, Xue Kang had an abundance of resources.","Xue Kang was actually not very generous to Kong Huan.","Xue Kang had many partners, and Kong Huan was only one of them. She was not even the most outstanding one. She could not even be ranked in the top ten. Some of Xue Kang’s female fox partners had already reached the Holy Spirit level or even pinnacle Holy Spirit level.","In spite of the eliteness of the Alluring Foxes’ bloodline, increasing their strength could increase the strength of their bloodline.","The reason Kong Huan was so uneasy before communicating with Lin Yuan was that she was afraid that Xue Kang would only be temporarily interested in her.","After her popularity passed, he would become cold towards her.","Before her bloodline reached Alluring Soul, Kong Huan did not dare to try to capture Xue Kang’s heart.","Xue Kang’s son in her womb was Kong Huan’s greatest bargaining chip. Only by improving Kong Huan’s bloodline could her bargaining chip unleash its full value!","Compared to capturing Xue Kang’s heart, Kong Huan wanted Lin Yuan to acknowledge her.","On the surface, the Alluring Foxes were the Snow-covered Foxes’ dependent species,but in reality. Lin Yuan was their master!","Winter did not take the spatial equipment from Kong Huan and said in a slightly gentle tone, “The Alluring Foxes need resources now more than ever. Young Master has given a large number of resources to the Alluring Foxes this time. Save your own resources for other uses!","“When I came, I observed the situation of the Alluring Foxes. I saw that the younger generation has been nurtured well. It shows that you’ve put in a lot of effort in your species’ development.","Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. Young Master hasn’t visited the North Universe to develop, so there’s basically no need for him to take the initiative to look for you.","“If you encounter anything, you can directly report to Young Master through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, or report the situation here to Young Master every once in a while. The leaders of the Snow-covered Foxes are promiscuous when they are young but will eventually choose a mate to be their queen. If your bloodline advances to Alluring Soul, you can try to develop in this direction!","“You know better than me how to win the favor of a Snow-covered Fox leader.","Apart from the things you need and numerous Creator resources, Young Master also asked me to hand this drop of Frigid Frost Marrow to you. It will definitely be extremely useful for your development among the Snow-covered","Foxes!”","Kong Huan was very happy to hear Winter’s words.","Kong Huan was so happy at first because she had another chance to contact Lin","Yuan.","Although Lin Yuan was not looking for her, she could report to him every once in a while.","Only by communicating could they deepen the relationship between master and servant.","Kong Huan felt that she and the Alluring Foxes were not important, but Winter’s words meant that Lin Yuan was interested in their future!","That drop of Frigid Frost Marrow was an ice-type treasure. Only a few drops were found in 100,000,000 old glaciers.","She was pregnant with a Snow-covered Fox descendant. Not only could she strengthen her physique by introducing the Frigid Frost Marrow into her body, but her body would also gain ice and snow attributes.","It could also nourish the child in her womb, increase the child’s affinity with the ice and snow energy, and increase the innate coldness of the Snow-covered Foxes.","A leader would indeed be happy to have a son, especially since this son was Xue Kang’s first son.","However, compared to having many children, Xue Kang hoped that his children would be extraordinary geniuses!","The Snow-covered Foxes placed great importance on nurturing the younger generation. Every fox leader was proud to have powerful and talented offspring, and Xue Kang was naturally no exception!","Kong Huan could already imagine how Xue Kang would react if she absorbed the Frigid Frost Marrow and gave birth to an extremely talented son for him.","She was not worried that Xue Kang’s future nurturing would cause her child to be separated from her.","There had always been a secret of the Alluring Fox Clan, which was that the Alluring Fox Clan could decide the gender of their offspring when nurturing one.","Female Alluring Foxes had a high status, but each branch could only give birth to at most three female members.","Male foxes worked as servants. This was very similar to the King Blood Jackals. However, the male Blood Jackals would at least have a chance to make a name for themselves. However, the male Alluring Foxes did not have such a chance at all.","On this front, the Snow-covered Foxes and Alluring Foxes were complete opposites.","Only males were eligible to become leaders, while females usually served as assistants to males.","Kong Huan could use her bloodline to ensure that this child of hers was a male.","Moreover, through the contract between her bloodline and the child, she would ensure that her child would always be closest to her!","The Alluring Foxes had a glorious history. When they were at their most glorious, they were above many other foxes. This also included the extinct powerful fox species.","Previously, Kong Huan had never come into contact with an Alluring Soul bloodline. After sensing its power from Lin Yuan, Kong Huan began to believe some of the records kept by the species.","As the current leader of the Alluring Foxes, Kong Huan wanted to lead her species to continuous development. She would use the Snow-covered Foxes as a springboard to jump into a brighter future!","The Alluring Foxes were best at charming people. Using other races as springboards could be said to be the most common method of the Alluring Foxes.","Kong Huan took the Frigid Frost Marrow from Winter and knelt on the ground with her head lowered at Winter’s feet.","“Thank you for your generous reward, Lord Lin Yuan. I will definitely lead the","Alluring Foxes in creating a world for you! It’s just that absorbing the Frigid Frost Marrow requires nurturing from external forces. I hope you can help me complete the absorption of the Frigid Frost Marrow so that its energy can be absorbed by the fetus in my womb! This way, the precious resource from Lord Lin Yuan won’t go to waste!”","Winter looked down at Kong Huan, who was prostrating in front of him.","Kong Huan’s words were very interesting. In order to get his help, she even mentioned Lin Yuan’s reward.","Winter didn’t feel offended by this. In fact, he felt a little impressed.","The more Winter thought about it, the more it would help Lin Yuan to expand his territory in the North Universe.","Lin Yuan had asked him to bring the marrow to Kong Huan because he wanted him to help her absorb it. Even if Kong Huan didn’t say anything, he would help Kong Huan absorb the Frigid Frost Marrow.","Winter was quite satisfied with Kong Huan’s development. He raised his hand and a wisp of cold air shot into Kong Huan’s body from his fingertips.","In an instant, Kong Huan felt that her internal organs had been frozen.","Her mind, soul, and spirit were protected by this wisp of energy and were not affected at all.","The Frigid Frost Marrow in her hand fused into her body under the guidance of the cold air.","Kong Huan’s soul, mind, and spirit remained in this huge icehouse for an unknown period. When she woke up, she felt that her body had entered a completely new state.","Kong Huan could not help but be fascinated by this ethereal state. The cold air had actually turned her bones into jade bones!","Kong Huan subconsciously touched her abdomen. She could feel the sturdiness of the little creature in her there.","Kong Huan knew that Winter had given her this opportunity. Just as Kong Huan stood up to thank Winter, she realized that he had disappeared.","When the coldness on her body completely dissipated, Kong Huan felt a rancid smell drilling into her nose.","Kong Huan looked down at her body and realized that there was a thick layer of grayish-black turbid matter attached to it.","Kong Huan hurriedly went to wash up and change her clothes. After washing up, Kong Huan was stunned by the person in the mirror.","The person in the mirror looked like her, but the skin, bone, temperament, and charm of the person in the mirror far exceeded her own!","With a face like hers, even if her bloodline did not increase to Alluring Soul, Kong Huan was confident she could try to capture Xue Kang’s heart.","However, Kong Huan could not explain the changes in her body to Xue Kang.","Before Xue Kang returned, Kong Huan had to complete her bloodline transformation.","It was understandable that her facial features had become exquisite because of the metamorphosis of her bloodline. Kong Huan did not want Xue Kang to have doubts about her after he returned.","Once Xue Kang suspected her, it would be very difficult for Xue Kang to truly love her!","Kong Huan absorbed the blood essence that Lin Yuan had given her.","Two days later, when Kong Huan woke up again, a seductive beauty lingered in the room.","Kong Huan’s pinkish-purple eyes flickered slightly. As her eyes moved, Kong","Huan almost captured her own heart.","So this was the Alluring Soul bloodline!","Only when one’s bloodline reached Alluring Soul could they truly unleash the Alluring Foxes’ true strength.","It was only now that her bloodline had reached Alluring Soul that Kong Huan felt like she had reached a higher level.."]},{"number":2923,"title":"Chapter 2923: Unparalleled Beauty Among the Foxeses!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2923: Unparalleled Beauty Among the Foxeses!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Kong Huan carefully comprehended her bloodline first before scrutinizing her appearance. In terms of appearance and temperament, even Xue Kang’s most favored women couldn’t compare to her.","Just as Kong Huan was about to take the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower to communicate with Lin Yuan and express her gratitude, she discovered the spirit qi crystals and soul-type spiritual ingredients that Lin Yuan had stored in the spatial equipment.","After a rough estimate, there were at least 30,000 spirit qi crystals. These spirit qi crystals were sufficient for her to enhance her strength and help the Alluring Foxes develop.","Dealing with Xue Kang was actually just the first step for the Alluring Foxes to establish a connection with the Snow-covered Foxes.","As the Alluring Foxes continued to develop, it was inevitable that the female Alluring Foxes would marry a large number of male Snow-covered Foxes. By that time, the Snow Covered Foxes would become a force that the Alluring Foxes could rely on and use.","Kong Huan’s bloodline had evolved to Alluring Soul, giving her the ability to help her subordinates break through to Alluring Bone.","Kong Huan possessed a strong sense of community and was very concerned about the development of her species. This trait of hers was also why Lin Yuan had taken a fancy to Kong Huan. As opposed to spending resources to support an expert, Lin Yuan was more willing to support the entire species. The value and benefits that a species could offer Lin Yuan outweighed those of what an expert could bring him.","Kong Huan was very nervous when she contacted Lin Yuan through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. She was well aware of Lin Yuan’s temperament and was afraid that he would ignore her. She had only contacted Lin Yuan twice since she had been recruited by him.","After contacting Lin Yuan, Kong Huan had been waiting on the sidelines. Soon, Kong Huan received a response to the message she had sent to Lin Yuan.","[Lin Yuan]: Kong Huan, you don’t have to be polite with me. You can use the resources I provide for you as you see fit. There’s no need to conserve them.","[Lin Yuan]: Once you’ve used them up, I will find an opportunity to provide more for you.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan’s reply, Kong Huan felt a warm glow in her heart. Lord Lin Yuan was supporting the Alluring Foxes’ development. He was going to provide them with more resources in the future. Before Kong Huan could thank Lin Yuan again, he sent another message.","[Lin Yuan]: Kong Huan, your bloodline should have been successfully enhanced, right? At Alluring Soul grade, it will be a little difficult to evolve further.","[Lin Yuan]: For now, focus on your development within the Snow-covered Foxes, and don’t worry about enhancing your bloodline. I will help you enhance it in the future.","The reason Lin Yuan told Kong Huan it was difficult to improve her bloodline further was that he had previously tried to enhance it. However, Lin Yuan did not gain much from his evolution. If Lin Yuan wanted to improve his Alluring Foxes bloodline, it would take a long time, even with the Body of All Spirits.","Kong Huan’s bloodline had been enhanced with Lin Yuan’s help. Under such circumstances, it would be extremely difficult for her bloodline to evolve by itself. Lin Yuan did not want Kong Huan to spend time and energy on things that may not be achievable.","The most important thing for Kong Huan now was to expand Lin Yuan’s territory in the North Universe according to Lin Yuan’s request.","Kong Huan was very smart and immediately understood what Lin Yuan meant.","[Kong Huan]: Rest assured, Lord Lin Yuan. I will definitely focus on the Alluring Foxes’ development and consider it my foremost duty at present. I will strive to let you be able to borrow the power of the Snow-covered Foxes within three years.","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with Kong Huan’s response. In terms of alertness, Kong Huan’s level of alertness was not inferior to Fan Lou. She could clearly understand his intentions. Since Kong Huan had promised Lin Yuan, it was unlikely that she would break her promise and upset him.","[Lin Yuan]: Previously, I chose to make the Alluring Foxes relinquish their power in the East Universe and head to the North Universe to develop, causing your species to suffer a huge loss.","[Lin Yuan]: I made such a request back then because I had my own considerations and concerns. I will definitely compensate for the losses you suffered in the East Universe in the future.","Lin Yuan’s words were a promise to Kong Huan and an acknowledgment of her efforts during this period. If he had not provided Kong Huan with resources, Lin Yuan’s words might have seemed a little fake. However, he had provided Kong Huan with a large amount of resources and helped her gain a foothold within the Snow-covered Foxes now.","What Lin Yuan had done was equivalent to helping Kong Huan take back the glory of the Alluring Foxes, especially since he had enhanced her bloodline to Alluring Soul.","With Kong Huan’s bloodline evolution alone, their development in the North Universe was bound to surpass that in the East Universe. Their development in the East Universe had had little to do with the time they had spent establishing themselves there, rather, it primarily depended on their strength. Improving the top combatants of the Alluring Foxes would allow them to live a better life.","[Kong Huan]: Thank you, Lord Lin Yuan, for taking our Alluring Foxes into consideration. We will certainly make the best use of our time to develop.","[Kong Huan]: At present, I haven’t encountered any resistance with the Snow-covered Foxes. However, if we face any obstacles in the future, I hope that Lord can lend a helping hand to us.","Kong Huan had always been a thoughtful person. Now that her bloodline had evolved and she was pregnant with Xue Kang’s child, she believed that Xue Kang would treat her better.","However, Xue Kang was not the only Foxes leader within the Snow-covered","Foxes. In the future, if the Alluring Foxes wanted to thrive within the Snow-covered Foxes, it would be necessary to interact with more than just Xue Kang.","If she encountered any trouble in the future, Kong Huan could only ask Lin Yuan for help. She believed that she had to say what she needed to say in advance. Kong Huan hoped that Lin Yuan would understand their difficulties within the Snow-Covered Foxes. She didn’t want Lin Yuan to perceive them as inadequate when she asked for his help in the future.","[Lin Yuan]: Of course. If you face any difficulties in the future, feel free to inform me.","Lin Yuan did not chat with Kong Huan for long, and the latter also did not dare to waste too much of his time. After ending the communication with Lin Yuan, Kong Huan took advantage of the time before Xue Kang returned to thoroughly address every aspect of the Alluring Foxes.","Kong Huan had eliminated nearly 1/6 of the Alluring Foxes. She had long harbored intentions to eliminate these people but could not bear to do so. Despite their unwillingness to submit to her, they were still the species’ inherent strength. However, the current rise of the Alluring Foxes had already become a sure bet, and prioritizing their stability outweighed the need to preserve their strength.","Xue Kang was very particular about ostentation. Before Xue Kang’s return, there would be a special ceremonial officer to inform the various dependent species. Every dependent species had to send a representative to welcome Xue Kang’s return.","In the past, Kong Huan would casually send a few outstanding young female Alluring Foxes to welcome Xue Kang. Due to the characteristics of their bloodline and the fact that Kong Huan was favored by Xue Kang, the Alluring Foxes had become the target of public scrutiny. What Kong Huan had to do her best to keep the Alluring Foxes low-key so that they would not arouse disdain from the other fox species.","However, as Kong Huan was preparing to seduce Xue Kang, keeping a low profile would undoubtedly hinder Kong Huan’s goal. Moreover, Kong Huan was pregnant with Xue Kang’s child. Once this matter was leaked, it would be impossible to keep a low profile.","When Xue Kang’s first offspring was born, the Snow-covered Fox leaders would definitely announce it to the world and attract tens of thousands of foxes to pay homage. In that case, she might as well make a grand appearance and show off her charm when welcoming Xue Kang.","Kong Huan had been inquiring about Xue Kang’s preferences, and she learned that he actually did not like people who maintained a low profile. Xue Kang liked female foxes who were generous.","Kong Huan looked at herself in the mirror and began to dress up. In the past, she had always liked to wear gorgeous clothes, but now, her stunning face, paired with an enchanting demeanor and aura, would captivate all who beheld her. As opposed to gorgeous clothes, plain clothes were more suitable for Kong","Huan now.","Kong Huan knew exactly how to maximize the characteristics of her appearance. Dressed in a white dress without any makeup, she was a stunning beauty amidst the snowy landscape.","Under normal circumstances, a dependent species would have to send at least 50 people to welcome a leader like Xue Kang. Kong Huan selected nine members of the Alluring Foxes who possessed exceptional beauty. However, standing beside Kong Huan, they merely appeared ordinary. If nine ordinary-looking members of the Alluring Foxes were to stand beside Kong","Huan, her striking appearance would make them seem noticeably out of place.","Over the past few days, the Alluring Foxes had already become aware that Kong Huan’s bloodline had undergone a metamorphosis. Apart from those who had been opposing Kong Huan and causing trouble for her, the other members were exceptionally happy about the evolution of her bloodline. Everyone in the Alluring Foxes was well aware that Kong Huan’s bloodline evolution would bring about a better future for the species.","As Kong Huan led the nine Alluring Foxes to the palace where Xue Kang lived, countless foxes were captivated by Kong Huan’s presence. Due to the bloodline characteristics of the Alluring Foxes, Kong Huan’s appeal wasn’t limited to male foxes alone, even female foxes could be equally drawn to her.","During this period, many people from other dependent species ran over to greet Kong Huan. Kong Huan maintained a lukewarm attitude toward these dependent species, albeit far less enthusiastic than before.","Kong Huan had just arrived at the territory of the Snow-covered Foxes, so she naturally had to build a good relationship with the other fox species. Perhaps when she encountered something in the future, these other species would be able to lend a helping hand.","Now that Kong Huan was thinking of controlling Xue Kang, she naturally would not care about their dependent species. If she got too close to any dependent species during the process of interacting with Xue Kang, it was very likely to bring disaster to them and would even incur Xue Kang displeasure.","Right now, these fox species members who were interacting with her were simply lusting after her body, nothing more. These people were too insignificant to the Snow-covered Foxes, and were not worthy of her effort. There were many dependent species who came to welcome Xue Kang, but even among the crowd, Kong Huan was still the most eye-catching one.","Even though Xue Kang’s phoenix had already appeared, many foxes still couldn’t help but look at Kong Huan. Xue Kang had always valued the attitude of his dependent species toward him. He had already observed that many of them were not making eye contact with him, which caused his expression to darken.","Xue Kang was not in a hurry to flare up. Instead, he looked in the direction of these gazes and immediately saw Kong Huan standing in the crowd.","Kong Huan stood there in a white dress and looked at him with a smile.","The few Alluring Foxes Foxes behind Kong Huan, who were dressed in vibrant colors, possessed exceptional beauty. Still, compared to Kong Huan, who was dressed in white, they paled in comparison and were not worth mentioning.","Among Xue Kang’s companions, the majority were female Snow-covered","Foxes, Xue Kang tended to prefer members of his own species over outsiders. But now, the appearance and temperament of the female Snow-covered Foxes beside him had become inferior.","Xue Kang found it hard to shift his gaze away from Kong Huan to the extent that he had forgotten his displeasure with other dependent species earlier.","Xue Kang did not recognize Kong Huan at first. He only confirmed Kong Huan’s identity after seeing the Alluring Foxeses behind her. Kong Huan was the mate he had chosen. Previously, Xue Kang’s interest in her was merely fleeting, and he did not pay much attention to her. Now apart from Kong Huan, Xue Kang could no longer tolerate anyone else.","Xue Kang had always done things as he pleased. As a leader, he had absolute autonomy. He stepped out of his phoenix carriage and walked towards Kong Huan. He extended his hand to invite Kong Huan to ride with him. This was an unprecedented encounter for Xue Kang’s companions.","Xue Kang’s favored companions had developed strong hostility towards Kong Huan, but it was only as simple as hostility. Being on the receiving end of Xue Kang’s care, his favored companions would not dare to find trouble with Kong Huan. Instead, they worried that Kong Huan might cause them trouble.","The charm of the Alluring Foxes could be transmitted through physical contact. The moment Kong Huan held Xue Kang’s hand, her Alluring Soul bloodline had already begun to subtly influence Xue Kang, intensifying his desire to draw closer to Kong Huan and win her favor. The reason the Alluring Foxes could dominate the world previously was that their bloodline effects on other fox lifeforms would not be detectable.","Despite having tens of thousands of companions, Xue Kang felt nervous sitting next to Kong Huan, like a young child. He was at a loss for what to do.","Kong Huan sat beside Xue Kang and revealed a pleasantly surprised expression. She did not take the initiative to talk to him. She wanted to reshape her interaction with Xue Kang. She wanted him to take the initiative.."]},{"number":2924,"title":"Chapter 2924 Evolving Faerie!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2924 Evolving Faerie!","Kong Huan had her own schemes in her heart. The Alluring Fox relied on their bloodline to manipulate emotions, allowing Kong Huan to obtain the greatest benefits from the interweaving and game of emotions with Xue Kang.","Xue Kang and Kong Huan’s relationship seemed like a match made in heaven, but it was actually a scheme that Kong Huan had meticulously orchestrated in order to let the Alluring Fox find the protection of the Snow-Covered Fox and use their power for their own benefit.","Kong Huan could acutely sense a hint of turmoil in Xue Kang’s aura beside her, indicating that she had accomplished half of her goal. It was fine as long as Xue Kang was interested in her. During her interactions with Xue Kang, his feelings for her would inevitably deepen continuously.","Lin Yuan was about to return to Sky City. He harbored no concerns regarding Kong Huan’s situation at all. Firstly, as a superior, Lin Yuan had to have faith in Kong Huan’s competence, given that he had chosen to place her in an important position. Furthermore, Lin Yuan had provided Kong Huan with everything that she needed and all of her requirements for development had been fulfilled. Under such circumstances, Lin Yuan would not be able to do anything if Kong Huan were to encounter any more problems.","Lin Yuan had made huge strides in the development of the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Before Sky City could stabilize its footing, Lin Yuan started to build faith country based on the actual situation in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Building the faith country had taken a lot of effort on all the members of Sky City.","In the beginning, Lin Yuan had taken large strides to grasp the situation and challenge the core members of Sky City. During the decades of development in the main world, the core members of Sky City had grown accustomed to a life of comfort and had become lax. At present, Lin Yuan had yet to return to Sky City, but he believed that all the members in Sky City had entered their optimal state.","Lin Yuan’s initial bold steps did not indicate blind arrogance. On the contrary, he preferred to proceed with caution and stability. For a long time to come, Lin Yuan would develop his faction in the East Universe.","Apart from investing in resources, Lin Yuan could not offer Kong Huan much help. Of course, if Lin Yuan could satisfy Kong Huan’s resource needs, yet Kong Huan was not able to let the Alluring Fox gain a foothold in the North Universe, then their existence would hold no meaning for Lin Yuan.","Spring, whose expression was steady, suddenly glanced in a direction, and Winter reacted the same way as Spring. Liu Chen, Liu Yao, Kani, and Jin Chen did not discover anything. However, they had already noticed the changes in Spring and Winter’s expressions. They followed Spring and Winter’s gaze and looked into the distance, trying their best to see what they had discovered.","Spring and Winter took the lead in speaking to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, there’s a special disturbance coming from the east and west, and it seemed to have connections with the faeries. It’s most likely that a natural landscape is evolving to a faerie or perhaps it’s a breakthrough for a faerie seeking evolution. No matter what the reason is, I think it’s necessary for us to go and take a look since we’ve discovered it! We’re quite far away from this faerie. It’s hard to sense it here. However, those species and factions that are closer will definitely be able to sense the aura and also rush over!”","Spring and Winter’s words did not surprise Kani and Jin Chen much, but it shocked Liu Chen and Liu Yao. Despite their best efforts to investigate, Liu Chen and Liu Yao couldn’t detect the slightest anomaly. This was equivalent to telling them that there was an insurmountable gap between them and Spring and Winter.","Having witnessed Winter demonstrate his strength, Liu Chen and Liu Yao were able to assess and anticipate his abilities. Now, it seemed that Winter had not used his full strength when dealing with the both of them.","Lin Yuan now understood the value of a faerie. The first faerie that Lin Yuan came into contact with was the one that helped Begin Lady pass the Heaven’s Trial. After passing the Heaven’s Trial, she directly became an intermediate faerie.","Lin Yuan could not help but be speechless. He did not expect that he would leave such an impression on Liu Chen and Liu Yao. As the leader of a large faction, he believed that his approach to handling matters was certainly not ruthless. While it was true that such an image would help the management of the faction members, Lin Yuan felt that there was no necessity to establish such an image. He did not wish for Sky City’s superiors and inferiors to have such a relationship in the future.","Lin Yuan personally stepped forward and helped Liu Yao up as he spoke to her in an extremely serious tone, “You don’t have to be so careful with me. All of you have now become my subordinates. From now on, you will join Sky City as Kani and Jin Chen did. As long as you refrain from actions that endanger Sky City and remain loyal to me, I will treat you with equal respect. While it’s appropriate to be cold when dealing with those star pirates, but when dealing with my own people, I think you should be able to feel my sincerity.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, not only did Liu Chen and Liu Yao nod, but Kani and Jin Chen also nodded vigorously. They had been by Lin Yuan’s side for such a long time that they could naturally sense his sincerity. From the perspective of a superior, Lin Yuan could be considered someone who treated his subordinates the best. Not only did he provide resources to Liu Chen and Liu Yao, but he also provided resources to their children.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao’s children would not be of any help to Lin Yuan, yet he chose to provide resources for them. Liu Chen and Liu Yao were aware that this was a gesture of respect towards them.","Jin Chen had only recently become Lin Yuan’s subordinate, yet he had already obtained a large number of spirit qi crystals, which he could not have obtained with his own ability alone. Jin Chen could use these spirit qi crystals and vitality to enhance his bloodline without needing to resort to killing his own kind to do so.","Among the four of them, Kani was definitely the one who had benefited the most from Lin Yuan. Kani’s bloodline had been successfully enhanced with Lin Yuan’s help, and her strength had risen from the pinnacle of the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom to the Holy Spirit level.","The King Blood Jackal could be considered kings in the wilderness of the North of the Lonely River. However, once they ventured into other areas, not only would they not be able to become kings, but they would also face challenges in their survival. Back then, if the King Blood Jackal could thrive in other areas, Kani would not have let them relocate to a godforsaken place like the North of the Lonely River.","Liu Chen, Liu Yao, Kani, and the others all expressed their loyalty to Lin Yuan. At this moment, they felt a sense of belonging to Lin Yuan. It was not easy for the four of them to obtain a sense of belonging.","During Lin Yuan’s conversation with them, he didn’t delay the journey. After traveling in the direction indicated by Spring and Winter, Liu Chen and Liu Yao’s faces showed expressions of astonishment.","At present, Liu Chen and Liu Yao were also able to sense the aura emitted by the intermediate faerie. Apart from its aura, Liu Chen and Liu Yao also sensed a large number of people gathering here. Among them, there was no lack of auras emitted by holy spirit experts. Judging from it, it was evident how many factions had their eyes set on the intermediate faerie.","At this point, Spring and Winter could already confirm that there wasn’t a natural landscape that was about to transform into an intermediate faerie. Instead, it was a lower faerie desperately trying to evolve. A lower faerie must have encountered difficulties to be evolving here. Otherwise, there was really no need for a lower faerie to take risks in an unfamiliar environment. Faeries should know very well that their bodies were a huge treasure. They were very careful about their own safety.","Spring and Winter sensed carefully and could confirm that there was only the aura of one faerie here. This meant that no members of the Faerie Institution were present.","Spring and Winter exchanged glances, and from the expressions in their eyes, they could confirm that they had made the same assumptions. Winter said to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, the people from the Faerie Institution haven’t arrived here yet. The Faerie Institution has the means to detect the location of the faeries. It is a method closely related to bloodlines that can’t be concealed. The Faerie Institution’s headquarters is in the West Universe, but there are also Faerie Institution factions scattered in the East Universe. I suggest that we take this faerie away before the Faerie Institution arrives. As long as we can take this faerie away without anyone knowing, we can push the blame to the other factions present!”"]},{"number":2925,"title":"Chapter 2925 The Disappearing Emerald Lady!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2925 The Disappearing Emerald Lady!","At any time, there was always a risk in seeking opportunities. Letting these factions be punished by the Faerie Institution to take the blame for him could be considered making the most of the situation.","Winter had never been concerned about the life and death of other factions and species. As an old fellow who had crossed countless eras, Winter possessed a transcendent understanding of life and death.","Lin Yuan raised his brows and acknowledged Winter’s words. Indeed, it would be better to find an opportunity to take this lower faerie away instead of staying and fighting with so many factions to contend for it. With Spring and Winter by his side, even if the Faerie Institution arrived, Lin Yuan believed that they would not be able to compete with him. However, Lin Yuan did not want to clash with the Faerie Institution.","Based on Lin Yuan’s understanding of the Begin Lady and Celestial Sight, he held a good impression of the faeries. He believed that each faerie’s previous form was a blissful haven. If it could cooperate with the Faerie Institution in the future, it would definitely bring great benefits to Lin Yuan.","“Winter, your suggestion is not bad. Let’s do this according to your suggestion!”","Winter bowed to Lin Yuan and said softly, “Young Master, let Spring protect you here. You don’t have to go forward anymore. Let me go and bring over the lower faerie that’s about to evolve. His lower faerie’s aura is very chaotic, and there are several energy fluctuations near it. It’s likely that the faerie is engaged in battle with someone or being plotted against.”","Lin Yuan had helped Begin Lady and Celestial Sight pass the Heaven’s Trial, so he was well aware of how dangerous it was for a faerie. When a faerie went through the Heaven’s Trial, they would try their best to seek protection from the outside world to successfully pass. While being harassed, it was impossible to pass the Heaven’s Trial.","Lin Yuan nodded and replied, “In that case, I’ll wait for you here. If that lower faerie is in danger, you might as well lend a hand to help it.”","Upon hearing this, Winter raised his hand and formed a hand seal. A crescent-shaped ice mirror appeared in front of Lin Yuan. The ice mirror displayed Winter’s perspective, and Lin Yuan could clearly see all his movements reflected in the mirror. This experience was rather novel to Lin Yuan.","Liu Chen, Liu Yao, Kani, Jin Chen, and the others all broke out in cold sweat for the other factions who had their eyes set on this faerie. Should this faerie really be under attack now, prompting investigation by the Faerie Institution, then it suddenly disappeared, the factions present would certainly pay for the Faerie Institution’s anger. There was no doubt about this.","As powerful lifeforms, they all knew the benefits of a faerie to a faction, especially a faerie that was about to evolve into an intermediate faerie. However, no one would choose to attack a faerie unless it was absolutely necessary. Apart from being afraid of the power of the Faerie Institution, it was mostly because they didn’t want to interfere with a faerie. For a faerie, besides the considerable danger of evolving its bloodline, the opportunity for bloodline evolution was equally rare. Once lost, it would be difficult to obtain it again.","Emerald Lady had been resisting tenaciously as if she had gone mad. Her resistance had completely infuriated the experts of the Evil Forest Tiger. These Evil Forest Tiger experts launched one attack after another at Emerald Lady, indicating a clear intent to kill her. The leader of Evil Tiger Forest was prepared to kill Emerald Lady after confirming that she refused to cooperate and didn’t leave any room for negotiation. However, such behavior was clearly something that those sparrows were unwilling to see.","If the people from the Evil Forest Tiger killed Emerald Lady, wouldn’t the other factions’ efforts be in vain!? A dead faerie was far less valuable than a living faerie. Emerald Lady had already suffered some injuries to her body. If she sustained more injuries, the other factions may not be able to help Emerald Lady pass the Heaven’s Trial and let her evolve into an intermediate faerie.","At this moment, various factions chose to intervene, determined not to let the Evil Tiger Forest harm Emerald Lady any further. Apart from helping Emerald Lady get rid of the people from Evil Forest Tiger, it was also crucial to calm Emerald Lady’s emotions as much as possible. The Evil Forest Tigers were really stupid. Even if they had to employ some methods to capture Emerald Lady, they definitely shouldn’t have targeted her vulnerabilities. This way, even if they really managed to control Emerald Lady, they wouldn’t be able to convince her to work for the Evil Forest Tiger in the future.","The people of the Evil Forest Tiger realized that other factions might become aware of the existence of Emerald Lady and that there might be other factions waiting in the wings, like mantises hunting cicadas while sparrows watch.","Capturing Emerald Lady, a faerie with special abilities, was something that the Evil Forest Tiger had been researching for the past 300 years. One of the Evil Forest Tiger branches was attacking Emerald Lady, while the other five branches remained hidden in the dark, preparing to wait for the sparrows to step forward and intimidate them.","The commotion had escalated. The members of the Evil Forest Tiger were really afraid that the Faerie Institution’s people would suddenly appear. All the factions present treated the Evil Forest Tiger as mantises, but little did they know that they also regarded the people from other factions in the same light. The factions bold enough to target the Evil Forest Tiger would all become resources for them.","In order to fight for Emerald Lady, the major factions engaged in a fight. The scene was very chaotic.","Upon seeing this scene, Emerald Lady’s despairing expression intensified. She was very regretful, as she did not expect such a serious consequence because of her negligence. In her heart, the heavenly pool that grew on her was like her own child. Emerald Lady had been using her roots to nourish the heavenly pool. If it weren’t for her nourishment of the heavenly pool, Emerald Lady could have evolved to a lower faerie at least ten thousand years earlier.","After the heavenly pool became a lower faerie, its abilities will establish a cycle with Emerald Lady’s. This cycle would be beneficial to both sides.","Just as Emerald Lady was in a state of despair, an inconspicuous snowflake descended from the sky and landed on her body. Right on the heels of that, an astonishing energy erupted from within the snowflakes, and Emerald Lady was sucked into the snowflakes. The moment she was sucked into the snowflake, all the factions pounced on the snowflake. However, the snowflake had actually disappeared silently under the eyes of all the factions. The aura emitted from Emerald Lady’s body was still lingering in the world, but she was no longer there.","The major factions present were not fools. They knew very well that this situation had occurred because an expert had used some special method to take Emerald Lady away. The power in the snowflakes didn’t come from Emerald Lady, and it most likely didn’t come from a faerie. Otherwise, the aura would not be so murderous. The moment the snowflake released its aura, everyone present had a feeling that if they did not dodge the aura released by the snowflake, they would definitely be frozen by it. Its aura had already surpassed the level that everyone present could imagine.","Emerald Lady was taken away by an expert in this way. Everyone present had no intention of continuing the fight. Without sufficient benefits, all battles were meaningless. However, it was clearly too late for the people from the major factions to escape."]},{"number":2926,"title":"Chapter 2926: Arrival of the Faerie Institution!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2926: Arrival of the Faerie Institution!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The entire sky suddenly darkened. However, what caused the sky to darken was not the thick rain clouds, but the monstrous yellow sand that covered the sky.","The yellow sand emitted a thunderous aura, but it did not affect the environment at all. On the contrary, it had a certain nourishing effect on the","environment.","The factions that dealt with the faeries in the East Universe were no strangers to this monstrous yellow sand. This was the ability of one of the higher faeries stationed in the East Universe by the Faerie Institution. This higher faerie had already lived for three eras and was exceptionally powerful. It was said that this higher faerie was formed from a desert and was one of the few intermediate faeries who were good at attacking.","The major factions present looked at the yellow sand in shock. They did not expect the Faerie Institution to arrive so quickly. Unfortunately, if the people from the Faerie Institution had arrived a moment earlier, Emerald Lady would not have been taken away by the snowflakes.","The fact that the Emerald Lady was taken away by the snowflakes in front of so many people was unbelievable to the Faerie Institution. If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they wouldn’t have believed it.","The lingering aura of the Emerald Lady remained, though her presence was no longer there. The people from the Faerie Institution would definitely vent their anger on the factions present. The only way for the major factions present to save themselves was to flee in all directions.","It was unlikely that there would be too many people from the Faerie","Institution. It seemed like there would only be two higher faeries at most.","The Faerie Institution had no way of keeping everyone here, hence if any one got caught by them, it would be purely bad luck on their part. Not only would they be unlucky, but their faction would also suffer fierce retaliation from the Faerie Institution.","Among the factions present, none were in a more awkward position than the Evil Forest Tiger. If the other five branches of the Evil Forest Tiger hadn’t emerged just now, only one branch of the Evil Tiger Forest would be present, and they would still have a chance of escaping amidst the chaos. Now that the Evil Forest Tiger’s six branches were all gathered here, the chances of escaping were minuscule. As long as one of them was captured by the Faerie Institution, the entire Evil Forest Tiger would not be able to escape punishment.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it was not difficult to find the faction behind an individual because it often had ties to the individual’s bloodline. It was precisely because of this reason that the experts from the major factions present were so flustered. Compared to their own deaths, these experts were more afraid that the species and factions behind them would be implicated.","The originally condensed yellow sand in the sky fell like raindrops. Every lifeform present seemed instinctively drawn to the sand, much like magnets. The yellow sand formed a layer of sand on the surface of these lifeforms, directly imprisoning them on the spot. However, the yellow sand did not stop moving. It would flow into the bodies of these lifeforms through their pores and seven apertures, cutting off their vitality from the inside out. The method was abnormally ruthless. This was in line with the Faerie Institution’s attitude toward those factions and individuals who posed a threat to the Faerie Institution or the faeries.","In the sky, a handsome male faerie with short yellow hair was furiously urging the rain of sand to descend. The reason why the sandstorm covered such a wide area was because this male faerie had activated his roots right from the start,","increasing the destructive power of the sand rain through his bloodline.","From the very beginning, this male faerie harbored the intention of killing everyone present who dared to target Emerald Lady. However, his expression gradually became solemn because he realized that he couldn’t sense the Emerald Lady’s existence. The atmosphere there clearly still had the dense aura of the Emerald Lady. She was about to face the Heaven’s Trial and transform her bloodline into an intermediate faerie.","Regardless of whether Emerald Lady was dead or had fallen into the hands of some faction, both outcomes deeply agitated Sand Abyss, causing him to be on the verge of going berserk.","At this moment, a figure out of thin air appeared beside Sand Abyss. The figure emanated an abnormally thick aura, like a lofty mountain. The aura emanating from this figure was different from the vibrant vitality exuded by Emerald Lady. It was heavy and suppressive, like a desolate mountain.","“Sand Abyss, when we do things in the East Universe, we have to take into account the reputation of the Supreme Palace. It’s not appropriate for you to activate your root power. Otherwise, hundreds of thousands of kilometers will turn into a desert within seven years. Countless lifeforms will perish because of you. This goes against the standards of conduct upheld by our Faerie Institution.","“Emerald Lady and I are transformed from natural landscapes of the same kind. Although we represent two extremes, I can investigate Emerald Lady and confirm her current situation. She was besieged by so many factions present, and she had also used her root power to manifest her faerie statue.”","“Emerald Lady’s lifespan has likely reached its end. You should grieve but not excessively. At this crucial moment, for Emerald Lady to continue depleting her root power solely for the sake of the heavenly pool that she nurtured back then is an exceedingly irresponsible and willful act. As an adult faerie, she has to pay the price for her decision. This does not just apply to Emerald Lady, but also us.”","This was the first time Sand Abyss had heard his old friend Deep Mountain speak so much. Sand Abyss understood very well that Deep Mountain had done so to comfort him. Deep Mountain knew about his relationship with Emerald Lady. It could be said that Emerald Lady had grown up under Sand Abyss’s protection. From the moment Emerald Lady become a faerie, Sand Abyss had fallen in love with her at first sight. Due to Sand Abyss strong desire to control, he also possessed a strong desire to control Emerald Lady, whom he had fallen in love with at first sight.","Even the heavenly pool that Emerald Lady had always cherished and nurtured within herself made Sand Abyss dissatisfied. Sand Abyss regretted interfering with Emerald Lady back then. If he hadn’t interfered, Emerald Lady might not have ended up like this.","“Deep Mountain, you have to help me find traces of the Emerald Lady. I don’t believe that these people here can kill her in such a short period of time. They don’t have it in them. As long as I find traces of Emerald Lady, I’ll help her complete her transformation even if I have to expend my root power!”","Deep Mountain’s expression darkened, “Sand Abyss, as one of the five envoys of the Faerie Institution stationed in the East Universe, your actions are jeopardizing your own interests. It doesn’t conform to the development guidelines of the Faerie Institution. You should know very well how much root power you need to use to help Emerald Lady survive the Heaven’s Trial if she’s really still alive.","“In the short term, the effects of consuming these roots may not be evident. However, when you have the next opportunity to transform your bloodline, it will pose a barrier, hindering your potential for further evolution in the future. Our Faerie Institution set such rules because we have too many precedents. It’s best if you don’t make a mistake. You’re the one with the highest chance of breaking through and becoming the faerie king among the five of us. If you want to use your bloodline power to help Emerald Lady, I’ll stop you.”","Deep Mountain was unusually serious when he said this. He did not want his good brother Sand Abyss to make a mistake. If Sand Abyss really used his root power to save Emerald Lady, how would Emerald Lady survive in the Faerie Institution in the future?!","Sand Abyss was not someone who could not distinguish between what was important and what was not. As long as he gave Sand Abyss some pointers, Sand Abyss would give up on this idea.","While speaking to Sand Abyss, Deep Mountain had already injected his root power into the ground under his feet and began to sense Emerald Lady.","Deep Mountain treated Emerald Lady as his younger sister, so he more or less had a good impression of her. Even if Deep Mountain was indifferent, he did not want anything to happen to Emerald Lady. However, no matter how hard Deep Mountain searched, he could not find any traces of Emerald Lady. This angered him and caused him to use the heavy pressure from the ground to crush many fellows who had already fled far away.","Lin Yuan’s location was extremely far away, so Winter put Emerald Lady into the snowflakes that he had condensed using his innate coldness. Unless someone with strength similar to Winter or who happened to be able to see through Winter’s innate coldness appeared, it would be practically impossible to discover Emerald Lady trapped in the snowflakes.","Winter used the innate coldness in the snowflakes to smoothen Emerald Lady’s bloodline and root power, which had become chaotic due to excessive stimulation. His actions immediately made Emerald Lady realize that the owner of the snowflakes was kind to her.","Emerald Lady had now completely calmed down. Although she felt sadness in her heart, she was also clear that her impulsiveness had passed, and she had survived. Certainly, she had to face the Heaven’s Trial. What she had to do was to try her best to ensure that she could survive the Heaven’s Trial and become an intermediate faerie.","Emerald Lady could guess that Sand Abyss would definitely avenge her when he arrived. Those fellows who targeted her and even cut off her pool’s future path would receive the punishment they deserved.","Winter rushed in front of Lin Yuan and waved his hand. Frost spread in all directions with Lin Yuan in the center, completely isolating his aura from the outside world. He crushed the snowflake containing the Emerald Lady, and her figure appeared in front of Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan could acutely sense that Emerald Lady was in an extremely bad state, but her bloodline was constantly trying to activate the energy of heaven. If not for Winter isolating Emerald Lady’s aura, the Heaven’s Trial could have descended at any moment.","Emerald Lady looked at Lin Yuan’s group with a defeated expression and did not speak immediately. Even if Winter had just helped her calm down the bloodline in her body, she could not immediately determine if they were friends or foes. From the Emerald Lady’s point of view, all the people who captured her should be classified as foes.","Lin Yuan took a step forward and used Morbius’ True Data to check on Emerald Lady before speaking seriously, ‘In your current condition, you need to absorb a large amount of pure spirit qi. Not only that, but you also need to absorb wood-element energy to nourish your bloodline. Otherwise, even if we’re willing to help you in Heaven’s Trial later, the benefits you obtain will be greatly reduced. I’m sure you don’t want this to happen. No matter what, you have to take responsibility for your future!”","Winter had brought Emerald Lady to Lin Yuan so that she could become his subordinate. Winter was a very smart person and knew how to help Lin Yuan subdue the Emerald Lady.","Emerald Lady was most likely most concerned about the heavenly pool that had its ley lines cut off and its water contaminated with various toxins. To others, helping restore the future of this heavenly pool may seem extremely difficult, but for Lin Yuan, it is remarkably simple.","As a natural landscape, even if the heavenly pool’s roots were cut off, it still possessed an extremely strong self-recovery ability. As long as he provided the root power needed by the heavenly pool, the heavenly pool would self-repair.","To the heavenly pool, root power consisted only of pure spirit qi and water-element energy. Lin Yuan could provide these things for the heavenly pool. Winter deliberately inquired about the heavenly pool’s situation to provide Lin Yuan with an opportunity to bring Emerald Lady under his wing as it was too dangerous to forcefully keep a faerie. Setting aside loyalty concerns, if the faerie were to contact the Faerie Institution, the Faerie Institution would definitely not let the matter rest.","Winter had already informed Lin Yuan of the information he had found out. Lin Yuan did not immediately mention the situation of the heavenly pool. Even if he were to do so, it would be more appropriate to wait until Emerald Lady passed the Heaven’s Trial.","Lin Yuan handed spatial equipment to Emerald Lady, “At present, we should be like enemies to you. You’ve caused a huge commotion here. We naturally have to come over to take a look. If it weren’t for our help, you know what would have happened to you now. We are both plunderers and saviors to you. I think the resources in this spatial equipment should be enough to show our goodwill!”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Emerald Lady’s eyes flickered slightly. She did not consider Lin Yuan and his group to be her saviors. If they were really her saviors, they could have stayed behind after helping her and waited for the Faerie Institution to arrive. By that time, the Faerie Institution would naturally reward them heavily. Yet, the group of people in front of her hadn’t done so because they were interested in her identity as a faerie and wanted to control her. As opposed to saviors, it should be more accurate to say that they were plunderers. If not for the fact that she really needed help now, Emerald Lady wouldn’t even want to try to discern whether the individuals before her were acting out of goodwill or malice.","Emerald Lady took the spatial equipment and examined it. She was shocked by the resources inside. She was well aware of her situation, and she didn’t actually have high expectations for her evolution to an intermediate faerie. With her current state, even if she returned to the Faerie Institution, they would most likely give up on her after weighing the pros and cons. Those intermediate and higher faeries wouldn’t possibly use their own root power to help her.","The rule of the Faerie Institution was to prioritize the protection of higher faeries as much as possible to ensure their combat power. However, in terms of resources, lower faeries could use them to increase the strength of the Faerie Institution.","The Faerie Institution had a quota for the resources provided to every lower faerie. Yet, the Creator resources accumulated in the spatial equipment given to her by this young man in front of him exceeded all the resources the Faerie Institution had provided after her transformation into a faerie.."]},{"number":2927,"title":"Chapter 2927: Emerald Lady’s Submission!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2927: Emerald Lady’s Submission!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","After inspecting the resources of this spatial equipment, Emerald Lady felt that the spatial equipment in her hand had become more valuable. With just the resources in the spatial equipment, she could replenish all her consumption. The fact that the people in front of her were willing to give her this spatial equipment made them appear as kind existences in Emerald Lady’s eyes. Emerald Lady needed these resources very much, but she didn’t immediately put them away and use them. She knew very well that the resources surely came with a price. Using these resources meant she needed to repay the group of people before her. Emerald Lady didn’t know what this group of people wanted her to do.","“You have provided me with so many Creator resources. What do you need me to do? My abilities may be unique, but clearly, they cannot create this much value. As a member of the Faerie Institution, I will never betray the Faerie Institution and let you use me to control more faeries!”","Emerald Lady looked at Lin Yuan warily. The group of people before her had brought her there from the encirclement of the major factions using a method that she had never heard of before. If it was for her sake alone, the price was really too high. Previously, she had heard that some faeries were controlled by evil factions. They would use the controlled faeries to attack more faeries. The Emerald Lady would rather give up her life than do such a thing.","Lin Yuan could see the wariness in Emerald Lady’s eyes. It was normal for her to be wary of him. If the Emerald Lady did not guard against him at this moment, wouldn’t she be a fool?!","Lin Yuan did not explain much to Emerald Lady. Instead, he released Begin Lady and Celestial Sight from the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Certainly, some things were easier for fellow faeries like Begin Lady and Celestial Sight to convey to Emerald Lady. As a faerie, Emerald Lady would also be more likely to listen to the Begin Lady and the Celestial Sight.","In terms of bloodline, the Begin Lady’s bloodline was higher than Emerald Lady’s. Fairies were very obedient to bloodlines. Using Celestial Sight as an example, it was extremely obedient to Begin Lady.","Emerald Lady hadn’t expected that two faeries would suddenly appear by Lin Yuan’s side, and one of them had a bloodline that surpassed her own.","Before Lin Yuan had summoned Begin Lady and Celestial Sight, he had already communicated with them.","Begin Lady’s heart ached for Emerald Lady. Upon sensing Emerald Lady’s state, she used her root power to nourish her. As an underground river that had nurtured countless lifeforms, Begin Lady’s root power was extremely healing. While there was a fundamental difference between this healing ability and Emerald Lady’s healing ability, they could complement each other to some extent.","As Begin Lady helped the Emerald Lady nourish her damaged roots, she conversed with her. Celestial Sight chimed in from time to time.","It did not take long for Lin Yuan to notice that Emerald Lady’s hostility toward him had decreased significantly. Despite maintaining a certain level of vigilance, Emerald Lady has begun to warm up to Begin Lady, who was willing to expend root power to help her.","“I’m Begin Lady, and you’re Emerald Lady. Our names are fated. Sister Emerald Lady, my path to becoming a faerie is much more difficult than yours. If it weren’t for Young Master’s help, I would have died in Heaven’s Trial. Celestial Sight was also supported by Young Master like me.","“Young Master sensed your aura and brought you here, but he won’t force you to do anything you don’t want to do. Now is not the time to talk about anything else. Use these resources to reach your optimal state as soon as possible so that you can welcome the Heaven’s Trial. We’ll talk about the rest after your","bloodline evolves!”","After she finished speaking, Begin Lady busied herself helping Emerald Lady and placed the resources in the spatial equipment in front of her. Begin Lady was exceptionally earnest in persuading Emerald Lady about the matter. Given her understanding of Lin Yuan, if Emerald Lady remained stubborn and refused to express any intention of surrendering to Lin Yuan, he would not keep helping her. No one would help a person who was wary of them for no reason, especially if they had to invest such a huge amount of resources. Of course, Lin Yuan wouldn’t continue to help Emerald Lady indefinitely. However, if Emerald Lady clearly refused to join, he probably wouldn’t bother her either.","Based on Emerald Lady’s attitude toward Lin Yuan’s resources, Begin Lady could come to a conclusion. The resources that Emerald Lady had previously used in the Faerie Institution could not compare to the resources that Lin Yuan had provided. Wouldn’t joining Lin Yuan be an opportunity for Emerald Lady?","Begin Lady and Celestial Sight had said everything that needed to be said, so she would let Emerald Lady think for herself.","After hearing the Begin Lady and Celestial Sight’s persuasion, Emerald Lady’s attitude toward Lin Yuan had subtly changed. Being acknowledged by two faeries like this, the group before her surely couldn’t be bad people. Since the other party was willing to provide her with such abundant resources, it would indeed be extremely beneficial for her to join this faction.","As highly intelligent lifeforms, faeries were capable of contemplating their future. Through the resources that Lin Yuan had provided for her, Emerald Lady had confirmed that her growth here would be much faster than in the Faerie Institution.","As the Emerald Lady absorbed the resources provided by Lin Yuan to stabilize her damaged bloodline, she spoke to Lin Yuan with an extremely serious expression, “Before discussing whether or not I want to join you, I would like to tell you about my abilities. I’m transformed from a hundred million years of green mountains. Originally, ordinary natural landscapes like green mountains don’t have the chance to transform into faeries. When I was still a natural landscape, I encountered many great opportunities.","“It was these great opportunities that allowed me to grow. I transform into a faerie much slower than other natural landscapes, yet my talent is by no means lacking. However, in terms of abilities, mine are rather limited. I can only enhance the growth and evolution speed of plant-type lifeforms.","“This makes it impossible for me to contribute much to the Faerie Institution with my abilities. I can say that I’m not good at fighting at all. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have been controlled by those evil people from the start.”","Emerald Lady’s description of her capabilities was very objective, she didn’t exaggerate her capabilities.","When she first became a faerie, Emerald Lady was treated as a genius in the Faerie Institution. Later, because of her ability, she was moved out of the core circle. These two matters had a huge impact on Emerald Lady, to the extent that she began to feel inferior.","What Emerald Lady was unaware of was that Lin Yuan already knew about her ability. The reason Lin Yuan valued her so much was precisely because of her ability. The most precious thing in the faith country was food, and the faith country had developed too quickly. Even if they kept nurturing Soldier Ration Radishes, their production was too low, and they could not keep up with the development of the faith country. Soldier Ration Radishes also could not be nurtured blindly as they had their own lifespan.","If the Emerald Lady was willing to submit to Lin Yuan, he would bring her to Sky City and let her nurture the Soldier Ration Radishes. In that case, the faith country would no longer need to worry about food and clothing, and the speed of development of the faith country would not need to decrease. Emerald Lady’s ability solved a fundamental problem that Lin Yuan urgently needed to solve. This made her ability extremely important to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan said directly, “You don’t have to be so pessimistic about your ability. To me, your ability is extremely important. If you join me, you will feel a sense of accomplishment because of your ability in the future. I will also be responsible for the subsequent improvement of your bloodline and strength. I can’t give you much time to think here. I hope you can immediately respond to me after passing the Heaven’s Trial. If you’re unwilling to join me, I won’t force you. I’ll let you leave and return to the Faerie Institution.”","Begin Lady knew Lin Yuan well, and he would not be a good person for no reason. At most, he would help Emerald Lady survive the danger like he was doing now. He would not invest more resources in her. The existence of a faerie could benefit an area. Lin Yuan would treat his investment in Emerald Lady’s resources as a good deed.","Even though Lin Yuan had become increasingly decisive along his journey, his original intention had remained unchanged.","Emerald Lady nodded at Lin Yuan and began to absorb the resources silently. Although Emerald Lady did not give Lin Yuan an answer, she had already made up her mind. She had already decided to join Lin Yuan. On one hand, it was indeed because of the resources that Lin Yuan had invested in her. Emerald Lady needed these resources to grow quickly. On the other hand, Emerald Lady also wanted to experience the sense of accomplishment her bloodline could bring her.","Lin Yuan let Emerald Lady recover her roots in advance so that her body could better withstand the benefits that would be bestowed at the end of the Heaven’s Trial. He did not need Emerald Lady to use her strong body to deal with this Heaven’s Trial.","Back then, even White Speak was able to help Begin Lady resist the Heaven’s Trial. Now, with Spring and Winter, resisting the Heaven’s Trial was naturally nothing difficult.","Spring and Winter sensed the aura of a faerie approaching them from afar, so they suggested to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, the people from the Faerie","Institution are rushing towards us. I’m sure that the people from the Faerie Institution won’t discover any traces of Emerald Lady. But if they keep rushing here, they’ll meet sooner or later. If we don’t want to have a conflict with the Faerie Institution, we have to leave this place!”","Winter did not send a voice transmission to Lin Yuan, allowing Emerald Lady to hear him clearly. He was forcing Emerald Lady to make a choice.","Lin Yuan nodded. If the people from the Faerie Institution were rushing toward him, Lin Yuan would indeed need to bring Emerald Lady with him.","Lin Yuan said helplessly to Emerald Lady, “Previously, I wanted to wait until you finished the Heaven’s Trial. Now, it seems that you have to make a decision in advance. If you decide to join me, we will take you out of here. If you want to return to the Faerie Institution, you can just wait here for the people from the Faerie Institution to arrive. After we leave, your aura will be able to spread out!”","Emerald Lady had a feeling that Lin Yuan was testing her and was joking. Lin Yuan had just given him so many resources. Would he really let her go?","Since Emerald Lady had already made her decision, she wasn’t prepared to change her mind. “I’m willing to leave with you and join you in the future. I hope you can be more tolerant in the future.”","Emerald Lady had feelings for the Faerie Institution, but as a member of the Faerie Institution, she felt like she was being controlled. She could sense Sand Abyss’s admiration for her, but she hated Sand Abyss’s control over her. Leaving the Faerie Institution was equivalent to leaving the Sand Abyss’s control. If she was stronger than Sand Abyss, even with her good temper, she would want to beat him up.","Having received Emerald Lady’s accurate answer, Spring and Winter led Lin Yuan and the rest to move, including Emerald Lady. Before leaving, Winter had deliberately cleaned up Emerald Lady’s remaining aura. Even if the Faerie Institution stood on the land where Emerald Lady was, they wouldn’t be able to sense her aura.","For a considerable period, Lin Yuan’s Sky City would hide in the North of the Lonely River to develop. The Faerie Institution’s influence was not powerful in the East Universe to investigate the North of the Lonely River. The factions present were enough for the Faerie Institution to vent their frustrations upon.","After arriving at the new area, Emerald Lady activated the bloodline in her body and the Heaven’s Trial descended.","Spring helped Emerald Lady resist the Heaven’s Trial, allowing her to steadily evolve.","The Emerald Lady had evolved from a lower faerie to an intermediate faerie. Her strength hadn’t increased too much, but her bloodline had increased several times over. The increase in her bloodline also increased Emerald Lady’s ability to promote the growth and evolution of plant-type lifeforms.","Subduing the Emerald Lady was a huge gain for both Lin Yuan and Sky City. If not for such a huge harvest, Lin Yuan would not have slowed down his pace of returning to Sky City.","Despite extensive searching, Sand Abyss and Deep Mountain still couldn’t find any trace of Emerald Lady. Sand Abyss and Deep Mountain didn’t execute all the people who targeted Emerald Lady but left a portion for interrogation.","After a careful interrogation, these people who were interrogated all had the same confession. Emerald Lady was taken away by a snowflake.","In the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds, there were only a few species with powerful ice-type and snow-type abilities. The Snow-covered Foxes, the Frost Ferrets, and the Cold Jade Vipers all possessed such abilities. However, the auras of these species were very obvious. If there were really members of these species, it was impossible for him not to detect them.","Sand Abyss and Deep Mountain were in an extremely bad mood, especially since Sand Abyss was on the verge of collapse the more they searched. However, no matter what, it was better for Emerald Lady to be taken away by a snowflake than to be killed.."]},{"number":2928,"title":"Chapter 2928 Luxurious Gift!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2928 ?Luxurious Gift!","Deep Mountain looked at Sand Abyss’ expression and sighed heavily. Then, he placed his hand on Sand Abyss’ shoulder and patted him.","“Sand Abyss, let’s go back and report. The disappearance of Emerald Lady is a huge loss to Faerie Institution. We haven’t made a move in the East Universe for nearly ten thousand years. We need to show the strength of the Faerie Institution to warn the major factions in the East Universe. At that time, there will most likely be the appearance of a faerie king. Although the heavenly pool that Emerald Lady has her eye on is in a bad state, it’s not impossible to save it. Do you think we should help this heavenly pool? No matter what, it has a similar bloodline to Emerald Lady.”","Deep Mountain was not the kind of person who would cause trouble for his good friend for no reason. He made such a suggestion because he felt that Sand Abyss had the ability to do so.","Sand Abyss shook his head. Sand Abyss did not know what it meant to love the object of a loved one’s affection. At this moment, Sand Abyss’s thoughts were all on Emerald Lady.","Sand Abyss was very put off by Emerald Lady helping this heavenly pool. He already felt that this heavenly pool was an eyesore.","“Give me another day. If I still can’t find any traces of Emerald Lady, let’s go back and report then. The heavenly pool will stay here. The fate of this heavenly pool originated from Emerald Lady. It is suffering from this calamity because of Emerald Lady. What will happen in the future will depend on the fate of this heavenly pool. Emerald Lady would never have come here and would not have ended up like this if not for the heavenly pool.”","Upon hearing Sand Abyss’s words, Deep Mountain did not know what to say for a moment. Deep Mountain felt that Sand Abyss made such a choice not only because of Emerald Lady but also because of his own thoughts.","Deep Mountain could sense Sand Abyss’ desire to control Emerald Lady. Did Emerald Lady’s decision really have nothing to do with Sand Abyss?","Deep Mountain would definitely not say these words.","“Alright, I’ll search for Emerald Lady with you today. I hope we can find her! However, the possibility of finding Emerald Lady is very slim. Don’t hold out too much hope. Just do your best and leave it to fate. If Emerald Lady was really taken away by some faction, this faction most likely has their eyes on her ability. They shouldn’t treat her too badly. As long as Emerald Lady is still alive, we will be able to meet one day!”","Sand Abyss did not relax at all when he heard Deep Mountain’s words.","Deep Mountain made it sound nice. If Emerald Lady was really captured by a faction, even if this faction did not take her life, they would definitely guard her strictly and restrict her freedom. How could they let Emerald Lady out?","If Emerald Lady could contact the Faerie Institution, they would definitely retaliate against this faction.","This faction that captured the Emerald Lady definitely knew this.","Sand Abyss and Deep Mountain were focused on Emerald Lady, but Emerald Lady, who had just successfully become an intermediate faerie after overcoming the Heaven’s Trial, was not focused on Deep Mountain and Sand Abyss at all.","Emerald Lady was extremely excited by Lin Yuan’s words,","“Is what you said true? Can you really help the pool recover its roots?”","Lin Yuan glanced at Winter, who immediately understood what he meant.","What Lin Yuan wanted to ask him was not whether he could help the heavenly pool recover its roots but whether it was possible for it to evolve into a lower faerie if he invested a large amount of resources into it.","If the heavenly pool was exposed to the major factions, the Faerie Institution would eventually turn their attention to it.","Lin Yuan would definitely not allow it to grow freely after healing its roots.","Not only would this not make Emerald Lady calm down, but it would also cause her to continue worrying about the heavenly pool.","Winter sent a message to Lin Yuan through his soul, “Young Master, the heavenly pool is not far from becoming a faerie. If those forces hadn’t tampered with the heavenly pool, it would have completed its transformation in ten years, and Emerald Lady wouldn’t have specially made this trip.","“It’s beneficial for you to turn this heavenly pool into a faerie and keep it as well as Emerald Lady by your side. The bloodline of this heavenly pool comes from Emerald Lady. The faerie it transforms into will complement Emerald Lady’s abilities and will be able to activate Emerald Lady’s bloodline to the greatest extent. It is very suitable for the development of the faith country.”","Winter paused for a moment and thought of Four Seasons Mountain, which Lin Yuan had yet to transform into a faerie.","“Young Master, if you help Four Seasons Mountain evolve in the future and directly transform it into a higher fairy, then Four Seasons Mountain, Emerald Lady, and Celestial Sight, who are both mountains as well, can promote each other. Begin Lady and the faerie transformed by the heavenly pool will surround this mountain and provide the best living environment for the entire faith country. These five faeries will definitely construct a blessed land that can create huge wealth.”","Winter’s plan was exactly the same as what Lin Yuan had in mind.","Lin Yuan already had such plans for Four Seasons Mountain, Begin Lady, and Celestial Sight. Emerald Lady and this heavenly pool just so happened to supplement his plans.","She felt that it was necessary to let Emerald Lady take a good look at the heavenly pool’s situation.","Even if Emerald Lady did not have any animosity toward Faerie Institution, she would know that Lin Yuan was the one who truly treated her well once she got a glimpse at the state of the heavenly pool.","Faerie Institution was more utilitarian toward Emerald Lady. They were unlike Lin Yuan, who was willing to spend so many resources to help Emerald Lady.","After Spring thoroughly investigated the situation, she told Lin Yuan everything she had discovered.","Winter brought Lin Yuan and the others to where Emerald Lady was.","This time, Lin Yuan had to secretly help the heavenly pool recover its roots and become a faerie. Thus, he put Kani, Jin Chen, Liu Chen, and Liu Yao into the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan had full trust in them and could even control the holy spirits.","Emerald Lady had not seen what the heavenly pool she had nurtured looked like yet.","Emerald Lady knew that the heavenly pool she had nurtured had been destroyed because she had heard about it from those wicked fellows. Now, she saw that the heavenly pool that she had painstakingly nurtured had actually been destroyed to such an extent!","Under such circumstances, it was impossible for her to treat the heavenly pool on her own. This would not change even if she used her roots.","Although Emerald Lady knew that it would be very difficult for the heavenly pool to recover, she was still very disappointed by Sand Abyss’s actions.","Sand Abyss clearly knew that she valued the heavenly pool, but he had not given it a chance at all. He had even previously expressed disgust at him helping the heavenly pool.","It was not difficult for Sand Abyss to get rid of these filthy energies without treating the heavenly pool’s roots.","Sand Abyss clearly did not want to give the heavenly pool any more chances.","Emerald Lady did not understand why Sand Abyss did such a thing when he was so nice to her and clearly liked her.","Sand Abyss’s love was like a cage to Emerald Lady. The fact that Emerald Lady had agreed to Lin Yuan’s invitation in such a short time was related to Sand Abyss’ control over her.","“Young Master, I...”","Before Emerald Lady could ask Lin Yuan for help, Lin Yuan had already taken out a spatial equipment and poured a large number of spirit qi crystals and water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls into the pool.","These water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls were produced by the Elemental Shellfishes. They were a specialty of the main world, and there were no Elemental Shellfish in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Otherwise, Lin Yuan would have seen traces of Elemental Shellfishes or heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls in Fortune Treasure Palace.","To put it bluntly, the value of the Elemental Shellfishes was that they could use spirit qi to transform into pure elemental energy. The purer the spirit qi absorbed, the purer the elemental pearls produced would be.","In order to nurture feys, many spirit qi professionals needed pure elemental energy to raise their bloodlines.","This made it more cost-effective to prepare heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls through the Elemental Shellfishes.","However, there were many feys in the Sky Beyond the Clouds that could produce pure elemental energy and many of them cost less than the Elemental Shellfishes.","Moreover, the price of pure spirit qi in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was about 2.5 times higher than elemental energy of the same purity.","This made the Elemental Shellfish extremely useless.","If it weren’t for the endless spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone and the Elemental Shellfish’s rapid conversion of spirit qi to produce elemental energy that enabled Lin Yuan to produce resources, he would have already considered replacing the Elemental Shellfishes!","“Compared to Emerald Lady simply helping the heavenly pool cleanse this polluted energy through external forces, it’s better to use this pure spirit qi and water-element energy to awaken the heavenly pool’s roots so it can cleanse itself! This way, we can ensure that the heavenly pool retains great potential for development after it transforms into a faerie. Otherwise, given its current crisis, it won’t be unable to advance even an inch after it becomes a faerie!”","Lin Yuan’s words moved Emerald Lady again. She knew very well how much resources Lin Yuan needed to invest in this decision."]},{"number":2929,"title":"Chapter 2929 Lin Yuan’s Return!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2929 ?Lin Yuan’s Return!","If it was out of Lin Yuan’s interest, there was no need for him to do so.","Lin Yuan’s actions made Emerald Lady deeply feel his sincerity and feel protected.","It was just as Lin Yuan had said. By letting the heavenly pool cleanse itself, it could maximize the pool’s development potential after it transformed into a faerie.","Since Lin Yuan was this considerate toward her, Emerald Lady was very willing to be loyal to him.","“Young Master, I will definitely work hard to create value for you in the future. I won’t let you sacrifice so much for me for no reason!”","Lin Yuan smiled and did not say anything. It was good that Emerald Lady had such a mindset.","Lin Yuan indeed needed Emerald Lady to do many things in the future and would have to trouble her.","The purification of the heavenly pool required time, so Lin Yuan could only provide it with resources while waiting at the side.","Winter enveloped this place with his aura. He would prevent anyone coming here from affecting the heavenly pool’s evolution.","The people from Faerie Institution had already left. They probably would not be returning anytime soon.","With Faerie Institution’s attitude toward this heavenly pool, even if it transformed into a faerie and disappeared, Faerie Institution would most likely not be able to discover it.","...","While Lin Yuan was waiting for the heavenly pool to transform, a group of giant white condors in North of the Lonely River flew over to investigate the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","Because of the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ orders, the Spinning Wings White Falcons did not fight with the King Blood Jackals or test the power supporting them.","However, the leader of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, Bai Yunzong, had been monitoring the territory of the King Blood Jackals.","The Spinning Wings White Falcons did not discover Sky City floating in the sky. Instead, they discovered the faith country that was constantly being built and changed.","When the Spinning Wings White Falcon spies discovered the faith country, Bai Yunzong understood the value of the faith country.","The faith country was a huge container that produced faith power. No matter how impure the faith power was, collecting it would represent unimaginable wealth.","Bai Yunzong was sure that this massive faith country was definitely not built by the King Blood Jackals. The owner of this faith country was probably the person behind them.","After much consideration, Bai Yunzong finally decided to inform Chi Jue of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, who were in the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","Firstly, with Chi Jue presiding over the Spinning Wings White Falcons, he was under Chi Jue’s supervision and could not do anything in secret. Whatever he did would definitely be discovered by Chi Jue.","Secondly, if he told Chi Jue about this discovery, he would most likely be able to obtain Chi Jue’s reward.","The Crimson Heaven Falcons must be very interested in this faith country.","In order to seize this faith country, the Crimson Heaven Falcons would most likely attack the power behind the King Blood Jackals.","Bai Yunzong hoped that this would happen.","Once the Spinning Wings White Falcons moved, they could plunder the King Blood Jackals’ wealth.","After making these contributions, it would be easier for him to obtain the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ blood essence from Chi Jue.","The few drops of blood essence Chi Jue gave Bai Yunzong helped his bloodline change. Bai Yunzong liked the joy of his bloodline transforming.","The Crimson Heaven Falcon bloodline was much stronger than the Spinning Wings White Falcon bloodline. Unfortunately, the blood essence Chi Jue provided for himself was insufficient to completely transform the bloodline in Bai Yunzong’s body.","“We have the Spinning Wings White Falcons. With them here, why would we need to do this? I have no intention of competing with you for authority among the Spinning Wings White Falcons. I’ll let you give orders to them!","“You should thank me for coming here this time. You’ve been with the Spinning Wings White Falcons for hundreds of years but haven’t made them submit. This time, I’ve shown you many hidden problems.","“You can use this opportunity to get rid of those disobedient Spinning Wings White Falcons. Chi Jue, I don’t believe that you can’t even control the Spinning Wings White Falcons well!","“I heard that you even applied for a few drops of blood essence to the head of the Spinning Wings White Falcons. This means you’ve spent a lot of effort on them.”","Chi Jue could not be bothered to argue with Chi Ling. If it were not for the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ arrival, the Spinning Wings White Falcons would not dare to do this.","“You don’t have to worry about whether I can control the Spinning Wings White Falcons. You guys have just arrived, so you still need to settle down. I also need to continue investigating some information on my side.","“Why don’t we wait for seven days before we act together? The Spinning Wings White Falcons are not strong enough. You do not need to use them as cannon fodder for no reason. No matter what, they are still one of our dependent species. Why don’t we act together?","“Use your strongest strength to catch this faction off guard so that you can negotiate with this faction as soon as possible. It’s easier for the species to decide about this faction if we figure out the truth during the negotiations.”","...","While Chi Jue and Chi Ling were plotting, the Moon Empress was holding an internal meeting in Sky City.","If the Moon Empress had encountered such a situation a month ago, she would definitely be in a dilemma and not know what to do. The Moon Empress feared that her decision would result in irreversible consequences.","But now, with the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, the Moon Empress could contact Lin Yuan. She had already informed Lin Yuan of the situation when the Spinning Wings White Falcons began to investigate the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","The Moon Empress could basically confirm they had discovered the existence of the faith country. She felt that this matter could not be ignored, be it the Spinning Wings White or Crimson Heaven Falcons, who were the source of the issue.","A war was about to break out between the two sides.","After listening to the Moon Empress’ explanation of the situation, Lin Yuan still gave the same answer. He told the Moon Empress not to worry. Autumn and Summer could protect Sky City and resolve this matter.","Moreover, Lin Yuan would return to Sky City within five days.","After the Moon Empress ended her communication with Lin Yuan, she immediately looked for Summer and Autumn and informed them of Lin Yuan’s arrangements.","The Moon Empress had convened this meeting to announce Lin Yuan’s return in five days. She also wanted everyone in Sky City to be on guard and try not to go to the area where the Crimson Heaven and the Spinning Wings White Falcons were located.","Before this meeting was held, the Moon Empress found Keira and asked her to assign a large numerous demon insects to the edge of the King Blood Jackals’ territory. They surrounded almost the entirety of the King Blood Jackals and Crimson Heaven Falcons’ territories.","Apart from wanting to protect the faith country, the Moon Empress also wanted to tell the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons they were aware of their actions.","It would be fine if this battle did not start. But once it started, either Sky City and the faith country would be destroyed, or both the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons would become subordinates of Sky City, just like how Sky City controlled the four races of the Lonely River.","...","After two full days, Lin Yuan looked at the male faerie who looked similar to Emerald Lady and said with a smile, “You have to thank Emerald Lady for what you have today. Emerald Lady obtained your future. Emerald Lady almost lost her life for you. From now on, you should stay by her side.”","The male faerie bowed to Lin Yuan again and looked at Emerald Lady with admiration.","Emerald Lady did not allow the male faerie to speak and directly reached out to help him.","“Little Pool, there’s no need to be so distant with me. You and I will follow Young Master and do our best to repay Young Master’s kindness!”","Emerald Lady named this male faerie transformed from the heavenly pool Gray Pool, and his abilities were exactly the same as Emerald Lady’s. The superimposition of their abilities could multiply the effects when nurturing plant-type feys.","As the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons were about to start a war with Sky City, Lin Yuan, the City Lord, needed to rush back to Sky City as soon as possible.","With Spring and Winter’s help, Lin Yuan rushed back to Sky City within three days. He smiled as he looked at the familiar scenery around him.","The moment Lin Yuan returned to Sky City, he headed to the Moon Empress’ residence."]},{"number":2930,"title":"Chapter 2930: Eternal Moon Prayer!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2930: Eternal Moon Prayer!","Ever since the Moon Empress learned that Lin Yuan was about to return to Sky City, she had been looking forward to his return.","The Moon Empress was reading the reports Su Yiren and Luo Lan had provided. The faith country was developing smoothly, but there were still many problems.","These problems would pose hidden dangers if left unchecked.","The Moon Empress knew very well how serious these hidden dangers would affect a faction’s development in the future.","When the Radiance Federation was developing, many hidden dangers existed, which were not corrected in the beginning. As these hidden dangers were gradually exposed, the Radiance Federation’s royalty often had to pay a huge price to clean them up!","The Moon Empress needed to contain these hidden dangers in the cradle so that they could not be exposed.","The Moon Empress was so tired and under so much pressure because of this goal.","The Moon Empress carefully read Su Yiren and Luo Lan’s reports and used a pen to annotate.","There were a few issues that the Moon Empress planned to personally head to the faith country to investigate.","Both Luo Lan and Su Yiren were very glad that the Moon Empress was willing to spend her time managing the faith country, as it saved them from making numerous mistakes. The Moon Empress’s ability to grasp the overall situation was something that Luo Lan and Su Yiren could not compare to.","Mystic Moon and Cold Moon supported the Moon Empress from the side. With Mystic Moon and Cold Moon’s help, the Moon Empress could control the entire situation. Without Cold Moon and Mystic Moon, the Moon Empress herself would inevitably be negligent in many things.","Sky City was not very large. There were only a dozen core members, and the other thousand-odd members rarely strayed from their respective roles.","The real problem was the faith country. There was friction in the faith country at all times.","It was inevitable that these living beings would fight for benefits after the villages were integrated. It was like gathering the students of several classes together, and fights would be inevitable between the students of each class.","It was even more so in the huge faith country!","Once such a situation occurred, the Moon Empress would get the demon insects to swiftly get rid of those troublemakers.","The Moon Empress rubbed her temples.","If this were all she had every day, it would not be a big deal to the Moon Empress. The key was that the Spinning Wings White Falcons were becoming restless.","The Moon Empress did not have as much faith in Autumn and Summer’s abilities as Lin Yuan did. After all, the Moon Empress had never seen them use their powers.","The faith country could be said to be the core project that Sky City had invested in after coming to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Fortunately, Lin Yuan was about to return. Otherwise, the Moon Empress would not know what to do!","The Moon Empress had just put down the documents in her hand when she looked up and saw Lin Yuan walking toward her.","The Moon Empress subconsciously rubbed her eyes, thinking she had recently been too busy. After confirming that it was really Lin Yuan, the Moon Empress hurriedly stood up.","Lin Yuan hurriedly went forward to hold the Moon Empress’ arm and said with heartache and guilt, “Master, you’ve really worked hard recently!”","The Moon Empress shook her head.","“It’s not hard on me. It’s hard on you when you’re outside!”","The Moon Empress looked at Lin Yuan from head to toe and said softly, “Little Yuan, you’ve lost a lot of weight and tanned a little during this trip. It’s obvious that you haven’t eaten properly!”","During this period, Lin Yuan had been travel-worn. He had indeed lost some weight after experiencing the hardships of life, and he was also a little darker than before.","Since Lin Yuan’s Body of All Spirits was in a state of absolute purity, his appearance changed little.","Only those who truly cared for him would notice these subtle changes in Lin Yuan’s body.","The Moon Empress’ concern touched Lin Yuan’s heart.","“Master, I will come here every day now. Compared to me, you really have to recuperate!”","Lin Yuan greeted Cold Moon and Mystic Moon.","Lin Yuan respected Cold Moon and Mystic Moon. Both of them were seniors who had witnessed Lin Yuan’s growth.","Both of them had given Lin Yuan a lot of support when he was growing up, and Cold Moon was Chu Ci’s teacher. Cold Moon’s nurturing of Chu Ci helped her greatly improve in all aspects.","When they saw Lin Yuan take the initiative to greet them, both Cold Moon and Mystic Moon bowed respectfully.","Previously, Cold Moon and Mystic Moon had addressed Lin Yuan as Young Lord because he was the Moon Empress’ disciple.","At that time, Lin Yuan had been very weak.","Lin Yuan’s strength had already surpassed that of the Moon Empress, and the two of them could clearly feel that the new generation was surpassing the old. Lin Yuan no longer needed to rely on the Moon Empress. Instead, he had become the Moon Empress and the others’ pillar of support!","The Moon Empress helped Lin Yuan adjust his collar as she said, “Little Yuan, you must have a lot of things to do since you just came back. Go do your work.","Remember to come over for dinner.’","Lin Yuan was not in a hurry to leave. Instead, he took out the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast from his spatial equipment.","A pinnacle Grade 4 Creator was an extremely precious existence in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","The Moon Empress could tell at a glance that the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast was extraordinary.","When the Moon Empress contacted Lin Yuan after obtaining the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower child ramet, Lin Yuan mentioned that he had found a suitable fey for her.","At that time, the Moon Empress was very curious about what kind of fey was suitable for her.","Not only did Lin Yuan help her increase her strength, but he also helped to increase her feys’ strength as well.","It could be said that Lin Yuan knew the Moon Empress’ feys very well. If Lin","Yuan said that this fey was compatible with the Moon Empress’ combat","system, it would definitely not be wrong!","The Moon Empress had long cultivated her mentality to a level as calm as an ancient well. However, the Desire Moon -Eyed Beast had undeniably brought the Moon Empress a huge surprise.","Whether it was the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s abilities, Moon Condensed Dew and Moonlight Protection, or the exclusive skill, Dark Side of the Moon, they were all very compatible with the Moon Empress.","In particular, Moon Condensed Dew could increase all the Moon Empress’ feys’ strength even faster.","It could be said that this Desire Moon-Eyed Beast was tailor-made for the Moon Empress.","At this moment, the Moon Empress suddenly thought of the Merciful Star Peony that Lin Yuan had contracted. The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast was compatible with her fey, and so was the Merciful Star Peony.","Lin Yuan could also choose to contract the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast. The Moon Empress knew that Lin Yuan had many feys and had the ability to contract multiple feys.","“Little Yuan, this Desire Moon-Eyed Beast is also suitable for you. With this Desire Moon-Eyed Beast, you can quickly nurture the Merciful Star Peony. Why don’t—”","Before she could finish, Lin Yuan spoke first. “Master, the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast is more suitable for you than me! In the future, if the Merciful Star Peony needs moon dew, I’ll ask you for it. Go ahead and contract this Desire Moon-Eyed Beast! It’s a good opportunity to see what kind of abilities and exclusive skills this Desire Moon-Eyed Beast will obtain as its grade and quality continue to increase!”","When the Moon Empress heard Lin Yuan’s words, she did not stand on ceremony. Once the Moon Empress contracted the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast, her overall strength would increase by a large level. And this was at the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s current level of Silver/Legend.","The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s Dark Side of the Moon could increase the offensive power of all the Moon Empress’ feys.","The little white rabbit who had been munching on carrots in front of the Moon Empress’ table had been looking at the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast ever since Lin Yuan summoned it. Its eyes were filled with interest in the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast as if even the radish in its hand was no longer fragrant.","“Little Yuan, since you say so, I’ll contract this Desire Moon-Eyed Beast. If you need moon dew in the future, just let me know.”","After saying that, the Moon Empress placed her hand on the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s forehead and circulated her spiritual energy. Soon, the Moon Empress successfully contracted the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast and became her fey.","The Moon Empress raised her hand, and a Willpower Rune with a faint amber color appeared on her fingertip. This rune gave people the feeling that it was like the boundless moonlight that shone brightly. Clearly, this Willpower Rune was very compatible with the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast.","“Little Yuan, it’s a coincidence. I comprehended this Willpower Rune recently. This Willpower Rune is very compatible with the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast. I can directly evolve the Desire Moon -Eyed Beast to Fantasy Breed. Then, I can increase its strength.”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Master, Sky City’s matters have been handled by you. I don’t have anything urgent to see the others about. Why don’t I stay here to help you strengthen the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast? Let me help you strengthen the Desire Moon -Eyed Beast. It will be more beneficial to its improvement.”","After the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast was contracted by the Moon Empress it was clearly not as afraid of people as before. The Desire Moon -Eyed Beast was very reliant on the Moon Empress.","The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast happily welcomed the Willpower Rune condensed by the Moon Empress.","The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast could feel the benefits of this Willpower Rune.","The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s body, which was intertwined with this Willpower Rune, gradually changed. Its fur gradually changed from its original yellow and white to a pale moon color. The symbol of an eye appeared on the long tail of the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast, which represented that the bloodline of the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast had improved.","Lin Yuan placed his palm on the Desire Moon -Eyed Beast’s back and channeled a massive amount of pure spirit qi into the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s body, promoting the transformation of its bloodline.","Lin Yuan could sense that the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s body had enlarged to nearly two meters long.","A body more than two meters long was considered huge for the Desire Moon-Eyed Beasts.","The size of the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast was not a good thing for it.","The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast could only play supportive positions in battle and did not have any combat abilities. The larger its body, the easier it would be for the enemy to target it and make it a live target.","Fortunately, the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s body only grew to a certain size. As its bloodline evolved again, its body began to shrink.","In the end, it became the size of a palm, just enough to stand on the Moon Empress’ shoulder.","After shrinking, the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast became even more exquisite and adorable. Not long after, with Lin Yuan’s Body of All Spirits, the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast was raised to Diamond X/Fantasy V.","Lin Yuan used True Data to investigate the evolved Desire Moon -Eyed Beast.","[Fey Name]: Desire Moon-Eyed Beast","[Fey Species]: Long-haired species/Eyed-beast species","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Light","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy V","Abilities:","[Moon Condensed Dew]: The moonlight in its body will be condensed into moon dew. The moon dew can boost entities that use moonlight as a main source of energy. These entities will be able to absorb energy even quicker, and their bodies will be cleansed.","[Moonlight Protection]: Its eyes will cleanse the moonlight, which will protect selected targets. The strength of the protection will be linked to the strength of its own bloodline and the strength of the moonlight in its environment.","[Gazing Moon]: Its eyes will fixate on the moon, and it will be able to comprehend everything it requires to evolve. The speech at which it absorbs moonlight energy will also be increased.","[Pure Moon]: In an environment with moonlight, moonlight can be used to extract things that do not belong to this lifeform but are attached to it, expelling these additional things.","[Moon Fusion]: It will melt into the moonlight to prevent the enemy from harming it. It can use the moonlight to enhance living beings that use moonlight as energy.","[Condensed Moon Tail Knot]: Use the hair on the tail to tie a moon knot on the target’s body. The moon knot can cause the moonlight energy in the target’s body to surge. The sacrificial tail knot can recover a large amount of moonlight energy in a short period of time.","Exclusive Skill:","[Dark Side of the Moon]: When it uses moonlight in its attacks, the moonlight will be boosted. A portion of the light-element energy will be transformed into dark-element energy. The two kinds of moonlight energy will attack the target.","[Eternal Moon Prayer]: Pray to the moon to increase its ability to control the moonlight energy according to the number of moons. The more moons it prays to, the stronger the moon energy it will control.","Lin Yuan was stunned for a moment. The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s previous exclusive skill was already very compatible with the Moon Empress.","But now, Desire Moon-Eyed Beast was not only compatible with the Moon Empress’ feys, but it was also compatible with the Moon Empress’ sacred source lifeform Forage Moon.","The exclusive skill Eternal Moon Prayer obtained by the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast when it evolved to Legend would increase the strength of the energy it controlled according to the number of moons.","There was only one moon in the natural environment, be it the main world or the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","However, because the sacred source lifeform Forage Moon had gathered all the moons in the dimensional world, it could summon six moons at the same time.","These six moons could greatly increase the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s ability to control the moonlight energy.."]},{"number":2931,"title":"Chapter 2931: Retaliating First!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2931: Retaliating First!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast relied on its ability to control the moonlight to improve all six of its abilities.","The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s Gold ability, Pure Moon, had a powerful","purifying effect. This purifying ability could use moonlight to purify energy or things that did not belong to a living being. It expelled things that did not belong to a living being. This purification ability could not only expel curses and control-type abilities, but it could also deal with the most difficult parasitic lifeforms. It used the moonlight energy to completely strip away these parasitic lifeforms.","This kind of purification ability with support effects could be regarded as a foundational ability most of the time.","The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s Platinum ability, Moon Fusion, allowed it to fuse its body into the moonlight to prevent the enemy from harming it.","This ability could be seen as a defensive capability. While defending, the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast could also use moonlight to amplify other creatures that used moonlight as energy.","All of the Moon Empress’ feys basically used moonlight energy as a source of energy. The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast could choose any fey to enhance.","The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s Diamond ability, Condensed Moon Tail Knot, also had an extremely powerful amplification effect.","Under the enhancement of the tail knot, the moonlight energy in the target’s body would be in a surging state. In a surging state, it could maximize the efficiency of a living being’s use of moonlight energy. The tail knot would be sacrificed when the moonlight energy in the target’s body was about to be exhausted. The target could recover a large amount of moonlight energy in a short period.","Using this moonlight energy to fight a prolonged battle greatly increased the endurance of the Moon Empress’s feys.","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with the Diamond X/Fantasy V Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s three new abilities and exclusive skills. He could see a pleasantly surprised expression on the Moon Empress’s face, which meant that she was also satisfied with the fey’s evolution.","“Master, we evolved the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast to Diamond X/Fantasy V. We need to let it settle down for a period of time.","“When the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast evolves to Myth Breed, we’ll continue to evolve it. We can evolve it to the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom stage in one go. ”","The Moon Empress seriously said, “Little Yuan, thanks to you, I obtained such a huge opportunity. You’ve wasted a lot of time here. Go and see Liu Jie and","Wen Yu! They haven’t seen you in a long time.”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Master, how can the opportunities you obtained from me be more than the opportunities I obtained from you? If not for your early nurturing, I wouldn’t have been able to improve so quickly.”","The Moon Empress shook her head gently. She had indeed given Lin Yuan some help, but that was what a master should do for her disciple. There was nothing special about them. Even if other experts accepted Lin Yuan as a disciple, they would do the same.","On the other hand, the other disciples would not give their master so many opportunities and help.","Her help to Lin Yuan had only accelerated Lin Yuan’s growth, and it did not have much of an impact on Lin Yuan’s growth limit.","The Moon Empress did not say too much to Lin Yuan. If she did, it would make her seem too pretentious as a master!","She just had to continue doing what she needed to do. The only thing she could do now was to help Lin Yuan take care of Sky City and the faith country and personally witness Lin Yuan’s growth!","After Lin Yuan left the Moon Empress’ residence, he was not in a hurry to meet Liu Jie and Wen Yu. Instead, he first met with Summer and Autumn.","The Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons were eyeing Sky City. Summer and Autumn had to have already investigated the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons’ situation.","Lin Yuan needed to understand the situation first.","If the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons really attacked Sky City and the faith country, Lin Yuan would get rid of them in one go.","He wanted to determine whether he should take in the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons or eliminate them directly.","In short, Lin Yuan would never allow any species to covet Sky City and the faith country!","The faith country could not withstand so many blows.","The faith country could now steadily produce faith power, and the rate at which faith power was produced was constantly increasing.","Once the faith country was damaged, it would be very difficult for it to recover to its current state!","If Lin Yuan let the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons off, the news of Sky City and the faith country’s existence would definitely spread. This would be extremely bad for the faith country and Sky City and would cause many safety hazards.","Lin Yuan did not want these safety hazards to appear.","If news of this spread from the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons and an even more powerful species targeted Sky City and the faith country, Lin Yuan would definitely be unable to deal with it!","Lin Yuan had already set his sights on the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons’ territory.","The Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons’ territory was much richer than that of the King Blood Jackals.","If Sky City wanted to fully develop the faith country, they would need both basic resources and population.","This especially applied to the population. The Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons’ territory had a large population. If the living beings of these two territories were gathered together, the scale of the faith country would increase by more than five times.","It was said that the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ territory alone was more than six times that of the King Blood Jackals.","In the wilderness of North of the Lonely River, the Crimson Heaven Falcons on which Lin Yuan had his eye were the supreme kings.","When Summer and Autumn saw Lin Yuan, they had mixed feelings. They envied Spring and Winter for being able to stay by Lin Yuan’s side for such a long time.","After experiencing so many things with Lin Yuan along the way, Lin Yuan’s attitude toward Spring and Winter must be even closer. Although Summer and Autumn’s emotions were a little complicated, the two of them did not feel bitter jealousy towards Spring and Winter. At most, they were envious.","They had been old friends for so many years. Lin Yuan would definitely bring the two of them along next time. From another perspective, Lin Yuan’s willingness to entrust the important task of guarding Sky City to the two of them could be seen as his trust in them.","After not seeing Lin Yuan for a long time, Summer and Autumn bowed to him seriously and called him ‘Lord Saint’.","Lin Yuan took out two pieces of spatial equipment and threw them to Summer and Autumn. They contained resources that were suitable for them.","Lin Yuan had asked Spring and Winter to help pick out these resources.","“Summer and Autumn, these should be very useful resources for the two of you. You can use these resources to increase your strength. Now that I’m back, I will provide the four of you with a large number of spirit qi crystals to help you continue to increase your strength.”","Previously, Lin Yuan did not help Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter because he did not have that many resources that could be used by the four of them.","Now that he had the faith country, Morbius had been helping Lin Yuan collect spirit qi crystals.","There were more than 1 trillion residents in the faith country, and the number of spirit qi crystals that they provided when they evolved was abnormally large. These spirit qi crystals had long been piled up into a mountain.","As the faith country continued to develop, Lin Yuan would have more and more spirit qi crystals.","Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter were the strongest forces under Lin Yuan’s command. Giving resources to the most elite forces under his command was the most beneficial approach for Lin Yuan.","They thanked Lin Yuan respectfully for his gifts.","However, the four of them were not too surprised. In the past, they had relied on Lin Yuan’s gifts to rise up. If not for Lin Yuan’s constant investment in them, it would have been impossible for them to be as powerful as they were now.","“Summer and Autumn, I believe you’ve already investigated the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons’ situation. Why don’t you tell me about them so I’ll know what I’m doing.”","Summer was the first to speak. “Young Master, Autumn mainly investigated the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons’ situation. I’m mainly responsible for protecting Sky City and the faith country.”","When Summer said this, her tone revealed some dissatisfaction.","Summer’s personality was relatively weak. As such, Autumn helped her to make most of the decisions.","After Autumn finished investigating the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons, Summer also had the idea of investigating them because she knew that Lin Yuan would definitely ask about them when he arrived.","However, Autumn rejected Xia’s idea of investigating the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons on the grounds that the faith country was too large and needed the two of them to protect it together.","Summer knew very well what Autumn meant by doing this. Autumn actually did not have many bad intentions. He was just doing this to show off in front of","Lin Yuan.","Summer did not want to have a conflict with Autumn because of such a matter.","However, there were some things that Summer had to make clear. Autumn was the one who investigated the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons.","If anything really happened, Summer would not take the blame for Autumn!","When Winter heard this, he looked at Autumn and thought, After so long, Autumn still likes to be greedy for credit. I’ve already warned him more than once about this.","Summer was the kind of person who did not like to fuss over anything. If it were Spring, she would definitely clash with Autumn.","It was one thing to cause trouble for Lin Yuan if there was a conflict. But more importantly, if there were a rift between the four of them, it would be difficult for them to cooperate as well as before.","Winter was going to find an opportunity to remind Autumn again.","Winter would tell Lin Yuan about this if he did not listen to him. Lin Yuan’s reprimand would definitely be effective on Autumn.","Autumn explained the situation of the Crimson Heaven and the Spinning","Wings White Falcons to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, the Spinning Wings White Falcons are just vassals of the Crimson Heaven Falcons. The Crimson Heaven Falcons have complete control over the Spinning Wings White Falcons and have sent their core members to guard the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ territory.","“I went to the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ territory and investigated the situation. The Crimson Heaven Falcon experts are guarding a forest. They’re most likely waiting for some natural treasure in the forest to mature.","“This kind of natural treasure can either allow the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ bloodline to break through or help their experts evolve. According to my observations, only two Crimson Heaven Falcons have broken through to the Holy Spirit level. The grades of those two experts are not very clear, so I think that a bloodline breakthrough is more likely than a grade evolution!”","Lin Yuan nodded. From Autumn’s explanation, Lin Yuan had a certain understanding of the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ situation.","This trip had broadened Lin Yuan’s horizons and he had seen many powerhouses who had broken through to the Holy Spirit level.","Lin Yuan had taken in Liu Chen, Liu Yao, and Jin Chen as his subordinates.","If he had not gone on this trip, Lin Yuan would have marveled at the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ strength. Now that he had been out for a while, He felt that the Crimson Heaven Falcons were only slightly stronger than the Elisa Clan.","“I heard that the Crimson Heaven Falcons have been investigating the faith country recently. Is that true?”","Autumn seriously said, “Young Master, it’s true! The Crimson Heaven Falcons will lead the Spinning Wings White Falcons to attack the faith country in the next few days. I suggest we attack the Crimson Heaven Falcons or the Spinning Wings White Falcons before they attack the faith country. If the experts of these two species attack directly from different directions, it will be difficult for us to cover all bases in our defense.","Autumn had expressed his opinion to Lin Yuan, and he agreed with him.","Lin Yuan also felt that he needed to attack the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons first. It would be best if he could control their experts in their territory.","It would not cause a large-scale war if it could be completely controlled. Lin Yuan could catch the Crimson Heaven Falcons off guard since they were unaware of the situation.","Lin Yuan did not do this because he feared the Crimson Heaven Falcon’s power but to ensure that the flames of war would not spread to the faith country.","After clarifying the pros and cons, Lin Yuan said, “Winter, you excel at protection. Why don’t you stay behind to protect Sky City and the faith country? Spring, Summer, and Autumn, the three of you will bring Liu Chen and Liu Yao to attack the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ territory. We must ensure that we completely control them all!”","Lin Yuan was not going to let Kani and Jin Chen go on this mission.."]},{"number":2932,"title":"Chapter 2932 The Insect Queen’s Opportunity!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2932 The Insect Queen’s Opportunity!","Kani had been away from the King Blood Jackals’ territory for some time. Kani needed to spend some time to regain control of the King Blood Jackals.","Lin Yuan had heard from Wen Yu that some King Blood Jackals had been disobedient recently, so he told Kani about this situation.","The King Blood Jackals were Lin Yuan’s tools to control the entire territory. They had to be obedient.","Lin Yuan believed that after Kani regained control of the King Blood Jackals, she would definitely put an end to this situation.","If Kani could not do this, there was no need for Lin Yuan to keep her by his side!","As for Jin Chen, Lin Yuan had arranged a good place for him.","The Sky Radish Endless Vine bloodline was extremely powerful. Lin Yuan wanted to nurture Jin Chen so that he could quickly increase his strength and replenish a large amount of vitality.","Lin Yuan was prepared to let Jin Chen guard the Soldier Ration Radishes and assist the Hundred Questions Beast army in nurturing them.","Lin Yuan had never allowed the Hundred Questions Beast army to move outside. Even if it was those who were completely under Lin Yuan’s control, he was not willing to expose the existence of the Hundred Questions Beasts to them. The Hundred Questions Beast army produced a large number of potions every day, and these potions were considered extremely important strategic resources.","The scarcity of food in the faith country had not improved. Currently, the faith country was expanding rapidly. The Soldier Ration Radish could only barely keep the residents of the faith country from being hungry. Even food and shelter could not be guaranteed.","This was the inevitable process of the expansion of faith country, and there was no way to avoid it.","As the faith country continued to develop, these situations would improve.","Even if the Soldier Ration Radishes could not feed all the residents of the faith country, the residents’ faith under the protection of the faith country would be much better than before. There was no doubt about that!","However, humans were always unsatisfied. In the faith country, some people had gathered and wanted to snatch the Soldier Ration Radishes from the area where they were planted.","Fortunately, Luo Lan was the first to notice this and inform Su Yiren. The latter also informed the Moon Empress of the situation, preventing anything bad from happening.","If Sky City did not strike when such a situation occurred, similar situations would inevitably happen in the future.","Only when such a situation had just happened could he stop it with lightning speed. Only then could he prevent such a situation from happening!","Although it was very difficult for such an incident to happen again, it was still necessary to spend some effort to eliminate the hidden danger in advance. Once something happened to the Soldier Ration Radishes, Lin Yuan would lose the way to maintain his faith country.","With a Holy Spirit expert like Jin Chen guarding inside, they could maximize the possibility of resolving any unexpected incidents they encountered.","Even if Jin Chen could not resolve the situation, he could still buy time until Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter arrived.","With Emerald Lady and Gray Pool, the Soldier Ration Radish would soon be nurtured in large quantities.","Apart from providing food for the residents of the faith country, the Soldier Ration Radishes could also allow Jin Chen to improve his overall strength as soon as possible!","Lin Yuan had already given Jin Chen the spirit qi crystals. During the process of devouring the Soldier Ration Radish’s vitality, Jin Chen could absorb these spirit qi crystals by himself.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s arrangements, Spring, Summer, and Autumn immediately responded.","Compared to Lin Yuan’s constant measurement, the three of them preferred Lin Yuan’s decisiveness in killing, which was the greatest recognition of their abilities.","Previously, Lin Yuan had asked Summer and Autumn to stay behind to protect Sky City and the faith country. If Summer and Autumn continued to stay behind in this operation, they would inevitably feel dissatisfied.","Winter was steady in his actions and extremely clear about things. He knew very well that Lin Yuan treated the four of them equally and did not intend to favor anyone, so he did not care about this.","On the contrary, in Winter’s opinion, Lin Yuan greatly valued the faction territory’s safety. Asking him to stay and protect it was the greatest recognition for him!","Liu Chen, Liu Yao, Jin Chen, and Kani were waiting outside.","After learning of Lin Yuan’s arrangements, Liu Chen and Liu Yao immediately went into action.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao were extremely excited to work with the three top experts. In Liu Yao’s opinion, this was the best way to get closer to them quickly!","Liu Chen and Liu Yao really hoped that they could get to know experts like Spring, Summer, and Autumn. Knowing someone who was stronger than them would definitely help their future development!","Liu Chen and Liu Yao were extremely powerful themselves. The two of them would be happy to be able to join this operation.","Kani heaved a sigh of relief.","As the ruler of the King Blood Jackals and the neighbor of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, Kani had always been very afraid of them.","Their strength had always suppressed the King Blood Jackals. Even though she had reached the Holy Spirit level, the fear in her heart had not disappeared. If Kani were to participate in this operation, she would definitely be extremely worried about her safety.","Apart from the Spinning Wings White Falcons, there were also experts from the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","The Crimson Heaven Falcons had always been an existence that Kani could only look up to.","Fortunately, Lin Yuan was not sending her to participate in the operation. Instead, she was going to stay back to manage the King Blood Jackals.","Kani was indeed interested in managing the King Blood Jackals. This was a good opportunity.","Lin Yuan had previously explained the situation to her and expressed his dissatisfaction with the King Blood Jackals. If he could not resolve their internal situation, Lin Yuan would definitely transfer his dissatisfaction to him! Kani had to prevent this from happening!","To begin with, she did not have much of an advantage over Lin Yuan. If this continued, she would not be far from being eliminated.","Meanwhile, Jin Chen was exceptionally happy. The environment that Lin Yuan had arranged for him was like a paradise to him.","The only thing Jin Chen had to do in this paradise was to restrain his desire to eat. If there were insufficient Soldier Ration Radishes, they should not eat them.","Jin Chen had already interacted with Emerald Lady and Gray Pool.","Not only could Emerald Lady and Gray Pool promote the Soldier Ration Radishes’ growth, but they were also extremely beneficial to Jin Chen, a plant lifeform.","It was already a joy for Jin Chen, Gray Pool, and Emerald Lady to be together.","...","Spring, Summer, Autumn, Liu Chen, and Liu Yao launched a thunderous operation.","Before the Crimson Heaven and the entire Spinning Wings White Falcons took action, they had already launched an attack.","Spring and Summer did not attack the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons directly. Instead, they opened a barrier and completely sealed the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ territory. Unless one was strong enough to break through the barrier, no one could leave.","Autumn led Liu Chen and Liu Yao into action. Autumn did not know how Lin Yuan was going to deal with the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons.","Autumn did not kill them all. Instead, he sent a golden leaf into the bodies of every Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons.","The target that was hit by this leaf would be like a tree in late autumn, and all their strength would wither. This leaf would absorb this energy just like a fruit that was about to be nurtured on a plant.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao did not have the ability to imprison other living beings like Autumn did.","In the face of the resistance of the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons, Liu Chen and Liu Yao would avoid their vital points and severely injure the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons so that they could not move. As long as they avoided their vital points and did not injure their roots, these injuries could recover on their own.","...","Lin Yuan had already met with Wen Yu and Liu Jie.","Liu Jie and Wen Yu had not changed much from before. Ever since Lin Yuan had left, Liu Jie had been in seclusion for half the time.","Liu Jie placed great importance on improving his strength. Without any restrictions on the use of the Firefly Demon Fetuses, Liu Jie transformed all the insect-species carcinoma feys controlled by Elegance into fairies.","If not for the fact that he was the white-clothed followers’ supervisor and had to deal with many matters regarding the white-clothed followers, Liu Jie would have remained secluded for longer.","Wen Yu was not in a hurry to reminisce with Lin Yuan. Instead, she took out all the information about Sky City and the faith country that she had organized.","Getting Lin Yuan to read through this information through Genius was much more convenient than Wen Yu explaining the situation to him bit by bit!","Ever since Wen Yu learned about Genius’ Connected Tails ability, she had developed a good habit of recording information through Hear Heaven’s Secrets.","Lin Yuan summoned Genius.","Genius used its long tail to hook Lin Yuan’s shoulder and landed in his arms. Lin Yuan pulled Genius into his arms.","Genius was now the commander-in-chief of the Hundred Questions Beast Army, and its actions were extremely dignified.","However, Genius was always that clingy little fellow to Lin Yuan, and Chimey was the same.","Genius greatly liked its life in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, but Chimey always complained about it.","As Chimey could not livestream after coming to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Chimey naturally lost its fans.","Chimey’s voice had already become famous in the main world. Now, only people in the Spirit Lock spatial zone would have the chance to admire Chimey’s singing.","Lin Yuan did not have any good ideas.","That was because Chimey needed to improve its abilities in the Spirit Lock spatial zone and did not have time to go outside to gain fans.","Actually, if Chimey really wanted to gain fans, Lin Yuan could let Chimey go to the faith country and sing there.","Chimey’s existence would accelerate the output of faith power from the residents of the faith country. However, two conditions were necessary to achieve this. First, Chimey needed to be strong enough, and second, he had to ensure that the faith country was in a completely stable state.","Otherwise, Lin Yuan could not rest assured about Chimey’s safety in the faith country.","As Genius used Connected Tails to look through the contents of these documents, Lin Yuan carefully understood everything that had happened to Sky City and the faith country while he was away.","Everyone in Sky City had their own roles to play, and their development was very positive.","The real problem was the faith country. There were not many big problems in the faith country, but the small problems had never stopped. Each of these problems would definitely take a lot of effort to eliminate.","Lin Yuan realized how hard it had been for Luo Lan and Su Yiren.","Under such circumstances, Luo Lan and Su Yiren rarely took the initiative to ask about the distribution of faith.","After Lin Yuan finished reading the information, Wen Yu put it away. This information would be saved by Wen Yu in the future. Every 100 years, there would be a 100-year-old record of Sky City and the faith country.","To Liu Jie and Wen Yu, Sky City and the faith country were separate. The faith country could only be considered an existence under Sky City. The Astronomical Parliament and the faith country were both forces under Sky City.","However, because Wen Yu was not strong enough in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the Astronomical Parliament could no longer communicate with the stars in the sky, so the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting could not be held.","Wen Yu felt very regretful. When he first came to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Wen Yu knew very well how much help the faith country could bring to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan sensed Liu Jie’s aura and smiled as he said, “Big Brother Liu, from the looks of it, it won’t be long before the strength of your divine kingdom increases. You’re the first among us to reach High-Grade Divine Kingdom!”","Liu Jie controlled many insect-species carcinoma feys through Elegance. After these insect-species carcinoma feys turned into fairies, many resources were needed to control them. Even the core members of the major factions could not afford these resources!","Lin Yuan had been providing unimaginable resources to help Liu Jie and the other insect-species carcinoma feys to evolve.","In the beginning, these insect-species carcinoma feys did not bring many benefits to Liu Jie.","However, as these insect-species carcinoma feys evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, the benefits gradually became apparent!","Insect-species carcinoma feys had always been controlled by the world’s will. Under normal circumstances, it was impossible for them to surpass Diamond grade in their entire lives. When they, went berserk, they would cause a catastrophe that could cause great harm. Without any restrictions, this kind of disaster could spread wantonly in the main world.","Still, the slightly stronger species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds could eliminate this disaster with some effort and time.","However, after these insect-species carcinoma feys changed their fate and reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, the insects produced by these insect-species carcinoma feys could contribute faith power!","Elegance would forcefully extract the faith power from the bodies of these demons, causing Elegance’s realm to continuously increase like an accelerator!"]},{"number":2933,"title":"Chapter 2933 Sequence Competition!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2933 Sequence Competition!","It was precisely because of the benefits of these insect-species carcinoma feys turning into fairies that Liu Jie was willing to transform them into fairies. If not for that, Liu Jie would not want to waste too many of Lin Yuan’s resources because of him.","Liu Jie smiled. “Lin Yuan, I’ve already told you about the benefits brought by these fairies. I didn’t expect them to contribute faith power to Elegance continuously. At this rate, Elegance should be able to evolve to the Holy Spirit level in a few years.”","Lin Yuan agreed with Liu Jie’s words. Stepping into the Holy Spirit level from the Divine Kingdom was exceptionally difficult to other lifeforms. For example, Kani only obtained the opportunity to reach the Holy Spirit level from pinnacle Divine Kingdom after an indefinite.","Furthermore, Lin Yuan gave Kani the opportunity. Without Lin Yuan, Kani would have taken perhaps tens of thousands more years to evolve. Now that Liu Jie had obtained such an opportunity, he seemed like a child of providence.","The Holy Spirit level was not the pinnacle of Elegance. The stronger a lifeform was, the more faith power it needed. After reaching the Holy Spirit level, Elegance’s future journeys were bound to be trouble-free.","“Big Brother Liu, if Elegance needs any resources to increase its strength in the future, just inform me. Insect-species carcinoma feys also exist in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","“However, they are not as destructive here as they are in the main world. They are often not treated as strategic resources and have no value. Upon discovery, they are immediately disposed of. As a result, none of the chambers of commerce sell insect-species carcinoma feys.","“This area of North of the Lonely River is extremely vast. Although the resources may not be abundant enough, we can always find some insect-species carcinoma feys if we put in a lot of effort.","“After we control the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons, I plan to develop the resources North of the Lonely River systematically. When the time comes, you will contract all the collected insect-species carcinoma feys.","“Big Brother Liu, as your strength continues to increase, you will be able to lead white-clothed followers better!”","Liu Jie could feel Lin Yuan’s concern for him. All along, Lin Yuan had always treated him selflessly, evoking a feeling of warmth within him.","Lin Yuan’s words had struck a chord in Liu Jie’s heart.","When Sky City had just been established, Lin Yuan had appointed Liu Jie as the leader of the white-clothed followers. However, Liu Jie had never been a powerful person among them.","Since Liu Jie had no competitive relationship with anyone in Sky City, he could still manage himself well even if he was not strong enough. However, insufficient strength was not a good thing. Liu Jie could sense that some of the white-clothed followers were not submissive to him, but he felt powerless to address it.","He could not possibly blame the white-clothed followers for not respecting him enough just because he was not strong enough. To forge iron, one must be strong themselves. With enough strength, Liu Jie would not feel as powerless as before when managing these white-clothed followers.","Wen Yu noticed the details in Lin Yuan’s words. “Young Master, are you preparing to attack the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons this time?”","Wen Yu’s strategic insight was second only to the Moon Empress in Sky City, surpassing Mystic Moon, Su Yiren, and the others. In the beginning, Mystic Moon had merely provided guidance to Wen Yu. Later, he noticed that Wen Yu had been taken in as a disciple because of her outstanding strategic insight.","Wen Yu was well aware of the benefits of eliminating the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons and leading Sky City and the faith country to occupy their territory.","To be fair, Sky City only had high-end resources and Soldier Ration Radishes, which provided provisions for sustenance. There was no way to exchange these high-end resources for basic resources in the wilderness of North of the Lonely River.","For the faith country to develop to its current state, it had basically exhausted the foundational resources in the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","Su Yiren and Luo Lan had talked to Wen Yu about this matter more than once, but Wen Yu had never had a good solution because she could not possibly decide to attack the territories of the King Blood Jackals and Crimson Heaven Falcons.","Wen Yu did not know about the strength of Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter as well as the Moon Empress.","Lin Yuan had just mentioned that he wanted to control the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons to develop North of the Lonely River. Based on Wen Yu’s understanding of Lin Yuan, he would not have said such words unless he was confident.","Lin Yuan replied in a serious tone, “That’s right. We’ve actually already attacked the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons. There will be a result soon.","“After I control them, I’ll get someone to bring you to their territories. You can then personally inspect the resources in these two areas. After your inspection, I’ll have to trouble you to make a resource development plan for their territory.”","Lin Yuan’s words greatly surprised Wen Yu and Liu Jie.","Wen Yu and Liu Jie did not expect Lin Yuan to have attacked the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons. Since Lin Yuan dared to attack them, it could only mean that he had accumulated a lot of power, which was good for the entire Sky City.","“Young Master, when I head to the territories of the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons to inspect, I hope that you can dispatch around 200 million demon insects for me. I can allocate a portion of the demon insects to guard every resource location I find.","“Demon insects can sense each other’s presence. The territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons alone is much larger than that of the King Blood Jackals. If we don’t mark it, I’m afraid we’ll have to waste time searching for many resource locations when we go over to develop them.”","When Keira first arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds, 200 million demon insects were considered a very large group. However, now that Keira had been developing there for such a long time, it was easy to mobilize 200 million demon insects. Currently, there are at least 100 billion demon insects.","The majority were primarily Class 3 Genetic Lock demon insects, extensively bred by Class 2 Genetic Lock demon insects. These Class 3 Genetic Lock demon insects were like the cornerstones of the demon insect world. For the sake of the prosperity of the demon insects, they could be consumed at will.","Keira was an extremely ambitious individual. Her ambition did not lie in targeting Sky City or increasing her status in Sky City. Instead, she was constantly prepared to face the other demon insect queens and intended to compete with them.","Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, Liu Jie, and the Moon Empress had noticed this situation, which was why they refrained from managing Keira. For a demon insect, it was good always to maintain their ambitions.","Sky City’s territory was not that big yet. As Sky City’s territory continued to expand, Keira needed to breed many insects to maintain its stability. While Keira’s ability was not highlighted in the establishment of the faith country, she consistently maintained its foundational stability. As soon as the lifeforms that caused trouble were discovered, Keira promptly ordered the demon insects to eliminate them.","Without Keira to maintain stability, the frequent conflicts in the faith country would create an atmosphere of instability. It would be impossible for Sky City to obtain so much faith power.","“Wen Yu, there’s no problem. You have extremely high authority within the demon insects. If you have any requests, you can communicate directly with Keira and get demon insects from her. By then, based on the actual situation, you can have as many demon insects as you want.","“With the expansion of the territory, I’m prepared to release the demon insect, Keira. I’ll provide a large number of genes for Keira to continue strengthening the demon insect army.”","In fact, Sky City possessed top-notch combat power. It could be said that controlling the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons was much easier than controlling their territories.","Both the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons had many dependent species under their command and some species that existed independently, struggling for survival between the two species. These species were proud and unwilling to submit to other species or the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons did not favor them. They were extremely difficult to deal with.","After Lin Yuan gained control of the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons, he could exercise control over their dependent species, as he did with the King Blood Jackals. Then, he would integrate these dependent species bit by bit into the faith country, becoming a manager who cooperated with the demon insects to maintain stability in the faith country.","However, it would require a lot of effort to deal with those species that were not under the control of the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons.","Lin Yuan had never been one to rush into things. He would allocate ample time to organize and control these two territories. He could not rush the acquisition of territories and the expansion of the faith country. If Lin Yuan were too hasty, the Soldier Ration Radishes wouldn’t be able to keep up with the production of provisions.","“Young Master, 200 million demon insects are sufficient. There are many specialized flying demon insects among them. I only need two to three of these flying demon insects and about 200 demon insects on the ground to mark a resource location. I’ve been supplying Keira with the genes of various species recently.”","These words reflected Wen Yu’s foresight and strategic insight. With so many talented individuals focusing on internal affairs in the Sky City, Lin Yuan was relieved, knowing that they could grow through their efforts and eventually become managers of the Sky City themselves.","The faith country did not need an individual leader to deliver faith power to all the members of Sky City. Both Su Yiren and Luo Lan needed to relinquish their identity as individual leaders.","In such an environment, Lin Yuan could completely leave the faith country to others. He only needed to make decisions on important matters behind the scenes.","After talking to Wen Yu, Lin Yuan asked Liu Jie, “What’s the situation with Big Brother Liu’s white-clothed followers? Did anything happen while I was gone?”","Liu Jie hurriedly said, “Lin Yuan, I have something to tell you about the white-clothed followers. Sky City’s basic members are divided into Combat Sequence and Reserve Sequence. Reserve Sequence members have always wanted to charge forward. Many of them made it into the Combat Sequence through the annual competition.","“The situation in the main world is relatively stable because the resources obtained by the Combat Sequence members are higher than the Reserve Sequences. Even those who are a little lax will be difficult to surpass.","“But now that they’re in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, both the Combat and Reserve Sequence members must adapt to the environment of the Sky Beyond the Clouds. However, the adaptability to the environment varies depending on the individual’s physique.","“Many Reserve Sequence members have improved by leaps and bounds after coming to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, surpassing the strength of some members in the Combat Sequence. It will be time for the internal competition between the two Sequences in another month. I suggest we re-select the two Sequences’ members, including the white-clothed followers.”","Liu Jie rarely made such a controversial proposal. However, Liu Jie was exceptionally resolute in making this suggestion. As the leader of the white-clothed followers, Liu Jie had to interact frequently with the white-clothed followers, members of Combat Sequence and Reserve Sequence.","These people were indeed loyal to Sky City, but human hearts were fickle. Fairness was the biggest prerequisite to prevent fickleness from arising in people’s hearts. Evaluating one’s position in Sky City based on one’s true strength would be acceptable to everyone.","Even with continuous expansion, the total number of white-clothed followers would ultimately be limited to 500 people.","The white-clothed followers appeared excessively arrogant when facing other Battle and Reserve Sequence members. Liu Jie did not want to see this situation continue, as it would definitely pose a huge threat to Sky City’s development.","If the total number of white-clothed followers and Battle and Reserve Sequence members exceeded 100,000, it would be extremely difficult for Liu Jie to maintain absolute fairness. It would be so difficult that Liu Jie might have no choice but to give up on this idea.","However, with only 5,000 people, Liu Jie’s idea of maintaining absolute fairness was achievable. He only needed to spend some effort, and it was not difficult for Liu Jie.","When Lin Yuan heard Liu Jie’s suggestion, he did not immediately express his stance. Instead, he pondered for a moment before nodding at Liu Jie with a smile. Lin Yuan could also see Liu Jie’s growth from his suggestion.","Lin Yuan had always acknowledged the importance of fairness within a faction. While it might be possible to hold on without fairness for a short period, significant problems were bound to arise over time. Lin Yuan was very pleased that Liu Jie had discovered this and proposed a solution.","“Big Brother Liu, I support your suggestion. When the competition begins, we can make it more grand. Then, inform all the members of the white-clothed followers, Combat Sequence, and Reserve Sequence in advance. When the time comes, the core members of Sky City will attend the ceremony, so let them prepare in advance.","“Why don’t we start discussing what rewards we should prepare for these participants based on their results when the competition ends?”"]},{"number":2934,"title":"Chapter 2934: Twelve-Winged Silver Corona!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2934: Twelve-Winged Silver Corona!","Apart from the core members, Sky City was only made up of the white-clothed followers and Combat and Reserve Sequence members. After that, the white-clothed followers and Combat and Reserve Sequence would not expand.","It could be said that the white-clothed followers and Combat and Reserve Sequence members were definitely Lin Yuan’s own people who were under his control. Since that was the case, Lin Yuan had no reason not to be generous. Under normal circumstances, Lin Yuan would provide a large amount of high-quality resources for Sky City’s grassroots.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Liu Jie and Wen Yu immediately displayed thoughtful expressions on their faces. Neither of them had ever considered what sort of rewards they would prepare for the white-clothed followers and Combat and Reserve Sequence members in the competition.","Previously, these rewards had been provided by Lin Yuan, which meant that he had always been the one making the decisions. Liu Jie and Wen Yu had merely distributed the resources provided by Lin Yuan according to his instructions. Now that Lin Yuan had given Liu Jie and Wen Yu a chance to suggest the distribution of rewards, they would definitely think about it seriously.","Wen Yu quickly had an idea. As Sky City’s main manager, Wen Yu knew very well how much resources Lin Yuan had invested in the white-clothed followers and Combat and Reserve Sequence members. Wen Yu easily calculated the approximate value of the reward according to a certain ratio.","Liu Jie’s ability in this aspect was inferior to Wen Yu’s, and he was still in deep thought. However, Liu Jie was the leader of the white-clothed followers, and the white-clothed followers and Combat and Reserve Sequence members were under his control. Even if Wen Yu had an idea, she did not speak. Instead, she waited for Liu Jie to speak first before she added.","After nearly five minutes, Liu Jie spoke extremely seriously, “Lin Yuan, be it the white-clothed followers, Combat Sequence or Reserve Sequence members, they all harbor a strong desire for new feys.","“After reaching the Divine Kingdom level, every white-clothed follower needs to replenish at least two feys. Those Combat and Reserve Sequence members who haven’t reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom will need to replenish at least one fey.","“Some white-clothed followers and Combat Sequence members have already made a request of me. Zhou Luo has always managed the Reserve Sequence members, and the situation is the same on his end.","“I think there’s no harm in using high-quality Bronze feys as a reward and providing some resources needed to nurture feys!”","Upon hearing Liu Jie’s words, Wen Yu nodded subconsciously. What Liu Jie had said would be considered the best reward in any faction. However, while it might suffice as an ordinary reward in Sky City, considering it as the main prize for a major competition would indeed seem somewhat shabby.","Lin Yuan intended to make the competition exceptionally grand. All the core members of Sky City, including the City Lord, would attend. This could be considered to be Sky City’s biggest event since its founding. Awarding the resources that Lin Yuan typically granted to the grassroots of Sky City as the rewards for this grand event seemed inappropriate.","Before Wen Yu could speak, Lin Yuan shook his head, “Big Brother Liu, the rewards for the competition shouldn’t be limited to just resources. As far as I remember, I have only promoted the members of the white-clothed followers to the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, and the other Combat and Reserve Sequence members are only at the spirit fire level.","“Compared to the newly contracted feys and the resources to increase their strength, these members will definitely want to increase their levels as soon as possible.","“Since we’ve already decided to make this competition grand, why don’t we prioritize the Reserve Sequence members for the competition?","“I will upgrade the top 30 participants of the competition from the spirit fire level to the Divine Kingdom level. Then, these members will obtain the qualifications to compete with the Battle Sequence members. The top 30 Combat Sequence participants can compete with the 500 white-clothed followers!”","Liu Jie had never mentioned to Lin Yuan that some white-clothed followers had become arrogant and lazy. Once Liu Jie discovered this situation, he would immediately deal with it and personally find these white-clothed followers for an in-depth conversation.","While Liu Jie hadn’t really brought up this matter to Lin Yuan, Wen Yu had documented it in the files. Lin Yuan proposed such a competition reward to increase the strength of the Reserve Sequence members.","He would start mobilizing Sky City’s grassroots, starting with the Reserve Sequence. Not only would this make Sky City’s internal competition stronger, but it would also help eradicate the arrogance at the grassroots.","This competition would also offer the Reserve Sequence members the opportunity for evolution. Otherwise, it would be too difficult for them to stand out in a situation where high-quality resources were mainly directed towards white-clothed followers and Combat Sequence members.","Wen Yu smiled when she heard Lin Yuan’s arrangement, which resonated well with her thoughts. However, she refrained from making specific arrangements because she did not know the price Lin Yuan had to pay to help Sky City’s grassroots increase their strength.","“Lin Yuan, I’ll make the arrangements as you say. However, we’re still in the midst of attacking the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons. Should I inform you about the competition now?”","Lin Yuan immediately said, “Big Brother Liu, just pass on the news now. You must give the Reserve Sequence members time to prepare before the competition. The Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons won’t need these Reserve Sequence members, and it won’t affect Sky City. We just need to focus on the acquisition of the territories later.”","Liu Jie immediately prepared to make preparations. Before he left, he thought of something and said to Lin Yuan, “Lin Yuan, not long after you left, a bunch of mice appeared in the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ territory. These mice possess extremely strong reproductive abilities and decent strength themselves.","“If the Moon Empress hadn’t ordered Summer to take action and eliminate this group of mice that could reproduce at high speed, the entire King Blood Jackal’s territory would have suffered a calamity!”","Liu Jie had lingering fears on his face. He had personally witnessed the reproduction of that group of mice. Seven or eight mice could multiply within half a day into a large swarm.","Liu Jie was very familiar with Red Thorn and Silver Corona and was aware that they fed on flesh and blood. He took the initiative to propose reserving a portion of the mice and raising them in the sea of flowers woven by Silver Corona and Red Thorn. Liu Jie’s suggestion allowed Red Thorn and Silver Corona to improve rapidly while Lin Yuan was away. As this was Liu Jie’s private request to Summer, Wen Yu did not document it in the records.","Upon hearing Liu Jie’s words, Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow, especially upon learning that Liu Jie had arranged for these mice to be in the sea of flowers woven by Silver Corona and Red Thorn.","This was because Lin Yuan had deliberately collected many mice kings in the previous rodent infestation, intending to use these tooth mice to replace dimensional lifeforms in feeding Red Thorn and Silver Corona. He didn’t expect Sky City to have a rodent infestation.","Lin Yuan keenly captured from Liu Jie’s words that these tooth mice capable of causing rodent infestation had escaped from the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","The Spinning Wings White Falcons could be said to be the natural enemy of these mice. Tooth mice that could multiply infinitely could be considered the best food for the Spinning Wings White Falcons. They must have released these mice and come over. Otherwise, they would most likely cause a rodent infestation within their territory.","The Spinning Wings White Falcons probably intended to use this method to probe their side, so the Moon Empress had gotten Summer to quell this rodent infestation. This meant that the alien insects did not have much effect in combating these tooth mice.","Lin Yuan had personally witnessed tooth mice’s ability to breed, which was stronger than that of demon insects.","Moreover, the individual combat strength of these tooth mice was not something that demon insects could compare to.","If it weren’t for the fact that these ordinary tooth mice had low intelligence and couldn’t be completely controlled by Keira like the clueless Class 3 Genetic Lock demon insects, they would definitely have the ability to become the top of the Species Ranking and threaten other species.","At present, Lin Yuan had already returned to Sky City. At such a distance, he could contact Silver Corona and Red Thorn.","Red Thorn was currently in a deep sleep. It was obvious that it was at the juncture of evolving. Silver Corona, on the other hand, had successfully evolved.","Silver Corona sensed Lin Yuan’s connection and knew that he had returned to Sky City. It immediately headed to Sky City to look for Lin Yuan.","While Lin Yuan had been away, Silver Corona had experienced a major transformation in its life. Now that Lin Yuan had returned, Silver Corona was eager to see him. Firstly, Silver Corona really missed Lin Yuan, and secondly, it wanted to prove its growth to Lin Yuan.","Silver Corona’s speed was extremely fast, and it didn’t take long before it appeared in front of Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was both surprised and delighted that Silver Corona had grown a pair of wings to become a 12 -winged fairy. He immediately used True Data to check on Silver Corona.","[Fey Name]: Sea Burial Lotus Flower (Silver Corona)","[Fey Grade]: High Sovereign (5/10)","[Fey Type]: Source/Fairy [Fey Quality]: Immortal IV","Abilities:","[Spotted Coral]: When trained according to the spots on the coral jade, different effects are generated.","Nurture Spot Style: Nurture the spots that were absorbed from the spotted coral jade in the Bone Lotus Flowers. The Bone Lotus Flowers will use a living being’s life and soul to nurture the spots to give them vitality. The spots with vitality can use the living being’s original strength to increase the strength and stamina of the Bone Lotus Flowers.","Burial Spot Style: Place the spots in between the Bone Lotus Flowers. The spots will eat the Bone Lotus Flowers and become bone insects. The bone insects will retain the spot’s abilities and can deal with attacks on the Bone Lotus Flowers according to the abilities. The external lifeforce will be absorbed and when the external lifeforce is still weak, their soul can also be absorbed.","[Bone Powder Mist]: The Bone Lotus Flowers will vomit out the living being’s bones that could not be digested. The bone powder will fly up into the sky and stay in the coral spots once it reaches a set thickness of layer.","[Blood Bone Insect Drunk]: While the bone insects are eating, they will enter a drunken state. When they’re in a drunken state, they will not feel any pain. The circulation of their root power will also slow down.","[Blooming Lotus]: The Bone Lotus Flowers’ structure will change and gain split into main lotuses and branch lotuses. The branch lotuses will strengthen combat power while main lotuses will lose all combat power. Every time the main lotuses blooms, the spots will use the vitality they absorbed to produce a skeletal insect. The skeletal insect can consume gus to repair damage done to the body.","[Arrival of Grant of Death]: When the hermit’s dead servants could not stand up against the enemies, they will change into the grants of deaths that place death penalties on the targets’ souls.","[Soul Parasite Rebirth]: The soul will be hosted in the main lotus. The main lotus will make a copy of the aura of the lifeform’s soul and vitality. When the target’s body and soul are damaged, the main lotus can be sacrificed while absorbing vitality and soul power to enable the target to be reborn. Once reborn, the target will be in a very weak state and its soul and roots will also be diminished.","[Lotus Territory Fairy Shadow]: The fairy bloodline in its body will be used to nurture lotus fairies in the sea of Bone Lotus Flowers. When the lotus fairies attack targets, there is a chance that the target will die instantly. The lifeforms killed by the lotus fairies will be turned into lotus puppets and they will retain a portion of the targets’ abilities from when they were alive.","[Soul Receives Bone Territory]: Use the fairy bloodline to trigger its own soul. The soul will be linked to the sea of flowers and can temporarily store the sea of flowers. The larger the sea of flowers, the shorter the period of time it can be stored in the soul (Its soul energy can be used to replenish its soul territory. If there is insufficient soul energy to replenish or strengthen the sea of flowers, the soul will suffer irreparable damage.)","[Hidden Lotus Bud Realm]: When the growth space outside its body is restricted, or when it wants to shrink the area of the sea of flowers, the main flower will change its form and form a bud realm and nurture the sea of flowers in it. In battles, each bud realm will form a space of its own. It can transfer the target in the sea of flowers to the bud realm to divide the battlefield.","Exclusive Skill:","[Hermit’s Dead Servant]: The Bone Lotus Flower will absorb the target’s body when attacking it. 1% of the target’s power will be injected into the target’s soul to cause the target to be pregnant with its dead soul. The dead soul will consume itself and when the Bone Lotus Flowers gain 36 hermit dead servants, every hermit dead servant will be able to create a layer of mist over the Bone Lotus Flowers.","[Rotted Bones into Fireflies]: Both vitality and death aura will be absorbed simultaneously. The vitality will turn into fireflies that will mend the sea of","Bone Lotus Flowers. The death aura will increase the strength of every Bone Lotus Flower. If there is a pile of rotting bones below the Bone Lotus Flowers to supply nutrients to them, as long as the main lotus is alive, rotting lotuses will be produced from the rotting bones and energy will be saved!","[Lotus Territory Symbiosis]: All of the lifeforms in the territory will be classified as one entity and their lives will be linked together. When individual targets are attacked, the lotus territory will take on some of the damage. Before the lotus territory is destroyed, the individual targets will continue to live.","[Parasite Bone Revives Life]: During combat, branch lotuses will be sacrificed to repair the sea of Bone Lotus Flowers. Other Bone Lotus Flowers and insect patterns can also be rejuvenated.","[Indestructible Spots]: In battle, regardless of the injuries received, the spots will not be depleted by external attacks. Spots replenished through other methods will also enjoy this effect. The excess spots will be trapped in the bud realm. When the bud realm is attacked, it can increase the stability of the bud realm and restore it.."]},{"number":2935,"title":"Chapter 2935: 11 Stars: Astronomical Parliament!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2935: 11 Stars: Astronomical Parliament!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Silver Corona had evolved from Sovereign/Creation to High","Sovereign/lmmortal. It had even evolved all the way to Immortal IV. This meant that the effect of nurturing Red Thorn and Silver Corona through the mice was much stronger than using dimensional lifeforms.","Among the tooth mice Lin Yuan had brought back, there was a mouse king, who would undoubtedly accelerate the growth of Red Thorn and Silver Corona.","Silver Corona was now a genuine twelve-winged fairy. Silver Corona’s abilities and exclusive skills became extremely powerful as its bloodline improved.","Silver Corona had reached High Sovereign and obtained the Hidden Lotus Bud Realm skill, which allowed Silver Corona to freely control the size of the sea of flowers without having to reduce its size due to space restrictions.","With the main flower nurturing the bud realm, each bud realm would essentially become an independent spatial world. In this independent spatial world, the sea of flowers could grow freely. This was equivalent to folding the sea of flowers. Every bud realm could be considered as Silver Corona’s way of dividing the battlefield.","As Silver Corona’s bloodline grade continued to increase, it could still form a forbidden area in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Once a foreign lifeform entered this forbidden area, it would be relatively more powerful.","Silver Corona could teleport these foreign lifeforms to different bud realms and make these powerful individuals lose the chance to help each other. If Silver Corona couldn’t defeat the opponent in the bud realm, it could also teleport its unit in the sea of flowers to the bud realms to assist in the fight. This not only greatly increased Silver Corona’s combat ability but also its functionality.","Silver Corona’s Immortal Breed exclusive skill, Indestructible Spots, allowed It to ensure that its spots would not be damaged in battles. Although it required a large number of spots to fight, it could not produce spots on its own.","Even if some of Silver Corona’s abilities and exclusive skills could greatly increase spots in battle, this was also because Silver Corona had previously accumulated the spots through the jade-textured coral jades. Silver Corona itself did not possess such an ability. Now that it possessed Indestructible Spots, Silver Corona no longer had to worry about the consumption of spots in battle.","Silver Corona had accumulated an abundance of spots and was in a state of excess. It would continue to accumulate spots in the future. Then, it could deposit those surplus spots into the bud realm. Whether the attack came from inside or outside the bud realm, the spots entering could increase the stability of the bud realm and even repair it.","Silver Corona had yet to reach World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. Once it did, it would be able to truly demonstrate its capabilities.","Previously, Lin Yuan had thought that nurturing Silver Corona and Red Thorn was an extremely difficult task, but he no longer thought so. Given the speed at which Red Thorn and Silver Corona’s strength were enhancing, adding a certain amount of mice kings would further accelerate their evolution.","Lin Yuan only needed to pay attention to these mice and not let their reproduction speed exceed the limits of Red Thorn and Silver Corona’s devouring abilities.","While Lin Yuan observed Silver Corona, Wen Yu and Liu Jie also watched it. Wen Yu did not have fairy-type feys, so she was not sensitive to Silver Corona’s bloodline. Since every one of Lin Yuan’s feys was evolving optimally, Wen Yu didn’t find Silver Corona’s six wings particularly remarkable.","Unlike Wen Yu, Liu Jie was very concerned about Silver Corona’s bloodline. Liu Jie’s Insect Queen had already reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, and its current bloodline was only at the level of 12 -wings, which was equivalent to Silver Corona’s bloodline. While its bloodline was slightly more advanced than Silver Corona’s, it was still far from 14-wings.","Even Liu Jie, who had stepped into the Divine Kingdom level, could not guarantee that Elegance would have a chance to evolve its bloodline.","Silver Corona was currently at the Immortal level. One step further and it would become Eternal/Spirit Fire. When it reached the Divine Kingdom level, Silver Corona might be able to raise its bloodline to 14-wings if opportunity arose. In terms of bloodline potential, Silver Corona far surpassed Elegance.","However, the strength of a fey, even if it was a fairy fey, could not be judged solely by its bloodline. Very few feys could compare to Elegance’s abilities, especially when it could control insect-species carcinoma feys and transform them into fairies. Because Liu Jie knew his value, he never indulged in self-pity like he did when Elegance was still Myth Breed.","At present, Liu Jie had become more confident. “Lin Yuan, I’ll spread the news of the competition now. As the leader of the white-clothed followers, I’m also a part of Sky City’s Combat Sequence. I want to participate in the competition too!”","Neither Wen Yu nor Lin Yuan was surprised by Liu Jie’s request. Liu Jie was a very strong-willed person. When faced with doubt, he wanted to prove himself. There was no doubt about this.","From a leader’s point of view, Liu Jie indeed needed to do this. Liu Jie had no chance to show off his strength in Sky City, especially after growing up. This made it inevitable for the white-clothed followers to doubt Liu Jie after their strength increased to the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","In the face of such doubts, Liu Jie could only use his strength to prove himself. As long as he could prove himself, he would immediately win the respect of the white-clothed followers and Reserve Sequence members.","Wen Yu told Lin Yuan everything she needed to say and was about to leave when Lin Yuan stopped her, “Wen Yu, don’t be in a hurry to leave. I have something to tell you.”","Wen Yu hurriedly stopped in her tracks and wondered why Lin Yuan was looking for her. She would try to speculate Lin Yuan’s thoughts not because she wanted to think about how to respond to him but because, instead of simply being Sky City’s manager, it was more accurate to describe her as Lin Yuan’s subordinate.","Wen Yu had long developed a habit of thinking, especially about Lin Yuan’s words. Only then would Wen Yu be able to understand Lin Yuan’s thoughts and reach a tacit understanding with him.","However, after thinking for a long time, Wen Yu could not figure out why Lin Yuan had stopped her. At that moment, Wen Yu heard Lin Yuan say, “Wen Yu, I remember that your Astronomical Parliament had evolved to 10 Stars when you left the main world. It should be almost at 11 Stars now, right?”","Wen Yu hurriedly said, “Young Master, my sacred source lifeform, the Astronomical Parliament, has indeed evolved to 11 Stars and obtained a new function. But I’m still far from activating the Astronomical Parliament.","“Even though my Astronomical Parliament has reached 11 Stars, I still can’t contact the celestial bodies in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. I keep feeling that there’s a barrier between us. I fear that even if my Astronomical Parliament reaches 12 Stars, I still won’t be able to convene meetings among the constellations. ”","Wen Yu did not hide her current situation and thoughts from Lin Yuan. She had always been very anxious about this matter. Wen Yu’s value in Sky City was mainly demonstrated through the Astronomical Parliament. Now that there was no Astronomical Parliament, she could only be an ordinary internal affairs member.","Wen Yu and Su Yiren each had their own strengths in internal affairs. In fact, they were both talents of the same level. However, Su Yiren’s Absolute Love Poppy was useful in managing the faith country. While Su Yiren’s poppy fruits had suffered many casualties in the main world, she replenished them after coming to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. They had all reached the World Emperor/Divine kingdom. These 14 poppy fruits could help Su Yiren harvest faith in the faith country.","If it were not because Su Yiren had no intention to seize the faith power, the residents of the faith country who had been in contact with the 14 Poppy Fruits and were drawn to the Absolute Love Poppy’s function would undoubtedly provide faith power to Su Yiren.","In this aspect, Wen Yu, who could not activate the Astronomical Parliament, was weaker than Su Yiren. However, no one in Sky City would look down on Wen Yu because of this. Many of Sky City’s core members had been","Astronomical Parliament members. They knew very well that although Lin Yuan had the final say in the Astronomical Parliament, Wen Yu was the actual controller.","However, Wen Yu’s demands of herself were all self-imposed. It was precisely because she had always had such high expectations of herself that she was continuously driven to improve.","Lin Yuan replied, “Wen Yu, in the process of nurturing feys, I nurtured a fey that can help you strengthen your connection with the constellations. If you feel that your connection with the constellations is only a step away now, you might have a chance to reopen the Astronomical Parliament in the Sky Beyond the Clouds!”","Lin Yuan’s words took aback Wen Yu. Lin Yuan typically conducted himself with composure, and it was rare for him to be so certain about something. If Lin Yuan could say that, he could basically guarantee that the Astronomical","Parliament would be reconvened.","There were two reasons why Lin Yuan was so certain. Firstly, 12 Stars was not the peak of sacred source lifeforms. His master, the Moon Empress’ sacred source lifeform, Forage Moon, had already broken through the 12 Stars limit.","When a sacred source lifeform broke through to the 12 Stars, it would form its own sacred rune. With each breakthrough, another sacred rune would appear. Although there would be no additional functions, the more sacred runes there were, the stronger the functions obtained would be.","Furthermore, the Star Vastness Peony’s amplification on the Astronomical Parliament would increase as its strength continued to improve, and there was still a lot of room for improvement. With possible improvements in both aspects, Lin Yuan was very confident in reopening the Astronomical Parliament.","Just as Wen Yu was pleasantly surprised, Lin Yuan said, “Wen Yu, why don’t you summon the sacred source lifeform Astronomical Parliament for me to take a look? We can give it a try now. I can also take a look at the Astronomical Parliament’s new function after its evolution!”","When she heard Lin Yuan’s words, Wen Yu closed her eyes, and a surge of spiritual energy surged out of her body. It carried a mysterious feeling as if it could connect to the stars in the sky.","The huge cat’s eye on Wen Yu’s forehead was like an intelligent eye that contained the wisdom of the galaxy. Dazzling starlight flickered in the cat’s eyes. Lin Yuan could clearly sense that Wen Yu’s spiritual energy was condensing into the cat’s eyes and trying to connect with the stars.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to investigate the Astronomical Parliament.","[Sacred Source Name]: Astronomical Parliament","[Sacred Source Species]: Source genus/Sacred Source species","[Sacred Source Star Grade]: 11 Stars","[Sacred Source Type]: Mystic Realm","Abilities:","[Star Spirit Seat]: When the astronomical parliamentary meeting is taking place, the members seated on the 12 zodiac constellation seats can exchange resources with the members seated on the north-south constellation seat with the willpowers and laws","[Constellation Charge]: During the session of the parliament, the power of the stars can be utilized to replenish the energy of the convener, prolonging the duration of the session and maintaining stability during its proceedings.","[Constellation Passage]: Expends a huge amount of star energy to open up a passage that connects to the Astronomical Parliament members. Astronomical Parliament members can teleport through this passage under the consumption of their willpower and laws.","[Star Spirit Blessing]: The constellation related to one’s position will bestow blessings upon the parliament members. It will use the power of the stars to provide them with certain opportunities to aid in their growth.","As 11 Stars sacred source lifeform, the Astronomical Parliament possessed four abilities. Wen Yu had always been very satisfied with the abilities of her Astronomical Parliament. In her opinion, each of its abilities was extremely powerful.","Unfortunately, the Astronomical Parliament could not be convened and Wen Yu’s sacred source lifeform was simply ineffective without the parliamentary meeting.","Upon seeing Wen Yu’s Astronomical Parliament’s abilities, Lin Yuan nodded. Every ability of the sacred source lifeform had increased the Astronomical Parliament’s strategic significance.","Among these newly acquired abilities, Constellation Charge could prolong the Astronomical Parliament’s time, which was extremely necessary. Several times before, after the Astronomical Parliament meeting ended, Wen Yu would be extremely exhausted and fall into coma for two to three days. Constellation Charge could effectively prevent such a situation.","Lin Yuan valued the Constellation Passage more than the Star Spirit Blessing.","Constellation Passage could directly open a passage connected to the Astronomical Parliament members regardless of the cost. This passage was equivalent to a teleportation door. It would allow Lin Yuan to use the","Astronomical Parliament members as a springboard to develop in other areas.","When the Astronomical Parliament members encountered an unsolvable danger, they could also use the Constellation Passage to teleport Lin Yuan or others over.","Wen Yu was waiting with a serious expression. Lin Yuan was going to support her in her attempt to reconvene the Astronomical Parliament.","At present, Lin Yuan also summoned the Star Vastness Peony. No one knew that this attempt would cause a huge storm in the four universes of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.."]},{"number":2936,"title":"Chapter 2936: Restarting the Astronomical Parliament!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2936: Restarting the Astronomical Parliament!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan had just nurtured the Star Vastness Peony, and it was still at Sovereign X/immortal IX, a certain distance away from evolving to High Sovereign.","If the Star Vastness Peony wanted to increase its strength, it needed to rely on the absorption of moonlight energy. It would probably have to wait for a while before it could evolve to the Divine Kingdom level.","However, this did not stop the Star Vastness Peony from using its exclusive skill, Celestial Body Boost, on Wen Yu.","When the Star Vastness Peony saw Lin Yuan and Wen Yu, it bowed slightly to them. The Star Vastness Peony and Wen Yu were old acquaintances. Wen Yu’s sacred source lifeform, the Astronomical Parliament, needed to comprehend the constellations.","During the period when the Star Vastness Peony absorbed starlight energy at night, Wen Yu stayed by its side.","However, unlike with Wen Yu, the Star Vastness Peony was not as warm and friendly toward Liu Jie.","Lin Yuan gave an order to the Star Vastness Peony, “Star Vastness Peony, please use Celestial Body Boost on Wen Yu and help her comprehend the constellations through the sacred source lifeform. Remember to do your best to protect Wen Yu during the process and ensure her safety!” The Star Vastness Peony nodded seriously. Then, it transformed into its true form, and the enormous shadow of the peony enveloped Wen Yu.","Wen Yu suddenly felt she was much closer to the stars in the sky. Previously, there was a barrier between her and the stars that she could not sense and touch. Now, they seemed much closer, as if the distance between them had diminished.","Under the Astronomical Parliament’s communication, the stars began to respond. Excitement illuminated Wen Yu’s face as she felt the connection deepening. Wen Yu knew very well that if she wanted to, she could start the Astronomical Parliament now. She sensed the space that the constellations had built for her, and she was still the absolute owner of the space.","Wen Yu was not in a hurry to try opening the Astronomical Parliament. Instead, she opened her eyes and looked at Lin Yuan with joy. It was obvious that she was asking Lin Yuan for his opinion.","Lin Yuan nodded at Wen Yu. It was necessary to investigate the actual situation of the Astronomical Parliament before convening it. He definitely did not want a repeat of the mishap where the Astronomical Parliament was convened, only to be abruptly halted minutes later due to Wen Yu’s physical condition.","After receiving Lin Yuan’s approval, Wen Yu took out two chairs and placed one beside her as she had done during the Astronomical Parliament meeting. Wen Yu sat on the chair and prepared to begin the ritual that was usually prepared before the Astronomical Parliament.","Lin Yuan called out to Wen Yu and handed her the seven or eight pieces of rainbow fish coats, indicating that she should use them up first. Apart from increasing the speed at which Wen Yu recovered her spiritual energy, the rainbow fish coats could also increase the resilience of her spiritual energy to ensure that even in the face of unexpected situations, Wen Yu would be less likely to suffer damaged spiritual energy.","Once spiritual energy was injured, it was very difficult to recover. Lin Yuan did not want Wen Yu to be in such a dangerous situation.","Lin Yuan had also collected many spiritual-type ingredients that were suitable for Wen Yu. However, these spiritual ingredients had a certain stimulating effect on the mind. It was far from being as gentle as the rainbow fish coats. It was not suitable for use unless it was necessary.","Lin Yuan also sat on the chair and waited to enter the familiar Astronomical Parliament. After a while, Lin Yuan and Wen Yu appeared at the same time and sat on the golden chair that no one had sat on for a long time.","Among the constellations, Libra and Leo lit up brightly, as if they were welcoming the return of a king. When Wen Yu felt the familiar touch of the golden chair beneath her, tears welled up in her eyes.","Wen Yu knew that her strategic importance to Sky City would greatly increase in the future. As one of the three founders of Sky City, she could finally use the constellations to weave a net for Sky City’s bright future.","The Astronomical Parliament had evolved to 11 Stars, and Wen Yu had become more proficient in her control over it.","Wen Yu possessed the ability to control the candidates to enter the Astronomical Parliament. In this Astronomical Parliament meeting, Wen Yu had only invited Lin Yuan to participate, without extending an invitation to Liu Jie.","This Astronomical Parliament meeting was Wen Yu’s first attempt after coming to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. She would be as cautious as possible because she knew that this was the only way to ensure her safety.","“Young Master, should I try to lure people into the Astronomical Parliament?”","Lin Yuan nodded. Since he wanted to see if Wen Yu’s Astronomical Parliament could successfully convene in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it was necessary to make such an attempt.","The consumption of Wen Yu’s energy to lure others into the Astronomical Parliament was much greater than maintaining the Astronomical Parliament itself.","There was no shortage of people in the Sky Beyond the Clouds who were willing to use everything they had, including freedom and life, to make a wish.","Wen Yu quickly sensed a life form from afar through the Astronomical Parliament.","However, before Wen Yu could pull the life form into the Astronomical","Parliament, she felt her spirit and soul begin to weaken. She understood that this was due to the depletion of her spiritual energy.","Wen Yu quickly ended the Astronomical Parliament meeting. If she forcefully pulled this life form into the Astronomical Parliament, she was certain that she would be bedridden for at least three years and would not be able to recover her damaged spiritual energy in a short period.","Even though Wen Yu immediately canceled the Astronomical Parliament, she still collapsed on the chair in reality. She felt as if thousands of needles were stabbing into her brain. Despite the pain she endured spiritually, Wen Yu was exceptionally joyful.","With the enhancement of the Star Vastness Peony, she had indeed held the Astronomical Parliament as she wished. Be it her sacred source life form or the Star Vastness Peony, they would continue to enhance, and Wen Yu’s spiritual energy would also continue to enhance.","At the very least, she wanted to prove that she had the possibility of holding an Astronomical Parliament in the future.","However, she probably wouldn’t have the chance to do so in the short term. Even if the Astronomical Parliament convened now, they wouldn’t be able to do anything in just a minute or two. Wen Yu had to ensure that it could last for more than 15 minutes before she attempted to pull people into the Astronomical Parliament.","When Lin Yuan saw Wen Yu’s current state, he immediately took out a gourd-shaped container and handed it to her. “In this gourd-shaped container made of water-blue jade, there are about 150 drops of warm essence sweet marrow. This warm essence sweet marrow is far better than the rainbow fish coats for spiritual recovery.”","“When recovering spiritual energy, there is a possibility of some water-element energy attachment, which could be considered a drawback of the warm essence sweet marrow. Fortunately, I can get rid of them with the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia. Using the warm essence sweet marrow to restore spiritual energy can help you avoid constantly falling into such a state!”","As he spoke, Lin Yuan opened the gourd-shaped container and poured the warm essence sweet marrow into Wen Yu’s mouth. Wen Yu’s state of spiritual energy depletion was immediately alleviated.","Wen Yu was pleasantly surprised by the existence of warm essence sweet marrow. However, she was very well aware that it must be exceptionally expensive. If it was not necessary, she would try not to use them. They were a precious resource that Lin Yuan had obtained from the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan sighed inwardly. Given Wen Yu’s current situation, if she wanted to reopen the Astronomical Parliament, she would have to wait until her Astronomical Parliament reached 12 Stars.","Breaking through the 12 Stars limit and awakening the sacred rune, or enhancing the Star Vastness Peony to the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom level were the only ways to make it possible.","Wen Yu’s successful convening of the Astronomical Parliament had a lot to do with the Astronomical Parliament’s Constellation Charge ability. Without","Constellation Charge, she might not even be able to last 30 seconds. Be it the","Astronomical Parliament or the Star Vastness Peony, it would not be easy to enhance them.","Suddenly, Lin Yuan thought of the Hundred Questions Beast. The abilities and exclusive skills of the Hundred Questions Beasts varied during their evolution. However, some of them possessed abilities like Spiritual Energy Expansion.","If Wen Yu could contract a Hundred Questions Beast with the Spiritual Energy Expansion ability, she would have a higher reserve of spiritual energy, and the increase in her spiritual energy reserve would help her increase the timing of the Astronomical Parliament meeting.","With Lin Yuan’s growing the Hundred Questions Beasts, it was not difficult for him to find a Silver-grade Hundred Questions Beast with Spiritual Energy Expansion ability.","Lin Yuan decided to find a suitable Hundred Questions Beast for Wen Yu to contract.","The Hundred Questions Beast did contain a huge secret, but Lin Yuan did not need to hide it from Wen Yu. It was impossible for Wen Yu to leak this information.","Lin Yuan brought Wen Yu into the Spirit Lock spatial zone. This was not the first time Wen Yu had entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone. However, the current situation in the Spirit Lock spatial zone was completely different from when she had entered it previously.","Wen Yu was astonished by the development of the Spirit Lock spatial zone. No matter how good the previous Spirit Lock spatial zone was, it was just a space. However, the current Spirit Lock spatial zone looked like a world.","Before Lin Yuan entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone, he had already informed Genius to help him choose a Hundred Questions Beast with the Spiritual Energy Expansion ability.","Genius was already standing on the work table with a silver-blue Hundred Questions Beast, waiting for Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan’s work table could be said to be the earliest item in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. His work table had never been changed.","He brought Wen Yu to the work table and picked up the Hundred Questions Beast beside Genius.","“Wen Yu, are you interested in contracting this fey? This is a small Hundred Questions Beast. This Hundred Questions Beast’s skill can help you increase your spiritual energy. It has a very special way of increasing spiritual energy, in which it doesn’t directly increase your spiritual energy, but allows its spiritual energy to superimpose with yours.","“You should know that the Hundred Questions Beasts are feys with powerful spiritual energy. When they evolve to the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom level, their spiritual energy will increase by at least 50 times. As long as you contract this Hundred Questions Beast, I will help you nurture it.”","Lin Yuan did not force Wen Yu to contract a Hundred Questions Beast. He had always treated her with great respect. As opposed to demanding Wen Yu contract a fey, he was more willing to follow Wen Yu’s choice.","Lin Yuan would explain the pros and cons of contracting a Hundred Questions Beast to Wen Yu, and then he would let her make the decision herself.","Even if Wen Yu was unwilling to contract the Hundred Questions Beast, it would not be a problem for Lin Yuan. He had merely found a solution to the problem.","Wen Yu was aware of the Hundred Questions Beast’s existence and knew that","Lin Yuan had a way to evolve it. Actually, she had long wanted to contract a Hundred Questions Beast, but she had never mentioned it to Lin Yuan. Now that Lin Yuan was willing to let her contract the Hundred Questions Beast, Wen Yu was undoubtedly very happy. She was very willing to contract the Hundred Questions Beast.","As long as she contracted it, she could start the Astronomical Parliament very quickly.","This time, Wen Yu had marked someone who was deeply entrenched in their dreams and possessed strong determination. Even from a distance, Wen Yu’s perception of this individual remained exceptionally strong.","The Astronomical Parliament did not manage to pull the individual over this time, but Wen Yu would still be able to find them in the next Astronomical Parliament. Hopefully, when the next Astronomical Parliament meeting was held, the individual would be deep in their slumber.","The Illusion Snake was once an exceptionally powerful species in the West Universe. Four epochs ago, they changed the state of the West Universe, which caused the Faerie Institution and other powerful factions in the West Universe to retreat as they were unwilling to directly start a conflict with the Illusion Snake.","However, due to their excessive prominence and certain events they experienced, the Illusion Snake gradually declined. The glory of the Illusion Snake had long vanished from the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","The Illusion Snake had split into 16 species during those four epochs. Among these 16 species, the weakest was the Purifying Water Illusion Snake. As the saying went: “A starving camel is still bigger than a horse.”","Logically speaking, even the weakest species of the Illusion Snake, the","Purifying Water Illusion Snake, should have a decent living environment. However, what really made it difficult for the Purifying Water Illusion Snake to survive was the suppression of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snake.","During the past one or two epochs, the Crystal Rock Illusion Snake almost treated the Purifying Water Illusion Snake as servants, ordering them to utilize their innate talents to extract precious ores from the rocky cliffs near the sea.","If the quality and quantity of these ores did not meet the requirements of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snake, they would rely on the suppression of their bloodline to kill the members of the Purifying Water Illusion Snake.","If not for the fact that they wanted the Purifying Water Illusion Snake to continue serving them, the Purifying Water Illusion Snake would have long perished in the hands of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snake.","In a cave on a cliff by the sea, a youth from the Purifying Water Illusion Snake suddenly awoke from his slumber.."]},{"number":2937,"title":"Chapter 2937 Twelve Stars of Love!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2937 ?Twelve Stars of Love!","The youth was very handsome, and there were faint blue snake patterns on his cheeks.","Inside the cave, there was more than one youth of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. However, this particular youth possessed a distinctive trait compared to other members of the same species.","The eyes of ordinary Purifying Water Illusion Snakes were silver-blue, but this youth’s eyes were different. One was silver-blue, and the other was green-gold.","Despite his appearance, this young Purifying Water Illusion Snake didn’t receive any preferential treatment. On the contrary, he frequently suffered abuse from the supervisor of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes.","Fortunately, the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes’ recovery ability was extremely strong. Therefore, his injuries and stamina would recover very quickly.","The young Purifying Water Illusion Snake raised his hand and rubbed his strange eyes. Last night, before he slept, Jing Bai had made a wish. He was willing to use everything to change his fate and the future of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","Under the suppression of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes, the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes had gradually lost their pride. Especially the newly-born members of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes, who considered the current suppression of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes to be the norm.","Over the past thousands of years, some members of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes were unwilling to be controlled by the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes and fled. Most of the members who had fled had been captured. Once captured, they would be immediately executed by the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes and would not be given a second chance.","Those members of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes who had not been captured could indeed escape the control of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes, but their close relatives had to suffer on their behalf and be executed by the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes.","Over such a long period, the close relatives of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes would be wary of each other, fearing that their close relatives might flee and leave them to endure the consequences.","In particular, in the past few hundred years, there had been cases of close relatives reporting that their relatives had fled. This situation made Jing Bai’s heart ache as it only meant one thing, which was that the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes were gradually being enslaved by the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes and were about to completely become their dependent species. It was a great irony because the Crystal Rock and Purifying Water Illusion Snakes lineage had once come from the same species, which was the powerful Illusion Snakes.","As long as the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes remained weaker, they would only continue to suffer. The Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes couldn’t take the initiative to give up on the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","Without the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes using their abilities to help the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes collect those precious ores, it would be difficult for the latter to collect those ores. To a certain extent, the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes contributed to making the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes stronger.","Last night, Jing Bai felt as if someone had answered his prayers and brought him to a place where the constellations shone brightly. However, before he could see the magnificent constellations clearly in his sleep, he felt like he was falling. Immediately afterward, Jing Bai woke up from his sleep.","Although the scene in the dream was abnormally real, Jing Bai did not take the dream too seriously. He simply regarded it as an illusion resulting from his anxiety about changing his current situation.","Contemplating this, Jing Bai laughed at himself. How could he possibly possess the capability to change this situation?","Because of his brother’s escape, his parents had been killed by the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes. He was only able to survive until now as a laborer because of his eyes. However, his eyes were not considered extraordinary among the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes, rather, they marked the beginning of Jing Bai’s abuse.","The Purifying Water Illusion Snakes’ eye color had a deep connection with their bloodline. His green-gold eyes proved that his Purifying Water Illusion Snake bloodline was not pure.","In a species where people came together because of bloodlines, those with impure bloodlines would be ostracized and discriminated against. The other youths from the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes in this cave did not live with Jing Bai.","Even though it was clearly his elder brother’s betrayal that led to the tragic death of his loved ones, there was a prevailing belief circulating that Jing Bai had caused the deaths of his own relatives.","These unfair treatments had indeed left Jing Bai somewhat resentful towards the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. However, Jing Bai still hoped that the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes could rise successfully.","Day after day, the waves in this bay relentlessly swept against the cliffs, and the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes began another working day for the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes.","Beside him, a few men in half-body python skin armor were whipping the slow Purifying Water Illusion Snakes members with their whips.","The Purifying Water Illusion Snakes who had been thrown into the sea from the cliffs did not dare to make a sound. They could only endure the pain in their bodies and do their best to collect the ores. If they offended the supervisors of the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes, they would be beaten to death.","...","Wen Yu, who was in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, had already contracted the silver-gray Hundred Questions Beast Genius had brought. After the Hundred Questions Beast was contracted, it was arranged to absorb the pure spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone to increase its strength.","In the past few decades, Wen Yu had comprehended three Willpower runes that were suitable for spirit-type feys. She chose a Willpower Rune that was most compatible with the Hundred Questions Beast and combined it.","The Hundred Questions Beast, which had fused with the Willpower Rune, did not undergo a qualitative transformation like Genius’ bloodline when it evolved to Diamond grade.","Nevertheless, Wen Yu found the Hundred Questions Beast’s Spiritual Energy Expansion was truly beneficial.","Wen Yu exclaimed, “As long as Young Master raises this Hundred Questions Beast to Sovereign/Creation, I should be able to guarantee that the Astronomical Parliament will last for more than ten minutes. If this Hundred Questions Beast can evolve to Immortal Breed, the Astronomical Parliament will be able to convene for more than 20 minutes.","“When the Astronomical Parliament breaks through, you can use the Star Vastness Peony to enhance me. It should be possible to extend the Astronomical Parliament meeting time to one hour, much longer than the time spent convening it in the main world previously. I can also recruit more people to become a member of the Astronomical Parliament.”","After contracting the Hundred Questions Beast, Wen Yu’s eyes were filled with endless anticipation.","After leaving the Spirit Lock spatial zone with Wen Yu, Lin Yuan did not stay any longer. Instead, he prepared to meet Su Yiren and Luo Lan. Lin Yuan knew that both of them had the most things to report to him in the entire Sky City.","During this period, if the Moon Empress had borne the heaviest burden, then Su Yiren and Luo Lan had borne the heaviest work.","Lin Yuan knew very well how vast the faith country was. It was one thing for Su Yiren and Luo Lan to possess the capability, but it was another thing altogether for them to bear the burden. He would not confuse the two matters.","Despite having chosen to contract a Vitality Sloth, it didn’t stop Su Yiren and Luo Lan from looking exhausted when Lin Yuan saw them. In particular, Luo Lan had dark circles under her eyes, which were a sign of prolonged physical exertion.","Luo Lan’s performance in Sky City had never been outstanding. Ever since she joined Sky City, she had been receiving help from others. Both Yin Lin and Su Yiren had assisted Luo Lan a lot, not to mention the support provided by Lin Yuan and Wen Yu.","Luo Lan, who had been growing up with the help of others, really hoped to prove herself. While Luo Lan was very ambitious, she had always suppressed her ambitions very well because she believed that it was foolish to show feelings in a place where others were generally better than herself.","During this period, Luo Lan had done her best, and she was very satisfied with the current results. Although Su Yiren was the one in charge of managing the faith country, Luo Lan was very clear about the value of her efforts. She had never harbored the intention of proving herself and only wanted to silently contribute to the construction of Sky City. This was the best repayment to her savior.","Su Yiren didn’t have as many thoughts as Luo Lan. Ever since she had left the main world and was no longer in charge of the Seven States of Darkness, and managing the Dark and Sand Island Continents, Su Yiren had been relieved of her burden.","What left the deepest impression on Su Yiren was the moment Lin Yuan found her hiding behind a pile of trash. At that moment, Su Yiren felt both uneasy and at ease.","Previously, Su Yiren had always felt that the moment Seventh Page War conquered the Seven States of Darkness was the turning point of her fate. However, the biggest turning point in her fate was actually the moment Lin Yuan found her.","When Lin Yuan found her, Su Yiren’s only thought had been survival. Recovering the Seven States of Darkness was just a wish she could only dream of.","Lin Yuan was like a dreamer who had fulfilled all of Su Yiren’s wishes. Since then, Su Yiren was very willing to use her own capabilities to manage a complicated faction. The more challenging things were, the more motivated Su Yiren became.","Both Luo Lan and Su Yiren had finally reunited with Lin Yuan after a long separation. Previously, they had not had much chance to communicate with Lin Yuan through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower.","Lin Yuan didn’t talk about business with Su Yiren and Luo Lan right away. Instead, he handed over some spiritual ingredients that were suitable for them.","There was nothing special about Luo Lan’s feys because Luo Lan’s soul energy was weaker than ordinary people’s. This was the reason Luo Lan only successfully contracted his own sacred source lifeform when she became a spirit fire expert.","Unlike Su Yiren, who had the Absolute Love Poppy, Luo Lan was skilled at governance, and Lin Yuan only needed to provide Luo Lan with ordinary resources to enhance her strength.","Su Yiren’s situation was very different from an ordinary individual like Luo Lan. Her situation was somewhat similar to Liu Jie’s, but Elegance’s uniqueness made it so that Liu Jie could only contract one fey. The insect-species carcinoma feys that Liu Jie contracted later were all contracted by Elegance.","On the other hand, Su Yiren’s contracted feys had to be combined with her sacred source lifeform. The Absolute Love Poppy would then control all the feys under Su Yiren’s control.","“Su Yiren, I heard from Wen Yu that your Absolute Love Poppy has mutated. I wonder how it is doing?”","Upon hearing that, Su Yiren immediately summoned her sacred source lifeform, the Absolute Love Poppy. A strange touch of pink light flickered in Su Yiren’s hand, and a beautiful flower the size of two palms was gently swaying.","Even though Su Yiren was controlling the Absolute Love Poppy to prevent its aura from leaking out, it still affected Luo Lan, who was standing at the side, and made her appear intoxicated.","On the other hand, Lin Yuan was not affected by the Absolute Love Poppy. He had developed strong resistance to control, whether it be over his mind, soul, or spirit. This resistance stemmed from his connection to the Purple Afterglow and the Alluring Soul Alluring Fox bloodline in his body.","Whether it was the Purple Afterglow that had evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom or the Alluring Fox bloodline in Lin Yuan’s body, their levels were not inferior to the Absolute Love Poppy.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to investigate the Absolute Love Poppy.","[Sacred Source Name]: Absolute Love Poppy","[Sacred Source Species]: Source genus/Sacred Source species","[Sacred Source Star Grade]: 12 Stars","[Sacred Source Type]: Spiritual/Soul/Mind","Abilities:","[Love Desire Glass]: By using the mind, spirit, and soul, the target will feel enormous love that will strike the target’s most important parts. A piece of glass that contains love will be formed. When the glass is broken, the target will give up its energy core, and its combat power will be triggered. Once the energy core is used up, the target will die.","[14 Poppy Fruits]: Contract 14 lifeforms of the same gender as the contractor, and the Absolute Love Poppy will plant a small poppy fruit inside the 14 lifeforms. The targets will gain a small amount of the Absolute Love Poppy’s power, and their appearances will change as well. The poppy fruits inside the targets will absorb the love from the target and transfer it into the Absolute Love Poppy to increase its Stars.","[Desire Absorption]: When a target is under the Absolute Love Poppy’s complete control, the target will become its plaything. All the energy in the target’s body can be absorbed by the Absolute Love Poppy at will. The Absolute Love Poppy will brew the controlled lifeform through the special substance and poison in its body. When it matures, it can absorb the target’s energy and convert it into its own inherent energy.","[Poppy Fruit Forest]: Every target who is attracted and contributes energy to the 14 Poppy Fruits will provide the Absolute Love Poppy with an equal amount of energy. The target’s double energy supply will be borne by the target itself.","Lin Yuan discovered that the Absolute Love Poppy’s star grade had evolved to 12 Stars. He remembered that the Absolute Love Poppy was only a 6 Stars sacred source lifeform when he first observed its data.","Lin Yuan realized that whether it was the Absolute Love Poppy, Su Yiren’s feys, or Su Yiren herself, the speed at which their strength increased far exceeded others. Be it Wen Yu, Luo Lan, Liu Jie, or the others, they were all left behind by Su Yiren. This must be related to the Absolute Love Poppy’s Desire Absorption ability."]},{"number":2938,"title":"Chapter 2938: Red Thorn’s Evolution!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2938: Red Thorn’s Evolution!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Absolute Love Poppy’s ability Desire Absorption could allow any life form that could be controlled by the Absolute Love Poppy to become bait for the Absolute Love Poppy to increase its strength.","As long as the Absolute Love Poppy injected a special substance into the target’s body, the strength absorbed by the target could directly be added to the Absolute Love Poppy and Su Yiren.","Su Yiren had relied on this method to increase her strength so quickly!","Apart from Desire Absorption, the Absolute Love Poppy also obtained a new ability called Poppy Fruit Forest. This ability allowed Su Yiren to obtain more faith power.","It could be said that the 14 Poppy Fruits had completely become a tool for Su Yiren to harvest faith power!","With this ability, Su Yiren’s speed of improvement would not be any slower than Liu Jie’s.","Lin Yuan was very happy about the improvement of his companions.","Even though Su Yiren was controlling the Absolute Love Poppy with all her might, she was still unable to prevent its aura from leaking out.","Luo Lan had been under the control of the Absolute Love Poppy for a long time so it had a considerable impact on her.","After Lin Yuan inspected the Absolute Love Poppy, Su Yiren quickly recalled it.","“Young Master, after my Absolute Love Poppy reaches 12 Stars, it will be quite difficult for it to continue improving. I’m no longer focused on improving my strength.","“Luo Lan and I have gained a lot from managing the faith country. Actually, those living beings scattered in the various villages don’t have much sense of belonging to the villages. After these villages were united, they could not attack each other because they were under our control, causing each village to be relatively peaceful. These neighboring villages began to fuse, and various lifeforms began to gather in groups.","“At first, Luo Lan and I felt that this kind of gathering was more in line with the standards of development. We planned a test area to deliberately facilitate this. But in the end, once the groups formed by these living beings reached a sufficient scale, they neglected our management.","“In the end, Luo Lan and I separated the residents of this experimental area and moved them to various places in the faith country to neutralize these groups. But this will inevitably cause conflicts between the different species!”","Su Yiren honestly explained to Lin Yuan the problems she had encountered when she was in charge of the faith country. Only Su Yiren could provide the best feedback to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan did not immediately answer Su Yiren’s question. Instead, he lowered his head and seriously pondered over her question.","In the end, Lin Yuan said seriously, “I think Sky City’s current development direction is most compatible with Sky City. We don’t have to put too much thought into it. We’re already doing our best to provide the best living environment for the residents of the faith country.","“In the faith country, we can guarantee food, shelter, and medical treatment. There’s no need to redistribute these living beings in the faith country according to their species. Once redistributed, the faith country will be equivalent to a miniature Sky Beyond the Clouds. The various races in the Sky Beyond the Clouds are constantly fighting. How can there be peace?”","Lin Yuan’s words reminded Su Yiren of an issue she had when she managed the Dark Continent and Sand Island Continent in the main world.","Now that she was managing the faith country, there were more than ten thousand species in the faith country.","If stability could be maintained, it meant that this method was an extremely high-quality way to manage the faith country. There was no need for her to take the initiative to create problems before they arose.","“Young Master, I understand what you mean. The faith country is still expanding. As there aren’t enough Soldier Ration Radishes, Luo Lan and I decided to slow down the expansion of the faith country. Many demon insects were lost in the previous conflicts.","“I hope that Keira can produce divide more demon insects to increase the stability of the faith country. Recently, there have been some rumors in the faith country that the Crimson Heaven Falcons are preparing to attack the faith country.","“They think that the faith country is about to become the possession of the","Crimson Heaven Falcons. This is most likely because a spy from the Crimson Heaven Falcons has infiltrated the faith country. However, because there are many people in the faith country, it’s very difficult to identify the spy. I’m afraid these rumors will throw the current faith country into disarray.”","Su Yiren knew very well that the faith country had only been established for a short period. The residents of the faith country did not have much sense of belonging to the faith country. Any rumor could destabilize the current state.","Apart from the internal stability of the faith country, Su Yiren was also worried that the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons would attack the faith country. Su Yiren would be helpless if such a thing happened.","Lin Yuan said to Su Yiren seriously, “You don’t have to worry about the situation with the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons. Soon, both the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons will become subordinates of Sky City and serve us. We will soon take over the territories of the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons.","“At that time, the faith country can expand into the territories of the Crimson","Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons. I will solve the problem of the Soldier Ration Radish supply as soon as possible. In a short period, I will be able to completely solve the problem of food and clothing in the faith country. Just do your best to expand your faith country.”","Su Yiren’s heart skipped a beat. Su Yiren had always regarded the Spinning Wings White Falcons as a threat.","In the end, Lin Yuan was not only going to get rid of the Spinning Wings White Falcons but the Crimson Heaven Falcons as well.","Without the threat of the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons, developing a faith country was a piece of cake for Su Yiren. Constructing the basic form of a faith country was the most difficult stage. Su Yiren had already solved the most difficult stage.","It was only now that Luo Lan completely broke free from the Absolute Love","Poppy’s influence. However, the Absolute Love Poppy still left some residual effects.","Luo Lan looked at Su Yiren with an ambiguous gaze and her face flushed red. When Su Yiren looked at her, she even lowered her head shyly.","Su Yiren hurriedly handed Luo Lan a potion that strengthened her spiritual energy and eliminated the mental influence. She urged Luo Lan to drink it. Su Yiren had specially requested these medicines from the Moon Empress. She was afraid that the Absolute Love Poppy would affect her own people.","Luo Lan did not interrupt the development of the faith country. She just let Su Yiren report to Lin Yuan.","Seeing that Su Yiren was almost done talking to Lin Yuan, Luo Lan said, “Young Master, didn’t you say that you wanted to choose some dependent species in the faith country to nurture? I paid special attention to these people in the faith country and realized that many of them have the chance to become spirit contractors.","“I think that if we want to nurture the managers of the faith country, we might as well choose and nurture some spirit contractors. Compared to ordinary people, spirit contractors are undoubtedly more suitable for this job. Spirit contractors are already seen as noble in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. This way, it will be easier to convince the public!”","Lin Yuan nodded. It was indeed better to nurture those with some talent as spirit contractors.","“Luo Lan, your suggestion is not bad. Since that’s the case, you can choose a spirit contractor from each village to nurture Use these spirit contractors to strengthen the control over the various villages.","“The faith country is a force formed by combining villages. If we can strengthen the control over these villages one by one, it will undoubtedly be a strong boost to the stability of the faith country as a whole.”","Lin Yuan, Su Yiren, and Luo Lan chatted for a while before Lin Yuan suddenly sensed Red Thorn calling out to him.","This meant that Red Thorn’s grade, quality, and bloodline had evolved.","Lin Yuan did not ask Red Thorn to come over. Instead, he prepared to go to the underground palace to meet Red Thorn personally.","Coincidentally, Lin Yuan was going to throw the mice kings into the sea of flowers that Red Thorn and Silver Corona had opened.","“Su Yiren, Luo Lan, I’ll inform Keira to produce more demon insects. Then, I’ll add more demon insects to guard each village.”","While talking to Su Yiren and Luo Lan, Lin Yuan sent Keira to the underground palace.","Lin Yuan used the Ethereal Jellyfish’s Node Teleportation skill and appeared in the underground palace after a few teleportations.","Before Lin Yuan could leave the underground palace, Red Thorn bumped into him.","Lin Yuan realized that Red Thorn’s fairy bloodline had also increased to 12 wings.","However, compared to Silver Corona, Red Thorn’s bloodline was clearly much stronger so Lin Yuan was not surprised. This was because Red Thorn’s bloodline was stronger than Silver Corona’s even before it evolved to 12 wings. Lin Yuan used True Data to investigate Red Thorn’s bloodline.","[Fey Name]: Red Thorn (Twelve-Winged Demon) (Thousand Eyes Relinquish)","[Fey Species]: Rafflesia genus/fairy species","[Fey Grade]: Sovereign (3/10) [Fey Type]: Source/Wood [Fey Quality]: Creation VI Abilities:","[Mouth of Relinquish]: Secretes vigorous digestive fluids with powerful corrosive properties, allowing a faster speed to absorb the energy in the food. The Tongue of Relinquish inside the mouth is able to increase the digestion speed by several times. It can also secrete a special corrosive fluid from the flesh and blood that it consumes. When the Tongues of Relinquish pierce a target, the tip of the tongue can be cut off and left in the target’s body. While the target remains alive, the tip of the tongue will control the target’s spirit and soul. After the target dies, the tip of the tongue can control and manipulate the target to make it appear as though it is still alive.","[Brutal Carnivore Vine]: The vines contained digestive fluids that grew in midair and the sharp teeth on the inner side of the vine could grind off and collect flesh and blood energy.","[Eye of Relinquish]: Eyes formed by using blood and flesh energy. Each eye contains a huge amount of blood and flesh energy. When the number of Eyes of Relinquish on every Mouth of Relinquish is maintained below 60, they are merely able to store energy. When the number of Eyes of Relinquish is above 60, those Eyes of Relinquish that are above 60 can be turned into an energy ray at any time.","[Sea of Flowers State Transition]: By quickly using up the stored-up energy, the sea of flowers’ child ramets’ attacking power and mobility can be improved by several times. The child ramets’ weapons will also morph in a way that increases their functionality.","[Demon Spirit Curse Kill]: Whenever any of the ortet’s ramets touches an enemy target and breaks through a target’s defense, the target will be cursed. Every curse carries a negative effect that would be stacked with every additional attack.","[Tongue Pouch Births Demons]: When a corpse is being consumed, it can be stored in the tongue pouch and nurtured. If the corpse’s power is intact, it can be nurtured into a special lifeform that contains a fairy bloodline. Its previous power will be retained and its power can also be increased when tempered by blood energy.","[Demon Transformed Bound Fairy]: Its bloodline will be injected into the demon nurtured by Tongue Pouch Births Demons. The demon will transform into a fairy with a bloodline that is one level lower and is controlled by Red Thorn. The fairy will take on the same abilities and with sufficient vitality, can become an individual Mouth of Relinquish (The bound fairy’s bloodline and power will be increased as the main body evolves. The nutrients absorbed by the bound spirit’s Mouth of Relinquish will be channeled to the main body.) [Death Soul Servant Demons]: During the process of devouring living beings, use the souls and death aura of living beings as well as their demonic bloodline to create servant demons. When the strength of the servant demons reaches the same level as their bodies, new servant demons will be born. Apart from having combat strength, these servant demons can also increase the speed at which it can nurture demons through their tongue pouches and transform them into demons.","Exclusive Skill:","[Spore Growth]: Spits a huge amount of spores, which can absorb the energy or flesh energy supplied by Red Thorn, out of its spore cavity to quickly grow ramets and child ramets that are controlled by the ortet.","[Wither Glory]: Red Thorn can rapidly absorb the energy from the soil and pour the energy into the sea of flowers. As long as the soil has the roots of the child ramets and ramets, the withered sea of flowers would reach its prime state.","[Spores Destruction Death Order]: Each time the entity grown from a spore is on the brink of death after being attacked by the enemy, the enemy’s energy that enters the spores will turn into pure death aura and death curse energy. The death aura will trigger the effects of the death curse energy and a time can be set to decide when the accumulated death curse energy will attempt to kill the target (the target’s survival is linked to the strength of the vitality in the target’s body).","[Sea of Flowers Sacrifice]: Sacrifice the sea of flowers produced by the main body and gather the energy of the sea of flowers into its body, allowing it to enter a special demonic state to maximize its strength. After entering this state, the deterrence and killing effect on other targets with demon bloodlines will greatly increase.."]},{"number":2939,"title":"Chapter 2939: The Crimson Heaven Falcons and Spinning Wings White Falcons Fall Under Control!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2939: The Crimson Heaven Falcons and Spinning Wings White Falcons Fall Under Control!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Previously, Red Thorn was Suzerain/Myth. Now, it had finally transformed into a Sovereign/Creation.","Red Thorn had become a 12 -winged fairy at Sovereign/Creation. Red Thorn had crossed an extremely difficult threshold. Red Thorn’s future development could be described as limitless.","Red Thorn’s attachment to Lin Yuan was extremely obvious, and it was extremely aggressive. Red Thorn had never tolerated other creatures being too close to Lin Yuan, especially fairies with the same bloodline as it.","Lin Yuan allowed Red Thorn to sit on his shoulder. It flapped its golden and red translucent wings and waved its small hands in satisfaction.","A vine extended from Red Thorn’s hand and tied the other end to Lin Yuan’s wrist. Red Thorn liked to communicate with Lin Yuan in this way. This was a habit it had developed before it obtained the fairy bloodline.","When Silver Corona and Red Thorn saw Lin Yuan, it scoffed and quickly flew back to the sea of flowers.","In the beginning, when Red Thorn and Silver Corona’s grades were relatively low, they were able to interact in a friendly manner around Lin Yuan. As their bloodlines improved, Red Thorn’s possessiveness toward Lin Yuan became more and more obvious.","Moreover, Red Thorn’s bloodline became stronger and it could directly suppress Silver Corona. This made Silver Corona intentionally avoid Red Thorn when it was by Lin Yuan’s side.","Without Lin Yuan, Red Thorn and Silver Corona would still be able to communicate with each other.","The sea of flowers was created by Red Thorn and Silver Corona. Privately, Lin Yuan valued Red Thorn more than Silver Corona.","Red Thorn was the first fey that Lin Yuan had contracted after Genius and Chimey. Red Thorn was also a legacy left behind by Lin Yuan’s parents in this life.","It could be said that no matter what kind of fortuitous opportunity Red Thorn obtained, every step of its evolution met Lin Yuan’s requirements. Lin Yuan only gave Red Thorn the freedom to evolve when it reached Myth","Breed.","During the evolution process, feys were affected by their surroundings.","Red Thorn’s evolution perfectly confirmed this conjecture.","Red Thorn’s Sovereign ability Dead Soul Servant Demons was extremely similar to Silver Corona’s exclusive skill Hermit’s Dead Servant. They fused the souls and bloodlines of the living to refine servant demons during the process of devouring living beings.","However, the Hermit’s Dead Servants created by Silver Corona were used for combat. The Dead Soul Servant Demons refined by Red Thorn were more like functional products.","Apart from having combat ability, it could also work with the ability Tongue Pouch Births Demons and Demon Transformed Bound Fairy to increase the speed at which demon spirits transformed into fairies.","It could be said that Red Thorn’s strongest combat ability was dependent on Tongue Pouch Births Demons and Demon Transformed Bound Fairy.","Dead Soul Servant Demons strengthened these two abilities, which basically strengthened Red Thorn’s strength.","Red Thorn’s new exclusive skill was called Sea of Flowers Sacrifice. Sea of Flowers Sacrifice was completely different from Red Thorn’s previous path.","Red Thorn’s previous path involved dividing its energy and transforming it into a sea of flowers to fight.","All the combat methods revolved around the sea of flowers.","Red Thorn was like the commander of the sea of flowers, but Sea of Flowers Sacrifice allowed Red Thorn to gather the energy of the sea of flowers into its body. It stimulated Red Thorn’s fairy bloodline again and entered a special fairy form to fight. In this state, it could maximize Red Thorn’s strength and make it a super strong individual unit.","Not only that, but after Red Thorn entered this state, it would be much more intimidating and lethal to other creatures with fairy bloodlines.","Red Thorn had the lowest grade among all of Lin Yuan’s feys.","Even the feys that Lin Yuan had spirit locked were about to surpass Red Thorn in grade.","However, the exclusive skill Sea of Flowers Sacrifice meant that Red Thorn’s combat potential had been greatly increased!","Lin Yuan was extremely satisfied with Red Thorn’s evolution.","“Do you still find the toothed mice delicious?”","Red Thorn quickly nodded.","“Yuan, the toothed rats mice much better than those dimensional lifeforms. The genes of these toothed mice are extremely beneficial to Silver Corona and me. After eating these toothed mice, I realized that they have improved my ability to produce the sea of flowers.","“It’s a pity that these toothed mice’ grades are a little low. It felt pretty good to eat them before Silver Corona and I evolved. After evolving in grade, I always feel that a large portion of my digestive ability will be wasted.”","Lin Yuan knew that Red Thorn was not picky about food but it rarely praised a certain food so seriously.","Lin Yuan handed the fey storage box containing the mice kings to Red Thorn.","“There are high-grade toothed mice in here. Some of them are even kings. Their breeding ability is much stronger than ordinary toothed mice. You don’t have to worry. As you advance in grade, the speed at which you increase your strength will slow down. Just focus on improving your strength.","“If you lack any resources, inform me immediately. These toothed mice haven’t been nurtured yet. In the future, if you think that the toothed mice produced by these mice kings don’t meet your and Silver Corona’s requirements, I just need to nurture them.”","Lin Yuan paused for a moment before speaking to Red Thorn in an extremely solemn tone, “Red Thorn, you’ve already seen the breeding ability of these toothed mice. You should know how much trouble these toothed mice will cause if they escape from the sea of flowers. When raising these mice, you have to make sure that they don’t escape your control no matter what.”","Red Thorn nodded and said, “Lin Yuan, don’t worry. When Summer brought the toothed mice over, she specially explained this to Silver Corona and me. She even said that these toothed mice are extremely good at burrowing underground. I have more arrangements for the underground of the area where I’ll be nurturing these mice than I do for the surface!","“These mice won’t escape Silver Corona’s and my control. In order to prevent accidents from happening, Silver Corona and I have also taken many protective measures in the periphery of the mice breeding area and deep underground.","We found that when raising these rats, they have a certain degree of obedience.”","Lin Yuan revealed a surprised expression. This was the first time he had heard that these toothed mice which could cause large-scale rat infestation had the ability to obey!","“Red Thorn, what do you mean by obedience? Can you and Silver Corona control these rats?”","Red Thorn shook its head and said, “We can’t control the rats, but we can set up a safe area for them. The toothed mice in the safe area won’t be attacked by Silver Corona and me. These toothed mice aren’t very intelligent, but they will soon realize this","“In order to survive, these toothed mice will fight for the safety zone. They will not hesitate to attack each other for it. The toothed mice that can stay in the safe area will be the strongest in the entire breeding ground.","“Only by handing the breeding rights to these toothed rats can we ensure that the quality of the toothed rats will increase.”","Lin Yuan understood what Red Thorn meant by control. To put it bluntly, Red Thorn and Silver Corona had found a way to let these mice reproduce in the sea of flowers.","Red Thorn and Silver Corona used the toothed mice’s instinct to seek advantages and avoid disadvantages to obtain food in an extremely stable way.","Lin Yuan knew that Red Thorn and Silver Corona were well-prepared, but he still reminded Red Thorn, “These mice kings have extremely high intelligence. They can use their identity as kings to control all the mice. With the addition of these mice kings, it will definitely bring you and Silver Corona quite a bit of difficulty.”","While Lin Yuan was instructing Red Thorn, the nest of the Spinning Wings White Falcons had been completely controlled by Liu Chen and Liu Yao.","The members of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, led by Bai Yunzong, collapsed to the ground.","The members of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, led by Chi Jue, resisted much harder than the Crimson Heaven Falcons. The elite members of the Crimson Heaven Falcons basically had their wings broken.","The energy in their bodies was sealed by a golden leaf.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao had been targeted by Winter before and had seen how he attacked. They already thought highly of Winter’s strength.","However, when they started the joint operation with Autumn, they realized that Autumn’s strength was actually higher than expected!","Liu Chen and Liu Yao thought that there would be a fierce battle when they participated in the operation.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao had heard of the Crimson Heaven Falcons. The overall strength of the Crimson Heaven Falcons was slightly weaker than the","Nine-Headed Snakes, but they also had combat strength above the Holy Spirit Realm.","From the looks of it, the bloodline of the Crimson Heaven Falcons suppressed the two of them.","However, Autumn basically did not give the two of them a chance to attack. He dealt with many Spinning Wings White Falcons and the elite Crimson Heaven Falcons alone. In this battle, Autumn appeared to be at ease. It was obvious that he had not used his full strength.","Everyone’s character was determined from the moment they were born. The things they experienced in their long life would change their character but their basic principles would not change much.","For example, Autumn had been by Lin Yuan’s side for such a long time. Although many things had gone wrong because of his impetuous personality and he had learned his lessons, he had yet to fix many issues.","For example, Autumn was still brooding over the fact that Lin Yuan had brought Spring and Winter with him instead of him. More than once, he wondered if he had done something wrong to displease Lin Yuan.","The more he thought about it, the more anxious he became.","Now that he finally had a chance, Autumn really wanted to prove himself.","Spring and Summer knew Autumn’s personality. For example, when Summer encountered something, she would not think as much as Autumn did. She would only do her job and what she had to do.","Autumn and Summer pulled open the barrier and enveloped the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons. Indeed, some members of the Spinning Wings White Falcons had escaped.","These escaping members of the Crimson Heaven Falcon were captured by Summer and Autumn.","In fact, Spring, Summer, and Autumn were all afraid that the Spinning Wings White Falcons would spread the news.","Even if the Crimson Heaven Falcons found out about the situation, they still did not have much ability to resist.","However, if the Crimson Heaven Falcons were to spread the news of the situation in the North of the Lonely River to other factions outside the North of the Lonely River, it would inevitably bring endless trouble to Sky City.","Chi Jue, who was originally the manager of the Crimson Heaven Falcons guarding the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, and Chi Ling were planning to command the Spinning Wings White Falcons to attack the faith country.","However, before the Spinning Wings White Falcons could make a move, the power behind the King Blood Jackals had already made the first move.","The power behind the King Blood Jackals was so powerful that even they could not resist it. At this time, any resistance would only increase the casualties.","It was obvious that the other party did not choose to kill them directly. Most likely, he wanted them to submit.","Chi Jue looked at Chi Ling who was not far away from him. The moment his eyes met Chi Ling’s, he understood what they meant.","On the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ side, Chi Ling was only a core member of the Crimson Heaven Falcons who had arrived first. After Chi Ling, the Second Elder of the Crimson Heaven Falcons would also lead a portion of the Crimson Heaven Falcons’s elites here.","Whether the two of them chose to resist or submit, they would inevitably be criticized by the other members of their species in the future.","Instead of letting Chi Jue and Chi Ling choose, it was better to drag it out until the Second Elder arrived.","As for the Spinning Wings White Falcons, with Bai Yunzong’s character, it was very obvious what choice he would make. After Bai Yunzong confirmed that the power behind the King Blood Jackals was stronger than the Crimson Heaven","Falcons, he would lead the entire Spinning Wings White Falcon race to submit.","Neither Chi Jue nor Chi Ling wanted to take responsibility. However, rather than dying here, the two of them hoped to survive.","In a situation where the other party was so powerful, the Crimson Heaven Falcons might still be able to have a bright future as a dependent species.","Of course, when Chi Jue and Chi Ling handed the choice to the Second Elder who was about to rush over, the fate of the Crimson Heaven Falcons would be in his hands.","The man who attacked the Crimson Heaven Falcons was clearly stronger than the leader of their species.","After Autumn controlled the situation, he said to Liu Chen and Liu Yao, “The two of you are the newbies that Young Master recruited this time. Remember to do your best for Young Master! Gather the members of the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons who have reached World Emperor. I have something to say to them.”","Although Autumn sometimes acted rashly and messed up his sense of propriety, he had an extremely strong charisma and personality.","Autumn was like a king who was looking down with disdain.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao hurriedly bowed in response. The strength Autumn had just displayed still shocked Liu Chen and Liu Yao.","Soon, according to Autumn’s request, Liu Chen and Liu Yao brought all the members of the Spinning Wings White Falcons who were at the World Emperor and above, as well as the Crimson Heaven Falcons to Autumn.."]},{"number":2940,"title":"Chapter 2940: Taking the Initiative to Obey!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2940: Taking the Initiative to Obey!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Before Liu Chen and Liu Yao brought the Spinning Wings White Falcons over, the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ internal group had already carried out a preliminary communication.","Bai Yunzong’s control over the Spinning Wings White Falcons was just as strong as that of the King Blood Jackals.","Bai Yunzong’s bloodline had transformed after absorbing the blood essence of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, which caused a portion of the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ upper echelons to doubt his bloodline.","Although the Spinning Wings White Falcons were indeed the dependent species of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, the bloodlines of the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons were on two parallel lines.","The Spinning Wings White Falcons used wind-elemental energy as their main source of energy, but the Crimson Heaven Falcons mainly used fire-elemental energy.","Using the Crimson Heaven Falcon bloodline to forcefully change the Spinning Wings White Falcon bloodline was not a wise choice from the perspective of species evolution.","If Bai Yunzong changed the control of wind elements that the Spinning Wings White Falcons were proud of into controlling fire elements, he would no longer be associated with the Spinning Wings White Falcon bloodline.","It was precisely because of this consideration that the higher-ups of the Spinning Wings White Falcons doubted Bai Yunzong.","Although this doubt had already appeared, it was not enough to threaten Bai Yunzong’s rule over the Spinning Wings White Falcons. Bai Yunzong was still the most authoritative leader of the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","Bai Yunzong had always been respectful to Chi Jue. He acted as a lackey of the Crimson Heaven Falcons. He treated Chi Jue’s words as an imperial edict.","But in fact, Bai Yunzong was always scheming.","Back then, the Crimson Heaven Falcons had occupied the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons and forced them to submit.","With the strength of the Spinning Wings White Falcons at that time, they couldn’t refuse. The control that the Crimson Heaven Falcons had over the Spinning Wings White Falcons back then could be said to be exactly the same as Autumn’s control over the Spinning Wings White Falcons now.","One had to know how to choose one’s strength and not be too rigid. This had always been Bai Yunzong’s principle.","After confirming that the faction controlling the King Blood Jackals was far stronger than the Crimson Heaven Falcons, Bai Yunzong chose to attach himself to Sky City without any worries.","This kind of voluntary attachment was not under Autumn’s coercion. Autumn did not even need to mention it. Bai Yunzong would take the initiative to find the corresponding opportunity.","The power of Bai Yunzong’s divine kingdom was related to telepathy. Bai Yunzong had already used the power of his divine kingdom to inform the core members of the Spinning Wings White Falcons who could make decisions.","The core members would try their best to express the Spinning Wings White","Falcons’ intention to submit when they had the chance to come into contact with Autumn.","Bai Yunzong did not know what choice the Crimson Heaven Falcons would make. If the Crimson Heaven Falcons were prepared to resist, he did not want the Spinning Wings White Falcons to become burial items for the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","The core members of the Spinning Wings White Falcons did not have any objections to Bai Yunzong’s choice.","Firstly, it was because Bai Yunzong had always been the leader of the Spinning","Wings White Falcons. Over the years, he had been the one to lead the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ development. Secondly, Bai Yunzong’s choice was very compatible with the interests of most members of the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","The Spinning Wings White Falcons were now on the weaker side. None of them wanted to die in this battle. Everyone’s common hope was to survive this storm.","The Spinning Wings White Falcons had been living under the noses of others for tens of thousands of years. The Crimson Heaven Falcons did not treat the","Spinning Wings White Falcons well. They only guaranteed the Spinning Wings White Falcon basic resources.","It might be a good choice for the Spinning Wings White Falcons to change the faction they relied on.","Because he had already communicated with the core members of the species in advance, he had a clear request and decision.","Therefore, Bai Yunzong hurriedly spoke the moment he saw Autumn, “Lord, I don’t know how the Spinning Wings White Falcons have offended you but I hope you can give us a chance. Let us follow you to make up for their previous mistakes!”","As Bai Yunzong spoke, he had already knelt on the ground with his hands by his sides. This could be said to be the greatest submissive etiquette of the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","Bai Yunzong was extremely nervous as he spoke. This was despite him feeling that the important figure standing in front of him had left the Spinning Wings White Falcons alive because he wanted to take in the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","However, before confirming this matter, there was no way to guarantee the safety of the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","Fortunately, this sudden attack was timely enough. If this surprise attack had happened a day later, there would probably have been no room for negotiation after the Spinning Wings White Falcons attacked!","When Bai Yunzong expressed his submission to Autumn, the other members of the Spinning Wings White Falcons were also very nervous. The answer of this god-like expert in front of them would determine the future of the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","Bai Yunzong’s voluntary submission was both unexpected and within Autumn’s expectations.","In fact, Autumn did not take the Spinning Wings White Falcons seriously at all. He did not even take the Crimson Heaven Falcons seriously.","Autumn’s thoughts were very simple. Be it the Spinning Wings White Falcons or the Crimson Heaven Falcons, they had so many members.","Species like the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons which were gathered through bloodlines were led by their rulers. If the current rulers did not agree to submit, then he would deal with them.","Then, the authority would be handed over to a ruler who was willing to lead the entire species to submit. This way, he could control the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons! After controlling these two species, there were many ways to make them submit.","Bai Yunzong’s plea was not to protect the Spinning Wings White Falcons but to protect his life and his right to rule the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","If Kani did not understand anything back then and was unwilling to submit to Lin Yuan, the King Blood Jackals would still have submitted to Lin Yuan but they would no longer have Kani as their leader!","Autumn looked up at Bai Yunzong.","Not only was Bai Yunzong smart but he was also very lucky. Being able to join Lin Yuan was a huge blessing for someone with Bai Yunzong’s strength and bloodline!","Sky City was still developing rapidly. Although Bai Yunzong did not join Lin Yuan at as serendipitous of a time as Kani had, as long as Bai Yunzong was smart enough, his status by Lin Yuan’s side would not be lower than Kani’s.","Firstly, it was because the bloodline strength of the Spinning Wings White Falcons was higher than that of the King Blood Jackals.","Secondly, the Spinning Wings White Falcons were good at flying and could take on the exploration work in the territory. Just from this point alone, the","Spinning Wings White Falcons were much more valuable than the King Blood Jackals!","The Sky City was still above the territory of the King Blood Jackals. The resources in the territory of the King Blood Jackals were already poor. But now, they were almost fully harvested.","After occupying the territory of the Crimson Heaven Falcons and the Spinning Wings White Falcons, it was very likely that Sky City would land above the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","On the one hand, it would facilitate the exploitation of resources. On the other hand, while establishing a faith country in the territory of the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons, it would also be convenient to take care of the faith country built in the territory of the King Blood Jackals.","In the future, Bai Yunzong would have plenty of opportunities to interact with","Lin Yuan.","Chi Jue, Chi Ling, and most of the members of the Crimson Heaven Falcons could not help but look up and glare fiercely at Bai Yunzong. Chi Jue and Chi Ling had already expected Bai Yunzong to lead the Crimson Heaven Falcons to submit, but they had not expected him to submit so quickly!","The other party had clearly decided to submit without being pressured. After the Spinning Wings White Falcons submitted, it was soon their turn to express their stance.","After Liu Chen and Liu Yao counted the number of people and confirmed that they had brought everyone over, they reported to Autumn, “Your Excellency Autumn, Sister Yao and I have already brought the people you mentioned. A few of them are seriously injured.”","Hearing Liu Chen and Liu Yao’s reply, Autumn said, “You’ve all become my Young Master’s prisoners. You only have two choices now. Surrender or die! I can decide whether to get rid of you or not with a raise of my finger. Since the Spinning Wings White Falcons have already expressed your stance, I’ll let you live.","“I heard that the Spinning Wings White Falcons are the dependent species of the Crimson Heaven Falcons. Your dependent species has already expressed their stance. As the main species, what should the Crimson Heaven Falcons","The pressure directly pressed down on the members of the Crimson Heaven Falcons. Now, it was time for the Crimson Heaven Falcons to speak.","However, Chi Jue and Chi Ling were shirking responsibility. Neither of them was willing to be the one to speak.","Both Chi Jue and Chi Ling had the ability to make decisions. Chi Jue was an envoy sent by the Crimson Heaven Falcons to the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons","Chi Ling was here to represent the Crimson Heaven Falcons. Even if what the two of them said could not represent all the Crimson Heaven Falcons, they could still represent the people present.","Before the Crimson Heaven Falcons completely collapsed and submitted to the Young Master mentioned by this expert in front of them, Chi Jue and Chi Ling did not want to be the first to betray the species.","However, they had to reply now. Chi Jue didn’t want to die at all.","Seeing that Chi Ling had no intention of speaking, Chi Jue spoke, “Lord, we’re all small fries of the Crimson Heaven Falcons. We don’t have the ability and qualifications to make decisions for the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","“I can represent the people here and choose to submit but it won’t mean much to you. I wonder if you can allow the leader of the Crimson Heaven Falcons to make this decision. The leader should be able to meet you soon.”","When Chi Ling heard Chi Jue’s words, she suddenly looked up and glared at him. Chi Jue’s words were equivalent to exposing the Second Elder of the Crimson Heaven Falcons who had yet to rush over.","There was a lot of unhappiness between Chi Jue and the Second Elder of the Crimson Heaven Falcons but Chi Jue should not be like this!","When Chi Jue decided to say these words, he did not consider what others thought of him. After all, Chi Jue did not betray or surrender.","Even if the entire Crimson Heaven Falcon eventually submitted to this faction behind the King Blood Jackals, he would still be nailed to the pillar of shame of the Crimson Heaven Falcon forever if he surrendered first.","Chi Jue indeed had his own thoughts. From Chi Jue’s perspective, these thoughts were indeed understandable.","However, Liu Chen and Liu Yao looked at Chi Jue regretfully.","This was an excellent opportunity for Chi Jue. This opportunity was exceptionally rare for him. It would not be an exaggeration to say that it would be the only one!","If Chi Jue stood up at this moment, he would decisively choose to surrender.","Based on Liu Chen and Liu Yao’s understanding of Lin Yuan, he would definitely not mistreat Chi Jue.","Chi Jue had thrown away a great opportunity.","Autumn raised an eyebrow at that.","“Since someone from the Crimson Heaven Falcons is about to come, let him make the decision! Coincidentally, I can also understand the specific internal situation of the Crimson Heaven Falcons through someone who actually carries weight. I don’t need to hear it from you small fries.”","Spring and Summer used their spirits to scan the area. After confirming that no one would escape, they released the restriction and left only a portion of their spirits to continue probing.","This expert from the Crimson Heaven Falcons who was about to arrive must be extremely powerful.","When facing this powerful fellow, it was necessary to make some preparations.","If this fellow from the Crimson Heaven Falcons sensed the existence of the barrier and turned to escape, they would have to spend a lot of effort chasing after him. Secondly, it was very likely that the news would spread during the pursuit. The best way to capture this expert from the Crimson Heaven Falcons was to catch a turtle in a jar!","Spring, Summer, and Autumn did not need to make too many preparations for the expert from the Crimson Heaven Falcons who was about to arrive. As long as they did not alert him, they would definitely be able to capture him easily.","While Autumn was waiting for the Second Elder to arrive, Lin Yuan arrived at the area specially created for the Soldier Ration Radishes.","Emerald Lady and Gray Pool were already on the move.","The two of them were nourishing the Soldier Ration Radishes with their innate abilities as faeries. The Soldier Ration Radishes were expanding at a speed visible to the naked eye.","The Soldier Ration Radish was a plant that grew extremely quickly.","Raising the growth speed of the Soldier Ration Radishes was not the best way to solve the food crisis.","If one took a closer look, they would discover that not only were the branches and leaves of the Soldier Ration Radishes growing faster, but the trunks were also gradually becoming thicker under the nourishment of Emerald Lady and Gray Pool’s roots.","The Soldier Ration Radish’s branches could only be separated when they had grown to a certain thickness. If the branches were not thick enough, forcefully reproducing the Soldier Ration Radish would cause it to enter a dormant state.","Previously, some of the Hundred Questions Beasts did not understand the Soldier Ration Radish and forcefully reproduced it, causing considerable losses.","Now, the Soldier Ration Radishes that had been forcefully reproduced and were in dormant states had begun to grow under the nourishment of Emerald Lady and Gray Pool’s roots.","From afar, Lin Yuan saw a beautiful figure investigating the situation of the Soldier Ration Radishes.","When the beautiful figure heard the commotion, she turned around and met Lin Yuan’s eyes.."]},{"number":2941,"title":"Chapter 2941: Sky City’s Granary!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2941: Sky City’s Granary!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","This beautiful figure hurriedly turned around among the Soldier Ration Radishes with a smile.","This beautiful figure was none other than Sun Ningxiang who had been following Lin Yuan.","Sun Ningxiang was neither a member of the Astronomical Parliament nor a member of Sky City.","Sun Ningxiang was the person in charge of Condense Fairy Orchard. She had led Condense Fairy Orchard and joined Sky City.","She only officially joined Sky City when she brought Condense Fairy Orchard to the marsh world to build a foundation for Lin Yuan in the marsh world.","Sun Ningxiang was not strong and did not have outstanding talent in internal affairs. It could be said that Sun Ningxiang had placed all her talents on plant cultivation and the management of fey breeding bases.","When Sun Ningxiang confirmed that she would follow Lin Yuan to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Lin Yuan helped her raise her strength to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","However, Sun Ningxiang had never thought of herself as a core member of Sky City. She only focused on the work that Lin Yuan arranged for her.","Ever since she had gone to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, apart from the first few core meetings of Sky City members, Sun Ningxiang had not had the chance to meet with Lin Yuan.","However, Sun Ningxiang knew that Lin Yuan valued her very much. Otherwise, he would not have given her such an important task like nurturing the Soldier Ration Radishes.","Apart from the Soldier Ration Radishes, other rare plant-type creatures were also planted here.","For Sun Ningxiang’s convenience, Lin Yuan provided her with 100 Deposit Vegetable Pods in human form as her assistants.","A few of the Deposit Vegetable Pods were standing beside Sun Ningxiang. When they saw Lin Yuan, they bowed slightly and greeted him.","Sun Ningxiang who had not seen Lin Yuan for a long time, found it difficult to suppress her feelings. However, she quickly adjusted her emotions and walked up to Lin Yuan with a smile, “Lin Yuan, the two faeries you arranged have given this place a new lease of life. The Soldier Ration Radish production will soon double.","“From next month onward, I estimate that the Soldier Ration Radishes produced for the faith country will be more than twice as much as it is now. As long as these Soldier Ration Radishes meet the conditions to be reproduced and cultivated separately, I will start to cultivate them separately.","“Based on the current situation, the production area for the Soldier Ration","Radishes is a little small. It’s necessary to expand this place. The Soldier Ration","Radishes produced in the future might not be useful. I will store the Soldier","Ration Radishes in batches.”","Lin Yuan smiled and nodded.","Wen Yu planned everything that had happened in Sky City so she was also very familiar with Sun Ningxiang’s situation. Wen Yu had compiled all the information. Lin Yuan knew how hard Sun Ningxiang had worked during this period.","During the continuous expansion of the faith country, Sun Ningxiang used her own ability to increase the production capacity of the Soldier Ration Radishes and appropriately used the resources provided by the Hundred Questions Beast army. Otherwise, it would have been difficult for the faith country to support such a rapid expansion.","It could be said that Sun Ningxiang was Sky City’s most outstanding logistics personnel.","As the production of Soldier Ration Radishes increased, it was necessary to stock up on them.","The Soldier Ration Radishes would not rot in the spatial equipment. The Soldier Ration Radishes would be able to maximize the stability of the faith country, whether it was to deal with the rapid expansion of Sky City or the emergence of some force majeure factors. They were the cornerstone of the faith country’s thriving development.","“Ningxiang, you’ve worked hard during this period. I heard from Wen Yu that you have plans to contract a Vitality Sloth. Your sacred source lifeform is not compatible with the Vitality Sloth. I suggest that you don’t contract the Vitality Sloth.","“Now, you have Emerald Lady and Gray Pool to support you in your work. Begin Lady and Celestial Sight will also stay here for this period. They will all help you!”","Lin Yuan had two goals for returning to Sky City.","Apart from cleaning up the troubles of the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons and occupying their territories to expand the faith country and develop Sky City, Lin Yuan had another very important goal. This goal was to help Four Seasons Mountain transform into a faerie.","Whether Four Seasons Mountain could evolve into a faerie depended on whether Lin Yuan could make the Faith Trees go against the ancient times.","Only by planting the anti-ancient Faith Tree on the Four Seasons Mountain could he gather the faith power of the faith country.","After collecting the faith power, it would be easier to distribute it effectively.","It was neither difficult nor easy to transform Four Seasons Mountain into a faerie.","Using a large amount of resources on the Four Seasons Mountain was enough to awaken the intelligence of the Four Seasons Mountain and turn it into a faerie.","However, Lin Yuan hoped that Four Seasons Mountain could directly transform into a higher faerie. This was the only way to increase Four Seasons Mountain’s future development potential.","After Lin Yuan finished nurturing Four Seasons Mountain, he would also let Four Seasons Mountain stay here. At that time, Four Seasons Mountain would be able to help Sun Ningxiang.","Sun Ningxiang hurriedly said, “Young Master, I’m not tired at all. This place is very helpful for my sacred source lifeform to increase its Stars. Compared to the others, I contracted a sacred source lifeform very late because my soul wasn’t strong enough.","“However, my sacred source lifeform has already reached 10 Stars while I’ve been here. Coincidentally, my sacred source lifeform’s ability has a good effect on the Soldier Ration Radishes’ growth. I originally planned to contract a Vitality Sloth. At the most important stage of the development of the faith country,","“I have to do something for our collective. My sacred source lifeform has only recently reached 10 Stars. Its new ability has already made it unnecessary for me to contract the Vitality Sloth.”","Sun Ningxiang’s sacred source lifeform came from the marsh world. It was purely a support-type sacred source lifeform with no offensive capabilities.","Every once in a while, Sun Ningxiang would use her sacred source lifeform to transform a Soldier Ration Radish into a female.","The output of the female radishes could be more than ten times that of the ordinary Soldier Ration Radishes.","Moreover, Sun Ningxiang could also use some special spiritual ingredients to try to nurture the female radishes so that they would have the medicinal properties contained in these spiritual ingredients.","Due to the guidance of Sun Ningxiang’s sacred source lifeform, the vines and leaves produced by the Soldier Ration Radish could cure diseases.","The Soldier Ration Radish’s mutation depended on Sun Ningxiang’s sacred source lifeform.","However, these Soldier Ration Radishes with special functions could be used under certain conditions. Not only could they increase the production of faith power but they could also save a large sum of healing funds.","Lin Yuan had built the faith country to ensure the health of the residents.","Lifeforms who had reached Myth Breed would not be tortured by illness anymore but the newborns in the faith country could not resist the invasion of disease.","Sun Ningxiang could be said to have found a suitable position and unleashed the power of her sacred source lifeform to the extreme.","After explaining her situation, Sun Ningxiang said to Lin Yuan very seriously, “Young Master, before the faith country expands, I feel that we shouldn’t distribute the Soldier Ration Radishes directly even if we have more of them. It will cause a lot of trouble if the residents of these faith countries suddenly transition from being barely hungry to being fed","‘ Now that the situation is good, the production of Soldier Ration Radishes will definitely double. It’s necessary to build the granary now!”","Su Yiren had just said what Sun Ningxiang said and Su Yiren had the same thoughts as Sun Ningxiang. Su Yiren also felt that the Soldier Ration Radishes should not be distributed in large quantities.","Su Yiren’s suggestion was to wait until the temple for sacrifices was completed, then use the rich food as a reward for the citizens who could provide high-quality faith power.","This was equivalent to sending out two messages. Citizens who could produce a large amount of faith power in the faith country had a very high status and better treatment. This would encourage other citizens in the faith country to compete to produce faith power first.","“Ningxiang, you have a good idea. The Soldier Ration Radishes have always been nurtured by you and the production of the Soldier Ration Radishes have always been provided by you. You have the most say in how many Soldier Ration Radishes you need to accumulate.","“You will be in charge of the construction plan of this granary! After the granary is built, you will also be in charge of it. I will arrange for 50 reserve members of Sky City to assist you in this matter. These 100 Deposit Vegetable Pods will continue to be your assistants. What do you think?”","Sun Ningxiang was very excited when she heard Lin Yuan’s words. Sun Ningxiang was indeed a person who did not fight for anything. However, when the opportunity was presented to her, Sun Ningxiang would still seize it and fight for it!","However, Sun Ningxiang would only grab those opportunities that she could grasp. Sun Ningxiang had always kept a respectful distance from those opportunities that she might not be able to grasp.","And this opportunity was clearly something that Sun Ningxiang herself could grasp! It was a piece of cake for Sun Ningxiang to manage the construction of this granary and the subsequent accumulation of resources.","“Young Master, don’t worry. I will definitely do a good job. 50 reserve members are more than enough for me. Apart from these 50 reserve members, I also hope that you can send some Spirit Craftsmen and Land Imps who are good at building infrastructure.","“Otherwise, it would be inconvenient for me to bring so many Soldier Ration Radishes with me. Moreover, accidents could happen easily!”","Sun Ningxiang had once been the leader of a faction. She had taken over Condense Fairy Orchard during its most critical period.","At that time, Condense Fairy Orchard had been surrounded by enemies from both sides. This gave Sun Ningxiang an extremely strong sense of danger. She liked to take precautions for everything!","Lin Yuan had always admired Sun Ningxiang’s sense of crisis.","Although Sky City and the faith country were developing very easily and the enemies that appeared, be it the Spinning Wings White Falcons or the Crimson Heaven Falcons behind them, were not enough to pose a threat to Sky City, it was inevitable that Sky City would encounter a real crisis in the future.","The next time they encountered such a crisis, Sun Ningxiang’s precautionary attitude would greatly reduce the losses that Sky City might suffer.","“There’s naturally no problem with the Spirit Craftsmen and the Land Imp. Even if you didn’t mention them, I would have prepared them for you. If you encounter any problems in the future, you can inform me. When I’m not around, you can look for Wen Yu.","“Remember, when you encounter something, don’t always think about fighting it alone. The members of Sky City are inseparable. It’s only right for us to help each other!”","Lin Yuan chatted with Sun Ningxiang for a while before bringing her to check on the situation at Four Seasons Mountain.","Lin Yuan realized that Four Seasons Mountain’s bloodline transformation was much easier than he had imagined. Four Seasons Mountain had really accumulated a lot over the years in the main world!","Lin Yuan was not in a hurry to evolve Four Seasons Mountain. Before evolving","Four Seasons Mountain, he felt that he should first get rid of the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons. Then, he would focus on evolving the Four Seasons Mountain.","There were many matters in Sky City that Lin Yuan had to decide for himself.","Spring, Summer, Autumn, Liu Yao, and Liu Chen had already waited and met up for the Second Elder of the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","The Second Elder was extraordinary. His strength had already broken through to the Holy Spirit level.","Due to the restraint of their bloodlines, despite being slightly weaker than Liu","Chen, it would be very difficult for Liu Chen and Liu Yao to take down the Second Elder even if they joined forces. This was unless Liu Chen and Liu Yao risked their lives. But even if they risked their lives, they would end up in an internecine outcome","However, it was different with Spring, Summer, and Autumn present.","Spring and Summer knew that Autumn liked to show off and did not attack the Second Elder.","Autumn pressed his fingers together and a scene of withering appeared behind him. These withered leaves attacked the Second Elder. The Second Elder was shocked and furious. He did not expect to see such a scene!","When Chi Jue first reported the situation of the faith country, the Crimson Heaven Falcons treated the faith country as a piece of fat meat that could be slaughtered. They had not taken the faction behind the King Blood Jackals seriously.","In the eyes of the upper echelons of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, this faction had designs on the King Blood Jackals but not the Spinning Wings White Falcons which were stronger than the King Blood Jackals.","It was obvious that they had figured out the situation and did not want to fight the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","Chi Zhentian had never thought that not only would the Spinning Wings White","Falcons become prisoners of this faction, but even strong Crimson Heaven Falcons would be injured and killed. They were like prisoners who were at a loss.","The scarlet flames that Chi Zhentian spewed out were as sticky as bright red paint. As the flames burned, phantoms of giant eagles with wingspans of more than 1000 meters flew out one after another.","However, be it these giant eagle phantoms or the burning of these dark red flames, they all seemed very powerless in the face of these fallen leaves. These leaves only covered these flames and the flames fused into the leaves.. Bright fire patterns were outlined on these leaves!"]},{"number":2942,"title":"Chapter 2942: Totem Snake Transformation!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2942: Totem Snake Transformation!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Every leaf was equivalent to a silent bleak world. All the targets that came into contact with this bleak world would become prisoners of this bleak world.","The resistance of Chi Zhentian was actually not very effective. Like the other","Spinning Wings White Falcons, he was filled with a strong sense of powerlessness. It was as if the Second Elder was just a weak ant.","It is easy to explain such a situation.","The fundamental reason for such a situation was that Autumn’s strength had to be far above that of Chi Zhentian.","To an ordinary person, stepping on an ant was no different from stepping on a","beetle.","The two seemed to belong to completely different dimensions.","The moment Chi Zhentian’s body was tainted by the golden flames that filled the sky, the energy in his body and the power of his bloodline were digested and devoured by these golden leaves.","Chi Zhentian who was originally soaring in the sky fell heavily to the ground.","Autumn slowly arrived in front of Chi Zhentian and the tip of his shoe stopped 10 centimeters away from Chi Zhentian’s head. It was as if being any closer to Chi Zhentian would stain Autumn.","Autumn looked disdainfully at the disheveled Chi Zhentian. He gently raised his hand and the leaves that landed in front of Chi Zhentian immediately left Chi Zhentian’s body.","This gave Chi Zhentian the chance to move freely.","“I asked the two leaders of the Crimson Heaven Falcons just now. They said that you have more weight and should make the decision. I’ll only ask you once. Do you want the Crimson Heaven Falcons to submit to my Young Master?”","Autumn’s tone was calm, but Chi Zhentian could feel the sharp killing intent in his words. It was as if as long as he said no, this expert in front of him whose strength he could not understand at all would kill him.","As the Second Elde, the difference in strength between him and the species leader was not too big. Even if the leader was stronger than him, he couldn’t suppress him so easily to the point that he did not have the chance to fight back.","Chi Zhentian frequently sparred with the of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, Chi Ranhong.","Chi Zhentian felt that even if Chi Ranhong obtained the opportunity that he had waited for thousands of years for and improved his strength, he would still be no match for this man with sharp eyebrows.","Not far away, there was a man and a woman who were obviously from the same species. Their strength was comparable to his. The other two women were undoubtedly much stronger than him! They had most likely reached a level comparable to the man with sword-like eyebrows.","Chi Zhentian was secretly shocked. What kind of powerful faction was standing behind the King Blood Jackals?","With the powerful strength of this faction, even if they did not reside in a small place like North of the Lonely River, they would be able to stand firm in the core area of the East Universe.","Such a powerful faction appeared here. Could it be that this faction was here for the treasure that the Crimson Heaven Falcons were waiting for to mature?","With this thought, Chi Zhentian felt that he was being a little ridiculous. That treasure was only effective on some special fire-type falcon-species feys and the Crimson Heaven Falcons happened to be one of the compatible bloodlines.","If not for the fact that the experts of the Crimson Heaven Falcons were using it, the Spinning Wings White Falcons who also had a falcon-species would absorb the energy of this treasure when it matured. They would definitely be burned to bones by the huge flames inside!","Chi Zhentian remembered that the last time Chi Jue brought back news, he said that someone in the territory of the King Blood Jackals had gathered the scattered villages together to form a huge country. This kingdom could steadily produce faith power.","If not for Chi Jue’s report, the Crimson Heaven Falcons would have coveted the faith power produced by this huge country.","The Crimson Heaven Falcons would not order the Spinning Wings White Falcons to attack an unknown faction at this critical moment.","This faction had powerful experts and collected faith power in an orderly manner.","To accumulate strength in a godforsaken place like North of the Lonely River, he must have a lot of plans!","All sorts of thoughts flashed through Chi Zhentian’s mind, but Autumn did not intend to give him so much time to consider.","Autumn snorted coldly. Autumn’s cold snort made Chi Zhentian subconsciously shiver. The killing intent released by Autumn’s aura seemed to turn into sharp knives that stabbed straight at Chi Zhentian.","Chi Zhentian hurriedly said, “I’m willing to lead all the Crimson Heaven","Falcons here to submit to your Young Master!”","Chi Zhentian’s words were very firm. Chi Zhentian was unwilling to be the first person to submit on behalf of the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","However, the Crimson Heaven Falcons couldn’t be a match for this faction even if they used all their strength. There was no point in resisting under such circumstances. Chi Zhentian could not bring all the Crimson Heaven Falcons to the netherworld!","The Crimson Heaven Falcons were a faction with many dependent species under their command. Before they came to North of the Lonely River and hid here, they had far more dependent species than they did now.","A faction that gathered other factions as their dependent species would be able to accept being the dependent species of a more powerful faction to seek protection.","The key was that the Crimson Heaven Falcons could not make a choice in the current situation.","When choosing to submit, Chi Zhentian glared fiercely at Chi Jue. If Chi Jue had not made such a report back then, he would not be in such a sorry state now!","Autumn nodded in satisfaction when he heard Chi Zhentian’s answer. In fact, Autumn did not think much of the Crimson Heaven Falcons. But before coming, Lin Yuan had clearly wanted to take the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons in as dependent species.","If Chi Zhentian was stubborn and did not work, Autumn would have no choice but to kill Chi Zhentian. It would seem like Autumn had not properly completed the mission that Lin Yuan had given him.","“Since the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons have chosen to submit to my Young Master, follow me to meet him!”","As he spoke, Autumn’s robe fluttered. A fallen leaf stuck to the back of every Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcon.","When they went to meet Lin Yuan, if anyone dared to make a move, this fallen leaf would immediately clean up the troublemakers.","Autumn would not allow anyone to be disrespectful in front of Lin Yuan, especially those whom he had brought over!","Lin Yuan had already returned to Sky City and was preparing to help the Moon Empress nurture the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast.","Before returning to Sky City, Lin Yuan handed over nearly 1,000,000 spirit qi crystals to Begin Lady for her and Celestial Sight to use to nourish the Four Seasons Mountain.","The faith country was not only a treasure trove that produced faith power but was also a treasure trove that provided spirit qi crystals to Lin Yuan.","Until now, Lin Yuan had yet to meet Morbius.","Morbius had been helping Lin Yuan absorb the World Grace and Creation World Ley Lines through the Pure Land of Bliss.","Lin Yuan had been using the golden pearls to strengthen the Law Runes in the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","As the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was in a deep sleep, Lin Yuan could not use its abilities.","Otherwise, with the golden pearls that he had accumulated, those laws could most likely be strengthened into spirit fire.","Lin Yuan was now providing a massive amount of resources to the Four Seasons Mountain. It was only a matter of time before the Four Seasons Mountain transformed into a faerie.","When he saw Lin Yuan, Mystic Moon hurried forward with a smile and said, “Young Lord, the Moon Empress is in seclusion. When the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast evolved to Myth Breed, its bloodline showed signs of metamorphosis.","“The Moon Empress and the Rabbit Emperor are very concerned about the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s situation, but I believe it won’t be long before they come out of seclusion!”","Lin Yuan nodded. The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s bloodline metamorphosis was a good thing for the Moon Empress so she needed to focus on dealing with it.","Lin Yuan could sense that Mystic Moon’s strength was on the verge of transforming from beginner World Emperor/Divine Kingdom to intermediate. Lin Yuan had helped Mystic Moon and Cold Moon increase their strength.","Cold Moon was different from Mystic Moon. Cold Moon was a spirit qi professional while Mystic Moon was a dragon species fey.","It was undoubtedly more difficult to increase Mystic Moon’s strength than it was to increase Cold Moon’s strength. This was because Mystic Moon had to ensure that his bloodline improved before he could increase his strength.","Mystic Moon’s bloodline was of an extremely high level and there were very few special spiritual ingredients to support it. It would be very difficult to reach Intermediate Divine Kingdom by relying solely on the activation of his bloodline. Even if he could cross this gate, he would waste a lot of his evolution potential.","Ever since Lin Yuan had become the Moon Empress’ disciple, Mystic Moon had been helping Lin Yuan and had done his best to help him solve his problems.","Even Lin Yuan’s capable assistant, Wen Yu, had been nurtured by Mystic Moon. Otherwise, with Wen Yu’s growth alone, she would not be able to help Lin Yuan for a long time.","Mystic Moon was a cold person when it came to outsiders. Lin Yuan had learned this when he first went to Leaning Moon Mountain. However, Mystic Moon was like a furnace to his own people. He always did his best for them.","Lin Yuan had always been very clear about Mystic Moon’s situation. During this trip, he had thought of solving the problem for Mystic Moon.","Lin Yuan handed a Diamond fey storage box to Mystic Moon.","“Uncle Mystic, I specially found the things inside for you. Whether it’s to increase your strength or increase your bloodline, they should be quite helpful.”","Upon hearing this, Mystic Moon hurriedly investigated the contents of the","Diamond fey storage box. Upon closer inspection, Mystic Moon saw that the Diamond fey storage box actually contained ten dragon pearls that emitted a majestic dragon aura.","The weakest of these dragon pearls was produced from a pinnacle World Emperor/Divine Kingdom dragon-species fey. If he could absorb the dragon qi inside, his bloodline would quickly increase.","Mystic Moon wanted to thank Lin Yuan but he realized that Lin Yuan had already disappeared and entered the breeding room next to the Moon Empress.","Mystic Moon looked in the direction where Lin Yuan had disappeared and revealed a warm and gentle smile.","If Cold Moon saw Mystic Moon’s smile, she would realize that Mystic Moon’s smile had only been shown to the Moon Empress before. And now, there was another person who made Mystic Moon smile, and that person was Lin Yuan!","Lin Yuan entered the breeding room room and released his new fey the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake that he had just spirit locked.","The Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake had already been nurtured to Sovereign/Creation.","[Fey Name]: Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake [Fey Species]: Snake Pupils/lllusion Snake","[Fey Grade]: Sovereign (3/10) [Fey Type]: Soul","[Fey Quality]: Creation VI","Abilities:","[Snake Eyes]: Controls other snake-species feys through its eyes. When its soul energy is enough to suppress other snake-species feys, it can induce them to contract or sacrifice it (Contract allows control over the snake-type lifeforms. As long as the targeted snake-type lifeforms’ spiritual power does not exceed its own, it will not escape its control. When sacrificing the targeted snake-type lifeforms, it can obtain the energy from its body and use its flesh to strengthen its own physical fitness).","[Snake Coiling Defense]: Coiled its body together, allowing the entire snake body to become one. When it is attacked, it can shrink its body and increase its defense to the greatest extent.","[Soul Forging Armor]: When the soul energy is combined with the snake-species fey’s bloodline, it will form an armor that interweaves with the bloodline on the surface of the body. Not only can it resist physical attacks, but it also has a certain resistance to elemental damage.","[Life Prolonging Shedding]: Under the circumstances of using the Snake Coiling Defense, if the target pierces through the defense and poses a threat to its life, it will instinctively undergo a snake shedding to avoid fatal damage. Each snake shedding weakens the body and diminishes a certain amount of soul strength.","[Swift Snake Shadow]: Increases the snake-species feys under its control, allowing them to react and attack more quickly.","[Violent Venom Burst]: Activate the snake venom in the target’s body, causing the slow-acting snake venom to instantly activate its poison effect and cause timely damage to the target. The poison damage to the target will be converted into healing energy to heal the army of snakes.","[Snake Devouring Rampage]: The snake-type feys under its control will devour each other and increase the strength of the main body in a superimposed manner. It will also cause the devouring main body to enter a berserk state and sacrifice itself to attack the enemy. At the end of its life, its body will explode, and the damage will be equivalent to its full strength attack at its peak.","[Fearless Snake Heart]: All the targets in the snake group will be fearless. The snake heart is as tough as iron and has a certain chance of being immune to mental, soul, and mind abilities. When facing a powerful enemy, even if the enemy uses bloodline deterrence, it can still reveal 100% of its strength.","Exclusive Skill:","[Six Flowers Curse]: Through the Six Flowers Curse in the eye, whenever the target’s body is invaded by poison related to the target, a snake flower will grow from the wound. When the number of snake flowers reaches six, the target’s bloodline will be forcefully changed, turning the target into a sub-snake.","[Control Strengthening]: When contracting a snake-species fey, the contract will be bound to the target’s soul. Once bound to the target’s soul, if the contract is shaken by external influences, the contract will spontaneously sacrifice the target to prevent it from breaking free from its control.","[Brahma Snake Totem]: Transform the totem into a copy on the contractor’s body. The contractor will share the worship of the snake creatures. It can perfectly control the snake creatures it controls and obtain the faith power of these snake creatures.","[Totem Snake Transformation]: Every time a snake-type lifeform undergoes a metamorphosis, a portion of the snake-type lifeform’s subsequent metamorphosis potential will be transferred to the contractor, helping the contractor’s physique and bloodline to undergo a metamorphosis.."]},{"number":2943,"title":"Chapter 2943: Sparrow Perching Chinese Parasol Tree!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2943: Sparrow Perching Chinese Parasol Tree!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Upon being summoned, the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake obediently wrapped its tail around Lin Yuan’s arm.","Morbius was on Lin Yuan’s wrist. As Morbius’ Spirit Lock fey, the Brahma","Flower Jade Blood Snake did not dare to overstep its boundaries. Even if Lin Yuan did not have anything on his left wrist, the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake would not dare to be there.","Apart from constantly improving its grade and quality, the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake, which had been staying in the Spirit Lock spatial zone all this time, also controlled many snake-species feys. Its ability to control snake-species feys was much stronger than Wendy’s when she was the Medusa Snake Demon.","While the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake behaved exceptionally well in front of Lin Yuan, it exhibited exceptional ferocity and dominance when dealing with other snake-species feys under its control. Many snake-species feys creatures would be eliminated if they did not meet its requirements.","The Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake was too spoiled and willful. Upon discovering this situation, Lin Yuan taught it a good lesson.","Lin Yuan had spent a lot of effort selecting the snake-species feys for the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake. Every snake that was lost because of its willfulness was a huge loss for Lin Yuan.","The Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake’s strength had already reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, and its intelligence was far higher than that of ordinary humans. If not for the fact that it did not like to appear in human form, it could already transform into a human and walk outside.","The Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake was extremely solitary and did not communicate with the lifeforms in the Spirit Lock spatial zone like Lin Yuan’s other Spirit Lock feys, and only liked to control its own wild snakes.","When the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake reached Sovereign, it obtained the exclusive skill, Fearless Snake Heart.","Snake-species feys were generally cunning, and they often preferred to use some strategies to deal with their enemies rather than brute force. The various habits of snake-species feys had caused them to dislike fighting head-on with their enemies in battle.","Fearless Snake Heart allowed snake-species feys to fight fearlessly while maintaining their inherent quality.","Apart from that, it could also allow them to have a certain chance to become immune to various forms of control on their spirit, soul, and mind. Even when facing bloodline suppression and being subjected to intimidation by the enemy’s bloodline, they would still be able to exert 100% of their strength. This greatly enhanced the strength of the snakes controlled by the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake.","When the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake reached Creation Breed and obtained Totem Snake Transformation, Lin Yuan was pleasantly surprised.","As the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake strength increased, the number of snake-species feys it controlled would also increase. With such a large number of snake-species feys being nurtured and enhanced, it was inevitable that their bloodlines would transform.","Whenever the bloodlines of the controlled snake-species feys transformed, the potential of this bloodline transformation would be reflected in Lin Yuan’s body through the totem to help his physique transform.","Lin Yuan’s Body of All Spirits needed to constantly transform, but it was extremely difficult. Up until now, Lin Yuan’s Body of All Spirits had not undergone any changes.","Totem Snake Transformation could assist Lin Yuan in enhancing his chance of physical transformation and help him in evolving the Body of All Spirits. This was extremely important to Lin Yuan.","Although Totem Snake Transformation had some side effects, such as causing the snake-species feys to lose half of their evolution potential while providing opportunities for Lin Yuan’s physical transformation, they would not affect the strength of the snakes. Even if it was for himself, Lin Yuan would provide the best resources for the snakes.","Lin Yuan raised his hand and stroked the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake that was tied to his arm. It felt cool to the touch and was as hard as a jade ring.","Lin Yuan did not immediately let the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake return to the Spirit Lock spatial zone like he did after checking the feys.","He told the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake, “You should have snake-species feys that are about to evolve their bloodlines, right? Bring one out now. I want to help its bloodline transform and also try the effect of your Totem Snake Transformation.","The Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake immediately summoned a giant silver-gray snake with a triangular head.","Upon being summoned, the giant snake did not even dare to let out its signature hissing sound. It obediently crawled by Lin Yuan’s feet.","The Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake hated it the most when snake-species feys under its control revealed their aura in front of it. Every time it encountered such a situation, it would eliminate them.","The snake was a Shatter Spatial Silver Viper that was at the juncture of bloodline transformation. Its scales were already in a semi-crystalized state. Once the snake scales crystallized completely, the Shatter Spatial Silver Viper’s bloodline would have a breakthrough.","If Lin Yuan wanted to completely crystallize the scales of the Shatter Spatial Silver Viper, he would only need to provide it with some pure spirit qi.","Lin Yuan brought a few spirit qi crystals to the Shatter Spatial Silver Viper and crushed them.","The Shatter Spatial Silver Viper did not give up on the rare opportunity and hurriedly absorbed the pure spirit qi. Gradually, its scales became transparent.","As the Shatter Spatial Silver Viper’s bloodline evolved, Lin Yuan felt a strange sensation in his body. The feeling was very strange as Lin Yuan felt that his body had been strengthened to a certain extent, and he trembled from the inside out. This time, the tremor seemed to be hitting the shackles of his body.","Such a sensation happening once was nothing significant for Lin Yuan. However, if it were to occur hundreds or thousands of times in the future, it would definitely be of great help to enhance Lin Yuan’s physique in the future.","Lin Yuan sent the Shatter Spatial Silver Viper and Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake back to the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Immediately afterward, Lin Yuan entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone to check on Chimey. Previously, Chimey’s problem was that it could not obtain top-grade strange flames, which restricted the evolution of its grade and quality.","Lin Yuan had traded for a large number of high-grade flames in Fortune Treasure Palace. The Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree, which had reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, could absorb these flames.","After the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree’s transformation, Chimey quickly absorbed the flame energy into its body.","Under normal circumstances, if Chimey had only enhanced its strength and quality, Lin Yuan would not have cared so much. Yet now, Chimey’s bloodline was throbbing. This was a sign that Chimey’s bloodline was about to transform.","Chimey and Genius were the first two feys to follow Lin Yuan. Chimey had evolved continuously from a Sound Bird. Even though it had always maintained its sparrow-species bloodline, Chimey’s bloodline was already comparable to the main phoenix-species feys when it reached Suzerain/Myth Breed. Its bloodline was even stronger than many main phoenix-species feys.","When Chimey and Lin Yuan’s other feys were all Suzerain/Myth Breed, Chimey showed exceptional strength among them.","However, when other feys had evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, Chimey had only evolved from Suzerain/Myth Breed to Sovereign/Creation in the past 20 years due to insufficient resources.","However, the accumulation of strength over time was beneficial for Chimey. In fact, its bloodline was already showing signs of metamorphosis.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to check on Chimey. [Fey Name]: Command Phoenix Dawn Day Sparrow [Fey Species]: Sound sparrow genus/sound sparrow species","[Fey Grade]: Sovereign (10/10) [Fey Type]: Sound/Light [Fey Quality]: Creation VIII","Abilities:","[Phoenix Cry]: The power of main phoenix will combine the phoenix cry into musical notes that will turn into birds. The birds will be able to pass through almost anything. After coming into contact with a target, the phoenix cry within the musical notes will stun and disturb the target. When the musical notes are attacked or blocked, they will separate into more birds.","[New Day of Light]: The exquisite main phoenix blood and sunlight will solidify into a sun. Under the light of the sun, its abilities will rapidly be absorbed by light. When the light is used up, it can replenish phoenix blood and soul.","[Phoenix Breed Input Sound]: By tempering the phoenix-species fey’s soul into phoenix breed and injecting it into the body of an avian fey, the avian fey will gain the intelligence and partial abilities of the phoenix-species fey. By setting the phoenix breed will be set alight and increase the power of the musical notes that had transformed into birds.","[Falling Sky New Day]: Drop the sun in its body to create a territory full of sun energy. When the sun energy depletes, it will temporarily be immune to most physical and elemental damage.","[Speak Spirit Singer]: Enter song into the soul. By using up the phoenix breed’s ability to bring song into reality, the willpowers and effects in the song can be an advantage or disadvantage to bless its friends or curse its enemies.","[Clear Zither Change Voice]: Place an anchor on something that could release light-type energy. By controlling this entity or whatever was connected to this entity, one’s voice or voice-type ability can be applied to this entity and dispersed with this entity at the center.","[Sun Projection]: Its bloodline will be transformed into a rising sun and projected onto that world’s original sun. The sun power will provide it with an overall boost. During this process, it will be closely linked to the sun. Once over, it will enter a very weak state.","[Nine Suns Cry]: When the suns formed within oneself resonate with the celestial body, the suns will extract energy from the celestial body to form nine suns. The nine suns can project their clear cries and create a domain filled with solar energy for themselves.","Exclusive Skill:","[Double Sun Reins]: The stronger the power of the sun it controls, the stronger its ability to communicate with other suns. According to the strength of the reins, it can offer a song to the sun and lend energy from the other suns to replenish itself.","[New Sun Body]: Fuse with the sun it produces and enter the Non -Burning Nirvana World Sparrow. Its abilities will not change but it will be able to switch attributes.","[Sound Spirit Sacred Hall]: Its own musical notes will form a sacred hall. Within the sacred hall, all of the phenomena contained in sound will become reality. When the main body enters the sacred hall, the effects will be able to spread outwards by using the energy in one’s body.","[Sparrow Perching Chinese Parasol Tree]: Separate a portion of its soul and bloodline from the parasol tree it resides in. When it accidentally dies, the soul and bloodline left on the platane wood will be activated, forming an embryo for it to reincarnate. After absorbing enough energy, it will revive in a new form.","Chimey had evolved to Sovereign and obtained the new Nine Suns Cry ability, which could be considered its strongest ability.","When Chimey let the sun in its body rise into the sky, the strength it displayed was already very powerful. Now, this sun could be divided into nine suns, and drawing energy from the celestial body would not affect Chimey’s own energy.","These nine suns could project Chimey’s voice, which was equivalent to expanding the range of Chimey’s language ability and the attack range of its Phoenix Cry ability.","As for Sparrow Perching Chinese Parasol Tree, it was a special life-saving ability.","Lin Yuan could sense that Chimey had been very depressed ever since it had left the main world and was unable to sing on Star Web. He had always doted on Chimey like a daughter and had no intention of letting it join the battle.","Lin Yuan’s plan for Chimey was to let it become a great singer in the faith country to help Lin Yuan obtain faith power. Hence, Chimey basically had no need for Sparrow Perching Chinese Parasol Tree.","However, having the exclusive skill was not necessarily a bad thing. If something really happened to Chimey in the future and Lin Yuan couldn’t take care of Chimey, it would ensure that Chimey would not lose its life due to unexpected occurrences.","If Chimey could become a great singer of the faith country, it would be equivalent to becoming the spokesperson of the faith country, and there was a possibility of encountering danger at any time.","When Lin Yuan saw that more than half of the flames stored in the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree’s leaves had been consumed, he hurriedly replenished them.","After Chimey finished transforming its bloodline, it pounced into Lin Yuan’s arms and flapped its wings to land on Lin Yuan’s shoulder.","Chimey said aggrievedly, “Yuan, it’s been a while since you came to see Chimey.","Genius has been very busy recently and has been staying in the Hundred Questions Beast army all day long. Chimey can only stay in the nest alone. Can you come and accompany Chimey more often in the future? Chimey can’t live stream on Star Web anymore. You guys are the only ones left!”","The more Chimey spoke, the more aggrieved it became. Its voice started to choke up, and Lin Yuan’s heart ached.."]},{"number":2944,"title":"Chapter 2944: New Ophiuchus Constellation!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2944: New Ophiuchus Constellation!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Chimey had never been delicate. There were two reasons why Chimey would say that.","Firstly, Chimey did not have any companions to accompany it in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. The people that it was familiar with, like Genius, had to enhance their abilities or attend to other matters every day. Otherwise, Genius would definitely be very willing to accompany Chimey.","Secondly, Chimey hadn’t been able to increase its strength. Those companions whose strength was comparable to or lesser than it had managed to enhance their strength. This inevitably made Chimey feel a sense of disparity. It felt that it was no longer as highly regarded by Lin Yuan as before.","Lin Yuan used the second knuckle of his index finger to touch the soft feathers under Chimey’s beak, “Chimey, you will still have many listeners in the future. Those listeners will admire and praise your singing from the bottom of their hearts.","“Now that you have the resources, just focus on improving your strength. When your strength increases, I’ll let you leave the Spirit Lock spatial zone and stay by my side. You’ll become Sky City’s spokesperson in the faith country.”","Chimey chirped in surprise and did not continue pestering Lin Yuan. Instead, it flew to the Phoenix Perching Chinese Parasol Tree’s nest to absorb the strange flame’s energy. Chimey had already set a goal in its heart, which was to do its best to evolve to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","Genius knew that Lin Yuan had entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone and immediately rushed over. Genius thought that Chimey would be chirping and waiting tor it, but it didn’t expect Chimey to already be working in the nest.","Genius did not disturb Chimey and said, “Yuan, this is your first time letting someone else contract the Hundred Questions Beast. You must remind Wen Yu not to spread the truth about the Hundred Questions Beast!”","As a highly intelligent lifeform, Genius understood its situation the best.","At present, it already had a deep understanding of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan absorbed knowledge from the Sky Beyond the Clouds by relying on Genius to record and summarize the contents of the books. It was precisely because it understood the current situation of the Sky Beyond the Clouds that Genius said such words.","The requirements for Creators in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were much greater than the main world’s requirements for Creation Masters. As Genius’ grade and quality continued to increase, it was now on par with the Moon Empress in terms of Creation Masters.","Genius could concoct the potion formula that Lin Yuan had obtained from the Moon Empress. The current Genius was about an intermediate to advanced Grade 4 Creator.","Genius’ earliest batch of Hundred Questions Beasts also had developed the ability equivalent to a Grade 4 Creator. It could be said that the Hundred Questions Beast army could create a value that could shock any faction. However, they did not have any combat ability.","The Hundred Question Beast army was created by Lin Yuan and existed by relying on Lin Yuan.","Genius was not afraid of the safety of the Hundred Questions Beast army, but that Lin Yuan would be targeted. Even if the person Lin Yuan had given the Hundred Questions Beast to was Wen Yu, Genius still could not help but remind Lin Yuan.","Upon hearing its words, Lin Yuan nodded seriously. Genius rarely offered reminders to Lin Yuan, so the fact it did so implied that the matter held significant importance in its mind.","Lin Yuan said seriously, “Genius, I know what you mean. Your concerns are valid. I’ll remind Wen Yu to pay attention!”","Wen Yu basically did not have a chance to go out of Sky City. Hence, there was no chance for outsiders to notice the Hundred Questions Beast.","As Lin Yuan spoke these words, he also reminded himself that Sky City was currently staffed with the same people as before, with not many additions. However, with Lin Yuan’s journey in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it was inevitable that he would accept people into Sky City.","The Astronomical Parliament would also allow some selected people to become members of Sky City. Even if these people were under Lin Yuan’s control and would not do anything to harm Sky City, it was still hard to guarantee that they would not be captured during missions.","Lin Yuan’s Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom could probe the truth. When those powerful factions interrogated the enemy members, the abilities to probe souls were not uncommon.","For Lin Yuan to completely conceal the Hundred Questions Beasts’ existence and prevent the outside world from knowing about them, he had to ensure that the Hundred Questions Beasts were not in public view and that the people in Sky City who had gone outside had not seen the Hundred Questions Beasts.Genius’ reminder was very important to Lin Yuan.","“Genius, Begin Lady is no longer in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Therefore, you will have to supervise everything in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Has anything happened in the Spirit Lock spatial zone recently?”","Genius thought for a moment and said firmly, “Yuan, the condition in the Spirit Lock spatial zone has been very good recently. Nothing unexpected has occurred. If there’s anything to mention, it’s probably the spies you caught working in the Spirit Lock spatial zone before. For some unknown reason, there’s an internal strife among them. It caused a chaotic fight between the seven of them and caused some losses in the cat garden.","“I’ve dealt with all seven of them with the war weapons you prepared for me. At the same time, I beat up the others in the cat garden.","“Also, I’ve warned them that if such a situation happens again, I’ll get rid of everyone working in the cat garden. It was because of your kindness back then that gave them a chance to live. In terms of working ability, they can’t even compare to those Deposit Vegetable Pods that were nurtured.”","When it mentioned this, Genius revealed a disdainful expression. The living environment that Lin Yuan provided for these people was outstanding enough, and these people did not have the chance to encounter such good conditions outside.","However, these people chose to fight over some benefits, causing the cat garden to suffer losses. In addition, the fights between these people might have a connection with their grudges.","Genius only explained the outcome to Lin Yuan and did not explain the specific situation to him. Lin Yuan was so busy every day that he did not have time to waste on such trivial matters.","Upon hearing Genius’ words, Lin Yuan nodded. The stability of the Spirit Lock spatial zone was good news for him. A large number of resources were nurtured in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, and these resources were constantly being produced outside.","Due to the constant increase of spirit qi concentration in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, many lifeforms that did not possess much evolution potential experienced improvements in their grade and quality in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Among them were the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls’ fairy.","Brocade Zither had already evolved into a genuine six-winged fairy. When they were in the main world, they could help Creation Masters increase the success rate of concocting potions.","If Brocade Zither was still a two-winged fairy now, then the child ramets it cultivated would not be of much help to Creators. However, after it became a six-winged fairy, the child ramets it produced could help Creators concoct potions.","There were currently no Creators from Sky Beyond the Clouds in Sky City, but both Genius’ Hundred Questions Beast army and the Moon Empress were full of praise for the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, which undoubtedly proved its value.","Through the transaction with Fortune Treasure Palace, Lin Yuan learned that resources like this were extremely rare in the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds. Once resources beneficial to Creators appeared, these resources would immediately be snatched by other factions.","Lin Yuan had plans to sell the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls to the public.","Firstly, it was impossible for Lin Yuan to always use Creator resources like spirit qi crystals and pure elemental energy for external transactions. By using the Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls, Lin Yuan could trade for various resources more conveniently.","Secondly, Brocade Zither’s Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls could wither on their own according to the ortet’s demand.","The Golden Lotus Brocade Pearls would always create value for the factions that were on good terms with Lin Yuan. On the other hand, even if those factions that were on bad terms with Lin Yuan acquired them through trade, they would quickly wither.","After leaving the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Lin Yuan also left the breeding room.","When he left the breeding room, he realized that the Moon Empress had also left the breeding room.","From the Moon Empress’ expression, Lin Yuan knew that nurturing the Desire","Moon-Eyed Beast was going smoothly. He did not ask about the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast again. He knew very well that if the Moon Empress needed his help in the future, she would directly ask him.","The Moon Empress said with a smile, “Spring and Autumn have returned to Sky City and brought the experts of the Spinning Wings White Falcons and the dozen or so Crimson Heaven Falcons over. The Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons have already been arranged to the second meeting hall.","“Little Yuan, if you have time, why don’t you go and take a look? I heard from","Spring that Summer stayed in the territory of the Spinning Wings White","Falcons and was stationed there. In that case, we’ll be able to take over the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons soon.”","Before Lin Yuan left Sky City, he had told the Moon Empress to look for Spring and Summer if she needed anything. The Moon Empress knew that the fact that Lin Yuan would instruct her that way meant that Spring and Summer were definitely very powerful and were capable of resolving many unexpected situations.","However, she never expected that they could eliminate the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons. This matter sounded too shocking!","If the Moon Empress had known that Spring and Summer were so powerful, she would not have been so nervous when she found out that the Spinning Wings White Falcons were about to target Sky City.","Lin Yuan nodded confidently, “Master, you’re right. We’ll be able to take over the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons very soon. Or rather, the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons is now Sky City’s! Not only that, Sky City will soon be able to control the territory of the Crimson Heaven Falcons.”","Lin Yuan’s words were filled with confidence. His confidence instilled a sense of security in the Moon Empress. It was a feeling that the Moon Empress rarely experienced. The few times that the Moon Empress felt a sense of security could be said to be related to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was not in a hurry to meet the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons. He would let them stay in the second meeting hall for now. There would be people in the second meeting hall who would torture them. By the time it was done, it would not be too late for Lin Yuan to meet with the experts of these two species.","Lin Yuan wanted the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons to submit wholeheartedly. He needed to control the Crimson Heaven Falcons through these members.","Lin Yuan had asked Wen Yu to contract a Hundred Questions Beast, which was a method that he had suddenly thought of. As long as the Hundred Questions Beast provided sufficient resources, there was no barrier to increasing its strength.","Wen Yu’s Hundred Questions Beast’s strength had increased. Through the Thoughts Letter Paper, she called out to Lin Yuan to try holding another Astronomical Parliament meeting.","Lin Yuan could sense that Wen Yu was very confident that the Astronomical Parliament would be convened again.","Since that was the case, it was more important for Lin Yuan to try holding the Astronomical Parliament again.","After having dinner with the Moon Empress, Lin Yuan arrived at the star platform located at the top of Sky City when the constellations shone.","Lin Yuan released the Star Vastness Peony and let it amplify Wen Yu.","Wen Yu used the huge amount of spiritual energy she had obtained from contracting the Hundred Questions Beast to communicate with the constellations, and soon the meeting began again.","Wen Yu and Lin Yuan looked at each other, and Lin Yuan nodded.","This time, Wen Yu had called for the Astronomical Parliament not only to see if it could be held smoothly but also to conduct a comprehensive test. Hence, Wen Yu had invited Liu Jie, Su Yiren, Luo Lan, and Bei Xu from the Astronomical Parliament.","Feeling the familiar call, they entered the Astronomical Parliament at the same time and sat in the chairs that originally belonged to them.","Bei Xu had the most difficult journey. He looked around and could not help but sigh.","In the current Astronomical Parliament, there were only six people left, including Lin Yuan and Wen Yu, as five people had left.","These five people had not chosen to go to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Now, they were not even qualified to enter the Astronomical Parliament. This included Yin Lin, who had joined the Astronomical Parliament with Bei Xu. Even though Bei Xu might be inexperienced, he could sense Yin Lin’s feelings for Lin Yuan. Bei Xu could not understand why Yin Lin had chosen to stay in the main world and not follow Lin Yuan to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. No matter how one looked at it, going to the Sky Beyond the Clouds was the best choice.","Along the way, Yin Lin had helped him grow. Before leaving, Yin Lin had specially looked for Bei Xu to bid him farewell.","Bei Xu couldn’t help but ask Yin Lin the reason. Yin Lin had only smiled and said that she was envious that Bei Xu didn’t have to fulfill his duties as the envoy of the federation and the Young Leader of the family.","Yin Lin was constrained by the burden pressing down on her own shoulders.","Bei Xu sighed softly. He did not know if Yin Lin was doing well in the main world.","He was not the only one who felt this way, though.","Su Yiren, Luo Lan, Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and even Liu Jie, who had just joined the Astronomical Parliament at a late stage, shared the same feeling.","At that moment, a figure was pulled into the Astronomical Parliament and stood before the chair representing the Ophiuchus constellation.."]},{"number":2945,"title":"Chapter 2945 Jing Bai’s Redemption!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2945 Jing Bai’s Redemption!","Bei Xu, Su Yiren, and Luo Lan were looking curiously at the figure who had been pulled into the Astronomical Parliament. Back when the three of them were drawn into the Astronomical Parliament, it was the same scenario.","Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie were prying into the memories of this young man called Jing Bai. They did not expect the two branches of the Illusion Snakes to have such a serious oppressive relationship with each other.","The Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes treated the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes as servants that could be slaughtered at will. The life and death of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes did not matter to them at all.","Jing Bai was not only oppressed by the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes but he was also discriminated against by the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","However, the discrimination of his own species did not change Jing Bai’s beliefs or cause them to become distorted. On the contrary, he became even more determined to lead the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes away from the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes.","Jing Bai believed that members of his own species discriminated against him because they were oppressed by the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes. If not for their oppression causing his brother to betray his parents and die tragically, he would not have had to endure the strange gazes from members of his own species.","In order to change the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes’ current situation, Jing Bai was prepared to use everything in exchange.","After Lin Yuan contracted the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake, it could be said that all snake-species feys were prey to him.","As branches of the Illusion Snakes, both the Crystal Rock and Purifying Water Illusion Snakes were extremely powerful. If the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake could control them, it would greatly increase the strength of its subordinates.","Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie looked at each other. They all felt that Jing Bai was qualified to be a member of the Astronomical Parliament.","Admitting new members to the Astronomical Parliament was a decision made jointly by Wen Yu, Lin Yuan, and Liu Jie.","Previously, when Yin Lin was sitting on the golden throne, her opinion was also sought regarding the admission of new members. However, ever since Yin Lin was elected, no new members had joined the Astronomical Parliament.","Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie had a common understanding. No matter what, the Astronomical Parliament would not accept evil individuals.","Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie had already seen Jing Bai’s resume. It could be said that Jing Bai possessed quite a good quality.","Since the last time Jing Bai received guidance, he would always have that dream about the constellations when he slept. Now, Jing Bai received guidance from the constellations again. However, this time, he did not come back empty-handed. Instead, he appeared in this mysterious meeting.","Jing Bai was still a little stunned. He could not tell if he was dreaming or in reality.","At that moment, he saw the woman sitting on the golden throne speak. “Welcome to the Astronomical Parliament. Your wish made me notice your existence. I want to confirm with you now: are you willing to use everything you have in exchange for the chance to fulfill your dream?","“If you’re willing, put your hand on the back of the chair behind you. You’ll become a member of the Astronomical Parliament.","“If you’re unwilling to make such an attempt, I’ll send you away. You’ll permanently lose your qualifications to become a member of the Astronomical Parliament!”","Wen Yu was well aware that even if she secured the Hundred Questions Beast from Lin Yuan and ensured the official convening of the Astronomical Parliament, it would still be inconvenient for her to dedicate too much energy to welcoming the members.","Before the Astronomical Parliament broke through the 12 Stars limit, Wen Yu could only allow one member to join the Astronomical Parliament at most.","Wen Yu’s words made Su Yiren, Yin Lin, and Bei Xu look nostalgic. Back then, Wen Yu had also asked them similar questions. Luo Lan and Bei Xu had already been at the end of their rope. Hence, in order to survive, they had had no choice but to join the Astronomical Parliament directly.","Su Yiren had initially doubted the Astronomical Parliament. Although she had successfully joined it in the end, she had suffered a lot because of her hesitation and doubts and almost missed this opportunity to change her fate.","The young man in front of them was facing the same choice as them.","The more Jing Bai thought about it, the more he felt like he was in a dream. Everything in front of him seemed too mystical, but even if he was in a dream, Jing Bai was still willing to use this opportunity to fulfill his wish.","Thus, he did not hesitate to place his handprint on the back of the chair behind him.","When Jing Bai pressed his hand onto the chair’s back, a sensation washed over him. It wasn’t the feeling of sleep—rather, he sensed the celestial body’s blessing, granting him a vague awareness of his surroundings in the present moment.","Jing Bai hurriedly turned around and looked around curiously, wanting to confirm if everything was just his imagination.","Upon seeing Jing Bai becoming an official member of the Astronomical Parliament and thus her companion, Su Yiren couldn’t help but speak up. “The seat behind me is the Corona Australis. My name is Su Yiren. Everything you’ve come into contact with now is real. You’ll naturally be able to tell after this meeting among the constellations ends and you leave.","“Now, I hope you can cherish this period in the meeting. This is extremely important for you to realize your wish!”","Su Yiren nodded.","Jing Bai basically had no friends in the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. Most of the time, he faced mockery and discrimination. Hence, he was not used to Su Yiren’s attitude.","Just like how Su Yiren nodded at him, he nodded back at her. “Um, my name is Jing Bai. I’m from the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.”","During their conversation, Lin Yuan could already feel his sense of belonging to the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. If Jing Bai did not have a strong sense of belonging to his species, he would definitely not have introduced himself in such a way.","Lin Yuan knew very well that with Wen Yu’s condition, she would not be able to hold on for much longer. Therefore, the duration of this Astronomical Parliament was bound to last for a relatively short period.","Lin Yuan did not intend to give Jing Bai too much time to familiarize himself with the others at the Astronomical Parliament, considering that he was already part of them now and would not lack such opportunities in the future.","Now that Jing Bai had joined the Astronomical Parliament and was still in a state of confusion, Lin Yuan felt that he needed to let him understand the situation. “Jing Bai, you’re now an official member of the Astronomical Parliament. I wonder if you know in which universe your Purifying Water Illusion Snakes is currently in?”","Jing Bai hurriedly bowed to Lin Yuan. He could tell that the three people sitting on the golden thrones were the superiors there. “Lord, my species is located in the North Universe. We are only dozens of kilometers away from the Water-Covered Coast. I usually live in caves in the cliffs around the Water-Covered Coast.”","Lin Yuan nodded. He had indeed investigated his life experiences. However, Jing Bai’s life experience did not include the knowledge he had.","Lin Yuan had no intention of heading to the North Universe yet, so he did not know where the Water-Covered Coast was.","After some thought, Lin Yuan asked, “Have you heard of the Snow-Covered Foxes in the North Universe?”","Upon hearing this, Jing Bai revealed a fearful expression on his face. He had basically heard of any species in the North Universe, and the Snow-Covered Foxes were a powerful species.","The Water-Covered Coast wasn’t too far from the area where the Snow-Covered Foxes lived, but the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes didn’t have the chance to make contact with them. Instead, the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes that enslaved the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes had interacted with the Snow-Covered Foxes.","At the pinnacle of the Illusion Snakes, even if they were not on par with the Snow-Covered Foxes, they were not much inferior to them.","But now, if the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes wanted to become a dependent species of the Snow-Covered Foxes, they would most likely be unwilling to take them in. The Snow-Covered Foxes indeed liked to take fox-species feys as their dependent species, but there were precedents where they had accepted other species as well.","Jing Bai did not know why Lin Yuan suddenly mentioned the Snow-Covered Foxes, nor did he know his motive, so he did not speak rashly. He only lowered her head slightly and waited for Lin Yuan to continue.","Ever since Lin Yuan handed the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower to Kong Huan, she would communicate with him every once in a while.","Kong Huan had completely charmed the Snow-Covered Fox leader, and he was now willing to do many things for her. However, until now, Kong Huan had not revealed the news that she was pregnant with his son. She planned to wait for their relationship to deepen before making the corresponding considerations.","Right now, no one dared to provoke Kong Huan in the territory of this Snow-Covered Fox leader. Even the other Snow-Covered Foxes in the territory were the same.","Kong Huan had been informing Lin Yuan about her achievements, who in turn was very supportive of her and told her not to worry about the consumption of resources. If Kong Huan’s resources were exhausted, Lin Yuan would continue to replenish them.","Lin Yuan’s selfless help served as Kong Huan’s greatest confidence booster.","It wouldn’t be long before Kong Huan completely charmed this Snow-Covered Fox leader, and by then Kong Huan would be able to take charge!","At that time, Lin Yuan could inform Kong Huan to take care of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. Perhaps this method could allow them to escape the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes’ oppression.","“Lord, I’ve naturally heard of the Snow-Covered Foxes. They are considered an extremely powerful species in the entire North Universe.”","Lin Yuan replied honestly, “I can’t help you much in the short term, but I can try to get a Snow-Covered Fox leader to protect your species. I will endeavor to make the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes become their dependent species. This will make it easier for you to escape the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes’ oppression.","“I presume the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes wouldn’t dare to meddle with the new dependent species of the Snow-Covered Fox leader, right?!”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, an excited expression appeared on Jing Bai’s face. He did not have high expectations. In his heart, as long as he could free the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes from the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes’ oppression, it would be enough. He did not even ask Lin Yuan to help his species rise.","If a Snow-Covered Fox leader was willing to step forward and take the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes as their dependent species, the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes would lose the ability to suppress them. They would certainly not dare to offend a Snow-Covered Fox leader.","Having easily achieved his long-standing dream, Jing Bai was so overwhelmed with joy that he found it difficult to articulate his gratitude to Lin Yuan and was momentarily at a loss.","Jing Bai’s actions left the other members of the Astronomical Parliament feeling a pang of sadness. Including Wen Yu, the other members of the Astronomical Parliament faintly saw reflections of themselves in Jing Bai.","Back then, they had lived an extremely difficult life before meeting Lin Yuan. At present, Lin Yuan started to redeem Jing Bai just like how he had redeemed them.","“Lord, thank you very much for your help to our Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. I will never forget your help!”","Lin Yuan smiled. He would need to trouble Kong Huan for this matter. At this moment, Kong Huan was alone and helpless in the North Universe and probably hoped to have one more person on her side there.","“I didn’t offer much help. It’s just a small favor. Remember your goal: to ascend with the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes, not to deter the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes from targeting you due to fear of the Snow-Covered Fox leader. I can supply all the resources your Purifying Water Illusion Snakes require to swiftly boost your strength.”","Lin Yuan prepared to send some resources to Jing Bai so that he could enhance his strength as soon as possible. Only by improving his strength could he ensure his own safety. Lin Yuan wouldn’t want to learn that Jing Bai was dead when the Astronomical Parliament convened again.","Teleporting required a significant amount of willpower and power of law. Lin Yuan still possessed ample reserves of both. With the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s awakening, he wouldn’t face any shortage of willpower or power of law.","There were a certain number of dead people in the faith country every day. Whether they died in an accident or died of old age, the bodies of these dead people contained willpowers. The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen could extract these wills and laws as Lin Yuan’s reserves.","Upon thinking about it, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s throbbing had become more and more frequent recently. She was most likely about to wake up.","After the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen devoured her parents’ sacred totems, she had reached the level of Sacred Source 12 Stars. When she woke up, she would most likely be able to break through the limits of the Sacred Source 12 Stars and reach a brand new realm.","Jing Bai gratefully told Lin Yuan the resources he needed.","Lin Yuan asked Wen Yu to activate Star Spirit Seat and send a Diamond fey storage box containing spirit qi crystals and numerous water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls over.","Once Jing Bai left the Astronomical Parliament, he would naturally be able to see Lin Yuan’s gift immediately."]},{"number":2946,"title":"Chapter 2946 Bai Yunzong’s Little Thoughts!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2946 Bai Yunzong’s Little Thoughts!","Lin Yuan always felt that Jing Bai seemed a little dazed. If he didn’t provide him with some resources, Lin Yuan was afraid that Jing Bai would wake up and think that what he had just experienced was just a dream.","After using Star Spirit Seat to transfer the resources, Wen Yu’s expression turned ugly.","Lin Yuan knew that Wen Yu had basically reached her limit. If she were to forcefully maintain the Astronomical Parliament after reaching her limit, it would definitely have a huge impact on Wen Yu’s health.","A small depletion of spiritual energy could be replenished. However, prolonged depletion of spiritual energy could result in permanent damage.","Lin Yuan directly instructed Wen Yu to end the Astronomical Parliament meeting. In any case, the Astronomical Parliament had recruited a new member, addressed the new member’s situation, and helped him resolve his problem. No matter how one looked at it, the Astronomical Parliament meeting was a success.","Wen Yu did not end the Astronomical Parliament immediately. She opened her eyes and endured the discomfort in her body as she used the precious spiritual ingredients that Lin Yuan had provided her to restore her spiritual energy.","Soon, Wen Yu recovered, but she had depleted her spiritual energy and needed some time to replenish it.","Wen Yu checked her body and told Lin Yuan, “Young Master, why don’t we set the next Astronomical Parliament meeting in 20 days? The Astronomical Parliament meeting every 20 days is basically my limit. The development in the Sky Beyond the Clouds has just begun. If we delay it for too long, it will be too time-consuming for us to deal with the situation.”","Lin Yuan nodded.","Holding the Astronomical Parliament every 20 days was relatively frequent compared to the Astronomical Parliament that was held in the main world previously. At that time, the Astronomical Parliament was only held once every 50 to 60 days.","There were two reasons why the Astronomical Parliament was extended for such a long time.","Firstly, Lin Yuan had been busy controlling the main world at that time and did not require the Astronomical Parliament to create any value for him.","Secondly, most of the Astronomical Parliament members had gathered around Lin Yuan. Even those who had not gathered around Lin Yuan had a Thoughts Letter Paper.","With the Thoughts Letter Paper, the Astronomical Parliament members could communicate with each other. There was really no need to hold the Astronomical Parliament all the time.","Lin Yuan now had something that could replace the Thoughts Letter Paper, which was the ramet of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. He could communicate with Kong Huan through it, and naturally, he could also communicate with Jing Bai in the future.","If not for the fact that there were relatively few young Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers and he did not have many to waste, Lin Yuan would have arranged a Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower to facilitate communication between Jing Bai and himself.","“Wen Yu, prioritize your health. You must ensure that the convening of the Astronomical Parliament meeting doesn’t compromise your safety and health. The Astronomical Parliament this time lasted more than 16 minutes when you used the Star Spirit Seat. This means that the Astronomical Parliament can officially begin!","“For the next Astronomical Parliament, we can intentionally reduce the duration to ensure you don’t exhaust your spiritual energy, keeping it within 14 minutes.”","...","While Lin Yuan and Wen Yu were conversing, Jing Bai opened his eyes in the cave. When he sensed the familiar darkness around him and the breathing of his companions nearby, he coughed twice.","Jing Bai’s cough quickly attracted an angry shout.","“If you can’t sleep, don’t disturb our sleep. If we don’t rest well, everyone will be whipped!”","Basically, whenever someone made a sound during the break, they would be subjected to such a stern shout. However, did the person who barked consider that their shout would wake everyone else up? Compared to the loud shout, his cough seemed quite insignificant.","Jing Bai only cursed in his heart. He knew very well that if he spoke at this time, it would inevitably cause an argument. It would be fine if the dispute could be resolved quickly. However, if it became too loud and disturbed the guards, it would undoubtedly lead to extremely negative consequences.","Jing Bai didn’t want others to be punished because of him.","Jing Bai was completely awake now. Just as Lin Yuan had expected, he thought that everything that had just happened was just a dream. However, it was undeniable that the dream just now gave Jing Bai a very pleasant feeling. In the dream, he seemed to have been the savior of the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes. Unfortunately, that sense of fulfillment was fleeting.","Jing Bai rubbed his eyes and spread his hands out. At this moment, Jing Bai suddenly realized that he had touched something very hard. Jing Bai had lived in this cave for a long time, so there shouldn’t be any miscellaneous items in this cave. Jing Bai took the item that was placed in his hand and looked at it. He realized that it was actually a very exquisite ring.","Jing Bai had never seen such an exquisite thing. Even if such a thing existed, it would usually be in the Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes’ hands.","The Crystal Rock Illusion Snakes hardly gave the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes any opportunity for enjoyment. The appearance of the ring reminded him of Lin Yuan’s words about leaving him a gift.","Lin Yuan had intentionally instructed Jing Bai on how to use it. At present, he activated his spiritual energy and projected it onto the ring as Lin Yuan had instructed.","Jing Bai’s breathing quickened. If he had not been mentally prepared, he would definitely have cried out in shock.","Jing Bai saw that this spatial equipment contained numerous crystals and round pearl-like things. The crystal contained a large amount of pure spirit qi. The pearl also contained extremely pure water-elemental energy. These things could increase Jing Bai’s strength in an extremely short period.","Compared to the items in this spatial equipment, what astonished Jing Bai even more was the realization that the meeting held among the constellations was actually real. It was equivalent to telling Jing Bai that his wish could really be fulfilled in the future. He was no longer a lonely and pitiful person. Now, he had officially found an organization.","Jing Bai knew how important this ring was to him, so he didn’t put it on. Instead, he opened his mouth and took it, keeping the ring below his molars, tightly clamped by his jaw muscles. He would secretly use these resources in an uninhabited place. If he could not hold back and used these resources now, the pure spirit qi in the crystal and the pure water-elemental energy in the pearl would immediately alert the others in the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes.","Given the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes’ current situation, those fellows would most likely report their private stash of resources to the inspectors in exchange for some benefits. If not for the fact that the Purifying Water Illusion Snakes were rotten to the core, Jing Bai would not mind giving these resources to them.","Jing Bai took two deep breaths and forced himself to calm down. He was looking forward to the next Astronomical Parliament meeting.","...","After a week, Lin Yuan called Autumn over and asked him, “How are the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons doing now?”","Autumn knew very well that Lin Yuan had not gone to see the captured Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons in the past week because Lin Yuan wanted him to polish off those individuals’ rough edges.","Autumn reflected that both the leader of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, Bai Yunzong, and the Second Elder of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, Chi Zhentian, had already adjusted their stances and wanted to submit to Sky City from the bottom of their hearts.","It was Lin Yuan who wanted to take these people under his wing, and not Autumn. Now, Autumn’s capabilities were stretched to their limit in managing the situation with the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons.","“Young Master, I’ve completed and handled everything that needed to be said or done. You can take over the captured Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons at any time.","“One of the individuals captured from the Crimson Heaven Falcons is the Second Elder, representing their top combat power. We’ve managed to loosen the tongue of the Second Elder. Feel free to inquire about anything you’d like to know from him at any time.”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “In that case, Autumn, why don’t you take me to take a look and understand the situation? It’s time to take in the Spinning Wings White Falcons!”","Sky City now could develop the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons. However, developing the territory would require the cooperation of the other species in the territory.","The Spinning Wings White Falcons were not the only ones in the territory. There were also their dependent species who listened to their orders. If Lin Yuan wanted to develop the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ territory without any bloodshed and obtain the support of these species, the Spinning Wings White Falcons had to cooperate fully.","Lin Yuan wanted to complete the development of the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ resources as soon as possible so that the faith country could continue to develop at its current speed. Therefore, controlling them was something that Lin Yuan urgently needed to do.","As for the Crimson Heaven Falcons, their territory was vast, and the Spinning Wings White Falcons were just one of their dependent species. In the short term, Lin Yuan wouldn’t be able to develop the territory under the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ jurisdiction, so any actions against them could be postponed for later consideration.","What Lin Yuan truly wanted to know was why the Crimson Heaven Falcons had remained in this barren area for so long and what they were waiting for.","If whatever the Crimson Heaven Falcons were waiting for was only beneficial to them and didn’t serve Lin Yuan’s interests, then he would not need to concern himself and Lin Yuan would not mind fulfilling the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ wish.","However, if the resources that they were waiting for were also useful to Lin Yuan’s feys, Lin Yuan would not mind snatching their resources to benefit his own feys.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the strong were respected. If Lin Yuan indeed took action against the Crimson Heaven Falcons, they wouldn’t dare to make any response.","Up until now, the Crimson Heaven Falcons had robbed countless species of their resources. Those species whose resources had been robbed had now obediently submitted to them. Lin Yuan believed that the Crimson Heaven Falcons would not make a mistake.","The Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons had been relocated by Autumn and were now stationed at the plaza on the western side of Sky City.","Autumn was very clear about his intentions. These Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons would either completely submit to Lin Yuan or Autumn would eliminate them, leaving no room for potential threats and giving them no chance to reveal Sky City’s situation to the outside world.","...","Ever since Bai Yunzong saw the Sky City on Sky Sea’s back, he realized how powerful the factions targeting the Spinning Wings White Falcons were.","However, there was no need for Sky Sea or the Sky City itself to be used to mark Sky City’s extraordinariness. Liu Chen, Liu Yao, and Spring, Summer, and Autumn were enough to prove how powerful Sky City was.","Bai Yunzong had not seen the Young Master that Autumn had mentioned after being captured for so long. He felt a little uneasy. He was afraid that the Spinning Wings White Falcons would be abandoned by this faction.","Bai Yunzong had always thought that the Crimson Heaven Falcons were extraordinary. Even as their dependent species, Bai Yunzong was very confident that his species could be valued by them. However, he didn’t have much confidence in facing this expert with several exceptionally powerful abilities and a faction that could build a huge faith country in a short period.","Over the past few days, Bai Yunzong had been restraining the Spinning Wings White Falcons in Sky City. He was afraid that some ignorant member would cause trouble for him. Bai Yunzong’s control over the Spinning Wings White Falcons was much better than Chi Zhentian’s control over the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","Chi Jue kept a very low profile, looking like a prisoner. However, Chi Ling didn’t seem to have the awareness of being a prisoner.","Chi Ling did not cause any trouble. However, he heavily scolded a Spinning Wings White Falcon who offended him, as though they were still the dependent species of the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","Currently, on this plaza, the Spinning Wings White Falcon and the Crimson Crimson Heaven Falcons were on an equal footing.","Chi Ling’s attitude clearly showed that he had no awareness of being a servant.","Upon seeing that Chi Zhentian didn’t immediately intervene to restrain Chi Ling, Bai Yunzong shot a look at the Spinning Wings White Falcons who were being disciplined by Chi Ling, prompting the member to express apologies to him.","With the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons preparing to submit, a competitive relationship had already formed between the two sides. The Crimson Heaven Falcons clearly did not take the Spinning Wings White Falcons seriously and did not approve of this competitive relationship.","Bai Yunzong was ready to manipulate the situation to suppress the Crimson Heaven Falcons, securing more opportunities for the Spinning Wings White Falcons among the Sky City leaders.","Since the Crimson Heaven Falcons were stronger than the Spinning Wings White Falcons, it was crucial to begin strategizing immediately to elevate the latter’s status."]},{"number":2947,"title":"Chapter 2947: Fortunately, There’s Still Time!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2947: Fortunately, There’s Still Time!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Under normal circumstances, Bai Yunzong would never be so optimistic.","However, the fact that the King Blood Jackals were not as strong as the","Spinning Wings White Falcons, yet they were greatly valued, sparked hope in Bai Yunzong’s heart.","This situation could only mean one thing: Sky City didn’t value the strength of this species very much. It was obvious that what mattered most wasn’t just the strength, but rather how much benefits he could bring to the faction.","After understanding this, Bai Yunzong could use this to cater to Sky City and gain the trust of the so-called Young Master.","From this point alone, there was a difference between the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons. Due to varying levels of self-awareness, the Crimson Heaven Falcons would still consider their previous identity and current status when carrying out orders.","It was very difficult for the Crimson Heaven Falcons to accept the fact that they had to be on equal footing with the Spinning Wings White Falcons. The harder it was for the Crimson Heaven Falcons to accept this, the more Bai Yunzong could use this to provoke them.","The Crimson Heaven Falcons were easily angered. Therefore, he only needed to change his attitude toward them. While his actions indeed had the purpose of deceiving the Crimson Heaven Falcons, no one would be able to point out anything wrong.","Spring was monitoring the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons’ situation and easily saw through Bai Yunzong’s thoughts. She did not feel that there was anything wrong with his thoughts. On the contrary, she admired his actions.","Bai Yunzong was using this reasonable method to seek benefits for the Spinning Wings White Falcons, increasing their likelihood of being placed in an important position.","As a leader, Bai Yunzong used his own ability to seek benefits for them. On the other hand, the Crimson Heaven Falcons did not know what was good for them. As a prisoner, how could they have the chance to assert their dignity?","Currently, Lin Yuan wanted to develop the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, and they were much more useful than the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","Before all the Crimson Heaven Falcons were under Lin Yuan’s control, he would not put them in an important position. Moreover, with Spring’s understanding of Lin Yuan, he would no longer let the Crimson Heaven Falcons manage the Spinning Wings White Falcons. Instead, it would give the Spinning Wings White Falcons a chance to develop themselves.","Just like when Lin Yuan had placed the King Blood Jackals in an important position, Bai Yunzong would also be placed in an important position by Lin Yuan like Kani.","Through his observation of Bai Yunzong during this period, Spring concluded that Bai Yunzong was deserving of Lin Yuan’s appreciation. He was a very clever individual. If such a person were used, he would take the initiative to lead the Spinning Wings White Falcons to create the greatest value for Lin","Yuan.","If there were any shortcomings in Bai Yunzong, it would likely be his keen awareness of the situation and a tendency to be somewhat ambitious.","In the future, if Sky City encountered any danger, Bai Yunzong would most likely lead the Spinning Wings White Falcons to join the factions targeting Sky","City.","However, this possibility was impossible.","Firstly, it was very difficult to encounter a faction stronger than Sky City.","Secondly, if Lin Yuan took Bai Yunzong under his wing, he would definitely control the Spinning Wings White Falcons like how he controlled the King Blood Jackals. When the life and death of the Spinning Wings White Falcons were in Lin Yuan’s hands, even if Bai Yunzong wanted to submit to other factions, he would not have the chance to do so.","In short, in Spring’s opinion, the Spinning Wings White Falcons were worth placing in an important position. With the Spinning Wings White Falcons, Sky City would have a large number of powerful aerial combat units. Their mobility was incomparable to the demon insects produced by Keira.","After learning that Autumn was about to bring Lin Yuan over, Spring appeared and said, “Young Master is about to head here. Why aren’t you guys getting into formation to welcome him?!”","The Crimson Heaven Falcons led by Chi Zhentian and the Spinning Wings White Falcons led by Bai Yunzong had never seen Lin Yuan before. Now that they had a chance to interact with this legendary “Young Master”, be it the Spinning Wings White Falcons or the Crimson Heaven Falcons, they were extremely nervous, especially Chi Zhentian and Bai Yunzong.","Because the Spinning Wings White Falcons were the dependent species, the Crimson Heaven Falcons instinctively considered them inferior. Under such circumstances, it was normal for them to look down on or humiliate the","Spinning Wings White Falcons. However, in front of Lin Yuan, not to mention Chi Ling, even Chi Zhentian did not dare to disrespect him.","The few of them saw the majestic Autumn following behind a young man. This young man had handsome features and a calm bearing. When his gaze swept over them, the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons instinctively lowered their gazes. Even Chi Zhentian and Bai Yunzong were no exception.","This was not because Lin Yuan exuded an overwhelming aura. In fact, he didn’t radiate any particularly extraordinary aura. It was completely because the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons had already lost their edge over the past few days and had instinctively placed their status beneath Lin Yuan. This was the root cause of the current situation.","“You’ve been in Sky City for quite some time. I reckon you must have a solid grasp of why you’re here. If that’s the case, dedicate your loyalty to the Faith Tree with your divine kingdom and holy spirit!”","Lin Yuan took out the Faith Tree that controlled the Lonely River’s Four Species","Overlords and King Blood Jackals. He did not waste his breath on the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons and directly stated his request and goal.","After smoothing out the rough edges, both the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons were ready to submit to Sky City. This opportunity revealed the members of both species with rebellious tendencies. Nevertheless, ultimately, both groups demonstrated excellent obedience.","After gaining control of the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons, the Faith Tree grew again. Now, they had become trustworthy existences for Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan spoke to Chi Zhentian first. “I don’t know much about the Crimson","Heaven Falcons. As the Second Elder, you are in charge of the entire species, so I hope you can tell me. It will make it easier for me to control the Crimson Heaven Falcons. As their leader, I will give you a chance.","“If you can do these things well, I will hand over the Crimson Heaven Falcons to you to manage in the future. However, if you don’t handle all of this well, it will hinder my ability to gain clear insight into your species’ internal dynamics, and I might suffer losses as a result. If that happens, you will lose your administrative position in the Crimson Heaven Falcons and will receive punishment!”","Lin Yuan’s words stirred Chi Zhentian’s heart, igniting a tumultuous mix of pressure and inner conflict. Deep down, he hesitated to reveal these circumstances to Lin Yuan. As the Second Elder, he felt a strong allegiance, despite now being part of Sky City. Betraying his species was something he couldn’t bring himself to do.","However, whether it was for his own sake or the Crimson Heaven Falcons’, he had to agree to Lin Yuan’s request and explain their internal situation. If he were to provoke Lin Yuan and incur his displeasure, it wouldn’t just affect him personally, he might also lose the opportunity to be put in an important position and even the Crimson Heaven Falcons might face repercussions as a whole.","Apart from thinking for the Crimson Heaven Falcons, Chi Zhentian would also think for himself. Chi Zhentian really hoped that he could become their leader in the future. He had no intention of controlling the Crimson Heaven Falcons, but he had to maintain his position as the number two figure of the Crimson","Heaven Falcons.","“City Lord, I naturally won’t hide what you want to know. I just don’t know what exactly I should say. It would take an immense amount of time to reveal everything about the Crimson Heaven Falcons. It might not be entirely convenient to discuss everything here, don’t you agree?”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan nodded. At present, he indeed did not have the time to listen to Chi Zhentian’s explanation. Lin Yuan was there today mainly to talk to Bai Yunzong.","Lin Yuan instructed, “Spring, bring him to Wen Yu and ask her to help sort out the information related to the Crimson Heaven Falcons. I have something to ask Bai Yunzong.”","Bai Yunzong and the Crimson Heaven Falcons were surprised by Lin Yuan’s sudden mention of him. In the eyes of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, the Spinning Wings White Falcons were merely servants.","Now that the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons were in front of Lin Yuan, he was even more interested in the latter, and this was a slap to the face of the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","However, in this situation, the Crimson Heaven Falcons did not dare to say anything. Chi Zhentian could only obediently leave with the Crimson Heaven Falcons and Spring.","Bai Yunzong looked at Lin Yuan anxiously and expectantly. Ever since he had chosen to join Sky City, he had not done anything that jeopardized their interests. Even before he joined Sky City, he had not done such a thing.","He indeed had to lead the Spinning Wings White Falcons to attack the faith country, but this was mainly because he had to listen to the Crimson Heaven Falcon’s orders. As a dependent species, they had no autonomy at all. Therefore, it should be a good thing that he was suddenly called out.","Bai Yunzong was the first to speak to Lin Yuan enthusiastically. “Hello, Lord.","I’m Bai Yunzong. From now on, I will definitely lead the Spinning Wings White","Falcons to sacrifice their lives for Sky City and offer all their loyalty!”","Autumn glanced at Bai Yunzong. Not only was he clever, but he also possessed a charming way with words that could captivate anyone.","Lin Yuan would not make too many requests of the servants. Keeping Bai","Yunzong close served the purpose of discussing the future acquisition of the","Spinning Wings White Falcons’ territory. Before enlisting their support, Lin Yuan intended to offer certain incentives to them. In his role as their leader, Bai Yunzong stood to gain greater advantages than his counterparts.","With a smile, Lin Yuan turned to Bai Yunzong and inquired, “Could you enlighten me on the number of servants within the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons? I aim to grasp the overall situation of your group.”","As their leader, Bai Yunzong knew their internal situation very well. Bai Yunzong told Lin Yuan, “City Lord, our species has a total of more than 3,000 servants. These 3,000 servants are all relatively powerful species in the territory and species with similar bloodlines to us. Apart from these servants, there are tens of thousands of other species that rely on these servants to survive.","“If you want to control this area where we lived previously, we can help you control all the servants. You don’t have to worry about developing the resources in the territory!”","Before uttering these words, Bai Yunzong had been silently speculating about Lin Yuan’s intentions for seeking him out. As Bai Yunzong spoke, he deliberately leaned toward the reason Lin Yuan was looking for him.","First of all, he intended to cater to Lin Yuan. Furthermore, he wanted to show Lin Yuan through his response that he was intelligent and exceptionally skilled at thinking. Bai Yunzong had clearly achieved his goal.","Upon hearing Bai Yunzong’s words, Lin Yuan could not help but smile. “You’re very intelligent. You understand the true purpose behind my words. Since you’re so smart, you’ll continue to manage the Spinning Wings White Falcons along with the territory.","“I believe you won’t disappoint me. In that case, you will all return to your original territory now. Please help me control the situation there!","“Once you help me gain control of the situation there, I will assist you in enhancing your bloodline and strength according to your current bloodline foundation.","“The elements suitable for the Spinning Wings White Falcons are different from the elements suitable for the Crimson Heaven Falcons. It may seem like a short-term power boost to transition the Spinning Wings White Falcon bloodline toward that of the Crimson Heaven Falcons. However, if this continues for a long time, you will suffer the backlash of your bloodline and die.","“I believe you’ve already begun to feel uncomfortable at night. Fortunately, you didn’t absorb much Crimson Heaven Falcon blood essence. Otherwise, even I wouldn’t be able to help you. Fortunately, there’s still time!”","Bai Yunzong naturally believed Lin Yuan’s words. In his heart, Lin Yuan was like a god. He had never considered that Crimson Heaven Falcon blood essence that was given to him as a reward, would come with hidden risks and they would have such a huge impact on him that he might even suffer a backlash and die.."]},{"number":2948,"title":"Chapter 2948 Unsealed Keira!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2948 ?Unsealed Keira!","Chi Jue had never told Bai Yunzong this before.","However, the Crimson Heaven Falcons had a long history of using blood essence as a reward. Naturally, Chi Jue knew this!","In Bai Yunzong’s heart, Chi Jue did not care about his situation and future at all. He only used the Crimson Heaven Falcon blood essence as a short-term motivation.","This action made Bai Yunzong extremely dissatisfied.","As Bai Yunzong had absorbed the Crimson Heaven Falcon blood essence, his influence in the species had decreased. This was something that Bai Yunzong could still accept. This was because Bai Yunzong had previously used the Crimson Heaven Falcon blood essence to increase his strength.","However, after confirming that the Crimson Heaven Falcon blood essence was harmful to him, Bai Yunzong developed a strong hatred for Chi Jue.","At the same time, Bai Yunzong could not help but think that it was fortunate that Lin Yuan had taken him in as a subordinate. Otherwise, his future would have been bleak.","Lin Yuan had given Bai Yunzong a promise that he could use his current Spinning Wings White Falcon bloodline as a benchmark to continue improving his strength.","“City Lord, thank you for your kindness. Don’t worry, I will definitely control the situation in the territory and cooperate with you in the handover and development. Thank you for your willingness to upgrade me and give me resources! No matter what step I take in the future, I will never disappoint you!”","“City Lord, thank you for your kindness. Don’t worry, I will definitely control the situation in the territory and cooperate with you in the handover and development. Thank you for your willingness to upgrade me and give me resources! No matter what step I take in the future, I will never disappoint you!”","When Lin Yuan heard Bai Yunzong’s declaration, he nodded noncommittally. Bai Yunzong naturally could not disappoint him.","As the leader of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, Bai Yunzong would control their territory in the same way that the King Blood Jackals did.","Once Bai Yunzong did something that disappointed Lin Yuan, it would definitely cause severe losses.","If it was just a small problem, Lin Yuan would not be disappointed at all. If Bai Yunzong caused Lin Yuan great losses, Lin Yuan would directly get rid of Bai Yunzong and replace him with someone who would not disappoint him.","Lin Yuan could evolve Bai Yunzong’s bloodline as a form of encouragement, but he still had many things to do.","There was no time to use his body composition to help Bai Yunzong.","Although Lin Yuan did not use his body composition to help Bai Yunzong improve his bloodline, he still rewarded him with some resources.","After beating someone up, he had to give them something sweet. This was more compatible with the management of a faction member. It allowed those who had been beaten to radiate passion and vitality.","Lin Yuan bestowed abundant resources that not only benefited Bai Yunzong but all the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","However, these resources would be distributed by Bai Yunzong in the future.","Lin Yuan could sense Bai Yunzong’s dominance over the Spinning Wings White Falcons. Bai Yunzong’s dominance was even stronger than Kani’s dominance over the King Blood Jackals.","Bai Yunzong also had the intention to solidify his dominance. Therefore, Lin Yuan was willing to give Bai Yunzong a chance to strengthen his rule.","However, Bai Yunzong’s dominance over his species had to serve Lin Yuan. If anything happened to the Spinning Wings White Falcons in the future, Lin Yuan could look for Bai Yunzong to resolve it.","...","When Lin Yuan went to see Red Thorn, he also sent Keira to the area where Red Thorn was. He had some matters to discuss with Keira.","However, Keira had just eaten the high-level lifeform genes that Lin Yuan had brought back and had fallen into a short slumber. She was going to use the genes of these high-level lifeforms to produce mutated demon insects.","Under such circumstances, Lin Yuan did not want to disturb Keira, so he did not force her to meet him. If Lin Yuan made the request, Keira would definitely drop everything she was doing and rush over to see him immediately.","Now that Keira had woken up from her slumber, Lin Yuan felt that he needed to meet her as soon as possible.","Lin Yuan had many things to instruct Keira. The biggest contributor to the faith country’s current stable development was not Su Yiren and Luo Lan, but Keira’s army of hundreds of millions of demon insects. These demon insects were able to maintain order in Sky City.","Besides the King Blood Jackals’ strictness with their dependent species, Sky City had been able to take control of their territory so quickly because Lin Yuan had commanded Keira to send out an army of demon insects.","Keira’s current strength had already reached World Emperor/Diving Kingdom. Because the demon insects produced could provide her with faith, Keira was not far from the Holy Spirit level.","The Class 1 Genetic Lock demon insects that Keira had produced were all at high-level World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","The strength of those demon insects with Class 2 Genetic Locks had basically broken through spirit fire and reached the divine kingdom.","The mighty army of demon insects was stationed in various parts of the King Blood Jackals’ territory. Even if the King Blood Jackals’ dependent species had any skewed thoughts, they did not dare to show them in their actions.","Lin Yuan could not place all his trust in the Spinning Wings White Falcons. Lin Yuan still had to rely on Keira’s army of demon insects.","When Lin Yuan left Sky City to look for resources, Keira had suggested to Lin Yuan to expand the army of demon insects, but he had rejected her.","Back then, Lin Yuan’s reason for refusing was very simple. He had never expected to occupy the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ territory so quickly. He still needed to attack the territory of the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","If the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons had not taken action first, Lin Yuan probably would not have targeted them even if he returned to Sky City.","Lin Yuan had always liked to do things steadily. He would first consolidate the current faith country. He would expand after completely developing the resources in the King Blood Jackals’ territory. If not, Lin Yuan would have accelerated Sky City’s development.","Lin Yuan was prepared to completely unseal Keira and provide a large amount of resources for her to use. He would enable Keira to produce demon insects as quickly as possible.","To provide the best environment for Keira, Lin Yuan would allow her to stay in the Spirit Lock spatial zone for some time. The environment in the Spirit Lock spatial zone could greatly increase the speed at which Keira produced Class 1 Genetic Lock demon insects.","After Bai Yunzong left with the Spinning Wings White Falcons, Autumn suggested Lin Yuan, “Young Master, if you intend to turn North of the Lonely River into a paradise that can produce faith power, I suggest that we simply set up along the Lonely River and completely control the entry and exit of North of the Lonely River","“After we control the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, we will be in control of the Lonely River’s shoreline.","“The area of North of the Lonely River is vast. As one heads downstream, there is a mountain that is hundreds of thousands of meters tall.","“The Spinning Wings White Falcons, King Blood Jackals, Crimson Heaven Falcons’ territory, which lies beyond the mountain haven’t been explored at all. Setting a boundary from the world outside the Lonely River can prevent the outside world from harassing and coveting the faith country.","“The land inside can be used to continuously expand the faith country and produce more faith power. As long as we invest a large amount of resources, it’s not difficult to do all of this.","“Summer has always had the habit of raising Thriving Summer Rising Clouds as playthings. They are very territorial plants. Plant these Thriving Summer Rising Clouds along the banks of the Lonely River and let these Thriving Summer Rising Clouds grow. All invaders, even if they are harmless mosquitoes, will be exterminated and expelled by Thriving Summer Rising Clouds.”","Spring felt that Autumn’s suggestion was extremely good. This way, they could avoid many hidden dangers.","However, Autumn was a little rude and actually had designs on Summer’s playthings.","Summer did not mind giving Lin Yuan those toys. If she knew that the Thriving Summer Rising Clouds could help Lin Yuan, she would have nurtured them a long time ago.","Since Autumn mentioned the Thriving Summer Rising Clouds, Spring also said, “Young Master, you value the Soldier Ration Radish so much because of its growth speed.","“The Thriving Summer Rising Cloud’s growth speed is actually not slower than the Soldier Ration Radish! The Thriving Summer Rising Cloud doesn’t even need to be provided with many resources for its growth speed will far exceed that of the Soldier Ration Radish","“Many Thriving Summer Rising Clouds might be needed to surround the entire Lonely River but it will be very easy for Summer to do this with my support.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up.","How could Lin Yuan not know how important it was to separate the inside and outside of the Lonely River? The greatest benefit of doing so was that it could allow the faith country to develop healthily and reduce the possibility of the outside world invading the faith country.","According to Autumn’s suggestion, if planting Thriving Summer Rising Clouds by the Lonely River’s embankment could achieve this, Lin Yuan would be willing to give it a try no matter how much resources he had to spend.","Lin Yuan planned to meet Summer after meeting Keira to explain the matter to her. Although Summer was Lin Yuan’s follower, he would definitely have to seek her opinion on such a matter.","Lin Yuan had thought about this situation before. Now that he knew that the Lonely River could be used as a dividing line to separate the entire North of the Lonely River, many thoughts appeared in his mind. He was now more confident in expanding his faith country.","...","Keira quickly appeared before Lin Yuan. The last time Lin Yuan had summoned her, she had been in a deep sleep. Keira felt very embarrassed.","Now that she had received the news of Lin Yuan’s summons, Keira hurried over with an apologetic heart.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan, Keira knelt on one knee and said, “Lord, I’m really sorry. The last time you summoned me, I was in a deep sleep. Next time, before I fall asleep, I’ll definitely take the initiative to ask if you have anything for me to do!”","Lin Yuan looked at Keira. As the number of creatures she hunted increased, she became more and more familiar with the ways of the world. She was like a wily old fox.","Lin Yuan was actually unwilling to communicate with Keira like this but did not have any issues with her.","From a certain perspective, Keira’s situation could be understood as the enhancement of her bloodline.","Lin Yuan said, “Keira, the situation is special now. You don’t have to study those special demon insects. I’m now preparing to remove the restrictions on you and allow you to reproduce vigorously. You can enter a state of accelerated reproduction just like you wanted. In order to ensure that your state can continue, I will let you enter the Spirit Lock spatial zone and use the environment of the Spirit Lock spatial zone to achieve this goal.”","Hearing this, Keira revealed a surprised expression.","What Keira wanted to do the most was expand the demon insects.","If Lin Yuan had not intentionally restricted the speed at which Keira could produce demon insects, he would not have let Keira lift the ban even if he wanted to listen to Wen Yu’s opinion. This made Keira rather depressed.","If not for Lin Yuan’s control over her, Keira would have already multiplied the number of demon insects by more than five times.","Even if Keira wanted to expand the demon insect army, she did not dare to insist unless Lin Yuan agreed.","Keira knew very well that Lin Yuan was extremely kind toward her and would provide her with high-quality resources to help her grow. However, all of this was based on the fact that Lin Yuan could control Keira.","Keira knew very well that once she left Lin Yuan’s control, he would be the first to eliminate her. Therefore, Keira had always been very obedient.","Keira had some complaints about Lin Yuan, but this did not affect her loyalty to him.","Now, Lin Yuan had lifted Keira’s ban and allowed her to enter the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","This made Keira both happy and excited. She had been thinking about how to find a suitable opportunity to convince Lin Yuan.","Keira no longer needed to think about whether she could accelerate the reproduction of the insects.","Lin Yuan wanted to expand the insect army to increase its reproduction speed which meant that Keira could freely increase her strength.","Keira felt that she was about to touch the threshold of the Holy Spirit level. After reaching the Holy Spirit level she could be considered a new demon insect queen in all four universes.","Keira was the only demon insect queen in North of the Lonely River. However, her gaze was never there.","Keira hadn’t forgotten the relentless pursuit of the demon insects, nor the subsequent torment and humiliation inflicted by a real insect queen, following an attack by other species. Were it not for that ordeal, she wouldn’t have sought refuge in the alien insect dimensional world, enduring exile for millions of years.","Even if she used her demon insect bloodline to nurture her demon insects, they would not be able to provide for her.","“Master, thank you for giving me a chance to expand the insect army. I won’t disappoint you! With my current strength and level, if you’re willing to let me increase my strength in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, I think I can make my demon insect army more than three times their current size in three months. It’s just that there are so many issues I need to consider. I’m afraid that the wanton gathering of these demon insects will affect the faith country!”"]},{"number":2949,"title":"Chapter 2949: Battle in the Blue Shark Sea!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2949: Battle in the Blue Shark Sea!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Keira was extremely meticulous. It was good that Lin Yuan wanted her to expand the demon insects but Keira did not want her expansion to affect the faith country.","If the demon insects wanted to reproduce, they needed space. Keira had been asleep for such a long time and did not know that Lin Yuan had already controlled the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","Lin Yuan said to Keira with a smile, “Since I’ve given the order for you to expand the demon insect army, I’m naturally prepared for this. Just focus on expanding the demon insects. From now on, the entire North of the Lonely River will be the territory of the demon insects.”","Keira was relieved. Since Lin Yuan had said so, Keira could peacefully expand the demon insects.","She had already said what she needed to say to Lin Yuan. If anything happened during the expansion of the demon insects in the future, Lin Yuan would not be able to blame her.","“Master, please arrange a space in the Spirit Lock spatial zone for me to use. If the space is too small, there won’t be any problems with the breeding of the demon insects. However, it’s hard to guarantee that the others in the Spirit Lock spatial zone won’t be affected by me!”","Lin Yuan sent Keira into the Spirit Lock spatial zone where she could now reproduce without restraint.","Lin Yuan would get Genius to arrange a large enough area for Keira to produce a large number of demon insects with Class 1 Genetic Locks.","Although the resources in the North of the Lonely River were relatively poor, this was only a lack of resources.","There were quite several species residing in North of the Lonely River. Through the genes of these species, Keira produced more and more types of demon insects.","Lin Yuan had already explained to Keira the purpose of expanding the demon insect army.","Keira was sensible. In the end, she would definitely produce suitable female insects to develop the demon insect army according to Lin Yuan’s requirements. Keira was very good at observing Lin Yuan’s intentions and would follow his instructions. She was especially serious about the details. This was also one of the reasons why Lin Yuan placed Keira in an important position.","It was not that Lin Yuan did not have the chance to encounter demon insects on this trip. There had been a female demon insect in the exhibition hall.","Lin Yuan did not choose to buy this female demon insect because the Fortune Treasure Palace’s asking price had exceeded his expectations.","Secondly, it was because female demon insects were mortal enemies. A female insect with ultimate reproductive rights would not submit to other female insects or cooperate with them.","Since Lin Yuan already had Keira, there was no need for him to consider taking in a new broodmother.","If Keira had not done her best, Lin Yuan would most likely have bought the female insect that was still in its embryonic form.","Since Keira could do things well, Lin Yuan did not want her to feel threatened and think that she could be replaced at any time.","After making arrangements for Keira, Lin Yuan heaved a sigh of relief.","Lin Yuan was prepared to rest for some time and wait for the competition. After the competition ended, he would improve the strength of the ordinary members of Sky City.","Before Lin Yuan could stop for two days, he received a message from Qin Yu.","[Qin Yu]: Master, you’ve arranged two things for me. One is to find an opportunity to promote Fan Lou. The other is to pay attention to the Bloodians’ war against the mermaids. Judging from the current situation, the Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory are about to battle the mermaids in the Blue Shark Sea.","[Qin Yu]: The Elisa clan will join this operation. At that time, the powerful species will be qualified to divide and take possession of the captives. If you’re interested in these sea species, I can help you capture another group of captives. At that time, you can deal with these captives!","Qin Yu’s words were very generous. Before meeting Lin Yuan, she would definitely care about the ownership of these mermaids.","However, after being taken in by Lin Yuan and being provided with a large amount of pure spirit qi, the mermaids were no longer as appealing.","It was quite beneficial for the dependent species to suck the blood of the mermaids, as apart from being rich in spirit qi, mermaid blood was also rich in elemental energy. However, the benefits these mermaid captives brought to the Bloodians could not be compared to those spirit qi crystals!","During this period, Qin Yu was in an abnormally good mood. The two Bloodian kings under her, Lhalu and Fan Qia, had completely extended their lifespans.","The current Elisa clan was in the most prosperous state it had been in the past hundreds of thousands of years.","Qin Yu’s status in the Scarlet Territory rose steadily. She already had enough authority to influence the important decisions of the Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory.","Not only that, Qin Yu knew very well that the Elisa clan had an unimaginable backer. If anything happened to the Elisa clan in the future, they could obviously seek Lin Yuan’s help. This allowed Qin Yu to not be afraid of anything.","Qin Yu had already met Fan Lou a few days ago. Although Lin Yuan had specially instructed Qin Yu to promote Fan Lou, Fan Lou was too weak so Qin Yu did not take him seriously.","Qin Yu wanted to find an opportunity to communicate with Lin Yuan but she was afraid that Fan Lou was not important enough. If she communicated with Lin Yuan through Fan Lou, it would seem like she was trying to find something to say. It would not be good if it affected the image that Lin Yuan had of her!","Now that the Bloodians were finally going to attack the mermaids, this matter was clearly worth looking for Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan thought, The Bloodians are indeed fast when it comes to hunting. They’re actually going to attack the mermaids so soon!","The mermaid race was not a small species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Like the Bloodians, they were also on the Species Ranking.","Although the mermaids were generally weaker than the Bloodians and would be at a disadvantage in battle, the mermaids had a large number of allies in the sea and could increase the water elements’ activity in the sea. As such, many powerful sea species were willing to lend a helping hand to the mermaids during battle.","This battle between the Bloodians and the mermaids would definitely be chaotic and Lin Yuan was not suited to participate.","Lin Yuan had already realized this.","Qin Yu could help him obtain mermaids and directly solve Lin Yuan’s need for mermaids. Through these mermaids, Dark Blue could quickly obtain faith and increase its strength.","[Lin Yuan]: Qin Yu, these mermaids are indeed very useful to me. Help me get as many mermaids as possible! I know that these mermen are equally useful to the Elisa clan. I will use resources to compensate the Elisa clan in the future!","Qin Yu had never been worried about obtaining resources from Lin Yuan. Before Lin Yuan left, he had given her a large amount of resources. These resources were enough for the Elisa clan to use for a long time.","In Qin Yu’s eyes, the spirit qi crystals that Lin Yuan had provided to the Elisa clan and the favors that had helped her increase her strength were already more precious than these mermaids!","Lin Yuan would even compensate the Elisa clan for these mermaids in the future. This was real charity!","He was so generous that Qin Yu felt that the Elisa clan was soaking in a honey pot.","Naturally, Qin Yu would not stand on ceremony with Lin Yuan.","Qin Yu secretly made up her mind to let the Bloodian warriors of the Elisa clan capture more mermaids. To the Elisa clan, these mermaids were basically equivalent to spirit qi crystals.","Qin Yu mentioned Fan Lou to Lin Yuan. Qin Yu’s idea was that if Lin Yuan was interested in Fan Lou and was willing to talk about him, they could have a good chat. If Lin Yuan was not interested in Fan Lou and showed a lack of interest, she would immediately end the conversation.","[Qin Yu]: Master, Fan Lou who you mentioned previously followed the Andra clan to the Elisa clan’s territory to congratulate me. The banquet will last for nearly two months. After the banquet ends, the various Bloodian clans will directly attack the Blue Shark Sea","[Qin Yu]: I cannot find any reason to promote Fan Lou now. Do you think I should find a reason to promote Fan Lou and turn him into a pureblood Bloodian? The Andra clan should be modifying Fan Lou’s bloodline. Fan Lou clearly has a portion of the Bloodian bloodline now but the level of the Bloodian bloodline in his body is not high. If he evolves into a Bloodian now, it will take a lot of effort and time for Fan Lou’s bloodline to improve in the future.","Lin Yuan’s willingness to interfere with Fan Lou’s bloodline showed how important Fan Lou was to him.","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment before replying.","[Lin Yuan]: In that case, find a chance to promote Fan Lou. The Lonely River’s four major species that are related to Fan Lou are all my people. You don’t have to be wary of them. I heard that the poison secreted by the Dark Pufferfish has a huge impact on the mermaid race. You can use this poison to reduce the number of casualties suffered by the Elisa clan!","Lin Yuan’s answer told Qin Yu that he valued Fan Lou very much.","The four major species of the Lonely River were all under Lin Yuan’s command. He had managed to unite them to work alongside Fan Lou.","Given this situation, Qin Yu realized she needed to adjust her approach toward Fan Lou. While she might be stronger than Fan Lou, it seemed that Fan Lou had a stronger connection to Lin Yuan than she did.","[Qin Yu]: Because they’re about to attack the mermaids, the Dark Pufferfish have become the common target of all the major Bloodian clans. It’s great that the Dark Pufferfish are under your command! With the help of their venom, the Elisa clan will definitely be able to capture more mermaids for you!","[Qin Yu]: I will find an opportunity to promote Fan Lou as soon as possible. Then, I will directly transform Fan Lou using a king’s essence blood to help Fan Lou complete the Bloodian transformation as soon as possible. After the transformation, his bloodline will reach a certain level of strength!","Initially, Lin Yuan did not think much of Fan Lou. Back then, he had chosen to let Fan Lou join him because he did not have many choices.","However, Fan Lou had proven his worth to Lin Yuan time and time again with his actions. This made Lin Yuan completely acknowledge Fan Lou and treat him as a subordinate.","Lin Yuan had always felt apologetic toward Fan Lou. Lin Yuan’s previous plan had not only caused Fan Lou a lot of pain, but it had also almost cost him his life.","Therefore, Lin Yuan wanted to find an opportunity to compensate Fan Lou. Otherwise, there was no need for him to let Fan Lou follow Qin Yu.","Since Lin Yuan planned to let Fan Lou follow Qin Yu from now on, Lin Yuan felt that he needed to explain Fan Lou’s situation to Qin Yu.","[Lin Yuan]: Fan Lou isn’t strong, but he’s quite capable. From now on, you can nurture him as you see fit!","Lin Yuan did not say much to Qin Yu. Although the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower could only conduct the most basic information transmission, it was enough for Lin Yuan to maintain contact with his subordinates.","Lin Yuan had given away many Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers in a short period so he felt that he needed to nurture more young Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers for emergencies.","The Thoughts Letter Paper produced by Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper was enough to communicate with the King Blood Jackals in their territory. But deep into the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ territory and in the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ territory, the Thoughts Letter Paper might not be of any use!","Lin Yuan was not blindly optimistic about this situation. It would undoubtedly take a long time for Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper to reach the Holy Spirit level. Before the strength of the Elemental Paper increased, he would have to facilitate communication through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers!","As the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers could only communicate between ramets and ortets while ramets and ramets could not communicate with each other, Lin Yuan couldn’t manage all of Sky City’s affairs.","Wen Yu, the Moon Empress, Liu Jie, Su Yiren, and the other core members of the Astronomical Parliament were the actual decision-makers of Sky City.","Lin Yuan felt that he needed to contact Zhan Lu, the manager of Fortune Treasure Palace.","He would obtain more ortets of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower from","Zhan Lu and strive to ensure that every core member of Sky City had an ortet.","Although this would increase the cultivation pressure and the spatial equipment of the people who went out on tasks would contain many Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ramets that targeted different ortets, it was undeniable that this could completely resolve the communication problem in Sky City.","No matter how big Sky City’s territory expanded, orders could still be transmitted to Sky City immediately.","Lin Yuan took out the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ramet that Zhan Lu had given him and contacted Zhan Lu.","[Lin Yuan]: Zhan Lu, I hope to trade more Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortets from Fortune Treasure Palace. I want to try to nurture them. I’ve already told you that I lack a fey that can communicate from afar.","Fortune Treasure Palace could be said to be the biggest winner in Treasure","City. Zhan Lu and Li Feng had gained two large pieces of land from Lin Yuan.","Just as Zhan Lu was thinking about how to design the two pieces of land, Lin","Yuan sent him a message.."]},{"number":2950,"title":"Chapter 2950: The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen Awakens","paragraphs":["Chapter 2950: The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen Awakens","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Recently, Zhan Lu had been looking for an opportunity to contact Lin Yuan and deepen their relationship.","Before Zhan Lu could take action, Lin Yuan contacted him first. This made","Zhan Lu very happy.","Zhan Lu had not contacted Lin Yuan because he was afraid that he would end up being treated coldly.","If Lin Yuan could not be bothered with him, Zhan Lu would not know what to do in front of Lin Yuan!","Lin Yuan’s experts closed both Class 4 void passageways when they opened. This capability itself was very difficult for Zhan Lu to imagine.","Afterward, Zhan Lu reported the situation to Fortune Treasure Palace. Fortune Treasure Palace valued Lin Yuan’s ability very much.","After learning of Lin Yuan’s abilities, Fortune Treasure Palace placed great importance on him and asked Zhan Lu to deepen his relationship with Lin Yuan. He also treated Lin Yuan as a star among the special honor guests!","Fortune Treasure Palace had a wide range of good partnerships. They paid special attention to these special honor guests so that one day, they could obtain powerful helpers when they needed them. Lin Yuan met Fortune Treasure Palace’s requirements perfectly.","Moreover, when Fortune Treasure Palace was trading with Lin Yuan, Lin Yuan did not take advantage of them like other special honor guests.","On the contrary, Fortune Treasure Palace was the one who took advantage of Lin Yuan. This was because the Creator resources that Lin Yuan used to exchange resources with Fortune Treasure Palace were at least Class 4 Creators.","If there was a chance in the future, Fortune Treasure Palace hoped to trade with Lin Yuan.","Be it helping Fortune Treasure Palace obtain two more pieces of land in Treasure City or helping Lin Yuan become a special honor guest, Zhan Lu’s status in Fortune Treasure Palace had greatly increased.","Zhan Lu was very grateful to Lin Yuan.","However, when he heard that Lin Yuan wanted to trade the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower’s ortet with Fortune Treasure Palace, Zhan Lu was somewhat troubled. Fortune Treasure Palace did not allow the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortet to be traded.","Fortune Treasure Palace invested a large amount of Creator resources to nurture the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers that had the potential to evolve into ortets.","However, since Lin Yuan had asked this of him, he definitely could not reject him.","Lin Yuan had already taken a Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortet from him. Based on what he said, it was likely that he had not succeeded in nurturing this Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortet but had obtained some breakthroughs.","Zhan Lu did not know how many Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortets Lin Yuan wanted to trade but it seemed like Lin Yuan wanted to trade a lot!","Zhan Lu did not reply to Lin Yuan immediately. Instead, he sent a request to Fortune Treasure Palace’s headquarters. Zhan Lu planned to do his best to apply for the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortet for Lin Yuan.","After receiving a response from the headquarters, Zhan Lu felt relieved and replied to Lin Yuan.","[Zhan Lu]: Young Master Lin, we haven’t contacted each other in a long time! The last time you left suddenly and I didn’t even have the chance to thank you properly. If you want the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortet, that’s no problem.","[Zhan Lu]: I’ll personally apply for it from the headquarters! If it was someone else who wanted the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, to be honest, even Mr.","Jin Chen, who is also a special honor guest like you, would not be able to get it. You are now the most respected special honor guest in Fortune Treasure Palace!","Zhan Lu’s words were meant to express goodwill to Lin Yuan, but it was undeniable that Zhan Lu’s words came from the bottom of his heart.","Zhan Lu had already applied for the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortet from the headquarters before communicating with Lin Yuan. The reason why Zhan Lu did not tell Lin Yuan was obvious. It was because he wanted Lin Yuan to owe him a favor.","Lin Yuan did not have a good way to obtain the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. The only way to obtain the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower was to trade with Fortune Treasure Palace.","Lin Yuan was afraid that Fortune Treasure Palace would not be willing to trade the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower with him. If so, Lin Yuan would have to spend a long time searching for the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower.","This would definitely greatly affect the speed at which Lin Yuan developed the territories of the King Blood Jackal and the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","Fortunately, what Lin Yuan was worried about did not happen.","[Lin Yuan]: There’s no need to thank me. Back then, I was also in Treasure City. Saving you was equivalent to saving myself. Moreover, I’m a special honored guest of Treasure City. I also became a sponsor of Treasure City. If you can help me this time, I will repay your kindness! When I get someone to retrieve the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortet, they’ll send my gratitude to you.","Lin Yuan did not dare to say that he was a good judge of character, but he could still see through Zhan Lu. Zhan Lu was a very smart person, but at the same time, he also valued benefits. As long as Lin Yuan could guarantee sufficient benefits that Zhan Lu could not refuse, Zhan Lu would treat Lin Yuan’s words as an imperial edict!","Lin Yuan had the most resources, and he was willing to use them to rope in Zhan Lu.","Even though Zhan Lu was one of the managers of Fortune Treasure Palace, he would sincerely use the resources of Fortune Treasure Palace to work for him.","Lin Yuan had only traded with Zhan Lu once, but this time alone had left a deep impression on Zhan Lu. If Lin Yuan could become more generous in the future, Zhan Lu would take the initiative to side with Lin Yuan without saying anything to him.","The existence of Fortune Treasure Palace was Lin Yuan’s greatest channel to obtain all kinds of resources. Most of the resources he had now were obtained from Fortune Treasure Palace.","After returning to Sky City, Lin Yuan already knew what kind of resources he needed the most.","Lin Yuan planned to use this opportunity to communicate with Zhan Lu and make a large transaction with him.","Due to the previous transaction and Lin Yuan’s strength, Fortune Treasure Palace had begun to value him. Lin Yuan decided to take advantage of this transaction to make the upper echelons of Fortune Treasure Palace pay more attention to him. Perhaps he would have a chance to cooperate deeply with Fortune Treasure Palace in the future!","Zhan Lu beamed with joy when he saw Lin Yuan’s message.","[Zhan Lu]: Young Master Lin, you really don’t have to be so polite! Although we haven’t known each other for long, we’re already old friends here! How many Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone ortets do you need this time?","Zhan Lu and Lin Yuan exchanged pleasantries, but Zhan Lu did not reject the benefits that Lin Yuan wanted to give him.","On the contrary, Zhan Lu was very happy that Lin Yuan could treat him like this. Lin Yuan’s treatment of him was equivalent to telling Zhan Lu that he was useful to Lin Yuan. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would not have thought of preparing a thank-you gift for him!","Lin Yuan was still as generous as ever. He had already prepared a generous reward for him during the last transaction, and he had also prepared another one this time. This meant that Lin Yuan really wanted to befriend him!","Zhan Lu was afraid that Lin Yuan would want more ortets than he could give. If such a situation happened, Zhan Lu was determined to get the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers that Lin Yuan had asked for from the headquarters no matter what. Even if it would cost him some dignity, Zhan Lu would not hesitate!","Lin Yuan never thought of making things difficult for Zhan Lu, but he needed a large number of Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers.","Sky City had more than ten core members, and all of them had to be equipped with an ortet.","Lin Yuan replied to Zhan Lu.","[Lin Yuan]: Zhan Lu, to be honest, I need at least 20 Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone ortets. If you have the ability to obtain more Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers, the more the better! How many Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers you can get will depend on your ability. I hope you won’t disappoint me. If you can help me get more than 30 Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone ortets, I will give you extra rewards!","Lin Yuan always thought far ahead. Apart from equipping Sky City’s core members with ortets, he also wanted to equip the Astronomical Parliament’s members with ortets.","The members of the Astronomical Parliament might have been small fry when they joined the Astronomical Parliament, but as long as they remained a part of the Astronomical Parliament, they would definitely become stronger and stronger.","In the future, he would definitely develop his faction.","However, the members of the Astronomical Parliament were all over the four universes. It was extremely difficult for them to obtain the ortets, which could be used for long-distance communication and facilitated communication between the faction members.","Lin Yuan planned to use the Astronomical Parliament to make Sky City bloom. He had already experimented with this method in the main world and had achieved great success. If not for the Astronomical Parliament, Lin Yuan would not have achieved such great results in the main world so quickly.","If not for Bei Xu and Peace, Lin Yuan would not have known about the Grotto Continent and Broiling Rock Continent. Naturally, he would not have discovered the world on the other side of Barren Sea either.","Since Lin Yuan wanted to make a name for himself through the Astronomical Parliament, he naturally had to provide some support to the members.","Zhan Lu had only applied for ten Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone ortets. The headquarters of Fortune Treasure Palace had very tight control over such communication resources. Ten ortets did not even meet Lin Yuan’s most basic requirements, which put some pressure on Zhan Lu.","Lin Yuan was so generous to him. If he could not even meet the basic requirements of 20 Fantasy Crystal Birthstone Flower ortets, Lin Yuan would definitely feel that he was useless. At that time, Lin Yuan would inevitably choose to trade with others. Lin Yuan had so many resources and powerful strength in his hands. He could have his pick of trading partners.","Zhan Lu gritted his teeth and decided to take out a portion of his resources. No matter what, he had to get the 20 Fantasy Crystal Birthstone Flower ortets for Lin Yuan!","If he had the chance to spend more resources and help Lin Yuan obtain more than 30 Fantasy Crystal Birthstone Flower ortets, he would definitely do it.","This was the best way to prove his worth to Lin Yuan.","Moreover, Lin Yuan had also said that if he could obtain more than 30 Fantasy Crystal Birthstone Flower ortets, he would be greatly rewarded. The reward that Lin Yuan mentioned was definitely not simple!","[Zhan Lu]: Young Master Lin, to be honest, our headquarters has extremely strict control over things like Fantasy Crystal Birthstone Flower ortets. It’s already abnormally difficult to obtain ten of them. I’ll go all out. Even if I have to beg, I’ll get 20 Fantasy Crystal Birthstone Flowers for you! As for the 30 of them, I can’t guarantee it, but I will do my best!","Zhan Lu’s words expressed his feelings for Lin Yuan and also indicated that it would be very difficult for him to help Lin Yuan obtain the Fantasy Crystal Birthstone Flower ortets. Zhan Lu was willing to work for Lin Yuan, but before doing so, he also hoped that Lin Yuan would be able to see his efforts.","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with Zhan Lu’s answer.","Lin Yuan did not mention the Fantasy Crystal Birthstone Flower to Zhan Lu again. Instead, he simply said:","[Lin Yuan]: I’ll get my people to bring a detailed list this time. Try to get all the resources on my list! I will be trading resources of the same standard as the last time. I won’t make things difficult for you.","When Zhan Lu saw Lin Yuan’s message, he was so excited that he could not hide the joy in his eyes.","When Zhan Lu replied to Lin Yuan, Lin Yuan did not reply.","However, Zhan Lu couldn’t care less about this. Lin Yuan had mentioned he had purchased a plethora of resources to establish a faction, indicating he’d be swamped with tasks.","Zhan Lu was ready to assist Lin Yuan immediately in acquiring over 30 Fantasy Crystal Birthstone Flower ortets, deferring any consideration of how to manage the two new pieces of land acquired by Fortune Treasure Palace.","Zhan Lu planned to prioritize securing the Fantasy Crystal Birthstone Flowers for Lin Yuan before addressing the matters concerning Fortune Treasure Palace’s land.","Under normal circumstances, Zhan Lu could not guarantee that he could obtain more than 30 Fantasy Crystal Birthstone Flowers for Lin Yuan.","However, if Lin Yuan used Creator resources to trade for large amounts of resources with Fortune Treasure Palace, even those unreasonable old fellows would definitely agree and facilitate this.","Fortune Treasure Palace indeed had a very tight control on the Fantasy Crystal Birthstone Flowers but in fact, there were some Fantasy Crystal Birthstone Flower ortets stored in Fortune Treasure Palace.","Using existing resources to exchange for Creator resources was very profitable for Fortune Treasure Palace.","This way, Zhan Lu would not even have to put in a lot of effort to help Lin","Yuan.","Zhan Lu was already looking forward to the benefits Lin Yuan would give him after he completed the deal.","Lin Yuan had suddenly ended his communication with Zhan Lu not because he had finished speaking with Zhan Lu.","Lin Yuan was actually prepared to reveal to Zhan Lu what kind of resources he needed on the list. This would make it easier for Zhan Lu to make preparations in advance. The resources that Lin Yuan wanted to trade were relatively rare.","Lin Yuan suddenly ended the discussion with Zhan Lu because he felt a throbbing in his soul. He knew that his sacred source lifeform was about to awaken!","Since the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was about to wake up, Lin Yuan naturally did not have the mood to pay attention to Zhan Lu. In any case, Lin Yuan had already completed the important transaction with Zhan Lu.","Lin Yuan endured the throbbing in his soul and summoned the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.."]},{"number":2951,"title":"Chapter 2951 12 Stars Sacred Sword Wielding Queen!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2951 12 Stars Sacred Sword Wielding Queen!","Lin Yuan and the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had not seen each other for a long time. She had been sleeping in the depths of Lin Yuan’s soul.","After swallowing her parents’ sacred source lifeforms, tens of thousands of ribbons had separated from her skirt. These ribbons were woven into a swaddling cloth for the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen. She slept peacefully in her swaddling clothes.","Even Lin Yuan, her contractor, could not get past the swaddling clothes to find out her actual situation.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s appearance had changed greatly. Although her facial appearance had not changed much, her attire and bearing made her seem like a completely different person.","Previously, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen gave off the feeling of a six or seven-year-old girl who had just bloomed and had yet to wield proper authority. She now held great power. It was like a high and mighty woman who looked down on all living beings and rules!","Upon summoning the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, Lin Yuan witnessed her opening her eyes. Joy and longing emanated from her calm amber gaze as she beheld Lin Yuan.","Observing this expression, Lin Yuan realized the Queen had evolved beyond mere instinctive behavior. Her gaze possessed the power to quell myriad emotions within the world.","The complexity of her reactions toward Lin Yuan stemmed from the fact that, amidst all she could control, Lin Yuan remained beyond her grasp.","“Long time no see, Sacred Sword Wielding Queen. Do you know? You slept for more than 20 years! I can see that you’ve improved a lot in the past 20 years!”","A faint smile appeared on her face.","“This time, after waking up from my sleep, I reached pinnacle 12 Stars as I wished. Previously, both the Sword Skills formed by absorbing the laws and wills and the illusion Immortal body formed by absorbing the Immortal body were at rather low levels. Even if I had kept them, they wouldn’t have been of any use. I sacrificed them all and turned them into a source of nutrients for me while I slept. All of my current power structure needs to be reabsorbed and transformed.”","At this point, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen puffed out her chest.","“The current me is more helpful to you in the world you’re in than in the main world! I didn’t sleep for more than 20 years in vain!”","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen first told Lin Yuan about her results during her slumber.","After that, no matter how graceful and calm the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was, she could not help but move her wide skirt to hug Lin Yuan. This was the manifestation of her abundant emotions.","Before the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen let go of him, Lin Yuan hugged her back. Regardless of whether it was she or Morbius, they were both companions that Lin Yuan had nurtured with all his might.","Up until now, Morbius had been the one who had helped Lin Yuan the most, followed by the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen. If not for her, Lin Yuan would not have been able to allow his experts to increase their strength so quickly before he awakened the Body of All Spirits.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s heart surged as she hugged Lin Yuan. As a 12 Stars sacred source lifeform, her emotions were no different from those of an ordinary human. It was no longer as single-minded and rigid as before.","At that moment, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen heard Lin Yuan ask, “After sleeping for so long, are you really hungry?”","Lin Yuan’s words made her retract her turbulent thoughts. She broke free from Lin Yuan’s embrace and looked up at him without responding.","However, she had forgotten that as Lin Yuan’s contracted sacred source lifeform, Lin Yuan could sense its thoughts.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was thinking, Since you’re so good to me, you won’t let me starve.","Lin Yuan sensed her thoughts and could not help but reveal a brilliant smile. The gluttonous little girl in the past had now become a stubborn little girl!","After chatting with the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, Lin Yuan used True Data to investigate her.","[Sacred Source Name]: Sacred Sword Wielding Queen","[Sacred Source Species]: Source genus/Sacred Source species","[Sacred Source Star Grade]: 12 Stars","[Sacred Source Type]: All (Changes with absorption ability)","Abilities:","[Queen Form]:","1. Queen’s Skirt Hem: Extract the Willpower Runes, Law Runes, spirit fire, and even divine kingdoms from dead creatures. It can also engrave the Willpower Runes, Law Runes, spirit fire, and even divine kingdoms of dead creatures on the skirt. At the same time, regardless of whether it extracts Willpower Runes, Law Runes, spirit fire, or divine kingdoms, it will leave behind the roots that can be used to directly increase the power of its body.","2. Queen’s Treasure Vault: Place the spirit fire or the divine kingdom in the queen’s treasure vault. The treasure vault will split the energy in the energy cores into the illusion spirit fire and divine kingdom land which contains the abilities of the feys when they were alive. The divine kingdom land can be sacrificed to burn the roots of the illusion spirit fire.","3. Queen’s Holy Maid: When a holy spirit is slayed, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen can use its grace to transform the holy spirit into her own holy maid. The holy spirit that transforms into a holy maid has the ability to control and manage divine kingdoms. In battle, the holy maid can influence the divine kingdoms controlled by the enemy. When facing a divine kingdom without a holy spirit, it may directly affect the target’s ability to use the divine kingdom.","4. Queen’s Authority: The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen has the ability to control wills, laws, spirit fire, and divine kingdoms. When extracting these substances, it can increase its speed through the holy maids under its authority.","...","[Sacred Sword Form]:","1. Blade of Sacred Sword: The blade pierces the skirt and consumes the spirit qi in the body to accumulate the wills and laws in the skirt. The spirit fire or divine kingdom will form a Sword Skill to attack.","2. Sacred Sword’s Hilt: The hilt will collide with the crown and consume the spirit qi in the body to choose a Sword Skill. Then, with other Sword Skills, wills, laws spirit fire or divine kingdom will be used as a sacrifice to fuse with the chosen Sword Skill. After the fusion, the Sword Skill and the laws, wills, or the divine kingdom of the spirit fire will be consumed.","3. Sacred Sword’s Tip: The tip of the sword transforms into tough armor and sharp weapons that hang on the holy maid’s body. It fundamentally increases the offensive and defensive power of the holy maid, making it easier for the holy maid to control the divine kingdoms of other living beings and interfere with the holy spirits of other divine kingdoms.","4. Sacred Sword’s Ribbon: When attacked by a specific ability, inject the wills, laws, spirit fire, or divine kingdom controlled by the skirt into the sword’s ribbon. The sword’s ribbon can differentiate and refine this energy through similar wills and laws that it has already mastered. The spirit fire and divine kingdom can offset the power contained in the other party’s ability.","Lin Yuan’s face revealed a look of surprise and understanding.","After looking at the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s data, Lin Yuan knew why she had said those words. Her improvement and growth could indeed help Lin Yuan more than he had expected.","Because the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was a unique product of the fusion of two sacred source lifeforms, the Grace Queen and Sword of Punishment, the original Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had been on par with the Sacred Sword form.","However, because of her bloodline, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had received an opportunity and evolved to pinnacle 12 Stars.","The Sword of Punishment had been blessed by the Grace Queen. As a result, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had been in its Queen form and was supplemented by the Sacred Sword form!","However, after the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen reached 12 Stars, the Queen and Sacred Sword forms had four abilities.","The first ability in the Queen form, Queen’s Skirt Hem, had already expanded from extracting willpowers and laws to the level of spirit fire and divine kingdoms.","In simpler terms, Lin Yuan could utilize the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to draw out the spirit fire and divine kingdom from targets of similar levels. Moreover, aided by Queen’s Treasure Vault, the spirit fire’s energy would morph into illusion spirit fire as well.","The root energy in the divine kingdom would be converted into the divine kingdom land.","The illusion spirit fire and divine kingdom land were connected to Sacred Sword’s Hilt.","It could be transformed into a Sword Skill that Lin Yuan could use.","After the spirit fire extracted from the target’s body was separated from the divine kingdom, the spirit fire crystals and divine kingdom crystals that were formed could increase the strength of Creation Breed and Divine Kingdom lifeforms.","This kind of upgrade did not require the support of the divine kingdom’s power. However, Lin Yuan learned from the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen that having faith power as support would enable him to achieve twice the result with half the effort!","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was a sacred source lifeform that could allow Lin Yuan to maximize his strength so he would not have to rely on his contracted feys.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan would not give up on nurturing his feys as his focus on improving his strength had always been on nurturing feys. Unlike the other species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, humans could not rely on their bloodline to become extremely powerful.","Human spirit qi professionals had a much stronger contractual ability with feys than the other species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds did. This was the humans’ strength and advantage.","Through Lin Yuan’s observation, this strength and advantage allowed humans to participate in the struggle against the other races.","However, compared to other lifeforms, humans had to spend a lot of resources to advance.","Lin Yuan’s Sacred Sword Wielding Queen could not only help him produce resources but it could also strengthen him.","After reaching 12 Stars, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s abilities Queen’s Skirt Hem, Queen’s Treasure Vault, Sacred Sword’s Hilt, and Blade of Sacred Sword, underwent a metamorphosis.","Apart from these four original abilities, both the Queen and Sacred Sword forms had gained two new abilities.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s third ability, Queen’s Holy Maid, actually allowed her to control holy spirits!","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen could form a trump card through her own roots so it was not difficult for her to form a trump card.","However, it would take some time to form a trump card. Moreover, being at 12 Stars meant that it could only have 12 trump cards at most. This was equivalent to one trump card per star.","This meant that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen could only transform 12 holy spirits into holy maids at most.","These holy spirits that were transformed into holy maids could control divine kingdoms. In battle, holy maids could even control divine kingdoms by influencing the enemy’s holy spirits.","When faced with divine kingdoms without holy spirits, it could even directly affect the target’s ability to use their divine kingdoms.","As long as the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had a holy maid, Lin Yuan would be able to gain a huge advantage when fighting Holy Spirit powerhouses.","Compared to Queen’s Holy Maid, the fourth ability was a powerful support ability for the first three abilities.","While the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was extracting the wills, laws, spirit fire, and divine kingdoms of other living beings, she could increase the speed of extraction of the spirit fire and divine kingdoms of other living beings through the sacred maids it controlled.","This could allow the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to maximize the production function and produce supplies as soon as possible.","Sacred Sword Form’s two new abilities supplemented her abilities.","Sacred Sword’s Tip allowed Lin Yuan to use the spirit fire and divine kingdoms to strengthen the holy maids.","They transformed into armor and sharp blades to strengthen the attack and defense of the holy maids. This increased the holy maids’ ability to fight against the holy spirits of the other divine kingdoms.","The holy maids were transformed from holy spirits and possessed the power of divine kingdoms.","When strengthened with a new divine kingdom ability, it would gain added effects.","Sacred Sword’s Ribbon was a defensive ability that could protect Lin Yuan.","When Lin Yuan was attacked by the enemy, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen would inject some kind of spirit fire and divine kingdom into the sword. It could maximize the power of the spirit fire or divine kingdom and neutralize the enemy’s abilities.","As long as Lin Yuan absorbed enough wills, laws, spirit fire, and divine kingdoms, he could weaken one of the enemy’s powerful abilities.","Under the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s continuous absorption of laws, wills, spirit fire, and divine kingdom, all consumption could be replenished.","However, providing food for the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had become a problem for Lin Yuan.","Ordinary wills and laws would be absorbed by the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen. When these ordinary wills and laws were accumulated, they could also be used.","Moreover, these wills and laws would be used as sacrifices when the Astronomical Parliament used Star Spirit Seat.","What the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen really needed to absorb was spirit fire and divine kingdoms. It also needed to kill a Holy Spirit Realm expert to obtain the holy spirit. These were not easy things to do.","Furthermore, as a sacred source lifeform, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen could not leave Lin Yuan’s body like other feys could.","The source of her power was Lin Yuan’s soul.","However, Lin Yuan was only troubled by the method of obtaining spirit fire, divine kingdoms, and sacred maids, not the source.","Lin Yuan had already witnessed how despicable the star pirates in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were. Every star pirate group killed countless species and living beings in a year. Turning these star pirates into nutrients for the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was the best choice!"]},{"number":2952,"title":"Chapter 2952 The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s Substitute Meal!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2952 The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s Substitute Meal!","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, if a person wanted to join a star pirate group, there was a basic requirement for strength.","Those who were too weak were not qualified to join the star pirates.","Even if some star pirates joined other star pirates because they lacked manpower, they would be eliminated as cannon fodder in a short period.","Every time Lin Yuan found a group of star pirates, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen would be provided with the best food.","Just as Lin Yuan was pondering, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen spoke. “Master, I can influence the divine kingdoms of other living beings through the holy maids. Actually, there are two directions for the choice of the holy maids.","“The first direction is for me to try my best to choose holy spirits of the same attribute to transform. This way, when I encounter those divine kingdoms and holy spirits with similar attributes to my holy maids, I can use extreme strength to suppress the enemy.","“The second direction is that my 12 holy maids will all choose different attributes and directions. Although the suppression will be much weaker this way, the range of suppression will undoubtedly become extremely wide.”","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen added, “Although there can only be 12 holy maids, these holy maids’ strength can be increased after absorbing holy spirits with the same attributes as them. If they continue to devour holy spirits, there’s almost no limit to the improvement of these holy maids.”","If the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen did not add anything, Lin Yuan might really think that she was hesitating about choosing the holy maids.","Now, it seemed that this was not the case at all. The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s choice was undoubtedly more inclined towards the latter.","For example, the Jasmine Lily was a wood-type fey. Its spirit fire or divine kingdom were all related to wood-type.","Spirit fire, divine kingdoms, and holy spirits all had attributes. If the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen could absorb holy spirits to evolve, Lin Yuan would definitely make her bloom on multiple fronts.","There were billions of species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Enemies with any attributes could be encountered.","If the holy maids chose a single attribute, no matter how strong the suppression of a certain attribute was, it would probably not be of much use in battle.","This choice would also cause the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to be unable to use holy spirits to upgrade its holy maids even if it could absorb most of the holy spirits that Lin Yuan obtained from killing star pirates.","“If you want me to choose, I will naturally choose the second option. I think you should be more inclined to do this. Is it true that holy maids can only absorbed after the target is killed?”","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen said confidently, “Absorbing the holy maids must be done when the target has just been killed and their divine kingdom has been broken open. This will enable the other party’s holy spirit to be captured. When Holy Spirit expert dies, the holy spirit will be imprisoned in the divine kingdom. It’s just that it has lost the source of faith power.","“A holy spirit with an empty shell is no longer suitable to be transformed into a holy maid. However, if there’s a corpse of a Holy Spirit expert, I can still extract the holy spirit energy inside to strengthen the holy maids!”","Lin Yuan handed two fey storage boxes in the shape of sun crests to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","These two fey storage boxes contained a large number of star pirates’ corpses.","The star pirates that besieged Treasure City had been eliminated, and Lin Yuan had asked Liu Chen and Liu Yao to collect a portion of the corpses.","Lin Yuan had specially asked Li Feng, the City Lord of Treasure City, for a portion of the star pirates’ corpses. At that time, Lin Yuan was already a sponsor of Treasure City, so Li Feng had not rejected him.","Lin Yuan wanted the corpses of these star pirates to prepare for the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s awakening. Now that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had awakened, the corpses that Lin Yuan had specially collected were finally going to be of use.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen took the two fey storage boxes and examined the items inside before saying seriously, “The items in these two fey storage boxes are enough for me to use for some time. I won’t be able to completely absorb the spirit fire, divine kingdom, and holy spirit power in these corpses in a year.”","As soon as it finished speaking, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen inserted her skirt into one of the fey storage boxes.","Lin Yuan had long known that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s skirt could penetrate space.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s expression did not reveal anything, but her gluttony had not changed at all. It had been hard on her to endure for such a long time!","“Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, just stay in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. I’ll arrange for Hu Quan to build a palace for you in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. 20 Deposit Vegetable Pods will be at your disposal. Let them help you classify the corpses of the experts in these two spatial equipment so that you can absorb them later.”","Previously, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen had absorbed the faith power and law power from corpses in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The high concentration of spirit qi could increase the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s absorption speed.","Before the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen fell asleep, it had requested Lin Yuan to find a place for it to stay in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","At that time, the Spirit Lock spatial zone had not been large enough so Lin Yuan could not agree to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s request. Now that the Spirit Lock spatial zone had enough space, Lin Yuan naturally had to fulfill the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s request.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen smiled. She was very happy that Lin Yuan took her words seriously.","“Alright, I’ll enter seclusion in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. After I condense the illusion spirit fire and divine kingdom land, I’ll hand over the remaining products to you so you can experiment with the effects of these spirit fire crystals and divine kingdom crystals!”","After Lin Yuan brought the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to the Spirit Lock spatial zone, she was extremely surprised by the changes in the spatial zone.","The Spirit Lock spatial zone was originally only a few hundred square meters and looked like a room. Now, it had become a rather wide miniature world. Although there were not many people living in the Spirit Lock spatial zone now, it could still be described as extremely prosperous.","Back then, Lin Yuan had planted nearly 10,000 Deposit Vegetable Pods. Without a doubt, these Deposit Vegetable Pods had become servants of the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","When Lin Yuan found Hu Quan, he was unwillingly instructing the Spirit Craftsman to help Keira divide the area.","Hu Quan could not help but complain when he saw Lin Yuan, “Young Master, it’s such a waste to give such a large area to this demon insect! If I plan this space for the demon insects, I think I can build an auspicious garden and raise the auspicious lifeforms that the Hundred Questions Beast army accidentally cultivated there.”","The reason why Hu Quan hated Keira so much was because of the design problem. Previously, he was extremely unhappy with Keira.","Moreover, Keira would produce a large amount of trash during the process of breeding the demon insects. This trash would usually be piled up in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Next to the area that Keira previously occupied was the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake that Hu Quan had painstakingly created. As a Spirit Craftsman with aspirations, Hu Quan definitely did not want the trash produced by Keira to affect the scenery of the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake. Hu Quan was far more concerned about this than Blackie who lived in Submerged Flood Dragon Lake!","There was no doubt that Hu Quan was an extremely capable Spirit Craftsman.","However, Hu Quan was not scheming. Once someone offended Hu Quan, he would hold a grudge. Therefore, Hu Quan had a lot of opinions about Keira staying in the Spirit Lock spatial zone again.","Lin Yuan smiled helplessly and said to Hu Quan, “Uncle Hu, Sky City needs Keira to expand the demon insects to stabilize the situation. Keira has to produce demon insects with Class 1 Genetic Locks in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","“Uncle Hu, to be honest, the Spirit Lock spatial zone will expand again in the future. The area of the Spirit Lock spatial zone is already inexhaustible.","“Uncle Hu, focus your energy on other places first. When the Spirit Lock spatial zone expands, Keira will complete this breeding mission. When the time comes, help Keira choose a place to stay that is far away from you so that it won’t affect your mood.”","Hu Quan did not continue to dwell on this matter. If the Spirit Lock spatial zone was still small, Hu Quan would definitely not want to give this area to Keira.","Now that the Spirit Lock spatial zone was so large, Hu Quan had yet to develop a large portion of it. Since that was the case, he would let Keira use this area for the time being. After all, Lin Yuan had already promised him.","Lin Yuan’s promise was definitely valid.","The entire Spirit Lock spatial zone belonged to Lin Yuan, and he was only a Spirit Craftsman working there. If he continued to fuss over this matter, he would appear insensible.","“Young Master, if you want Keira to stay here, why don’t you send more of the Deposit Vegetable Pods to help Keira clean up? These Deposit Vegetable Pods also have the function of refreshing the air around them.","“It’s rare for you to have the time to enter the Spirit Lock spatial zone. What instructions do you have this time?!”","Lin Yuan said with a smile, “I’m not the one asking for your help this time. My sacred source lifeform wants you to help build a palace in the Spirit Lock spatial zone for her. She can discuss this with you. I don’t know what it thinks or what style she likes.”","Hu Quan waved at the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","“I can complete the things here in a day or two. Why don’t you tell me your thoughts? I’ll draw the design and you can modify it with me. Don’t worry, the design of the palace will definitely be modified until you’re satisfied!”","While the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen negotiated with Hu Quan, Lin Yuan left the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan felt somewhat regretful.","The resources in North of the Lonely River were too scarce, there were almost no star pirates there. Otherwise, Lin Yuan could have organized a group of people to surround these star pirates and stockpile more food for the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","...","After resting for two days, Lin Yuan did not stay idle and went to see the Moon Empress again.","Lin Yuan remembered that when the Moon Empress had spoken to him, she had mentioned that there was a species in the southwest of the King Blood Jackals’ territory that could replace the Bug-Consuming Thearch Emperor Lizards as terrestrial fortresses.","Ordinary individuals of this species could grow to more than 100,000 meters while powerful individuals could grow to more than 400,000 meters.","Any holy spirit of this species was like a majestic mountain, and such a strategically important species was necessary to Lin Yuan.","For this species to be able to survive until now, they definitely had astonishing strength.","Sky City could detect the existence of this species, so the Crimson Heaven Falcons probably knew about this species.","Chi Zhentian had used a few days to reveal all the secrets that he possessed. Lin Yuan wanted to see if there was anything related to this species in the secrets that Chi Zhentian revealed.","When the Moon Empress saw Lin Yuan pondering for a moment, she spoke to him as if she had made an important decision. “Little Yuan, I feel that there’s still a need for us to have question-and-answer sessions in the future. However, this time, it’s my turn to ask while you answer.”","Lin Yuan’s investment in the Moon Empress not only made her more confident, but it also made her curious about the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","The Moon Empress really wanted to understand the Sky Beyond the Clouds from the bottom of her heart, especially now that she was already in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","However, the only way for the Moon Empress to understand the Sky Beyond the Clouds was through Lin Yuan. Unless the Moon Empress went out to travel, it was impossible to understand the actual situation of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Despite being a teacher, she would have to consult her disciple for a long time. This made the Moon Empress mentally prepare herself.","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but scratch the back of his head. He had been feeling a nagging sense of importance upon his return but struggled to recall its specifics.","Having delved into ancient texts and explored numerous locales, Lin Yuan had gained a comprehensive understanding of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Initially, Lin Yuan intended to share this knowledge with Sky City’s core members through Genius, ensuring their clarity about this world.","Upon the Moon Empress’ mention of a question-and-answer session, Lin Yuan’s mind promptly gravitated toward it.","“Of course, it will be great to have question-and-answer sessions with you. Before the question-and-answer sessions, I can synchronize the information I gained previously with you. This will give you a complete understanding of the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds!”","Lin Yuan summoned Genius.","It had been a while since the Moon Empress had seen Genius. When Genius saw her, it raised its hand, jumped into her arms, and meowed softly.","The Moon Empress treated Genius extremely well and had doted on him a lot.","Genius had not seen the Moon Empress for a long time and missed her very much.","Of course, Genius being so close to the Moon Empress had a lot to do with Lin Yuan and the Moon Empress’ relationship. If Lin Yuan’s relationship with the Moon Empress was not good, then no matter how good the Moon Empress was to Genius, the latter would never show any close feelings toward her.","The Moon Empress shook Genius and said, “It seems that Genius’ food has been pretty good recently. You’re actually much heavier than before!”","Genius shook the long tails on its back and pouted at the Moon Empress as it said, “I evolved, not gained weight!”","Genius turned around and jumped into Lin Yuan’s arms from the Moon Empress’ arms.","Lin Yuan could not help but smile.","A few of the star pirates who had surrendered to Lin Yuan were very good at cooking, especially cooking meat. After Genius discovered this, it often asked these star pirates to cook delicious food for it. Under such circumstances, it would be strange if Genius was not fat!","Lin Yuan was certain that Genius hadn’t gained any weight since its evolution."]},{"number":2953,"title":"Chapter 2953 Lin Yuan’s Reflection!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2953 Lin Yuan’s Reflection!","....","“Genius, use Connected Tails to transfer all the knowledge about the Sky Beyond the Clouds that I asked you to organize to Master! Genius, you’ve indeed gained a little weight. In the future, if you want to eat braised pork like before, remember to exercise too!”","Genius lowered its tail when it heard that, and its eyes filled with grievance.","Ever since Genius started managing the Hundred Questions Beast army, it had basically stopped moving around. Genius spent half of its time concocting potions every day.","Concocting potions was something that Genius had to do daily because only by concocting more potions could Genius become more proficient. Genius was actually walking the path of an ordinary Creation Master. Genius’s hard work was inseparable from its rapid improvement in Creation Master abilities.","Genius couldn’t eat less braised pork. Genius made up its mind to exercise daily in the future. In short, the next time he was carried by the Moon Empress, Genius did not want to hear her say that it had gained weight again!","When Genius used Connected Tails, its body lit up with a magnificent light. A long tail, like a phantom light, extended toward the Moon Empress, connecting her and Genius tightly.","Lin Yuan had set the highest level for the Moon Empress. The knowledge that Genius transmitted to her was the same as the knowledge that Lin Yuan possessed.","The Moon Empress could feel a large amount of knowledge being transmitted into her mind through Genius’s tail. The massive amount of knowledge made the Moon Empress’s head swell.","The Moon Empress realized that this knowledge was not fragmented, and she did not need to sort it out herself. This knowledge was extremely organized and had already been meticulously arranged. When this knowledge appeared in her mind, it was as if it were engraved there.","This was the first time Lin Yuan had displayed Genius’s ability in front of the Moon Empress.","The Moon Empress was both shocked and surprised by Genius’s ability.","As the Moon Empress gained a clearer understanding of the situation in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, a thought appeared in her mind.","During the Radiance Federation’s Creation Master exam, they could bring Hundred Questions Beasts to provide support.","Lin Yuan had passed the Class 2 Creation Master exam at a young age and had to go through a practical test of spirit fluid concoction.","However, Lin Yuan had scored full marks in the exams for Scholar, Fey Observer, and Spiritual Ingredient Analyst.","Even the Moon Empress could not guarantee that she could have done this!","There was no threshold for the basic spirit qi professional examination in Soaring Dragon Federation. Everyone could participate.","About 20% of the exam questions tested the contents from the books. The contents of these books had to be memorized.","The Moon Empress had been a Class 5 Creation Master at that time, but it had been impossible for her to memorize so many books word for word.","Now, the Moon Empress knew that Lin Yuan had most likely obtained 100 points with the help of the Hundred Questions Beast.","It turned out that the Hundred Questions Beast gained such an ability at a young age!","Now that the Moon Empress had grasped the situation in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, she no longer needed to ask Lin Yuan for a lot of knowledge.","However, the Moon Empress still felt the need to have question-and-answer sessions with Lin Yuan. When she had the same level of knowledge as Lin Yuan, her questions could help him improve. Lin Yuan had more opportunities to understand this world than she did.","Many of her questions would most likely be answered by Lin Yuan in the future.","“In the future, Master’s question-and-answer sessions will still be held once a week. Let’s set it at five o’clock every Friday! Even if I’m not in Sky City, our question-and-answer sessions can be conducted through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. I should be able to trade for many Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortets.","“When the time comes, I will hand over the ortet to you. This way, not only can you contact me through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, but you can also contact the other members of Sky City.","“I came to you this time to tell you that I’m preparing to leave Sky City in the next two days to take a look at the species that can be used as a war fortress.”","The Moon Empress had been both reluctant and worried because she thought that she would have to go somewhere far away so soon after returning. When she heard that Lin Yuan was only going to take a look at the war fortress, the Moon Empress was relieved.","The Moon Empress had already sent people to investigate this species. Firstly, this species was not very aggressive. Even if other creatures invaded its territory, as long as they did not disturb its normal life, they would not be attacked.","Secondly, no matter how strong this species was, they were most likely comparable to or inferior to the Crimson Heaven Falcon in overall strength.","Lin Yuan would definitely bring Spring, Summer, Autumn, or Winter. Regardless of who it was, they could guarantee his safety. The Moon Empress had heard that Autumn had single-handedly defeated a portion of the Spinning Wings White Falcons and Crimson Heaven Falcons’ elites!","Among these elites was the Second Elder of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, whose strength had surpassed the Holy Spirit level.","“Little Yuan, you have to be careful when you go out this time. You’ve only been back for a few days. You don’t have to tire yourself out. Everyone has arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds, and the core members of Sky City have contracted the Lifespan Mouse.","“It’s good for Sky City to develop rapidly, but it’s also beneficial to develop slowly. Actually, I don’t recommend that the faith country be expanded so quickly. Everyone in Sky City has their own duties. If we want to maintain the normal circulation of Sky City, everyone needs to play their part.","“Luo Lan and Su Yiren are the two who have the heaviest missions. It has already taken them a lot of effort to manage the faith country. Once the faith country expands, it’ll probably be very difficult for both Luo Lan and Su Yiren to persist!","“No matter how quickly the faith country expands, the trade network connecting the entire faith country is being built by Listen, Endless Summer, and Gu Lang. It’s not necessarily a good thing for you to take too big a step.”","The Moon Empress was extremely serious when she said this. However, she only wanted to give Lin Yuan suggestions and did not have any intention of guiding him.","The Moon Empress did not know how capable Lin Yuan was.","The Moon Empress had only shared with Lin Yuan the knowledge and lessons she had learned. These experiences and lessons were exceedingly valuable to her. The Moon Empress had been greatly affected by this.","The Moon Empress did not wish for Lin Yuan to suffer the same fate as her. As his Master, the Moon Empress had to impart what she deemed necessary to her disciple.","Lin Yuan was never one to act without considering the consequences. After hearing this, he would undoubtedly take it into serious consideration.","Lin Yuan had been away from Sky City for a considerable time, so his knowledge of it was limited. He had not been involved in the specific processes.","Indeed, expanding the faith country now would exert significant pressure on Su Yiren and Luo Lan. It remained unknown whether they could withstand such pressure.","Furthermore, as the Moon Empress had noted, the larger the establishment, the more challenging it would be to establish trade channels. Due to the expansion of the faith country, Listen’s progress was constantly slowing down.","The Moon Empress’s words prompted Lin Yuan to consider whether he should slow down the expansion of his faith country.","It was not easy to recruit core members with management abilities for Sky City.","For instance, Liu Chen, Liu Yao, and Jin Chen were skilled in carrying out missions, but they lacked proficiency in managing forces.","Lin Yuan’s subordinates Qin Yu and Fan Lou were much better at management than Liu Chen, Liu Yao, and Jin Chen. However, Qin Yu had the Elisa clan to oversee, and Lin Yuan had assigned Fan Lou to the Scarlet Territory. He was poised to become a member of the Honor Absent Parliament.","Sky City’s operations relied on the talents Lin Yuan had brought from the main world. Lin Yuan was grateful to have encountered these individuals to assist him.","Time passed nearly ten times slower in the Sky Beyond the Clouds than in the main world.","Lin Yuan had been in the Sky Beyond the Clouds for such an extended period that the main world had likely undergone changes. In the future, if Lin Yuan were to nurture a powerful Abyssal Beast, he could seize an opportunity to return to the main world and assess the situation.","However, such actions would likely draw the attention of the Honor Absent Palace, once again making the main world a target!","It appeared that finding high-end talents for Sky City was more crucial than enhancing the strength of its members.","“Master, your words have greatly benefited me. I realize now that I lacked thorough consideration previously! Before formulating a new plan, I will seek the opinions of Su Yiren, Luo Lan, Listen, and the others.","“But regardless, even if we refrain from expanding the faith country, we must still gather resources within the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons! Currently, resources for constructing the faith country are nearly depleted.”","Upon seeing that Lin Yuan had taken her advice to heart, the Moon Empress was delighted.","“Go. If you indeed decide to expand your faith country, Mystic Moon, Cold Moon, and I can assist you. Managing such a large faith country should not be an issue for the three of us!”","Lin Yuan felt reassured. Regardless of the challenges, the Moon Empress stood as his strongest supporter.","Regardless of whether it was the Moon Empress, Cold Moon, or Mystic Moon, they were all preoccupied. Lin Yuan would not allow the three of them to undertake such a responsibility.","“Master, along with Uncle Mystic and Aunt Cang, please oversee the overall situation for me! I intend to dedicate time and effort to scouting for managers for Sky City. Now that the Astronomical Parliament’s meeting can be reconvened, we should be able to identify many suitable candidates. It will simply require some time.","“I will endeavor to slow down Sky City’s pace while strengthening it. The same applies to the faith country, which is an extension of Sky City!”","After conversing with the Moon Empress for a while, Lin Yuan sought out Wen Yu and shared his thoughts with her.","Wen Yu understood that Lin Yuan was not seeking her input but rather making a decision.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Wen Yu recognized a flaw in her approach. She had failed to consider the consequences of moving too swiftly.","Wen Yu had never doubted her abilities. As she continued to grow, she became increasingly aware of her strengths. Wen Yu knew her worth well and no longer underestimated herself as she had before. She was brimming with confidence.","However, following Lin Yuan had always been smooth sailing, making it challenging for her to navigate setbacks.","Recognizing her oversight, Wen Yu resolved to make timely adjustments.","Lin Yuan’s words served as a wake-up call for Wen Yu.","“Young Master, we were indeed overly eager in developing the faith country. The current pace of development will inevitably lead to future problems. Slowing down now can prevent Sky City and the faith country from incurring losses.","“Su Yiren, Luo Lan, Listen, Endless Summer, and Gu Lang have been working tirelessly. They cannot sustain this pace for much longer without adequate food supplies. If this continues, they will undoubtedly suffer!","“This situation is detrimental to their progress. Slowing down now will allow them time to recuperate! However, the final decision rests with you!”","Lin Yuan decisively stated, “Let’s temporarily slow down development. During Sky City’s competition, we can afford to let everyone take a breather. The main pressure on Luo Lan and Su Yiren stems from food shortages, hindering their ability to meet the faith country’s demands. Fortunately, the food shortage will soon be resolved.","“Wen Yu, I will investigate species suitable for use as war fortresses. Upon my return, I will personally assist you in enhancing the strength of the Wind Crystal Precious Bottle and the Hundred Questions Beast to reach the Holy Spirit level as soon as possible!","“Utilizing the Astronomical Parliament to select talent is an excellent strategy. Additionally, I will consult with Big Brother Liu and Zhou Luo to identify any management-savvy individuals among Sky City’s white-clothed followers in the combat and reserve sequences. If Sky City possesses such promising individuals, we should provide them with opportunities. Let’s see if any can rise to the occasion!”","Wen Yu committed Lin Yuan’s instructions to memory, prepared to execute them upon his return from investigating war fortresses.","Chi Zhentian had previously mentioned this species when briefing Wen Yu on the situation. She had gathered valuable information about it from him, much of which proved invaluable."]},{"number":2954,"title":"Chapter 2954 Titan Rhinoceros Elephant!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2954 Titan Rhinoceros Elephant!","....","Wen Yu reported the news to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, if you’re prepared to investigate this species, the information I obtained from the Second Elder of the Crimson Heaven Falcons should be very useful to you.”","Wen Yu handed Lin Yuan the collated information from Chi Zhentian.","While Lin Yuan used Genius’ exclusive skill, Connected Tails, to examine it, Wen Yu explained briefly, “Young Master, Chi Zhentian said that this species is called the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant.","“The bloodline legacy of this species is similar to the history of the Crimson Heaven Falcons. In the early days, the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants could not compare to the Crimson Heaven Falcons. But after generations passed, the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant’s body became larger and larger, developing to this extent.","“The Crimson Heaven Falcons have been in North of the Lonely River for a few epochs. Chi Zhentian expressed that he doesn’t know the exact situation of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants who are out of the area.","“However, the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants in North of the Lonely River have at least doubled in size in the past few epochs! Chi Zhentian suspects that the area where these Titan Rhinoceros Elephants live has a secret that can enlarge their bodies.”","12:19","After reading Chi Zhentian’s report, Lin Yuan had a certain understanding of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants and knew a lot about the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ internal affairs.","The overall strength of the Crimson Heaven Falcons was slightly weaker than Lin Yuan had imagined.","The Crimson Heaven Falcons had been guarding this area to wait for a natural treasure called the Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom to mature. This Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom was extremely beneficial to the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ fire elements.","In addition, this Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom grew inside the skull of a huge bird skeleton, sucking the essence of this huge avian-type fey’s skeleton dry.","The Crimson Heaven Falcons’ leader ate the Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom.","With the nourishment of the Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom and the pure and surging avian-type fey bloodline power in the Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom, there was a high chance that the leader’s strength would improve further.","Spending a few epochs to allow the Crimson Heaven Falcon to gain an expert who could change the structure of the Crimson Heaven Falcons would be very beneficial.","Wen Yu had noted that Chi Zhentian had wanted to find out more about the Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom. It was obvious that he did not want Sky City to take the Crimson Blood Mushroom away when they took in the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","With the Crimson Blood Mushroom, the Crimson Heaven Falcons had the possibility of breaking through their current situation.","The more powerful the Crimson Heaven Falcons were, the more authority they would have with Lin Yuan.","Wen Yu did not respond to Chi Zhentian’s probing. She did not know what Lin Yuan was going to do.","In Wen Yu’s eyes, all the Crimson Heaven Falcons were Sky City’s prisoners. No matter what decision Lin Yuan made, the Crimson Heaven Falcons could only accept it unconditionally. He had no right to bargain at all.","Lin Yuan was not interested in this Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom but he was interested in another item in the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ territory.","It was the Nirvana Feather Flower Spring that was used to nourish the Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom! To Lin Yuan, this treasure was not inferior to the Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom at all. In fact, it was far more precious than the Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom!","The Nirvana Feather Flower Spring was effective on any avian-type fey.","A Nirvana Feather Flower would grow in the Nirvana Feather Flower Spring. The Nirvana Feather Flower was like a derivative lifeform of the Nirvana Feather Flower Spring.","The Nirvana Feather Flower could not be eaten by avian-type feys directly. Its sap was extremely toxic.","However, the fragrance emitted by the Nirvana Feather Flower could help avian-type feys nourish their body and increase the possibility of bloodline transformation.","From Chi Zhentian’s message, Lin Yuan could sense that Chi Zhentian was actually dissatisfied with the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ arrangements.","Since the Nirvana Feather Flower Spring had been used to nourish the Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom, Chi Zhentian had not had a share at all. Not only that, even the fragrance emitted by the Nirvana Feather Flower could only be absorbed by the leader of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, Chi Mingyan.","Indeed, Chi Mingyan was stronger than Chi Zhentian. Chi Zhentian admitted this. But compared to Chi Mingyue, he, the Second Elder of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, was just a decoration.","All these years, he had only been helping Chi Mingyan manage the Crimson Heaven Falcons. He had done all the dirty and tiring work, but he did not get a share of the benefits.","Even though he knew that this was to protect the interests of the Crimson Heaven Falcons to the greatest extent, the dissatisfaction in Chi Zhentian’s heart accumulated.","Lin Yuan ignored Chi Zhentian’s dissatisfaction. Chi Zhentian’s dissatisfaction with the Crimson Heaven Falcons was meaningless to Lin Yuan. Lin Yuan couldn’t help Chi Zhentian adjust his dissatisfaction.","As the leader of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, Chi Mingyan was definitely stronger than Chi Zhentian in terms of ability and strength. Otherwise, how could Chi Mingyue suppress Chi Zhentian? Even if Chi Zhentian had some complaints, he still had to do these things.","Lin Yuan was prepared to leave the Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom to Chi Mingyan so he could digest and absorb it.","Chi Mingyan might not be able to steadily advance to the next grade with the Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom alone. However, if Lin Yuan was willing to help, everything would be different.","Lin Yuan would rely on his body composition to help Chi Mingyan. The increase in his grade and quality was basically a sure bet.","Lin Yuan would take the Nirvana Feather Flower Spring if he left the Crimson Flame Blood Mushroom with Chi Mingyan.","The Nirvana Feather Flower Spring was too suitable for Chimey! With the help of the Nirvana Feather Flower Spring, Chimey could quickly raise its grade and quality in an extremely short period. It was not impossible for Chimey to not prevail despite being a late bloomer.","Lin Yuan had fulfilled the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ expectations. Since Lin Yuan wanted the Nirvana Feather Flower Spring from the Crimson Heaven Falcons, the Crimson Heaven Falcons would not be dissatisfied.","“Wen Yu, I’ll learn about the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants after I take a look at them. I hope the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants can surprise me! If we’re sure that they can really be used, we can immediately build the war fortress!","“Since we’ve already decided to stabilize our footing and develop Sky City slowly, we might as well spend some effort to make Sky City and the faith country into an indestructible iron bucket. As long as there are no internal problems, this iron bucket will definitely not be destroyed!”","Wen Yu said seriously, “Young Master, there will definitely be no problems within Sky City. I’ve always believed that! While you are exploring the territory of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, I will take good care of Sky City.","“If there are any problems, I will communicate with the Moon Empress. Alternatively, I’ll contact you through Thoughts Letter Paper or the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower.”","Sky City held a profoundly warm place in Wen Yu’s heart; it was akin to her home. Regardless of circumstance, she harbored a fervent desire to safeguard it.","Comprising just over twenty core members, Sky City fostered a tight-knit camaraderie among its inhabitants. Even in the face of conflict, the city’s overall stability remained unshaken, with resolutions swiftly forthcoming.","Wen Yu pledged to risk her life to uphold Sky City’s equilibrium. If she discovered anyone attempting to disrupt its stability, she would show no mercy.","Lin Yuan ventured out with a profound sense of reassurance. He knew that even if he were absent for decades, as long as Spring, Summer, Autumn, or Winter safeguarded Sky City’s safety, it would continue to thrive and develop at a rapid pace.","“Wen Yu, don’t worry about the Crimson Heaven Falcons,” Lin Yuan reassured her. “Sky City won’t be able to take over the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ territory for a long time to come. When they launched a surprise attack on the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, Spring and Autumn opened their barriers.","“The news of this conflict should not have reached the ears of the Crimson Heaven Falcons yet. Chi Zhentian and the others’ faith has been taken by the Faith Tree. They probably won’t tell the other Crimson Heaven Falcons.","“Apart from how to develop the faith country, the focus now is on the development of the resources of the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ territory. We have too few resources now. Such limited resources can’t support the consumption at all. Most of the things I trade are rare resources, not basic resources for development.","“This time, with the development of the King Blood Jackals’ territory, the basic resources will be stored in large quantities. I think these basic resources should be enough for a long time!”","Wen Yu hurriedly said, “Young Master, the Moon Empress has just reminded me of this matter. I have specially selected some people from Sky City’s reserve team. These people are the weakest in the reserve forces. Even if they participate in the competition, they won’t be able to achieve anything.","“I’ll choose 500 members from among them and place them among the Spinning Wings White Falcons. These people will review every resource developed and used in the territory of the Spinning Wings White Falcons. This will ensure that there will be no problems with resources.","“Bai Yunzong is a very smart guy. He knows the current situation of the Spinning Wings White Falcons very well. He himself will most likely restrict the internal affairs of the Spinning Wings White Falcons!”","Lin Yuan was reminding Wen Yu before he left.","Since Wen Yu knew about this, there was no need for her to continue talking about this matter.","Lin Yuan brought Winter directly to the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ territory. Winter’s movement speed and traveling ability were the strongest among the four followers. It was most convenient for Lin Yuan to bring Winter out.","Although Winter did not show it on the surface, he was still happy that Lin Yuan had chosen him.","Previously, when Lin Yuan had arranged the operation, he had not chosen Winter. Winter would not show his emotions like Autumn did. However, Winter would still make comparisons in his heart.","If Autumn continued to be so sensitive to such matters, Lin Yuan would choose to use Autumn more often when he needed people. Then Winter would have to find an opportunity to have a good chat with Autumn.","Spring and Summer were both people who did not fight over anything. However, if Autumn always acted like this, it was inevitable that Spring and Summer would be dissatisfied one day.","If the four of them had an internal strife, how could they live up to Lin Yuan’s nurturing of them in his previous life?","At that moment, Lin Yuan had been thinking about how the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants had grown bigger in such a short period of time and eventually grown into such a huge body.","It would have been fine if the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants had been that big from the start. However, it was obvious that the transformation of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants over the past few epochs was the key to the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ huge size!","Lin Yuan asked Winter, “Winter, have you heard of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants before?”","Winter fell into deep thought.","Winter had existed for countless epochs and had seen too many species. However, as long as it was a species that Don had seen before, he would have an impression of them.","Winter thought for a moment and said, “Young Master, I should have heard of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. Apart from having two mountain-like Rhinoceros horns on their heads, the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants have four extremely exaggerated tusks. Both their horns or tusks are weapons that can be used in battle.","“Young Master, do you think that the species that can be called a war fortress refers to the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants? In my impression, the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants are indeed huge, but it shouldn’t be possible for them to become that large. This is unless the bloodline of the entire Titan Rhinoceros Elephants has mutated because of something. I have seen many species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","“When I heard that this species that could be used as a war fortress was so huge that it could reach 400,000 meters, I was rather surprised. As far as I know, there are only a few experts who live in the sea. Only when their strength reaches a certain level can they grow to such a huge extent. But the members of this species can reach a hundred thousand meters in size. It’s really against common sense.","“However, there are all kinds of strange things in the world. Life has infinite possibilities. There are indeed some special spiritual ingredients that can make lifeforms larger. When we see this species later, I’ll most likely be able to see what’s going on with them.”","Winter paused before continuing. “Young Master, if this species is too unruly, I don’t recommend spending too many resources on them because the war fortress is not for the elite members of Sky City but for the warriors selected by the faith country.","“This species might restrain themselves under the control of experts, but under the control of those ordinary warriors, if this war fortress loses control, it will definitely cause a huge impact.”","Lin Yuan came to see this species with the intention of learning about them. If this species had flaws and was inconvenient to control, Lin Yuan would not force them to become Sky City’s war fortress.","Winter was unaware of the information provided by Chi Zhentian. According to his information, this species was indeed relatively docile."]},{"number":2955,"title":"Chapter 2955 Legendary Breath Soil!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2955 Legendary Breath Soil!","....","If Lin Yuan had not known about the docility of this species in advance, he would not be so enthusiastic about building a war fortress.","With Winter’s help, Lin Yuan would only need about a day to reach the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ territory.","Lin Yuan did not give too much information to Winter. Instead of saying too much information to disturb Winter’s judgment, it was better to let him judge the functionality of this species from a subjective perspective.","If the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants had the possibility of becoming a war fortress, Lin Yuan would spend a lot of effort to control this species.","If Winter and Lin Yuan determined that the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants did not have the possibility of building a war fortress, they would give up on it due to the low safety factor.","Lin Yuan would not touch the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants for a long time. The area where the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants were located was too far away from where Lin Yuan was developing. Even if Lin Yuan controlled them now, it would be very difficult for him to have the energy to develop the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ territory.","While Lin Yuan was out, all the white-clothed followers’ combat and reserve sequence members in Sky City seemed to be running on steroids. This especially applied to the reserve sequence members.","These reserve sequence members had never been used after joining Sky City. These people came from poor backgrounds. When they first entered Sky City, the reserve sequence members were shocked and terrified by the large amount of resources Sky City poured into them.","However, these reserve sequence members were no longer new to Sky City. They had been in Sky City for more than 20 years when they were in the main world.","These reserve sequence members could obtain a large amount of resources every day, but they did not see any chance of improvement.","Official white-clothed followers and combat sequence members received more resources than reserve sequence members.","The strength of these white-clothed followers had already been raised to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, but they could be considered absolute experts to the reserve sequence members who were spirit fire experts!","This competition could be said to be the best news for the reserve members. This allowed these reserve Sequence members to see the possibility of advancing to the combat sequence or even the white-clothed followers.","Having been a reserve sequence member for a long time, it was inevitable that the lack of opportunities would cause them to feel like they were floating aimlessly.","These people felt extremely regretful and had the intention to work hard.","As for those who did not show any enthusiasm after the news of the competition spread, it would not take long for them to be eliminated from the reserve sequence.","Sky City was a huge faction. Apart from a dozen core members, there were only a few thousand basic members. Such a force only nurtured elites and not idlers.","Liu Jie and Zhou Luo, the two managers of the white-clothed followers’ combat sequence and reserve sequence, had such thoughts.","Previously, when managing the white-clothed followers’ combat and reserve sequences, it was usually Zhou Luo who put in more effort because Liu Jie was busy improving his individual power.","Currently, Liu Jie could be said to have the most feys in Sky City. Even Lin Yuan could not compare to him.","Liu Jie had to spend more effort on his insect-species carcinoma feys.","Elegance had always treated these insect-species carcinoma feys that transformed into fairies badly. This meant that Liu Jie had to enter seclusion every once in a while.","Apart from Lin Yuan, none of Sky City’s peers were a match for Liu Jie. If Lin Yuan did not use his trump cards, he could not guarantee that he could defeat Liu Jie in a battle in the wild.","Now, Lin Yuan was preparing to hold a competition in Sky City. Once the news spread, Liu Jie would start managing Sky City.","Apart from Lin Yuan and Wen Yu, Zhou Luo was the first person in Sky City to be recognized by Lin Yuan.","Liu Jie’s acknowledgment of Zhou Luo stemmed from that life-and-death battle they experienced together. Liu Jie and Zhou Luo were old buddies and their relationship could be described as close.","When Zhou Luo saw Liu Jie, he smiled and said, “Does the leader of the white-clothed followers have the time to pay attention to us now that you’re done with the fairies? I got a few jars of good wine from Lord Lin Yuan. Let’s have a few drinks! When Sky City’s competition starts in a few days, the two of us will really be busy!”","Liu Jie said helplessly, “Old Zhou, don’t tease me if you have nothing to do. What do you mean by done with the fairies? You make it sound like I’m not a serious person!”","Zhou Luo laughed when he heard that.","“To be honest, Old Liu, if anyone dares to say that you’re not serious, I’ll be angry with him! Besides you, who else doesn’t have a girlfriend at such an old age? There are so many beauties in Sky City but none of them caught your eye.","“If you really like anyone, listen to my advice. If you really chase after her, she will be yours! As the saying goes, a good woman is afraid of being pestered by a man. Don’t you know how my wife found me? I stuck around until she became mine!”","Zhou Luo only got married a few years before he came to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. His marriage partner was a combat sequence member. She was extremely talented and was affiliated with all support-type feys. Her affinity could be said to be similar to Chu Ci’s back then.","At that time, Sky City was in need of manpower and the members of the white-clothed followers had yet to settle down.","This woman did not disappoint Lin Yuan’s nurturing and completely relied on her own ability to become an official member of the white-clothed followers.","The female white-clothed follower was indeed not interested in Zhou Luo at first. But under Zhou Luo’s relentless pursuit, she eventually became his wife. Judging from Zhou Luo’s experience, it was indeed right to say that a good girl was afraid of being pestered by a man.","However, Liu Jie’s mind had never been on this.","If Liu Jie had been chasing after a target all these years, it would definitely be Lin Yuan.","However, Liu Jie’s pursuit of Lin Yuan had started with Lin Yuan’s salvation and the retainer knight’s oath. It was Lin Yuan who had given him hope to survive.","Even now, his heart had not changed. But he did have more thoughts. Apart from wanting to protect Lin Yuan as a retainer knight, Liu Jie also wanted to manage Sky City with Lin Yuan and realize their dreams together.","This was the motivation for Liu Jie to work so hard to increase his strength.","Liu Jie had spent the past few decades on such matters and was not in the mood to consider anything else.","Liu Jie smiled and said to Zhou Luo, “Everyone has different aspirations and thoughts. You, on the other hand, have nothing to do but enjoy your life with your wife and child. But you have to remember not to allow your power to lag! I don’t want to hear that anyone in Sky City has surpassed you!”","Zhou Luo said solemnly, “Don’t worry about this. Lord Lin Yuan promoted me to this position. I definitely won’t allow my strength to embarrass Lord Lin Yuan! It’s just that faith power is really too difficult to obtain. Otherwise, my strength would most likely be able to increase again!”","Liu Jie was not as optimistic as Zhou Luo; he knew how difficult it was to increase one’s strength. It was all thanks to Lin Yuan’s help that they could improve their strength so easily.","Liu Jie remembered that Lin Yuan had said that the main purpose of the faith country’s existence was to collect faith power for Sky City. Judging from this situation, once the faith country could collect a large amount of faith power for Sky City and Lin Yuan distributed the faith power, the strength of Sky City’s core members would increase again.","In the past, Liu Jie would have definitely split hairs over this and thought that all of this was a gift from Lin Yuan. However, Liu Jie no longer thought that way.","Sky City had only developed to this day because of the joint efforts of all its members. Su Yiren and Luo Lan had both contributed greatly to the prosperity of Sky City.","As the leader of the white-clothed followers chosen by Lin Yuan, he only needed to do his job well.","“Old Zhou, the competition is imminent. Have you observed the situation of the members of Sky City?”","Zhou Luo shrugged and said, “Most of the reserve sequence members are very excited. To them, this competition is equivalent to discovering a way to rise. However, there are still some among these 5,000 people who don’t have much fighting spirit. They always feel that there’s a huge gap between the reserve sequence and the combat sequence, much less the white-clothed followers.","“I originally planned to tell you about this so you can decide if there’s a need to tell Lord Lin Yuan about this. These people were nurtured using Sky City’s resources. But now, they’re all acting as though they’ve forgotten about this. I think it’s necessary to find an opportunity to send all these reserve sequence members to train in the future. They’ll really lack courage if they don’t experience bloodshed!”","Liu Jie did not say anything else. He knew Lin Yuan very well.","Since Lin Yuan had placed his focus on managing the white-clothed followers’ combat and reserve sequences, he would definitely place more focus on this in the future.","Those hooligans would eventually be educated or expelled by Lin Yuan.","“Old Zhou, I think we need to mobilize these people’s fighting spirits.”","Zhou Luo nodded in agreement.","“The fighting spirits of the reserve sequence members do need to be mobilized, but that will be enough. The fighting spirits of the combat sequence members is already abnormally high. For members of the combat sequence, it’s not only an opportunity but also a risk.","“The members of the combat sequence all want to become white-clothed followers but they’re afraid that the members of the reserve sequence will suddenly rise and replace them. If we light a fire among the combat sequence members, the combat sequence will probably be completely ignited!","“The fighting spirit of the white-clothed followers is also high. They know very well how many benefits they get as white-clothed followers. Who would want to be demoted when benefits are at stake?","“Once they’re downgraded, they’ll be laughed at by their colleagues. Furthermore, Lord Lin Yuan has already said that there will be generous rewards before the competition. Even I am envious of the rewards personally given by Lord Lin Yuan, let alone them!”","Although Zhou Luo looked carefree most of the time, he was actually a very meticulous person.","During his time working with Liu Jie, Zhou Luo had spent far more time managing than Liu Jie did. Zhou Luo did not have any achievements in management, but at least he did not make any mistakes.","Zhou Luo’s perception of emotions was extremely strong. He had once used his perception to cleverly resolve the internal conflicts among the combat sequence.","“Let’s go, Old Zhou. Save the wine for later. Let’s first take a look at the reserve sequence. Let’s understand who among the reserve sequence has the potential to advance further into the combat sequence! During this period, pay more attention to the reserve sequence.","“If anyone really starts to mess up, compile a name list. There’s a mission coming up that requires manpower. Let’s keep these trashed people for the mission! The number of reserve sequence members applying for missions is far from enough.”","Liu Jie admired those who knew that they were not strong enough and took the initiative to apply for missions.","At the very least, these people were still working hard and had not given up. If he encountered any opportunities in the future, they might be able to break through to the combat sequence!","They would give up on the competition this time and take the initiative to participate in the mission because they were preparing for the next competition.","However, those who did not choose to participate in the mission but continued to sit around doing nothing were the vermin of Sky City. It was a huge waste of Sky City’s resources to spend a large amount of resources on these vermin!","...","Lin Yuan had already arrived at the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ territory. As soon as he entered, he acutely noticed something amiss.","The vegetation in the territory of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants was too lush. It was completely different from the vegetation outside the territory. It was as if there was an obvious dividing line.","After searching for a long time, Lin Yuan did not find any traces of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.","Winter pondered and said, “Young Master, if I’m not wrong, there should be some kind of Breath Soil in this area. Moreover, this Breath Soil has already developed intelligence. Otherwise, this Breath Soil wouldn’t be able to control such a range as well as radiate so accurately while restraining its strength so outstandingly. I can vaguely feel the frequency of energy flowing in this land.","“If the Breath Soil really exists here, it’s not impossible for the species that come into contact with its effects to multiply in size in a few epochs.","“There are a few footprints in the southwest that have clearly been left recently. Based on the shape of these footprints, there’s a high chance that this Titan Rhinoceros Elephants is the one I know of. Young Master, let’s head southwest!","“It shouldn’t be long before we can find the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. If the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ bodies can really reach 400,000 meters, no matter how lush the vegetation here is, it won’t be able to provide enough food for many Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. Therefore, there must be less than 200 Titan Rhinoceros Elephants!”"]},{"number":2956,"title":"Chapter 2956: The Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ Large Appetites!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2956: The Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ Large Appetites!","....","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Winter made this speculation after much deliberation. With the information he had now, Winter was basically certain that his guess was right.","Winter looked a little excited as he spoke. the Breath Soil was not so easy to come by!","The Breath Soil was the amalgamation of the highest attributes of the earth elements. It was a rare treasure in the eyes of any faction and species.","The wilderness of the North of the Lonely River was rarely visited by people. Everyone felt that the wilderness of the North of the Lonely River was poor. Who would have thought that such a barren place would actually nurture an existence like the Breath Soil?","Lin Yuan was pleasantly surprised. Since Winter had said that the Breath Soil was a good thing, it must be an extremely precious item.","“Winter, you said that the Breath Soil can produce intelligence. Is the Breath Soil very similar to those elemental creatures? Or can the Breath Soil be considered an elemental fey?”","Winter hurriedly explained to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, elemental lifeforms are indeed rarer than ordinary flesh-and-blood creatures, but compared to the Breath Soil, ordinary creatures are equivalent to ordinary nature and faeries.","There’s no comparison.”","As he spoke, Winter pointed into the distance.","“Young Master, if we go a little further east, you’ll be able to see a Titan","Rhinoceros Elephant more than 250,000 meters long! The Titan Rhinoceros Elephants that live here come from the same source as the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants that I know of previously.","“The two are the same species. You can understand that by how the Breath Soil caused the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants to become like this. The Titan Rhinoceros Elephant I detected has an extremely high-level special earth element aura. This aura is emitted by the Breath Soil.”","Soon, Winter led Lin Yuan to a behemoth.","The Titan Rhinoceros Elephant was extremely tall. Its back was flat and wide and its four thick limbs were covered in thick, hard keratin. These hard keratin were like the scales of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant. The two towering","Rhinocerosceros horns and four flamboyant tusks on its head made the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant look extremely mighty.","The fact that the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant had grown so many pieces of equipment meant that there were often internal conflicts within the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. They needed to rely on the battles among themselves to establish the status of the species or to help with courtships.","The Titan Rhinoceros Elephants could transform into human form. However, such a huge creature preferred its majestic body to its human form.","“Winter, this Titan Rhinoceros Elephant has already reached the Divine","Kingdom level. Let’s go take a look at this Titan Rhinoceros Elephant’s temper.","We can also use it to understand all the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.”","Lin Yuan took the lead and flew toward the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant.","Winter stayed a reasonable distance away from Lin Yuan. If Lin Yuan was in danger, Winter could protect him at any time from such a distance.","The best way to test a living being’s temper was to try to anger this living","being.","The Titan Rhinoceros Elephant’s tail was very short compared to its height and body length but it was still tens of thousands of meters long. The wrinkled skin on its tail and the hard fur on it allowed the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant’s tail to use the strong wind to protect its body when it waved.","Lin Yuan had already entered the combat range of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant’s tail so he released his aura.","Lin Yuan’s aura was clearly a threat to this Divine Kingdom Titan Rhinoceros Elephant. However, this Titan Rhinoceros Elephant did not attack Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan and Winter were able to land steadily on the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant’s back.","Lin Yuan remembered that Chi Zhentian had once said that the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants were extremely territorial.","Even though the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants were extremely territorial, this one did not attack him. This meant that the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant’s territorial nature was only targeted toward its members or entities which made the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant feel like an offensive target that had invaded its territory.","From this point alone, the temper of the entire Titan Rhinoceros Elephants was relatively good.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to take the initiative to communicate with the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant, it actually took the initiative to contact him, “Hey, it’s not polite to land on my back like this. I’ll forgive you today since I’m in a good mood. Go back to where you came from.","“I advise you not to land on the backs of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. If anyone is in a bad mood, you’ll all become minced meat!”","While communicating with Lin Yuan, the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant used its trunk to sweep up dozens of giant trees. Then, it put these giant trees into its mouth and chewed them in big mouthfuls, scattering huge pieces of debris and branches on the ground.","Lin Yuan sensed that tender grass began growing in the areas that had just been uprooted. The exposed and brown ground was covered again in an instant.","Lin Yuan could now communicate through his soul. He spoke to the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant through his soul, “Your species members are so huge. No matter how abundant the resources here are, there can’t be too many of you, right?”","The Titan Rhinoceros Elephant had said those words to drive Lin Yuan away. It had not expected Lin Yuan to continue chatting. This petite creature ignored its words, making the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant a little angry.","However, this Titan Rhinoceros Elephant did not flare up immediately. Instead, it said rather arrogantly, “In this territory, no other species dares to have designs on my species, regardless of our numbers. The same goes for those stupid birds in the east and those stupid crocodiles living in the west! I advise you to leave before I get angry. Otherwise, don’t blame me for depriving you of your chance to live!”","Winter nodded at Lin Yuan. Based on the current situation. the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant had a good temper. As long as the temperament of the other Titan Rhinoceros Elephants was half that of the one in front of them, the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants would definitely qualify to become an outstanding war fortress.","When Lin Yuan heard the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant’s threat, he did not take it seriously at all.","Lin Yuan said to the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant with a smile, “Why do you think you’re the one who will deprive me of the chance to live, and not the other way around? Winter, it’s so big that it’s inconvenient for us to communicate with it, and I don’t like people eating while I’m talking to them. Winter, help me restrain him. Make him transform into his human form before talking to us.”","Winter bowed to Lin Yuan and released his aura.","Winter’s aura did not dissipate in the surrounding environment. It condensed into a single beam that targeted the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant in front of him.","Apart from this Titan Rhinoceros Elephant, the other living beings could not sense Winter’s aura at all.","To this Titan Rhinoceros Elephant, the aura released by Winter was like a hammer that ruthlessly smashed into the back of his head.","It stunned the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant.","Winter’s aura far exceeded the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant’s imagination. After knowing that it was powerless to resist, the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant listened to Lin Yuan’s request and transformed into a human.","The Titan Rhinoceros Elephant in its human form was nearly five meters tall, and its body was filled with strong muscles. It looked like an iron lump.","The Titan Rhinoceros Elephant in human form looked at Winter warily and mumbled, “Why are you here in the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ territory and why are you talking to me? The Titan Rhinoceros Elephants have never left our territory, so we naturally won’t have any enmity with any species.”","Lin Yuan said straightforwardly to the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant, “Of course, we didn’t come here just to joke around with you. We came here intending to take in all the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants and turn you into a strategic force that we can use!”","Xiang Da originally thought that the two people in front of him were here to target him. Xiang Da was trying his best to think about when he had offended these two people.","Unexpectedly, these two fellows were not targeting him, but all the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants!","Although Xiang Da was huge, he was extremely intelligent. Xiang Da immediately understood what Lin Yuan meant by turning the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants into a strategic force.","The Titan Rhinoceros Elephants were huge and had the qualifications to become a strategic force.","Xiang Da did not think about what would happen to the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants if this old and young man in front of him controlled them.","Xiang Da felt that he was not a match for the old and the young experts in front of him. There was no point in resisting under such circumstances.","Xiang Da asked, “You said that you want to control the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. The Titan Rhinoceros Elephants have a huge appetite. Apart from sleeping, we basically eat all day long. You’ve already seen it.","“Only the lush vegetation here can guarantee the appetite of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. If you control the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, you should be able to let us continue staying here, right?”","Lin Yuan was already prepared for the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants to resist.","Lin Yuan had spoken so bluntly just now because he wanted to test the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant’s temperament and bloodlust.","Lin Yuan thought that the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant would struggle no matter what but he did not expect it to choose to be honest.","“If I take control of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, I can’t be sure if I will keep you here. However, if the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants submit to me, I will definitely not let you starve. I can guarantee this! Even if we go somewhere else, I still have the confidence to feed the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants!” In Lin Yuan’s eyes, the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants were already his.","Lin Yuan would definitely not lie to his subordinates.","Lin Yuan said that he could feed the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants because he had Emerald Lady and Gray Pool’s help and the Soldier Ration Radishes were being distributed wantonly. The Soldier Ration Radishes’ growth had also greatly increased.","Under such circumstances, it was not difficult for Lin Yuan to feed the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.","However, Xiang Da did not believe Lin Yuan at all.","At the moment, there were about 190 of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. If not for the uniqueness of this place, it would have been lucky if more than 20 Titan Rhinoceros Elephants of such size were able to remain fed.","The old and young men in front of him had no idea how big the Titan","Rhinoceros Elephants’ appetites were, so he casually made a guarantee.","They were really too unreliable. If he really took the entire Titan Rhinoceros Elephants away with his arrogant words, they would be able to empty his pockets in minutes!","Despite Xiang Da not believing Lin Yuan, he did not express his disbelief.","“If you can guarantee that I won’t go hungry, it won’t be a problem for me to follow you. I’m already a little hungry now. Can you let me return to my true form and continue eating? Our bodies are abnormally large. Once we stop eating, hunger will quickly hit us. In my species, only the bigger males have a chance to get a wife!”","Lin Yuan did not immediately let Xiang Da return to his original form.","“Don’t be anxious. I still have two questions for you. It won’t be too late for you to transform into your true form after I’m done asking! I have a plant rich in vitality here. After you answer my question, I can give it to you to taste!”","Xiang Da had already expected Lin Yuan to continue to ask him questions. This young man’s gaze was half on him and half on the land he had destroyed. The old man standing behind the young man had been sizing up the surrounding environment.","Xiang Da’s heart tightened. The other party clearly wanted to ask about the environment here.","This matter was a secret of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. Xiang Da did not want to tell the secrets of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants to these two fellows in front of him.","However, the situation was rather dire. If he did not say it, these two fellows in front of him would definitely not let the matter rest!","Xiang Da said as if he had accepted his fate,","“Go ahead. I can’t guarantee that I’ll know what you’re asking but I won’t hide what I know from you! I’m not considered to be at the management level in our species. I’ve just changed my surname from Xi to Xiang.","“The surnames of my species are divided according to their size. Those below","250,000 meters have the Xi surname and those above 250,000 meters have the Xiang surname. The ones who truly know our species’ secrets are the elders who are more than 400,000 meters long.”","Xiang Da briefly explained the situation of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants to Lin Yuan. He was afraid that Lin Yuan would ask him a question that he did not know and that Lin Yuan would be unwilling to believe him.","Xiang Da did not feel too burdened. Even if the others in the species encountered such a situation, they would likely make the same choice as him. After all, who would be willing to die if they could live?","There were very few members of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants and every member’s life was extremely precious. This was the consensus of all the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.","If it were any other member of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, they would have made the same decision as him.","Xiang Da’s words allowed Lin Yuan to understand the internal situation of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. Lin Yuan could tell that Xiang Da was very willing to cooperate with his questions.","“Don’t worry, I’m not asking you questions to make things difficult for you. I won’t ask questions that you don’t know how to answer..”"]},{"number":2957,"title":"Chapter 2957 Breath Soil Symbiosis!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2957 Breath Soil Symbiosis!","....","“How long has it been since the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants came here? You should know how big a normal Titan Rhinoceros Elephant is, right? Have you guys been larger than normal Titan Rhinoceros Elephant cubs since you were born, or did you only grow bigger after?”","Lin Yuan’s three consecutive questions were abnormally clear. All three of his questions pointed to the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant’s history.","As an intelligent species, the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants had records of history. If history was not recorded, they would not be able to carry on their legacy.","Lin Yuan’s questions were indeed not difficult for Xiang Da, who could answer Lin Yuan’s questions.","From Lin Yuan’s three questions, Xiang Da knew that Lin Yuan’s true goal was to trace the reason for the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ huge size. In the end, he would have to ask about the secrets of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.","However, given the current situation, Xiang Da could not reject Lin Yuan’s question.","Xiang Da said truthfully, “Our lineage doesn’t come from the East Universe. Our ancestors migrated from the North Universe. Most of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants should be living in the North Universe now, surviving and reproducing there.","“Our ancestors belonged to the branch with weaker bloodlines in the North Universe. They were exiled by their species because of a lack of resources. I don’t know how many years it took to migrate all the way here and then take root here.”","Lin Yuan was certain of one thing. This huge group of Titan Rhinoceros Elephants had indeed undergone such a huge change because of the environment.","After answering Lin Yuan’s first question, Xiang Da continued to seriously answer the other two questions, “My species has detailed records of everything that happened. Ordinary Titan Rhinoceros Elephant females are about 60,000 meters long. Males are slightly longer than females, but they won’t exceed 20,000 meters in length. 80,000 meters was already the largest recorded size of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants during their prosperous period!","“Our bodies don’t grow all of a sudden. Before the end of the last epoch, our largest elder was only 200,000 meters long. I only just managed to meet the standards of obtaining the surname Xiang.","“The Titan Rhinoceros Elephants developed rapidly in this epoch. When I was born, my size had already reached 40,000 meters. The size of our newborns is increasing as our species develops here. If we continue to develop according to this trend, our species’ size will become larger and larger. The same will go for our newborns!","“I hope that there won’t be conflicts between the members of my species because of food in the future! The trees growing in the territory are starting to be insufficient to eat!”","While Xiang Da was replying to Lin Yuan’s questions, Lin Yuan could sense that what Xiang Da was most worried about was food. Xiang Da was very afraid that as the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants continued to develop, the food shortage would gradually become more and more serious.","It could be discerned from Xiang Da’s words that he was already dissatisfied with the size of the newborn Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.","Lin Yuan was not sure if this was Xiang Da’s personal thought or if all the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants were such gluttons.","If all the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants were such gluttons, then it would be easy for Lin Yuan to control the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants with absolute martial force. Lin Yuan only needed to satisfy the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ hunger.","As Lin Yuan grew, he had seen many species. No matter how powerful a species was, they had to face difficulties.","Lin Yuan could understand if the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants had such thoughts.","Apart from sleeping, the members of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants searched for food all day long. Such a huge body had to constantly eat to prevent an energy gap from appearing.","Lin Yuan did not intend to continue asking Xiang Da about the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ internal situation. It would be a little one-sided to learn more from Xiang Da.","After Lin Yuan took control of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, he directly went to look at the history of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. Many things would be presented more clearly to Lin Yuan.","“Since the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants have undergone such changes because of the environment here, do you know why the environment here is so magical?”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s question, Xiang Da was silent for a long time before he gritted his teeth and said, “There’s a special energy flowing under the ground here. This energy can nourish plants. This energy can also subtly nourish the animals living in this land. It’s just that the nourishment for animals is far inferior to the nourishment for plants! It’s not obvious that the other creatures here have grown bigger.","“I think it has something to do with their genes and also with the fact that other creatures can’t eat too many plants growing in this land!","“These plants growing on this land have solidified the energy flowing in the land. We can use them to absorb the energy in the land. As for where the energy in this land comes from, I don’t know. If you want to know, you have to ask the elders.”","Xiang Da looked at Lin Yuan expectantly and said, “Hehe, Lord, can you let me try the plant that contains a large amount of vitality? There are only so many types of trees here. I’m already tired of eating them!”","Lin Yuan did not know whether to laugh or cry. Xiang Da was the most pompous person Lin Yuan had ever come across. He could be said to be the purest fellow.","Lin Yuan happened to be interested in seeing how suitable Xiang Da was to the Soldier Ration Radish so he handed the fey storage box containing the Soldier Ration Radishes to Winter before instructing Xiang Da to transform into his original body.","As the Moon Empress’ disciple, the Radiance Envoy of the Radiance Federation, and the savior of the main world, it was very easy for Lin Yuan to master the forging technique of fey storage boxes. The fey storage box’s technology had already been revolutionized by Lin Yuan.","The Soldier Ration Radishes in this fey storage box were enough for Xiang Da, who was more than 250,000 meters long, to eat for some time!","Upon receiving Lin Yuan’s instructions, Xiang Da hurriedly transformed into his original body and waited to be fed.","After Winter poured the Soldier Ration Radishes into Xiang Da’s mouth, he immediately started chewing.","The juice of the Soldier Ration Radishes moistened Xiang Da’s mouth. This taste that he had never eaten before made Xiang Da squint his eyes in happiness.","It was impossible for Winter to stand there and feed Xiang Da all day so he simply tied this fey storage box to the Rhinocerosceros horn at the front of Xiang Da.","Xiang Da only needed to use his spiritual energy to connect with the fey storage box. The Soldier Ration Radishes in the fey storage box would enter Xiang Da’s mouth.","Xiang Da enjoyed the taste of the Soldier Ration Radish, but he quickly stopped eating.","Xiang Da said to Lin Yuan in an extremely serious tone, “Lord, I admit that the vitality in this plant you provided me is extremely abundant but this plant doesn’t contain the surging energy in this land! Absorbing that kind of energy will be more beneficial to the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants!”","Lin Yuan did not say anything else. He agreed with Xiang Da.","The energy emitted by the Breath Soil in this land had revolutionized the bloodline of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. This benefit was obvious.","The Soldier Ration Radishes did not have such energy but as long as he obtained the Breath Soil hidden under this land, they could use the energy of the Breath Soil to nurture the Soldier Ration Radishes.","Then, the Soldier Ration Radish would contain the energy emitted by the Breath Soil. Not only that, but the Soldier Ration Radishes would also grow bigger and bigger like the plants here!","The Soldier Ration Radishes’ growth speed would not be affected by its size.","Once the Soldier Ration Radishes grew in size, even without Emerald Lady and Gray Pool’s help, they would still be able to provide for all the members of the faith country. No matter how fast the faith country developed, there would be no need to worry about food and clothing.","With the help of Emerald Lady and Gray Pool, it was not difficult to use the enlarged Soldier Ration Radishes to feed the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants and strengthen them!","“Eat some of the plants here to recover your energy as soon as possible. Then, bring us to find the other members of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. The entire Titan Rhinoceros Elephants has less than 200 members. It shouldn’t be difficult for you to help me find them.”","Xiang Da did not reject Lin Yuan this time, but he spoke to him in an extremely serious tone, “Lord, I can do this but can you agree to one of my requests?”","Lin Yuan revealed a curious expression.","Lin Yuan really could not think of what kind of request Xiang Da would make of him.","“Tell me. You’ve helped me resolve many of my doubts. As long as it’s not difficult to fulfill your request, I’ll definitely agree to it.”","Xiang Da transformed into human form and bowed respectfully to Lin Yuan.","“Lord, I’m not the strongest Titan Rhinoceros Elephant. It’s barely possible for me to rank in the top 30. However, I will support all of your instructions in the future. I hope that you can let me share your worries after you take in the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants!”","Xiang Da’s words made Lin Yuan pay more attention to him.","For Xiang Da to be able to say this, it meant that he was not a simple foodie but a meticulous fellow!","Lin Yuan had always liked to use smart people. Xiang Da’s words proved to Lin Yuan that he was a smart person. Lin Yuan was willing to give Xiang Da this opportunity.","No matter how many members the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants had, definitely needed a manager. The manager of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants would continue to control the species in the future.","However, the strategic significance of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants was much greater than that of the other species under Lin Yuan’s control. The manager of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants needed to keep them in check.","An ambitious guy like Xiang Da was very suitable for this job!","“Of course. Your future self will definitely thank yourself for your choice today. As long as you help me find the members of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, I can give you such an opportunity!”","Xiang Da let out a special roar when he heard this. This roar was not ear-piercing but it could be heard from an extremely far distance.","“Master, this is the special contact method of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. When the members of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants nearby hear this cry, they will automatically. You can ride on my back. I’ll run ahead and scream non-stop. The other members will locate me based on my cry.”","Xiang Da knew very well that his actions were equivalent to helping Lin Yuan control the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. This behavior was somewhat like selling one’s species for glory.","Xiang Da did not feel any guilt.","Firstly, the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants did not have the ability to resist the elder beside Lin Yuan. Secondly, there was no problem for him to consider his future.","In the past, it was because he did not think for himself that he missed those opportunities. If he had seized those opportunities, his current body length would most likely reach 400,000 meters and he would become an elder of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants!","Lin Yuan and Winter sat on Xiang Da’s back. Lin Yuan did not feel any bumps as Xiang Da ran.","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant’s stability. Winter, on the other hand, protected Lin Yuan while investigating the flow of the special energy below the ground.","The Breath Soil that had developed intelligence was extremely good at hiding its existence. However, once the Breath Soil made an error, it was very likely that Winter would discover its location.","The Breath Soil could increase its strength by nourishing everything and obtaining the merit power. The merit power was an energy similar to faith power.","However, merit power was of a slightly higher level than faith power. The difficulty of obtaining it would correspondingly be higher!","Once the Breath Soil began to recover the merit power, Winter would be able to determine the location of the Breath Soil and then constantly determine its location.","As Xiang Da continued to run, Lin Yuan could feel the ground trembling in the distance. This meant that members of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants had already begun to gather in Xiang Da’s direction.","Lin Yuan looked at Winter, who nodded at him and pointed to the southwest.","“Young Master, the Breath Soil is in that direction. Let’s control the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants first! After I’m done controlling the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, I’ll take you to look for the Breath Soil.","“This Breath Soil should have obtained intelligence a long time ago. Otherwise, its ability to restrain its aura would not be so strong. The Breath Soil can coexist with faeries. After coexisting with faeries, the will of the faeries will be the main force and the will of the Breath Soil will be the secondary force.","“If this Breath Soil can coexist with Four Seasons Mountain, Four Seasons Mountain will become a higher faerie. Allowing the Four Seasons Mountain to control the Breath Soil is the best way to use it to serve you.”","Lin Yuan nodded in agreement.","Winter had explained the situation of the Breath Soil to Lin Yuan along the way. The Breath Soil was only affiliated with natural environments and plants. It would show hostility and avoid living beings in unnatural environments and plants.","Furthermore, the Breath Soil could not be contracted or controlled like other lifeforms such as feys."]},{"number":2958,"title":"Chapter 2958 Cleansing Breath Soil!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2958 ?Cleansing Breath Soil!","Therefore, controlling the Breath Soil through a faerie was the only way to control it.","The Breath Soil was too precious. It would be a waste to use ordinary faeries to control the Breath Soil.","Using a natural phenomenon like Four Seasons Mountain which had already transformed into a higher faerie to control the Breath Soil would be symbiotic and benefit both parties.","As a higher faerie, the Four Seasons Mountain could make the compatibility range of the Breath Soil extremely wide. It could also help the Breath Soil circulate its power and provide it with continuous metamorphosis.","With Winter around, Lin Yuan did not have to worry about not being able to find the Breath Soil. This Breath Soil could be considered an unexpected gain for Lin Yuan.","In the beginning, Lin Yuan and Winter had not anticipated the existence of the Breath Soil.","Lin Yuan asked Winter, “To make it easier for you to control the Breath Soil here, is it necessary to send another person to help you? After all, controlling the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants also requires a lot of your energy.”","Winter was not like Autumn who was afraid that others would share his credit. On the contrary, when serving Lin Yuan, Winter always strived for stability and convenience.","It would indeed be much more convenient to arrange for another person to deal with it together.","“Young Master, call Summer over. Summer’s physique can be connected to the flourishing vegetation. Using these plants, you can accurately locate the Breath Soil. If you call Summer over, I’ll help you control the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants while you go find the Breath Soil with her!","“The completion time of both sides will be roughly the same, so you won’t be delayed too long in the territory of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants. The Breath Soil will collect other precious items within its radius and choose a portion that suits its attributes to devour. Those that don’t match their attributes will be left behind by the Breath Soil","” As long as we find the Breath Soil, it will be equivalent to netting the accumulation of several epochs in this place! After taking the Breath Soil away, the feys will lose the supply of special energy and their growth speed will return to the same state as the outside world.","“As the circle of life continues to turn, the creatures here will gradually shrink and return to their normal size.”","Lin Yuan once again gained a certain understanding of the Breath Soil through Winter’s words.","If it was really as Winter had said, then there was no need to develop the territory of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants because there were no more resources in the territory of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.","Only when Listen, Endless Summer, Gu Lang, and the others built the trade network of the faith country and Sky City’s reserve resources were abundant could they develop the territory of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants to accommodate the residents of the faith country.","Although there were no more resources in the territory of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, as long as there were people and lives living on this land, they could always create value through labor.","Since Summer was more suitable to search for the Breath Soil, Lin Yuan called her over.","Hearing that there was the Breath Soil here, Summer’s face revealed a pleasantly surprised expression. Even for experts at Summer’s level, the Breath Soil was still a rare treasure.","When Summer, who had just arrived, saw the lushness of the trees here and the size that far exceeded the outside world, she roughly guessed the abilities of this Breath Soil.","Summer obviously knew more about the Breath Soil than Winter did.","“Young Master, if I’m not wrong, this Breath Soil is either Cleansing Breath Soil or Giant Fertile Demon Soil! Each has its own benefits. However, Cleansing Breath Soil is better for the development of Sky City. It’s also more suitable to be fused with faeries!”","Summer was usually not good with words. Among the four of them, Summer was always the one who spoke the least.","Summer would not have said this if she had not recognized the Breath Soil.","Lin Yuan was always extremely curious about new things.","Lin Yuan was about to obtain one of the two Breath Soils Summer mentioned.","“Summer, what are the effects of the Cleansing Breath Soil and Giant Fertile Demon Soil? Judging from the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ size, the Giant Fertile Demon Soil should be more suitable for the situation, right?”","Summer explained to Lin Yuan very seriously, “Young Master the Cleansing Breath Soil’s ability is targeted at plants and vegetation. It allows plants and vegetation to rapidly increase in grade under the enhancement of the special energy it emits.","“Furthermore, it allows the plants and vegetation’s bodies to continue growing larger. Rather than enlarging the size of plants, increasing the growth speed of plants and reviving heavily injured plants is the Cleansing Breath Soil’s main ability!”","As she spoke, Summer raised her hand and shot out a wave of energy, directly creating a crack in the lush vegetation.","All the grass and trees in the area affected by the energy were reduced to dust and the soil was turned upside down!","However, not long after, this area quickly turned green. In the blink of an eye, the gray land could no longer be seen. After the grass grew, small trees began to sprout on it. In less than a minute, they had grown into hundred-meter-tall trees.","Previously, Lin Yuan had seen everything on Xiang Da’s back, but it had not been clear.","Now that he was on the ground, Lin Yuan could not help but sigh at the marvel that was the Breath Soil.","“Young Master, this is a small experiment of mine. The Giant Fertile Demon Soil’s ability to enable growth and enlargement is mainly targeted at living beings.","“The Titan Rhinoceros Elephants here are huge. It’s because they ate a lot of the plants here. After all, the changes in the size of the other living beings haven’t reached the extent of the effects of the Giant Fertile Demon Soil","” Even if the Giant Fertile Demon Soil is also able to help plants grow, the effects definitely can’t reach the current level. However, anything is possible. This might really be the Giant Fertile Demon Soil, but it might have undergone some changes!”","Summer’s explanation could be described as meticulous.","From Summer’s words, Lin Yuan knew that Summer already saw this Breath Soil as the Cleansing Breath Soil.","Summer said this because she had always been cautious and reliable.","“We’ll know what kind of Breath Soil it is when we find it. Originally, I thought that I would need some time to prepare for the evolution of the Four Seasons Mountain. Now, it seems that there’s no need to prepare anymore. When I obtain the Breath Soil, I can directly help Four Seasons Mountain transform!”","Lin Yuan split up with Summer and Winter. He had a rough understanding of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ personality. The Titan Rhinoceros Elephants were very easy to control. However, building a war fortress on them required a lot of manpower and material resources.","Hu Quan, a Spirit Craftsman who had long surpassed Class 6, was not good at building war machines. Hu Quan was better at building buildings that were filled with art.","Actually, it was better to use Creators to build war machines than to use Spirit Craftsmen.","However, Lin Yuan did not have many Creators under him. Lin Yuan had always been the one bearing the burden of Sky City’s resources. Sky City’s strongest Creator was the Moon Empress.","The Moon Empress could help Lin Yuan take a look at Sky City’s overall situation but did not have the time to build those war fortresses.","Lin Yuan thought, It might be time for Sky City to recruit a few outstanding Creators.","Creators were the ones who produced resources. It was definitely impossible to recruit Creators through resources.","Apart from the increase in resources and strength, there was something more important to any lifeform. This was lifespan!","Lin Yuan had not stopped raising and breeding the Lifespan Mice all these years. All of Sky City’s white-clothed followers and combat sequence members had already contracted the Lifespan Mouse.","Even so, Lin Yuan still had tens of thousands of Bronze Lifespan Mice in his Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Each Lifespan Mouse could allow a living being to obtain an endless lifespan and become a witness to history.","However, even if one had an endless lifespan in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it was very difficult to survive without powerful strength.","Before the Creator concocted potions to increase the strength of other feys, he must first improve his strength.","Lin Yuan needed to find those Creators who had reached the end of their lifespan.","There was no such thing as a Star Web in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan’s current information channels were extremely limited, and he only had three powerful factions under his control.","The first was Treasure City, of which Lin Yuan was now a sponsor.","The second was Fortune Treasure Palace. Lin Yuan was now a special honor guest that Fortune Treasure Palace paid special attention.","The third was the Elisa clan in the Scarlet Territory.","Although Qin Yu had become a Bloodian queen with boundless glory, Lin Yuan was the actual ruler of the Elisa clan.","If Lin Yuan wanted to find Creators whose lifespans were about to end, the only way was to use these three factions to help him search.","Lin Yuan’s explanation would be very simple. He only needed to say that he had spiritual ingredients that could help increase his lifespan by a few years.","He wanted to use these spiritual ingredients in exchange for some potions from high-grade Creators.","After finding the Creators who were about to reach the end of their lifespans, Lin Yuan could casually negotiate with them.","With Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter by his side, Lin Yuan definitely had the power to hold down the fort.","This made Lin Yuan unafraid of the Creators who developed evil intentions and spread the news after learning that Lin Yuan had a way to indefinitely extend lifespans.","Those Creators who knew about the Lifespan Mouse only had two choices. They could either join Sky City and obtain endless lifespans to work for Sky City or they would be imprisoned by Lin Yuan and end their short lifespans.","After being the manager of a powerful faction for so many years, Lin Yuan had long understood the essentials of being a faction manager.","For Creators who were willing to join Sky City, Lin Yuan could not only grant them endless lifespans, but he could also create favorable living conditions for them and increase their status in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","At this moment, a fluorescent green light appeared on Summer’s body.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there were no obvious changes in the four seasons like in the main world.","For example, North of the Lonely River was almost unaffected by the four seasons.","Summer released her aura, giving Lin Yuan the feeling that midsummer had arrived.","The green light that seeped out of Summer’s body was connected to more and more plants. Summer scanned the surroundings from time to time and constantly determined the direction to bring Lin Yuan forward.","A full day passed in this quiet atmosphere.","Suddenly, Summer stopped in his tracks and raised her hand.","Summer cut her finger with her fingernail and a drop of green blood dripped into the soil.","A furious dragon-like branch emerged from the ground and carried Lin Yuan and Summer in a certain direction. The growth speed of these branches was tens of thousands of times faster than the growth speed of the trees nourished by the Breath Soil.","The leaves on the branches resisted all the wind pressure and Summer quickly brought Lin Yuan to a flat open space.","It was extremely strange to have such a space without trees in the lush forest.","“Young Master, I’ve kept you waiting. I’ll get the beings for you now!”","After saying that, the ground beneath Lin Yuan’s feet immediately began to churn. In just a short while, the tree branches grabbed a humanoid creature that was nearly a meter tall and glowing with a gem-like brilliance.","Beside this creature, there was a large amount of soil that was the same color as itself flowing like liquid.","Lin Yuan could clearly see the fear on the creature’s face.","“No wonder you’re so difficult to catch. You’ve already transformed into a human! Looks like you’ve absorbed a lot of merit power over the years! You should have already tried. Even if you’re in the soil, you won’t be able to escape from me.","“Now that you’re imprisoned in my life wood, you won’t be able to escape even if you have wings! I’ll give you two choices now.","“The first is to be directly refined. You can be made into many things.","“Second, you submit to my Young Master. From now on, I’ll arrange for a higher fairie to coexist with you. It won’t be a disgrace to your growth. Give me an answer to the specific choice.”","After saying that, Summer quietly looked at the Breath Soil that had already transformed into a human, and did not say anything else.","At the same time, Summer sent a voice transmission to Lin Yuan. “Young Master, I didn’t guess wrongly. This is indeed the Cleansing Breath Soil. Rather than promising it many benefits, deterring him and making it submit is undoubtedly a better way!","“It has lived for so long and absorbed so much merit power to transform into a human. It definitely won’t want to die here and be refined. Let it conquer itself before joining you. It will be much more obedient. I promised it that it would coexist with a higher faerie which would be extremely beneficial to it.”","Lin Yuan could not help but praise Summer.","Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter had fundamental differences in their personalities but in terms of handling matters, the four of them were undoubtedly extremely outstanding.","The Cleansing Breath Soil did not think for long before it said, “I’m not strong enough to escape your control, but if you want me to submit to you, you have to fulfill your promise!”","The Breath Soil told Lin Yuan instead of Summer, “She said that you’re her Young Master. You’re the one in charge. I need you to give me a guarantee. As far as I know, higher faeries are not easy to find. They are basically all in the Faerie Institution. Could it be that you’re working with Faerie Institution?”"]},{"number":2959,"title":"Chapter 2959: Holy Spirit Star Vastness Peony!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2959: Holy Spirit Star Vastness Peony!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan and Summer entered the Cleansing Breath Soil’s nest and captured it.","The Cleansing Breath Soil was completely unable to resist.","If the Cleansing Breath Soil wanted to protect its own interests, it had to ask questions.","The Cleansing Breath Soil felt that the other party’s suggestion of arranging a higher faerie for it was a little exaggerated. How could it be so easy to arrange for a higher faerie? If the other party was not related to the Faerie Institution, he must be lying to it","Lin Yuan said in an extremely serious tone, “You’re about to join me. Trust is something we have to have between us. I’ll soon let you see the higher faerie I promised and arranged for you. It’s just that it’ll take some effort for you to coexist with this higher faerie.”","Lin Yuan’s answer made the Cleansing Breath Soil frown. Lin Yuan’s words meant that he did not have any cooperation with Faerie Institution.","However, since the other party had promised that it would be able to see this higher faerie soon, the Cleansing Breath Soil had no choice but to agree.","The intelligent Cleansing Breath Soil said sensibly to its future leader, “I will definitely leave this land after joining you. There is a lot of energy in this land that I can control but can’t take away.","“Do you have any plant-type creatures? Even if it’s a plant-type creature in the Holy Spirit level, I can use this energy to help it advance by a large level and transcend the Holy Spirit level itself. Take it as a gift from me to you. I hope you can treat me well in the future and not lie to me!”","Lin Yuan was pleasantly surprised. He had contracted a total of four plant-type feys – the Jasmine Lily, Green Vine, the Star Vastness Peony, and the Abyss Red Lotus.","Among them, the Abyss Red Lotus was the weakest. It was only at","Sovereign/immortal Breed and had yet to step into the Divine Kingdom level.","The Abyss Red Lotus was at the juncture of its bloodline metamorphosis. The best way for a living being with a bloodline at the juncture of metamorphosis to evolve was to increase its bloodline first before increasing its strength.","Therefore, the Abyss Red Lotus was the most unsuitable choice.","Of the three remaining three feys, the Jasmine Lily focused on healing and","Green Vine focused on combat. These two were very important to Lin Yuan.","However, when it came to functionality, the Star Vastness Peony was better.","More importantly, the Star Vastness Peony could support Wen Yu in holding the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meetings. Therefore, the Star","Vastness Peony had the highest priority among Lin Yuan’s plant-type feys.","Lin Yuan summoned the Star Vastness Peony and told the Cleansing Breath Soil, “Of course. I’ve always been responsible to all the living beings under my command. Help it increase its grade. Its current strength is at","Sovereign/immortal IX. It has yet to reach Eternal. According to what you just said, it should be able to directly advance to the Holy Spirit level.”","After the Cleansing Breath Soil checked the situation of the Star Vastness Peony, the expression on its face was extremely interesting.","“Of course. You should be a spirit contractor, right? I’m very curious. How did you nurture this fey to such an extent?”","Lin Yuan did not deny his identity as a spirit contractor. Instead, he said proudly, “Every one of my teys has been nurtured according to the best method. From now on, you will be under my command, and your nurturing will naturally be no exception.","“Not only will I help you quickly obtain merit power, but I can also invest the resources you need.”","The Cleansing Breath Soil revealed a faint smile.","“My true form is the Breath Soil. You must know something about the Breath Soil. Otherwise, you wouldn’t know how to catch me!","“All Breath Soil requires two things to increase our strength. One is pure spirit qi, and the other is a substance rich in pure earth-elemental energy. These two resources can only be produced by a Class 4 or above Creator. Are you really willing to give them away?”","Upon hearing the Cleansing Breath Soil’s words, Lin Yuan thought to himself that he had guessed correctly. If the Breath Soil wanted to increase its strength, it needed these two resources that he could produce in large quantities.","Lin Yuan took out two wooden boxes made of completely jade-textured wood, and Summer very considerately transported them to the cage that imprisoned the Cleansing Breath Soil.","“These two wooden boxes are filled with the resources you need. You can absorb them yourself. I think the resources I provided you should be able to make you feel more at ease, right? Even if these resources can’t prove anything, they can show my sincerity to you.”","When the Cleansing Breath Soil saw the two boxes of resources that Lin Yuan had given it, it trusted Lin Yuan even more than before.","The Cleansing Breath Soil grew here in the wild and had no chance of coming into contact with such Creator resources. Through its life in this land and its understanding of information, the Cleansing Breath Soil generally knew the value of these Creator resources.","Lin Yuan was willing to hand over so many precious resources to it, which meant that Lin Yuan had no possibility of lying to it. If Lin Yuan really had the intention to deceive it, it would not have given up these resources!","After understanding this, the Cleansing Breath Soil began to respect Lin Yuan and truly see him as its master.","Lin Yuan had two motives for doing this. Apart from convincing the Cleansing Breath Soil that he could calm it down, he also had to nurture it well.","Just from the ability of the Cleansing Breath Soil, its strategic value was higher than that of Gray Pool and Emerald Lady.","To the faith country, the Cleansing Breath Soil could completely be used as a foundational support.","The Star Vastness Peony understood the situation. It had actually obtained such a huge opportunity!","Among Lin Yuan’s feys, its strength was comparable to the Abyss Red Lotus, but the latter was better at fighting than it was. This made the Star Vastness Peony feel inferior.","Fortunately, the exclusive skill Celestial Body Boost could enhance Wen Yu’s sacred source lifeform and help her hold the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meetings. Only then did its strategic value increase. And because of this, it had obtained this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","From now on, it would become the strongest among Lin Yuan’s feys.","The Star Vastness Peony transformed into its main body and took root in front of the Cleansing Breath Soil, waiting for this opportunity to descend.","Lin Yuan nodded at Summer, indicating that she should stop restraining the Cleansing Breath Soil.","The Cleansing Breath Soil would not lie to him after understanding the pros and cons. Removing the shackles on the Cleansing Breath Soil not only gave the Cleansing Breath Soil respect and dignity but also allowed the Cleansing Breath Soil to more conveniently guide the energy gathered here to increase the Star Vastness Peony’s strength.","Two days passed in the blink of an eye.","Winter had already completely controlled the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants and had them gather in the forest not far away.","When Winter saw that the Cleansing Breath Soil was helping Lin Yuan’s feys increase their strength, he did not speak. Instead, he prepared to wait for the Star Vastness Peony to evolve before talking to Lin Yuan. This would prevent Lin Yuan from being distracted.","As for the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, although they would feel abnormally hungry if they did not eat for a few days, their body would not be seriously affected.","Rather than using the Faith Tree to control the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, Winter suggested that Lin Yuan use his divine kingdom to control their fountains of faith and holy spirits.","Amidst the starlight, the Star Vastness Peony finally stopped evolving.","The Star Vastness Peony had broken through from Sovereign/immortal to Eternal, spirit fire, and Divine Kingdom. Now, it had already condensed a holy spirit and become an intermediate Holy Spirit expert. It firmly sat at the top of all the feys Lin Yuan had contracted.","Lin Yuan would provide faith power to the Star Vastness Peony in the future, and the Star Vastness Peony had its own way of obtaining faith power as well.","Lin Yuan did not need to worry about this.","Lin Yuan used True Data to investigate the Star Vastness Peony.","[Fey Name]: Star Vastness Peony [Fey Species]: Buttercup species/peony species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (10/10) [Fey Type]: Wood/Light","[Fey Quality]: Elementary Holy Spirit [Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Activate Light]: In a place filled with starlight, it will be guided by the stars and be unaffected by blinding effects. In a place with absolute darkness, the surroundings can still be clearly seen.","[Casted Item Starlight]: When stars appear, the starlight can temper the body to improve the body’s quality.","[Tempering Essence Starlight]: In a place with starlight, it will absorb energy from the starlight to temper spiritual energy and increase the strength of the spiritual energy.","[Condensing Spirit Starlight]: In a place with starlight and when its soul is injured, the starlight will nourish its soul and heal it quickly.","[Starlight Robes]: The starlight will be directed to a target’s body and transform into a robe. While the target is draped in the robe, it will be immune to poison and curses and the harm suffered from the poison and curses will be reduced.","[Star-storing Flower Jade]: Once the flower petals have absorbed sufficient starlight, they will become jade-textured and break away from the flower. The jade-textured flower petals can be stored for a long time and will be able to speed up the rate at which starlight tempers its body.","[Star River Guide]: In any environment, it can link its thoughts and star river to confirm its location. It will also experience blessing effects to raise its luck and turn adversity into fortune.","[Radiant Star Teardrops]: Gather all the energy in the galaxy and brew them in the calyx. They will eventually transform into pure star energy.","[Starlight Teleportation]: When pointing to two things through starlight, starlight will create a starlight link for the terminals of the two things. It will use the starlight link to let the targets on both ends communicate telepathically or interact with objects in the spatial link.","[Starlight Sacrifice]: Sacrifice the starlight it receives and use the energy in the starlight to improve its other abilities or exclusive skills, strengthening the effects of its abilities and exclusive skills.","Exclusive Skill:","[Constellation Imprint]: Attempt to communicate with the stars. If the communication is successful, a star imprint will appear on the body. The star imprint can help the body to take on all curse effects. When the star imprint is triggered, the energy within it will flow into the body and raise the body’s quality within a short period.","[Star Contraction]: It will become deeply bound to a star and be able to use the star’s energy to raise its defensive capabilities. The degree to which the defensive capabilities will be raised depends on the strength of the star and the bond with the star.","[Merciful Stars]: For stars, containing too much energy will become a negative burden. The hardship of stars will be comprehended and the energy within the stars will be extracted. The energy from the stars will be used to strengthen the body composition of a target. (If the target is forcefully strengthened and is unable to handle the power from the stars, the strengthening will be halted. It will need to take on the additional power from the stars as well as the consequences.)","[Star Map Shackle]: It will use the energy of the celestial bodies it is linked to to draw a star map that will be applied to a target’s body. Regardless of whether it is day or night, the shackle of the star map will prevent the target from strengthening its body and energy. The energy it absorbs will only strengthen the shackle. At night, the effects of the shackle will be amplified.","[Celestial Body Boost]: Its body will be attached to an entity. Its spiritual energy will be applied to this entity to increase the entity’s sensitivity towards stars. The entity’s link to stars will also be deepened and enable the stars to interact with this entity.","[Light Drawing Branch]: Uses starlight and its own root power to separate a secondary flower. The secondary flower has the ability to use Starlight Teleportation between the main Flower Pearl. It is equivalent to a stable star coordinate.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Star Forming Blossom]: Every time it connects with a celestial body and reaches an intimate state with this celestial body, a flower that can represent this celestial body will bloom on this plant. Every time these celestial bodies inherit faith, it can use the flowers produced by the celestial body to absorb and distribute the faith obtained by a portion of the celestial body.","[Star Brewing Spirit Forging]: By brewing the power of the stars, it can use the power of the stars and faith power to form a special star spirit fluid. This star spirit fluid has a certain tempering effect on holy spirits and can effectively heal the injuries they suffer.","Holy Spirit beings had one more divine kingdom ability than Divine Kingdom beings. Lin Yuan had known this a long time ago.","The first Holy Spirit existence that Lin Yuan had investigated was Kani.","The divine kingdom ability that Kani obtained at Divine Kingdom more or less limited her combat strength. It was only after Kani advanced to the Holy Spirit level and obtained the divine kingdom ability Jackal-Devouring Purgatory that Kani’s situation was resolved and her combat strength was no longer restricted.","The Star Vastness Peony had obtained two new abilities, one new exclusive skill, and two new divine kingdom abilities. None of these abilities, exclusive skills, or divine kingdom abilities disappointed Lin Yuan.","In particular, the two abilities Starlight Teleportation and Starlight Sacrifice could be linked with the exclusive skill Light Attraction Branch. It allowed the Star Vastness Peony to obtain an ability similar to the Astronomical Parliament but completely different.","The Star Vastness Peony’s Eternal ability, Starlight Teleportation, might open up a new situation for Lin Yuan’s development.."]},{"number":2960,"title":"Chapter 2960 Beginning a New Structure!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2960 Beginning a New Structure!","....","Starlight Teleportation was an extremely simple ability to explain. It was a means of communicating between two objects connected by starlight. With the starlight bond as the core, the two objects could communicate with each other through telepathy.","The Astronomical Parliament needed to pull a target into the Astronomical Parliament before the target could interact with resources and information.","Moreover, interacting with resources required a large amount of willpower and law power. If not for the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, Lin Yuan would not have been able to pay the required faith.","Moreover, those who were truly powerful did not need to use everything they had to achieve a certain wish.","Under the enhancement of the ability Starlight Sacrifice, the starlight connection became even more stable.","Lin Yuan could directly make one-on-one deals with the powerful rulers of the various factions through the Starlight Bond and negotiate cooperation.","However, it was too difficult for Starlight to locate a person. Even if the Star Vastness Peony had reached the Holy Spirit level, it was very difficult to directly locate a person through the star map in the sky.","Fortunately, the exclusive skill Light Drawing Branch that the Star Vastness Peony obtained after reaching Eternal allowed the Star Vastness Peony to split itself and consume its own root power to produce secondary flowers","These secondary flowers could be used as coordinates for the main flower. As long as the target had the secondary flower produced by the Star Vastness Peony, Lin Yuan could use Starlight Teleportation to interact with the target’s information and resources at any time.","Interacting with the information and resources of the truly powerful was not an easy task.","However, Lin Yuan had enough trump cards.","The Creator resources in Lin Yuan’s hands could tempt any faction. Moreover, the Creator resources in Lin Yuan’s hands would continue to be innovated in the future and become more and more advanced. This was because Morbius’ grade and quality would increase again.","If Lin Yuan were to trade resources with the City Lord of Treasure City, Li Feng, and Fortune Treasure Palace, he would need to go through a lot of trouble. Furthermore, it would take a long time for the resources to be delivered.","Through the Star Vastness Peony, Lin Yuan could complete the interaction between the two sides’ resources promptly.","Treasure City was a large city that focused on trade. Not only were there many chambers of commerce coming and going in Treasure City every day but there were also a large number of chambers of commerce in Treasure City.","Furthermore, Treasure City could be considered the largest trading city closest to the North of the Lonely River.","As a sponsor of Treasure City, Lin Yuan felt that he needed to deepen his communication with Li Feng. Therefore, he felt that it was necessary to hand over the Star Vastness Peony to Li Feng.","The Star Vastness Peony could consume its own root energy to separate the flower stalks. It could replenish the consumed source energy through pure spirit qi.","Separating the secondary flower would not have any effect on the Star Vastness Peony itself.","The only inconvenience was that the Star Vastness Peony needed at least two months of cooldown time to separate a secondary flower.","Therefore, Lin Yuan would not easily hand the secondary flower over to others.","For example, the person in charge of Fortune Treasure Palace in Treasure City, Zhan Lu, did not have the qualifications to obtain a branch.","Now that Lin Yuan and Zhan Lu had formed a good relationship, Zhan Lu could help Lin Yuan search for and trade the resources he needed. This relationship was enough for Lin Yuan.","It was inevitable that he would alarm the true upper echelons of the Fortune Treasure Palace by conducting such a large transaction with Zhan Lu.","If the true upper echelons of Fortune Treasure Palace wanted to come into contact with Lin Yuan, they would have a higher authority to trade resources than Zhan Lu. Only then would Lin Yuan consider releasing a branch of the Star Vastness Peony.","The Star Vastness Peony obtained divine kingdom ability Star Forming Blossom","If Star Forming Blossom was found out by other Divine Kingdom elites, they would probably be envious of the Star Vastness Peony.","Star Forming Blossom would allow the Star Vastness Peony to communicate better with the stars and obtain faith power from them.","Many species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds worshiped celestial bodies. They would treat a certain star as the guardian star of their species.","Once this thought was born, the living beings of this species would provide faith power to the stars in the sky. After the Star Vastness Peony reached an intimate relationship with this star, it could obtain a portion of the faith in this star to increase its strength.","This meant that Lin Yuan did not need to take care of the Star Vastness Peony in the future and the Star Vastness Peony could quickly increase its strength.","As the Star Vastness Peony was a fey Lin Yuan had spirit locked, Lin Yuan did not contract it with his spiritual energy.","This meant that the Star Vastness Peony’s strength would not have an upper limit.","The divine kingdom ability that the Star Vastness Peony obtained after stepping into the Holy Spirit level did not help the Star Vastness Peony increase its ability to obtain faith.","It could be said that the divine kingdom ability that the Star Vastness Peony obtained after stepping into the Holy Spirit level had nothing to do with the divine kingdom ability that the Star Vastness Peony obtained after advancing to the Divine Kingdom level.","However, in terms of ability, the Star Vastness Peony’s new divine kingdom ability was not weak at all. In fact, it could even be said to be rather strong.","The Star Vastness Peony’s divine kingdom ability Star Forming Blossom had only helped the Star Vastness Peony solve the problem of improving its strength.","However, the Star Vastness Peony obtained the divine kingdom ability Star Brewing Spirit Forging after stepping into the Holy Spirit level. By brewing the power of the stars and combining it with its own faith power, it could heal the injuries of other living beings and holy spirits.","The Star Vastness Peony was the first of Lin Yuan’s feys that could heal holy spirits.","Lin Yuan had learned from the City Lord’s residence that Holy Spirit experts rarely made enemies with experts of the same level because they were afraid of damaging their roots. On the other hand, they were also afraid that their holy spirits would be harmed if they fought with their divine kingdoms.","The ability to heal holy spirits was not a unique ability, but it rarely existed in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Many Holy Spirit experts were unable to heal when their holy spirits were injured.","Now that he had the Star Vastness Peony’s divine kingdom ability Star Brewing Spirit Forging, if anyone’s divine kingdom in Sky City or faith country was damaged in the future, the Star Vastness Peony could help them recover their province and save them a lot of trouble.","Summer, Winter, and the Cleansing Breath Soil looked at the Star Vastness Peony in surprise. The growth of the Star Vastness Peony had clearly exceeded their expectations.","When the energy in the ground was exhausted, Winter stepped forward and said to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, all the members of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants have been gathered. I’ve placed them just outside of this forest. Those Titan Rhinoceros Elephants have not eaten for the past two days. Do you think we should control them one by one? These Titan Rhinoceros Elephants will definitely create great value for Sky City’s prosperity in the future!”","Lin Yuan knew what Winter meant. The Titan Rhinoceros Elephants did not have a large population and Winter hoped that he could control them one by one.","Many Titan Rhinoceros Elephants had yet to reach World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, so Lin Yuan could only control a portion of the members.","Compared to using the Faith Tree to control the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, Lin Yuan preferred to control the entire Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.","Lin Yuan stored the Star Vastness Peony in the Spirit Lock spatial zone and said to Winter, “Let’s go. After taking control of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, we can quickly go back and give the Cleansing Breath Soil an explanation. We can directly bring the Cleansing Breath Soil to take a look at its partner who’s about to become a higher faerie.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, the Cleansing Breath Soil, which had just obtained a large amount of resources, calmed down.","There was indeed a faerie under this young man’s command, but this faerie might not be able to meet its standards. The Cleansing Breath Soil did not believe that Lin Yuan could arrange a higher faerie for it.","The Cleansing Breath Soil might even be able to accept a lower faerie if it was able to obtain so many resources every day.","Lin Yuan took control over the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants extremely quickly so he had the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant experts above the Divine Kingdom level release their fountains of faith and holy spirits.","The members of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants who had not reached the Divine Kingdom level would be reared by Lin Yuan until they reached it.","...","While Lin Yuan was controlling the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants, the other Bloodian clans in the Scarlet Territory had already set off for the Blue Shark Sea to attack the mermaids. A large-scale battle between the mermaids and the Bloodians was about to begin.","Qin Yu found a reason to take Fan Lou under her wing. The last time he came to the Elise clan’s territory, Fan Lou already had the blood of the Bloodians flowing in his body.","Qin Yu wanted to keep Fan Lou. Facing Qin Yu, the newly promoted Bloodian queen, Yi Xue did not dare to say anything.","Afraid that Qin Yu would be dissatisfied if he said anything more, he could only obediently hand Fan Lou over.","As Fan Lou had become a Bloodian under the protection of the Elisa clan, even the Lonely River’s four major species formed a relationship with the Elisa clan.","Fan Lou knew that Qin Yu was Lin Yuan’s subordinate but the Lonely River’s four major species did not know about this.","The envoys of the Lonely River’s four major species were very excited about getting involved with the Elisa clan and pinned all of this on Fan Lou. They thought that Fan Lou had brought benefits to them so they became even more respectful to Fan Lou than before.","Fan Lou did not explain to the four Lonely River envoys. Firstly, the matter of controlling the Elisa clan was obviously a secret, and Fan Lou would never take the initiative to leak Lin Yuan’s secret.","Secondly, Fan Lou was also enjoying being respected by the envoys of the four major species of the Lonely River.","In the beginning, the envoys were very resistant to the idea of going to the Blue Shark Sea to join the operation against the mermaids. It was obvious that they were unwilling to get involved in this mess.","However, due to Lin Yuan’s instructions, they had no choice but to do so.","But now, the envoys of the four species of Lonely River did not dare to show any dissatisfaction in front of Fan Lou.","Rather, they constantly tried to use Fan Lou to please Qin Yu.","Qin Yu felt that the envoys of the four species of Lonely River were a little stupid. They really could not understand the crux of the matter. How could the shrimp soldiers and crab generals in the Lonely River be qualified to come into contact with a Bloodian queen?","In fact, Fan Lou could already kick out the four species of Lonely River. They could no longer help Fan Lou.","However, Fan Lou did not do so. On the contrary, he would sometimes take the initiative to advise the envoys. No matter how stupid the envoys were, they were still Lin Yuan’s subordinates.","Before the battle against the mermaids ended, the status of the Lonely River’s four species among the Bloodians would only increase.","Fan Lou could tolerate the envoys but he was no longer willing to bother with the Andra clan.","Fan Lou had suffered a lot in the Andra clan and he had almost died in the Andra clan’s territory.","It was true that Lin Yuan had Fan Lou’s back. But if Feng Qing really attacked Fan Lou, Fan Lou would not be able to resist at all.","Every step Fan Lou took was a cautious one. This made Fan Lou especially dislike the members of the Andra clan.","Fan Lou had become a Bloodian because of the blood essence provided by the Andra clan. The level of blood essence provided by the Andra clan to Fan Lou was too low.","It took Qin Yu a lot of effort to Fan Lou improve his bloodline and Fan Lou suffered greatly.","In fact, the Andra clan had an even higher level of blood essence. However, the Andra clan had never thought of giving an even higher level of blood essence to him.","Even though the envoys of the four species of Lonely River had established a relationship with the Elisa clan, they still chose to befriend the Andra clan.","Fan Lou had never thought of interfering.","However, the envoys of the four races of the Lonely River were always acting as the messengers of the Andra clan.","Putting aside his attitude towards the Andra clan, the higher-ups of the Andra clan did not think that they could rely on themselves to establish a relationship with the Elisa clan, right?!","Qin Yu’s good attitude meant that Lin Yuan must have given her an explanation.","Qin Yu was abnormally cold to the other Bloodian clans. Perhaps only those clans with the current queen or had a long legacy of a queen bloodline could meet her standards.","A few months ago, the Andra clan was still a colossus in the eyes of Fan Lou. But now, the Andra clan was like a clown in Fan Lou’s eyes.","“Brother Fan Lou, it looks like it will be a long time before we reach the Blue Shark Sea. The Andra clan’s leader, Yi Xue, is preparing to hold a banquet after tonight’s journey ends. He will take out the blood wine that has been stored for at least a thousand years to entertain you. Are you interested...?”","Ink Thorn was interrupted by Fan Lou before he could finish speaking.","“Ink Thorn, I thought we were friends. Apart from helping each other, friends have to respect each other. I’ve rejected you more than three times regarding the Andra clan. I’ve turned you down three times. Don’t you see what I mean?”","At this point, Fan Lou realized that Ink Thorn’s eyes were filled with displeasure. This made Fan Lou’s tone turn cold.","“Ink Thorn, you’ve been in the Scarlet Territory for a long time. Don’t forget why you’re here. Our purpose here isn’t for you to befriend a faction, but to help Lord Lin Yuan! What I’m going to do from now on will have nothing to do with the Andra clan. Do you think I need to waste my time and energy on the Andra clan?”"]},{"number":2961,"title":"Chapter 2961 The Queen’s Blood Bestowed!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2961 The Queen’s Blood Bestowed!","....","The expression on Ink Thorn’s face kept changing as he listened to Fan Lou’s words. Cold sweat began to seep out of his forehead and back.","The words of Fan Lou were extremely clear.","It was also the first time in a long time that Fan Lou had taken the initiative to criticize Ink Thorn.","Apart from expressing his dissatisfaction with Ink Thorn, he also reminded Ink Thorn not to forget his purpose of representing the Dark Pufferfish in the Scarlet Territory.","Befriending the Andra clan would not bring any benefits to the Dark Pufferfish.","Fan Lou’s sharp reminder brought Ink Thorn back to his senses. Ink Thorn quickly realized the problem with his current method.","In fact, befriending the Andra clan was not as beneficial as he had imagined.","Like Fan Lou, he had submitted to Lin Yuan. He had come to the Scarlet Territory to cooperate with Fan Lou, so he should follow his will. His previous approach had already deviated from this point.","Ink Thorn was afraid that Lin Yuan would be dissatisfied with his actions. Once Lin Yuan was dissatisfied with him, he could be replaced at any time.","His status might be important in the Dark Pufferfish, but he was dispensable to Lin Yuan.","Thinking of this, Ink Thorn hurriedly bent down and said, “Brother Fan Lou, I was insensible. I actually didn’t understand what I should do. I’m extremely sorry. I’ll immediately make adjustments. I definitely won’t do anything that will affect you in the future!”","Seeing that Ink Thorn had listened, Fan Lou reached out and patted his shoulder.","“It’s good that you can figure out matters yourself. You know very well what kind of attitude I’ve always had towards you. If you cooperate with me, I have the right to command you.","“You should be one of my subordinates, but when have you ever seen me order you around? I’ve always treated you like a friend. But you have to understand what you should do and what you should do!","“You said something wrong just now. What you’re doing is not affecting me, but Lord Lin Yuan’s plan. You’re more familiar with the envoys of the other three species of the Lonely River than I am. I hope that you can represent me and give them some advice. From now on, keep a distance from the Andra clan!","“The Dark Pufferfish can produce toxins that restrict the abilities of water creatures. You are an extremely important resource to all the Bloodians. If you get too close to one of the clans, the other clans will definitely think something is wrong. There will likely be twists and turns!”","Fan Lou’s status in Lin Yuan’s heart had increased greatly, but he did not have the chance to come into contact with the other members of Sky City. Therefore, no matter how stupid the people of the Lonely River were, Fan Lou had to befriend them.","When Fan Lou was working for Lin Yuan, he had contributed as much as he could and tried his best to help Lin Yuan.","However, Fan Lou also had to consider himself.","Ink Thorn was extremely touched by Fan Lou’s words. He could feel that Fan Lou really treated him as a brother.","Even biological brothers might not be able to help him analyze the pros and cons like Fan Lou.","“Brother Fan Lou, if I succeed in the future, I will definitely do my best to repay you! From now on, no matter what happens, I’ll inform you immediately. I hope you can help me make more decisions in the future.”","Fan Lou said with a smile, “Since you’ve already figured out the pros and cons of this matter, it’s over. After this operation ends, you’ll most likely return to the Lonely River. When we return, the envoys of the four species will definitely be rewarded.","“It’s all thanks to you that my mission was completed so smoothly. If Lord Lin Yuan asks me about you, I will put in a good word for you. I believe that you will definitely succeed one day!”","Fan Lou was just being polite. He could not say for sure if Ink Thorn would be able to stand out in the future. However, from what Ink Thorn had done recently, he could not be considered a smart person. Lin Yuan had never liked idiots.","Although Fan Lou’s words were polite, they greatly encouraged Ink Thorn. This was because all the actions of the Lonely River’s four species were led by the Dark Pufferfish. In addition, Ink Thorn and Fan Lou were the closest.","Even if the other envoys were unwilling to admit it, Ink Thorn could still be considered the leader of their operations.","...","Ink Thorn conveyed Fan Lou’s teachings to the rest. Ink Thorn’s words enlightened the other envoys. The three of them could not help but express their gratitude to Ink Thorn.","...","Yi Xue, the leader of the Andra clan, anxiously awaited updates from Ink Thorn and his companions. Despite the loss of Fan Lou, who had been selected by Qin Yu to join the Elisa clan, the Andra clan maintained its ties with the four species of the Lonely River, enabling them to negotiate deals with them.","Recently, Yi Xue had invited those envoys many times in exchange for more Dark Pufferfish venom because the Bloodians had already begun to take action against the mermaids.","In order to prevent losing too many members, the various clans wanted to obtain the opportunity to trade with the Dark Pufferfish. This made the Andra clan, which was on good terms with the four species of the Lonely River, famous.","As it was not difficult to exchange for the Dark Pufferfish venom from Ink Thorn, Yi Xue had traded a lot of the venom. This allowed the Andra clan to earn a lot of resources from the other Bloodians.","Of course, this method of getting rich also caused dissatisfaction among many Bloodian clans, especially those who were on good terms with the Andra clan. These Bloodian clans had hoped that the Andra clan would introduce them to the Lonely River’s four species, but the Andra clan did not have such intentions at all. They were only thinking of ways to earn resources.","The Allen clan was already separated from the Andra clan because of the previous incident. Due to the Andra clan’s unwillingness to recommend the four Lonely River species to the Allen clan, the latter publicly expressed that they had broken off relations with the Andra clan, which made things extremely ugly.","Actually, Yi Xue had always regretted making Lin Yuan unhappy because of his hesitation.","Since he could not save his relationship with Lin Yuan, Yi Xue hoped that he could establish a relationship with the Elisa clan.","Because Qin Yu had become a Bloodian Queen, the Elisa clan was at their peak in the Scarlet Territory. If they could build a relationship with the Elisa Clan, the Andra Clan would also enter the fast track of development.","The best way to get close to the Elisa Clan was to get back on good terms with Fan Lou.","Apart from not being able to guarantee Fan Lou’s safety in the Andra clan, Yi Xue felt that he had always treated Fan Lou well.","After all, Fan Lou had been a member of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves at that time. It was not appropriate for the Andra Clan to directly interfere in their internal affairs.","Furthermore, Fan Lou was not that important in Yi Xue’s eyes. He never expected that an inconspicuous fellow like Fan Lou would be fancied by Qin Yu.","The blood wine had been meticulously prepared, a lavish gesture meant to honor Fan Lou and Yi Xue. Though using thousand-year-old blood wine might seem extravagant, it was deemed necessary to convey sincerity, prompting the use of several jars.","However, despite the preparations, neither Fan Lou nor Ink Thorn, along with the other envoys, made an appearance.","After a prolonged wait, Yi Xue reluctantly dispatched someone to reach out to Ink Thorn and the others. Eventually, word came from Ink Thorn, expressing his regrets and citing inconvenience as the reason for his absence. This news fueled Yi Xue’s anger.","It was true that the Andra clan had made efforts to reach out to the four species of the Lonely River, and reciprocally, the envoys had shown interest in fostering friendship with the Andra clan. Such efforts had led to numerous successful deals between the two sides.","Why did the envoys stop being ambiguous with the Andra clan after meeting Fan Lou? Why did they distance themselves from the Andra clan?","Ink Thorn would definitely not cut ties with the Andra clan on the surface. This would not benefit him at all. The best way to avoid contact with the Andra clan was to slowly alienate them. That way, the Andra clan wouldn’t be able to find trouble with him.","The four species of the Lonely River did not have a strong backer like Fan Lou in the Scarlet Territory. They had to be careful.","...","Qin Yu had been paying close attention to Fan Lou and knew that he had rejected the Andra clan’s invitation.","Tonight, Qin Yu invited Fan Lou to dinner. While they were eating, Qin Yu asked, “Why have you been staying with the Andra clan? Do you have any conflicts with them?”","Fan Lou said truthfully, “Your Excellency Qin Yu, I didn’t stay with the Andra clan previously. I stayed in the Andra clan’s Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. I didn’t have much contact with the Andra clan.","“The Andra clan thinks that I’m of some use because I have a close relationship with the four species of the Lonely River. When I was dealing with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, they left me with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. I don’t have any conflicts with the Andra clan, but that doesn’t mean that we need to interact more.","“It’s not difficult to guess why the Andra clan contacted me. It must be because they want to use me to cozy up to the Elisa clan. If I take the initiative to accept the invitation, wouldn’t it be equivalent to giving the Andra clan a chance to climb up?”","Fan Lou had always shown enough respect to Qin Yu, but Fan Lou did not treat her as a high and mighty existence. Instead, he treated Qin Yu as Lin Yuan’s subordinate.","Therefore, Fan Lou addressed Qin Yu as Your Excellency, not Lordess.","He was very honest with Qin Yu.","Qin Yu really liked the way Fan Lou talked to her and interacted with her. If Fan Lou was overly respectful at every second, Qin Yu would really have nothing to talk to him about.","“If Lord Lin Yuan hadn’t made the request, or if it weren’t for your mission, there’d be no need for you to initiate contact with the Andra clan. Your future won’t solely revolve around the Bloodians anymore.","“Lord Lin Yuan expressed his desire for me to assist you in joining the Honor Absent Parliament. I recall that the leader of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves is also a member. However, since your strength hasn’t reached the Holy Spirit level, even if I recommend you, your status within the Honor Absent Parliament will be limited. Membership status there is primarily based on strength.","“Though your influence within the Honor Absent Parliament may initially be modest, it will still afford you certain privileges. Thus, you can begin looking ahead.","“Until you officially join the Honor Absent Parliament, I won’t introduce you to other factions. Once you’re a member, I’ll broaden your connections.","“You’ve recently become a pureblood Bloodian. I urge you to concentrate on enhancing your strength in the days ahead. Should you require resources, don’t hesitate to inform me. I’ll gladly assist you.”","Ever since Qin Yu sensed how much Lin Yuan valued Fan Lou, she had the intention to befriend him.","She and Fan Lou were both under Lin Yuan’s command. With Lin Yuan’s resources, she could make Fan Lou a genuine Bloodian Queen.","If she befriended Fan Lou now, she might be able to borrow his strength in the future.","Fan Lou felt deeply moved. Lin Yuan had given him a fresh start in life.","As Lin Yuan had been discussing Fan Lou’s arrangements, he had presented them with remarkable simplicity. Fan Lou was aware of Lin Yuan’s plans for him, thanks to Qin Yu.","In Qin Yu’s presence, Fan Lou concealed his emotions, expressing respect by clenching his fist.","“Your Excellency Qin Yu, Lord Lin Yuan has already provided resources for me to enhance my strength. I will utilize them diligently. Thank you for your care. I am committed to focusing on my strength during this period. If you require my assistance in this operation, please do not hesitate to inform me. Frankly, I have never battled a mermaid before!”","Qin Yu interjected, “The Elisa clan has specialized warriors for combating mermaids. There’s no need for you to take action. While Lord Lin Yuan has furnished resources to enhance your strength, he may not have included Bloodian blood essence, correct?","“To aid in fortifying your bloodline, I will offer you a portion of my blood essence. This Queen-level blood essence will assist in elevating your Bloodian lineage.”","This time, Fan Lou did not reject Qin Yu. He bowed to her and said, “Then I’ll thank you in advance!”","...","While the Bloodians were heading toward the Blue Shark Sea, Lin Yuan had already brought the Cleansing Breath Soil and the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants to the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","These Titan Rhinoceros Elephants were not easy to settle down. Firstly, they were too big. Secondly, it was a huge problem for these Titan Rhinoceros Elephants to survive and eat.","Lin Yuan had just solved the problem of food and clothing in the faith country and the granary had yet to be built. He did not have that many Soldier Ration Radishes to feed the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.","For the foreseeable future, Lin Yuan’s resources could barely maintain the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.","If he wanted to solve all the problems, he would have to wait until Four Seasons Mountain transformed into a faerie and fused with the Cleansing Breath Soil.","The only way to satisfy the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ appetite was to let Four Seasons Mountain become a high-level faerie and combine it with the Cleansing Breath Soil."]},{"number":2962,"title":"Chapter 2962: Realm Abyss Red Lotus!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2962: Realm Abyss Red Lotus!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The leader of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants was named Xiang Yu. His body had already reached 490,000 meters and was on the brink of hitting 500,000 meters.","Reaching a body length of 500,000 meters posed a significant challenge for the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.","After relocating, Lin Yuan informed Xiang Yu that they could only sustain basic food and clothing for a short time. While Xiang Yu found this difficult to accept, he ultimately agreed.","Xiang Yu rushed to the scene when he heard Xiang Da summoning his members.","After knowing that Xiang Da was controlled by another living being, Xiang Yu resisted intensely. But in the end, his resistance was ineffective. Xiang Yu knew very well that there was an extremely distant and insurmountable gap between his and Winter’s strength.","Although Titan Rhinoceros Elephants were gargantuan, their energy usage was no different from that of ordinary creatures of the same grade, and it might even be weaker.","Indeed, with their physique, Titan Rhinoceros Elephants could cause immeasurable damage by colliding with a target.","However, they also had an obvious weakness. Once enemy units landed on them, they could wreak havoc on their bodies, turning them into living targets.","Titan Rhinoceros Elephants could summon their fellow members when encountering such situations.","Xiang Yu did not have the ability to refuse. He feared that if he did, Lin Yuan would replace him with a Titan Rhinoceros Elephant over 400 ,ooo meters long.","Even in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, a secluded race like Titan Rhinoceros Elephants understood the need to adapt and submit to the situation.","As long as they obtained a certain amount of food every day, the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants could survive for a long time, thanks to their reserve energy.","Xiang Yu was very tempted by Lin Yuan’s war fortress plan. If he could build a war fortress on theirs backs and attach metal armor to them, the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants would make up for a huge shortcoming!","The Cleansing Breath Soil was in Lin Yuan’s hands, and he was prepared to combine it with a high-grade faerie.","As long as this matter was completed, the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants could have as much food as they wanted. Compared to being reared and fed while searching for food everywhere, this was not a bad thing for the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.","The moment Lin Yuan returned, he asked Wen Yu to build a territory for the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants.","There were all kinds of species in the faith country, and they had all kinds of beliefs.","Some species believed in the stars while others worshiped giants. The Titan Rhinoceros Elephants were also a way for Lin Yuan to collect faith.","Lin Yuan brought the Cleansing Breath Soil to the foot of Four Seasons Mountain.","Lin Yuan told the Cleansing Breath Soil, “This is your future companion. Take a look and see if you’re satisfied.”","As the Cleansing Breath Soil beheld Four Seasons Mountain, it found itself unable to avert its gaze. The mountain stood tall, reaching into the sky, its distinct seasonal beauty captivating the observer. The aura of the four seasons permeated the air, enchanting the Cleansing Breath Soil.","Sensing the potential within Four Seasons Mountain, the Cleansing Breath Soil recognized that it was on the verge of ascending to a higher faerie form.","The union of the Cleansing Breath Soil with Four Seasons Mountain practically guaranteed the mountain’s elevation to a higher faerie status.","Amidst the presence of other faeries in the vicinity, the Cleansing Breath Soil remained uninterested, its focus solely on Four Seasons Mountain.","Even Begin Lady, an intermediate faerie born from a river, failed to capture the attention of the Cleansing Breath Soil.","The Cleansing Breath Soil spoke before Lin Yuan could say anything. “Can you guarantee that you can help it withstand the Heaven’s Trial when it transforms into a higher faerie? If you can guarantee that I can merge with it now!”","Lin Yuan smiled when he heard that. He liked the Cleansing Breath Soil’s proactive attitude. This meant that the Cleansing Breath Soil had indeed taken a fancy to Four Seasons Mountain.","As the saying went, you could lead a horse to water, but you could not make it drink. If the Cleansing Breath Soil did not like Four Seasons Mountain, forcing it to merge with it would inevitably cause conflicts to arise in the future.","“I’ve already prepared everything here. You can combine with Four Seasons Mountain now. I will definitely be able to help it complete its transformation in five days. You don’t have to worry about this!”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s affirmative reply, the Cleansing Breath Soil did not say anything else and went straight to Four Seasons Mountain. It took root on it and gradually melted into it.","Lin Yuan took a deep breath and thought, Four Seasons Mountain has finally welcomed the opportunity to transform. Once Four Seasons Mountain completes its transformation, the development of Sky City and the faith country will greatly improve.","During these five days, Lin Yuan prepared to nurture the Abyss Red Lotus. The Abyss Red Lotus had already evolved from Sovereign/lmmortal IV to Sovereign/Eternal X.","When it reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, there was a high chance that the Abyss Red Lotus’ bloodline would undergo a transformation.","Whenever Lin Yuan had time, he would use his Body of All Spirits to nourish the Abyss Red Lotus.","Before Lin Yuan could head to the Spirit Lock spatial zone to nurture the Abyss Red Lotus, the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ramet in Lin Yuan’s hand received a message from Zhan Lu.","[Zhan Lu]: Young Master Lin, I’ve secured the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone","Flower ortets you desired. However, my efforts to procure a large quantity caught the attention of one of the supervisors, who then alerted a leader at Fortune Treasure Palace. They wish to speak with you directly. Would you do me the honor?","Upon sending this message, Zhan Lu harbored deep resentment toward the headquarters’ administrator. He had always relied on Lin Yuan as his exclusive channel. Each time Lin Yuan conducted trades, Zhan Lu reaped substantial benefits.","The supervisor showed no deference and promptly informed a leader, who now sought direct communication with Lin Yuan. Going forward, Lin Yuan may find it more advantageous to deal directly with this leader for resource exchanges.","Zhan Lu hoped that Lin Yuan would reject him.","Lin Yuan was in a very good mood when he saw Zhan Lu’s message.","Firstly, it was because Zhan Lu had obtained enough Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortets for him. Secondly, his transaction had finally attracted the attention of a Fortune Treasure Palace leader.","Zhan Lu had never been Lin Yuan’s ideal partner. If Lin Yuan wanted to deepen his cooperation with Fortune Treasure Palace, he would definitely need to work with the real person in charge.","[Lin Yuan]: Thank you for obtaining these Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortets for me. The resources I promised you won’t be little! Since a leader wants to see me, how can I refuse?","Zhan Lu’s heart broke when he saw Lin Yuan’s message, but he did not dare to complain.","[Zhan Lu]: Since that’s the case, Young Master Lin, when will you have time to meet this leader? He said that he can rush over immediately if you give him a location.","Lin Yuan would absolutely not permit the leader to venture to North of the Lonely River.","Should he head there, he would uncover the secret of Sky City.","Should the leader indeed surface in North of the Lonely River, Lin Yuan wouldn’t contemplate cooperation; rather, he’d strategize removing him.","The Star Vastness Peony had just produced a ramet after stepping into the Holy Spirit level. Since that was the case, he would hand the first ramet produced by the Star Vastness Peony to this leader!","[Lin Yuan]: The person I sent to see you hasn’t set off yet. He will give you a flower that can condense starlight. When the time comes, that leader will naturally be able to meet me!","After saying that, Lin Yuan found Jin Chen and prepared to send him to Treasure City.","Lin Yuan gave Jin Chen the list of materials to trade for the Star Vastness Peony and a fey storage box.","After receiving these resources, Jin Chen felt that he was valued by Lin Yuan.","Ever since Jin Chen had been by Lin Yuan’s side, he had not had much of a presence. There were too many powerful people around Lin Yuan, so Jin Chen did not dare to ask Lin Yuan too much.","If he was stronger than Lin Yuan, he would have the qualifications to make requests.","However, the strength that he had always been proud of was now considered weak in Lin Yuan’s camp. Now, Jin Chen was finally relieved.","“I’m very familiar with Treasure City. It will take nearly 10 days to go back and forth. I have the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower you gave me. I can use it to contact you at any time. If anything unexpected happens, I’ll inform you immediately.”","It was not difficult for Jin Chen to help him transport this batch of supplies.","Jin Chen was completely under Lin Yuan’s control, so the latter was not worried about him.","After dealing with these matters, Lin Yuan entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone and summoned the Abyss Red Lotus.","During this period, Lin Yuan had been letting the Abyss Red Lotus grow freely and had not paid much attention to its situation.","The color of the Abyss Red Lotus was even more red than before. Thin golden patterns appeared on its originally pitch-black roots. It was obvious that there were some changes to the bloodline of the Abyss Red Lotus as it advanced in grade.","Lin Yuan used True Data to investigate the Abyss Red Lotus.","[Fey Name]: Realm Abyss Red Lotus [Fey Species]: Realm abyss red lotus species/realm abyss red lotus genus","[Fey Grade]: High Sovereign (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Fire/Wood [Fey Quality]: Eternal X","Abilities:","[Lotus Nirvana]: After making a decision to self-destruct, all the energy in its body will be gathered inside the seed. When the seed sprouts, the life and bloodline will be passed on.","[Splendor of Fire]: Fill the area with fire-elemental energy. All other energies besides fire-elemental energy will be eliminated and the ability of other lifeforms to control fire-elemental energy will be removed.","[Hellfire Lotus Imprint]: The lotus imprint will place a lock on the target and prevent it from gaining energy. Every layer of lotus imprint added will strengthen the lock on the target’s energy and bloodline.","[Cleansing Aura Lotus Flames]: The flames will transform into a lotus coffin. Choose a space and the flames will preserve it. Time and fixed entities will be preserved in their current condition.","[Lotus World Law]: Control the core of the world and issue orders to the lifeforms in the world. Those who were defiant would be blocked from receiving energy from that world.","[Hellfire Application]: Combine with other lifeforms and combine the energy of the world controlled by Lotus Locks the World with its own to boost itself.","[Burning Lotus Cleansing Dance]: The body will be burned up into nutrients","and turned into a lotus. The lotus will be in a cleansing state. Burning the main body will increase the effects of Hellfire Application and protect the worlds linked to Lotus Locks the World.","[Perfect Lotus Seat Shadow]: The lotus will turn into a lotus seat that protects the contractor’s feet. It will continuously project a lotus shadow to protect the contractor and remove all energy in the vicinity that could harm the contractor. It will also enable the contractor to gain all the world energy and world fusions it controls and the present world’s energy’s influence on the contractor will be reduced.","[Realm Lotus Breath]: Every time it goes to an unfamiliar area, even if the energy rules of this area are different from the energy laws it has, it can still integrate with the rules of this area through the lotus breath. This area will become a suitable environment for it and you will not be rejected by the laws.","Exclusive Skill:","[Red Lotus Hellfire]: A target’s karma, bloodline, and energy will be burned up. The flames will add the Hellfire Lotus Imprint on the target’s body.","[Lotus Locks the World]: When contact is made with the core of a world, the lotus roots will wrap around the world’s core. The core of the world will become an energy source for the lotus while the lotus takes over the world.","[Everything to Ashes]: Fire-elemental energy will nourish the body. All entities and energy can be burned and inject increasingly pure fire-elemental energy into itself. The higher the level of the burned entities and energy, the greater the impact on the roots if internal energy is lacking. (If the impact on the roots is too severe, the utilization of cleansing lotus might be affected).","[Lotus Creations]: Its bloodline will be injected into mature lotuses and the lotus roots will activate bloodline energy based on the injected bloodline. The energy in the lotuses will be sacrificed to turn the activated bloodline and its genes into a replicated lifeform.","[Sky-Repairing Lotus Roots]: When the divine kingdom constructed from faith power collapses or is damaged, its lotus roots can repair the damaged divine kingdom and recover it to its complete state.","[Illusory Lotus Faith]: Under the control of an area or the center of a world, all the faith power produced in this area will be absorbed by the illusory lotus. After the illusory lotus absorbs the faith power, it will purify it and transfer it to the designated target.","Lin Yuan realized that the Abyss Red Lotus bloodline, which had evolved into Sovereign/Eternal X, had transformed into a Realm Abyss Red Lotus.."]},{"number":2963,"title":"Chapter 2963 Lin Yuan’s Higher Faeries!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2963 Lin Yuan’s Higher Faeries!","....","Lin Yuan was very happy that his fey’s bloodline had undergone a transformation during the evolution process. He examined the abilities and exclusive skills obtained after the grade and quality of the Realm Abyss Red Lotus had increased.","Its High Sovereign ability was called Realm Lotus Breath. It was an ability where the Realm Abyss Red Lotus used its breath to ensure that Lin Yuan and the target fuse perfectly into any environment, even if the energy of the surroundings didn’t match Lin Yuan’s own energy. While it sounded a little niche, it was, in fact, extremely useful.","There were many mystic realms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. These mystic realms formed a small world of their own. They all had their own systems and rules. If Lin Yuan were to explore these mystic realms in the future, Realm Lotus Breath would be of great help to him.","Apart from these mystic realms, the Sky Beyond the Clouds also had many areas where specific species lived. For example, the death zones where dead lifeforms lived contained dense death energy, which had a huge impact on the living. With Realm Lotus Breath, even in such a dead zone, Lin Yuan would still be able to do well.","Just like how many lifeforms could create domains with their divine kingdoms, Realm Lotus Breath would reduce the impact of these domains on Lin Yuan. Coupled with the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s ability, Lin Yuan might be able to ignore the domains of other lifeforms in the future. It could be said that Realm Lotus Breath was extremely beneficial to Lin Yuan.","The exclusive skill that the Realm Abyss Red Lotus obtained after evolving to Eternal was called Illusory Lotus Faith. As the saying went, it was extremely blissful for a person to have a pillow when they were sleepy.","At present, Illusory Lotus Faith gave Lin Yuan a refreshing feeling of having a pillow when he was sleepy. Before the Abyss Red Lotus evolved into the Realm Abyss Red Lotus, it could use Lotus Locks the World to wrap its roots around the core of the world and use the world core as energy to form lotus roots to invade this world.","There were similar things like the Continent Vein Core in the various regions of the Sky Beyond the Clouds. When Lin Yuan occupied the King Blood Jackals’ territory, the Continent Vein Core had already been collected by Spring.","Now that Lin Yuan had occupied the Spinning Wings White Falcons’s territory, the Continent Vein Cores in the territories of the Spinning Wings White Falcons and the Titan Rhinoceros Elephant would be collected in spring.","The Realm Abyss Red Lotus could use Lotus Locks the World to control the area represented by these Continent Vein Cores.","Previously, Lin Yuan did not let the Realm Abyss Red Lotus control these Continent Vein Cores because he felt that it would not be of much use. The level of the Continent Vein Core in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was extremely high.","It would take a lot of time for the Realm Abyss Red Lotus to refine them and would affect the increase in the Realm Abyss Scarlet Lotus’ strength. But now, it was necessary for Lin Yuan to let the Realm Abyss Scarlet Lotus absorb the Continent Vein Cores.","This was because with Illusory Lotus Faith, the Ream Abyss Red Lotus could absorb the faith produced by all lifeforms in the area under its control and store this faith in the lotus that grew out of it.","This allowed Lin Yuan to solve the problem of distributing faith in the faith country without reverting the Faith Tree.","It was not easy to return the Faith Tree to its roots. Moreover, Lin Yuan was not sure how long it would take for it to do so. Not only could Illusory Lotus Faith absorb the faith power produced by the faith country, but it could also redistribute the faith power.","The Realm Abyss Red Lotus could also purify the faith power it absorbed with Illusion Lotus Faith.","Because there were too many species, the purity of faith collected from the faith country would definitely be slightly poorer.","However, the advantage of collecting faith like this was that it was abundant in quantity. If the Realm Abyss Red Lotus could purify faith, the value of the entire faith country would increase greatly from its original foundation.","At present, solving the problem of faith could be said to be a top priority.","Lin Yuan gave the Realm Abyss Scarlet Lotus the Continent Vein Cores he had found in the King Blood Jackals’ territory so that it could absorb them.","Although absorbing the Continent Vein Cores would waste the time of the Realm Abyss Red Lotus, to a certain extent, they would also enhance its strength. After absorbing these Continent Vein Cores, the Realm Abyss Red Lotus’ strength should be able to reach World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","Lin Yuan used his Body of All Spirits to nurture the Realm Abyss Red Lotus and injected a massive amount of spirit qi into it to help it refine the Continent Vein Cores.","If Lin Yuan had not gone to help Four Seasons Mountain pass the Heaven’s Trial to witness its transformation, he would have been helping the Realm Abyss Red Lotus refine the Continent Vein Cores.","In at most two months, the Realm Abyss Red Lotus would be able to complete the absorption of these Continent Vein Cores.","...","Lin Yuan brought Winter to the foot of Four Seasons Mountain.","Summer had been guarding the foot of Four Seasons Mountain all this time to inspect its situation. Once anything abnormal happened to Four Seasons Mountain, Summer would be able to help it immediately.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan rushing over with Winter, she said in an extremely serious tone, “Young Master, from the current situation of Four Seasons Mountain, it can already undergo a transformation at any time.","“However, what I mean is to let Four Seasons Mountain persist for a while longer so that it can fuse with the energy in the Cleansing Breath Soil. This way, it will be easier for Four Seasons Mountain to perfectly fuse with the Cleansing Breath Soil when it transforms into a higher faerie. At present, the fusion between the two is somewhat superficial.","“Four Seasons Mountain was merely serving as the host body of the Cleansing Breath Soil now, and their roots hadn’t shown any signs of fusing.","“I’ve been investigating and sensing the situation of Four Seasons Mountain and the Cleansing Breath Soil. Another day or two of accumulation won’t cause any harm to either of them.”","Summer conveyed the actual situation she observed to Lin Yuan. Prior to this, she hadn’t engaged in much communication with Four Seasons Mountain, as the current situation certainly required Lin Yuan to make decisions.","Lin Yuan nodded. If the current accumulation did not bring any harm to Four Seasons Mountain, Lin Yuan had no reason to refuse.","After the Realm Abyss Red Lotus obtained Illusory Lotus Faith, Lin Yuan no longer felt any pressure. He would no longer place all his hopes of reverting the Faith Tree to its ancestry on Four Seasons Mountain anymore.","Lin Yuan stood there quietly and watched as Four Seasons Mountain compressed the energy in its body. At the same time, he kept supplying spirit qi crystals to Four Seasons Mountain so that it would have sufficient spirit qi to absorb.","Two days later....","When Four Seasons Mountain’s energy compression reached its limit, it made a request to Lin Yuan. Lin Yuan agreed to Four Seasons Mountain’s bloodline transformation request.","The aura of Four Seasons Mountain suddenly spread out, causing the color of the entire world to change. The entire world clearly felt the impact.","Winter and Summer hurriedly released their aura and enveloped the surroundings around Four Seasons Mountain to ensure that its aura would not affect the surrounding area so extensively.","The transformation of Four Seasons Mountain into a faerie couldn’t be accomplished in just a day or two. During this period, Winter and Summer would use their aura to envelop Four Seasons Mountain. With Winter and Summer’s strength, as long as they employed some methods, they could prevent its aura from leaking out.","Although North of the Lonely River was a godforsaken place, it was completely out of touch with the outside world. However, the aura released by a higher faerie could still attract the attention of the outside world.","Begin Lady, Celestial Sight, Emerald Lady, and Gray Pool had already arrived in front of Lin Yuan. Sun Ningxiang had also rushed over.","During the awakening of the faerie bloodline and the transformation toward becoming a faerie, it was not suitable to remain on Four Seasons Mountain’s body.","This was the first time Sun Ningxiang had witnessed such a big scene and she was exhilarated.","Begin Lady, Celestial Sight, Emerald Lady, and Gray Pool acted like they were on a pilgrimage. They eagerly anticipated witnessing the birth of a higher faerie, knowing the profound impact it would have. Observing the transformation process allowed them to experience the unique aura released by the roots of a higher faerie’s bloodline.","Lin Yuan didn’t have the time to communicate with them because he was at the foot of Four Seasons Mountain, supplying it with a massive amount of resources. It was all thanks to the establishment of the faith country and Morbius’ hard work in collecting spirit qi crystals for Lin Yuan. Otherwise, Lin Yuan’s resources would not have been enough for Four Seasons Mountain.","After Four Seasons Mountain completed its metamorphosis, Lin Yuan would most likely run out of resources. However, it was worth it to spend more resources to nurture a higher faerie.","Four Seasons Mountain was transformed under Lin Yuan’s continuous efforts.","The aura of all four seasons enveloped Four Seasons Mountain in an eternal cycle. While Spring and Winter veiled its aura, they didn’t intentionally obstruct the natural flow of seasonal energies it emitted. This was because the mountain’s seasonal aura held immense benefits for all growth.","Spring and Winter did not completely block the Heaven’s Trial because Four Seasons Mountain needed its energy to help it fuse with the Cleansing Breath Soil.","Initially, the Cleansing Breath Soil had indeed submitted due to its inferior strength compared to Lin Yuan and the others. However, it reaped numerous benefits from following Lin Yuan.","As Lin Yuan fulfilled his promises to the Cleansing Breath Soil, the latter’s opinion toward him shifted, now recognizing his great kindness. Utilizing the Heaven’s Trial’s energy to refine Four Seasons Mountain itself, the benefits accrued by the mountain far surpassed what was expected.","The Cleansing Breath Soil’s roots were constantly fusing with the Four Seasons Mountain’s roots. During the fusion process, the Cleansing Breath Soil became even more grateful to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan sighed inwardly. It was all thanks to Spring and Winter. Otherwise, he would not have been able to help Four Seasons Mountain complete its transformation. Any one of the Heaven’s Trials that descended now could kill him.","In the end, Four Seasons Mountain evolved to a higher faerie as he wished. Judging from the process of Four Seasons Mountain’s transformation, Lin Yuan felt that it was all thanks to the Cleansing Breath Soil. Without it, it would probably be very difficult for Four Seasons Mountain to transform into a higher faerie.","...","While Four Seasons Mountain was undergoing its metamorphosis, Jin Chen had already rushed back from Treasure City. Not only was Jin Chen very familiar with Treasure City, but he was also a special honor guest.","Upon seeing Jin Chen help Lin Yuan with his affairs, Zhan Lu was astounded.","Zhan Lu and Jin Chen had a good personal relationship. He asked Jin Chen, “Brother Jin Chen, you’re getting so close to Young Master Lin. Are you helping him now?”","Zhan Lu was someone who understood the ways of the world. He wouldn’t directly inquire whether Jin Chen had joined Lin Yuan. as such a question would most likely make Jin Chen feel extremely awkward.","Jin Chen understood what Zhan Lu meant. He did not hide his relationship with Lin Yuan and said directly, “I’m already under Young Master’s command. I’m here to help him make a deal with you.”","After Jin Chen revealed his identity, regardless of how much Zhan Lu hinted or probed, he didn’t say much more and simply completed the mission according to Lin Yuan’s request.","After completing the mission, he immediately returned to the King Blood Jackals’ territory. Along the way, Jin Chen was very careful. He changed directions many times and only crossed the Lonely River after confirming that no one was following him.","Jin Chen had promised Lin Yuan to return within 10 days. He did not want to go back on his word on his first mission.","After returning to the territory, Jin Chen realized that Lin Yuan was helping Four Seasons Mountain evolve its bloodline, so he did not dare to disturb Lin Yuan. In any case, he had already completed his mission. It would not be good if he disturbed Lin Yuan when he was at his busiest.","Only when Jin Chen saw that Four Seasons Mountain had completed its transformation and became a higher faerie, did he dare to report to Lin Yuan.","“Young Master, I’ve already done what you arranged for me. These three fey storage boxes are filled with the resources on your list. I stored the ortet of the 33 Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers in my divine kingdom without any mistakes!”","With that, Jin Chen took out the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower from the divine kingdom.","Lin Yuan patted Jin Chen’s shoulder and said with a smile, “You’ve completed the mission well. From now on, you’ll stay on Four Seasons Mountain to harvest the Soldier Ration Radish planted there. This is the most suitable place for you to increase your strength.”","Lin Yuan accepted the Diamond Fey storage box from Jin Chen and carefully placed the 33 Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortets inside. Within the confines of the Spirit Lock spatial zone, these ortets would soon receive nurturing care from the Hundred Questions Beast army.","For Jin Chen, Lin Yuan’s gesture amounted to a significant reward. As a Sky Radish Endless Vine, Jin Chen already reaped substantial benefits from coexisting with Four Seasons Mountain. Moreover, the fusion of Four Seasons Mountain with the Cleansing Breath Soil only heightened these advantages.","Additionally, Lin Yuan granted Jin Chen unrestricted access to the Soldier Ration Radishes, enabling him to expedite his strength enhancement.","After living here for hundreds of years, Jin Chen felt that it was not impossible for him to surpass the Holy Spirit level, break free from its restrictions, and evolve to a higher level!"]},{"number":2964,"title":"Chapter 2964 Sky City That Was Targeted!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2964 Sky City That Was Targeted!","On one hand, Lin Yuan rewarded Jin Chen for his excellent performance in completing the mission assigned to him.","On the other hand, Jin Chen’s awareness of the value of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers for Sky City’s development played a significant role. Storing them in the divine kingdom ensured their safety, even in the event of an accident, as long as Jin Chen remained unharmed.","Lin Yuan admired Jin Chen’s foresight, contrasting it with Kani’s less careful approach to handling matters.","It had been five days since Jin Chen’s return to the faith country. Considering the timing, it was about time for the Palace Master of Fortune Treasure Palace to reach out to him.","The Star Vastness Peony’s secondary flower could directly release starlight energy to communicate with Lin Yuan. There was no need for the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower.","Lin Yuan had already told the Star Vastness Peony that once a request came from the ramet, he would arrange for it to meet the Palace Master directly using the connection made of starlight.","Lin Yuan shifted his gaze back to Four Seasons Mountain, which had evolved into a higher faerie.","While Lin Yuan was observing Four Seasons Mountain, it had already arrived in front of him. It knelt on one knee and said with cupped fists, “I successfully became a higher faerie with your help, Lord. I hope you can give me a name!”","For a faerie, a name held significant importance. Faeries typically chose their own names, and it was rare for them to seek help from others in naming themselves, as was the case now.","Four Seasons Mountain’s actions were both a form of gratitude and reliance on Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment before speaking. “You are a natural landscape nurtured by Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter. Your body is tainted with the aura of the four seasons. The changing of the four seasons is a cycle. Why don’t we call you Season Cycle?”","Season Cycle muttered the name that Lin Yuan had given it. “Thank you for giving me a name, Lord!”","Season Cycle’s human form was a black-haired girl who looked very cold. Her long black hair hung down to her feet and fluttered in the wind, looking exceptionally elegant.","The most memorable thing about Season Cycle was her eyes. She had heterochromatic eyes, with two different colors in each eye. Blue, green, orange, and white represented the colors of the four seasons. Her dazzling four-colored eyes alone would leave an unforgettable impression on people.","There was no need for Lin Yuan to use Morbius’ True Data to investigate Season Cycle.","“Lord, apart from using the aura of the four seasons to nourish everything, I can also use roots power to condense the Four Seasons paradise. In paradise, I can increase the comprehension of lifeforms of the world and help them nurture a special body composition.","“Once a lifeform obtains body composition in my Four Seasons paradise, it can use the aura of the four seasons to constantly improve its body composition!”","Season Cycle paused for a moment and looked at Begin Lady, “The way I bestowed body composition on other lifeforms is very similar to how Begin Lady used her own blood to help other lifeforms obtain the Sacred Wood bloodline.","“If I encounter problems or face death, the people who have obtained body composition in the Four Seasons paradise will be affected. The mildest consequence is losing body composition, where the vitality within the body diminished, resulting in a lifespan of less than twenty years. Heavier consequences entail the loss of life.”","Lin Yuan could not help but sigh in his heart. The abilities of a higher faerie were indeed much stronger than that of an intermediate faerie. Lin Yuan had a special body composition and was well aware of the benefits it could bring to a lifeform.","Season Cycle was located directly below Sky Sea and was protected by Sky City. If the safety of Season Cycle was compromised, the entire Sky City would fall. However, such a scenario was highly unlikely to occur. Furthermore, Season Cycle possessed astonishing strength.","Season Cycle was now stronger than Holy Spirit existences like Jin Chen and Kani. If anyone were to make a move on Season Cycle, their strength had to transcend the Holy Spirit level and reach the level of Liu Chen and Liu Yao.","Winter once discussed with Lin Yuan about how a lifeform could acquire its body composition. Only a very small portion of lifeforms’ body composition were innate. Most lifeforms’ body composition had to be nurtured.","In some special mystic realms, there was a spiritual ingredient called the Sacred Body Stone. A lifeform would absorb it into their body and fuse it with their bones, blood, and soul to become a stone core in their body. The Sacred Body Stone would then trigger a genetic model and create a body composition that was compatible with that lifeform.","The lifeform would be guided by the stone core and would have a clear understanding of what spiritual ingredients it should obtain to refine the stone core. When the stone core was completely dissolved in its body, this lifeform would awaken its body composition.","However, as opposed to obtaining the body composition bestowed by Season Cycle in the Four Seasons paradise, Lin Yuan was more inclined to find Sacred Body Stone for the Moon Empress, Wen Yu, Liu Jie, and Su Yiren so that they could obtain body compositions that were compatible with their bodies.","Lin Yuan believed that the body composition obtained in the Four Seasons paradise was more suitable as a reward for white-clothed followers to enhance their strength.","Lin Yuan had just arranged for Season Cycle to help Emerald Lady and Gray Pool to nurture the Soldier Ration Radishes when Wen Yu found him. “Young Master, Bei Xu sent me a message through the Thoughts Letter Paper and said that there is a group of people occupying the banks of the Lonely River. These people are most likely with a clear purpose in mind.”","“Bei Xu sent two groups of Stone Mantis Crabs to meet with them. However, they did not attack the two groups. Bei Xu suspects they are either targeting Sky City or the resources that the Crimson Heaven Falcons have been waiting for for so long.”","At present, Jin Chen was no longer by Lin Yuan’s side.","Lin Yuan glanced in the direction that Jin Chen had left and said, “Wen Yu, arrange for Liu Chen and Liu Yao to monitor this group of people closely. Don’t alert them for the time being. Let’s see what their goal is first!”","Lin Yuan found it implausible that these individuals had come for the Crimson Heaven Falcons. They had nested in North of the Lonely River for epochs, making it improbable for these newcomers to know when the spiritual ingredient they awaited would mature. Even if they possessed such knowledge, it seemed unlikely they would attack for such scarce resources.","Their assembly by the Lonely River suggested they were investigating matters on its opposite shore, oblivious to the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ situation. Thus, it could be inferred they were likely there for Jin Chen.","Lin Yuan recalled Jin Chen’s assurance that he hadn’t been followed upon his return. He also trusted Jin Chen wouldn’t intentionally invite trouble. If these people were connected to Jin Chen, it hinted at their superior strength, surpassing even Jin Chen’s Holy Spirit level. There must be beings above the Holy Spirit level among them, possibly more than one, to perceive Jin Chen as prey.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen currently lacked holy maids. Should these individuals dare to target Sky City, they could become prime candidates for such a role. Hopefully, one among them possessed a holy spirit meeting the criteria to serve as a holy maid.","Upon receiving Lin Yuan’s instructions, Wen Yu immediately arranged for Liu Chen and Liu Yao to monitor that group of people. Out of concern for Bei Xu’s safety, Wen Yu had asked Autumn to take care of him before informing Lin Yuan.","Autumn had always exuded an air of arrogance and aloofness toward many, but with Wen Yu, he displayed profound respect. This stemmed from Wen Yu’s equivalence to him and the others who once followed Lin Yuan. It was clear that Lin Yuan placed a deep trust in Wen Yu and his companions. As Wen Yu matured, she and Liu Jie might indeed become integral companions.","Despite Bei Xu’s low presence, he held a pivotal role within Sky City, greatly esteemed by Lin Yuan. Autumn stood ready to defend Bei Xu if needed, and on regular days, he oversaw territorial patrols.","On the banks of the Lonely River...","A group of people who looked ordinary but could not hide their hostility gathered together and roasted the fresh fish that they had just caught.","Among them, an one-eyed man cast a glance toward the Lonely River greedily and said fiercely, “Big Brother, could our information be wrong? Is that person really a special honor guest who traded resources from Fortune Treasure Palace?","“We’ve gone through all this trouble to follow him here and almost exhausted Sixth Brother’s aura-seeking earthworm to death. If we don’t get anything, we will have wasted our efforts. There’s nothing worth plundering here!”","“There are Four Species Overlords that have ruled the Lonely River for many years. They must have accumulated a lot of resources. Why don’t we plunder them first and give our brothers some assurance?”","Before the honest-looking man in the lead could speak, the red-eyed woman with two curved horns on her head gave the one-eyed man a fierce scolding, “Fifth Brother, remember that you are a star pirate, not a thief. There is no need to resort to thief tactics.","“Even if we really want to attack the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River, we have to first confirm the relationship between them and the Bloodians. Didn’t you hear that they are working with the Bloodians? Don’t offend the Bloodians over this matter. If we offend them, we’ll have to face the pursuit of some Bloodian clans!”","The one-eyed man gritted his teeth in pain but did not dare to say anything to this woman. He could only say embarrassedly, “It’s already very difficult for the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River to establish a relationship with the Bloodians. How can the Bloodians take them seriously? I don’t think there’s even a Holy Spirit expert among the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River. When we wipe them out, why would we leave any survivors who might leak information? Third Sister, you’re being too cautious!”","The one-eyed man was afraid that the red-eyed woman would slap him again, so he quickly changed the topic. “But you’re right, Third Sister. It’s better to be safe than sorry.”","Before the one-eyed man could finish speaking, the honest-looking man in the lead gritted his teeth and stood up, “There’s nothing worth plundering from the Four Species of the Lonely River. The information we received can’t be wrong. Our people have been planted in Fortune Treasure Palace for nearly 100 years.","“As their customers, we choose suitable targets in Fortune Treasure Palace. The person we’re following was personally received by Zhan Lu. Hence, he must have a powerful background!”","“We’re not only targeting him but also the faction behind him. Let’s go and investigate the strength of this faction first. Don’t act rashly. I have a feeling that we will definitely earn a lot this time.","“In a few years, the largest event in the entire East Universe, the Creation Conference, will begin. At that time, the major factions in the East Universe will send Creators to participate. We have to plunder more resources to ensure that we can invite these Creators to tailor-make potions for us at the Creator Conference.","“We have a Sacred Body Stone. In order to obtain this Sacred Body Stone back then, only seven out of the ten of us brothers remain today. Even if it’s for the souls of our brothers, we have to use this Sacred Body Stone well!”","When the others heard the leader’s words, their expressions changed. Complex emotions flashed in the depths of their eyes, yet none of them showed any sign of being convinced by his words.","There was only one Sacred Body Stone. In the end, only one person could complete the contract with it. Now, everyone was risking their lives to help that one person at the Creation Conference.","In this group, the one most qualified to absorb the Sacred Body Stone was obviously the man in the lead. It was true that doing all of this would make the group stronger. However, these star pirates, who were accustomed to living on the edge, were not willing to sacrifice themselves for others.","The few of them were about to fake a response when nine different types of elemental energy quietly filled the surrounding environment. These types of elemental energy finally turned into a cage that trapped this group of people.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao’s figures appeared outside the cage. Lin Yuan had instructed them to monitor this group and find out their motive.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao now knew the purpose of these people and their identities. It turned out that they were a group of high-end star pirates who specialized in plundering experts.","Lin Yuan had said that it was best not to alert the enemy. However, now that he knew their identities and goals, capturing them would not be considered disobeying Lin Yuan’s orders.","These people thought that they had found the password to their wealth, but targeting Sky City was equivalent to sending themselves into a bottomless abyss."]},{"number":2965,"title":"Chapter 2965: Naive Star Pirates!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2965: Naive Star Pirates!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Liu Chen and Liu Yao hated star pirates. The two of them hated the star pirates themselves, but not the way they lived.","The competition between the various species for territory and resources was","essentially a form of plundering. The star pirates’ way of living was not a problem, but their actions extended beyond mere plundering to actively exterminating other species and factions.","It was different from the wars between the various species and factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds for resources.","Moreover, the wars for territory resources were usually comparable in strength. Even if there was a difference, it would not be much.","However, the star pirates would target those factions and species that were much weaker than them, which was equivalent to depriving them of the chance to survive.","If Liu Chen and Liu Yao had managed to capture such a skilled star pirate group, they would have considered utilizing them. This tactic mirrored their approach when they raided Treasure City in search of their offspring.","While the star pirates could have been valuable assets to Liu Chen and Liu Yao, they believed Lin Yuan wouldn’t opt for this strategy. Consequently, once the identities of the star pirates were confirmed, their destinies were sealed.","“What’s the reason for your sudden attack on us? Could it be that you’ve encountered fellow star pirates?”","Among this group of people, only the man in the lead and the red-eyed woman with two long horns on her head were relatively calm. Everyone else had panicked expressions on their faces.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao did not release their auras, but they did not deliberately hide them.","This group of star pirates already knew that Liu Chen and Liu Yao were targets that they could not surpass no matter what. If these two people had malicious intentions toward them, they would be at their mercy. In such a desolate and remote place like North of the Lonely River, it was very difficult to find a Holy Spirit expert.","The leaders of those powerful factions might not even have the strength to reach the Holy Spirit level. Why did two experts above the Holy Spirit level suddenly appear? How could such experts appear so casually?","Even in an extremely prosperous place like the Sky Beyond the Clouds, encountering such experts was an exceedingly rare occurrence.","Liu Yao was mistaken for one of the star pirates, and anger flashed across her face. She never thought that she would one day be regarded as a star pirate.","“Heh, peers? My Lord hates star pirates the most. It will be impossible to find your peers here. We’ve already learned about your intentions through your conversation. Since you have your eyes set on Jin Chen, he’s the one we consider our peer. Since that’s the case, follow me back and meet my Lord!”","Liu Yao did not waste her breath on these star pirates. She would just bring them back and hand them over to Lin Yuan.","However, Liu Yao’s words revealed two pieces of information to these star pirates. The people who had captured them were not targeting them and were also following orders.","What kind of existence could command these two fellows whose strength had already surpassed the Holy Spirit level?!","The person who commanded these two fellows hated star pirates—this was not good news for them.","Other than that, these star pirates also knew that their target was from the same faction as these two fellows. Upon understanding these two points, these star pirates couldn’t help but feel a sense of unease creeping into their hearts.","This elite star pirate group had faced many dangers before, but this was the first time they were completely controlled by someone without any chance to resist.","The red-eyed woman with long horns on her head was no longer calm. She turned her head and looked at the man in the lead.","Jia Ba had experienced countless situations, big and small, and he could calmly analyze the problem in every situation. Now, Jia Ba hadn’t even met this Lord, and he was at a loss about what to do next.","While the other members of this star pirate group needed Jia Ba to come up with a plan, he did not do anything and this caused him to lose the trust of the people. If Jia Ba were to raise the matter of the Creation Conference and the Sacred Body Stone now, at least half of these people would voice their opinions.","While Liu Chen reported to Lin Yuan, Liu Yao would look after the star pirates.","Lin Yuan was currently in Sky City’s meeting room, thinking about the construction of fortifications at the edge of the Lonely River.","Summer had already nurtured Thriving Summer Rising Clouds.","However, Thriving Summer Rising Clouds needed to be planted at the edge of the Lonely River one after another. Yet, invaders had already appeared.","If Bei Xu hadn’t discovered the invaders and reported them promptly, the consequences would have been unimaginable had they actually crossed the Lonely River, discovered the faith country, and spread the news.","Lin Yuan knew that Liu Chen and Liu Yao would immediately report to him after finding out their purpose.","Lin Yuan’s fingers lightly tapped on the table, emitting a beeping sound.","Wen Yu, who was sitting beside Lin Yuan, knew that this was something Lin Yuan would subconsciously do when he was thinking.","“Young Master, I think there’s a high probability that these people followed Jin Chen here. We discovered very early on that after these people controlled these people, there probably wouldn’t be much of an impact!”","Lin Yuan shook his head. “Now, our Sky City’s influence has spread too wide. The faith country is a cake large enough to drive any faction crazy. We have to take precautions.","“To target Jin Chen, this group needs some knowledge about him. I doubt those who’ve come are all there is. If other members have stayed back in Treasure City or elsewhere and notice the group’s disappearance, they’ll likely try hard to find them. Smart folks use resources wisely. We can’t assume they lack smart members elsewhere.”","Wen Yu’s heart tightened at the revelation. She realized her oversimplification and underestimation of the opposing faction’s prowess. The group that had converged on the banks of the Lonely River possessed formidable strength.","Otherwise, they wouldn’t have set their sights on a Holy Spirit expert like Jin Chen.","At that moment, there was a knock on the meeting room door. Wen Yu walked up and opened the door.","Upon seeing Liu Chen standing at the door, Wen Yu gestured for him to enter.","Liu Chen bowed to Wen Yu and stood beside Lin Yuan. “Young Master, when I was monitoring this group of people according to your instructions, I learned they are a star pirate group that specializes in targeting elite factions.","“This group of people followed Jin Chen not only to rob him but also to find out the faction behind him. Now we have captured them, you can question them at any time! ”","Upon hearing Liu Chen’s report, Lin Yuan felt relieved. If it was the star pirates, everything would be easy to resolve.","Moreover, Lin Yuan was certain that these star pirates did not collude with Fortune Treasure Palace and did not know that Jin Chen was his subordinate. Otherwise, if this star pirate group knew that Jin Chen possessed such huge wealth, they would have already robbed him on the way back.","In the battle to protect Treasure City, Lin Yuan had let Winter display his strength. The higher-ups of Treasure City were all aware that Winter was his subordinate. If this elite star pirate group knew about him and knew that Jin Chen was one of his people, how would they have dared to come here!?","Just as Lin Yuan was about to ask Liu Chen to bring the star pirates in, he heard Liu Chen say after some deliberation, “Young Master, based on the communication between the leader of this star pirate group and his subordinates, I learned two pieces of information.","“The first piece of information is that this star pirate group followed Jin Chen’s aura according to the aura-seeking earthworms. They tailed Jin Chen from a very far distance, so Jin Chen didn’t discover them.","“The second piece of information is that this star pirate group might have a","Sacred Body Stone. They mentioned something related to the Sacred Body Stone.”","It had taken Liu Chen a long time to tell Lin Yuan about this situation because he had been conflicted about whether he should report it to Lin Yuan.","Liu Chen knew very well that he could not fully believe the words of this star pirate group. There was too much deceit among the star pirates. What if the leader of this star pirate group was deceiving the other members and there was actually no Sacred Body Stone?","If he told Lin Yuan this information, it would be equivalent to him spreading false information to Lin Yuan. In that case, it was very likely that he would lose Lin Yuan’s trust.","However, the situation with the Sacred Body Stone was no small matter. Liu Chen believed that even if he reported the wrong information, it was better than knowing but not reporting it.","Lin Yuan had never doubted Jin Chen’s loyalty, so his heart did not waver when he heard Liu Chen’s words. It was only when Liu Chen mentioned the Sacred","Body Stone that Lin Yuan’s heartstrings began to stir.","The Sacred Body Stone was a treasure that Lin Yuan only recently learned about, which was capable of allowing lifeforms to activate their body composition.","Lin Yuan harbored the intention to activate the body composition of the elite core members of Sky City, and Winter had previously mentioned to him the difficulty in finding one. Now, Lin Yuan had obtained a chance to obtain the Sacred Body Stone. This was simply a great thing!","Lin Yuan raised his hand and threw a ring-shaped fey storage box with the Nine-Headed Snake totem carved on it at Liu Chen.","Liu Chen quickly took the fey storage box from Lin Yuan.","“Your offspring have already broken out of their shells for some time. The both of you won’t have the chance to obtain resources on your own if you follow us.","“A young Nine-Headed Snake requires resources the most. In addition to spirit qi crystals, there are 11 types of nearly 100% pure elemental energy available. You can decide which type of energy to allow your offspring to absorb. The remaining resources are sufficient for the two of you to use in the short term.”","Ever since Liu Chen and Liu Yao had been recruited by Lin Yuan, they had always been conscientious and had solved many problems for him.","Apart from Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter, Liu Chen and Liu Yao were considered Lin Yuan’s strongest subordinates. Hence, Lin Yuan would not treat Liu Chen and Liu Yao lightly.","If Lin Yuan did not fulfill Liu Chen and Liu Yao’s request to nurture their offspring, it was likely that they wouldn’t continue to wholeheartedly serve Lin","Yuan.","Liu Chen used his spiritual energy to check the resources in the fey storage box, and the contents shocked him.","Lin Yuan had indeed given Liu Chen and Liu Yao numerous resources. In the past two weeks, they had been using these resources very carefully.","Just as Lin Yuan had mentioned, Liu Chen and Liu Yao, who served Lin Yuan by his side, could no longer obtain resources outside like before. Therefore, they started to worry about nurturing their offspring. However, before Liu Chen and Liu Yao could worry for long, Lin Yuan gave them a solution. This was equivalent to liberating Liu Chen and Liu Yao to a certain extent.","With Liu Chen and Liu Yao’s strength, no matter how hard they worked outside, they would not be able to obtain elemental energy with 100% purity. A type of pure elemental energy was exceedingly rare, and Lin Yuan’s gift comprised as many as eleven types of it. With this pure elemental energy, not only could the two of them nurture their offspring, but their strength and bloodline would also obtain a chance to evolve.","Liu Chen told Lin Yuan gratefully and sincerely, “Young Master, thank you for your gift. Liu Yao and I will definitely do our best for you in the future. We’re truly grateful to you for nurturing us.”","Lin Yuan raised his hand to help Liu Chen up. “You’re treating me like an outsider. You and Liu Yao have already become part of Sky City and have contributed a lot to Sky City. You deserve this. In the future, if I obtain more Sacred Body Stones, I can consider activating your body composition for you,","Liu Yao, and your descendants!”","Liu Chen had been by Lin Yuan’s side for a long time, and he knew that the experts who had submitted to Lin Yuan had received rewards and changed their fates. If not for Lin Yuan, it would have been impossible for Qin Yu to become a Bloodian Queen!","Lin Yuan was not one to make empty promises. He would likely fulfill all his promises in the future.","After thanking Lin Yuan again, Liu Chen contacted Liu Yao and asked her to bring the star pirates in.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao stood beside Lin Yuan and Wen Yu respectively. They released their auras above the Holy Spirit level and enveloped the 40-odd members of the star pirate group.","Lin Yuan scanned the dozens of star pirates and realized that there were nine of them who had reached the Holy Spirit level. It should not be difficult to choose an existence suitable to be a holy maid among the nine of them.","Before Lin Yuan could speak, the rough-looking middle-aged star pirate could not help but shout, “We’ve never done anything to harm you. Even if we targeted your subordinates, we haven’t done anything yet. I don’t think we’re enemies yet!”","The one-eyed star pirate’s words made Lin Yuan laugh in anger. If he were to convict these star pirates according to the method he used in his previous life, it would probably be the difference between murder and attempted murder. Since they already had the intention to plunder and kill him, how could they not be enemies?","Someone who had been a star pirate for so long would not be so naive, right?!"]},{"number":2966,"title":"Chapter 2966 Fu Mi!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2966 Fu Mi!","....","Lin Yuan shot Liu Chen a look. Water, fire, wind, and earth elements weaved together into a long rope, with thunder elements coursing along its length.","Like a snake, the long rope reached out to the one-eyed man. The long rope shot into the one-eyed man’s still-blind eye. As the thunder energy on the long rope paralyzed the one-eyed man’s body, it completely imprisoned him.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao knew that Lin Yuan intended to collect the bodies of experts, so Liu Chen had deliberately preserved the completeness of the one-eyed star pirate’s body when he attacked him.","Lin Yuan tapped his finger on the table and told Liu Chen, “Let him release his holy spirit for me to see. I want to see if it is useful to me.”","Liu Chen said respectfully, “Young Master, I’ll draw out his holy spirit now!”","The long rope probed into the one-eyed man’s body, and it was unclear what changes occurred within him. Nevertheless, his body began to tremble rapidly. The aura of the divine kingdom was released. In no time, a slightly illusory holy spirit surged out of the one-eyed man’s divine kingdom.","Lin Yuan released the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to check the one-eyed man’s holy spirit.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen shook her head at Lin Yuan. She despised the one-eyed man’s holy spirit.","“Master, this is a both metal-type and earth-type holy spirit. Its ability is to increase the activity of metal and earth elements, as well as its agility and sturdiness. The effect of this holy spirit is really too poor. I don’t want to turn his holy spirit into a holy maid. However, I can refine his divine kingdom into the pure land of the gods. The holy spirit can also be used as nutrients for the holy maids.”","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s evaluation of this one-eyed man was like a diner evaluating a piece of steak.","At that moment, it was in a state of meticulous scrutiny. Her words made the other star pirates tense up at the same time.","These star pirates robbed experts everywhere, annihilating countless species and factions. However, they had never treated other lifeforms as nutrients to increase their strength like the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","This one-eyed man was nutrients to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, so what was the difference between them?","The moment Lin Yuan summoned the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, he had already sealed the star pirate group’s fate. Otherwise, she would not have revealed herself so easily.","Lin Yuan said to the star pirates with a smile, “You know very well what my goal is. As a group of star pirates, when plotting against other factions and species, you have to be mentally prepared to be executed by them.","“I won’t let you off. Both your divine kingdoms and holy spirits will be used by me to achieve my goals and become my nutrients. However, one of you can survive. I wonder who among you desires this chance to live?”","Lin Yuan’s words caused the expressions of these star pirates to become abnormally complicated. However, the core members of this star pirate group were all here, and they had been together for more than 1,000 years.","In the face of Lin Yuan’s threat, even if some people were tempted, they did not immediately make the decision to betray the star pirates.","Lin Yuan raised his hand and said, “Since you don’t have the ability to make a decision for the time being, I’ll let you calm down for a while!”","Lin Yuan then glanced at Liu Chen.","Liu Chen understood tacitly and shot out more than ten ropes made of elemental energy, piercing into the bodies of the few Holy Spirit star pirates. As for the remaining Divine Kingdom star pirates, Liu Chen dealt with them.","Liu Chen calmly walked over and stored the bodies of the Divine Kingdom experts that had been disposed of in his spatial equipment. These were all high-quality delicacies for the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","The Holy Spirit experts who had been pierced by the elemental ropes could not move. Their bodies were in a numb state, and they had lost their perception of the outside world, but their thoughts remained active.","Lin Yuan believed that when these Holy Spirit experts realized that their lives were in his hands, more than half of the members would be willing to obtain this chance to live. Star pirates had no principles to speak of. However, it was not certain who would be the first to recognize reality and show loyalty to Lin Yuan.","No matter how sincere the star pirates who possessed holy spirits suitable to be refined into holy maids were, Lin Yuan would not give them a chance. Lin Yuan didn’t want to forgive a star pirate because he was prepared to take this star pirate under his wing and nurture them. Lin Yuan only wanted this star pirate to gather all the members of the star pirate group outside to prevent future troubles.","Lin Yuan believed that even if he didn’t express it explicitly, intelligent star pirates would surely understand his intentions.","Liu Chen activated the holy spirits of these star pirates one by one and let the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen inspect them.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen immediately showed interest in the holy spirit of one of the star pirates.","“Master, this holy spirit is both water-type and ice-type. Its ability is to weaken the other elements and reduce their activity through water and ice elements. If refined into a holy maid, it would prove invaluable in battle. Over yonder, we have a wood-type holy spirit. Its specialty lies in augmenting other entities. Converting it into a holy maid would yield an exceptional support unit.","“There’s also a rare spiritual-type holy spirit. If its ability was to bolster resistance against spiritual entities, it could potentially be transformed into a holy maid. However, its primary function involves interfering with the minds of other holy spirits, rendering it unsuitable for transformation. As per our initial strategy, it’s prudent to target functional-type entities.”","After reaching the Sacred Source 12 Stars, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen gained autonomy, enabling it to select the most compatible holy maid.","The two star pirates with holy spirits that were suitable to be converted into holy maids were destined to die. Since the holy maids needed to be transformed by living holy spirits, Lin Yuan did not get rid of the two star pirates immediately.","Liu Chen whispered to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, one of the two star pirates that Young Master has just selected is the leader of this star pirate group. According to the information that Liu Yao and I heard, the Sacred Body Stone is in the hands of this leader.”","Lin Yuan nodded. “Since the Sacred Body Stone is on this star pirate group leader, we will soon be able to prove whether this star pirate group possesses it or not. They’ve been thinking about it for a while. I think they’re almost done. Liu Chen, let go of their restraints!”","Liu Chen had just subdued his thunder energy when the striking woman, with fiery red hair, red eyes, and an aura of cold beauty, spoke first.","“My lord, I am Fu Mi,” she began. “Deputy leader of this star pirate group, responsible for external communication. If I pledge allegiance to you, I can rally our members and manage our spies. Even our leader is unaware of their arrangements.”","As soon as Fu Mi finished, several star pirates erupted in anger. Clearly, they hadn’t anticipated her surrendering first. Yet, there were others who, upon hearing her words, hastily expressed their willingness to submit, hoping to secure their survival as the sole survivors of the group.","Lin Yuan’s gaze lifted to Fu Mi. He noticed the horns protruding from her head, confirming she was a devil. Fu Mi emanated the essence of the devil bloodline, evident in the characteristic horns adorning her head.","Devil tattoos appeared on the two long horns. It was either the concentration of the devil bloodline in Fu Mi’s body was high enough, or Fu Mi was deliberately stimulating her bloodline.","Lifeforms with devil bloodlines were indeed intelligent. Fu Mi had guessed the reason Lin Yuan wanted to keep her alive. Her words indicated that she had engaged in serious contemplation and accurately pinpointed the issues that mattered to her.","Fu Mi was the one who had been eliminated by the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen as a spiritual-type holy spirit. If Fu Mi was spared, Lin Yuan could hand her over to the devil group and let them nurture her!","Lin Yuan ignored the other star pirates and spoke directly to Fu Mi. “You said that you’re the deputy leader in charge of external communication, so take the initiative to release your holy spirit and let me control it. Then, gather all the members of your star pirate group outside. How well you handle this matter will determine your future treatment.”","Fu Mi was originally extremely nervous. On the one hand, she was afraid that she had guessed Lin Yuan’s motive wrongly. On the other hand, she was also afraid that Lin Yuan would not choose her in the end.","A big shot like Lin Yuan was likely someone who would keep his word. If he chose to spare others, Fu Mi would be left with no options but a dead end. Not only would she die, but everything about her, including the holy spirit, would also be absorbed as nutrients in the future.","After all the effort Fu Mi had put into her growth to reach this point, she certainly didn’t want to end up in such a predicament.","Fu Mi heaved a sigh of relief when Lin Yuan chose her. What Fu Mi had just said to Lin Yuan was absolutely true. With so many star pirates there, she could not lie to Lin Yuan. Once she lied, she would be exposed by the other star pirates.","Fu Mi knew very well that she had a genuine competitive relationship with the other members, which left no room for mistakes. An intelligent person like Fu Mi would not let others have something on her.","Since Lin Yuan had chosen Fu Mi, it meant that the others had lost their chance to live. The other star pirates quickly fought for themselves.","Upon listening to the star pirates’ wails and roars, Lin Yuan said, “I have always been a soft-hearted person and am willing to give you a chance.","“Now, Fu Mi, tell me about the internal situation and secrets of your star pirate group. The rest of you can correct Fu Mi’s words and supplement them after Fu Mi has finished explaining the situation. As long as the number of corrections and supplements exceeds three, I will re-screen from among you and choose a new person among you to be spared.”","Lin Yuan had now gained control over Fu Mi. Since Fu Mi claimed that she was their deputy leader, she would definitely understand the situation of their group very well.","Lin Yuan wanted to understand the situation of this star pirate group. Elite star pirate groups held a lot of information, and Lin Yuan believed that a smart person like Fu Mi would certainly not disappoint him.","There was no trace of nervousness on Fu Mi’s face when she heard Lin Yuan. Fu Mi was certain that she was the person with the most information within the star pirate group. After all, she was in charge of all external matters.","In order to ensure her irreplaceable position in the star pirate group, Fu Mi had deliberately concealed some information, especially from Pang Jie, the leader.","Since Lin Yuan wanted to know the situation in the star pirate group, Fu Mi did not mind telling him everything.","After pondering for a while, Fu Mi told Lin Yuan everything she knew. She did not give the other members a chance to correct her.","Since she wanted to tell him everything, Fu Mi did not hide the information about the Sacred Body Stone. Her explanation lasted for nearly three days.","Wen Yu recorded Fu Mi’s words. After sorting them out, Lin Yuan realized that this star pirate group had really done all kinds of evil. However, after doing so many evil deeds, they had accumulated a lot of wealth.","After Fu Mi finished explaining the situation, Lin Yuan looked at the other members and saw that Pang Jie had an extremely ugly expression.","Pang Jie had not expected Fu Mi to hide so much useful information from him, causing him to be unable to determine if what Fu Mi had said was true or false.","“Why don’t you have anything to add after Fu Mi finishes speaking? In that case, I can only conclude that everything Fu Mi said is true. There’s no need for me to keep you useless fellows!”","At that moment, an angry shout echoed. “Fu Mi, is what you’re doing fair to us? We’ve always respected and treated you as our Second Sister.”","Fu Mi looked up and saw the man in a white robe beside her. Her face was red with anger as she said helplessly, “Sixth Brother, I really don’t know if I should call you naive or stupid for saying such things to me. Don’t you know that our leader has been using us? I remember that you know all of this. Could it be that in a team like ours, you, fool, have put in genuine effort?","“I joined this team later than all of you, but I was able to become the deputy leader. Isn’t it because I’m more intelligent than all of you combined? I’ve never thought of myself as your Second Sister.","“If Pang Jie wasn’t stronger than us and had been secretly suppressing me, I would have left this team long ago. I wouldn’t have waited until now. I hope you understand what’s going on. If there’s a next life, don’t be so stupid!”"]},{"number":2967,"title":"Chapter 2967 Star Pirates Hunting Plan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2967 Star Pirates Hunting Plan!","....","While speaking, Fu Mi’s voice remained cold, yet unlike before, it now carried a sense of disdain, adding a touch of frigidity to her tone. She made no effort to conceal her indifference in front of Lin Yuan. This demeanor was characteristic of Fu Mi—there was no need for pretense.","Despite Lin Yuan expressing a desire to spare her life, he wouldn’t dispose of her simply due to her personality. Fu Mi aimed to remain authentic even as Lin Yuan’s subordinate. Her recent behavior provided Lin Yuan with insight into her character.","Devils were inherently cold and selfish beings, prone to plotting and scheming. Fu Mi was confident that Lin Yuan could discern her devil bloodline.","Lin Yuan could not be bothered to witness such a spectacle. Based on his understanding of this star pirate group, their connections were merely superficial, devoid of any genuine friendship. The source of Sixth Brother’s anger wasn’t his deep bond with Fu Mi but rather the sense of betrayal he felt from her.","Sensing Lin Yuan’s impatience, Liu Chen immediately controlled the star pirates other than Fu Mi.","Lin Yuan told Fu Mi, “I have two devil groups under my command. Since you have a devil bloodline, why don’t you join them for training?”","After making the arrangements, Lin Yuan prepared to leave the meeting room. Liu Chen and Liu Yao would help the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen use the holy spirits to refine the holy maids and absorb the other holy spirits.","Fu Mi’s eyes flickered upon hearing Lin Yuan’s arrangements for her, and a wave of worry surged through her.","Two devil groups? Joining them couldn’t possibly be easy. With only devil’s bloodline coursing through her veins, she knew she couldn’t outsmart those pure-blooded devils, no matter how hard she tried.","Rather than focusing on honing her schemes, Fu Mi yearned to strengthen her abilities. She dreaded the thought of being trapped in a world where countless individuals conspired against one another.","When she thought about how Lin Yuan had used Holy Spirit and Divine Kingdom experts as bait, Fu Mi hurriedly found a way out for herself. “Lord, I’m in charge of contacting the star pirates. I have connections with many high-end star pirates. If you plan to capture other star pirates, I can help you arrange for them to fall into your trap. You only need to arrange for a few experts to control those star pirates. The relay station outside Treasure City is an excellent location.”","Compared to the relay station outside Treasure City, Fu Mi felt that this area of North of the Lonely River was more suitable to attract those powerful star pirates. None of them had explored this area, so it would be easier for others to believe her if she made up some lies.","However, Fu Mi could sense that Lin Yuan valued this area very much. It was obvious that he did not want outsiders to enter. Moreover, he had been arranging for people to patrol this area. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have been discovered the moment they arrived in that area.","When Fu Mi saw Lin Yuan turn around to look at her, she knew that she had made the right bet. Lin Yuan’s gaze toward Fu Mi was more serious than before. Previously, Fu Mi had guessed his thoughts, but now she seemed to understand his needs.","Lin Yuan indeed needed many Divine Kingdom and Holy Spirit experts to feed the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","Lin Yuan had his own rules, so he set his sights on the star pirates and did not plan to use other lifeforms to nurture the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","Fu Mi had connections with the other powerful star pirates, and being able to help Lin Yuan gather them was equivalent to helping Lin Yuan.","“It’s rare for you to have such thoughts. As a star pirate, you have harmed countless species. In the future, I will set up an organization to fight against star pirates for you. You will develop this organization. This is the start-up fund for your organization. From now on, I will distribute resources to you according to the number and level of star pirates captured by your organization.","“Later, I’ll arrange for someone with sufficient strength to hold down and preside over your organization. He won’t help you make decisions or restrict your movements. However, he’ll give you martial force support and ensure safety when dealing with other star pirates.”","Having said that, Lin Yuan left the meeting room.","Fu Mi was glad that she had obtained this opportunity so that she did not have to fight with the devils for survival. Not only did Fu Mi secure better survival opportunities for herself, but she also effectively gained the authority to establish her own faction.","Although Fu Mi used to be a star pirate, she did not find it unacceptable to clean up the star pirates.","Fu Mi probed the fey storage box with her spiritual energy and saw that it contained many Creator resources. They shocked even a star pirate like Fu Mi, who was used to seeing wealth.","Liu Yao walked to Fu Mi’s side and whispered, “Today, the other members of your star pirate group are all unlucky, but you are certainly the lucky one. Lord Lin Yuan is extremely generous. If you work under Lord Lin Yuan, you will benefit greatly in the future. You have to seize the opportunity!”","Liu Yao initially dismissed Fu Mi, considering them to be on different levels. However, after Fu Mi demonstrated determination in securing a path for herself and Lin Yuan forgave her, Liu Yao acknowledged her presence.","Previously, Liu Yao didn’t view Fu Mi as significant. However, with Lin Yuan granting Fu Mi authority to form a faction, the situation changed. If Fu Mi performed well in the future, she could earn Lin Yuan’s trust as a valued subordinate. Consequently, Liu Yao was now open to cultivating a positive relationship with Fu Mi.","Having observed Fu Mi’s cold demeanor before, Liu Yao wasn’t inclined to establish a genuine connection with her.","Upon hearing Liu Yao’s words, Fu Mi, typically reserved, nodded in acknowledgment, signaling her willingness to engage with Liu Yao.","From the moment Fu Mi saw the resources in the fey storage box, she knew how generous Lin Yuan was to his subordinates. At the very least, following a leader like Lin Yuan would not be as oppressive as Pang Jie. If Pang Jie had not been sucking the blood of the other members, the strength of the star pirate group would at least be much stronger than it was now.","Fu Mi was very confident in her ability. If Lin Yuan could arrange for someone with sufficient strength to ensure her safety during the operation, she would definitely be able to capture numerous star pirates in a short period.","To Lin Yuan, enhancing the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen wasn’t just about boosting his own power—it also meant generating valuable growth resources for Sky City.","Fu Mi’s organization held immense significance for both Lin Yuan and Sky City.","Summer wanted to nurture Thriving Summer Rising Clouds on the banks of the Lonely River. Spring was the best partner for Wen Yu and the Moon Empress and could help them deal with the matters in the territory.","As Winter was best at traveling, Lin Yuan wanted him to make a trip to the North Universe. There had to be someone guarding the faith country. After thinking about it, Lin Yuan believed that Autumn was most suitable to establish this organization with Fu Mi. Moreover, Autumn was also the one who liked to fight the most among the four of them.","After spending considerable time interacting with Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter, Lin Yuan had developed a deep understanding of their temperaments.","Autumn, in particular, emerged as the most sensitive among the quartet. Previously, he tended to overanalyze whenever Lin Yuan made any arrangements.","This time, Lin Yuan decided to approach Autumn directly, intending to clarify the significance of the upcoming operation. Such a gesture could also serve as a gesture of appeasement towards Autumn.","However, Lin Yuan wasn’t in a rush to discuss his arrangements with Autumn. While he had been listening to Fu Mi talk about the star pirate group, the Star Vastness Peony had informed him about the communication request from the child ramet.","Through his conversation with Fu Mi, Lin Yuan realized that the star pirates had no connection to Fortune Treasure Palace, dispelling his previous misunderstanding.","Having already kept the Palace Master of Fortune Treasure Palace waiting for quite some time, Lin Yuan saw no reason to delay further. Doing so might imply a lack of regard for the Palace Master’s time.","Mutual respect was essential for cooperation, especially when both parties were willing to collaborate.","After returning to his room, Lin Yuan summoned the Star Vastness Peony and let it open the starlight link through Starlight Teleportation. Not long after, the Star Vastness Peony’s secondary flower responded to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan found himself drawn into a sky filled with stars, enveloped by a space unlike that of the Astronomical Parliament. There, the starry expanse was thinner, yet more mysterious, allowing only their solitary meeting. Despite the distance, the ability to communicate face-to-face was truly astonishing.","At that moment, Lin Yuan heard the Star Vastness Peony’s voice. “Master, do you want to hide your figure and appearance? If you need me, I can use the constellation to cover you up so that he won’t be able to see through your appearance. All the consciousness in this star bond needs to be transmitted by me. No matter how strong he is, he won’t be able to spy on your situation through the constellation!”","Lin Yuan looked interested. He felt that he had to make himself more mysterious. Moreover, Lin Yuan did not like others to know his appearance. It would be inconvenient for him to travel outside in the future.","“Star Vastness Peony, help me cover it with the constellation.”","As soon as the Star Vastness Peony enveloped Lin Yuan, the Palace Master teleported over, his expression betraying clear shock at the scene before him. However, his surprise was fleeting, vanishing from his face almost as quickly as it had appeared.","The Palace Master appeared to be a middle-aged man, with his long chestnut-colored hair pulled up into a high tie. Strands of hair at his temples cascaded down to his chest, nearly reaching the level of his beard.","Despite his casual attire—a flowing jade-green robe—he emitted an aura of nobility and refinement.","A high-quality jade-green brooch adorned his chest, featuring a Jade Blood Phoenix Eye Stone of exceptional grade. This stone rivaled the Sacred Body Stone in quality, though it was not as costly.","Nevertheless, the Jade Blood Phoenix Eye Stone embedded in the brooch alone could fetch at least two Sacred Body Stones in exchange. The artifacts adorning the Palace Master reflected Fortune Treasure Palace’s true wealth and prestige.","“Hello, my name is Lin Yuan. I believe that Zhan Lu has introduced me to you and that you already know some information about me. I’m very happy to meet you.”","Ling Muzhuo had been pondering different ways to connect with Lin Yuan. He had decided to approach Lin Yuan only after grasping his background. Ling Muzhuo was intrigued by the resources Lin Yuan utilized to trade with Fortune Treasure Palace. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have readily met with such an esteemed guest of the Palace.","This method of introduction led Ling Muzhuo to suspect that Lin Yuan was attempting to showcase his abilities. Yet, Ling Muzhuo couldn’t quite grasp the purpose of this approach, prompting him to focus more closely on Lin Yuan.","“My name is Ling Muzhuo. Have you heard of my name? Now, in the East Universe, I’m the Palace Master responsible for managing the internal affairs of Fortune Treasure Palace. I’m firmly in the top position in the East Universe’s Fortune Treasure Palace.","“In the future, if you wish to trade with Fortune Treasure Palace, it will be more convenient for you to look for me than Zhan Lu. Moreover, I have more power on my side. I can take out many resources that Zhan Lu can’t trade with you.”","Ling Muzhuo shared Lin Yuan’s thoughts, but unlike Lin Yuan, who showcased his capabilities through a unique method, Ling Muzhuo opted for a straightforward approach to assert his status and authority in Fortune Treasure Palace.","In Ling Muzhuo’s view, there was no reason for Lin Yuan to decline his proposal for resource trading.","Ling Muzhuo had confirmed that Lin Yuan and Zhan Lu lacked a significant personal bond. Their relationship had formed recently when Lin Yuan visited Fortune Treasure Palace. With this limited connection, Lin Yuan had no need to fret over Zhan Lu.","Fortune Treasure Palace operated uniquely, with four Palace Masters in each dimension. These masters had distinct rankings primarily determined by points. Similarly, leaders overseeing various regions within the faction also held rankings based on their points. Everyone relentlessly pursued point accumulation.","Ling Muzhuo’s current actions were equivalent to snatching a channel to obtain points from Zhan Lu. However, Ling Muzhuo would compensate Zhan Lu in other ways, so Zhan Lu would not have much objection to his actions. Even if Zhan Lu had objections, he would not dare to show it.","However, whether or not Lin Yuan wanted to cooperate with him was up to Lin Yuan to decide.","Lin Yuan liked Ling Muzhuo’s directness, so he said honestly, “This is my first time here and I have never heard of your name. However, I am very willing to cooperate with you, Palace Master Ling. If you can satisfy my need for resources, I think we will become very good friends in the future!”"]},{"number":2968,"title":"Chapter 2968: Deal with the Palace Master of Fortune Treasure Palace!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2968: Deal with the Palace Master of Fortune Treasure Palace!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Lin Yuan’s stance toward Ling Muzhuo was even clearer. The main point of Lin Yuan’s words was that he would only become good friends with Ling Muzhuo if he satisfied his needs. This showed that the relationship between the two was determined by supply and demand.","Ling Muzhuo wanted Lin Yuan to obtain many resources from Fortune","Treasure Palace because this would encourage him to help him in the future.","As the leader of Sky City, Lin Yuan did not need to be overly polite when communicating with the leaders of any faction. The Sky Beyond the Clouds was a place that did not care about relationships at all. In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, relationships were determined by strength. Lin Yuan and Ling Muzhuo had interacted because they needed each other.","Of course, Lin Yuan’s words also revealed information related to him.","Lin Yuan’s mention of his arrival led Ling Muzhuo to suspect that he wasn’t from the East Universe. This puzzled Ling Muzhuo, leaving him unable to determine Lin Yuan’s true identity. Despite his desire to uncover Lin Yuan’s background, Ling Muzhuo found himself at a loss.","Given the resources Lin Yuan possessed, Ling Muzhuo could never have imagined that Lin Yuan had only arrived in the Sky Beyond the Clouds less than a year ago.","Ling Muzhuo laughed out loud when he heard Lin Yuan’s words.","“I’ve long heard from Zhan Lu that you’re a straightforward person. Now that I’ve seen you today, you really live up to your reputation! It doesn’t matter if you haven’t heard of me. In our future dealings, I believe that you will treat me as a friend.","“I’ve already asked Zhan Lu to mobilize Fortune Treasure Palace’s inventory to complete the transaction immediately for the supplies on the orders you brought this time. If Zhan Lu were to trade with you, he would need to spend at least a few months to gather these resources. In the future, we can carry out resource transactions according to this speed.”","Lin Yuan, who was hidden in the starlight, said with a smile, “Then I’ll thank you in advance. I have no lack of Creator resources, but I really lack all kinds of other resources to build my own faction!","“I will try my best to ensure that the supplies traded from Fortune Treasure","Palace are paid through Creator resources. I think this is also the key to why","Fortune Treasure Palace is so willing to trade with me.”","That was indeed what Ling Muzhuo had in mind. He had even intentionally made such a suggestion. However, Ling Muzhuo was afraid that this hint would affect the friendly relationship he had just formed with Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had recently traded numerous rare resources with Fortune Treasure Palace, their value akin to Creator resources. Additionally, Lin Yuan traded for basic resources available elsewhere.","What set Fortune Treasure Palace apart was its capacity to supply vast amounts, meeting Lin Yuan’s requirements. Utilizing Creator resources for such basic supplies would be wasteful.","There was nothing wrong with Lin Yuan taking the initiative, but if Fortune Treasure Palace asked him to do so, it might seem like they were treating him as a fool.","In the end, Lin Yuan brought up the topic himself without needing any hints. To some extent, his actions resembled showing off his skills. His words confirmed his abundant Creator resources and his lack of fear in using them—he simply aimed to gather enough resources.","Fortune Treasure Palace loved wealthy guests like Lin Yuan the most!","Ling Muzhuo said in a serious tone, “Young Master Lin, you’re a special honor guest of Fortune Treasure Palace. You know how we have always treated special honor guests. Apart from taking the initiative to befriend you because our faction can obtain many Creator resources by trading with you, it’s also related to the strength of the experts under you.’","Since Lin Yuan had communicated with him in such a frank manner, Ling Muzhuo was unusually frank.","After a slight pause, Ling Muzhuo continued. “I think you should be able to understand one thing, which is that there are thresholds for cooperation and communication. No one is willing to waste time on weak and irrelevant forces.","I think you should be the same. I hope we can work well together in the future!”","Ling Muzhuo’s every word was related to benefits, but his words made Lin Yuan feel at ease.","This kind of profit-oriented partnership was more suitable for Sky City.","“I happen to have a matter that I would like your help with. This matter will require a certain amount of connections from your side.”","Ling Muzhuo furrowed his brow upon learning that he needed to leverage his connections. It was widely known that Fortune Treasure Palace placed great importance on cultivating relationships.","Ling Muzhuo hesitated to exhaust the connections painstakingly accumulated by the faction. Yet, outright refusal would risk straining the carefully nurtured rapport between them.","“Young Master Lin, simply state your needs. While Fortune Treasure Palace is accommodating to special honor guests, some requests may not yield results despite our connections. Nevertheless, we’ll endeavor to assist you. If we fall short, please accept our apologies.”","Lin Yuan perceived Ling Muzhuo’s words as a cautious disclaimer.","Raising an eyebrow, Lin Yuan replied, “I won’t impose undue burdens on our partnership. This task shouldn’t pose a significant challenge for you. Furthermore, it’s mutually beneficial. If you decline, I’ll seek assistance elsewhere. However, missing this opportunity may alter our future collaboration. I hope you understand.”","The more Ling Muzhuo listened to Lin Yuan, the more he felt that something was amiss. Why did it sound like Lin Yuan was giving Fortune Treasure Palace a huge opportunity when he was the one asking for their help? If he lost this opportunity, he would take the initiative to look for another one!","Ling Muzhuo felt that Lin Yuan was underestimating him. Fortune Treasure Palace’s capabilities were not as simple as they appeared. Also, their influence in the East Universe was not strong to begin with. They had a much greater presence in the other three universes than in the East Universe!","Ling Muzhuo felt a twinge of displeasure at Lin Yuan’s words but concealed it adeptly. With a friendly and polite tone, he replied, “Certainly! If Fortune Treasure Palace is unable to assist you, why should any blame fall on you? We do not operate in such a discourteous manner! To be so would be to betray the trust you’ve placed in us.”","Internally, Ling Muzhuo was curious about Lin Yuan’s request. In case it was indeed trivial, Lin Yuan had certainly blown it out of proportion. Ling Muzhuo pondered whether it was worth investing future time and effort in Lin Yuan.","Despite his composed exterior, as a leader of Fortune Treasure Palace, Ling Muzhuo’s mind was anything but at ease.","Observing Ling Muzhuo’s expression, Lin Yuan discerned no shift in tone. Yet, he was certain that Ling Muzhuo was displeased.","Lin Yuan was aware that his words had likely irked Ling Muzhuo, though his intention wasn’t to provoke. Rather, he sought to leverage the situation to showcase his abilities once more.","“Most of the Creators under my command are Grade 3 and 4. There are very few high-grade Creators. I hope that you can introduce me to some high-grade Creators!”","Ling Muzhuo did not say anything. He knew that Lin Yuan would probably continue. This was because Lin Yuan’s words were far from a win-win situation.","“The lifespan of Creators is not unlimited. There should be some high-grade Creators in the Sky Beyond the Clouds who have basically reached the end of their lifespans. These Creators have been working hard to obtain spiritual ingredients that can increase lifespan.","“I possess unique spiritual ingredients capable of extending life. Furthermore, these ingredients won’t counteract the effects of other lifespan-extending ingredients.","“I aim to trade these specific spiritual ingredients with those high-grade Creators nearing the end of their lives. I believe you won’t refuse this offer! By recommending and assisting these Creators, you’ll undoubtedly earn their gratitude!”","Lin Yuan’s statement ignited Ling Muzhuo’s curiosity.","Finally, Ling Muzhuo grasped Lin Yuan’s previous remarks.","Lin Yuan claimed to possess spiritual ingredients capable of prolonging life. Moreover, these ingredients’ efficacy wouldn’t diminish if the Creators consumed other lifespan-enhancing ingredients.","If Fortune Treasure Palace mediated for Lin Yuan, they would not only gain Lin Yuan’s favor but also earn favor from those high-grade Creators.","Acquiring favor from such esteemed Creators wasn’t a simple feat!","Fortune Treasure Palace indeed had connections with Creators nearing the end of their lifespans. Among them were Grade 6 Creators.","These Creators chose to become special honor guests of Fortune Treasure","Palace. They were not only interested in gathering resources from Fortune Treasure Palace but also sought after spiritual ingredients to prolong their lifespans.","Such spiritual ingredients were exceedingly rare, making it difficult for Fortune Treasure Palace to amass them even with their best efforts over the span of a year. Additionally, certain experts within Fortune Treasure Palace required these resources, making it imperative for the faction to prioritize their distribution among their own ranks.","Should Ling Muzhuo miss this opportunity, he might deeply regret it and feel compelled to approach Lin Yuan once more to secure it.","Lin Yuan had subtly sensed Ling Muzhuo’s hesitation and uncertainty in his earlier, reserved response. This prompted Lin Yuan to explain the advantages Fortune Treasure Palace stood to gain from the transaction, ensuring transparency and preventing any undue advantage for his faction. Though he was indeed extending assistance, he recognized the need to offer supplementary benefits in return.","But in the end, this favor fell on Fortune Treasure Palace, which had already benefited greatly.","Ling Muzhuo’s tone toward Lin Yuan was much warmer than before.","“Haha, thank you for thinking of Fortune Treasure Palace! We have the contact information of those Creators whose lifespans are about to end. We will tell these Creators about the spiritual ingredients in your hands.","“I am very curious about the spiritual ingredients that you mentioned. I wonder if you can trade some of them with us? As long as it’s a resource that Fortune Treasure Palace has, feel free to mention it!”","Lin Yuan helped other creatures obtain endless lifespan through the Lifespan","Mice. Once this coveted resource was exchanged, ensuring that the formidable Creators of Fortune Treasure Palace didn’t uncover its secrets was impossible.","Even with a slim chance, Lin Yuan was determined to prevent any leakage of information. The Lifespan Mouse would remain firmly under Lin Yuan’s control!","Lin Yuan said directly, “I apologize. These lifespan-enhancing ingredients are foundational resources for me. They can be exchanged for premium Creator resources and secure a steady supply of high-grade materials. Thus, I’ll only trade them to esteemed Creators. I trust you won’t bring up this matter again, as I value our ongoing relationship.”","Lin Yuan’s declaration effectively closed off any discussion of trading these resources with Ling Muzhuo.","Understanding Lin Yuan’s stance, Ling Muzhuo felt a pang of regret.","Fortunately, Fortune Treasure Palace possessed its own stock of lifespan-extending spiritual ingredients. These not only sufficed for the faction’s experts but also provided trading opportunities with outsiders.","If Fortune Treasure Palace really did not have such resources that were linked to survival, they would most likely shamelessly ask Lin Yuan for them even if Lin Yuan rejected Ling Muzhuo.","Lin Yuan could sense that Ling Muzhuo truly wanted to befriend him. Thus, he would definitely do his best to introduce him to a high-grade Creator.","It would not be long before the resources of Sky City’s high-grade Creators were replenished.","The link formed by the Star Vastness Peony in space was subject to the same limitations as those of the Astronomical Parliament. This restriction stemmed from the fact that maintaining the link depleted the energy within the Star Vastness Peony’s body.","Having conveyed his message, Lin Yuan concluded his meeting with Ling Muzhuo. Now, all that remained was to prepare for the reception of these Creators and take them under his wing!","Recently, Su Yiren and Luo Lan had sought out Lin Yuan on two occasions to inquire about the gathering of faith in the faith country.","Su Yiren and Luo Lan were not the type to persistently trouble Lin Yuan over matters he was already aware of.","Their return to Lin Yuan was prompted by the exceptional beings in the faith country who, through their remarkable talents and abilities, had garnered the respect and affection of their peers, thus beginning to harness the power of faith!"]},{"number":2969,"title":"Chapter 2969 Transformed Thunder-Descending Shadow!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2969 Transformed Thunder-Descending Shadow!","....","This was not a bad thing for Sky City’s future development, but it greatly affected Lin Yuan’s goal of establishing Sky City.","Although these creatures who had displayed outstanding abilities and talents could also provide faith, the repeated transmission of faith power would indeed cause a waste of faith power.","Su Yiren and Luo Lan did not know how to deal with this situation.","Lin Yuan had already expected this to happen. Otherwise, he would not have been so anxious to transform Season Cycle into a faerie.","Lin Yuan needed to nurture the Faith Tree through Season Cycle. Fortunately, when the Abyss Red Lotus evolved into the Realm Abyss Red Lotus and obtained a new exclusive skill, everything was resolved.","Lin Yuan only needed to use his Body of All Spirits to support the Realm Abyss Red Lotus to refine the Continent Vein Cores.","Lin Yuan told Luo Lan and Su Yiren relaxedly, “Yiren, Luo Lan, I already know what you two are talking about. In another ten days, this matter will be properly resolved.","“The operation of the faith country can’t rely on just the two of you. If the faith country wants to develop properly, it needs to nurture a large number of talents to be placed in every part of the faith country! And these living beings who can obtain faith power are all talents worth nurturing in the future!","“You can pay more attention to these people and select them to be nurtured. When we nurture these people, they can take on a lot of the pressure for you. They can also make the faith country more stable and increase the citizens’ happiness! This will enable them to produce more faith power!”","Seeing Lin Yuan’s relaxed demeanor and hearing his assurance that the matter would soon be resolved, they were relieved, knowing that the faith country would remain unaffected for the next ten days.","The burden on Luo Lan and Su Yiren’s hearts lifted. Having previously managed federations themselves, they understood Lin Yuan’s intentions.","These individuals would one day become leaders in their own right. Su Yiren and Luo Lan had even debated whether it was necessary to eliminate them to consolidate the power of faith. Doing so would secure faith power acquisition for the faith country, but it would result in significant losses in other areas.","With Lin Yuan’s encouragement to nurture these individuals, Luo Lan and Su Yiren set out to select a group to form their stable team.","Su Yiren and Luo Lan would have to take over a bigger business in the future. The faith country would continue to expand and they couldn’t focus on the current matters.","Cultivating some people would free Su Yiren and Luo Lan, and it would also make it easier for them to manage the faith country.","“Young Master, we know what to do! By the way, do you recall those Thunder-Descending Shadows you requested us to position throughout the faith country?","“We’ve already stationed the Thunder-Descending Shadows in the designated temples. Utilizing the resources you provided, we’ve nurtured these shadows diligently. At present, the strongest Thunder-Descending Shadow has reached Sovereign/Creation VI.","“Young Master, would you like to inspect the progress of these Thunder-Descending Shadows? To facilitate homage and manage disputes, we’ve intentionally altered the form of the Thunder-Descending Shadows, allowing them to absorb feys with distinct characteristics.","“This adjustment ensures that when an elemental creature like the Thunder-Descending Shadow assumes a humanoid form, it possesses a symbolic item indicative of its strength and status!”","Naturally, Lin Yuan had not forgotten about the Thunder-Descending Shadows. They could be considered the key to maintaining Sky City’s stability and allowing it to produce faith power!","If there were few Thunder-Descending Shadows, their value would be greatly reduced.","However, the thunder zone that had been guided to Sky Sea’s back could already produce Thunder-Descending Shadows steadily!","Lin Yuan was rather curious about the Thunder-Descending Shadows’ growth.","Lin Yuan remembered that before he left the faith country, the Thunder-Descending Shadows were only at Diamond/Legend. To be able to nurture them to Sovereign/Creation VI in a few months was already very fast!","“You guys did very well. The leopard form is indeed not compatible with the function that the Thunder-Descending Shadow needs to perform. Summon them. I’m really curious about how well they have been nurtured!","“If the Thunder-Descending Shadow’s subsequent abilities and exclusive skills are different from what we expected, we need to specially guide them!”","Seeing that Lin Yuan was interested in the Thunder-Descending Shadow, Luo Lan summoned them from the fey storage box.","Purple light flashed with golden lightning, and the Thunder-Descending Shadow materialized before Lin Yuan.","These Thunder-Descending Shadows were markedly different from the leopard-shaped ones Lin Yuan had encountered previously. Now, they boasted three pairs of wings intertwined with Thunder Light, each pair exceptionally broad, dispersing Thunder Light with every beat.","Donned in robust purple-gold armor, the humanoid Thunder-Descending Shadows sported three towering horns resembling a mountain, exuding an imposing presence akin to that of a god—a sight to behold for any mortal.","Lin Yuan recognized one of them as the very creature he had once nurtured. During its infancy, it had been wild and unruly, relentlessly resisting Lin Yuan’s efforts with incessant struggles and roars.","Now that the strength of this Thunder-Descending Shadow had increased, it had extremely high intelligence.","When it faced him, it was no longer as violent as before. Instead, it showed a hint of intimacy.","Lin Yuan used True Data to investigate the Thunder-Descending Shadow.","[Fey Name]: Thunder-Descending Shadow (Angel Form)","[Fey Species]: Elemental-species/elemental-genus","[Fey Grade]: Sovereign (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Thunder","[Fey Quality]: Creation VI","Abilities:","[Thunder Light]: Activates the thunder energy in one’s body, transforming oneself into a glowing object that connects to the clouds in the sky and emits the same amount of light along with the clouds.","[Thunder Roar]: Rapidly rotates and rubs the thunder energy within oneself, producing a violent roar to stimulate the eardrums. In the presence of condensing clouds, the clouds will also emit a roar of an equivalent degree.","[Thunder Transformation]: Allows one’s body to absorb the aura of other lifeforms in the environment, enabling it to simulate the appearance of other lifeforms.","[Thunder Appearance]: Fills the surroundings with thunder energy. Wherever the thunder energy goes, it has a concealment effect. When the thunder energy touches the target, it can detect the target’s location before the thunder energy dissipates.","[Thunder Flame Suspension]: The suspended thunder ball pulls the target and attaches the target to the thunder ball. The thunder energy inside the thunder ball, friction at high speeds, activates the fire elements to burn the target attached to the thunder ball. After burning the target’s body to ashes, the spirit and soul will be imprisoned in the thunder ball.","[Annihilation Thundercloud]: Summons thunderclouds to cover an area. The thunder that descends from the thunderclouds will cause damage to lifeforms. Initially, it will paralyze the target, and attacking the paralyzed target will double the effectiveness of the attacks.","[Thunder Body Tempering]: Place the special thunder energy on the target specified in the range. Use the thunder energy to help the target temper their body and increase the toughness of their body. At the same time, it also has a weak effect of removing impurities in their bodies.","[Extreme Lightning Energy Storage]: When facing thunderstorms, it can collect the violent lightning in the thunderstorm into the lightning space it has opened up. It can convert the thunder energy in the lightning space to recover its consumption and provide its own continuous mobility.","Exclusive Skill:","[Thunder Marking]: Creates a mark on the target using thunder energy. Afterward, one’s damage-type abilities will not affect the target with the mark.","[Mighty Lightning Form]: When facing a target that is resistant and unwilling to obey, use the Mighty Lightning Form to intimidate the target with its appearance. There is a certain chance of making the target submit to it.","[Lightning Birth]: When being attacked from the outside world and in a near-death state, as long as the thunder crystal nurtured by the body is not destroyed, the thunder crystal can continuously replenish thunder energy in an environment rich in thunder energy. The thunder crystal can reproduce the body and the newly nurtured body will have the same strength as before.","[Tribulation Body Guiding]: When the thunder energy possessed reaches its limit, it can trigger the lightning tribulation to refine the thunder crystal in its body and expand the energy of the thunder crystal to boost its abilities and exclusive skills. Every successful lightning tribulation can increase the effect of its abilities and exclusive skills by about 5% (Number of lightning tribulations: 2).","The Thunder-Descending Shadows had always been functional feys in Lin Yuan’s heart, and he had always treated them as such.","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with the Thunder-Descending Shadow’s new exclusive skills. Its abilities and exclusive skills were either life-saving or improved its functionality.","For example, Thunder Body Tempering had the effect of improving the physical fitness of living beings and tempering the body to remove impurities.","The Thunder-Descending Shadow’s effect on improving the physical fitness of living beings was not as good as the Star Vastness Peony’s and its effect on removing impurities was not as good as the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar.","However, whether it was the tempering of the Star Vastness Peony or the Silver Stamen Gold Luster Cassia nectar, they could only be used by the core members of Sky City. They could not benefit too many people.","However, the Thunder-Descending Shadow could use Thunder Body Tempering to benefit all the white-clothed followers as well as the members of the combat and reserve sequences. Even the talents that Su Yiren and Luo Lan had discovered in the faith country would have the opportunity to temper themselves.","The Thunder-Descending Shadows could serve as a reward for contributors. Additionally, it could subtly bolster Sky City’s strength. It possessed an incredibly potent functional ability!","Extreme Lightning Energy Storage harnessed the energy of thunderstorms from the sky and stored it within the Thunder-Descending Shadow’s body.","This not only neutralized the adverse effects of thunderstorm weather on the faith country but also empowered the Thunder-Descending Shadow to utilize other abilities with greater endurance. It enabled the Thunder-Descending Shadow to fully leverage its functional capabilities.","With a sufficient absorption of thunderstorms, even if the casting of Thunder Body Tempering depleted significant energy, it could still sustain the ability’s effects.","Apart from these two opportunities, the Thunder-Descending Shadow’s three new exclusive skills were as effective on faith country as the two new abilities were.","Mighty Thunder Form was an exclusive skill that suited the Thunder-Descending Shadow’s role of being a sacrifice.","There were many people in the faith country, so it was inevitable that there were traitors among them. Under the condition of ensuring the perfect circulation of faith, the demon insects dealt with numerous people who obstructed the peace of the faith country every day.","Mighty Thunder Form would allow the Thunder-Descending Shadow to educate these disobedient people who were unwilling to contribute their faith, giving these people a chance to contribute their faith in the future.","Cultivating the Thunder-Descending Shadows required a significant consumption of resources, especially considering Lin Yuan’s utilization of resources to forcibly enhance their strength.","Should anything happen to the Thunder-Descending Shadows, Lin Yuan would need to nurture them anew. This would not only entail a substantial investment of resources but also potentially disrupt the operations of the faith country due to the void left by the absent Thunder-Descending Shadows.","Lightning Transformation served as a life-saving exclusive skill, allowing the Thunder-Descending Shadow to survive on the brink of death or with only the elemental core remaining in its body.","As long as the crystallized elemental core remained intact, the Thunder-Descending Shadow’s energy core would be transported to the thunder zone. There, it could swiftly resurrect, thus conserving Sky City’s resources and time.","This perpetual cycle allowed the Thunder-Descending Shadows to serve as perpetual sacrifices in the faith country.","Unlike flesh and blood lifeforms, elemental lifeforms did not possess a finite lifespan. In certain special environments, they could endure indefinitely.","Spring had previously imparted this knowledge to Lin Yuan.","It was highly probable that elemental lifeforms had inhabited perilous locations in the Sky Beyond the Clouds for countless years.","However, these enduring elemental lifeforms were typically not feared as monsters to be avoided by people. Instead, they represented opportunities sought after by various factions.","The speed at which elemental lifeforms increased their strength was largely related to the environment they were in.","Once an elemental lifeform grew in an environment, the elemental energy in the environment would be greatly consumed.","This made it so that even if elemental lifeforms had unlimited lifespans, their strength would still be limited.","The environment where these elemental creatures lived often nurtured many natural treasures.","However, if there were elemental lifeforms in places that could continuously produce elemental energy, their strength would reach an unimaginable level!","The reason Spring knew so much about elemental lifeforms was that she had started as an elemental lifeform.","The fact that Spring’s strength could increase to this extent was enough to show the potential of elemental lifeforms."]},{"number":2970,"title":"Chapter 2970 The Bloodians’ Death Toll!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2970 The Bloodians’ Death Toll!","....","The Thunder-Descending Shadow’s current functionality completely met Lin Yuan’s expectations, and he was very satisfied with it.","Su Yiren and Luo Lan Lin Yuan had finished observing the Thunder-Descending Shadow and asked, “Young Master, do you need to specially nurture this Thunder-Descending Shadow in the future? If these Thunder-Descending Shadows require special training, why don’t I look for Di Wanmi and ask her to formulate a follow-up training route according to your request?”","Sky City really did not have any Creators to use now. Di Wanmi could be said to be moved wherever she was needed.","However, Sky City’s situation would soon be rewritten.","“The Thunder-Descending Shadow has grown well. The other Thunder-Descending Shadows can grow according to the standards of this one. There’s no need to interfere more with the Thunder-Descending Shadows.","“There should be no lack of resources to nurture them. If you lack resources, just ask me. If I’m not around, go look for Master. She will provide you with resources!”","Apart from Lin Yuan who could mobilize resources at will, the Moon Empress was the only person in Sky City who could do so.","Lin Yuan trusted Liu Jie, Wen Yu, Su Yiren, and the others enough. However, if there were no restrictions on the use of resources, overuse of resources would inevitably lead to waste in the long run.","Moreover, Lin Yuan could not possibly give Sky City’s core members the authority to allocate resources.","However, this would inevitably cause those who did not have the authority to dispatch resources to overthink.","Apart from himself, Lin Yuan had made the Moon Empress the only person who had the right to dispatch resources. Not only could she guarantee that Sky City would be provided with resources when Lin Yuan was not there, but she could also convince everyone.","“Young Master, rest assured. We’ve been diligent in nurturing these Thunder-Descending Shadows. However, their sheer numbers pose a challenge. Each Thunder-Descending Shadow requires individual attention, limiting the number of caretakers available. It may take five to six years to fully nurture all of them.","“Though we’ve only recently arrived in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, five to six years is a short span in the development of our faith country. By then, the faith country will likely achieve stability. In addition to generating ample faith, it will also foster talents to reinforce Sky City.”","Lin Yuan nodded in agreement with Su Yiren.","It was evident that Lin Yuan had been supplying the faith country with resources. However, once the faith country was nurtured, it would undoubtedly yield significant benefits for Sky City.","If his sole aim was to garner faith, there would be no need for Lin Yuan to invest such effort in its development.","Recalling what Listen had reported a few days ago, Lin Yuan addressed Luo Lan and Su Yiren, stating, “Listen has already established trade channels for the densely populated 83rd and 144th districts in the north. These districts will serve as experimental grounds to assess the efficacy of the trade network. Any shortcomings identified will be swiftly addressed.”","Su Yiren and Luo Lan received this news with delight, both deeply invested in the faith country’s progress. With the two most prosperous regions now connected through trade, the residents could anticipate a markedly improved quality of life, transcending mere subsistence.","Coincidentally, Su Yiren and Luo Lan were keen to observe the resultant increase in faith power from these districts as trade commenced.","“Young Master, we are fully committed to facilitating the opening of trade channels in the 83rd and 144th districts,” they affirmed. “We will soon meet with Listen to coordinate our efforts and arrange for additional security measures, including deploying two more batches of demon insects to safeguard these areas.”","Lin Yuan smiled and nodded. After chatting with them for a while, he returned to the Spirit Lock spatial zone and used his body composition to support the Realm Abyss Red Lotus in refining the Continent Vein Core of the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","North of the Lonely River was very peaceful. At the same time, it had entered a period of rapid development.","...","The first thing Season Cycle did after becoming a higher faerie was to help Emerald Lady and Gray Pool nurture the Soldier Ration Radishes through the Cleansing Breath Soil in their bodies. This allowed the Soldier Ration Radishes to grow rapidly.","The Soldier Ration Radishes that originally needed a long time to be distributed could now be distributed in large quantities!","Season Cycle still existed in her original form. She proposed to Lin Yuan that the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants should inhabit her territory. This arrangement ensured that the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants could still thrive on the Cleansing Breath Soil and also have access to the Soldier Ration Radishes, which were growing rapidly.","Lin Yuan did not reject Season Cycle’s opinion.","Indeed, Season Cycle was the best place for the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants to survive.","Firstly, she could solve the cost of manpower and transportation. Secondly, even if the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants had sufficient food, they still needed space to move around.","The Titan Rhinoceros Elephants had thought that they would be hungry for a long time, but in the end, all their problems were solved in just a few days.","Lin Yuan had provided a better living environment for this species. The Titan Rhinoceros Elephants had never thought that their species would one day be able to live on a higher faerie!","...","Unlike the peace in North of the Lonely River, the mermaids and Bloodians in the Blue Shark Sea far away from Lin Yuan were engaged in an intense battle.","The mermaids had already received word that the Bloodians planned to attack them in the Blue Shark Sea and had secured several allies in anticipation.","However, not all sea creatures were willing to engage in conflict with the Bloodians, known for their relentless pursuit of enemies.","Despite the mermaids’ preparations, the ensuing conflict inflicted significant losses on both sides, driving them to fight to the death.","Over ten empress-class mermaids fell victim to the Bloodians, an intolerable blow for the mermaid community.","The Bloodians held inherent strength over the mermaids, and their motives for initiating the war were driven by a desire for sustenance rather than mere conquest—other sea species also risked becoming their prey.","Many sea creatures who came to the aid of the mermaids were slaughtered, prompting others to reconsider their involvement and retreat.","The Bloodians made clear their unwavering intent to target the mermaids, deploying a potent poison that not only harmed the mermaids but also affected other sea species.","Following the departure of the first wave of sea allies, some chose to submit to the Bloodians.","The prospect of depleting their species’ elite combatants in this conflict posed a grave threat to their survival in the sea, a price the mermaids could still afford.","Should one species withdraw, others would likely join the fight.","The mermaids struggled to maintain their defenses as the leaders of the Bloodian clans convened for a crucial meeting.","Qin Yu sat on one of the seven gem-encrusted seats. Previously, Qin Yu did not have the right to sit in such a seat. Qin Yu had already become a true leader of the Bloodians.","Qin Yu was even more grateful to Lin Yuan.","A tall female Bloodian sitting on the throne with a mole on the tip of her nose spoke. “Should we keep attacking these mermaids? They’re no longer providing any benefits.","“Our clans have captured numerous mermaids already. These captives could serve as a temporary food source for us!","“Not only do we risk losing strength by continuing to fight, but the Bloodians, especially those with royal bloodlines, have already suffered significant losses, with some clans having less than 30% of their population remaining.”","As the tall Bloodian Queen with a mole on the tip of her nose spoke, she revealed a sympathetic expression.","Those who did not know better would definitely think that this Bloodian Queen might seem inherently kind-hearted.","However, those familiar with the circumstances understood the truth: she continually deployed king clans to the front lines in the ongoing conflict against the mermaids and sea clans.","This marked her first presence at such a gathering.","Though Qin Yu harbored her own thoughts, she refrained from speaking impulsively. Any words she uttered now held the potential to sway the interests of the Elisa clan.","In this meeting, only a queen possessed the authority to address such a high-level internal Bloodian assembly. Others could only stand below, listening in silence.","Luxury mattered greatly to the Bloodians, a fact underscored by the ease with which they acquired chairs. The presence of Bloodian leaders who had the bloodline of kings served primarily to showcase the elevated status of the seven Bloodian Queens.","The oldest Bloodian Queen spoke in a pleasant tone. “What’s so difficult about that? Whether it’s the mermaids or other sea species, they’re just food to us.","“We’ve already acquired what we want, so why linger on this sustenance? Must we eradicate all of them? How can we ensure our reproduction if we exterminate these delicacies?","“They won’t continue to provide sustenance in the future! It’s regrettable that many Bloodians with king bloodlines have perished. Throughout the years, under the current queens’ protection, Bloodian clans with king bloodlines have absorbed numerous dependent species. Select exceptional beings from these dependents and convert them into Bloodians. They can compensate for the population loss quickly.","“The Bloodian lineage primarily relies on blood. clan members don’t necessarily need to be pure-blooded newborns from childbirth.”","The Bloodian Queen’s words made the faces of the Bloodian leaders with king bloodlines turn extremely ugly. However, no one dared to retort publicly.","That was indeed true, but the main way for Bloodians to reproduce was still to rely on pure-blooded Bloodians to reproduce, not to forcefully transform other species through blood essence. Such a transformation method did not involve any so-called emotions.","These people who were chosen from their dependent species did not have any sense of belonging to the Bloodians. It was very likely that doing so would raise the status of the members of a few dependent species and affect the balance between the dependent species.","Qin Yu remained silent. She was even more grateful to Lin Yuan in her heart.","This operation had caused such heavy losses to the Bloodians, far exceeding Qin Yu’s expectations.","If she had not become a new Bloodian Queen, the Elisa clan would still be a clan with a queen bloodline but without a queen to preside over them. The members of the Elisa clan would have definitely rushed to the battlefield.","The members of the Bloodian clans who had queen bloodlines had indeed lost a lot less, but it was not as if they had not lost more than 20% of their elite population.","At present, everything between her and the Elisa clan was bestowed by Lin Yuan. Qin Yu knew that Lin Yuan’s goal was to control the Scarlet Territory.","Qin Yu would constantly strengthen herself and raise her status among the Bloodians to achieve this goal.","Seeing that Qin Yu had not opened her mouth, the tall Bloodian Queen with a mole on the tip of her nose said with a smile, “Sister Qin Yu, you’ve only just taken up this position. Are you still a little nervous?","“Since everyone is still in the middle of deciding whether or not to continue fighting against the sea species, it’s up to us to decide. Why don’t we let Sister Qin Yu decide on this matter?”","Previously, Qin Yu was a male Bloodian when she was a Bloodian king. Although she had changed her gender when she was promoted to a queen, she was still a little unaccustomed to being called ‘Sister’ in public.","However, all the Bloodian Queens there were much more experienced than her. It was understandable for them to call her sister.","Since she was called, it was not appropriate for Qin Yu to not speak even if she did not want to be in the limelight.","Qin Yu had already achieved her goal. There was no need for her to stay here any longer. Escaping now was the best choice.","When she returned, she would have a reason to contact Lin Yuan and explain the specific situation of this operation to him. Then, she would trade the mermaid captives she had captured to Lin Yuan.","“If everyone is interested in my opinion, I see no reason to kill these mermaids. What’s the urgency regarding food? If the need arises later on, we can always reconsider targeting the mermaids.","“I’ve recently assumed the role of a Bloodian Queen, and there’s much I have yet to learn. If anyone disagrees with my viewpoint, please feel free to express your thoughts. You’re not obligated to abide by my decision!","“However, I want to clarify one thing: The Elisa clan will no longer partake in future operations against the mermaids, nor will we share any resources acquired from such endeavors.”"]},{"number":2971,"title":"Chapter 2971: Tears of Mermaid!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2971: Tears of Mermaid!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","This tall Bloodian Queen who specially mentioned Qin Yu was not surprised that Qin agreed with her.","Rosa had been paying attention to Qin Yu’s situation since a long time ago. She had always felt that Qin Yu had the potential to become a Bloodian Queen. According to Rosa’s understanding of Qin Yu, the latter was not a person who liked to kill meaninglessly without caring about the benefits in front of her.","Rosa continued what Qin Yu said. “The Meia clan doesn’t plan to continue participating in the follow-up operation either. In fact, it’s very simple whether we will continue the operation.","“Whichever clan has the intention and goal of continuing the operation will send their own members. Only the clans that contribute can share the subsequent resources. It’s fair!","“Those Bloodian clans that don’t plan on participating in this operation will wait here, just like we will. If any Bloodian clan encounters a crisis while dealing with the sea species and mermaids that is very likely to exterminate them, the clans that don’t intend to take action won’t just watch but will come forward to help.”","Rosa’s words set the tone for Qin Yu’s suggestion. After some thought, the other five Bloodian Queens did not raise any objections.","The decision of the Bloodian Queen sitting on the jeweled chair made the leaders of the Bloodians who only had king bloodlines heave a huge sigh of relief. As the party that suffered the greatest losses in this operation, they definitely did not want the losses to continue expanding.","Moreover, based on the current situation, there were basically no more benefits to continue harvesting.","This was the first time Qin Yu had spoken publicly after becoming a Bloodian Queen. All the queens had given her respect without exception. It could be considered as establishing Qin Yu’s authority as a Bloodian Queen.","The Bloodian Queen spoke first, her dark red hair intricately braided with large gems adorning each strand.","“Our species has gained a lot of benefits from this operation. Even the Bloodian clans that only have duke bloodlines have gained a lot. However, some resources belong to those who are capable. Why don’t our queen clans trade for the Tears of Mermaid that the Allen clan obtained in this battle? Otherwise, if the mermaids come looking for us, I don’t think the Allen clan itself can protect these resources from being taken away!”","Shi Mei, the Allen clan’s leader, felt a sense of foreboding upon hearing the news.","She was acutely aware that the Allen clan could not safeguard these resources. This wasn’t the first time Shi Mei had been involved in such endeavors.","Essentially, every collective action by the Bloodians resulted in the redistribution of resources held by the weaker clans. This ensured that the dominant clans ultimately reaped the benefits of resource allocation.","The Tears of the Mermaid could only be produced by mermaids above the thearch level. Not only was it a cherished treasure of the mermaids, but it also held immense value for the Bloodians.","Shi Mei said sensibly, “The Allen clan had planned to hand over these resources from the beginning. Even if you didn’t say it, I was already prepared to submit these resources voluntarily after the event and let the queen clans distribute them!”","With that, Shi Mei respectfully took out a bottle. This bottle contained more than 20 drops of Tears of Mermaid.","Even Qin Yu, who could already obtain many resources from Lin Yuan, could not help but be tempted when she saw these Tears of Mermaid.","Qin Yu was not surprised by the way the Bloodians distributed resources.","Before Qin Yu ascended to the position of Bloodian Queen, she endured similar mistreatment. At that time, the sense of powerlessness gripping Qin Yu’s heart mirrored what Shi Mei now experienced. Nevertheless, she maintained a facade of respect, concealing any discontent.","In the Bloodian society, status hinged not on prowess but on lineage.","Should dissent arise, even if the queens remained silent, other clans might attack the dissenting clans to curry favor with them.","The Elisa clan had previously suffered such repercussions, significantly impacting their trajectory. Were it not for these setbacks, the clan might have prospered centuries earlier.","Recognizing Shi Mei’s astuteness, Qin Yu pondered the prospect of nurturing her further.","Qin Yu harbored ambitions of controlling the Bloodians, spurred not only by gratitude toward Lin Yuan but also by the welfare of the Elisa clan.","The Elisa clan relied on Lin Yuan’s influence. Otherwise, Qin Yu wouldn’t dare entertain such aspirations.","Presently, whatever challenges arose, Lin Yuan was ready to assist.","The Bloodian Queens found Shi Mei’s compliance gratifying.","Qin Yu contemplated forging a connection with Shi Mei in the future, perhaps even granting her a significant role within the hierarchy.","Qin Yu said at the right time, “It’s good that you have such awareness. In order to commend your awareness, I’ll back you up during the exchange of resources so that you won’t suffer a loss in the transaction!”","The other Bloodian Queens were very surprised that Qin Yu had suddenly spoken up for this king clan.","In the eyes of the Bloodian Queens, the Allen clan was nothing special.","Although the Allen clan had the king bloodline, they did not have a king.","A Bloodian faction that did not even have a Bloodian king would not be noticed by these Bloodian Queens.","Within the Bloodian society, every action revolved around benefits. Acting on emotion was deemed impossible for them. High-level Bloodians, with their superior bloodlines, found it exceedingly challenging to hold favorable opinions of their low-level counterparts. Consequently, instances of high-level Bloodians marrying those of inferior bloodlines were almost nonexistent.","Grateful for Qin Yu’s assistance during her ordeal, Shi Mei bowed to her in appreciation.","Qin Yu reciprocated with a gentle nod in response to Shi Mei’s gratitude.","The Tears of Mermaid stood as the mermaids’ most prized possession and the Bloodians’ greatest acquisition. These tears possessed the unique ability to increase any creature’s affinity with water elements while concurrently catalyzing the purification of their bloodlines.","Upon obtaining such invaluable resources, the Bloodians weren’t limited to personal use; they could also leverage them in exchange for a plethora of high-grade Creator resources.","Qin Yu was about to contact Lin Yuan to see if he needed the Tears of Mermaid.","Now that she had become a Bloodian Queen, she had the conditions to trade with the other Bloodian Queens.","She had many Creator resources on hand and could use them to trade with the Bloodian Queens.","Since Qin Yu was willing to give respect to the other Bloodian Queens, they would definitely respect her as well. Therefore, even if some Bloodian Queens wanted to occupy the Allen clan’s resources for no reason, they still gave the Allen clan abundant resources when they traded for Tears of Mermaid.","The Allen clan had exchanged high-end resources for a plethora of low-end ones. By any measure, they found themselves at a disadvantage. Yet, this outcome represented the best they could achieve.","While surrendering the Tears of Mermaid might not appease the Bloodian Queens, reporting to higher-ups about a Bloodian clan hoarding such treasures would assuredly earn her significant rewards.","Having already gone their separate ways, the Andra clan remained resolute, likely due to their ties with the Lonely River’s four species. It was evident they harbored no intentions of reconciling with the Allen clan.","However, not long ago, Yi Xue took the initiative to seek out Shi Mei, expressing hopes of burying the hatchet and resuming cooperation.","At the time, the Allen clan had already suffered numerous casualties, prompting Shi Mei to agree to Yi Xue’s proposal.","Yet, throughout their renewed collaboration, the Andra clan consistently held back, leading to substantial losses for the Allen clan.","Despite numerous attempts to address these issues with Yi Xue, there was no sign of willingness to resolve matters. Thus, Shi Mei was thoroughly disheartened by Yi Xue, whom she already held reservations about.","Being the first to discover the Tears of Mermaid, the Allen clan had shared this information due to their close partnership with the Andra clan, allowing Yi Xue to become aware of the situation.","Yi Xue had been thinking of ways to get resources from her in the name of cooperation. He had not done anything to obtain these resources.","However, Shi Mei had been afraid that Yi Xue might disclose the discovery.","Despite her reluctance, she had relented and prepared to offer four Tears of Mermaid to the Andra clan as hush money.","In Shi Mei’s view, this hush fee was already steep. Yet, Yi Xue had been dissatisfied and threatened her, claiming that failure to provide all required resources to the Andra clan would lead to the revelation of the Allen clan’s acquisition of the Tears of Mermaid.","Faced with Yi Xue’s coercion, Shi Mei had contemplated allowing the Allen clan to claim the Tears of Mermaid for themselves. Nevertheless, she had gritted her teeth and surrendered an additional six precious Tears of Mermaid.","With the situation altered and the Tears of Mermaid already relinquished, there was no longer any need for Shi Mei to succumb to Yi Xue’s threats.","Despite their falling out, Shi Mei’s longstanding cooperation with the Andra clan had led her to still value their old friendship, and she had never contemplated taking action against Yi Xue. However, this sentiment relied on the condition that Yi Xue refrained from threatening her as well.","Now faced with Yi Xue’s forceful demeanor, Shi Mei was no longer inclined to be lenient.","Observing Yi Xue standing nearby, Shi Mei detected panic in his eyes.","If Shi Mei were in Yi Xue’s position, she would surely take the initiative to offer the Tears of Mermaid in exchange for resources.","However, Yi Xue did not opt for this course of action. Greed seemed deeply ingrained within him.","“To demonstrate our support for you, the Allen clan has already provided you with the necessary resources. We trust that the queens can appreciate the loyalty of our clan.","“In further testament to my allegiance to the queens, I must report a matter of importance. The Tears of Mermaid are not solely in possession of the Allen clan. The Andra clan also holds them. These tears were acquired from our clan by the Andra clan. All queens must be made aware of this!”","Upon finishing her statement, Shi Mei watched as Yi Xue collapsed to the ground.","The gazes of all the Bloodian Queens turned to Yi Xue as he hastily addressed them, “Queens, upon learning of your need for the Tears of Mermaid, I had already prepared to offer them to you. However, before I could act, someone else intervened. I implore the queens to investigate this matter thoroughly!” With that, Yi Xue swiftly produced the 10 Tears of Mermaid.","“I recall that the Andra clan has not had a king for nearly 1,000 years. Yet, despite lacking a ruler, you still seek to monopolize such resources. It appears the Andra clan harbors rebellious intentions.","“Do you not understand that as an inferior clan, you are obligated to obey the superior clans? Tell me, what consequences will the Andra clan face for their actions? In my view, considering the gravity of their offense, extermination seems a fitting punishment!”","The Bloodian Queens were incensed by the Andra clan’s actions. Firstly, they were dismayed by the lack of prior notification regarding the Andra clan’s possession of the Tears of Mermaid, feeling a loss of control over their clans.","Furthermore, they keenly felt the erosion of their authority. A Bloodian clan without a king dared to defy their decree!","However, these Bloodian Queens would not really annihilate the Andra clan just because of this matter.","Although Yi Xue was afraid, he was thinking the same thing. As long as the Andra clan suffered in some way, it would be fine.","He had already formed a grudge with the Allen clan. He would have a chance to settle scores with Shi Mei sooner or later.","“The Andra clan has always been fearless in every Bloodian activity. We have paid a great price for this. This time, the Andra clan is really in trouble. We are willing to accept any punishment! I hope you can give us a chance. We are willing to take out 50% of the resources we accumulated as compensation!”","Yi Xue no longer had any intention of defending himself. The expression of apology could be said to be unusually sincere.","Yi Xue knew very well that what the Bloodian Queens wanted was for him to submit to them. As long as he straightened his stance, he would still have a chance. He would be able to obtain the resources he lost sooner or later.","From now on, when the Andra clan developed, he would have to take revenge on the Allen clan for what happened today!","When Shi Mei reported Yi Xue, he had already predicted that his report would most likely cause a deadly feud with the Andra clan.."]},{"number":2972,"title":"Chapter 2972: The Executed Andra Clan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2972: The Executed Andra Clan!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Shi Mei still did this because her hatred for Yi Xue could not be reduced because of this.","In addition, the Bloodian Queens would probably get rid of Yi Xue to maintain their authority.","However, when Yi Xue said this and the other Bloodian Queens did not immediately attack Yi Xue, Shi Mei realized that her actions were a little hasty.","Shi Mei actually didn’t want to become enemies with the Andra clan if it could be avoided.","Despite the Andra clan not being as powerful as the Allen clan, prolonged conflict between them would still result in losses for the Allen clan.","Shi Mei understood that speaking less around the Bloodian Queens reduced the chances of making mistakes. However, she couldn’t resist saying, “Queens, Yi Xue has been threatening me for these mermaid tears. He had no intention of giving them up. I hope you won’t be deceived by his words!”","As she spoke, Shi Mei sensed the gaze of several Bloodian Queens upon her, some filled with malice. This realization made her suspect that the Andra clan had likely formed a connection with a specific Bloodian Queen over time.","There was a Bloodian Queen who sought to protect Yi Xue and the Andra clan.","It was probable that Yi Xue had informed a certain Bloodian Queen about possessing the Tears of Mermaid, essentially disrupting their plans.","With this in mind, Shi Mei quickly dismissed the idea. The Andra clan didn’t appear to have such a connection. If they did, they wouldn’t have resumed contact with the Allen clan after it severed ties with the Andra clan.","Following the Allen clan’s decision to sever ties, their treatment of Yi Xue had become exceedingly hostile.","At that moment, the voice that had already favored her once sounded out again. “There’s more than one disobedient Bloodian clan in this operation. The internal conflicts among the Bloodians have severely affected the internal development and balance of the Bloodians.","“The Andra clan’s leader, Yi Xue, hid some resources and tried to deceive the queens. He deserves to be executed.","“As far as I know, the Andra clan has been selling the venom of the Dark","Pufferfish at a high price because of their good relationship with the Lonely River’s four major species. I suggest that the Andra clan be stamped with the slave mark and allocated to the other clans as blood servants. The Andra clan’s dependent species will be divided among the Bloodian clans that are close to the Andra clan.”","Upon uttering her words, Qin Yu harbored an intense desire to eradicate the entire Andra clan. This inclination wasn’t a spur-of-the-moment decision— rather, she had harbored this intent for quite some time but had been lacking the opportune moment to execute it.","Viewing Fan Lou as a fellow colleague under Lin Yuan’s supervision, Qin Yu recognized the current necessity for her assistance.","Given Lin Yuan’s high regard for Fan Lou, it was evident the latter would soon rise. Thus, by eliminating the Andra clan, Qin Yu perceived it as extending a favor to Fan Lou.","The enmity between the Allen and the Andra clans was palpable and irrevocable. There existed no plausible resolution for this longstanding feud. Should Qin Yu offer another favor to Shi Mei, undoubtedly, she would align herself with her cause.","Qin Yu not only conveyed her disdain for the Andra clan but also imparted strategies for dealing with them effectively.","As long as the Bloodian Queens refrained from supporting the Andra clan, their fate would be sealed today!","It was inconceivable for a Bloodian Queen to ignore her authority.","Moreover, her approach to handling the Andra clan resulted in numerous Bloodian clans reaping tangible benefits.","If indeed a Bloodian Queen were to back the Andra clan, she would intercede on their behalf.","Additionally, this was to elucidate the intricate dynamics between Bloodian clans with Bloodian Queens and those with king bloodlines.","Yi Xue never thought that Qin Yu would deal a heavy blow to the Andra clan at a time like that.","There was no enmity between him and Qin Yu. He had even brought important members of the Andra clan to a banquet held by important members of the Elisa clan.","If there was any interaction between the Andra clan and Qin Yu it was probably because Fan Lou had left the Andra clan and joined the Elisa clan.","The only possibility was that Fan Lou had made Qin Yu hate him.","“Lord Qin Yu, don’t listen to her! The Andra clan has always respected you.","We’ve never done anything to harm your interests! 1—”","Before Yi Xue could finish his sentence, Qin Yu was already speaking. “Hid the Tears of Mermaid? Which despicable person are they listening to? How can you utter an excuse like you’ve never tried to harm the interests of the queens?”","It had been so long, but no one had spoken up for the Andra clan. This meant that the Andra clan had never received the favor of any Bloodian Queen.","The Bloodian Queen with a mole on the tip of her nose sensed Qin Yu’s killing intent toward the Andra clan and smiled as she said, “That’s right. The Bloodians don’t know how to respect the queens’ authority any more! I’ll defend the queens’ authority and get rid of this Bloodian vermin from the Andra clan! 50% of the resources isn’t enough to buy the life of the Andra clan after committing such a mistake!”","After saying that, the Bloodian Queen immediately took action and intimidated Yi Xue in front of the other clan leaders.","The Bloodian aura, which was of a higher level than the king bloodline, overwhelmed Yi Xue, rendering him immobile.","Yi Xue’s struggle tugged at the heartstrings of the other clan leaders, making them understand that all Bloodians were ants in front of the queens and that they could only bow down to them!","Currently, the authority of the Bloodians could only be controlled by the people sitting on these chairs. In the future, if anyone wanted to make a name for themselves among the Bloodians, there would only be one way—they must become a Bloodian Queen.","Qin Yu had already done what she needed to do. As long as Shi Mei was smart enough, she would come and find her after the meeting ended.","This meeting had already decided the next course of action for the Bloodians. After dealing with the Andra clan and distributing the Tears of Mermaid, the operation ended completely.","The Bloodians left the Blue Shark Sea.","The blue seawater of the Blue Shark Sea had already been dyed a faint blue-pink color by the blood. There would always be the remains of the sea creatures and Bloodians on the beach.","No matter how great the losses the Bloodians suffered in this battle, as the one who initiated the operation, it was impossible for them to show it.","Facing their devastated home, the mermaids and sea clans could only grit their teeth and clean up the battlefield.","Although they had suffered heavy losses, it was already the greatest benefit that the Bloodians could give the mermaids.","There were also no less than five Class 2 members of the Honor Absent Parliament among the mermaids.","However, these Class 2 parliament members were not in the Blue Shark Sea. This matter would definitely blow up to the Honor Absent Parliament in the end.","The Bloodians had never been afraid of such things because there had been countless species that had caused trouble with the Bloodians in the Honor Absent Parliament over the years.","The Honor Absent Parliament had no way of deciding who was right and who was wrong in the face of the war between the various species. They were just weaker and stronger.","With Yi Xue’s death, the Andra clan did not dare to resist at all. They could only be obediently marked with slave marks and divided among the various clans.","Back in the Allen clan’s tent...","Shi Mei still had lingering fears. This incident had taught Shi Mei a lesson and made her realize that she no longer had any chance to develop the Allen clan.","The Allen clan could control those small opportunities. These small opportunities would not make the Bloodian Queens unhappy.","If the Allen clan obtained a great opportunity, it could only be divided among the Bloodian Queens.","Under such circumstances, the best way for the Allen clan to rise was to get involved with a Bloodian Queen.","Qin Yu could be considered the best target among them! Qin Yu had helped her twice. She was the only Bloodian Queen who had ever expressed goodwill to her.","Shi Mei calmed down and secretly went to the Elisa clan’s tent in disguise.","Qin Yu would see if she could determine if the Allen clan could establish a relationship with the Elisa clan later.","Shi Mei was used to keeping a low profile. Moreover, if she acted in a","high-profile manner without Qin Yu’s approval, it would likely cause Qin Yu to misunderstand.","Shi Mei arrived at the entrance of the Elisa clan’s tent. Qin Yu did not immediately receive Shi Mei. Instead, she got someone to lead Shi Mei into the outer tent. She also clearly told Shi Mei that she was busy with something.","Shi Mei felt at ease. Qin Yu had gotten someone to bring her into the outer tent, which meant that she had plans to meet her.","Now that Qin Yu refused to see her, she must have something important to do.","Just as Shi Mei had expected, Qin Yu was communicating with Lin Yuan through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower.","[Qin Yu]: Lord Lin Yuan, the Bloodian mission to the Blue Shark Sea is over. I’ve captured more than 200,000 mermaids for you. More than half of them have high-level bloodlines. I wonder if these 200,000 mermaids can satisfy your request. Many other Bloodian clans have also captured mermaids. I can easily trade more mermaids from these clans for you.","Lin Yuan, who was helping the Realm Abyss Red Lotus digest the Continent Vein Core, saw Qin Yu’s message and immediately communicated with Dark Blue.","According to Dark Blue’s calculations, the mermaid’s sea could accommodate at most 350,000 to 400,000 mermaids.","If he wanted to accommodate more mermaids, he needed to expand the mermaid’s sea. The area of the mermaid’s sea was determined by the area that Dark Blue could radiate.","Therefore, Dark Blue had space for 350,000 to 400,000 mermaids.","[Lin Yuan]: Qin Yu, help me prepare 400,000 mermaids. Try your best to ensure the quality of these mermaids!","Qin Yu carefully memorized Lin Yuan’s request. It was easy for her to help Lin Yuan obtain 400,000 mermaids. She did not even need to use Creator resources to trade.","[Qin Yu]: Apart from these mermaids, Lord Lin Yuan, we also obtained the Tears of Mermaid in the Blue Shark Sea. I have three of them now. Do you need them? If you need it, I can try to trade with other queens for them. However, if you want to trade for the Tears of Mermaid, you will have to spend many Creator resources.","Her Creator resources were provided by Lin Yuan, so Qin Yu felt that she had to make things clear to Lin Yuan before expending a large amount of Creator resources.","Qin Yu did not want to cause a misunderstanding with Lin Yuan because of her consumption of Creator resources.","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up when he heard the words Tears of Mermaid. Lin Yuan had seen the Tears of Mermaid in Fortune Treasure Palace’s vault. However, the Tears of Mermaid were resources that Fortune Treasure Palace did not trade with outsiders.","Lin Yuan had made a special request to Zhan Lu and had been rejected even though Zhan Lu clearly wanted to befriend him. This made Lin Yuan realize how precious the Tears of Mermaid were.","Moreover, as the owner of the mermaid bloodline, Lin Yuan knew how the Tears of Mermaid were produced.","The Tears of Mermaid was not as simple as the tears of a high-level mermaid. It was a crystal secreted from the soul every time the mermaid’s bloodline evolved after breaking through to the thearch level.","The Tears of Mermaid were no longer useful to Lin Yuan. He just wanted to improve his mermaid bloodline through the Body of All Spirits.","The level of the Tears of Mermaid was much higher than the level of ordinary mermaid tears. However, it could definitely be considered the best nourishment if he wanted to improve Dark Blue’s bloodline!","Three Tears of Mermaid were not enough to transform Dark Blue’s bloodline. Moreover, Dark Blue would also need to consume and absorb the Tears of Mermaid after this bloodline transformation.","[Lin Yuan]: Qin Yu, try your best to collect the Tears of Mermaid. You don’t have to worry too much about the consumption of Creator resources. I will provide you with plenty of Creator resources in the future. When I provide you with them, I will give you something special so that you can interact and communicate with me directly.","Initially, Lin Yuan hadn’t planned on giving Qin Yu the secondary flower from the Star Vastness Peony.","Qin Yu’s journey to the Blue Shark Sea had underscored her value to Lin Yuan. She was akin to a tentacle Lin Yuan had extended into the Bloodians, her presence carrying profound significance.","This realization led Lin Yuan to reserve the second secondary flower from the Star Vastness Peony for Qin Yu. Otherwise, their resource interactions would necessitate a mediator, opening the door to potential issues over time.","With Qin Yu now within the sight of the other Bloodian Queens, Lin Yuan couldn’t rely on Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter to supply her indefinitely.","[Lin Yuan]: Qin Yu, I recall you mentioning your two assistants. While their lifespan issues have been addressed, they have little hope of enhancing their bloodlines. If this persists, even with continued use of the queen blood essence, they will struggle to endure beyond 10,000 years! I can transform them into authentic Bloodian Queens like yourself before the end of their lifespans.."]},{"number":2973,"title":"Chapter 2973 The Rooted Red Lotus!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2973 The Rooted Red Lotus!","....","Qin Yu had thought that Lin Yuan would reward her for her contributions, but she did not expect Lin Yuan to bestow a tremendous blessing upon the Elisa clan.","Lin Yuan had mentioned a similar situation before, but he did not explain it in detail.","The two Bloodian kings, Rula and Fan Qia, were Qin Yu’s two most outstanding assistants in the process of managing the Elisa clan. The few of them had worked together for so many years and already had sufficient tacit understanding with each other.","After becoming a Bloodian Queen, her life level had transformed, and there were also changes in her thoughts.","The reason Qin Yu treated Rula and Fan Qia like this was that they had accumulated a deep enough relationship over tens of thousands of years.","Otherwise, it would have been impossible for Qin Yu to continuously provide them with queen blood essence. Once Qin Yu’s queen blood essence was consumed, it would take a lot of time to recover.","[Qin Yu]: Lord, thank you for your support and reward for the Elisa clan. We will not disappoint you no matter what.","[Qin Yu]: With your help, Rula and Fan Qia will certainly be able to become the Bloodian Queens! If three Bloodian Queens appear in the Elisa clan, their right to speak in the entire Scarlet Territory will be greatly enhanced, making it more convenient for them to work for you.","Although Qin Yu was loyal to Lin Yuan, she still endeavored to secure benefits for the Elisa clan.","Lin Yuan never minded his subordinates’ selfish motives. In fact, he often found it advantageous for them to possess such motives, as they typically had their own goals, which better served his interests.","Having provided the necessary details, Qin Yu wasted no more of Lin Yuan’s time. His promises were sufficient for her, filling her with enthusiasm and renewing her vigor for the tasks ahead.","Following her discussion with Lin Yuan, Qin Yu didn’t overlook Shi Mei, who had come to visit. She had anticipated Shi Mei’s arrival, recognizing her as an intelligent person. If Shi Mei failed to even accomplish this much, wouldn’t she have protected Shi Mei and the Allen clan in public for nothing?!","Qin Yu wasn’t in a rush to trade the Tears of Mermaid with other Bloodian Queens, as immediate action might suggest impatience. However, she was also aware of the need to avoid undue delay.","Even though trading large quantities of the Tears of Mermaid might raise questions among other Bloodian Queens about her abundance of Creator resources, Qin Yu needed to do so. She feared that any delay might result in the Tears of Mermaid being consumed by others before she could complete Lin Yuan’s mission.","After a long wait, Shi Mei was escorted into the tent by Qin Yu’s trusted aide. It was her first one-on-one interaction with a Bloodian Queen, and she felt extremely nervous.","Qin Yu did not say anything to Shi Mei. Instead, she asked directly, “Do you know why I asked you to come here?”","Shi Mei actually feared that Qin Yu would talk nonsense with her. She did not understand Qin Yu and was afraid that she might inadvertently say something wrong which triggered Qin Yu’s displeasure.","However, Qin Yu went straight to the point in communicating with her, further proving that Qin Yu had taken a fancy to the Allen clan.","“Lordess Queen, you summoned me here to bring the entire Allen clan to listen to your teachings. My entire clan is willing to serve you as a servant in the future. I hope that you won’t despise our clan!”","At this point, Shi Mei paused for a moment before hurriedly saying, “Among the clans with the king bloodline, our Allen clan is considered the foremost clan. Lordess, you can send an envoy to the Allen clan for inspection!”","While Qin Yu appeared to have selected the Allen clan on a whim, it wasn’t because she didn’t grasp their significance. The Allen clan boasted a deep heritage and king bloodlines, making them a prominent Bloodian clan. Even after the demise of their king 1,000 ago, the current clan leader restrained their aggression, thus safeguarding their vast wealth. This was one of the key reasons Qin Yu was interested in the Allen clan.","“I’ll naturally send envoys to the Allen clan to investigate your background. At the same time, I’ll let the envoys take a portion of the resources from your Allen clan. But don’t worry, I didn’t save your Allen clan to plunder your resources and absorb your foundation. You have to remember this clearly!”","Upon hearing Qin Yu’s words, Shi Mei hurriedly nodded in agreement, but she did not agree in her heart.","Qin Yu would ask the Elisa envoy to extract resources from the Allen clan’s treasure vault. This left Shi Mei unable to refuse due to the situation.","Qin Yu made it sound nice, but wasn’t this behavior considered as absorbing the foundation of the Allen clan?!","The Elisa clan was only interested in the most precious high-end resources that the Allen clan possessed.","Shi Mei had refrained from using these resources because she wanted to use them to evolve into a true Bloodian king.","Only by becoming a Bloodian king herself could the Allen clan stand out from among the king clans.","Otherwise, no matter how much accumulation the Allen clan had, they couldn’t break away from their original trajectory.","Even those queen clans rose step by step in this manner.","The moment Shi Mei became the leader of the Allen clan, she was determined to develop them to new heights.","Qin Yu’s words effectively shattered Shi Mei’s wish, but Shi Mei did not dare to harbor resentment toward Qin Yu. If she showed the slightest dissatisfaction, the Allen clan would have to suffer the calamity of extermination.","In the Bloodian clans, harboring resentment toward a Bloodian Queen was considered a grave act of disrespect for low-level Bloodians.","Shi Mei did not believe that Qin Yu could not sense her animosity.","While Shi Mei struggled to conceal her emotions, Qin Yu looked at her with a playful gaze. Qin Yu knew Shi Mei’s ambition, which was precisely why she uttered such words.","Even without the Creator resources provided by Lin Yuan, Qin Yu would not be interested in the Allen clan’s resources.","The Elisa clan’s resource reserves were a few levels higher than the Allen clan’s resource reserves. The more ambitious Shi Mei was, the more her current restraint demonstrated her obedience.","Qin Yu’s first priority was to ensure that the Bloodian clan as well as their leader under her command were obedient.","Qin Yu was very satisfied with Shi Mei’s attitude. Just as Qin Yu had punched Shi Mei hard in the heart, she now planned to prepare some rewards for Shi Mei at the right time.","“I won’t let my subordinates take the resources of your Allen clan for nothing. After I absorb the blood energy in the blood pool, I will pluck five Blood Red Lotuses from the blood pool of my Elisa clan. I can give you these five Blood Red Lotuses to help your bloodline evolve in an extremely short period.","“Remember to submit to me and work for me. You will benefit greatly in the future. If I find out that you have ulterior motives, not only will everything I reward you be taken back, but the Allen clan will also suffer the calamity of extermination!”","Qin Yu was normally less generous than she was now. When bestowing rewards, she would not normally reward treasures like the Blood Red Lotuses. Qin Yu was doing this because of the growth she experienced under Lin Yuan’s guidance. She understood that when it came to rewarding others, she must be generous and not hold back. Rather than being stingy, it would be better if she did not reward at all.","Bringing the Allen clan under her command was not something she couldn’t hide from other Bloodian Queens and clans.","If Shi Mei used the Blood Red Lotuses to evolve her bloodline, it would allow the other Bloodian clans to know the benefits of relying on Qin Yu.","The Bloodians had always believed in strength. Qin Yu had already become a Bloodian Queen and the strongest among the Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory.","There was no need for Qin Yu to keep a low profile.","Upon hearing Qin Yu’s words, Shi Mei knelt in front of her excitedly and sincerely offered her the highest etiquette of a Bloodian. “Lordess Qin Yu, rest assured. Under my leadership, the Allen clan will remain loyal and committed to serving you as your faithful pawn. If there is a disloyal Allen clan, they will be destroyed by the heavens and the earth! From now on, the Allen clan will be under your supervision at any time!”","Qin Yu allowed Shi Mei to finish offering the highest etiquette of the Bloodians and used a force to lift Shi Mei’s body.","“From now on, there’s no need for such tedious etiquette between us. I already know your intentions. I prefer you to demonstrate your value through your actions. Shi Mei, don’t disappoint me!”","Qin Yu’s promise to Shi Mei was equivalent to fulfilling Shi Mei’s wish, giving the Allen clan a chance to rise. It was already a great honor to have the backing of a Bloodian Queen, let alone the fact that this Bloodian Queen also provided so many practical benefits to her.","Qin Yu’s first promise was already so generous. She would definitely not mistreat Shi Mei and the entire Allen clan in the future.","...","Since the Allen clan had already become a subordinate of the Elisa clan, Shi Mei openly displayed all of this without hiding anything. Naturally, this drew the attention of other Bloodian Queens in the Elisa clan.","Qin Yu had just become a Bloodian Queen, the Elisa clan should be in a deficit of resources.","They had recruited the Allen clan so openly most likely because they were interested in theit accumulated resources. In short, none of the Bloodian Queens believed that Qin Yu had the intention to nurture the Allen clan.","...","After two days, Qin Yu began to meet the other six Bloodian Queens one by one. As the new Bloodian Queen, Qin Yu should acquaint herself with the others.","During her meeting with the Bloodian Queens, Qin Yu suggested that she wanted to trade the Tears of Mermaid.","Qin Yu’s explanation to every Bloodian Queen was the same. She said that in order to become a queen in the blood pool, she had let the Elisa clan collect too many Creator resources in the early years.","However, the two kings of the Elisa clan also needed to evolve their bloodlines.","The Tears of the Mermaid held the power to extend one’s lifespan to a certain extent, proving more valuable to the two kings of the Elisa clan than Creator resources.","In the Bloodian clans, each Bloodian Queen operated as an entirely independent entity. While they forged alliances, they also maintained a cautious vigilance toward one another. Therefore, news of any trade involving the Tears of the Mermaid among the Bloodian Queens was unlikely to spread.","Should anyone dare to gossip about such matters, they risked swift exposure by their peers. However, Qin Yu harbored unwavering confidence in her ability to procure these tears, having made a promise to Lin Yuan.","Although Creator resources held lesser value to individuals like Rula and Fan Qia compared to the Tears of the Mermaid, they held greater significance for the Bloodian Queens. In a clan led by a queen, the queen’s interests always took precedence.","As Qin Yu had anticipated, five Bloodian Queens opted to trade with her.","The Bloodian Queen who didn’t trade with Qin Yu likely faced situations similar to those described by Qin Yu, which was that she also needed to use the Tears of Mermaid on a few kings who were nearing the end of their lifespan.","After receiving such an answer, Qin Yu did not force her. It would be impolite to force her at a time like this.","In any case, the Tears of Mermaid she had obtained fulfilled Lin Yuan’s requirements and exceeded her mission requirements.","Qin Yu was looking forward to the upcoming resource exchange with Lin Yuan.","...","At present, Lin Yuan was still helping the Realm Abyss Red Lotus absorb the Continent Vein Core in the King Blood Jackal’s territory.","The Realm Abyss Red Lotus had basically finished absorbing the Continent Vein Core. When it finished absorbing it, it would be able to absorb the faith power produced by all the lifeforms in the territory of the King Blood Jackals. This included the faith power that Lin Yuan had produced and obtained.","The Realm Abyss Red Lotus became the core of faith power transmission and transfer in the territory of the King Blood Jackals. From now on, the Realm Abyss Red Lotus would be the highest-level facility in the territory of the King Blood Jackals.","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment and felt that the Realm Abyss Red Lotus would not only control the territory of the King Blood Jackals, but also the Spinning Wings White Falcons, Crimson Heaven Falcons, and Titan Rhinoceros Elephants’ territories in the future.","Once the Realm Abyss Red Lotus took root, it would not be easy to move it.","Lin Yuan felt that instead of letting the Realm Abyss Red Lotus take root in the King Blood Jackals’ territory and move it around in the future, it was better to let the Realm Abyss Red Lotus take root on Sky Sea’s back like Sky City.","At the thought of this, Lin Yuan found Hu Quan in the Spirit Lock spatial zone and prepared to let him leave.","He chose a place on the back of Sky Sea to create a lotus pool for the Realm Abyss Red Lotus to take root. The problem related to faith country’s faith was finally resolved."]},{"number":2974,"title":"Chapter 2974 Planning!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2974 Planning!","....","The lotus pool that allowed the Realm Abyss Red Lotus to take root had many requirements, Hu Quan had to make a special design.","The Realm Abyss Red Lotus’ roots were extremely long, so all its roots couldn’t be firmly rooted in Sky Sea’s body. No matter how huge Sky Sea was, the Realm Abyss Red Lotus’ roots could still pierce through its body.","Lin Yuan let the Realm Abyss Red Lotus take root on Sky Sea’s back and let its roots stabilize it.","Around the lotus pool, many large dimensional spaces had to be created to store and grow the Realm Abyss Red Lotus’ roots. Therefore, Hu Quan had to carefully forge the lotus pool.","It had been a long time since Hu Quan had left the Spirit Lock spatial zone. After leaving the Spirit Lock spatial zone and coming to the outside world, Hu Quan felt the difference in spirit qi between the Spirit Lock spatial zone and the outside world and felt a little uncomfortable.","After living in an environment with a high concentration of spirit qi for a long time, the feeling of leaving it was similar to throwing a fish that lived in clear water into a smelly ditch.","Hu Quan shrugged and said, “Young Master, I have been in your space for too long. I’m not used to returning to the real world now. I might as well transfer 200 Spirit Craftsmen to quickly create what needs to be created according to your requirements, and then you can send me back to the space. I still have a lot of work to do in the space!”","Hu Quan was an old man who had joined Sky City a long time ago. Ever since he entered Sky City, he had been handling all of Sky City’s construction work. Lin Yuan’s Return from Faraway mansion, the Sky City on Sky Sea’s back, and even the Spirit Lock spatial zone were all built by Hu Quan.","The way Hu Quan and Lin Yuan interacted was not like how Lin Yuan’s subordinates treated him as their master. They were more like an uncle and nephew.","“Uncle Hu, I called you out this time to plan an area on Sky Sea’s back for planting a special large lotus-species fey. This lotus-species fey is a little special, so there are additional requirements for its cultivation in the lotus pool. If I don’t get you to come forward, I won’t feel at ease handing it over to someone else.”","Hu Quan chuckled upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words; they amounted to an acknowledgment and trust in his ability. He had always appreciated Lin Yuan’s recognition of his designs.","When Hu Quan first joined Lin Yuan, he was merely a Class 4 Spirit Craftsman. At the time, Lin Yuan was already a disciple of the Moon Empress. With Lin Yuan’s stature, he could easily attract a Class 5 Spirit Craftsman. Given Lin Yuan’s prestige and resources, any Class 5 Spirit Craftsman would have readily worked under him.","Hu Quan’s current strength had also been nurtured by Lin Yuan, step by step. Without meeting Lin Yuan, he would still be an arrogant and ignorant individual with numerous negative reviews, criticized as a heartless craftsman focused solely on making money through substandard work.","Without Lin Yuan’s guidance, it would have been impossible for him to transcend the Class 2 world and become the chief designer of a prominent faction like Sky City.","“Young Master, you trust me. I will definitely do my best to design without slacking off. Tell me about your requirements for the lotus pool first. I’ll see if they can be fulfilled!”","Before Hu Quan built Sky City, he had already transcended to Class 5 Spirit Craftsman. After transcending, there was no longer a clear classification of Spirit Craftsman abilities. Hu Quan wasn’t sure how strong he had been as a Spirit Craftsman. He was very confident in his abilities, but he wasn’t conceited. He didn’t think that he would be able to fulfill all of Lin Yuan’s requirements.","Lin Yuan said seriously, “Uncle Hu, you previously created a few fey storage boxes with a lot of space for me, which enabled communication between the inside and outside. I need you to use this technique to create a huge storage space within the walls surrounding the lotus pool, which allows communication with the outside.","“As for the rest, Uncle Hu, you can design as you see fit. My only requirement is that the storage space within the pool walls be as large as possible. If you need any materials, you can look for Wen Yu. There are many rare spatial spiritual ingredients in Sky City’s treasure vault now. You can use these spiritual ingredients when building the lotus pool.”","Upon hearing this, Hu Quan felt relieved. It was not difficult for him to open a huge storage space connected to the outside world in the wall of the pool.","“Young Master, I understand your request. I’ll mobilize the Spirit Craftsman to do this now. If it’s just building a lotus pool, I won’t need 200 Spirit Craftsmen. With the help of the Land Imps and the construction ability of Sky Sea, I’ll just mobilize 50 Spirit Craftsmen to work with me. I can finish the lotus pool in about three to five days.”","After saying that, Hu Quan immediately set off to contact Wen Yu to inquire about the new spiritual ingredients in Sky City.","Hu Quan thought that if there were any rare spiritual ingredients suitable for forging the Spirit Lock spatial zone, he could try to apply to Lin Yuan for them.","The three to five days that Hu Quan mentioned were in line with Lin Yuan’s expectations.","After Hu Quan finished forging the Realm Abyss Red Lotus on Sky Sea’s back, he could start collecting faith in the faith country.","...","Ling Muzhuo was extremely efficient. After only ten days, he contacted Lin Yuan and said that he could recommend two Grade 4 Creators to Lin Yuan.","There was also a Grade 5 Creator who had reached the end of his lifespan. However, this Grade 5 Creator did not expressly say if he wanted to come.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Grade 4 Creators were a benchmark. They were equivalent to Class 5 Creation Masters in the main world. At this level, they were considered a real big shot.","For example, the Moon Empress could only be considered to have just stepped into the threshold of Grade 4 Creator. At this level, they were still in the exploratory stage of being a Grade 4 Creator.","The specially diluted spirit qi crystals that Lin Yuan traded with the outside world were defined as resources produced by Grade 4 Creators, which gave Lin Yuan a clear understanding of the abilities of Grade 4 Creators.","The resources produced by Lin Yuan’s Spirit Lock spatial zone were at the pinnacle of Grade 5 Creator resources, and they were most likely not at the level of Grade 6 Creators. Only when Morbius’ grade increased again would the production of resources in the Spirit Lock spatial zone be able to cross the threshold of a Grade 6 Creator.","However, it was only a matter of level. The amount of resources produced by the Spirit Lock spatial zone was not something ordinary Creators could compare to. Even if hundreds of Creators were added together, they could not compare to the production of Creator resources in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","However, the Spirit Lock spatial zone had a drawback. It could only produce spirit qi and energy at the level of Grade 5 Creators. Hence, it was not as comprehensive as a true Creator.","If Lin Yuan could recruit two Grade 4 Creators and one Grade 5 Creator, it would solve Sky City’s urgent need for Creator resources.","With Lin Yuan unable to go out for the next week and considering the time needed to travel to Treasure City, he scheduled to meet the two Grade 4 Creators at Fortune Treasure Palace in half a month. As for whether the Grade 5 Creator would come or not, it was not Lin Yuan’s decision.","Lin Yuan thought that if this Grade 5 Creator’s lifespan really reached its end and there was hope to extend it, he would definitely make this trip regardless of how arrogant he was.","It had only been ten days, but Ling Muzhuo had already recommended two Grade 4 Creators to him. This made Lin Yuan very satisfied. In the future, Ling Muzhuo would definitely introduce more and more Creators to him.","Once Lin Yuan gained control over these Creators, he planned to offer Ling Muzhuo benefits, encouraging him to work harder for him in return for these benefits.","Ling Muzhuo intended to meet Lin Yuan in real life. Firstly, it was to gauge Lin Yuan’s strength. Secondly, it could deepen his relationship with Lin Yuan after meeting him.","Not to mention Grade 5 Creators, even those Grade 4 Creators were extremely noble. It was better for Lin Yuan to meet these Creators at Fortune Treasure Palace rather than bring them to Lin Yuan. The Creators were too difficult to serve. Although he was the Palace Master of the East Universe headquarters, these Grade 4 Creators would not give him any face.","...","Five days passed in the blink of an eye. On the fourth day, Hu Quan completed the construction of the lotus pool.","Hu Quan led the Spirit Craftsman to continue carving and decorating the lotus pool. He spread a thick layer of Revival Soil in the lotus pool and added Grasswood Fountain Water, making it the most suitable environment for lotus-species feys to live in.","There were all kinds of elegant lotus patterns carved on the walls of the lotus pool. Under the light and shadow, these lotus patterns were like cloud patterns swimming on the walls of the pool.","The Realm Abyss Red Lotus actually did not need the Grasswood Fountain Water and Revival Soil on Sky Sea’s back. However, it did indeed enjoy such an environment.","The Realm Abyss Red Lotus grew some secondary roots that were less than 100 meters long. It used these roots to intertwine with the flesh inside Sky Sea, firmly anchoring its body to Sky Sea’s back. Then, it inserted its sturdy main roots into the space connected to the pool wall like a spirit snake, allowing the main roots to grow freely.","After the Realm Abyss Red Lotus settled its main roots, Lin Yuan said to it, “Realm Abyss Red Lotus, you have already absorbed the Continent Vein Core that represents the territory of the King Blood Jackals. Use Illusory Lotus Faith to absorb all the faith power produced in this area!”","As Lin Yuan gave the order, the Realm Abyss Red Lotus swayed its lotus leaves a few times before they began to move rhythmically.","The faith power produced by all the lifeforms in the King Blood Jackals’ territories gathered toward the Realm Abyss Red Lotus. There were billions of lifeforms in the territory of the King Blood Jackals. Even if some lifeforms produced very little faith power, it still formed a flood of faith power when combined.","Fortunately, Gray had transformed into clouds that covered Sky Sea’s body. The other lifeforms could only see the faith power gathering in the clouds, but they could not spy on Sky Sea’s existence.","Not long after, the first golden lotus in the lotus pool grew out. The illusionary lotus was translucent and was 90% similar to the Realm Abyss Red Lotus.","The Realm Abyss Red Lotus could accumulate an unlimited number of illusionary lotuses, so there was no need to be in a hurry to use the faith power.","Not only could the Realm Abyss Red Lotus help Lin Yuan collect all the faith power produced in the King Blood Jackals’ territories, but it could also allow Lin Yuan to clearly determine the daily output of faith power in the faith country.","Lin Yuan and the Realm Abyss Red Lotus could communicate smoothly. Lin Yuan asked the Realm Abyss Red Lotus to regard the faith power it had absorbed for the entire day as one unit so that it could learn about the increase in faith power every day. This would allow Lin Yuan to clearly understand what actions could be taken to help Sky City produce more faith power in the future.","After settling the Realm Abyss Red Lotus and confirming that it could absorb all the faith power in the environment, Lin Yuan immediately informed Su Yiren and Luo Lan of the situation. This way, the two of them could focus on the development of Sky City in the future and no longer have to worry about the distribution of faith power.","...","Lin Yuan left Sky City with Winter and resumed his journey to Treasure City.","“Young Master, I really didn’t expect you to be able to nurture a precious item like the Lifespan Mouse. With these Lifespan Mouse and enough martial force as support, it is possible to persuade those Creators to choose to submit.”","Previously, Winter had no idea that Lin Yuan had nurtured the Lifespan Mouse. Despite Winter’s long dominance in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the sight of the Lifespan Mouse still filled him with astonishment.","The Lifespan Mouse could bestow an endless lifespan upon a lifeform. Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter enjoyed long lifespans due to their power, yet none were infinite. Without continued strength increases, they faced eventual death from old age.","Lifeforms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds pursued strength for two reasons: to allow themselves to do as they pleased and to prolong their lives. The limitation of lifespan acted as a shackle, compelling all lifeforms to seek liberation.","The stronger a lifeform, the more reluctant they were to face the end of their lifespan. Winter, for example, struggled to confront life and death calmly.","Throughout history, Creators held a dominant position in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Flattered by other lifeforms, Creators became exceedingly arrogant and rarely submitted to others.","However, exceptions existed. If Lin Yuan could satisfy the survival needs of these Creators, they might compromise to survive and retain respect. Additionally, Lin Yuan’s martial force could compel Creators to set aside their pride in critical moments.","Lin Yuan had informed Winter of his intention to recruit some Creators for Sky City, prompting Winter’s concern.","While Lin Yuan could easily direct Winter to target a specific species or faction, subduing a Creator posed challenges. Winter lacked viable strategies to coerce Creators into submission. Threatening them individually was impractical, and refusal would inevitably lead to confrontation and potential death."]},{"number":2975,"title":"Chapter 2975: Silver Fantasy Sunset!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2975: Silver Fantasy Sunset!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The official factions in the four universes of the Sky Beyond the Clouds had clearly defined regulations. Regardless of the conflicts among various species, they could not threaten the species’ Creators. Therefore, the fight between the major factions had nothing to do with these Creators.","Once there was a problem with the faction that a Creator belonged to, this Creator could choose to join other factions. If they rashly killed a large number of Creators to make these Creators submit, other factions would definitely target Sky City. No matter how neatly and strictly he handled his matters, there was always the risk of outsiders becoming aware if such actions were repeated frequently.","Furthermore, even if these Creators joined Sky City, Winter would have to keep a close eye on them to prevent them from causing trouble.","Now, the Lifespan Mouse had solved all the problems.","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “If it weren’t for the Lifespan Mouse, I wouldn’t have made such a decision in the first place. With these Lifespan Mice, Sky City will soon have enough Creators to create value!”","Winter said seriously. “Young Master, Creators are a group of people who are not easy to get along with. Many Creators have very strange tempers and are not as easy to control as Kani and Jin Chen. I suggest that after these Creators contract the Lifespan Mouse, you raise these Lifespan Mice by your side and use them to manipulate the Creators. Perhaps it will take several decades before these Creators are truly assimilated by the Sky City.”","Lin Yuan nodded. These Creators were definitely high-level figures. Subduing them was indeed different from subduing Jin Chen and Kani. However, Lin","Yuan did not really want to use this method to restrict these Creators. That was because such restrictions would change the relationship between the members of Sky City. These Creators who were accepted into Sky City would definitely be treated as its core members.","“Winter, while Sky City is indeed short of Creators, we don’t want all Creators. We still have to try our best to choose those Creators with outstanding characters. For those Creators with poor quality, let them die of lifespan depletion. This way, I believe these Creators will feel a sense of belonging to","Sky City after joining it.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Winter immediately became aware of the difference in their thinking. He was thinking about control, while Lin Yuan was thinking about assimilation. Considering it from a long-term perspective, completely assimilating it would definitely be better than long-term control.","Lin Yuan cared for every one of his subordinates. This was an extremely rare quality for a superior.","Along the way, nothing much happened.","When Lin Yuan returned to Treasure City, he realized that it was much more prosperous than before. Merchant groups drove in and out of the roads that Treasure City had opened up, constantly transporting large amounts of supplies.","From this, it could be seen that Treasure City had recovered from the previous incident. Much of this success could be attributed to the capabilities of the City Lord of Treasure City, Li Feng.","Before leaving Treasure City, Li Feng had told Lin Yuan that the main goal of developing Treasure City in the future would be to increase its strength. After hundreds of years, Treasure City would have enough martial force to protect it.","With the abundant resources accumulated previously, the transformation of","Treasure City wouldn’t be particularly difficult. Several hundred years would be sufficient to achieve this goal. With such an understanding, the development of Treasure City would definitely become better in the future.","Since he had come to Treasure City, Lin Yuan had to contact Li Feng.","News of Lin Yuan’s arrival at Fortune Treasure Palace would most likely reach the ears of the City Lord. If Lin Yuan did not show up in front of Li Feng, it was hard to guarantee that Li Feng would not think too much.","Lin Yuan, who understood the ways of the world, first went to the City Lord Manor to visit Li Feng. Although Treasure City’s trading system had been restored, it was still in a state of disrepair and in need of revitalization. Many of the destroyed districts had to be rebuilt.","Li Feng strengthened his control over the chambers of commerce and the population of Treasure City. Everyone who entered or left Treasure City had to register and report. He was currently at his busiest stage, but when he heard that Lin Yuan had arrived at Treasure City, he immediately returned to the City Lord Manor.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan, Li Feng said with a smile, “Young Master Lin, it’s been a while since we last met. How have you been during this period?!”","During the conversation, Li Feng warmly extended his hand to Lin Yuan, who graciously reciprocated by shaking hands with him.","“Everything is fine thanks to you, City Lord Li! I came to Treasure City this time to conduct a transaction with Fortune Treasure Palace. However, I came to visit you before heading there. Seeing that everything in Treasure City is in a state of being repaired, I know that everything here will be fine!”","Li Feng laughed and said, “Young Master Lin, since you’re one of us. I will be frank with you. Previously, although I was the City Lord of Treasure City, it was not like no faction in Treasure City could resist and restrain me. I didn’t have any good solutions to deal with these factions that were contending against and restraining me.","“As the City Lord, I’ve only managed Treasure City for more than 2,00 years, but some factions have always been rooted in Treasure City. After the previous storm, most of those factions were basically wiped out by the star pirates and me. Without these people restraining Treasure City, I have the final say. This allows me to develop Treasure City according to my own ideas.”","Li Feng bowed respectfully to Lin Yuan. “Thank you, Young Master Lin, for giving me a chance to fulfill my ambitions. If not for you, I would probably have become a part of history alongside Treasure City.”","Li Feng took out a bright silver seed and handed it to Lin Yuan, “Young Master Lin, this is the reward from Honor Absent Palace for Treasure City’s survival through this calamity. This Silver Fantasy Sunset seed should belong to you.’","Lin Yuan did not have any knowledge about the Silver Fantasy Sunset in his mind. This meant that Genius had searched through so many books, but there were no records of it. However, this did not affect Lin Yuan at all.","Lin Yuan had already used Morbius’ True Data to investigate the Silver Fantasy Sunset seed.","Lin Yuan had been thinking about how to hide Sky City’s development in North of the Lonely River. The Thriving Summer Rising Clouds planted by Summer could only ensure the territory’s safety, but they could not hide Sky City’s development. However, this Silver Fantasy Sunset had the ability to do so.","The Silver Fantasy Sunset was the same type of plant as the Morning Glory that Lin Yuan had planted in the Xia Region’s greenery. It could reproduce in large numbers every season.","During the blooming process, the Silver Fantasy Sunset would release a large amount of pollen. When the pollen filled the environment, the surroundings would appear as if reflected in a mirror.","Because the Silver Fantasy Sunset was blooming all year round, this mirror effect persisted continuously.","Lin Yuan only needed to use this Silver Fantasy Sunset seed to produce a large number of Silver Fantasy Sunsets and plant them together with Thriving Summer Rising Cloud to completely protect the North of the Lonely River’s environment.","Since it was a fey that he needed, Lin Yuan did not stand on ceremony and accepted the Silver Fantasy Sunset’s seed.","“City Lord Li, your statement seems serious. Our relationship is one of cooperation, so it should be mutually beneficial. If there’s a need in the future, I think I’ll protect Treasure City like before.”","When Li Feng heard Lin Yuan’s words, he felt that he had made the right decision to let Lin Yuan become the sponsor of Treasure City. Lin Yuan’s existence gave Li Feng enough confidence to do things.","“Young Master Lin, in the future, I believe there will be many occasions where I’ll need your help. If you have any requests, feel free to inform me, and I’ll do my best to fulfill them to the best of my ability!”","Upon hearing his words, Lin Yuan smiled. “I really have something to ask City Lord Li for help with. There’s no need to use the power of Treasure City for this matter, but it will take some effort from you. However, after you’ve spent enough effort, you’ll be able to obtain enough feedback!”","In all the transactions with Lin Yuan, Li Feng had always been the one benefiting from Lin Yuan’s assistance. Now, if Lin Yuan sought his help, Li Feng was more than willing to lend a hand.","Not only did Li Feng want to help Lin Yuan, but he was also thinking about how to do his best to help Lin Yuan. However, Li Feng was somewhat uncertain. He was afraid that he would not be able to help Lin Yuan in the end.","“Young Master Lin, don’t hesitate to ask for help. Not only am I willing to invest effort, but I’d pay a huge price for your sake.”","Lin Yuan’s request for Li Feng’s help was the same as the one he made to Ling Muzhuo. Yet, the two requests involved entirely different information and connections.","Li Feng was associated with the official faction of Honor Absent Palace. He knew more people from the official faction.","Using Li Feng as a channel to introduce Lin Yuan to Creators whose lifespans were nearing their end might not necessarily produce inferior results compared to seeking assistance from Ling Muzhuo.","There was no inherent issue with Lin Yuan seeking Li Feng’s help, and Li Feng was unaware of any safety risks associated with Lin Yuan’s plan. Just as Ling Muzhuo could weigh the pros and cons after hearing Lin Yuan’s request, a discerning person like Li Feng would likely be able to do the same.","As the City Lord of Treasure City, there was no doubt about Li Feng’s intelligence. If he weren’t smart, it would already be an achievement for him to hold his own as a newly appointed City Lord in a city entrenched with local factions that had existed for thousands of years, especially considering Li Feng’s lack of established martial force.","“City Lord Li, you are an official figure of Honor Absent Palace. With your strength, you should also be a member of the Honor Absent Parliament. I hope to use your channels and connections to introduce some Creators to me!” Lin Yuan was right. Li Feng was indeed a genuine member of the Honor Absent","Parliament. However, he didn’t have much face in front of those high-grade Creators. Lin Yuan would definitely not be interested in Creators of lower grades.","Li Feng really wanted to do something for Lin Yuan, but this matter was really difficult for him.","“Young Master Lin, I do have some channels for Creators, but even if I use my connections to find these Creators, the compensation that I should pay won’t be little. Moreover, most of the time, these Creators tend to charge more when dealing with acquaintances. So, when I approach them, they demand even higher compensation!”","Li Feng told Lin Yuan the truth without hiding anything.","Lin Yuan liked Li Feng’s honesty. It let Lin Yuan know that Li Feng was the kind of person he could really work together with. Rather than those who took on everything themselves, Lin Yuan preferred cautious collaborators like Li Feng.","“City Lord Li, I haven’t finished speaking. Not only do you understand the situation of those Creators, but I also understand it very well. The reason why I asked you to introduce me to these Creators is that I have some spiritual ingredients that can increase their lifespans.","“With these spiritual ingredients, those Creators who are about to reach the end of their lifespan will cooperate with me for the sake of the spiritual ingredients. Therefore, you only need to introduce me to those Creators who don’t have much lifespan left.","“I have Creators under my command, and I know what kind of temper the","Creators have. If we cooperate, I definitely won’t let you help with tasks that are difficult to accomplish and put you in a difficult position.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Li Feng’s eyes lit up. He wasn’t afraid to leverage his connections, having witnessed firsthand the power of Lin Yuan’s subordinates. To forge relationships with such individuals, Li Feng was willing to tap into his own network.","However, he was worried that the Creators he introduced to Lin Yuan might be too arrogant, risking Lin Yuan’s discontent. If this occurred, there was no guarantee that Lin Yuan wouldn’t hold him accountable. In such a scenario, Li Feng might as well refrain from offering his help.","Li Feng couldn’t divulge too much information about Lin Yuan to the Creators he introduced. Through their interactions, Li Feng had sensed that Lin Yuan valued his privacy.","Now, Li Feng understood that Lin Yuan wanted to use spiritual ingredients that could increase lifespans to hire Creators nearing the end of their own lifespans to work for him.","Lifespan was a mundane concept for those in infancy, youth, and adulthood, as lifeforms at these stages couldn’t sense the aura of death. Moreover, the risks of the environment in the Sky Beyond the Clouds had made many lifeforms pessimistic, fearing various accidents that could shorten their lives.","Individuals like Li Feng, born into wealth, shared a similar apprehension when they were young.","However, for those approaching the end of their lifespan, particularly the higher-ups among them, they were willing to go to great lengths to extend their time.."]},{"number":2976,"title":"Chapter 2976: Spare My Life!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2976: Spare My Life!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Those spiritual ingredients that could increase lifespan were extremely expensive. However, they came with many different effects.","If the Creators had consumed some kind of spiritual ingredient that could increase their lifespans, the new spiritual ingredients provided by Lin Yuan would most likely be ineffective.","However, Li Feng did not specifically mention this to Lin Yuan. For those Creators, as long as a channel to increase lifespan was provided, regardless of whether it was effective in the end, they would accept the offer.","“Your Grace Lin Yuan, there’s an old friend of mine in Treasure City. He’s a high Grade 4 Creator, not far from pinnacle Grade 4. He only has less than 100 years left to live. I invited him here this time because one of my children needs to wash away the impurities in his body. I’ve put in a lot of effort to make him make this trip. Do you think I should help you arrange it now? Speaking of which, it’s a coincidence that he’s leaving the day after tomorrow.”","Lin Yuan raised his eyebrows. If what Li Feng said was true, then it was really a coincidence.","In Lin Yuan’s previous life, anyone who could live for 100 years was extremely lucky. However, in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, 100 years passed in the blink of an eye.","It was common for powerful lifeforms to go into seclusion for 1,000 years. For example, Qin Yu had gone into seclusion for nearly 4,000 years to become a Bloodian Queen.","Lin Yuan had arrived at Treasure City earlier than the agreed time with Ling Muzhuo, so there was no need to rush to Fortune Treasure Palace. Coincidentally, he had the time to meet the high Grade 4 Creator that Li Feng had mentioned.","“City Lord Li, since that’s the case, I’ll leave the arrangements to you. I need a quiet room with an absolutely secretive environment to communicate with the","Creator you recommended to me.”","Li Feng hurriedly said, “Young Master Lin, don’t worry. I left the room you booked last time for you to use alone in the future. It happened to come in handy today. Why don’t you meet this old friend of mine there? With the presence of this elderly man by your side, any environment can be deemed an absolute quiet room for you!”","Li Feng’s words were a show of goodwill to Winter. Now, the relationship between Li Feng and Lin Yuan had grown closer, and they had established a cooperative relationship.","Winter nodded at Li Feng. If not for the change in the relationship between Li Feng and Lin Yuan, Winter would not have paid attention to him.","Li Feng excitedly made the arrangements. Once this matter was accomplished, he would be doing Lin Yuan a favor. Not only would his relationship with Lin Yuan advance further, but the Creator he referred to as an old friend would also appreciate him in the same way. In the future, when he asked for Creator resources, it would not be as troublesome as now.","Lin Yuan returned to the room he had stayed in the City Lord Manor and realized that the room had been renovated. The renovation took a lot of ingenuity and must have taken at least a few days to complete. It was enough to show Li Feng’s attitude toward befriending him.","Winter said, “Young Master, Li Feng is a very far-sighted individual. His management of Treasure City reflects great ambition. There must be someone from Honor Absent Palace who wants to train Li Feng. Otherwise, Li Feng wouldn’t have been assigned to a resource-type city like Treasure City. If there’s a suitable opportunity in the future, you can help Li Feng. If he can become one of us, he will definitely be of help in the future!”","Lin Yuan, Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter had always had a consensus that only those truly under his control could be considered his own people.","Lin Yuan smiled. “Now that we’ve started working with Li Feng, we’ll become more familiar with him. We can understand Li Feng and know what kind of person he is before deciding whether to invest resources in him.”","In Lin Yuan’s opinion, Li Feng was very opinionated, but being too opinionated may not necessarily be good, especially considering Li Feng’s future development in Honor Absent Palace. People who were too opinionated may run the risk of losing control over their actions.","This loss of control did not imply that Li Feng would disregard Lin Yuan’s orders. Instead, it meant that Li Feng was more used to making decisions on his own that were not in line with Lin Yuan’s needs. In an environment like Honor Absent Palace, once a decision was made, there was no possibility of going back on it.","Lin Yuan had been in this room for nearly two hours, but the Creator had yet to appear.","Lin Yuan understood that it was impossible for Li Feng not to inform him of the situation immediately. The Creator was obviously putting on airs.","At that moment, Lin Yuan understood why Winter had suggested he have double control over these Creators.","“Young Master, do you need me to rush him for you?”","Winter sensed Lin Yuan’s displeasure. Since the Creator did not come immediately, it was very likely that the Creator would only appear when Lin Yuan showed signs of wanting to leave.","There was nothing Winter could do about this situation, which was the most annoying thing about Creators. All the Creators that Winter had encountered with basically had such stubborn behavior.","Lin Yuan did not ask Winter to look for the Creator. Instead, he said coldly, “Winter, I didn’t have the chance to interact with these Creators before, so I don’t know much about the Creators in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Let’s continue to wait here. I’ll see how long it will take for him to come over!”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, he knew this Creator would likely face consequences soon. It would be best if he had a reason that Lin Yuan could accept.","Lin Yuan waited in the room for nearly eight hours. During that time, he did not idle. He was circulating his Body of All Spirits to refine his Bloodian bloodline.","There was a reason why the Bloodians could hunt down other factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. The feedback from a Bloodian bloodline on physical qualities and strength was too strong. After Qin Yu became a Bloodian Queen, Lin Yuan had taken a portion of her blood essence.","Right now, Lin Yuan’s bloodline was at the level of a Queen. If not for the fact that Lin Yuan’s strength was not up to the standard of a Bloodian Queen, he could have used his bloodline to pretend to be a real Queen.","Lin Yuan had heard from Qin Yu that the Bloodian Queen bloodline was not the highest level. Above the queen bloodline was the empress bloodline. It was said that there was an ancestral bloodline above the empress bloodline.","However, the most powerful individual among the Bloodians was only at the empress level. Lin Yuan was prepared to use his Body of All Spirits to improve his queen bloodline. However, strengthening a Bloodian Queen bloodline was an extremely long process.","However, Lin Yuan had plenty of time. The Body of All Spirits could improve his bloodline much faster than a Bloodian Queen could improve her bloodline through resources. Furthermore, if Lin Yuan were to absorb the blood essence of other Bloodian Queens during this process, it could also accelerate his progress.","Upon hearing the sound from outside the door, Lin Yuan opened his eyes, while Winter stood behind him, glaring coldly at the entrance.","The door was not knocked on. Instead, it was pushed open from the outside.","“Why do you want to see me? I heard that you have spiritual ingredients that can increase lifespan. Show me those spiritual ingredients. If I can use it, we can talk. If I can’t use it, you don’t have the right to talk to me!”","Li Feng, who was following behind the man, was livid. When he went to discuss this matter, he did not expect Huang An to be dissatisfied that Lin Yuan did not take the initiative to greet him.","In Huang An’s eyes, even if someone had spiritual ingredients that could increase lifespan, they must first come to see him if they wished to cooperate using those ingredients. If they didn’t come to visit him first, Huang An wouldn’t take them seriously.","In all the negotiations, Huang An had grown accustomed to ensuring that he always maintained a dominant position, regardless of the circumstances. This was his confidence as a high Grade 4 Creator.","Li Feng gave Lin Yuan an apologetic look, but the latter did not respond. Instead, he signaled Li Feng to leave.","Li Feng had helped Lin Yuan communicate this matter. Since Li Feng had done nothing wrong, Lin Yuan wouldn’t vent his anger on him.","Seeing Lin Yuan allowed him to leave, Li Feng felt an inexplicable sense of relief.","Despite Li Feng explaining Lin Yuan’s background to Huang An, he did not take it seriously. He continued to use his status as a high Grade 4 Creator to be arrogant. Not only did he delay for nearly eight hours, but he also pushed open the door when he entered. This went beyond mere arrogance.","If Lin Yuan and Huang An got into a conflict there, he would definitely be in a dilemma.","Lin Yuan had the right to fall out with Huang An, a high Grade 4 Creator. With Huang An’s attitude, Li Feng felt that there was a high chance that they would quarrel.","After Li Feng left, Huang An snorted coldly. “You haven’t answered my question yet. Let me tell you that my time is extremely precious. It’s not something you can casually delay. I’m leaving Treasure City tomorrow. You have to be grateful to me for taking the time to meet you in my busy schedule.”","Winter couldn’t stand Huang An anymore. If Lin Yuan hadn’t said anything, he would have slapped Huang An’s face and shattered his teeth to make him unable to utter such annoying words.","Lin Yuan was so angry that he laughed. “Gratitude? It seems like you really like others to thank you. In that case, Winter, come and thank this Creator who made us wait for eight hours!”","Lin Yuan finally spoke out, bringing great relief to Winter.","Winter immediately released his aura, sealing off the entire room in an instant.","Winter’s pressure enveloped Huang An without holding back, causing Huang An to spit out a mouthful of blood.","Huang An felt as if Winter’s released aura was crushing his internal organs, rendering him unable to channel his spiritual power.","A high-grade Creator did not need to bring retainers with them when they went out because Creators were powerful.","Creators would definitely prioritize improving their strength before improving the strength of others.","Huang An had always been very confident in his strength. However, Winter’s strength made Huang An feel a huge disparity and instilled an exceptional sense of fear in his heart.","Previously, Huang An had never been treated like this when he treated others with such an attitude. This was the first time he had been treated in such a manner.","“I’m a high Grade 4 Creator. My identity as a Creator has been verified in the Creator Alliance. Do you know what you’re doing now? If word of this gets out, you will be held accountable by the Creator Alliance. Honor Absent Palace will not let you off either!”","Winter said emotionlessly, “We naturally know what we’re doing now, but what makes you think this matter will spread? As long as it doesn’t spread, why would we be held accountable by the Creator Alliance and targeted by Honor Absent Palace?”","Huang An shouted sharply, “It was Li Feng who brought me here to see you. If anything happens to me, Li Feng won’t just stand by and watch!”","Winter raised his hand and pointed at Huang An. Cold air condensed on Winter’s fingertips, “No, Li Feng is a smart person. He won’t want to get into this trouble for no reason. If anyone asks him, he’ll say you’ve already left Treasure City.","“Besides, I heard from Li Feng that you only have 100 years left to live. Instead of letting you travel around to obtain a way to increase your lifespan, it’s better to send you to sleep now!”","Huang An’s arrogance and confidence stemmed from his status as a high Grade 4 Creator. It came from the endless flattery and adulation from others. These were the main reasons Huang An had become like this. Before he grew up, Huang An was a timid person. When he had less than 20,000 years left to live, he had already begun searching everywhere for methods to extend his lifespan.","Huang An possessed a strong will to survive. If he were unwilling to let time erode him, he certainly wouldn’t consent to having his life taken away by others.","Huang An could sense indifference and disdain from Winter toward himself. He did not doubt that Winter might really end his life by attacking him.","At that moment, Huang An completely panicked and his attitude softened!","When Lin Yuan saw the change in Huang An’s expression, he thought that Huang An was just a coward. He did not deny Huang An’s Creator abilities, but apart from Creator-related abilities, there was nothing worthy of praise about him.","Lin Yuan did not participate in Winter’s targeting of Huang An during this period. Winter’s cold finger landed on Huang An, causing half of his body to freeze.","Huang An felt the call of death and hurriedly shouted, “Y-You can ask me to do anything. Forgive me, spare my life!”","The corners of Winter’s mouth curled up slightly when he heard Huang An shout this.."]},{"number":2977,"title":"Chapter 2977 Lifespan Mice That Were Dispatched!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2977 Lifespan Mice That Were Dispatched!","....","Winter never intended to kill Huang An. All of his actions were only intended to intimidate Huang An. After all, Lin Yuan had never given him any orders to deal with Huang An.","Winter attacked and injured Huang An because he knew very well that a fellow like Huang An would only submit if he injured him and made him truly feel the threat of death.","Compared to Lin Yuan taking the initiative to invite Huang An into Sky City, it was better for him to use these unconventional methods to force Huang An to submit. Otherwise, even if he intimidated Huang An now, he would definitely put on airs again when Lin Yuan invited him.","“Whether or not to spare your life depends on our Young Master’s decision. Our Young Master will meet other Creators later. Seeing you was just a spur-of-the-moment idea.”","Huang An dragged his frozen half-body and crawled to Lin Yuan. He crawled to the ground and told Lin Yuan in a sorry state, “Young, Young Master, my Creator ability has reached high Grade 4. I also have some spirit fluid secret recipes I obtained with great difficulty. The spirit fluid I concoct for you will definitely be of great value. S-Sorry for offending you just now. Even if you don’t help me increase my lifespan, I’m willing to work for you!”","Lin Yuan looked at the pathetic Huang An and snorted.","At present, Huang An seemed to understand the situation well, although his behavior just now was despicable.","Lin Yuan knew very well that he should not forgive a fellow like Huang An so easily. The more difficult it was to obtain his forgiveness, the more obedient he would be in the future.","“A high Grade 4 Creator isn’t all that impressive. Over time, most high Grade 4 Creators will accumulate some hidden potion formulas. However, that doesn’t prove your worth.","“You’re so rude to me and don’t have much lifespan left. Why should I forgive you? I need you to give me a reason. Otherwise, you’ll die here today. When City Lord Li asks me later, I’ll say you left through the window. I believe City Lord Li is so smart that he won’t ask too much.”","Lin Yuan’s words made Huang An’s body tremble slightly. Huang An’s main purpose in coming to see Lin Yuan was to see if Lin Yuan could help him increase his lifespan by a few years.","Huang An’s arrogance was a trait he had become accustomed to, but he never expected it to lead to such serious consequences.","Lin Yuan did not care about the life and death of a high Grade 4 Creator. Hence, Huang An came to a conclusion: Creators were nothing to Lin Yuan.","Compared to dying here, Huang An would accept any means of survival.","“Lord, even if I only have 100 years of lifespan left, I can concoct numerous potions for you in the hundred years and create enough value for you. I hope you can let me follow you and atone for my rudeness today!”","Since Huang An had put it this way, Lin Yuan spoke directly. “In that case, use your holy spirit to pledge allegiance to me. Do you know that your words just now successfully saved your life and gave me a reason to let you live?!”","The corners of Huang An’s mouth twitched. To pledge loyalty to Lin Yuan, Huang An had to swear with the holy spirit that everything he did in the future would be under Lin Yuan’s control.","No one wanted to be controlled by others, especially a noble Creator like Huang An. However, when circumstances outweighed his capabilities, refusal would only lead to death. Huang An had no choice but to summon his holy spirit and let Lin Yuan control it through the divine kingdom.","Ever since Huang An had entered this room for less than an hour, he had become Lin Yuan’s servant. Huang An, whose holy spirit was under Lin Yuan’s control, still did not dare to get up from the ground. He could only crawl there and wait for Lin Yuan’s instructions.","Although Huang An was an inherently arrogant and conceited individual, apart from concocting Creator resources, he was useless.","However, apart from the Moon Empress, Huang An was the only second Creator in Sky City.","Lin Yuan raised his hand and the Jasmine Lily appeared in his palm. When the Jasmine Lily evolved to Suzerain/Myth III, it could take human form. However, compared to taking human form, Lin Yuan’s Jasmine Lily preferred to stay in the Spirit Lock spatial zone in its original form and absorb the spirit qi in it. It did not spend any effort elsewhere.","The Jasmine Lily emitted a few green lights and landed on Huang An’s body, healing the frostbite on his body. While Lin Yuan was healing, Winter removed the cold air he had injected into Huang An’s body.","If Winter didn’t whisk away the chill from Huang An’s body, the Jasmine Lily’s efforts to heal his injuries would be in vain, no matter how fervently it tried.","Following Huang An’s healing, Lin Yuan took two steps forward and lifted him up, saying, “For your sins, you deserve death a thousandfold. Yet, by choosing to align with me and faithfully pledging your loyalty, I shall extend your lifespan.”","Lin Yuan took out a Lifespan Mouse that had been specially nurtured in the Spirit Lock spatial zone and handed it to Huang An.","There was no need for Lin Yuan to introduce it. The moment Huang An saw the Lifespan Mouse, he clearly understood its abilities.","Huang An’s body trembled again.","Previously, Huang An had trembled in fear when facing Lin Yuan. Now, he was trembling because he had seen the Lifespan Mouse’s ability and knew that once he contracted it, he would obtain an endless lifespan. As long as there were no accidents, he could continue living.","In the eyes of the Creator, every resource had a clear value. This Lifespan Mouse was a priceless treasure in Huang An’s eyes. Not to mention a Grade 4 Creator like him, even a Grade 5 Creator would go crazy when they saw this Lifespan Mouse.","As the era changed, countless giants had perished in the torrent of time. If these giants had had a Lifespan Mouse, they would have been able to survive until now.","Huang An asked Lin Yuan uncertainly, “Lord, are you going to bestow this fey to me?!”","When Huang An asked this question, he was somewhat uncertain. Huang An felt that he was unworthy of such resources. This Lifespan Mouse was even more valuable than a Grade 4 Creator like him.","Lin Yuan placed the Lifespan Mouse in Huang An’s hand. The Lifespan Mouse ran around Huang An’s palm and curiously sniffed the aura on his palm.","“Of course. If I didn’t want to give it to you, why would I take it out before you? You can contract it. However, this little fellow is unable to increase its grade and quality. Once it dies, you will also die. I’m sure you are already aware of this. For your safety, this mouse will remain with me for care and supervision after you’ve contracted it.”","Upon hearing that Lin Yuan wanted to give him the Lifespan Mouse, Huang An was overjoyed and did not pay much attention to the fact that Lin Yuan wanted to control the Lifespan Mouse for him.","Lin Yuan had already taken control of Huang An’s holy spirit and could determine Huang An’s life and death. Under such circumstances, it did not matter to Huang An if Lin Yuan used another method to control him.","At that moment, Huang An felt like he had profited from a disaster. If he had known that Lin Yuan had a way for him to obtain an endless lifespan, he would definitely have tried his best to join Lin Yuan.","Huang An had experienced the feeling of nearing the end of his lifespan. Now, as he faced the imminent replenishment of his lifespan, he could finally relax.","In the future, Huang An would no longer have to worry about his lifespan.","As a witness of epochs, Huang An could now focus on enhancing his abilities as a Creator in his endless lifespan. Even if he was limited by his talent, there was always a possibility of evolution after constant training. Now, being a Grade 5 Creator was no longer Huang An’s goal. Huang An believed that he could become a Grade 6 Creator.","“Lord, please take care of the Lifespan Mouse for me in the future. If there’s anything you want me to do, just tell me. I’ll do my best to fulfill your request!”","Despite his arrogance, now that Huang An had become Lin Yuan’s subordinate, he was well aware of what he needed to do.","When Huang An was young, he had once been a servant under a Grade 3 Creator. It was because Huang An was very tactful and diligent that he was taken in as a disciple by the Grade 3 Creator. Due to this, he had the chance to learn the abilities of a Creator.","Huang An had served his master for more than 2,000 years, but in the end, his master still failed to become a Grade 4 Creator and died because his lifespan was exhausted.","Not only was Huang An stronger than his master in terms of Creator talent, but he was also luckier than his master to be able to contract a sacred item like the Lifespan Mouse when his lifespan was less than 100 years old.","Lin Yuan was satisfied with Huang An’s current attitude. Huang An had already formed a contract with the Lifespan Mouse, so Lin Yuan told Huang An after taking it away, “There’s nothing for you to do now. Just follow me. When you return, someone will make arrangements for you and tell you what resources to concoct.”","Lin Yuan’s words hinted to Huang An that a significant faction was supporting him. The mere fact that this faction could offer the Lifespan Mouse as a reward to someone like Huang An, who had recently emerged, indicated the strength of their foundation.","As a Creator, Huang An had always wanted to rely on a large faction. With a large faction backing him, he would no longer have to worry about obtaining resources.","As an unspecialized Creator, Huang An had spent a lot of effort searching for resources, especially when he wanted to try some experiments. However, if Creators wanted to continuously improve their abilities, they had to study more and try to break through. He would not have to worry if he joined a huge faction.","...","Li Feng had always been concerned about the interaction between Lin Yuan and Huang An. While it was primarily their affair if Huang An provoked Lin Yuan due to his arrogance, Li Feng was the one who had introduced Huang An to Lin Yuan.","Li Feng feared Lin Yuan might develop negative opinions and thoughts about him.","Observing Lin Yuan and Huang An, Li Feng noticed Huang An closely trailing behind Lin Yuan, resembling Lin Yuan’s sidekick.","This sight surprised Li Feng immensely, sparking curiosity about what had transpired between Lin Yuan and Huang An to prompt such a significant change.","Huang An’s attitude toward Li Feng was exceedingly complex. Initially, Huang An had almost felt as though Li Feng had led him into a trap. However, considering the outcome, it was Li Feng who had aided him in seizing this opportunity.","Even if Huang An harbored grievances against Li Feng, he couldn’t exhibit them as one of Lin Yuan’s subordinates. Huang An believed doing so would imply dissatisfaction with being under Lin Yuan’s command.","Taking the initiative, Huang An greeted Li Feng and warmly patted his shoulder, seemingly expressing gratitude to Li Feng for introducing him to Lin Yuan.","Li Feng felt relieved. It was fortunate that Huang An hadn’t clashed with Lin Yuan. Not only had Li Feng assisted Lin Yuan, but he had also won Huang An’s favor.","“It seems that you and Young Master Lin have had a good conversation. I didn’t establish this connection between you two for nothing!","“Young Master Lin, when you came, you said you were preparing to go to the Fortune Treasure Palace. Why don’t you inform me? I’ll help you prepare the carriage!”","Lin Yuan declined Li Feng’s good intentions. “City Lord Li, I’m about to leave for Fortune Treasure Palace. I’m here to bid you farewell. After I leave Fortune Treasure Palace, I probably won’t come to your City Lord Manor again. This is a Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ramet. If anything happens in the future, you can contact me through it.”","Upon hearing that Lin Yuan was about to leave, Li Feng felt rather regretful, but he did not continue to persuade Lin Yuan to stay.","A person with Lin Yuan’s background would definitely have something to do. It would be too much to force Lin Yuan to stay.","The Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower was a communication fey unique to Fortune Treasure Palace. Although there were occasionally Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers in the outside world, they still carried a powerful Fortune Treasure Palace aura.","Lin Yuan’s Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower had most likely been traded from Fortune Treasure Palace. This meant that Lin Yuan had a deep relationship with Fortune Treasure Palace.","However, Li Feng did not care about this. It did not matter which faction Lin Yuan was close to. It was fine as long as Lin Yuan was a sponsor of Treasure City. Now that Lin Yuan had given him that ramet, it would be easier for him to communicate with him in the future.","“Young Master Lin, if I help you contact a Creator in the future, I’ll tell you through this Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ramet.”","After saying that, Li Feng turned to ask, “Your Grace Huang An, you previously said that you wanted to go to the treasure vault of the City Lord Manor to see if there are any spiritual ingredients you need. Why don’t I arrange it for you now?”","Huang An shook his head. “There’s no need to trouble you. I’ll leave with Young Master Lin!”"]},{"number":2978,"title":"Chapter 2978: The Amazing Lin Yuan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2978: The Amazing Lin Yuan!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","After saying that, Li Feng saw Huang An following closely behind Lin Yuan.","Li Feng and Huang An’s relationship went way back. Li Feng understood Huang An very well. Despite Huang An’s arrogance, he treated Li Feng quite well. After all, he had agreed to every one of Li Feng’s previous requests for trade.","Li Feng had previously traded Creator resources from Huang An without hesitation. Otherwise, Li Feng would not have immediately thought of Huang An upon learning that Lin Yuan wanted to trade with a Creator whose lifespan was about to end.","In Li Feng’s impression, Huang An always walked with his head held high and his back straight.","However, Huang An, now following behind Lin Yuan, actually bent down slightly. This discovery made Li Feng’s heart skip a beat. Considering his attitude toward Lin Yuan, Li Feng speculated that Huang An might have joined Lin Yuan.","Li Feng believed that this possibility was highly likely. Otherwise, if Lin Yuan had only traded with Huang An and the latter had obtained the spiritual ingredients that could restore his lifespan, Huang An’s attitude toward Lin Yuan would definitely not be like this.","Li Feng could sense the fear in Huang An’s eyes when he looked at Lin Yuan. Huang An might have any other emotions toward Lin Yuan, but fear didn’t seem right.","Li Feng and Zhan Lu were already very close, but because of Lin Yuan, they grew even closer. They had a gathering not long ago and discussed the development of the Fortune Treasure Palace’s new land.","Since Zhan Lu had promised Li Feng to increase Fortune Treasure Palace’s tax revenue to aid in Treasure City’s development, Li Feng no longer restricted the expansion of Zhan Lu’s power in the city. Instead, he provided Zhan Lu with a lot of support. This strengthened the relationship between Zhan Lu and Li Feng even more than before.","Zhan Lu had told Li Feng that Jin Chen, the special honor guest of Fortune Treasure Palace, was currently working for Lin Yuan and seemed to have joined","Lin Yuan.","When discussing this matter, Zhan Lu was surprised. He was certain that Lin Yuan and Jin Chen did not know each other before.","Among the special honor guests, Lin Yuan and Jin Chen almost had a conflict. It was unclear when Lin Yuan and Jin Chen’s relationship had become superior and subordinate.","When Zhan Lu mentioned this matter, he didn’t harbor any particular thoughts. He simply marveled at Lin Yuan’s strength, amazed that he could prompt a Holy Spirit expert to submit willingly.","Li Feng listened carefully to Zhan Lu’s words. He had not interacted much with Lin Yuan. However, Lin Yuan became a guardian of Treasure City because he actively pursued him. Ever since then, Li Feng had not interacted with Lin Yuan. Hearing news about Lin Yuan reaffirmed his confidence in the decisions he made back then.","Zhan Lu felt that Huang An’s submission to Lin Yuan was exactly the same as what Zhan Lu had said about Jin Chen.","Li Feng was prepared to get some information from Huang An when he met him again. He wanted to know if Huang An had joined Lin Yuan.","Initially, Li Feng did not want Huang An to go to Treasure City’s treasure vault and let him directly choose resources from there. The treasure vault was his accumulation for many years as City Lord. Li Feng even included the resources he had obtained when he was not working in Treasure City into it.","Huang An would not show courtesy in selecting resources and would take almost all of the cherished resources he had collected.","Although Huang An would exchange Creator resources with him, some of the resources Huang An took from the treasure vault were much lower than Grade 4 Creators. Many of the materials could be exchanged for Grade 5 Creator resources.","Li Feng could accumulate so many rare resources because Treasure City was a very popular resource trading city.","There was only one possibility for him to let go of this rare opportunity, and that was to cooperate with Lin Yuan. If Lin Yuan could even subdue a Grade 4 Creator like Huang An, Li Feng felt it was necessary to get closer to Lin Yuan and deepen their cooperation. Only by borrowing strength in the Sky Beyond the Clouds could one go further!","Lin Yuan had already arrived at Fortune Treasure Palace with Winter and Huang An.","Ling Muzhuo personally welcomed Lin Yuan at the entrance of Fortune Treasure Palace and brought the three of them to a quiet room.","Only Ling Muzhuo, the Palace Master in the East Universe, could use that quiet room when receiving esteemed guests. No one else, not even Zhan Lu, the person in charge of Fortune Treasure Palace, had the qualifications to do so.","Zhan Lu followed behind Ling Muzhuo gloomily the entire time. Ling Muzhuo’s actions were equivalent to snatching his opportunity.","While it was true that Ling Muzhuo had given him some compensation, it was not enough to make up for the opportunities he had taken away.","Lin Yuan did not treat Zhan Lu coldly just because he had gotten close to Ling Muzhuo. When he saw Zhan Lu, he took the initiative to greet him, which made","Zhan Lu very happy.","Ling Muzhuo’s image was the same as the one Lin Yuan had seen in the starlight connection.","“I haven’t seen Palace Master Ling for a few days, and you’re still as elegant as ever!”","Lin Yuan’s words made Ling Muzhuo smile.","Ling Muzhuo had never seen Lin Yuan’s true appearance in the starlight connection, so he was very curious about his true appearance.","It didn’t take long for Ling Muzhuo to meet him.","Ling Muzhuo had asked Zhan Lu to report Lin Yuan’s situation to him in detail before, and Zhan Lu had always emphasized that Lin Yuan was extremely young.","Ling Muzhuo had always harbored suspicions toward Zhan Lu’s words, feeling that he was not telling the truth.","Zhan Lu had claimed that Lin Yuan was under 50 years old. If that were true, how could he command such a formidable faction?","Even if Lin Yuan were the faction’s Young Master, it would strain credulity. Without enduring trials, how could such a vast faction bestow such significant authority upon a young person?","However, upon seeing Lin Yuan, Ling Muzhuo became convinced that Zhan Lu had spoken truthfully.","Indeed, Lin Yuan was not yet 50. Lifespan was an undeniable truth. The younger Lin Yuan was, the more Ling Muzhuo esteemed him.","“Young Master Lin, you’re truly gifted. At your age, wielding such strength and independence is remarkable. In my youth, I was adrift, unsure of my path!”","Ling Muzhuo’s praise was heartfelt. There was no need for excessive politeness; they were already partners. Superfluous niceties would only","demean him.","In his 40s or 50s, Ling Muzhuo had been a carefree playboy, relying on his family’s resources. It took unforeseen events to spur him to action.","In Ling Muzhuo’s estimation, barring accidents, Lin Yuan was destined for greatness.","In the future, these experts could also contribute to Fortune Treasure Palace.","Ling Muzhuo wished to invest in Lin Yuan, though he was uncertain if Lin Yuan would accept Fortune Treasure Palace’s investment.","Judging from the Creator resources that Lin Yuan used to trade with Fortune Treasure Palace, he most likely did not need them to invest resources in him.","Upon hearing Ling Muzhuo’s words, Lin Yuan smiled. “Palace Master Ling, your courtesy is appreciated. You wield great influence in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, capable of causing a stir in the East Universe with a mere step.”","“Fortune Treasure Palace is not to be underestimated. If they lacked such capability, I doubt I would have formed such a close partnership with them. The item I provided requires extensive time and resources to cultivate, including the energy of the Breath Soil.”","Ever since Ling Muzhuo began communicating with Lin Yuan, he enjoyed showcasing his skills. Lin Yuan’s response indicated his own desire to demonstrate his abilities to Ling Muzhuo.","Individuals like Ling Muzhuo, who enjoyed displaying their skills, were undoubtedly conscious of their status. However, this trait wasn’t a flaw in their collaboration; rather, it had its advantages.","As long as Lin Yuan demonstrated sufficient capabilities to earn Ling Muzhuo’s esteem, their transaction would proceed smoothly.","Lin Yuan’s words surprised both Zhan Lu and Ling Muzhuo.","Ling Muzhuo, having used the Star Vastness Peony’s ramet to establish a star bond, understood that feys capable of instant face-to-face communication and ultra-long-distance material teleportation were exceedingly rare. He hadn’t anticipated that nurturing such a fey would require resources of the caliber of the Breath Soil.","Even Fortune Treasure Palace would struggle to obtain resources like the Breath Soil. Furthermore, even if they possessed it, trading it externally would prove challenging.","Lin Yuan’s demonstration of his abilities yielded a positive outcome with Ling Muzhuo greatly valuing him.","Ling Muzhuo chuckled. “It appears Brother Lin places great trust in me to entrust such a precious resource. Rest assured, I won’t disappoint. I’ve already informed the Creators of your capabilities, particularly your ability to extend their lifespans.","“Would you prefer to meet them immediately, or would you like some time to rest before our arranged meeting? They’ve arrived early, eagerly anticipating our encounter. Brother Lin, if you’re ready to meet, I can make the arrangements promptly.”","Previously, Ling Muzhuo had addressed Lin Yuan as Young Master Lin. His switch to a more familiar address indicated his desire to deepen their relationship.","Ling Muzhuo used such a direct method to test Lin Yuan. If Lin Yuan acknowledged his way of addressing him and responded to it, it meant that he also intended to get closer to Ling Muzhuo. If Lin Yuan did not have such intentions, forcing it would most likely arouse his disgust.","Although Lin Yuan looked young, he had already cultivated an extremely sophisticated worldly wisdom in the time he had spent in the main world.","Lin Yuan laughed and said, “Brother Ling, since you’ve already arranged for those Creators to come, won’t it be equivalent to making things difficult for you if I let them wait for a long time? Arrange for me to meet them! If I want to rest, it’s not too late to do so after meeting them!","“When I meet these Creators, I need to reveal some information about the resources in my hands. I don’t want outsiders to know about this, nor do I want these Creators to share among themselves to avoid any disloyal intention.","“Therefore, I wish to meet with each of these Creators individually. I hope you can convey my request to them. I don’t want to cause misunderstandings between these Creators, nor do I want them to cause trouble for me!”","Lin Yuan openly voiced his request without any concealment to Ling Muzhuo. Lin Yuan had a foundation and resources in his hands.","It was Ling Muzhuo who wanted to take the initiative to curry favor with Lin Yuan, not the other way around. Lin Yuan believed that Ling Muzhuo would facilitate his request.","Huang An, who was beside Lin Yuan, subconsciously shrunk his neck. He could already predict the fate of these Creators that Lin Yuan would meet alone. They would most likely join Lin Yuan’s faction like him.","The information concerning the Lifespan Mouse in Lin Yuan’s possession must be kept confidential. Should it leak, Huang An understood that all major factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds would target Lin Yuan to obtain the Lifespan Mouse.","Many powerful species had suffered dire consequences due to their failure to securely hold onto rare resources, often resulting from leaked information about these assets.","It could be said that Huang An had no regrets after being forcefully recruited by Lin Yuan. On the contrary, being taken under Lin Yuan’s wing was considered the greatest opportunity of his life.","Compared to the prospect of immortality, joining a faction and working for it seemed trivial. Joining Lin Yuan’s faction did not equate to losing his freedom. As a highly respected Grade 4 Creator, he retained autonomy.","In the future, he would have opportunities to travel outside and enjoy protection from other factions. Lin Yuan would likely invest in him and help enhance his Creator abilities.","Most Creators would undergo their processes and eventually feel exceedingly fortunate to be recruited by Lin Yuan.","Ling Muzhuo was delighted by Lin Yuan’s response. He said confidently,","“Brother Lin, since you’re prepared to meet them now, I’ll arrange it for you. “Apart from the two Grade 4 Creators, the Grade 5 Creator has also arrived. I’ll arrange for you to meet the two Grade 4 Creators first, and then the Grade 5 Creator.. What do you think?”"]},{"number":2979,"title":"Chapter 2979: There’s Such a Good Thing?!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2979: There’s Such a Good Thing?!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","There was an unwritten rule among the Creators in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Creators of higher grades should make their appearance last to show their honor.","In terms of status, Ling Muzhuo, the Palace Master of Fortune Treasure Palace, was comparable to a Grade 5 Creator. However, regardless of the circumstances, he would not offend these Creators, even if their lifespans were about to reach the end.","Therefore, while making arrangements, Ling Muzhuo went back to consider the Creator’s rules.","Lin Yuan smiled and addressed Ling Muzhuo, “Brother Ling, you can arrange things as you see fit, but please ensure my prior arrangements are upheld.”","He reiterated his request to Ling Muzhuo, trusting in their budding friendship and Ling Muzhuo’s attitude toward him to handle the matter appropriately.","Zhan Lu felt overshadowed by Ling Muzhuo’s presence around Lin Yuan, which made him hesitant to engage too deeply in conversation.","Instead, he directed his attention to Huang An. Although their relationship wasn’t as close as Li Feng’s and Huang An’s, they had exchanged words on a few occasions.","Zhan Lu took the initiative, addressing Huang An, “Sir Huang An, it’s a pleasure to meet you here. I see you’re acquainted with Young Master Lin. It’s been a while since you’ve graced Fortune Treasure Palace with your presence.”","Though Huang An wasn’t an official honor guest, Zhan Lu regretted that Huang An hadn’t accepted a prior invitation. If Huang An were to become an esteemed guest, Zhan Lu’s efforts would surely be recognized.","Huang An glanced at Zhan Lu, favorably impressed by his connection to Lin Yuan. His tone remained polite.","Earlier, on their journey, Huang An had suggested Lin Yuan reveal his identity as a servant, but Lin Yuan declined, preferring to maintain a facade of a business relationship.","Knowing Ling Muzhuo’s extensive information network, Lin Yuan didn’t want to imply any control over the Creator.","With Lin Yuan’s intentions clarified, Huang An had prepared his response for others.","“It’s true that I haven’t been here for a while. Not only do I know Young Master Lin, but he’s also an important partner of mine.”","Huang An straightforwardly expressed his attitude toward Lin Yuan, which attracted Ling Muzhuo’s attention. The fact Lin Yuan was valued so highly by a high Grade 4 Creator was enough to prove Lin Yuan’s worth.","Ling Muzhuo allowed Zhan Lu to chat with Huang An. It would be great if Zhan Lu could bring Huang An into Fortune Treasure Palace as a special honor guest.","“Brother Lin, rest assured. These three Creators are each in separate rooms.","Two of the Grade 4 Creators hold grudges against one another. The Grade 5 Creator refused to share a room with them, feeling it would diminish his status. If you wish to meet them all simultaneously, I’ll need to make extra arrangements.”","Ling Muzhuo’s words both explained the situation and served as a warning about the difficult nature of the Grade 5 Creator. He hoped Lin Yuan would be mentally prepared.","Ling Muzhuo had intervened on Lin Yuan’s behalf, hoping to avoid any conflict with a Grade 5 Creator. Otherwise, their good intentions might lead to undesirable outcomes.","Observing Lin Yuan’s silence, Ling Muzhuo wondered if his message had been understood.","Ling Muzhuo trusted Lin Yuan to understand the boundaries implicitly, so he refrained from further explicit warnings.","Lin Yuan entered the room without Huang An, accompanied only by Winter.","As Zhan Lu had been in contact with Huang An, he allowed Huang An to stay in Fortune Treasure Palace for further communication.","Upon entering the tranquil room, Lin Yuan spotted an elderly woman with white hair seated, sipping tea. She exuded an aura of fragility as if a mere gust could snuff her out.","Her appearance reflected the toll of age, a stark contrast to her youthful essence as a Creator.","Upon seeing Ling Muzhuo enter with Lin Yuan and Winter, she set her teacup down and rose unsteadily, taking the initiative to greet them.","The impression she left on Lin Yuan differed greatly from that of Huang An.","Huang An, with a lifespan of 100 years remaining, exuded arrogance, underestimating his reliance on connections to extend his life.","Perhaps he also underestimated Li Feng’s ability to forge beneficial alliances for him.","As a Grade 4 Creator, this elderly woman wielded formidable power. Her struggle against aging likely drove her to value any means of extending her lifespan dearly.","Ling Muzhuo introduced Lin Yuan to the elderly woman, “Master Xi Mei, this is Young Master Lin that I told you about. Young Master Lin has a way to increase your lifespan.","“Brother Lin, this is Master Xi Mei. She’s an intermediate Grade 4 Creator and is very famous in this area. She’s very good at healing injuries and has saved the lives of many experts in this area.","“You two have a good chat. I’ll leave first. I can guarantee that no one will listen in on your conversation.”","After saying that, Ling Muzhuo left the room. He did not continue to chat with Lin Yuan and Xi Mei after the introductions and left the space to them.","Ling Muzhuo hoped that Lin Yuan’s methods could help Xi Mei recover her lifespan. This way, as the person who introduced her, Xi Mei would owe him a huge favor.","If Lin Yuan did not help her recover her lifespan, Xi Mei would die within a month or two. If Xi Mei was going to die, Ling Muzhuo wouldn’t want her to die in Fortune Treasure Palace.","Lin Yuan trusted that Ling Muzhuo could create a favorable environment for him, where they wouldn’t be subjected to any form of surveillance.","However, Lin Yuan would not place his trust in Ling Muzhuo. The moment he left the room, Winter had already enveloped the room with his aura. If someone were to investigate the situation in the room, Winter would discover it immediately.","Xi Mei took the initiative to pour a cup of tea for Lin Yuan. “Young Master Lin, this should be the first time we’ve met. Try this pot of life-prolonging tea that I specially concocted. The life-prolonging tea uses pine needles as the base and incorporates four spiritual ingredients known to increase lifespan, the Longevity Purple Ginseng, the Heavenly Fate Snow Mushroom, the Knotweed, and the Longevity Scarlet Fruit. It’s specially stir-fried and brewed with lotus heart dew.","“For those who are replenishing their lifespan for the first time, this cup of tea that I specially concocted can extend their lifespan by at least 500 years. It’s just that I can only taste it lightly.”","Lin Yuan raised his brows. The four spiritual ingredients Xi Mei mentioned were all precious. Fortune Treasure Palace would only hide resources that would not be sold.","Lin Yuan took the teacup but did not drink the tea. He knew the meaning behind her words. Xi Mei was telling him that even with such spiritual ingredients, she couldn’t increase her lifespan. If Lin Yuan couldn’t drink the tea in the cup, then he should leave.","To Xi Mei, even the most precious resources were merely objects. Otherwise, Xi Mei would never have squandered this kind of tea that could extend lifespan nor would she casually give it to others.","Xi Mei most likely didn’t believe she could extend her lifespan again. Her reluctance to give up was simply driven by the desire to survive.","Lin Yuan did not need to use so many methods to deal with Xi Mei’s situation like he did with Huang An.","When she saw that Lin Yuan had put down the teacup she had handed over and had not drunk the tea, Xi Mei’s gaze wavered as she looked up at Lin Yuan.","There was no species behind Xi Mei, nor did she have any faction she belonged to, which meant no one could inherit Xi Mei’s resources.","If it were a Creator from a species of faction whose lifespan was about to run out, they would not be able to squander like Xi Mei.","Lin Yuan did not immediately answer her question, nor did he take out the resources she wanted to see. Instead, he asked her, “Xi Mei, if someone could enable you to live longer, but it required you to join their faction and work for them, would you be willing?”","Lin Yuan’s gaze was fixed on Xi Mei as he spoke.","Xi Mei could sense Lin Yuan’s seriousness from his words.","Xi Mei smiled. “Is there such a good thing? Any life, when facing the prospect of becoming a withered and decayed tree like me, would consider staying alive as the greatest pursuit.","“Death is the end of everything. Only by living can you enjoy this world. Even if there’s such a good thing in this world, I don’t believe it will fall into my lap.”","Just as she finished speaking, an orange mouse appeared in Lin Yuan’s palm. It was looking around curiously. When Xi Mei saw the orange mouse, she subconsciously looked away.","Xi Mei, who had averted her gaze, froze for two seconds. Then, shock surged out of her eyes as she stared at the Lifespan Mouse in Lin Yuan’s palm. Her breathing suddenly quickened, and she couldn’t help but raise her hand.","Facing a glimmer of hope greater than expected, Xi Mei, already in despair, could no longer conceal her emotions.","Winter’s gaze remained fixed on Xi Mei. If she showed any signs of attempting to snatch the Lifespan Mouse, Winter would stop her immediately.","Lin Yuan watched quietly as Xi Mei released her emotions. After a long while, Xi Mei released her holy spirit and bowed to Lin Yuan. “Young Master Lin, I will treat you as my salvation and serve you for life. I will be proud to serve you.” Xi Mei’s actions proved to Lin Yuan she was smart.","After gaining control of Xi Mei’s holy spirit, Lin Yuan said, “After you contract this Lifespan Mouse, it has to be placed in my hands. I will help you feed it and ensure that its lifespan is in an infinite state.”","After seeing Huang An, Lin Yuan had already decided to employ dual tactics to control these Creators. Even with Xi Mei’s cooperation, Lin Yuan still had to abide by the rules he had set.","Xi Mei said with a smile, “I believe in the value I can create and that you won’t waste such a treasure for nothing. I’m extremely grateful you’re willing to help me feed the Lifespan Mouse.”","Xi Mei’s integration as Lin Yuan’s subordinate was abnormally smooth, and Lin","Yuan instructed her, “Don’t let outsiders know about the situation of the Lifespan Mouse and everything that happened here today, including the other Creators in the faction!”","Lin Yuan said this because he did not want the Creators who had joined Sky City to know that he possessed numerous Lifespan Mice. As long as he stopped these Creators under his control from sending messages, others would not know. With these two layers of control in Lin Yuan’s hands, it was impossible for the Creators under his control not to abide by his orders.","Lin Yuan had given Huang An the same advice, but neither Huang An nor Xi Mei knew his true intentions.","“Young Master Lin, don’t worry. I’ve never been a talkative person. When we go out later, should I directly reveal my identity as your subordinate or conceal our relationship to let the Palace Master think we have established cooperation?”","Xi Mei knew that Lin Yuan was going to meet a total of three Creators. Be it that woman with the sharp tongue or that arrogant old man, their lifespans had already reached the end. It was likely that Lin Yuan would take the other two under his wing as well. Regardless of whether Lin Yuan’s plan would succeed or not, his actions were too conspicuous.","Xi Mei’s suggestion was beyond Lin Yuan’s expectations. She was very good at reading people’s minds.","Although Xi Mei was not as capable as Huang An as a Creator, she was more worth nurturing than Huang An for Sky City.","“Xi Mei, you only need to tell the public that we have reached an agreement.","Don’t forget to thank Palace Master Ling.”","Lin Yuan walked out of the room.","He wanted Xi Mei to thank Ling Muzhuo, conveying that introducing these Creators, whose lifespans were nearing their end, would be advantageous for him.","Ling Muzhuo would only use his connections to introduce more Creators who were about to reach the end of their lifespan to Lin Yuan if there were benefits involved.."]},{"number":2980,"title":"Chapter 2980: Unreasonable Price!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2980: Unreasonable Price!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","After opening the door, Lin Yuan discovered two strange silver-purple potted plants at the entrance of the room. He used True Data to inspect the two pots and discovered that they were called Screen Irises.","The Screen Irises were spatial-type and wind-type dual-element feys. They could form an energy barrier between them that blocked the outside from probing the inside. If the people inside wanted to transmigrate the barrier, they only needed to sprinkle water on the leaves of the two Screen Irises.","There were two cups beside the two Screen Irises.","The Screen Irises were not considered an extremely rare fey in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Xi Mei, who walked out of the room behind Lin Yuan, naturally spilled the water in her cup on the two pots of Screen Irises.","After recovering her lifespan, Xi Mei no longer bore the appearance of an elderly woman with white hair and wrinkled skin. Instead, she had become a woman with long chestnut hair and peach-blossom eyes.","It had been a long time since Xi Mei had recovered to such a state. She kept looking at herself and took out a pair of exquisite ear clips to clamp on her ears. Then, she put on a gorgeous necklace.","Upon seeing this, Lin Yuan knew Xi Mei had regained her passion for life and her vision for the future.","Ling Muzhuo was waiting outside the palace, looking forward to the outcome","of Lin Yuan and Xi Mei’s conversation.","Ling Muzhuo had personally investigated the issue of Xi Mei’s lifespan and knew how troublesome it was. Xi Mei was a special honor guest of Fortune Treasure Palace and worked closely with them. If Xi Mei could recover her lifespan, Fortune Treasure Palace could also obtain many benefits.","Moreover, if Lin Yuan could help Xi Mei recover her lifespan, he could help another Grade 4 Creator recover their lifespan.","As for whether Lin Yuan could help the Grade 5 Creator recover his lifespan, Ling Muzhuo was uncertain. This was because the level of resources a Grade 5 Creator could access far exceeded that of a Grade 4 Creator and was not something a Grade 4 Creator could compare to.","The fact he could invite his Grade 5 Creator came as a surprise to Ling Muzhuo. It showed that even this Grade 5 Creator was constantly seeking opportunities to stay alive.","If a low Grade 5 Creator was willing to join Honor Absent Parliament, they could at least become a two-star Speaker based on their status as a Creator.","Ling Muzhuo had not contacted this Grade 5 Creator through the channels and connections of Fortune Treasure Palace. Instead, he contacted him personally. He did not have a close relationship with this Grade 5 Creator. He had always wanted to get closer, but there wasn’t any opportunity.","Ling Muzhuo had placed all his hopes on Lin Yuan, hoping that Lin Yuan could help him build a good relationship with this Grade 5 Creator.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan and Xi Mei walk out one after another, Ling Muzhuo smiled. Just by looking at Xi Mei’s current state, Ling Muzhuo knew that the transaction between Lin Yuan and Xi Mei had gone smoothly without needing to inquire further.","Ling Muzhuo took a step forward and said warmly, “Congratulations, Your","Excellency Xi Mei, for extending your lifespan as you had wished. In the future,","I will still help you find more opportunities to extend your lifespan.”","Xi Mei did not care about Lin Yuan’s control over her and was very grateful to Ling Muzhuo.","“Palace Master Ling, you’re too polite. Young Master Lin has recovered a lot of my lifespan this time. I spent most of my life near Treasure City. Now that I’ve recovered my lifespan, I’m prepared to explore around. Fortune Treasure","Palace is spread throughout the East Universe. I can continue to cooperate with","Fortune Treasure Palace no matter where I go.”","Xi Mei’s words were her response to Ling Muzhuo’s help. Ling Muzhuo had spent so much effort waiting to hear those words from her.","Ling Muzhuo did not care about Xi Mei’s activity near Treasure City. He was the Palace Master of the East Universe’s Fortune Treasure Palace, not the person in charge of Fortune Treasure Palace branches in Treasure City.","Xi Mei’s departure was not a loss for Ling Muzhuo. It was just that Zhan Lu was going to lose a big client.","Ling Muzhuo cupped her hands at Xi Mei and gave Lin Yuan a thumbs up.","“Brother Lin, you’re still the most capable. Let’s go. I’ll bring you to meet a","Grade 4 Creator. That Grade 4 Creator has already sent her retainer to rush me twice. She keeps asking when you will finish talking to Xi Mei.”","Ling Muzhuo emphasized “rush me twice”, indicating that a Grade 4 Creator was not easy to deal with.","Lin Yuan’s lips twitched. He and Xi Mei had only met for less than two hours. Two hours was nothing in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","In the past two hours, this Grade 4 Creator had come to urge him twice, which made him feel that this Grade 4 Creator wasn’t seeking help to restore her lifespan. Instead, she seemed to be looking for trouble.","Xi Mei snorted and said, “Young Master Lin, the Creator you’re going to meet has some enmity with me. She’s clearly in a similar state to me but still maintains a hostile demeanor. Why don’t I go with you to teach her a lesson!”","Upon hearing Xi Mei’s words, Ling Muzhuo felt surprised. He was well aware of the feud between Xi Mei and the Grade 4 Creator. Their first encounter had already exposed him to their confrontation.","Xi Mei gave Ling Muzhuo the impression of someone who had experienced life and death, remaining calm and composed. However, despite the other Creator’s situation being no better than Xi Mei’s, she persisted in aggression and showed no mercy in her speech, giving the impression of an old child.","Ling Muzhuo sincerely wished to avoid conflicts in Fortune Treasure Palace. However, he had never considered stopping Xi Mei.","Xi Mei’s current state was the best evidence of Lin Yuan’s ability.","As long as Lin Yuan could help the other Creator recover her lifespan, any conflicts would be inconsequential.","If those involved refrained from spreading the news, Ling Muzhuo could quell the storm.","Lin Yuan was quite surprised by Xi Mei’s suggestion. She was highly intelligent and emotionally astute, unlikely to make such requests rashly. Lin Yuan was curious to see her next move.","Observing Xi Mei’s actions more closely, especially given Lin Yuan’s efforts to nurture her, would assist him in carefully assessing her abilities.","“It’s great that Your Excellency Xi Mei is willing to help me. Allow me to express my gratitude in advance. I’m not good at dealing with cunning individuals. If I were to confront them, I fear I might lose my temper!”","Lin Yuan’s words were airtight, leaving no room for Ling Muzhuo to suspect his relationship with Xi Mei. Simultaneously, Lin Yuan crafted his image to Ling Muzhuo, intentionally revealing his short temper, signaling that he wouldn’t yield even to a Grade 4 Creator.","By conveying his temper to Ling Muzhuo, Lin Yuan ensured future situations would be met with more emotional consideration.","This could effectively mitigate conflicts between Lin Yuan and Ling Muzhuo, even within Fortune Treasure Palace. Lin Yuan’s past interactions indicated that individuals with both temperament and capability were often esteemed and respected by others.","Ling Muzhuo brought Lin Yuan to the entrance of another side hall and said with a smile, “Brother Lin, Your Excellency Mei, I’ll continue to stand here as a lookout for you!”","Ling Muzhuo cupped his hands at Xi Mei and said in a low voice, “Your Excellency Xi Mei, this is the territory of Fortune Treasure Palace after all. I hope you won’t have a direct conflict with Her Excellency Cen Ruyi. Otherwise, it will be difficult for my side. Fortune Treasure Palace’s reputation will also be affected.","After some deliberation, Ling Muzhuo decided to remind Xi Mei. Since Ling Muzhuo had just helped Xi Mei, she probably wouldn’t blame him for saying such words.","Ling Muzhuo was genuinely concerned that Lin Yuan would fall out with Cen Ruyi since he said he had a bad temper and did not like interacting with bad-tempered people.","At that point, it wasn’t a matter of whether Cen Ruyi was willing to cooperate with Lin Yuan, but rather if Lin Yuan was willing to give the spiritual ingredients capable of increasing lifespan to Cen Ruyi. If such a situation happened, it would be too awkward.","Xi Mei didn’t embarrass Ling Muzhuo, but she didn’t give Ling Muzhuo an affirmative answer either. Instead, she said, “I am going with Young Master Lin to help him. I won’t take the initiative to find trouble. Wouldn’t I be causing trouble for Young Master Lin if I took the initiative to cause trouble?","“But if that old fellow, Cen Ruyi takes the initiative to find trouble with Young Master Lin and me, I can’t possibly just stand by without taking any action. Otherwise, my trip with Young Master Lin will be meaningless. I hope Palace Master Ling can understand me!”","Ling Muzhuo remained silent. If Cen Ruyi kept causing trouble with Lin Yuan and Xi Mei, it would mean that she was disrespecting Fortune Treasure Palace.","Ling Muzhuo had a deep relationship with Cen Ruyi. Previously, she had helped strengthen Ling Muzhuo’s contracted fey.","Initially, Ling Muzhuo and Cen Ruyi had a better relationship. No matter how bad Cen Ruyi’s temper was and how deep the hatred between her and Xi Mei was, she would not be stupid enough to give up the opportunity to increase her lifespan.","If Cen Ruyi truly acted so foolishly and forced Muzhuo to make a choice, Ling Muzhuo would stand on Lin Yuan and Xi Mei’s side.","However, from any perspective, standing on Lin Yuan and Xi Mei’s side was more in line with Fortune Treasure Palace’s interests.","In the end, Fortune Treasure Palace was still a merchant faction. When the two allies of Fortune Treasure Palace had conflicts, the faction would always only help the stronger party.","Lin Yuan and Xi Mei had just stepped into the side hall when they saw four","Holy Spirit experts standing behind the Screen Irises","The Holy Spirit level was considered a threshold in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Those who could reach the Holy Spirit level were top-notch experts in any faction.","When Xi Mei appeared behind Lin Yuan, the four of them initially looked surprised, then instinctively became guarded, though a trace of astonishment lingered in their eyes.","Surveying the varied expressions before him, Lin Yuan couldn’t suppress a smile. He broke the silence, “I’m Lin Yuan. I’ve come to discuss a deal with Her Excellency Cen Ruyi. Since she’s sent so many attendants and stationed guards at the door, allow me to convey my respects.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, the four were perplexed.","Cen Ruyi knew Lin Yuan had visited Xi Mei first, which displeased her.","Had Xi Mei not regained her vitality, they would’ve kicked her out long ago. But her recovery, coupled with Lin Yuan’s endorsement by Fortune Treasure Palace, proved his worth. Offending him was unwise, yet they were unsure how to inform Cen Ruyi.","Currently, Cen Ruyi was in a frail state, unlikely to take well to Xi Mei’s recovery.","Though these four were Cen Ruyi’s last disciples, none dared disturb her to announce Lin Yuan’s arrival.","Each passing moment felt increasingly intolerable.","As the lead woman prepared to enter and relay the message, the door swung open from within.","Before it fully opened, Lin Yuan heard a voice exclaim, “Go ask the Palace","Master Ling. Our Lady has waited too long, growing impatient. What’s this Lin thinking? If he can’t aid our Lady, we’ll need to intervene to soothe her anger!”","A tall, strong, and handsome man walked out of the room. The person’s gaze met Lin Yuan’s.","“Oh? I didn’t expect Cen Ruyi to have such thoughts. If I can’t help her recover her lifespan, then her subordinates will find trouble with me? It’s only been two hours since I met Her Excellency Xi Mei. Is two hours a long time? I’m very curious now. Is Lady Cen Ruyi so anxious because she can’t last more than a few hours?”","Lin Yuan’s voice was very light and pleasant, with particles at the end of each sentence that made his voice very magnetic.","However, Lin Yuan’s melodious voice grated on the ears of Cen Ruyi’s retainers.","While it was acceptable for Lin Yuan to criticize Cen Ruyi for her anxiety, his remark that she wouldn’t last a few hours amounted to cursing her to death!","Not only did Cen Ruyi’s retainers catch wind of Lin Yuan’s words, but Cen Ruyi also heard them.","An ominous aura suddenly permeated the space. Before Xi Mei could intervene to shield Lin Yuan, an even more imposing aura enveloped the room, sealing it off.","Remaining composed, Lin Yuan remarked, “Since Lady Cen Ruyi insists on being disrespectful, it seems she has no interest in negotiating with us. Winter, enlighten her. Make her understand that she’s imploring us to spare her life.","We’re not here to indulge her tantrums.”","With Lin Yuan’s command, a chill descended upon the side hall, encasing Cen Ruyi’s retainers and Cen Ruyi herself in ice.."]},{"number":2981,"title":"Chapter 2981: Can’t Control Your Temper!?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2981: Can’t Control Your Temper!?","....","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The bone-piercing cold seeped into their bodies, feeling like razors scratching their bones.","Winter considered Lin Yuan a god and followed him faithfully. Normally, it was difficult for Winter to get angry, having lived for so many years, unless someone disrespected Lin Yuan.","Winter was unfamiliar with the two Grade 4 Creators, Xi Mei and Cen Ruyi. While Grade 4 Creators were esteemed by others, Winter saw them as insignificant. Although Lin Yuan was just beginning to rise in this life, Grade 4","Creators still held some influence in his faction, though it would soon diminish.","Xi Mei, as a Grade 4 Creator, possessed greater intelligence than Cen Ruyi. Aware of her limited lifespan, Xi Mei adopted a pleading demeanor. In contrast, Cen Ruyi not only refrained from pleading but also prepared to exert her power to suppress Lin Yuan.","It appeared that achieving Grade 4 Creator status had blinded Cen Ruyi to the realities of the world.","As Cen Ruyi and her four attendants remained sealed in ice, they endured heightened mental and emotional states due to the relentless pain inflicted by the ice.","“Young Master, go in and have a cup of tea first. Let me teach them a lesson. This Grade 4 Creator is even worse than Huang An back then. If she’s not properly taught, she won’t be of much use. If I really can’t teach her well, why don’t I just get rid of her? If the Palace Master of Fortune Treasure Palace outside asks later, we’ll just come up with a random reason. It’s very normal for a Grade 4 Creator to master teleportation methods!”","Lin Yuan nodded. He intended to take Creators under his wing but would not force her if she was unwilling.","However, Cen Ruyi, like Huang An, had taken the initiative to find trouble with him. Lin Yuan could not sit back and do nothing in the face of someone who took initiative to find trouble with him. If Lin Yuan were to cooperate with such a person, she indeed needed to be taught a lesson.","With Cen Ruyi in the room, treating him with such disdain, Lin Yuan lacked any interest in conversing with her.","Given Lin Yuan’s ability for long-distance teleportation, escape from the room was easily achievable unless space constraints intervened. Ling Muzhuo wouldn’t suspect him if he provided a plausible excuse. No one would suspect him of the death of a Grade 4 Creator within these walls.","Winter’s strength surpassed Cen Ruyi’s, allowing him to take direct control of the situation.","Ling Muzhuo, outside, remained oblivious to any energy fluctuations within the hall. Lin Yuan believed that even if Ling Muzhuo discovered the truth, he would prioritize between him and a deceased Grade 4 Creator. Most likely, Ling Muzhuo would proactively provide cover for him.","Xi Mei and Lin Yuan entered the house, where she served him tea. Softly, she remarked, “Though Lady Cen Ruyi’s demeanor may not be pleasant, her intentions are not malevolent. She holds many unique secret recipes and excels in nurturing dragon-species feys.”","As Xi Mei cursed Cen Ruyi inwardly, she was relieved she had chosen wisely. Had she treated Lin Yuan similarly, she’d have undoubtedly faced the same consequences.","Cen Ruyi wasn’t truly foolish. Xi Mei understood her well enough to know she likely sought to employ a dominant approach to secure spiritual ingredients from Lin Yuan, thus extending her own lifespan.","Cen Ruyi feared death more than Xi Mei did. Xi Mei’s commendations of Cen Ruyi stemmed solely from her sense of duty.","Cen Ruyi had once thwarted Xi Mei’s opportunities, leading to a rift between them. Xi Mei’s defense of Cen Ruyi was merely fulfilling her obligations.","Lin Yuan did not drink Xi Mei’s tea immediately. Instead, he took out some refreshments and placed them on the dining table, “Since Your Excellency Xi Mei loves to drink tea so much, why don’t you try these special refreshments? I bet you have never eaten these special refreshments before.”","Without exception, Zong Ze had specially prepared these refreshments for Lin Yuan. They were his hometown food.","At present, Xi Mei’s explanation of Cen Ruyi’s value was equivalent to showing Lin Yuan the scale of the situation.","Xi Mei did not sit beside Lin Yuan. Instead, she respectfully stood beside him and picked up a piece of exquisite snack to taste.","The snacks had a refreshing sweetness, rich with a creamy fragrance, and the fruity fragrance added even more flavor to the creaminess.","Xi Mei was not a reserved person. However, she did not choose to sit beside Lin Yuan because she could feel Winter’s respect for him. Winter, whose strength exceeded hers by a lot, was exceptionally respectful to Lin Yuan and chose not to dine at the same table.","If she were to directly sit in front of Lin Yuan and enjoy the delicacies, it would appear as if she were asserting superiority over Winter. Xi Mei was a smart person and wouldn’t do such a thing.","“Young Master, these refreshments are all delicious, much better than those prepared by the chefs I hired before. I’ll be lucky to be by Young Master’s side in the future!”","Upon seeing that Xi Mei liked his hometown’s snack, Lin Yuan smiled. “Since you like to eat, why don’t you try more? It’s about time for us to have a chat with Cen Ruyi after we finish tasting these refreshments. I hope Cen Ruyi won’t court death by then!”","Xi Mei was certain that Cen Ruyi had never imagined that she, a Grade 4 Creator, would end up in such a situation. She must have realized and decided to submit. After all, Xi Mei’s current state was the best evidence of Lin Yuan’s power.","No longer focusing on Cen Ruyi, Xi Mei had said all she needed to say. Cen Ruyi’s fate was now her own concern. If she wasn’t foolish, she would surely weigh her options carefully.","After taking a few sips of tea and a bite of refreshments, Lin Yuan and Xi Mei were quite content, spending nearly half an hour enjoying the treats.","Lin Yuan finished the last sip of tea and turned to Winter, saying, “Release them, Winter. I’m sure they have matters to discuss with me by now.” Winter quickly released Cen Ruyi and her companions. As the ice melted, they lay weakly on the ground, still recovering from the cold and disoriented.","Lin Yuan understood Winter’s methods well. If Cen Ruyi didn’t cooperate in the next half hour, she would truly be beyond redemption. Lin Yuan wasn’t in a rush. He waited for Cen Ruyi to recover her senses before turning to her, waiting for her to speak.","The intense cold she endured in the ice had indeed frightened Cen Ruyi. While trapped, she overheard voices outside. Cen Ruyi hadn’t expected Xi Mei to speak up for her, which made her see Xi Mei in a different light.","Regardless, Cen Ruyi appreciated Xi Mei’s gesture of goodwill.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan looking at her, Cen Ruyi quickly lowered her head and said, “Young Master Lin, I’m really sorry. I shouldn’t have failed to discipline my subordinates and let them treat you in such a manner. I couldn’t hold back my temper either. I hope you—","Before Cen Ruyi could finish, Lin Yuan interrupted her, “I heard that you’re very strict with your subordinates. I can tell that they’re very afraid of you! How could they have done such a thing without your permission? Looks like you did learn some lessons just now, but you only learned half a lesson. Winter, as a teacher, you’ve made some mistakes in teaching!”","Lin Yuan’s tone was extremely calm, but his words made Cen Ruyi’s heart skip a beat.","Just as Cen Ruyi was about to speak, the coldness enveloped Cen Ruyi again and sealed her in ice.","Winter bent down and said, “Young Master, it’s my fault for not teaching her well. Give me ten minutes. I’ll either teach her a lesson or get rid of her. There’s no point in keeping such a person around.”","Winter’s killing intent toward Cen Ruyi surged. Cen Ruyi was truly foolish to still be trying to find excuses for herself at such a critical moment.","In Winter’s opinion, Cen Ruyi had caused him to do a bad job in front of Lin Yuan.","Xi Mei poured herself another cup of tea and took a few sips. Rather than saying that she was looking for an excuse, it would be more accurate to say that Cen Ruyi was just being stubborn to protect her pride. After this, Cen Ruyi would definitely learn to be obedient.","However, Lin Yuan’s attitude toward Cen Ruyi could not be compared to his attitude toward her. If she worked under Lin Yuan in the future, Cen Ruyi would no longer be her opponent. Instead, she would become her subordinate and be managed by her.","Winter intensified the effect on Cen Ruyi. When he let Cen Ruyi out, she took nearly 20 minutes to recover.","This time, Cen Ruyi had indeed learned her lesson and did not dare to argue with Lin Yuan anymore. Instead, she took the initiative to suggest that she wanted to join Lin Yuan.","Cen Ruyi did not bring up the matter of restoring her lifespan to Lin Yuan. With her lifespan dwindling, if Lin Yuan was willing to accept her, he would surely help her restore it.","At present, all Cen Ruyi could think about was not wanting to be sealed in the ice for the third time.","After taking Cen Ruyi under his wing and controlling her holy spirit, Lin Yuan did not immediately hand the Lifespan Mouse to Cen Ruyi. Lin Yuan had two reasons for doing this. On one hand, even if he took Cen Ruyi under his wing, he wanted to make sure she learned her lesson. On the other hand, Lin Yuan did not want Ling Muzhuo to think that he could help everyone who wanted to increase their lifespan. If he could help everyone recover their lifespans, Ling Muzhuo would inevitably be suspicious over time.","After confirming that Lin Yuan had taken Cen Ruyi under his wing, Xi Mei took the initiative to tell Cen Ruyi about Lin Yuan’s instructions.","Cen Ruyi, who had learned her lesson, firmly remembered Xi Mei’s instructions to her. She was afraid that if she did anything wrong and angered Lin Yuan, she would suffer endless punishment.","Upon walking out of the side hall’s door, Lin Yuan saw Ling Muzhuo waiting there. When Ling Muzhuo spotted Lin Yuan, he quickly went up to him and asked with a smile, “Brother Lin, how did it go? Did you help Lord Cen Ruyi recover her lifespan?”","Ling Muzhuo, who had been guarding outside, did not sense any energy fluctuations and perceived no indication of conflict between Lin Yuan and Cen Ruyi.","While asking, Ling Muzhuo’s gaze shifted toward Lin Yuan’s back. Cen Ruyi, who had followed Lin Yuan out, did not regain her youthful appearance like Xi Mei. Instead, she still looked old and haggard. This led him to understand that the spiritual ingredients in Lin Yuan’s hands must not be able to restore Cen Ruyi’s lifespan.","Ling Muzhuo was a little worried about whether Lin Yuan could restore Master Yi He’s lifespan as a Grade 5 Creator. He had just reported the news of Xi Mei’s lifespan recovery to Master Yi He, which aroused Master Yi He’s interest and confidence. If Lin Yuan failed, wouldn’t it be equivalent to sending a fake message?","Lin Yuan said indifferently, “Brother Ling, do you really think that I have a divine medicine in my hands that I can help anyone? I don’t have that kind of ability. It’s been nearly five hours since I met Her Excellency Xi Mei. Brother Ling, please take me to see the Grade 5 Creator first.","“Let’s talk after I meet this Grade 5 Creator. I don’t want to keep him waiting. Just now, Her Excellency Cen Ruyi lost her temper because she waited for me for more than two hours. Fortunately, she didn’t blame me in the end.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Cen Ruyi’s lips twitched crazily. She was indeed angry because she had waited for Lin Yuan for more than two hours and had also caused trouble for him. However, in the end, it wasn’t that she didn’t blame Lin Yuan, but rather that Lin Yuan chose to forgive her after punishing her. Although Lin Yuan was not telling the truth, Cen Ruyi did not dare to refute him.","Ling Muzhuo felt a little regretful that Lin Yuan could not help Cen Ruyi recover her lifespan, as Cen Ruyi did not owe her any favors in return.","Even though Cen Ruyi did not have much lifespan left, Ling Muzhuo still spoke to her warmly, “Although Your Excellency Cen Ruyi did not help you this time,","I will still try my best to help you find spiritual ingredients that can increase your lifespan in the future. I’ll definitely inform you as soon as I find it!”","Cen Ruyi knew that Ling Muzhuo was just being polite. The Fortune Treasure Palace also needed spiritual ingredients that could increase lifespan. Even if","Ling Muzhuo really managed to find it, he would prioritize giving it to the Fortune Treasure Palace and not to her. If Cen Ruyi had not been controlled by Lin Yuan, she would have snorted and left.","Upon recalling what Xi Mei had instructed her to do, Cen Ruyi said to Ling Muzhuo, “Although Young Master Lin didn’t help me recover my lifespan, it doesn’t mean that he didn’t help at all. He has spent quite some time here with me. Please take him over quickly so as not to keep the Grade 5 Creator waiting for too long!”","Cen Ruyi’s words made Ling Muzhuo smile. Ling Muzhuo was surprised to find out that even though Lin Yuan was unable to help Cen Ruyi restore her lifespan, she still acknowledged the favor he had done for her. Thus, Ling","Muzhuo decided to spend more effort on Lin Yuan and introduce him to some Creators whose lifespans were about to end.."]},{"number":2982,"title":"Chapter 2982 Star-Arming Moon Bamboo!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2982 Star-Arming Moon Bamboo!","....","Ling Muzhuo had been the Palace Master of Fortune Treasure Palace for many years. The fact that he could become the Palace Master had a lot to do with the power behind him.","In all his years as the Palace Master Fortune Treasure Palace, Ling Muzhuo had rarely encountered such a win-win situation. The factions or individuals who cooperated with the Fortune Treasure Palace either wanted convenience or wanted to obtain benefits.","These individuals had such intentions that the Fortune Treasure Palace had limited benefits when trading with them. However, now, through cooperation with Lin Yuan, Ling Muzhuo had gained significant benefits without investing anything. The favors that he had made turned into his rewards in the end.","As the Palace Lord of the Fortune Treasure Palace, Ling Muzhuo also had his own selfish motives. The favors he received through this method would not be attributed to the Fortune Treasure Palace, but to himself.","If he introduced more high-grade Creators to Lin Yuan, he believed that when he engaged in trades with them in the future, they would afford him some respect and favor due to his connections with Lin Yuan.","Ling Muzhuo brought Lin Yuan to a side hall that was only a lake away from the main hall and said to him in an extremely serious tone, “Brother Lin, this is the Grade 5 Creator. We usually call him Lord Yi He. He became a Grade 5 Creator a long time ago. He’s extremely powerful, but he can’t escape the baptism of the New Age.”","Ling Muzhuo was introducing Lin Yuan to the Grade 5 Creator he was about to meet. At the same time, he also wanted to convey to Lin Yuan that Yi He cared a lot about his identity. He hoped that Lin Yuan met Yi He later, he could call him Master to express his recognition and respect for Yi He’s capabilities.","However, Lin Yuan couldn’t address him as Lord Yi He. This was because Lin Yuan intended to take Yi He, a Grade 5 Creator, under his command. As the leader, how could Lin Yuan call his subordinate Lord?","“Unless Big Brother Ling can obtain an eternal lifespan, no lifeforms can withstand the wear and tear of time. As a Grade 5 Creator, Master Yi He must have developed his own understanding of life while in the process of strengthening and nurturing other lifeforms. I’ll go in and meet this Master Yi He. Perhaps he can enlighten me!”","After saying that, Lin Yuan brought Winter into the side hall that was obviously more luxurious.","Ling Muzhuo noticed that Lin Yuan did not address Yi He as Lord. Instead, he addressed him as Master Yi He.","Calling a Grade 5 Creator Lord was an established custom in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. In order to show respect for a Grade 5 Creator, everyone would take the initiative to address them in that manner. Even if Lin Yuan was not a native of the East Universe, he should be aware of this rule.","There was only one possible reason why Lin Yuan would call him that, and that was because there was no lack of Grade 5 Creators around him or these Grade 5 Creators were equals or even inferiors in front of Lin Yuan, which was why he treated Yi He with such an attitude.","Ling Muzhuo was much more powerful than a Grade 5 Creator, but when facing a Grade 5 Creator, Ling Muzhuo still had to respectfully address them as Lord. Disrespecting a Grade 5 Creator could provoke their displeasure, and when the news spread, it could attract the hostility of other high-grade Creators.","Many high-grade Creators formed groups. Some would even create organizations for other Creators to join, forming a mutually beneficial alliance. Lord Yi He was the leader of the Creator Alliance. Unfortunately, because Yi He’s lifespan was about to end, the popularity and influence of this Creator Alliance had diminished greatly.","Yi He had helped Ling Muzhuo a lot and had a good personal relationship with him. Otherwise, Yi He wouldn’t have made this trip upon Ling Muzhuo’s invitation. Once Yi He successfully recovered his lifespan, the Creator Alliance he established would definitely be able to last for a period of time. The two important cooperation projects of Fortune Treasure Palace might find realization through Yi He.","However, Ling Muzhuo did not have much confidence in Lin Yuan’s ability to restore Yi He’s lifespan. Helping a Grade 4 Creator recover their lifespan was completely different from helping a Grade 5 Creator recover their lifespan.","As soon as Lin Yuan entered the side hall, he saw an elderly man tending to the plant-type feys placed in the hall. The plant-type feys were all extremely functional supreme treasures that definitely could not be traded in the Fortune Treasure Palace’s exhibition hall.","The elderly man was very focused on taking care of the plant-type feys. When he saw Lin Yuan and Winter, his gaze first landed on Winter before quickly shifting to Lin Yuan.","“At such a young age, you’ve already reached the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. You’re truly a genius! You must be the Lin Yuan that Ling Muzhuo mentioned. Let’s see what the Star-Arming Moon Bamboo I raised looks like!”","Lin Yuan could not sense any signs of aging from Yi He, but his appearance indicated that he had no choice but to give up on maintaining his youthful appearance to preserve his vitality.","Winter was retracting his aura. The fact that Yi He could look away from Winter so quickly meant that he didn’t see through Winter’s disguise.","“This pot of Star-Arming Moon Bamboo is naturally raised very well. From the fineness of the leaves, it can be seen that you have poured a lot of effort into it. It’s just that the amount of pure spirit qi absorbed by this Star-Arming Moon Bamboo is a little small. Otherwise, the starlight on the bamboo leaves should be brighter!”","When he heard Lin Yuan’s way of addressing him, he was slightly stunned. Ever since he became a Grade 5 Creator, everyone would address him as ‘Lord’. To Yi He, the title of Master felt both unfamiliar and distant. If it was hundreds of years ago when his lifespan was still sufficient, Yi He would definitely not allow others to call him that. But now, Yi He no longer valued worldly possessions like fame and resources.","In Yi He’s eyes, Lin Yuan was really too young. In order to verify the effects of a spiritual ingredient, Yi He had gone into seclusion for more than 50 years to optimize a potion formula.","Yi He, who was at the end of his lifespan, suddenly felt the meaning of life reincarnation upon encountering such an outstanding new life form.","At this moment, he entered a state of epiphany.","Lin Yuan was surprised when he sensed Yi He’s state. His current state was very similar to when Lin Yuan had comprehended the Willpower Rune.","Lin Yuan did not choose to disturb Yi He. Instead, he retreated to the side and quietly waited for Yi He’s epiphany.","He turned to look at Winter. It would probably require a long time for a person with Yi He’s strength to have an epiphany. Lin Yuan did not have that much time to accompany Yi He. If Yi He’s epiphany required several years, Lin Yuan couldn’t possibly wait for that long.","At that moment, Winter’s voice transmission sounded in Lin Yuan’s mind, “Young Master, Yi He’s luck is really bad. If he had entered such a state a few hundred years earlier, his strength would definitely have improved further. Even his lifespan would have improved further. It’s just that it’s a little late to enter such a state now. Yi He’s lifespan is not enough to support his breakthrough. When he gets out of this state, he’ll probably feel uncomfortable.","“In this huge Sky Beyond the Clouds, Yi He can be considered a veteran expert. Bringing him under your wing could be beneficial. Given his network of connections, he can help you in many matters.”","Winter rarely expressed such acknowledgment towards others. Presently, this was the highest evaluation Winter had given to outsiders since Lin Yuan had known him.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to ask how long it would take for Yi He to wake up from this state of epiphany, he saw that Yi He had returned to normal. Lin Yuan could see a flash of complexity in his eyes.","Yi He sighed softly to hide the complicated emotions in his eyes as he smiled at Lin Yuan, “You’re quite young, but you’re quite knowledgeable. You helped me just now. Since you recognize the extraordinary nature of this Star-Arming Moon Bamboo, I’ll give it to you as a gift.”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan did not stand on ceremony with Yi He. If Yi He did not intend to join him, Lin Yuan would not force him.","However, Lin Yuan wanted to trade the Star-Arming Moon Bamboo from Yi He, as it was the best tonic for those feys that used the moonlight as their energy source. It could help his master’s feys, the Star Vastness Peony, and Wen Yu’s sacred source lifeform, the Astronomical Parliament, quickly enhance their strength.","This spiritual ingredient was too rare. If he missed it, Lin Yuan really did not know if he would be fated to encounter such a rare treasure again.","Through Yi He’s actions, Lin Yuan gained insights into Yi He’s personality. He appeared to be a very forthright person. Furthermore, he did not take these external objects seriously.","Of course, the reason why Yi He had casually given out this pot of Star-Arming Moon Bamboo was most likely because he believed that he didn’t have much lifespan left. Even if he could really obtain spiritual ingredients that could increase his lifespan, he would only be able to live for a few dozen years at most.","“Since that’s the case, I shall thank Master Yi He in advance. I believe you should know the reason why Palace Master Ling facilitated our meeting. I wonder if we should continue chatting and admiring the flowers here or get down to business first?”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Yi He laughed, “Lin Yuan, you’re so direct, let’s get down to business then/ I haven’t met anyone as interesting as you in a long time. Regardless of whether we can complete the trade later, I will set up a banquet in this side hall to entertain you tonight. Then we’ll drink and make small talk!”","Having just experienced an epiphany, Yi He had become more open-minded about everything. However, facing the situation where his lifespan was about to run out, Yi He felt a little sad. It was rare to meet someone that he found interesting, so he was willing to spend time with Lin Yuan.","There were very few people in the entire East Universe who could have the honor of being invited to Yi He’s banquet.","“If we are going to drink, it will definitely be better to drink joyful alcohol than sorrowful alcohol. I hope that our upcoming trade will give you a reason to drink joyful alcohol. It’s just that there are many times when you have to give up something to gain something. I hope Master Yi He can understand!”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, the expression on Yi He’s face became interesting. Yi He had never heard about joyful alcohol and sorrowful alcohol before, but indeed, he found solace in alcohol whether he was happy or troubled. When he was depressed, he would drink to drown his sorrows. In times of joy, drinking indeed became much more satisfying.","Yi He understood the principles of sacrifice and gain from the very beginning, even when he was just starting out. To gain something, one must be willing to make sacrifices. This was an immutable truth that had stood the test of time.","The serious manner in which Lin Yuan imparted such wisdom left Yi He with a special feeling. It was as if he had become a stupid old man. Although his lifespan was about to run out and he could not maintain his youthful appearance, the functions of his body did not deteriorate at all.","Yi He was not angry at Lin Yuan’s words, but he turned around and began to teach Lin Yuan, “Lin Yuan, you do have to give up something to gain in this world. It’s just that many things have different values depending on their levels. You will slowly understand this in the future. This time, you must have brought some extremely rare spiritual ingredients that can increase lifespan. Why don’t you show me this spiritual ingredient first?","“The spiritual ingredients you took out probably won’t be able to help me recover my lifespan. Ever since I realized that my lifespan was about to be exhausted, I’ve worked hard to extend it by more than 14,000 years. Few spiritual ingredients can continue to increase my lifespan!”","Lin Yuan did not immediately take out the Lifespan Mouse and asked in an extremely serious tone, “Master Yi He, you’ve extended your lifespan by more than ten thousand years and used all sorts of methods. I believe that you value your life very much. If there’s a chance for you to obtain an endless lifespan, but this opportunity requires you to pay the price of freedom, would you be willing to use freedom to exchange for this endless lifespan?!”","If someone else asked him such a question, not only would Yi He be displeased, but he might even slap them. There was no point in asking such a question. Could it be that Lin Yuan was going to help him transform into an elemental lifeform to get an endless lifespan?!","Elemental lifeforms also had many restrictions if they wanted to obtain an endless lifespan, in which they could only survive in a rich elemental environment. Once they left this dense elemental environment, it would be very difficult to maintain their lives. When that happened, the endless lifespan would naturally become a joke.","For some reason, perhaps because Lin Yuan had given him an epiphany, Yi He was extremely tolerant of Lin Yuan and was even willing to spend time speaking freely with him.","After thinking about Lin Yuan’s question seriously for a while, he said, “If it means only gaining a few tens of thousands of years of lifespan but depriving me of my freedom, I certainly won’t agree to it! I don’t only risk losing dignity but it also means that my time is no longer under my control. Such a price is not something that tens of thousands of years of lifespan can compensate for!”"]},{"number":2983,"title":"Chapter 2983 Yi He’s Creator Alliance!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2983 Yi He’s Creator Alliance!","....","At this point, Yi He changed the topic and said without hesitation, “However, if I can get an endless lifespan, it will be a different story. “Endless lifespan represents eternal life. Immortality is still my greatest pursuit and the pursuit of all life. If there’s really a chance to live forever, even the other Grade 5 Creators will do their best to fight for it, let alone me.","“All these years, I’ve been running around to obtain a lifespan. I’ve long become a slave to lifespan. I don’t have any so-called freedom to speak of. At your age, everything is just beginning. I suppose you probably can’t understand what an elderly person like I am saying!”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan knew what Yi He was thinking, so he spoke in an extremely serious tone. “Master Yi He, if I can give you an endless lifespan, would you consider joining me and working for me?!”","Yi He initially thought Lin Yuan was just speaking freely and hadn’t expected Lin Yuan to say such things to him so seriously. He did not think that Lin Yuan had spiritual ingredients that could allow a lifeform to live forever. Throughout his journey of growth, Yi He had received too many invitations that he had lost count of them. At present, Lin Yuan’s invitation was definitely new to him.","Yi He actually didn’t want to continue this topic anymore. The depletion of his lifespan was already a certainty, and Yi He could already foresee his own fate. It was a little strange to talk about such things at this time.","However, he still patiently replied, “If you can let me obtain an endless lifespan, I can naturally join you and work for you. It’s just that it’s best for young people not to have too many expectations, as you won’t be able to see the reality and lose your determination and courage to strive forward as a result. Alright, you should show me the spiritual ingredients you prepared first!”","Lin Yuan had already asked all the necessary questions, so he took the Lifespan Mouse out of the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Yi He’s originally lazy gaze suddenly erupted with light the moment it landed on the Lifespan Mouse. He hurriedly held the Lifespan Mouse with both hands and carefully observed it.","At this moment, Yi He suddenly understood why Lin Yuan had asked him such a question earlier. Lin Yuan was not just speaking freely to him, he was really genuinely asking to consider if he wanted to reveal this fey to him.","Yi He did not regret what he had just said. If there was such a chance, he was indeed willing to exchange it. However, the current situation was a little special.","Lin Yuan was a World Emperor/Divine Kingdom expert.","However, the aura emitted by the elderly man beside Lin Yuan was only at high-grade Holy Spirit level. Yi He had already captured the Lifespan Mouse and could kill both of them with a raise of his hand. In that case, he would still have an endless lifespan and would not have to be controlled by others.","With this thought in mind, Yi He regarded Lin Yuan with a complex gaze. Both Winter and Lin Yuan noticed the shift in Yi He’s expression.","They maintained their expressions, awaiting Yi He’s decision.","Should Yi He choose to pledge loyalty to Lin Yuan, as suggested, Lin Yuan would readily mentor him, allowing a Grade 5 Creator like Yi He to attain a high-ranking position within Sky City.","Honoring his promise would showcase Yi He’s character and integrity. However, reneging on his word, refusing to join Lin Yuan, and attempting to seize the Lifespan Mouse to attack Lin Yuan would prompt Winter to assert direct control over Yi He, akin to his handling of Cen Ruyi. This would underscore that Grade 5 Creators hold no special privileges under Lin Yuan’s authority.","After a while, Yi He resolved his inner conflict and addressed Lin Yuan, saying, “Lin Yuan, I’ll have to address you differently from now on. I am now one of your subordinates. If you require anything, just inform me. At present, I lead an alliance of Creators. If you wish for my allegiance, I can delegate management of this alliance to a trusted friend.”","Lin Yuan smiled and extended his hand, “Since that’s the case, I’ll have to trouble you to take care of me in the future. Welcome to Sky City!”","Lin Yuan pondered about the Creator Alliance mentioned by Yi He. A Creator Alliance could be said to be extremely valuable. He had previously heard Ling Muzhuo mention organizations like the Creator Alliance. It seemed that Yi He was the leader of the Creator Alliance.","Lin Yuan had originally intended to bring Yi He along and bring him into Sky City. However, upon knowing that Yi He had the Creator Alliance, Lin Yuan changed his mind. It was better to let Yi He continue to develop this Creator Alliance outside so that Lin Yuan could borrow their resources. This was much more beneficial to Lin Yuan than bringing him back to Sky City.","“Master Yi He, contract this Lifespan Mouse first. With its endless lifespan, you’ll find it easier to continue developing this Creator Alliance in the future. The endless lifespan in exchange for freedom that I mentioned before actually doesn’t impose many restrictions on you. hope you can tell me about the Creator Alliance in the future!”","In reality, Yi He was reluctant to disband the Creator Alliance, considering it his own close-knit circle. He had nurtured a special fey to facilitate communication among the Creators within this circle. Handing over control of the faction he had managed for countless years would likely leave him disappointed for a considerable time.","Yet, since he was now under Lin Yuan’s command, it would be unreasonable for him to continue leading the Creator Alliance. Therefore, he refrained from suggesting such a course of action to Lin Yuan. To his surprise, Lin Yuan granted him the freedom he desired.","Following his contract with the Lifespan Mouse, Yi He took the initiative to surrender it to Lin Yuan. Aware of Lin Yuan’s intention to reclaim the Lifespan Mouse, Yi He comprehended his actions fully. If the roles were reversed, Yi He would have acted likewise.","After giving the Lifespan Mouse to Lin Yuan, he released his holy spirit for Lin Yuan to control, “Since I’m in charge of this Creator Alliance, I’ll continue to stay in Cloud Splendor Palace outside Clear Peak City from now on. Young Master, do you have a communication fey? If you don’t, I have a Thousand Words Cicada here. You can contact me through a voice transmission at any time.”","After saying that, Yi He took out a small cicada that was completely emerald green. The cicada kept flapping its wings and letting out a pleasant cry.","Lin Yuan once again encountered a fey capable of long-distance communication.","The Thousand Words Cicada’s communication ability was stronger than the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. The Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower could only transmit text messages, but the Thousand Words Cicada could transmit voice messages.","Lin Yuan did not need Yi He to introduce the Thousand Words Cicada to him. He had already found out about it through True Data. However, the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower was more suitable for Lin Yuan and Sky City.","The Thousand Words Cicada could only transmit messages from point to point. Only young cicadas born from the same mother cicada could transmit messages.","A fey like the Thousand Words Cicada could only give birth to two or three cicadas at a time, unlike the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, which could form a huge communication network.","Lin Yuan received the Thousand Words Cicada and handed a Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower to Yi He, “Master Yi He, I’ll also give you one of the feys I use for communication. This way, even if one communication channel is broken in the future, we can still communicate through another method.”","Yi He immediately recognized that the communication fey that Lin Yuan took out was the ramet of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. He could not help but ask Lin Yuan, “Young Master, is your relationship with the Fortune Treasure Palace extremely close?”","After becoming Lin Yuan’s subordinate, Yi He felt it necessary to inquire about Lin Yuan’s relationship with Fortune Treasure Palace, so he could understand how to interact with them in the future.","It was thanks to Ling Muzhuo that he had the chance to meet Lin Yuan. If Ling Muzhuo had not repeatedly invited Yi He, he would not have come. In his heart, he was still quite grateful to Ling Muzhuo.","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment before replying, “We don’t have a close relationship. The Fortune Treasure Palace and I are just trading with each other. You can still maintain your previous identity when you travel outside. There’s no need to publicly say that you’ve joined another faction. If there’s anything you want to do, just do it. I won’t restrict you unless it’s necessary. Since you have recovered your lifespan, why don’t we leave this side hall?”","Yi He hurriedly said, “Young Master, as I just mentioned inviting you to a banquet, why don’t you give me this opportunity to tell you about the Creator Alliance?”","Before Lin Yuan could nod, Yi He enthusiastically took out many dishes. Without exception, these dishes were all made with extremely rare spiritual ingredients and had extremely strong local characteristics of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan actually did not like to eat the food that Yi He had taken out. High-grade spiritual ingredients usually had a very strong taste. The food made from these high-grade spiritual ingredients resembled the medicinal cuisine that Lin Yuan had consumed in his previous life. Compared to these medicinal cuisines, Lin Yuan preferred normal food.","It was true that eating food made of rare spiritual ingredients could improve one’s physique, but Lin Yuan’s Body of All Spirits had no room for improvement.","After some conversation, Lin Yuan learned that Yi He was an intermediate Grade 5 Creator, and there was also a low Grade 5 Creator in the Creator Alliance that Yi He had founded. In addition, there were 27 Grade 4 Creators under him, and these people were all Yi He’s best friends.","Lin Yuan was rather surprised by the number of people in the Creator Alliance. There were actually 27 Grade 4 Creators in the alliance. This made Lin Yuan even more certain that he had to let Yi He manage this Creator Alliance well.","After introducing the Creator Alliance under his command, Yi He spoke to Lin Yuan warmly and seriously, “Young Master, if you need any Creator resources, just let me know. I can issue a mission in the Creator Alliance.”","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment before replying, “Yi He, I won’t stand on ceremony with you. I want to exchange for more potions to strengthen insect-type lifeforms and increase and recover spiritual energy through the Creator Alliance you control. Although you’ve joined me, I won’t ask you for help for nothing. I have many Grade 4 Creator resources on hand. I can use these Grade 4 Creator resources to exchange for them.”","As he spoke, Lin Yuan took out a few spirit qi crystals and shook them in his hand before handing them to Yi He to investigate.","Yi He did not take the spirit qi crystal from Lin Yuan and quickly waved his hand, “Young Master, why would I want your compensation for the things you arranged for me? It’s easy to concoct potions to nurture insect-species feys and restore spiritual energy. I’ll arrange for those Grade 4 Creators to concoct more!”","Upon hearing his words, Lin Yuan replied with a smile, “Master Yi He, you’ll definitely have to pay the other Grade 4 Creators for their work. It’s impossible for these Creators to work for you for free after joining your alliance. In the future, I might have to cooperate with these Creators under your command. Only by paying more can I ensure that they are willing to make potions for me for a long time!”","As Lin Yuan’s strength continued to increase, he began to pay more attention to the accumulation of potions because he realized that he could not solve everything with just spirit qi crystals.","Liu Jie’s increase in strength and Wen Yu’s spiritual energy growth and recovery were not achievable with just the spirit qi crystals.","Apart from constantly collecting special spiritual ingredients, Lin Yuan also needed to prepare some potions. It was time for Liu Jie and Wen Yu, his two right-hand men, to improve their strength.","As the leader of the Creator Alliance, Yi He would definitely not let his subordinates work for nothing. Those who could become Grade 4 Creators were all intelligent individuals, and Yi He did not want his friends to be suspicious.","Yi He was prepared to pay for the resources himself. However, now that Lin Yuan had expressed his intentions, he would not reject it no matter what the reason was.","After Yi He returned, he prepared to hold a meeting in the organization and tell everyone in the Creator Alliance that his lifespan had been restored. This news could rekindle the members’ fighting spirit.","“Alright, Young Master, I’ll make the arrangements now. I’ll try to rush back tonight!”","After Lin Yuan finished his meal, he left the side hall together with Yi He, who had already restored his youthful appearance. Yi He was extremely good-looking. Among all the individuals that Lin Yuan had encountered, Yi He’s looks easily ranked within the top five.","Upon seeing Ling Muzhuo, Yi He raised his hand and cupped his hands towards him. After expressing his gratitude to Ling Muzhuo, he immediately set off for his Cloud Splendor Palace.","As news of his lifespan nearing its end spread, many factions near Clear Peak City sought to capitalize on his situation. In the past, Yi He had no intention to deal with these factions. Now, Yi He was prepared to settle scores with them to let these factions know who truly held power within a 500,000-kilometer radius of Clear Peak City, Dragon Heart City, and Fire Stream City!"]},{"number":2984,"title":"Chapter 2984: Prey and Hunter!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2984: Prey and Hunter!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Over the past thousand years, Yi He had become increasingly low-profile because of his lifespan. Many of the matters that used to concern him were no longer of interest to him now.","Yi He’s transformation was like a signal to others that his days were numbered.","As his lifespan neared its end, the relationship between the members of the Creator Alliance had become delicate. Yi He was aware of all of this, and now he wanted to change this situation.","Now that his lifespan had recovered, his inner arrogance and audacity had returned in full force. While Yi He maintained a calm demeanor, it was only a mask on the surface. Having seen through life and death, he had become indifferent to everything else. Now, he only cared about Lin Yuan’s opinion.","Ling Muzhuo originally wanted Yi He to stay in Fortune Treasure Palace for a few more days, but after seeing that he had no intention of staying, Ling Muzhuo didn’t force him.","Before Yi He left, he waved at him. This action showed that Yi He remembered his favor.","“Brother Lin, the spiritual ingredient in your possession capable of restoring lifespan is truly remarkable. It even restored Lord Yi He’s lifespan.”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan smiled. He knew that Ling Muzhuo had mentioned the spiritual ingredient in his possession again because he had the intention to trade with Lin Yuan. Trading the Lifespan Mouse with Ling Muzhuo was out of the question for Lin Yuan. As for other spiritual ingredients capable of restoring lifespan, Lin Yuan did not possess any.","“Brother Ling, the spiritual ingredients in my possession that can restore my lifespan are indeed rare. That’s why I require those Creators to offer me their promise before I engage in any trade with them. Be it the two Grade 4 Creators, Xi Mei and Cen Ruyi, or the Grade 5 Creator, Master Yi He, they all promised me.","“I will definitely make the most of such resources, and only trade with Creators. If one day your lifespan is nearing its end, I can use it to help you restore it. As for others, let’s forget about it.”","Ling Muzhuo indeed wanted to trade for this spiritual ingredient from Lin Yuan.","Upon hearing that, Ling Muzhuo did not insist on continuing the trade. If he were to bring it up again and face rejection from Lin Yuan, not only would Ling Muzhuo’s goal fail, but it could also strain their relationship. Ling Muzhuo was very clear about this.","“Brother Lin, do you have any plans to stay here for a few more days?!”","Lin Yuan smiled and shook his head. “Brother Ling, I’m currently gathering resources everywhere. Don’t you know how busy I am? I don’t have much time for vacation and rest. When I’m free in the future, I’ll visit you. I’m preparing to leave tomorrow. Besides, you have my contact information. We can communicate anytime!”","Lin Yuan had already received a message from Fu Mi while conversing with Yi","He. Fu Mi had assisted Lin Yuan in gathering several star pirates near Treasure City, and they had already taken their positions. Fu Mi wanted to ask Lin Yuan when he would finish off these star pirates.","Fu Mi had gathered the star pirates but did not have a specific reason for looking for them. Hence. Fu Mi had only mentioned that there was a big deal.","Now, the star pirates had already begun to inquire Fu Mi about the details of the big deal. She could not delay for too long anymore.","Lin Yuan was prepared to meet with Fu Mi tomorrow to get rid of these star pirates. He hoped that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen could choose a suitable candidate from these star pirates to be a holy maid.","“Brother Lin, since you’re leaving tomorrow, you have to give me a chance to show off today! ”","After saying that, Ling Muzhuo began to make preparations. Not only did he invite Lin Yuan, but he also invited Xi Mei and Cen Ruyi.","Lin Yuan had just helped Xi Mei and Cen Ruyi. Now, using the pretext of hosting Lin Yuan, he invited Ximei and Cen Ruyi. They would definitely not reject his invitation. Ling Muzhuo intended to use this banquet to deepen his relationship with them.","Xi Mei and Cen Ruyi were indeed giving Ling Muzhuo face. However, Ling Muzhuo’s plan to trade Creator resources with Xi Mei and Cen Ruyi would ultimately fail as they would only contribute resources to the Sky City and wouldn’t leak resources outside.","Ling Muzhuo’s banquet was very detailed, allowing Lin Yuan to experience the luxury of the Sky Beyond the Clouds experts’ lives.","Lin Yuan was not interested in these lavish social interactions. However, Ling Muzhuo’s chef was skilled and knew how to cook many delicacies Lin Yuan had never tried.","In terms of taste, though, Liu Jie and Zong Ze’s dishes were not inferior to the ones that Ling Muzhuo had treated him to. The environment provided by Ling Muzhuo was also far inferior to the environment in Lin Yuan’s Spirit Lock spatial zone","The banquet lasted until late at night before Lin Yuan returned to the side hall that Ling Muzhuo had arranged for him.","Lin Yuan stayed in the inner hall while Winter guarded the door.","Winter had been by Lin Yuan’s side for years. During this period, Winter witnessed Lin Yuan’s growth step by step, bringing both joy and delight to him. Nonetheless, Winter felt that Lin Yuan was too kind-hearted. When strengthening his sacred source lifeform, he only chose to target star pirates.","In the eyes of most experts in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there was no concept of good or evil. Those who were overly kind-hearted often progressed much slower in enhancing their strength compared to those who were willing to do whatever it took.","In order to survive, the various species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds fought against each other following the laws of the jungle. The concept of good and evil basically did not exist. For example, the Bloodians seemed to be on the evil side when they attacked the mermaids, but in the end, this operation was just a large-scale hunting operation by the Bloodians.","Although Winter felt that Lin Yuan’s actions were not in line with the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ rules, he did not remind Lin Yuan. As Lin Yuan grew up, he would gradually revise his current viewpoint and would be able to understand this world more clearly. Winter also couldn’t be certain that his understanding would always align with Lin Yuan’s growth.","Lin Yuan sat at the table and took out a completely jade-textured agarwood and an octagonal incense burner with eight auspicious beasts carved on it from his spatial equipment. He placed the jade-textured agarwood into the incense burner and lit it.","White smoke came out of the octagonal incense burner with eight auspicious beasts carved on it. The elegant smell of agarwood filled Lin Yuan’s nose.","Among all the spices, Lin Yuan loved the jade-textured agarwood. Every time he lit the agarwood, he felt a sense of security.","Before coming to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Lin Yuan rarely had the chance to travel around. This period could be considered the time of Lin Yuan’s most rapid growth. His growth was not reflected in his strength but in his wisdom and vision.","Lin Yuan closed his eyes and entered a state of sleep as he sorted out everything that had happened during this period.","At that moment, Fu Mi contacted Lin Yuan through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ramet.","[Fu Mil: Boss, everything is in order on my end. When will you come over? They’ve heard about the big deal and want to come over personally to discuss it with you!","Fu Mi’s message seemed normal, but Lin Yuan frowned.","Firstly, Fu Mi had already confirmed the time for their meeting beforehand. Given that the time had already been set, Fu Mi wouldn’t come to find him again because of this matter. She needed to hide her identity when carrying out such a mission outside. It was not a good thing to contact him too much.","Secondly, Fu Mi usually referred to him as ‘Master’. The sudden change in address meant that something must have happened to her. However, Lin Yuan was not worried because Autumn would follow Fu Mi and secretly protect her. Even if Fu Mi was targeted by those star pirates to send him, it must be to fish for more people.","Lin Yuan received a message from Autumn as soon as Fu Mi sent it.","[Autumn]: Young Master, these star pirates have plans to exploit. They might have intentionally attacked Fu Mi because they heard that there was a Sacred Body Stone in the star pirate group Fu Mi was in. I’m going to lure more star pirates over and capture all of them in one fell swoop. Fu Mil s performance is not bad. This is Fu Mil s main plan.","Autumn’s message confirmed Lin Yuan’s suspicion. Originally, Fu Mi was the hunter, but unexpectedly, the relationship between the hunter and the prey had quietly undergone a change. Unfortunately, these star pirates had miscalculated because the prey they were targeting was not something they could deal with.","[Lin Yuan]: Autumn, I will postpone my meeting with Fu Mi. I hope all the members of these star pirates can gather in three days!","Lin Yuan had planned to meet Fu Mi quickly to settle the matters here. Now, it seemed like he would have to wait a few more days!","Lin Yuan then replied to Fu Mi.","Even though he had postponed meeting Fu Mi, he still left Fortune Treasure Palace the next morning.","Xi Mei and Cen Ruyi did not leave with Lin Yuan. On the second and third day, they left Fortune Treasure Palace and met up with Lin Yuan outside Treasure City.","Huang An had been by Lin Yuan’s side for the past few days. When he saw Cen Ruyi and Xi Mei, he couldn’t help but feel a sense of being more valued by Lin Yuan.","Cen Ruyi and Xi Mei were intermediate Grade 4 Creators and slightly weaker than Huang An in terms of Creator abilities.","Seeing the expression on Huang An’s face, Cen Ruyi looked envious, but she did not dare to offend Huang An. Like Xi Mei, Huang An had recovered his lifespan, yet she had yet to recover her lifespan!","Xi Mei showed a considerable amount of respect toward Huang An, adopting a deferential attitude toward him. However, she did not care about Huang An at all. Huang An’s sense of superiority in front of Lin Yuan could only mean he was not intelligent.","Lin Yuan could even take in a Grade 5 Creator like Yi He, so Huang An was nothing to Lin Yuan. Even if Lin Yuan hadn’t noticed Huang An’s behavior yet, he would see it sooner or later. Such a person was no threat to Xi Mei.","Ever since Xi Mei joined Lin Yuan, she had been contemplating how she could be valued by Lin Yuan.","“Alright, now that we are all together, follow me to deal with a group of star pirates.”","After saying that, Lin Yuan handed the Lifespan Mouse to Cen Ruyi and asked her to contract it.","“I know you have a bad temper and a flawed personality, but I can’t tolerate troublemakers among my subordinates. I hope you can restrain your temper in the future and avoid causing trouble for yourself!”","Cen Ruyi received the Lifespan Mouse from Lin Yuan in surprise and hurriedly promised him, “Lord, the negative impression I left on you before was mainly due to some conflicts between Xi Mei and me. In truth, my temper isn’t as bad as it may seem. Don’t worry, I’ll restrain myself in the future!”","Cen Ruyi thought Xi Mei had most likely contracted this special rat-species fey and obtained an endless lifespan. As soon as Cen Ruyi contracted the Lifespan Mouse, Lin Yuan took it away.","At present, Cen Ruyi’s lifespan and holy spirit were already under Lin Yuan’s control. Thinking of the lesson Winter had taught her, Cen Ruyi felt a sense of fear toward Lin Yuan. The moment this fear appeared, she began to regard Xi Mei more favorably.","At that moment, Fu Mi was facing six higher-ups of the star pirate group. To outsiders, Fu Mi’s face was ashen and revealed a hint of fear.","As a lifeform with the devil bloodline, Fu Mi’s acting skills could fool most lifeforms. Perhaps only pure-blooded devils could tell something from Fu Mi’s expression.","A black-faced man in a purple robe said in a mocking tone, “Don’t you specialize in targeting those elite factions and experts and look down on our plundering business? Why are you asking us for help now?","“Your star pirate group only has a few dozen people in total, and over the years, there haven’t been any new recruits to replenish the losses. Could it be that old Pang guy has deceived you all?”","Many of the star pirates present were old acquaintances of Fu Mil s star pirate group. They had interacted with each other before.","Ever since Pang Li’s strength broke through more than 600 years ago, he had tightened his control over the star pirate groups. Basically, all the resources produced by the star pirate groups were kept in his pocket.","At present, Fu Mi looked a little stupid for working so hard for Pang Li.","This wasn’t the first instance of Fu Mi enduring such ridicule. She was well aware of the nature of the star pirates and Pang Li’s cunning ways. Unfortunately, Pang Li’s power had far exceeded Fu Mil s, leaving her with no means to resist him.","Many members of the star pirate group were oblivious to the reality of their situation.","Lacking confidence in her ability to incite rebellion among the majority of the star pirate group’s members, Fu Mi had had no choice but to endure in silence.","In a way, Lin Yuan had rescued Fu Mi, rendering all those before her mere prey. Why should Fu Mi concern herself with the opinions of prey?","Despite her internal incredulity, Fu Mil s tone turned grave as she spoke. “Meng Kuo, mind your words. Our leader will arrive shortly. Do you comprehend our leader’s temperament? Are you seeking conflict with our leader?”","The black-faced man named Meng Kuo burst into laughter upon hearing that.."]},{"number":2985,"title":"Chapter 2985 Hunting Net","paragraphs":["Chapter 2985 Hunting Net","....","“Dispute? Our star pirate group boasts over 1,000 members. While we may not match the elite status of your group, we are far from weak. My strength rivals Pang Li’s. So what if there’s a conflict between us? Do you think I fear your leader?","“Fu Mi, you’re clever. You must understand why so many star pirates have gathered here. If Pang Li refuses to relinquish the Sacred Body Stone and share its benefits, it’s not a matter of whether he wants conflict, but whether we’ll allow him to leave!","“I admire your skills. Once your group disperses, I’ll extend an invitation to join ours. But ensure you bring Pang Li here. These people haven’t assembled for naught. If he doesn’t show, you’ll need to explain. You know firsthand the difficulty of appeasing them.”","Meng Kuo’s words trailed off as a sharp voice interjected from the side.","“Old Meng, you seem fond of Fu Mi, but have you even considered her feelings? Many star pirate groups seek her, and Pang Li will likely come unless Fu Mi’s message holds a secret code.”","The voice paused, then mocked, “Fu Mi, if your leader treats you like this, why stay? Continuing means you disregard your life!”","Fu Mi turned a deaf ear to these words and did not respond. She just stood there quietly. She had already disguised herself and completed what needed to be done. She really could not be bothered to answer to these people anymore.","Fu Mi understood the current situation through the conversation between the leaders of these star pirates. Although these star pirates were very disdainful of Pang Li, they had made sufficient preparations to besiege Pang Li and prevent him from escaping with the Sacred Body Stone. They had brought all their members along for this purpose.","She had completed the mission very well and was just waiting for Lin Yuan to come and reel in the net.","At this moment, Autumn’s cold voice sounded in Fu Mi’s ears, “How’s the situation? Can we reel in the net now?”","With Autumn’s strength, outsiders couldn’t sense anything abnormal when he sent a voice transmission to Fu Mi. However, if Fu Mi sent a voice transmission to him, the outside world would be able to sense Fu Mi’s soul fluctuations.","Fu Mi was not as strong as Autumn but understood the kind of person Autumn was and knew her thoughts well. She had experienced the power of Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter. While Autumn was formidable, they could stand toe-to-toe with him.","Autumn had always wanted to prove himself to Lin Yuan, but he had never had a suitable opportunity.","Autumn asked Fu Mi if she wanted to resolve everything before Lin Yuan arrived.","For a long time to come, Autumn would stay by Fu Mi’s side. Hence, Fu Mi was willing to help Autumn create an opportunity to showcase himself before Lin Yuan. If Autumn could do so because of her, he would treat Fu Mi better than he did now.","Fu Mi said loudly, “Lord Autumn, everything is ready. You can take action at any time!”","Just as Fu Mi finished speaking, a desolate aura suddenly enveloped all the star pirates present. The star pirates could not even make a sound before they were pressed to the ground by this desolate aura.","Fu Mi witnessed Autumn’s strength again and was still incredibly amazed.","As soon as Autumn appeared, he immediately took control of the situation. He knew that Lin Yuan only wanted Holy Spirit and Divine Kingdom star pirates and had no requirements for other star pirates. Therefore, he directly killed all the star pirates below the Divine Kingdom level and did not give them any chance of survival.","Among the star pirate groups Fu Mi had gathered, only two of them were like the star pirate groups that Fu Mi had been in previously and focused on developing elite star pirates. The majority of the other four star pirate groups hadn’t reached the Divine Kingdom level.","Autumn directly eliminated 90% of those present, sending a chill through the hearts of all the star pirates without exception.","These star pirates had already realized that this gathering initiated by Fu Mi was an ambush and they were all Fu Mi’s targets. It was ironic that previously they had placed themselves in the position of hunters.","Autumn hated the noise of the captives the most, so he did not give these star pirates a chance to speak.","Fu Mi walked forward and began to move the bodies of the star pirates who had been controlled. She divided these star pirates into six groups according to the groups they belonged to.","The Holy Spirit star pirates were at the front, while the Divine Kingdom star pirates were at the back. They were like butchers moving livestock in a slaughterhouse.","After moving the bodies, Fu Mi was about to clean the floor when she saw Lin Yuan walking in with Winter and the other three figures.","Fu Mi had seen two of these three figures before. One of them was Huang An, and the other was Xi Mei. Without exception, they were all genuine Grade 4 Creators.","Fu Mi understood very well what it meant for these two Grade 4 Creators to follow Lin Yuan respectfully. The two Creators had joined Lin Yuan. However, Fu Mi was not surprised.","Having witnessed the strength of Lin Yuan’s subordinates, Fu Mi held an attitude of admiration toward him. Even if someone were to say Lin Yuan had a Grade 5 Creator under his command, Fu Mi wouldn’t be surprised at all.","Autumn stood before Lin Yuan and said, “Lord, I’ve already dealt with everything here. You can question them directly.”","Winter surveyed the chaotic scene before him, then turned his attention to Autumn. He already had a hunch about what was unfolding.","Autumn had already handled the star pirates prior to Lin Yuan’s arrival, employing unconventional methods that undeniably aided Lin Yuan without complication.","However, he had trodden a fine line, as he lacked insight into Lin Yuan’s true intentions. Without this knowledge, Autumn couldn’t predict how Lin Yuan planned to address the situation. If Lin Yuan had different plans, now that the star pirates were subdued, executing those plans might prove challenging!","Lin Yuan gazed at the mess strewn across the ground, raising his hand to summon the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to extract the remaining wills and laws from the corpses.","Since the wills and laws hadn’t yet dissipated from the remnants of the star pirates, Lin Yuan glanced at the subdued group and said, “Autumn, release their constraints. Let them speak freely, at least. One of them might provide valuable insights!”","In response to Lin Yuan’s directive, Autumn lifted the suppression on the star pirates. A black-faced man, who had previously taunted Fu Mi, exclaimed in alarm, “Who are you?! Why are you attacking us here?!”","Upon hearing his words, Lin Yuan looked at the terrified star pirate as though he was looking at a fool. “Why is it that you’re allowed to lay hands on others, but others aren’t allowed to lay hands on you? How can there be such a logic in this world!?”","At that moment, Meng Kuo’s heart was filled with an unusual sense of fear, but Meng Kuo wasn’t a fool and had already vaguely guessed the situation.","Fu Mi had already walked to Lin Yuan’s side and bowed.","In this operation, Fu Mi could recognize Huang An and Xi Mei, and similarly, the leaders of the other star pirate groups could recognize them.","These three Grade 4 Creators couldn’t be associated with star pirates. There were only two possibilities for such a situation to happen.","Firstly, Pang Li had pledged allegiance to the young man in front of him.","Secondly, the young man had already killed Pang Li and had only taken Fu Mi under his wing.","Upon receiving Fu Mi’s invitation and arriving at the location, the leaders were shocked. They hadn’t expected to find only Fu Mi there. It was precisely because of this they had ill intentions towards Fu Mi. If Fu Mi had appeared with her star pirate group, these other star pirates wouldn’t have dared to harbor any ill intentions.","Lin Yuan sat on the chair that Fu Mi had brought over and said calmly, “You’re all gathered together to snatch the Sacred Body Stone. I’m a little curious. There’s only one Sacred Body Stone. How are you planning to distribute it with so many people?”","Lin Yuan had already handed over the Sacred Body Stone to the Moon Empress. Meanwhile, he had reaped considerable gains from a star pirate group. The combined strength of these six groups rivaled that of Fu Mi’s previous crew, hinting at potentially lucrative returns for Lin Yuan.","Aware of their newfound dependence, the leaders were cautious not to provoke Lin Yuan, realizing he could offer them similar patronage as he did Fu Mi. These astute pirates promptly began earnestly responding to Lin Yuan’s inquiries.","As Lin Yuan interacted with the high-ranking members of these groups, he learned of their intentions to invest in the upcoming Creation Conference.","Their plan? To barter the Sacred Body Stone with the Creators for a significant haul of potions, knowing well the likelihood of trading it for Grade 5 Creator resources.","Rather than squandering the Sacred Body Stone for resources, Lin Yuan pondered the aspirations of Pang Li, whom he had killed. He recognized the Sacred Body Stone’s potential to awaken body composition, not to be obtained in vain.","Lin Yuan asked curiously, “How did you know there was a Sacred Body Stone in Fu Mi’s star pirate group?”","When Lin Yuan asked a question, the green-haired star pirate was very cooperative and spoke first. “Lord, Pang Li’s Sacred Body Stone was snatched from someone else’s hands while exploring a relic. Pang Li chose to kill and silence them, unaware that someone had secretly left behind a message.","“I was the one who received the message and informed the other star pirates. With my own abilities, I couldn’t seize the Sacred Body Stone from Pang Li’s hands, so I had to resort to this plan. According to the agreement, each of the other five star pirate groups can only obtain 15% of the profits from the Sacred Body Stone. I can obtain 25%.”","Lin Yuan looked at the green-haired star pirate and said softly, “Are you satisfied with only 25% of the profits from cooperating with the other five star pirates?”","The green-haired star pirate said helplessly, “If I take 10% more than them, they might still tolerate me. If I propose that each star pirate group only takes 10% while I take 50%, they might agree just to get the information. However, once they agree, they will definitely turn against me.","“The star pirate group I lead is the weakest among these groups. As a weakling, I have to consider my safety.","“Lord, I’m willing to use all the accumulation of our star pirate group to exchange for my life. In addition, I know of a blessed land that has yet to be developed. In this blessed land, there were certainly feys exclusive to it. These are the kinds of things even Grade 5 Creators would fight to acquire!”","Lin Yuan stared at the man with long green hair for a few seconds and said lightly, “If what you said is true, I can spare your life and let you follow Fu Mi in the future.”","After saying that, Lin Yuan raised his voice at all the star pirates, “Right now, all of your lives are in my hands. I will only leave one person behind in each star pirate group. Since I’ve already chosen a person from this star pirate group, Autumn, get the rest to release their holy spirits!”","Autumn released his aura and used it to forcefully let the Holy Spirit star pirates, excluding the green-haired man, release the holy spirits from their divine kingdoms.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen looked at the holy spirits and shook her head at Lin Yuan, indicating that they were only suitable for devouring and not for refining into holy maids.","When Lin Yuan saw this, he waved his hand at Autumn. Without exception, these holy spirit experts were pierced by Autumn’s fallen leaves and died on the spot.","Lin Yuan’s casual words didn’t have much of a deterrent effect, but the death of this star pirate immediately stimulated the other star pirate groups’ members. They all started competing to reveal the secrets of their groups.","Unfortunately, the true secrets of the star pirates were in the hands of the upper echelons, and those with less power possessed limited information. Thus, only the true upper echelons had a chance to survive.","Lin Yuan wanted to leave one person in each star pirate group to contact more star pirates like Fu Mi and lure them over. Every member of the star pirate groups had a network in their hands, and this network was what Lin Yuan truly valued.","Lin Yuan was already prepared to treat the star pirates as prey and had specially arranged for Autumn to follow Fu Mi. Logically speaking, this team needed to be strengthened. Otherwise, Autumn, who had been sent out, would be wasted.","Unlike the young man with green hair who held information about a blessed land, the individuals from the other groups who first explained their situations didn’t possess such knowledge. Still, these star pirate groups had abundant resources.","Lin Yuan had obtained more resources from these groups than he had from Fortune Treasure Palace combined. Moreover, many of the resources were invaluable. The kind of resources that could not be traded in Fortune Treasure Palace.","Hunting these star pirates could already be regarded as one of Sky City’s pillar industries now."]},{"number":2986,"title":"Chapter 2986 Artifact: Palm of Blessed Land!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2986 Artifact: Palm of Blessed Land!","....","Among the six individuals handpicked by Lin Yuan, one served as the leader of the star pirate group, three held the position of vice leader, and two were core members responsible for intelligence.","The sole leader was the green-haired man who had initially surrendered to Lin Yuan.","Despite the willingness of the other five leaders to submit to Lin Yuan, he did not spare them.","These leaders were compelled to make this decision upon observing the willingness of many key members of their group to surrender.","Previously holding prominent positions within the star pirates, these individuals found their interests stripped away upon Lin Yuan’s arrival. Even if they were now under his control, their sincere allegiance was doubtful.","While the three vice leaders and two intelligence officers held significant roles, they did not lead the star pirate groups.","Typically, the leaders enjoyed the most benefits within these groups. Joining Lin Yuan would liberate these individuals from suppression, making them more pliable. Moreover, Lin Yuan’s status within the star pirate group provided him with enough control over its network.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen found nothing of value from the star pirate group led by the green-haired man. However, it took an interest in a fire-type holy spirit present in the group led by the purple-robed man.","This holy spirit possessed a simple yet versatile ability—it could both amplify and suppress flames, as well as evoke and extinguish unique fire elements.","Although this ability might seem mundane to an expert, it perfectly suited the needs of the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, who intended to refine it into a holy maid.","By transforming it into a holy maid, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen could utilize its enhancement and suppression abilities to contend with other experts possessing fire-type holy spirits.","Apart from that holy spirit, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen considered two others as potential alternatives. However, Lin Yuan ultimately decided against allowing her to choose these alternatives.","Transforming the holy spirit into a holy maid and then nurturing the holy maid required numerous resources, making the holy maid not easily replaceable.","Now that he had three holy maids to nurture, there was no need for Lin Yuan to rush things.","Under Autumn’s oversight, a team of seven star pirates, including Fu Mi, would have the capability to capture numerous star pirates in the future.","“Alright, the six of you have been chosen to survive. This is your honor and chance to bid farewell to the dirty group of star pirates. You can pledge your allegiance to me first. When you pledge your allegiance to me, you can say your names.”","The man with long green hair was also the first to release the holy spirit to pledge loyalty to Lin Yuan.","“Lord, my name is Yun Qingyang. I’m from the Cloud Wave Horned Eagle species. From now on, I’m willing to use the abilities of our species and my abilities to serve you wholeheartedly. If you’re interested, I can bring you to the blessed land at any time.”","When the other star pirates who had pledged allegiance to Lin Yuan saw that Yun Qingyang had beaten them to it again, they looked down on him for being a lackey.","The star pirate group led by Yun Qingyang had just been destroyed, yet he had already adopted such behavior. On the other hand, they were secretly blaming themselves for not seizing the opportunity and falling behind.","Lin Yuan looked at the loyal Yun Qingyang kneeling on the ground and smiled. “I can see that you’re very sensible and know how to seize opportunities. You’re a very smart person. In that case, you’ll be Fu Mi’s deputy in charge of the other five from now on!”","Upon hearing that, Yun Qingyang revealed a pleasantly surprised expression. He had just joined Lin Yuan yet he had already become a manager. This was equivalent to being one step ahead of the others.","Having already stood out twice, if he stood out too aggressively again, Lin Yuan’s impression of him might change. There was a limit to everything, and Yun Qingyang was very good at grasping this limit.","Yun Qingyang stood beside Fu Mi and nodded at Fu Mi, who was far weaker than him.","Fu Mi had only been by Lin Yuan’s side for a short while, and Yun Qingyang was slightly stronger than her. Thus, Fu Mi did not put on airs and was very polite to Yun Qingyang.","Lin Yuan had arranged for Yun Qingyang to be his subordinate. Under the condition that Yun Qingyang had no issues, she needed to manage her relationship with Yun Qingyang well. Otherwise, it would indicate her incompetence and a lack of tolerance.","When she had just been chosen by Lin Yuan, there had only been her and Autumn in the entire organization, so Fu Mi had not felt any pressure. However, Fu Mi felt a lot of pressure now. She knew that if she didn’t progress, her current position would eventually be taken over by Yun Qingyang.","As for the other five, they could not pressure Fu Mi whatsoever.","The five of them followed Yun Qingyang and expressed their loyalty to Lin Yuan. All their holy spirits were under Lin Yuan’s control.","Lin Yuan said, “Fu Mi, you’re the leader of this team. Come and tell the new members about the team’s plans from now on!”","Fu Mi knew Lin Yuan was flattering her and establishing her prestige as the leader. She took a step forward and said somberly, “From now on, the seven of us will be partners who need to fight side by side. Our goal is to use our connections to contact and gather those star pirates and get rid of them. I gave our team a name, the Hunting Group. From now on, everyone has to hunt star pirates as their responsibility!”","Fu Mi’s words stunned Yun Qingyang, who was extremely receptive.","Those who could become the backbone of a powerful star pirate group were all old star pirates. It was hard to accept such a change from being the backbone of a star pirate group to the hunter of a star pirate.","Yun Qingyang clearly remembered that Fu Mi had been hunting for experts with her star pirate group not long ago. Evidently, Fu Mi had just joined Lin Yuan, and they were the targets that Fu Mi had hunted with her connections.","Yun Qingyang did not have any sense of belonging to the star pirate industry that he had previously worked in. To him, it was merely a means to acquire resources more conveniently.","Yun Qingyang had already calculated the relationship he had with the star pirates over the years and pondered about which star pirates he could help Lin Yuan gather.","Fu Mi communicated with Yun Qingyang and the others for a long time and carefully detailed the team’s plan.","Lin Yuan had originally planned to bring Huang An, Cen Ruyi, and Xi Mei back to Sky City. Now that he knew about the blessed land, Lin Yuan started to think about exploring it.","Every blessed land had a special fey and many rare spiritual ingredients that belonged to it. However, the resources produced by this blessed land belonged to the blessed land itself. If one could obtain them, it would bring great benefits to a faction.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there was an artifact refined by a high-grade Creator called Palm of Blessed Land, and it could store blessed lands within it.","Lin Yuan possessed the Palm of Blessed Land, acquired from the Fortune Treasure Palace in a previous trade. However, his Palm of Blessed Land was of the lowest tier, crafted by a Grade 4 Creator, capable only of containing low-grade blessed lands.","Should they encounter a mid-grade blessed land, they could only fragment it and gather it using several low-grade Palm of Blessed Lands. Employing such a method, which destroyed a blessed land to collect it, would significantly diminish the value of a mid-grade blessed land.","Having brought in Yi He through the Lifespan Mouse, Lin Yuan received ample resources from him before his departure. Among these were a few higher-level Palm of Blessed Lands, suitable for containing mid-grade blessed lands. However, when faced with high-grade blessed lands, they proved ineffective.","Encountering a high-grade blessed land was not a simple feat. Furthermore, its appearance would trigger numerous phenomena, enough to draw the attention of nearby major factions.","It was likely that the blessed land Yun Qingyang discovered was of low-grade status. Nonetheless, even a low-grade blessed land was a treasure coveted by major factions, beyond their grasp despite their best efforts!","For instance, shortly after the previous Bloodian Queen of the Elisa clan passed away, they stumbled upon a low-grade blessed land. However, they refrained from competing with other factions for it.","Lin Yuan was in a hurry to explore this blessed land because he was afraid that other than Yun Qingyang, there might be others who knew about it and that they would explore it first.","Upon seeing that Fu Mi was almost done, Lin Yuan told Yun Qingyang, “You said that you have information about a blessed land. Why don’t you bring us to the location now?”","Yun Qingyang’s expression changed. Indeed, he was aware of that blessed land, but he had only mentioned half of the story. Now that Lin Yuan wanted to go to this blessed land, Yun Qingyang could not hide it from him.","“Lord, I do know the location of that blessed land, but the situation regarding it is a little special. I...”","Upon seeing Yun Qingyang’s hesitant speech, Lin Yuan furrowed his brow. “As long as you’re not lying to me and know its location, it’s fine. As for the rest, just tell me.”","Yun Qingyang didn’t relax at all. “Lord, the blessed land is in the mountain ravine between the two peaks of Camelback Mountain, which is about two days away from here. I discovered it when I led the star pirates to follow a group of people.","“It’s just that this blessed land has already been occupied by the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers in the north of Camelback Mountain. These tigers have nearly wiped out all the species in Camelback Mountain in fear the news would spread.","“At that time, we were also discovered by an expert of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger. Due to our relatively superior strength, it was not easy for their expert to take us down. Thus, he invited us to enter the blessed land to take a look.","“I figured out that this expert planned to lure us in and kill us, so I pretended to accept and found the opportunity to injure the expert and escape with the star pirates. If you want to explore this blessed land, you have to face the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger head-on.","“The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers in the north of Camelback Mountain are not the main branch in the East Universe, just a side branch. Still, they must have an expert whose strength has surpassed the Holy Spirit level. Otherwise, they wouldn’t be so domineering!”","Yun Qingyang nervously explained the situation to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan couldn’t help but sigh. The appearance of a blessed land should have benefited all lifeforms, but sometimes things didn’t go as planned.","The lifeforms of Camelback Mountain hadn’t even had the chance to benefit from the blessed land before dying because of it. Ultimately, in this world, resources belonged to the capable, and weakness was the original sin, especially in a place like the Sky Beyond the Clouds!","The cruelty of the Sky Beyond the Clouds far exceeded that of the main world. Even lower faeries like Emerald Lady, who had the protection of a powerful faction like the Faerie Institution, would become the target of others.","“It’s fine. Just bring me there. I hope this blessed land hasn’t been developed by the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.”","After saying that, Lin Yuan gestured for Yun Qingyang to lead the way.","Yun Qingyang explained the strength of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger and emphasized that they had experts above the Holy Spirit level.","The three Grade 4 Creators standing behind Lin Yuan should know that the bloodline of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger was extremely powerful and almost every member could fight beyond their level.","Since Lin Yuan did not take the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers seriously and Autumn’s strength was so formidable that even Yun Qingyang couldn’t imagine, it seemed like the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers should not be able to threaten Lin Yuan.","Winter did not let Yun Qingyang lead the way at his own speed. Instead, he let Yun Qingyang point out the direction and quickly led Lin Yuan and the others in the designated direction.","Firstly, Winter was afraid that the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers would extract many resources from the blessed land. Secondly, he did not want Lin Yuan to waste too much time on such a trivial matter.","...","In less than half a day, Lin Yuan saw the entire Camelback Mountain from afar. It was like the back of two camels and looked exceptionally majestic from afar. The aura of the vegetation near Camelback Mountain became denser, and Lin Yuan could hear faint cries.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there were powerful species stationed in mountain ranges or wide rivers. Under normal circumstances, factions that passed by such places would try their best to stay as far away as possible.","“Lord, the blessed land is between these two mountain peaks. If we go any further, we should be able to see the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers stationed there!”","Yun Qingyang was still afraid of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, but when he reminded Lin Yuan, he did not show his fear.","Lin Yuan walked ahead excitedly. It was obvious he did not take the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers seriously.","However, Lin Yuan had never been to a blessed land before and did not understand the situation.","Now, Lin Yuan finally had a chance to see the blessed land. He could also use the Palm of Blessed Land to store and bring it to North of the Lonely River.","As soon as Lin Yuan entered the mountain pass between the two mountain peaks, he saw a tall man with a tiger-shaped mark resembling a king character in Chinese standing on a big tree not far away.","When the tall man saw Lin Yuan, he revealed a playful expression."]},{"number":2987,"title":"Chapter 2987: Pinnacle Low-Grade Blessed Land!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2987: Pinnacle Low-Grade Blessed Land!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Wei Ke was a member of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers’ Guardians. The Guardians were in charge of protecting all the businesses under the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.","Ever since the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers discovered this blessed land on Camelback Mountain a month ago, they had considered it the most important industry and had been thinking about how to develop it.","It was true that blessed land was a huge treasure vault, but developing it also had its own challenges. When necessary, powerful martial force support was needed as the lifeforms bred in the blessed land usually had astonishing combat strength. The special species bred in these blessed lands were like special species specially born to protect the blessed land.","The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers could deal with the species nurtured in this blessed land. However, they did not want to annihilate them as these species were invaluable.","Because his mother’s bloodline was not pure enough, Wei Ke was a descendant of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers and their dependent species. Wei Ke only had 3/4 of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger bloodline, which caused him to be ostracized by the Guardians. Otherwise, Wei Ke would not have been arranged to guard there.","The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers came to Camelback Mountain and started a 10-day massacre. Almost all the lifeforms in Camelback Mountain were wiped out by them.","The people who came in must have come from outside and were not natives of Camelback Mountain. After idling for so long, Wei Ke finally found some enjoyment.","Wei Ke was not in a hurry to attack Lin Yuan. When he saw Yun Qingyang following behind Lin Yuan, his playful expression was tainted with killing intent. “Oh? We meet again. Previously, I kindly invited you to take a seat inside. Why did you run away with the star pirates? Where are the thousand-odd people in your star pirate group? Why did you only bring a few of them?”","Yun Qingyang, Fu Mi, and the others tried their best to restrain their auras beside Lin Yuan. They did not leak out their auras, and Winter also did the same. This made Wei Ke feel no pressure upon seeing Lin Yuan and his group. He merely thought they were all subordinates of Yun Qingyang, the leader of the star pirate group.","While Wei Ke might perceive it that way, Yun Qingyang would never dare to agree directly. He berated loudly, “What nonsense are you talking about? On the way here, I realized that only those lifeforms with no intelligence were left on Camelback Mountain. Where did those original species go?”","Wei Ke exuded a sudden, overpowering aura. “Where did they go? Naturally, they were all eliminated! Otherwise, how could we ensure the news of the blessed land remained undisclosed? Because of you, I faced punishment from my own kind. I should have contacted my companions back then and eradicated your star pirate group. I won’t let you off this time!”","No sooner had Wei Ke’s words echoed than the young man at the forefront of the group spoke coldly. “To safeguard the blessed land from falling into outsider hands, you annihilated thousands of species on Camelback Mountain.","Aren’t you afraid of the repercussions of such ruthlessness?!”","Upon hearing this, Wei Ke’s dominating presence surged even further.","“Repercussions? Who dares seek revenge against our Shadow Teeth Ferocious","Tigers in this domain? Our rule extends over these six mountains, including Camelback Mountain. Perhaps you should reflect on whether your past misdeeds have led you to encounter me today!”","With that, Wei Ke lunged toward Lin Yuan, a massive black tiger shadow looming behind him.","Winter, positioned behind Lin Yuan, refrained from immediate action. He knew Autumn had long desired to impress Lin Yuan, but the right opportunity had never presented itself. This was it.","In the past, Winter wouldn’t have afforded Autumn such deference. However, considering Spring and Summer had been left in Sky City territory while he accompanied Lin Yuan, and Autumn had been dispatched elsewhere, Winter granted Autumn this chance to shine to dispel any lingering doubts.","Before Wei Ke could approach within 100 meters of Lin Yuan, Autumn struck preemptively. Three fallen leaves embedded themselves in Wei Ke’s body, not only immobilizing him and stifling his energy but also hindering his ability to send messages.","After subduing Wei Ke, Autumn asked Lin Yuan, “Young Master, the strength of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers is quite formidable. In terms of bloodline, it is stronger than that of the King Blood Jackals. Do you have any plans to recruit the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers?”","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment and did not make a decision immediately. In terms of bloodline and strength, the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers had indeed reached the standard to be taken in as subordinates. However, they were only suitable to survive in the forest and required a huge territory. North of the Lonely River’s environment was not suitable for the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.","As for the fact that the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers had annihilated thousands of species on Camelback Mountain, Lin Yuan was indeed discontented. However, any other powerful species would most likely make a similar choice to keep the blessed land in their hands and prevent the news from leaking. The Bloodians were far more ruthless than the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.","“Should we recruit the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers and explore the blessed land first? Autumn, help me get some information about the blessed land from him first. Once we have gathered enough information, I’ll leave it to you to take control of the other Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. Gather all the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers and watch over them!”","The fact that Lin Yuan had taken the initiative to assign a mission to him made Autumn very happy. It made him feel valued by Lin Yuan. Autumn especially liked the feeling of being valued by Lin Yuan.","“Young Master, give me a few minutes. I’ll definitely make him spit out all the information he knows. My ability is very suitable for interrogation!”","With that, Autumn walked up to Wei Ke and did not ask for information directly. Instead of directly questioning Wei Ke, Autumn decided to exert some pressure on him to compel him to voluntarily reveal everything he knew.","Wei Ke had already heard what Lin Yuan had said earlier and understood his purpose for coming.","With a wave of Autumn’s hand, more than ten leaves that were different from the fallen leaves from before landed on Wei Ke’s body. These ten leaves did not embed themselves into his body like the previous leaves but entered his body instead. As blood flowed in Wei Ke’s body, the leaves occasionally released a special energy, stimulating his body.","At that moment, Wei Ke, whose movements and speech were sealed, was enduring the torture inflicted by Autumn. In less than two minutes, the way Wei Ke looked at Autumn had completely changed. He looked at Autumn with a pleading expression and fear that came from his soul.","Upon seeing this, Autumn did not stop. Instead, it took another two minutes before he released the restriction on Wei Ke.","Autumn told the exhausted Wei Ke, “I’ll give you five minutes to tell me everything you know. If I find out you’re hiding something, I’ll let you experience what you just felt for 100,000 years!”","In Wei Ke’s eyes, Autumn was a demon. He harbored no doubts that Autumn would truly subject him to such treatment. Wei Ke did not want to experience the feeling again for even a second, even if it meant betraying the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers by revealing the situation of the blessed land.","Wei Ke asked anxiously, “Lord, I will definitely tell you everything I know. But where should I start? Should we talk about the internal situation of our Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers first, or should we only talk about the situation of this blessed land?!”","Although Wei Ke was not pure-blooded, he had a high status among the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers because of his strength. While it was not a lucrative job to guard the door here, it was an important job.","Wei Ke knew a lot of things. However, he feared that if he did not start well, Autumn would think that he was being long-winded and would have opinions about him again and subject him to the torture he had just experienced.","Autumn turned to look at Lin Yuan with an extremely respectful expression. It was obvious that he was waiting for Lin Yuan to take the lead on this idea.","Lin Yuan was not interested in the internal situation of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. “Just tell me about this blessed land.”","Upon hearing this, Wei Ke couldn’t help but feel bitter. While he was well-acquainted with the internal affairs of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, his knowledge of the blessed land was limited.","Stationed there from the outset for surveillance, he gleaned what he could about it during shifts from a few friends. Though usually reliable, he doubted the accuracy of their accounts about the blessed land.","Wei Ke feared misspeaking, especially in front of Autumn, and the potential repercussions it might bring.","The pursuit of the blessed land by these individuals weighed heavily on Wei Ke, surpassing even the pressure from the Elders of his species. The person who subjected himself to such torment with a mere few leaves was likely stronger than the Elders themselves. It seemed inevitable that the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers would struggle to defend the blessed land.","“Lord, I’m a member of the Guardians guarding this place. I don’t know much. However, I promise to tell you everything I know!”","Lin Yuan did not want to make things difficult for Wei Ke. A guard was bound not to know much about the situation. Lin Yuan only needed to understand the situation in the blessed land.","In a while, Lin Yuan would capture the higher-ranking Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers to understand the situation. Now, he wanted to ask Wei Ke first so that Lin Yuan could confirm the authenticity of the information.","“Just tell me what you know. Your species has almost wiped out all the lifeforms on Camelback Mountain. If I find out that your information is fake, not only will I attack you, but I will also destroy your entire species. Only by being obedient will you have a chance to live!”","Lin Yuan’s words made Wei Ke shiver. He did not doubt Lin Yuan’s words at all. This was how the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers treated the other species previously. Only those who were obedient could survive. Those who were disobedient were directly killed by the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.","“Lord, the blessed land has been verified by the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger Elders. It should meet the pinnacle low-grade standard and is almost at mid-grade.","“Originally, we had no intention of exploring this blessed land here. However, due to its high level, our Palm of Blessed Land can’t absorb it. Otherwise, this blessed land would most likely not be here anymore.","“This is because this blessed land is only a step away from mid-grade. Almost all the special feys nurtured inside have reached the Divine Kingdom level and are extremely resistant. We have the intention to take in the special feys produced by these blessed lands. Otherwise, they would likely have been fully exploited by now!”","Wei Ke was extremely angry when he said this. If the Elders did not have any differences because of the distribution of benefits and completed the exploration of the blessed land earlier, he would not have to continue guarding here for more than a month. Naturally, he would not have to suffer the pain just now.","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan grasped the situation of the blessed land.","According to Wei Ke, the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers had yet to develop it. Given the rarity of blessed lands, any species acquiring one would typically exercise extreme caution in its development.","The value of such a land would significantly diminish if its unique features were forcibly eradicated. A low-grade blessed land was already a rare find. Lin Yuan marveled at his luck in stumbling upon a pinnacle low-grade blessed land!","With Yi He’s Palm of Blessed Land, Lin Yuan possessed the means to claim this pinnacle low-grade blessed land.","Wei Ke noted Lin Yuan’s lack of reaction after he finished speaking. He hoped Lin Yuan wasn’t displeased with the information, as it was all he knew.","“Lord, that’s all I know. I know where the Elders are. If you need me to, I can bring you to see them!”","Wei Ke said those words to save his life, but immediately after speaking, he regretted it deeply. Why was he saying all this for no reason? If he brought Lin Yuan and the others to look for the Elders, wouldn’t he become a traitor to the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers?","In his heart, Wei Ke hoped that Lin Yuan would ignore his words and not let him bring him to see the Elders. However, his hopes were dashed.","“Your suggestion is not bad. Bring me to see the Elder in charge of the development!”","After speaking to Wei Ke, Lin Yuan added, “Autumn, when we meet the Elder in charge later, Winter and I will ask this Elder for information. You will directly set off to control the entire species!","“After we understand the situation of the blessed land, we will control the special feys there. We can directly use the Palm of Blessed Land to carry the blessed land and leave Camelback Mountain.. We can decide what to do with the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers before we leave!”"]},{"number":2988,"title":"Chapter 2988 The Path Of Survival!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2988 The Path Of Survival!","....","Autumn said confidently, “Young Master, don’t worry. I will definitely take control of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers in the shortest time possible.”","“We definitely won’t let the other Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers delay you from asking about the situation in the blessed land.”","Wei Ke had always been proud of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers’ strength. But now that he heard Autumn’s words, Wei Ke could not help but feel that the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers were very weak. How did they become manipulated by the other party so casually? This was something that had never happened in their history.","Wei Ke braced himself and led the way, bringing Lin Yuan to the First Elder of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.","The First Elder was the strongest of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. If Lin Yuan could not defeat the First Elder, the species’ crisis would be completely resolved.","If Lin Yuan’s subordinates could easily control the First Elder, the entire species would be defeated by Lin Yuan. It would be up to Lin Yuan to decide whether to kill or torture them.","The First Elder, Wei Xiao, was the strongest expert in the species. Wei Xiao’s strength had broken through not long ago. After that breakthrough, Wei Xiao’s strength was slightly higher than the species leader’s.","Wei Xiao was very smart. In a situation where he could not even defeat a powerful enemy, he would definitely find a way to let the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers gain a foothold.","Along the way, Wei Ke brought Lin Yuan and the others to meet many Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. These individuals clearly treated Lin Yuan and the others as Wei Ke’s prisoners.","From time to time, someone would greet Wei Ke.","Wei Ke felt bitter, but his expression was normal. He did not show any abnormality.","If he was the only one who was not too strong, the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers would have the ability to resist.","Wei Ke would pass on the information even if he had to sacrifice himself.","However, the enemy was too powerful. Resistance was useless. Under such circumstances, Wei Ke had to find a way out for himself.","At this moment, Wei Ke heard a soft voice. “You’re very smart and sensible. If I want to control the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, I can give you a manager position.”","Lin Yuan’s words made Wei Ke feel bitter and happy. It was difficult for Wei Ke to define what kind of feelings he had now.","However, if he could really become the manager of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, it would be a transformation of fate for Wei Ke.","Previously, because of his bloodline, no matter how outstanding Wei Ke’s performance was, it was still difficult for him to obtain room for advancement among the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.","The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers regarded their bloodline as everything. In such a species, every member basically determined their fate from the moment they were born.","“Thank you for your appreciation, Lord. If there’s such a chance, I won’t disappoint you! We’ll reach the command center where the First Elder is in a few minutes. The First Elder likes silence. Apart from the First Elder’s servants and assistants, there shouldn’t be anyone else in the command center! It will be very convenient for you to move around.”","Lin Yuan knew that the First Elder only had a few people by his side because he was extremely confident in his strength.","The First Elder’s habit made it convenient for Lin Yuan to reach his next goal.","A few Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers were standing beside a building made of all kinds of animal bones and ores.","The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers shouted and frowned when they saw Wei Ke.","“Wei Ke, why are you looking for the First Elder at this time? You should be guarding the entrance of Camelback Mountain at this time!”","“If someone enters Camelback Mountain through the entrance at this time and discovers the blessed land, causing losses to our species, a mixed-blood fellow like you will definitely be locked up in the Shadow Eclipse Cave to suffer and be punished!”","Hearing these people publicly insult his bloodline, Wei Ke’s face turned ashen, but he did not retort.","This was because in the eyes of these pure-blooded Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, his bloodline was indeed lowly. His current achievement was already the greatest achievement of a non-pure-blooded member in the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.","In order to prevent these pure-blooded Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers from mocking him and ruining Lin Yuan’s goal, Wei Ke hurriedly said, “I’m here to see the First Elder because I caught the leader of the star pirates who escaped. I think it’s necessary to bring him to the First Elder so he can interrogate him! Let’s see if he has leaked the situation of the blessed land!”","Hearing Wei Ke say this, the guard in the lead said, “Wei Ke, you were just punished because of this, and you actually captured this star pirate group’s leader so quickly! Wei Ke, don’t have any crooked thoughts or try to lie to the First Elder!”","Wei Ke hurriedly said, “How would I dare to do such a thing?! If I do that and the First Elder exposes me, how can I maintain a foothold in the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers in the future?”","The guards looked at each other and said, “I don’t think you would dare to do that. The leader is discussing the mining plan with the First Elder. The leader hates mixed-bloods like you the most. When you go in, you have to pay attention to your words and actions. Don’t make him hate you. Otherwise, no one can save you! Since this group of people are captives, take them in with you.”","When Wei Ke saw that the guards had relented, he hurriedly bowed to them and led Lin Yuan and the others inside.","Wei Ke said as he walked, “We’re really lucky that they didn’t pester us too much. Otherwise, we would have to spend more effort to enter!”","Lin Yuan said with a chuckle, “The bloodline of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers clearly doesn’t have much of an impact on your strength but the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers actually values bloodline as much as a species like the Bloodians!”","Lin Yuan’s words hit a sensitive spot in Wei Ke’s heart.","The bloodline was restricted by countless members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. The male members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers were not as picky as the Bloodians in choosing mates. They would choose pure-blooded female tigers for the purity of their bloodline. They were abnormally promiscuous.","As a result, the number of non-pure-blooded members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers was five times that of pure-blooded members.","It was as if non-pure-blooded members and pure-blooded members belonged to two different species.","These non-pure-blooded members were like the dependent species of pure-blooded members; they were at the mercy of these pure-blooded members. Even though Wei Ke’s strength had already increased to the Holy Spirit Realm, he still could not escape such treatment.","In the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, there was a precedent of being executed for being disrespectful to a pure-blooded member.","Those male tigers would forcefully leave their bloodlines in the species, but they would not nurture non-pure bloodlines.","Wei Ke had grown up with his mother when he was young. It was unknown what he was feeling as he spoke to Lin Yuan, “Lord, if you’re willing to subdue the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers and I’m lucky to be placed in an important position by you, I hope you can give me a chance to depose the vices of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers! The value that those non-pure-blooded members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers can create is actually not inferior to these so-called pure-blooded members at all!”","When Lin Yuan heard Wei Ke’s words, he did not immediately speak. He pondered for a moment before saying to Wei Ke, “The bloodline of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers makes the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers only good at combat. The reason why the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers can be so powerful is indeed related to their combat ability, but it’s not just because of their combat ability.","“The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers and other tiger species or cat species feys are constantly breeding bloodlines. In fact, they are enriching the diversity of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger bloodline. I will neither deny nor support your ideas and plans. This is your own business. As long as you can create value for me, how you manage and modify the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers is your own business.","“The leader and First Elder of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers are here. It will undoubtedly be much more convenient for me to ask for information later. Autumn, you can move now!”","Lin Yuan had already stepped into the tent made of animal bones.","There were only two members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers in the tent. These two members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers sat there with ashen expressions. It was obvious that they were not having a pleasant conversation.","The two Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers shouted at the same time when they saw Lin Yuan, “Who are you? Where did you come from?”","When they saw Wei Ke behind Lin Yuan, their unfriendly gazes landed on him. It was obvious that they wanted Wei Ke to give an explanation.","Wei Ke was obviously very afraid of the First Elder and leader of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. But things had already happened, so Wei Ke made a decision.","Thus, Wei Ke gritted his teeth and ignored the First Elder and the leader. Instead, he introduced them to Lin Yuan, “Lord, the one sitting on the left is the First Elder of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, Wei Xiao. The one sitting on the right is called Wei Ao, the leader of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.”","Wei Ke entered the room and did not explain the situation to Wei Xiao and Wei Ao. Instead, he introduced the situation to Lin Yuan.","This behavior completely angered Wei Xiao, who was the First Elder, and Wei Ao, who was the leader. The two of them released their auras at the same time and prepared to put a stop to this ridiculousness.","However, before their auras could reach Lin Yuan, a few wisps of frost and snow completely blocked their auras.","“How dare you! How dare you be disrespectful towards my Young Master?”","After blocking Wei Xiao and Wei Ao’s auras, the two wisps of frost and snow rushed in front of them. The moment they touched their bodies, Wei Ao and Wei Xiao felt that they were frozen.","Lin Yuan walked forward and answered Wei Ao and Wei Xiao’s question with a smile, “Who am I? I’m the City Lord of Sky City and the person who’s about to take over this low-level blessed land. The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers have eliminated so many species on Camelback Mountain for this blessed land.","“I think it’s only right that I do the same to the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers now! Do you think I should eliminate the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers or give you a way out? With your strength and vision, you should be able to tell that my ability to eliminate the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers is definitely not just for show!”","Wei Ao and Wei Xiao were the leader and the elder of the species. They had always been very clear and aware about things.","From Winter’s strength, the two of them could confirm that Lin Yuan was telling the truth!","The other party had defeated the two of them with this move alone. The two of them did not even have the chance to resist.","The two of them were the strongest people in the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. If the old man who could easily suppress them wanted to kill the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, it would be as easy as drinking water.","It was obvious why Wei Ke was here. The most reasonable reason for Wei Ke’s appearance here was that he was controlled by this group of people and had already submitted to their strength.","As the leader of the species, be it for the development of the species or for his own selfish reasons, he definitely did not want the species to be extinct.","As the leader, Wei Ao was the first to speak, “Lord, I hope you can give the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers a way out. Although the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers’ strength is inferior to yours, we can still help you share the burden a lot of the time! We are willing to offer our loyalty to you! Not only can I give you everything I obtained in the blessed land, but I can also give you the resources the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers obtained over the years!”","As the leader, Wei Ao made the most correct decision.","Lin Yuan looked at Wei Ao in admiration. The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers were powerful. Although they were ruthless and could exterminate other species, it was a manifestation of their strength.","Now, in the face of a powerful enemy, the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers could adapt to the situation and retreat bravely. This was the situation of the leader, Wei Ao. As the saying went, he who understood the times was a wise man. Under the survival of the jungle laws, Wei Ao was undoubtedly qualified to be the leader. This was because Wei Ao was really leading the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers to try their best to survive without caring about the immediate benefits.","On the other hand, the strongest person in the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers that Wei Ke mentioned, the First Elder Wei Xiao, roared angrily after hearing Wei Ao’s words, “Wei Ao, you are the biggest traitor of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers! As the leader, not only are you leading the species into submission but you also easily promised away the resources that we painstakingly collected over the years.","“Where are you going to take the species from now on? As the First Elder, I disagree with your decision! If you hadn’t advocated the slow development of this blessed land, the development of this blessed land would have already reached the final stage. I...”","Wei Ao’s expression remained unchanged as he listened to Wei Xiao’s accusation.","Wei Ao had always felt that Wei Xiao was capable but short-sighted. Wei Xiao seemed to be saying that if he had listened to his previous suggestion, he would not be encountering the current calamity!","Even if he listened to Wei Xiao’s suggestion and stopped caring about the special feys nurtured in the blessed land, he couldn’t complete the development of the blessed land now!","Furthermore, the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers did not control a blessed land with a sufficiently high grade.","If there was no way to take this low-level peak blessed land, they would definitely send the experts of the species to guard it. At that time, others would still be able to come after the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.","The powerful side controlled the fate of the weak. There was no need to lie."]},{"number":2989,"title":"Chapter 2989 Treasure and Auspiciousness!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2989 Treasure and Auspiciousness!","....","Wei Xiao would definitely pay the price for his words just now.","Just as Wei Ao had expected, a youthful voice sounded in his ears.","The emotions in this voice did not fluctuate because of Wei Xiao’s words just now but they directly decided Wei Xiao’s fate.","“Since the First Elder of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers has so many traitors and can’t be used by me, you can get rid of this First Elder! Before I get rid of him, I’ll be able to see if his holy spirit can create value for me!”","After hearing Wei Xiao’s words, Lin Yuan knew that Wei Xiao was not easy to control. If he wanted to control Wei Xiao, he would have to give him a lot of promises in order to change Wei Xiao’s mind.","The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers were not important to Lin Yuan and they were not worth his effort.","The leader of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers and the First Elder were in disagreement. Leaving two people behind was not beneficial to the internal management of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. Only by getting rid of one could there be only one voice among the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.","Although Wei Ao was not as strong as Wei Xiao who was the First Elder, he was obedient.","Winter liked Lin Yuan’s decisiveness in killing. He should cut the Gordian knot for such a small issue.","The chill that Winter had just projected into Wei Xiao’s body suddenly exploded. This chill froze Wei Xiao’s divine kingdom until it cracked and the fountain of faith stopped flowing. Wei Xiao’s holy spirit was covered in frost and was forced out of his body.","Lin Yuan used True Data to investigate the holy spirit. It was a dual type holy spirit of dark and shadow type.","Shadow type was a variant of dark type, just like the relationship between sand type and earth type.","Wei Xiao’s holy spirit could transform other elemental energy into dark energy for its use. It also bred shadows in the darkness to block the perception of other living beings.","This ability to turn other types into dark type could target other creatures with dark type. The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen should be very interested in Wei Xiao’s holy spirit.","Wei Xiao’s holy spirit could be considered the best holy spirit Lin Yuan had encountered ever since he formed the intention of allowing the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to refine holy spirits.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen’s voice sounded in Lin Yuan’s mind, “I like Wei Xiao’s holy spirit very much. It will be worth investing resources to nurture and refine it into a holy maid! Furthermore, the strength of his holy spirit is very high. The combat strength of the converted holy maid will also be strong!”","Lin Yuan released the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen, who had appeared in front of Lin Yuan, spun her skirt happily. Threads intermediately coiled around the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen and shot into Wei Xiao’s holy spirit’s body.","These threads ignored the resistance of Wei Xiao’s holy spirit and wrapped around it layer by layer.","The transformed holy spirit was screaming non-stop, and Wei Xiao’s body reacted accordingly.","This scene deeply shocked Wei Ke and Wei Ao, filling their hearts with a sense of horror and fear.","In Wei Ke’s eyes, Wei Xiao was the strongest expert of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers and their god of war. However, the strongest expert of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers had become a lamb waiting to be slaughtered by Lin Yuan. He did not even have the slightest ability to resist!","To Wei Ao, Wei Xiao was both his old partner and competitor.","Wei Xiao was not as strong as Wei Ao at the beginning, but he was more talented than Wei Ao.","Coupled with the fact that Wei Xiao had obtained some opportunities earlier, Wei Ao became even more afraid of Wei Xiao.","After Wei Xiao’s strength broke through, Wei Xiao’s right to speak in the clan had already advanced beyond his position as the species leader. Wei Ao had no choice but to compromise with Wei Xiao on many things regarding the development of the blessed land.","Before Lin Yuan came in, Wei Ao had no choice but to agree to accelerate the development plan because of the pressure exerted by Wei Xiao. Now, this threat had died in front of him, and even the holy spirit had become a tool for others. Wei Ao could not help but sigh. It also made Wei Ao understand that the young man in front of him was someone that the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers could not disobey.","Just as Wei Ao was thinking, Wei Ao saw that the young man who had dealt with Wei Xiao in a joking manner was looking up at him. This made Wei Ao subconsciously avoid eye contact with the young man in front of him and lower his head.","Lin Yuan replied with a smile, “I heard from Wei Ke that your name is Wei Ao. There’s no need for you to be so afraid of me. As long as you lead the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers in working for me, not only will the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers be able to survive but they will also obtain more opportunities!","“The First Elder of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers is no longer under your control. It’s more convenient for you to maintain your authority in the species if I get rid of him. I don’t think you’ll disappoint me. You can manage the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers for me, right?”","Wei Ao was a little agitated by Lin Yuan’s words, especially when Lin Yuan said that he would manage the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers for him.","Lin Yuan’s words meant that the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers had completely become his property.","However, Wei Ao was helpless. Surrendering to such a group of powerful fellows was the only choice. Otherwise, the only outcome awaiting him was death.","“Lord, don’t worry. I will definitely control the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers well for you and lead them in carrying out your orders! The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger Clan will not do anything that you don’t allow them to do! I’m willing to swear on my holy spirit for you, Lord!”","As he spoke, Wei Ao released his holy spirit. When he released his holy spirit, he was afraid that Lin Yuan would take a fancy to it and choose to kill him. Like Wei Xiao, he was not an irreplaceable existence. As long as Lin Yuan wanted to, he could promote any member of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers to become the leader.","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with Wei Ao’s behavior.","“Wei Ao, you and the First Elder I killed have always been working together to manage the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. It’s inevitable that you’ll be too tired to manage the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers alone now. I think it’s better to arrange for someone to help you!”","Wei Ao understood what Lin Yuan meant. Lin Yuan was worried about him managing the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers alone and wanted to arrange for someone to monitor him.","“Lord, it will indeed be quite stressful for me to manage the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers myself. Do you have anyone suitable to help me manage the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers?”","Lin Yuan pointed in Wei Ke’s direction.","“I think Wei Ke is not bad. Although Wei Ke is not pure-blooded and his bloodline does not meet the requirements of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers for high-ranking positions, a species can’t improve if they fixate on bloodline. They should care more about the strength of their members and their ability to deal with things. I believe that someone as smart as you will definitely understand what I mean!”","Wei Ke’s entire body tensed up at Lin Yuan’s sudden call.","When he heard that Lin Yuan was really going to support him to become the manager of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers and enable him to manage the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers along with Wei Ao, an indescribable joy appeared in Wei Ke’s heart.","When Wei Ke heard Lin Yuan mention his bloodline, he could not help but feel touched.","Previously, Lin Yuan clearly did not know about the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers’ situation. After he explained the internal bloodline situation of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, Lin Yuan wanted to change the influence of the bloodline on the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.","This gave those members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers who did not have pure bloodlines but were extremely outstanding a chance to stand out! After he became the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger’s manager, Wei Ke would vigorously push forward Lin Yuan’s decision to eliminate the species’ bloodline discrimination.","Before Wei Ao could speak, Wei Ke had already knelt in front of Lin Yuan.","“Lord, thank you for giving me this opportunity. I definitely won’t disappoint you! If I do anything wrong in the future, I’m willing to lay down my head in front of you!”","Lin Yuan nodded at Wei Ke. Lin Yuan had given such an important opportunity to Wei Ke. If Wei Ke did not seize this opportunity, Lin Yuan would definitely not give him a second chance. If Wei Ke did not do well, Lin Yuan would not give him a chance. Instead, he would directly replace him.","Wei Ao had already submitted to Lin Yuan. But after hearing Lin Yuan’s suggestion, Wei Ke could not help but look conflicted.","The leader Wei Ao, was a firm supporter of the bloodline-based system. He had never used a non-pure-blooded member of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.","Wei Ke, a non-pure-blooded member of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, was able to join the guards because of his own talent and the fact that his father was a council member of the elders.","If they placed emphasis on those non-pure-blooded Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, the status of the pure-blooded Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers would be severely affected.","If this continued for a long time, the people in power in the species would most likely become non-pure-blooded Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.","For example, Wei Ke, a non-pure Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger, had gained equal footing with him because of Lin Yuan’s support.","When Lin Yuan saw that Wei Ao did not immediately respond to him, he did not make things difficult for him. Ideas needed time to slowly change. Lin Yuan had already informed Wei Ao of his decision. After Wei Ao digested it, he would naturally carry out his suggestion.","“Wei Ao, you can discuss the details with Wei Ke. Remember to submit a plan to me after you’re done. Now it’s your turn to talk about the situation of this blessed land!”","Wei Ao heaved a sigh of relief. He knew that he would have to give Lin Yuan an answer sooner or later but he could not change his mind now.","Wei Ao needed to digest Lin Yuan’s suggestion and mentally prepare himself. Once this change was implemented, the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers would definitely be shocked!","“The special feys in the blessed land have been preventing the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers from exploiting the resources. As a result, for nearly a month, the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers have only managed to mine the resources in the periphery of the blessed land. Wei Xiao came to me because he hoped that I could agree with his goal of destroying and developing the blessed land.”","Lin Yuan frowned slightly.","“Why are the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers trying to destroy the blessed land? f we take more time to develop, this blessed land will be developed sooner or later. Why do we have to use such a destructive method to develop it? This will cause the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers to lose a lot of resources.","“As far as I know, those special creatures that were nurtured in the land can be sold for a high price. The Creation Conference is about to begin. There’s no reason for you to waste the resources you have! The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers occupy the mountain here as kings. You shouldn’t need to worry about safety.”","Wei Xiao’s suggestion had nothing to do with safety and Lin Yuan was right.","Before meeting Lin Yuan’s group, the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers did not feel that any nearby species could pose a threat to them!","The reason why Wei Ao and Wei Xiao were in a hurry to develop this blessed land was because the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers had a secret.","Now that the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers had become Lin Yuan’s prisoners, there was naturally no need to guard their secrets.","“Lord, the reason why the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers want to mine the blessed land quickly is because we obtained some information. There’s a change in the direction of Coiling Dragon Mountain. Either an auspicious sign of heaven and earth has descended, or a mid-grade blessed land is about to appear on Coiling Dragon Mountain!","“The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers has the intention to fight for it. The resources produced in mid-level blessed lands are much more precious than those produced in low-level blessed lands. The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers are also preparing for the upcoming Creation Conference.”","Lin Yuan pursed his lips. If the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers did not hesitate to use violence to develop this low-level blessed land and head in the direction of Coiling Dragon Mountain, the accuracy of the information must be very high!","Lin Yuan was very interested in both the auspicious and mid-grade blessed lands. It seemed that after taking over this low-grade blessed land, he would have to make a trip to Coiling Dragon Mountain to see what caused the heaven and earth to change!","“The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers should have already investigated Coiling Dragon Mountain. Otherwise, you wouldn’t have made such a decision. I’m very curious about the situation at Coiling Dragon Mountain.”","Wei Ao said without hiding anything, “Lord, many species have gathered at Coiling Dragon Mountain! There’s a point at the center of the phenomenon on the Coiling Dragon Mountain. This point prevents outsiders from entering! Therefore, no one knows what has appeared in the central area of Coiling Dragon Mountain.","“However, no faction would want to miss such a phenomenon. The abnormality formed by Coiling Dragon Mountain is even greater than the phenomenon that took place when this low-level blessed land was born.","“Lord, if you’re interested in the phenomenon at the Coiling Dragon Mountain, I can lead you there! Lord, if you’re interested in the phenomenon at the Coiling Dragon Mountain, I can lead you there! If not for the fact that this low-level blessed land has not been explored for a long time, the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers would have moved towards Coiling Dragon Mountain!”","Lin Yuan turned to look at Winter when he heard Wei Ke’s words.","“Winter, help me to control the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers with the Faith Tree. Go to the Coiling Dragon Mountain first. Firstly, we have to explore the situation at Coiling Dragon Mountain. Secondly, if the treasure happens to appear, we can keep it in our hands!”","Winter answered, “Young Master, the phenomenon is most likely related to the blessed land and that restriction is very likely related to auspicious signs. There won’t be any restrictions in the blessed land. It’s not rare for auspicious signs to appear along with a blessed land. If an auspicious sign really descends, I’ll have to trouble you to make a trip personally!”"]},{"number":2990,"title":"Chapter 2990: The Lonely River’s Blessed Land Plan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2990: The Lonely River’s Blessed Land Plan!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Winter had lived for so many years and was already a transcendent existence in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. He knew many more things than Wei Ao, the leader of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. Winter could make good judgments based on his own experience.","Lin Yuan looked at Winter in confusion. He did not know why Winter wanted him to make this trip.","Winter hurriedly explained when he saw Lin Yuan’s puzzled gaze, “Young","Master, even if you don’t come, I can guarantee that no one will develop the blessed land or snatch it away. The auspicious blessing of heaven and earth will be accompanied by a blessing. The blessing of heaven and earth has a huge effect on strengthening one’s physique. Your body composition has only been activated for a short period. This blessing is equally effective on you.","“Furthermore, the auspicious signs of heaven and earth can only be subdued when it’s just born. It can only be subdued during that short ten minutes of consciousness chaos. Once we miss this chance, we can only imprison and kill the auspicious signs of heaven and earth. The auspicious signs of heaven and earth can’t be willingly controlled by others!”","Lin Yuan’s expression changed.","The auspicious blessings of heaven and earth could strengthen one’s body composition and they were indeed very useful to Lin Yuan.","Moreover, Lin Yuan was also very interested in the auspicious signs of heaven and earth.","Heaven and earth auspicious feys were born from heaven and earth spirit qi. Back in the main world, Lin Yuan had obtained a Brocade Embroidered Fortuitous Dragon’s dragon pearl.","The Brocade Embroidered Fortuitous Dragon was also a lifeform born with an auspicious aura.","However, the auspiciousness of the world was fundamentally different from the auspiciousness of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","The main world was only a level-one world at that time, which was far lower than the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Wei Ao did not expect that the expert beside Lin Yuan would be able to deduce the possibility with just this bit of information.","Wei Ao had heard of the auspiciousness of heaven and earth. The value of the auspiciousness of heaven and earth was far higher than that of a mid-grade blessed land.","The heavenly auspicious contract was a blood contract. As long as the contractor’s blood was combined with heavenly auspicious, it would be enough. The strengthening of the body composition was essentially nourished by the auspicious aura. Even non-spirit contractors could contract the auspicious signs of heaven and earth.","Heaven and earth auspicious signs had extremely high growth potential and they also came with special abilities.","These abilities often complemented blessed lands and could benefit one party.","However, if an auspicious sign of heaven and earth was born in a blessed land, it would be very difficult to find this auspicious sign in ten minutes after breaking the restriction.","A special fey born in this blessed land would stop the invaders of the blessed land.","Moreover, the area of a mid-grade blessed land was too large. Even if the aura of the blessed land did not cover the auspicious aura of heaven and earth, it was no different from finding a needle in a haystack!","Wei Ao knew very well that he did not have the ability to participate in the exploration of this mid-grade blessed land. All he could do was lead the way.","“Lord, I’ll gather the members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers and send them to join you!”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “When I first entered this tent, all the members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers were already under my control. You only need to command them to contribute their faith to my Faith Tree.”","Lin Yuan summoned the Faith Tree outside the tent.","The Tree of Faith, which was originally only dozens of meters tall, was now about 10,000 meters tall. It was filled with fruits.","Wei Ao was speechless when he saw Lin Yuan’s Faith Tree. How many species did Lin Yuan control with this Faith Tree to make it so prosperous?","Autumn moved extremely quickly. Whether it was the pure-blooded Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers or the members with the bloodline of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, they were all gathered outside the tent, waiting for Lin Yuan to walk out and deal with them.","These members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers were all in deep fear.","Being captured in their own territory, these members of the Shadow Teeth","Ferocious Tigers thought of how they had killed and plundered other species.","Wei Ao looked at the members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers kneeling on the ground in front of him and sighed, “The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers will relv on this Lord in front of us in the future and become his deDendent species. If you want to continue being members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, you will contribute your fountain of faith to this Faith Tree and swear your loyalty! Those who don’t want to give their loyalty will be personally removed by me!","The members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers were not fools. They knew why Wei Ao, the species leader, was saying such words.","It was obvious that Wei Ao was already under the control of the young man in front of him.","Not only did this young man want to seize the blessed land, but he also wanted to control all the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. Under such circumstances, those who were unwilling to cooperate naturally had to be eliminated!","Those who were smart had already begun to declare their loyalty to the Faith Tree, but it was inevitable that there were some stupid fellows in this large species. For example, the First Elder of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, Wei Xiao, was not smart at all. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would not have told Winter to get rid of Wei Xiao.","Wei Ao was a man of his word. He endured the pain and killed a few fellows who were unwilling to submit.","After Wei Ao eliminated a portion of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, those who were also unwilling to submit hurriedly put away their thoughts.","Lin Yuan realized that there were not many pure-blooded members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. They only accounted for one-seventh of the total population or even less.","Most of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers were non-pure-blooded members like Wei Ke. No wonder Wei Ao wanted to protect the interests of the pure-blooded Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.","Once the status of these non-pure-blooded members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers was raised, the strength of the pure-blooded Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers would decrease due to the number of people.","The two of them competed fairly against the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, which was the weaker side.","The operation of a species, especially when the species was already controlled by others, did not hinge on combat ability!","Lin Yuan intended to elevate the status of non-pure-blooded Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers but he would not completely abandon the benefits of pure-blooded Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. Lin Yuan would let the pure-blooded Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger and the non-pure-blooded Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers keep each other in check.","After all the members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger Clan had pledged their allegiance, Wei Ao walked forward and spoke to Lin Yuan very seriously, “Lord, you’ve already met all the members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. Now, our entire clan has more than 87,000 people and there are less than 12,000 pure-blooded Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. Do you want to consider the living environment of the pure-blooded Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers? If...’","Lin Yuan knew what Wei Ao meant. It could be said that Wei Ao was thinking the same thing as Lin Yuan.","“I know your concerns. I didn’t ask you to change the internal system of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers at once. I can give you 50 years to make a smooth transition. I believe that if you work hard with Wei Ke on this matter, you can balance the pure-blooded and non-pure-blooded forces in the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. This is more beneficial to the development of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers!","“We will take over this pinnacle low-grade blessed land. Lead the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers back to your original territory to organize the resources and take everything you can. We’ll meet back here in a month.”","Wei Ao knew that Lin Yuan was preparing to migrate the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. The Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers’ development here had basically reached its limit due to the influence of resources and the environment. To the current Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, migrating was not necessarily a bad thing!","“Lord, in a month, I will naturally lead the entire Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger Clan to standby here. Since you’ve chosen Wei Ke, I’ll communicate with him more and ask for his opinion.”","With that, Wei Ao led Wei Ke and the members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger Clan out of Camelback Mountain.","Lin Yuan had considered the issue of relocating the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers carefully. If the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers stayed on Camelback Mountain, they would be out of Lin Yuan’s control.","Lin Yuan’s faction was currently in the North of the Lonely River so it was inevitable that there would be problems with the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers if they remained outside. If the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers were in danger, Lin Yuan would not be able to help.","Although the territory of the King Blood Jackals’ territory in North of the Lonely River was not suitable for the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers, the territory of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants had already been vacated. The territory of the Titan Rhinoceros Elephants still had the residual energy of the Cleansing Breath Soil. It was far better than the current territory environment of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tiger Clan!","Apart from the environment, North of the Lonely River was also barren because there were not many powerful species there. Lin Yuan’s establishment was all over the North of the Lonely River, and he was integrating the living beings there to form a faith country.","Lin Yuan’s development was now bound to North of the Lonely River.","Lin Yuan had already obtained a pinnacle low-grade blessed land. If he could obtain a Class 2 blessed land, he could rely on this blessed land to improve the environment.","He wanted to turn North of the Lonely River into a land of true fertility!","Apart from that, Lin Yuan chose to control the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers because outstanding members of the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers could enrich Genius’ cats. In the future, for a long time, the expansion of Genius’ cats could be chosen from the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers.","Lin Yuan took out the Palm of Blessed Land that Yi He had given him and prepared to try to subdue this pinnacle low-grade blessed land.","Winter explained to Lin Yuan how to use the Palm of Blessed Land, “Young Master, before using the Palm of Blessed Land, you need to mark it with spiritual energy. Once it’s marked, it will be bound to you. No one else can use it. It’s just that it consumes too much spiritual energy to load a blessed land through the Palm of Blessed Land.","“I’m a little worried that every time you use each, it will overdraft your spiritual energy. Even this Palm of Blessed Land that stores the low-grade blessed land will only be used by experts at pinnacle Holy Spirit level.”","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment before handing the Palm of Blessed Land to Winter.","“In that case, I’ll have to trouble you to help me load this low-grade blessed land through the Palm of Blessed Land! With your strength, it should be very easy for you to release the blessed land.”","Winter was slightly stunned but he did not say anything. Instead, he took the Palm of Blessed Land from Lin Yuan and moved to help Lin Yuan collect this pinnacle low-grade blessed land.","Winter felt that there was really no need to be overly courteous towards Lin Yuan. Lin Yuan asking him to take the blessed land meant that Lin Yuan trusted him very much. Winter enjoyed and cherished the feeling of being trusted by Lin Yuan.","When Autumn saw that Lin Yuan had given Palm of Blessed Land to Winter, he felt a little upset and lowered his head slightly.","Upon seeing this, Lin Yuan knew that Autumn’s sensitive mind was overthinking again!","Lin Yuan said in an extremely serious tone, “Autumn, you brought Fu Mi, Yun Qingyang, and the others out to hunt star pirates. It’s very tiring for you to help me out. The star pirates you are hunting are related to the improvement of my sacred source lifeform, the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen. “You’re the best at fighting. I’m really worried about leaving it to others!”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, his disappointment was swept away, and he was in a state of high spirits!","When Fu Mi, Yun Qingyang, and the other star pirates saw this, they could not help but wonder what Lin Yuan had done to make his subordinates so loyal!","There was no need to control the special feys born in the blessed land through the Palm of Blessed Land. The interior of the Palm of Blessed Land was equivalent to a self-contained space that could absorb heaven and earth.","Winter quickly completed his control of the Palm of Blessed Land.","Lin Yuan said to Fu Mi, Yun Qingyang, and the others, “You guys can leave this place first and return to Treasure City. You don’t have to take action for the time being. It won’t be too late to take action after Autumn returns!”","Lin Yuan was prepared to bring Autumn and Winter to Coiling Dragon Mountain. With so many species gathered there, the competition would definitely be intense.","Apart from competing with these species, Lin Yuan also had to find auspicious signs and contract them.","One more person was equivalent to an additional layer of protection!","Lin Yuan brought Autumn and Winter to Coiling Dragon Mountain based on the map given by Wei Ao.","As the leader of the hunting team, Fu Mi gave the order, “You’ve just joined the hunting team and are under the Lord’s command. I think your emotions are still fluctuating. When we return to Treasure City, we’ll rest for a while. Think about which star pirates we can contact!”","Fu Mi had just betrayed the star pirates and joined Lin Yuan so she was extremely emotional.","Fu Mi felt that these people’s situation should be similar to hers.","However, Fu Mi’s mentality changed after she received Lin Yuan’s reward.","Fu Mi could clearly feel that following Lin Yuan was more promising, and Yun Qingyang and the others would soon have the same thoughts as her.","On the way back to Treasure City, Yun Qingyang went to Fu Mi and asked softly, “Fu Mi, you haven’t been under the Lord’s command for long, right? We will work under the Lord in the future. I wonder if you can tell me about his personality and habits? It will also make it easier for me to interact with him in the future!”","Fu Mi glanced at Yun Qingyang and once again felt that Yun Qingyang was smart enough to know to invest effort into Lin Yuan!","However, sometimes, intelligent people were misled. It was not a good thing to be too smart.","Intelligence might even cause more serious consequences than being stupid. Especially when this smart person was already controlled by someone!"]},{"number":2991,"title":"Chapter 2991: Are You Still Going to Fight?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2991: Are You Still Going to Fight?","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Yun Qingyang, we can be considered old acquaintances. Previously, you secretly poached me, hoping I could join your star pirate group and cooperate with you, but I rejected you. It’s fate that we’re working under Lord Lin Yuan now. That’s why I’m reminding you not to try and guess his thoughts too much.","“I don’t know Lord Lin Yuan’s personality and habits, but judging from the resources he gave me, he’s a person who trusts and is very generous to his subordinates. You just need to know this and work hard for him!","“We won’t have many opportunities to interact with Lord Lin Yuan daily. It will always be Lord Autumn!","“Lord Autumn has a cold personality and is not easy to get along with. If you make wild guesses about his personality and habits, don’t blame me for not reminding you when she gets rid of you!”","Fu Mi was not a good person. As a star pirate, she was ruthless most of the time.","The reason she reminded Yun Qingyang was that they were old acquaintances!","Compared to a deputy she was not familiar with, Fu Mi preferred to work with familiar people. This way, she could reduce the possibility of mistakes. Fu Mi said so much to Yun Qingyang because he hoped she could keep Yun Qingyang as her assistant.","Seeing that Yun Qingyang’s expression had turned solemn because of her words, Fu Mi knew that he had listened to what she said.","As for what Yun Qingyang would do in the future, that was his own business.","At this moment, Fu Mi heard Yun Qingyang say very seriously, “Fu Mi, I’m very grateful you’re willing to tell me this. From now on, I’ll support you in managing this hunting team.","“Over the years, I’ve met many high-ranking members of the star pirates. I can invite more than 15 groups of star pirates. When Lord Autumn is done with his business with Lord Lin Yuan and returns to Treasure City, I will inform you.","Before that, I’ll let you know you first. Let’s study it together.”","Fu Mi lowered her eyes and looked at Yun Qingyang. The way she looked at him was completely different from before.","These were Yun Qingyang’s resources. Logically speaking, Yun Qingyang did not need to tell her about these resources.","Yun Qingyang’s actions were equivalent to telling her he could work with her as a deputy in the future.","“Alright, I’ll come with you to give advice! You used to be the leader of a star pirate group, so you have more experience managing a team than me. I have many things to learn from you in the future!”","Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang reached a consensus. With Fu Mi as the leader and Yun Qingyang as support, no matter how many star pirates joined them in the future, both sides would become close partners!","Lin Yuan did not know what Fu Mi and Yun Qingyang were thinking. Even if he knew, he would not feel anything else.","As star pirates, no matter what environment they were in, they would do their best to protect their interests. There was nothing wrong with this behavior. As long as Fu Mi could help him hunt more star pirates, Lin Yuan would turn a","blind eye to it as long as it did not affect his interests.","In terms of loyalty, Lin Yuan controlled their holy spirits, so everyone was trustworthy.","Camelback Mountain was already extremely tall. But compared to Coiling Dragon Mountain, Camelback Mountain was nothing.","Lin Yuan was on the outskirts of Coiling Dragon Mountain, and there were already many factions guarding it.","Lin Yuan saw these factions rushing toward him after noticing him.","“Did the three of you come here to snatch the treasure after hearing the news?”","When this person spoke to Lin Yuan and the others, his tone was filled with disdain.","Lin Yuan was not surprised that these people had such feelings toward him. Lin Yuan had asked Winter and Autumn to suppress their auras to the level of the Holy Spirit level. Such strength was not enough there.","Most importantly, there were only three people in Lin Yuan’s group, unlike the thousands of people from the other factions who had rushed here in groups.","Lin Yuan looked at the red-haired woman with red scales on her face and said,","“The three of us did hear the news and wanted to come here to watch the show.","How is the situation on Coiling Dragon Mountain?”","At that moment, Lin Yuan was like an ignorant youth asking the woman for directions.","The woman looked at the factions about to surround them and said playfully, “Little brother, I can tell that you’re very young. It’s normal for young people to be a little curious. However, the two guards beside you need to remind you that you can’t just join in any commotion.","“Little brother, you’ve become a fat piece of meat in the eyes of all the factions here. Hand over your storage equipment and join our team. I can guarantee your survival. Otherwise, with so many forces here, you’ll probably end up plundered!”","Lin Yuan could already tell why so many factions were waiting at the entrance of Coiling Dragon Mountain.","None of the forces present could compare to the Shadow Teeth Ferocious Tigers. They couldn’t explore blessed lands or compete for the auspicious signs of heaven and earth.","These factions were not there for those purposes. Instead, they were here to plunder the weak passing factions. What a good plan!","He had already become the target of these people.","The fact that these people could stay here so peacefully meant that the restriction had not been broken and the blessed land and the auspicious signs of heaven and earth had not appeared.","Even so, Lin Yuan could not be bothered to waste too much time here.","“I’m not interested in joining your faction. I don’t need your protection, nor will I give you my storage equipment. If any faction treats us as fat meat and wants to attack us, this faction will have to bear the consequences!”","When the red-haired woman heard those words. she looked surprised.","In the red-haired woman’s eyes, Lin Yuan was like a little idiot. She wondered what kind of elder had taught him to be so stubborn at a time like that. However, although the little fellow in front of her was pitifully stupid, his appearance was handsome and his aura was unmatched!","This red-haired woman had many crooked thoughts about Lin Yuan.","At this moment, a stern voice shouted, “Lizzie, do you think we’re all dust? Just now, the Red Horn Snakes plundered a few groups. Why are you starting up again? The Red Horn Snakes don’t take us seriously. Aren’t you afraid of becoming public enemies?","“This group of people should be robbed by us! If the Red Horn Snakes are so greedy, we won’t give you respect anymore!”","Lizzie realized that many teams were looking at her with hostile expressions. She knew that she had to take a step back now.","The Red Horn Snakes she led had indeed occupied a huge advantage. If she insisted on taking control of this group, they would probably incur the wrath of everyone.","Lizzie looked deeply at Lin Yuan and sighed inwardly. She was really not fated with this handsome young man! Not only could she not plunder Lin Yuan’s group but also could not protect them.","Lizzie took a deep breath and said coldly, “I have always been reasonable. When it’s your turn to plunder, just do it. Have we robbed this group of people?","Haman, you have to be reasonable! Or don’t blame me for falling out with you!”","Lizzie retreated to the side and told Lin Yuan in a regretful tone, “If you join in such a commotion again in you next life, you must ensure that you have enough strength!”","Lizzie knew very well what kind of treatment Lin Yuan and the others would receive after being plundered. Numerous corpses had accumulated below—these corpses came from the weak teams that had been plundered. Those who did not have the strength would only die there. They did not even have the qualifications to join in the fun and plunder others!","Lin Yuan ignored Lizzie and said loudly, “Are you still planning to attack us? If you attack me, I won’t hold back!”","Lin Yuan’s words made the surrounding people burst into laughter. They couldn’t help but wonder if this youth with outstanding looks was a fool.","The man called Haman laughed and said, “It’s our turn now. Leave these idiots to me!”","Haman looked at Lin Yuan viciously.","“That’s right, we’re going to attack you! Not only will I attack, you but I’ll also plunder your resources and break your necks inch by inch! I’ve never seen someone as ignorant as you!”","After saying that, Haman threw a punch at Lin Yuan. He was prepared to let Lin Yuan and the others know how powerful he was before forcing them to hand over their resources obediently.","After plundering this group, it would probably be a long time before it was their turn again.","Haman wanted to take advantage of this time to find some fun for himself.","Lin Yuan frowned and said, “Autumn, come and get rid of the people who are plundering here. It’s a good opportunity to see if they have any holy spirits that","I like. These people doing this here are no different from star pirates.”","Autumn could not stand these people anymore. Previously, Lin Yuan had not asked him to attack them, so he could only endure all of this.","Now that Lin Yuan had spoken, Autumn’s fingertip shot out tens of thousands of leaves.","The aura contained in these leaves formed a prison that controlled everyone present.","Autumn did not give these people a chance to speak at all. He used the energy in the leaves to draw out the holy spirit in their bodies.","Those who were not Holy Spirit experts were directly cleaned up by Autumn. Their corpses were stored in the fey storage box.","These individuals were looting the area. The spatial equipment worn by the corpses likely contained numerous resources.","Once the situation concluded, someone would naturally tidy up these supplies.","Winter explained earnestly, “Young Master, the Sky Beyond the Clouds differs greatly from the Class 2 world you previously inhabited. Such occurrences are commonplace here. Had we not possessed ample strength, we might have succumbed to torture from the opposing party. The competition within is even fiercer!","“Those lacking sufficient strength who enter the competitive arena are swiftly eliminated without explanation! There’s no room for leniency within.","“Observing the restriction, it appears that its effect is diminishing. In a matter of days, it will vanish entirely. I propose we preemptively clean the interior of Coiling Dragon Mountain. Failure to do so may result in someone impeding our search for the auspicious signs of heaven and earth once the restriction dissipates!","“If our sole aim is to claim this sacred land, no further preparations are necessary.","“Autumn and I can potentially breach the restriction beforehand and access the sacred land. However, its dissolution will undoubtedly disrupt the yet-to-emerge auspicious signs of heaven and earth!”","Lin Yuan nodded. In fact, he was no longer as affected by the world’s morality as before.","Unless it was necessary, Lin Yuan did not want to become a murderous person even in an environment like the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","However, now that it involved the acquisition of auspicious signs, Lin Yuan naturally would not show mercy!","“After Autumn deals with these guys, we’ll enter Coiling Dragon Mountain and clear the interior. Whether it’s a mid-grade blessed land or an auspicious sign of heaven and earth, they are invaluable resources!","“In order to prevent anyone from leaking the information inside and attracting more forces to visit this place, we can’t let any forces leave Coiling Dragon Mountain! The forces that can enter must have reached a certain standard. If these forces are willing to surrender, we can give them a chance! If these forces have no intention of surrendering, we’ll get rid of all of them!”","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen selected a wind-type holy spirit. If it refined this wind-type holy spirit into a holy maid, it would have a total of five holy maids!","The more holy maids there were, the harder it would be to find suitable holy spirits in the future.","In less than two hours, the forces outside Coiling Dragon Mountain were cleared out. Winter set up a restriction outside the mountain.","Once other factions entered the mountain, they would be corroded by the cold.","This chill would not kill anyone but could alert people and prevent any other forces from entering.","If these factions insisted on entering Coiled Dragon Mountain after being alerted, Lin Yuan could only eliminate them! To seize an opportunity, one must accept the accompanying risks, even if it meant confronting Lin Yuan himself!","Upon entering Coiled Dragon Mountain, Lin Yuan noticed numerous species had established restrictions at its entrance, serving as formidable deterrents.","Despite the abundance of species outside the mountain opting to raid others rather than venture inside, it was likely due to intimidation from these restrictions.","Lin Yuan paid no heed to these deterrents and soon encountered two groups.","Upon seeing only three people in Lin Yuan’s group, the teams expressed surprise.","“Why weren’t you accosted by those outside?”","“They allowed you entry into Coiled Dragon Mountain? You must possess some strength!”","“Would you consider joining forces with us? The three of you won’t be able to secure anything alone.. Together, we can divide the resources based on our strengths!”"]},{"number":2992,"title":"Chapter 2992 Unexpected Harvest!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2992 Unexpected Harvest!","....","When the two parties saw that Lin Yuan’s group of three had not relented, their expressions changed slightly. However, they did not flare up immediately and continued to say persuasively, “Most of the forces here are in groups. Let’s form groups first. This way, even if we want to join a larger group, we can have more say!”","Lin Yuan did not give the two groups any respect and said firmly, “You’ve indeed entered Coiling Dragon Mountain, but you’re moving around the periphery and roping in people everywhere. The reason for this situation is that you’re not strong enough to compete in the core circle. This is the only way for you.","“How could a truly powerful power be willing to split the resources here evenly? A group that can take in your group is still at the bottom here on Coiling Dragon Mountain. Lions will not associate with worms! Now, I’ll give you a chance. Do you choose to submit or be eliminated?”","Lin Yuan’s words made the hearts of the 100 people in the two groups tighten simultaneously. They did not understand the situation of Lin Yuan and the other two.","Although Autumn and Winter still had the aura of someone who had just reached the Holy Spirit level, Lin Yuan’s expression was too natural and confident when he said that. He did not seem to be joking at all.","There were only two outcomes to these words. The first was that their two groups chose to submit, and the second was to resist fiercely.","Once they made a move, they would immediately know how deep and shallow Lin Yuan and the other two were.","Both sides were stunned by Lin Yuan. They looked at each other and did not speak immediately.","Lin Yuan said in a low voice, “I don’t have time to waste with you. If you still can’t make a decision in three seconds, you’ll be eliminated!”","Just as Lin Yuan finished speaking, a man in yellowish-brown clothes hurriedly said, “The people of Egret Cliff are willing to submit and follow the three of you in your exploration!”","Egret Cliff, where Lan Lu was located, was close to Coiling Dragon Mountain. It was the first faction to discover the phenomenon.","However, Lan Lu was extremely timid by nature and had been hesitating about whether to go to Coiling Dragon Mountain.","In the end, greed defeated his fear. However, after arriving, Lan Lu realized that the situation was extremely complicated. It was not something the group he led could deal with!","However, once they entered, they could not leave halfway. Apart from the factions that could not enter Coiling Dragon Mountain because they were not strong enough, there were also some powerful factions hidden.","These factions did not want to enter Coiling Dragon Mountain to compete with so many factions. Instead, they were prepared to plunder the factions that had left the mountain.","If Lan Lu left with his group now, he would immediately become the target of those people.","There was no way for Lan Lu to leave, so he had no choice but to group up with other forces to find someone to rely on.","Unlike Lan Lu’s weakness, the other faction’s leader was an opportunist through and through. He had been looking for an opportunity for the species to transform. Therefore, that leader did not choose to submit because of Lin Yuan’s words.","Three seconds later, a chill arose behind Lin Yuan, and the other faction beside him was instantly frozen into statues.","Lan Lu did not even notice how all of this happened.","However, during this process, Winter’s body had always had the aura of someone who had just entered the Holy Spirit level. It had not changed at all.","No matter how stupid Lan Lu was, he knew Winter had hidden his aura. Lan Lu shrank his neck in fear while secretly rejoicing at his choice. If he had not made such a choice, he and his group would have all become statues.","Lan Lu knew very well that when he chose to submit, many of his subordinates would think he was too timid.","Once such thoughts appeared, it would not be beneficial to his subsequent management of the group.","But now, Lin Yuan had used his strength to prove that Lan Lu had made the right choice. He had saved his subordinates.","After a brief moment of shock, he hurriedly bent down before Lin Yuan.","“Lord, your strength is indeed powerful. No wonder you dared to bring only two subordinates to Coiling Dragon Mountain! My name is Lan Lu, and I am the leader of Egret Cliff. From now on, I will follow all of your orders! If there’s anything you need me to do, just tell me!”","Lin Yuan looked at Lan Lu and thought, This fellow named Lan Lu knows when to yield and when to stand tall. It’s very convenient to use such a person.","Lin Yuan did not ask him to pledge allegiance to him like when he had subdued his subordinates. Instead, he said directly, “Bring the people from Egret Cliff to help me find the locations of the other factions. When you find them, inform me through this piece of paper. We’ll rush over immediately!","“If you do well, I’ll give you a good fortune. If you don’t do well, it means that you’re an incompetent person. Incompetent people don’t deserve to work under me.”","Lin Yuan handed a Thoughts Letter Paper to him.","The Thoughts Letter Paper could not transmit messages from afar but was enough to cover the entire Coiling Dragon Mountain.","Lan Lu bent down and reached out to catch the Thoughts Letter Paper. To do such a thing made him feel a little uneasy.","However, Lan Lu felt that any faction would not directly attack his group when they discovered him.","After all, those factions did not know his strength.","Lan Lu was confident he could inform them!","“Lord, I will do my best to complete your tasks! However, our strength is limited. If we encounter those unreasonable lunatics who attack us directly, I’m afraid I won’t be able to bring the news to you, Lord! Lord, do you think you should arrange a subordinate for us?”","He tried his best to speak slowly, afraid Lin Yuan would be displeased by his words.","Once Lin Yuan’s emotions changed, Lan Lu would immediately shut up.","Lin Yuan knew that his request was to ensure his safety, but he could not hand over Winter and Autumn to him.","“If I give them to you, what value will you have? What you have to do now is to prove your value to me. Even if you encounter those powerful species, as long as you’re smart and send the news as soon as possible, I can guarantee your safety!”","When Lan Lu heard that, he knew he could only rely on himself for the rest. Lan Lu did not want to die at all!","The scene of how the young man in front of him had dealt with the other group was still vivid in his mind. If he did not handle this matter well, he would likely end up in the same situation!","Apart from preventing him from encountering those crazy groups, he had to ensure he could meet Lin Yuan’s requirements.","“Young Master, the bloodline of this species from Egret Cliff is very low and doesn’t have much potential. Do you think it’s necessary to recruit these people?”","Lin Yuan replied seriously, “This trip to Coiling Dragon Mountain has wasted a lot of our time. I plan to use this trip to choose more species and move them to North of the Lonely River to enrich the environment there!","“To these species, it’s more important to be smart and to know what to do than to possess strength. I can also use this opportunity to screen these species.”","Lin Yuan would clear out many species on this trip to Coiling Dragon Mountain, but it did not mean that the defeated species were not smart and did not have potential.","However, those species were rebellious and were unwilling to submit.","If he forcefully brought these species to North of the Lonely River, they would inevitably cause trouble. What Lin Yuan needed were obedient and intelligent species.","“Winter, help me control these factions in Coiling Dragon Mountain from another direction. Autumn can just follow me alone. Let’s try to control all the factions here before the restriction disappears. I don’t want anything to happen when the restriction disappears!”","Lin Yuan had just finished making arrangements for Winter when the Thoughts Letter Paper received a message from Lan Lu.","Lan Lu had already found several species and factions. During the process of contacting them, Lan Lu did not encounter any danger.","However, those factions asked Lan Lu to join them.","Due to the lack of strength of Lan Lu’s group, those factions requested Lan Lu and the others to join as servants.","He knew that joining such a group could help him come into contact with more species, but he was still Lin Yuan’s servant. He was afraid that Lin Yuan would be displeased if he joined other factions and groups as a servant, so he had reported to him in advance.","Lin Yuan’s reply was very simple. “You don’t have to think so much. It’s fine as long as you can help me gather more factions. If the number of factions around you reaches a certain level, you can call us over directly!”","Lin Yuan’s response brought a wave of relief over him, alleviating his concerns about joining the group.","This coalition comprised seven factions, boasting considerable size and influence. Despite this, Lan Lu hesitated to summon Lin Yuan immediately.","He had two reasons for the delay. Firstly, he aimed to impress Lin Yuan by gathering additional factions, showcasing his organizational prowess.","Distinguishing between ability and brute strength, Lan Yuan knew Lin Yuan valued the former more. Lin Yuan’s discernment had earned him his position; he wasn’t one to merely prioritize physical might.","Secondly, Lan Lu harbored a nagging fear that Lin Yuan might develop an interest in these factions, leading him to abandon Lan Lu. This would leave Lan Lu vulnerable, with no allies to turn to, casting a shadow over his future prospects.","Trapped under someone’s influence, Lan Lu couldn’t help but contemplate his fate.","However, Lan Lu soon shelved these concerns as a confrontation erupted between his newly joined group and another group, escalating into a skirmish.","Ensuring his own safety became a pressing concern for Lan Lu. The clash threatened to derail his plans, leaving him vulnerable to unforeseen consequences.","Forced to act, Lan Lu resorted to reaching out to Lin Yuan using the Thoughts Letter Paper.","Moments later, Autumn materialized alongside Lin Yuan in front of Lan Lu, stunning everyone. Their sudden appearance defied comprehension.","Lin Yuan remained silent, fixing his gaze upon Lan Lu.","Lan Lu immediately understood what Lin Yuan meant and could not help but have a strange feeling.","Lan Lu shouted, “Stop fighting and submit to my Lord immediately! Don’t blame me for not giving you a chance. If you submit late, you’ll only die!”","Lan Lu had an idea and imitated Lin Yuan’s words, “I’ll give you three seconds to think about it.”","When he spoke, Lin Yuan gave Autumn a look, signaling him to release his aura.","Autumn’s pressure suddenly enveloped the two groups of people who were about to fight.","Lan Lu directly shouted for the various factions in the two groups to consider for three seconds. These factions would definitely not be moved.","However, these forces were still unwilling to submit after sensing Autumn’s strength. In that case, he would let Autumn get rid of these people and leave them as bait for the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen!","The aura released by Autumn did not target Lan Lu. He watched as the powerhouses far stronger than him bent over under the pressure of Autumn’s aura and crawled in front of him.","Lan Lu only felt a sense of comfort from the inside out. Lan Lu had never experienced such a feeling before!","Autumn’s aura was filled with killing intent, unlike Winter’s.","More than half of the faction leaders present chose to submit in these three seconds.","In the cruel Sky Beyond the Clouds, it was very common for low-level factions to submit to factions stronger than them.","Additionally, from the strength Autumn displayed, he was more powerful than the experts present had imagined!","If one wanted to live in front of such an expert, would they be qualified to say no?","The faction leaders who did not immediately choose to submit after three seconds did not really want to submit. They just wanted to find an opportunity to negotiate with Lin Yuan.","These species that wanted to negotiate were immediately eliminated by Autumn.","Looking at the 11 factions kneeling before him, Lin Yuan took out 11 Thoughts Letter Paper.","He made arrangements for the leaders like how he had arranged for Lan Lu. He told these factions to spread out and search for groups like Lan Lu was doing before sending the news to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan brought Autumn to subdue these factions.","...","At present, 12 factions were serving Lin Yuan, and there would be more and more in the future.","Coupled with the fact that Winter was also taking action, Lin Yuan would soon be able to control all the factions in Coiling Dragon Mountain!","Just as Lin Yuan was subduing these factions, he received a voice transmission from Winter, “Young Master, there are some powerful forces in Coiled Dragon Mountain. I can’t believe there’s a Grade 5 Creator hiding among the forces I’m facing.","“This Grade 5 Creator is not only unwilling to submit because of his position in Honor Absent Palace but also wants to go against me. A Grade 5 Creator is very important, especially now that Sky City is developing. Young Master, do you want to meet this Grade 5 Creator?”"]},{"number":2993,"title":"Chapter 2993 The Master of the Sacred Feather Villa!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2993 The Master of the Sacred Feather Villa!","....","Winter added, “If this Grade 5 Creator is killed just like that, I can guarantee that no news will spread, but it will be a pity. This Grade 5 Creator’s ability should be stronger than Yi He’s. Furthermore, this Grade 5 Creator is powerful and has successfully awakened his body composition, which has reached the standard of Class 2!”","Winter’s words immediately piqued Lin Yuan’s interest.","Winter’s meaning was clear. Even if this Grade 5 Creator was unwilling to submit, Winter still could not bear to kill him.","Lin Yuan knew very well how many benefits a Grade 5 Creator could create. Even the powerful organizations might not have a Grade 5 Creator holding down and presiding over them.","Basically, those powerful factions were working together with Grade 5 Creators. This could be seen from Ling Muzhuo’s attitude toward Grade 5 Creators.","It was a pleasant surprise to meet a Grade 5 Creator there.","Subduing this Grade 5 Creator wasn’t as straightforward as Ling Muzhuo introducing them to Yi He, who was nearing the end of their lifespan, and then taking in Yi He through the Lifespan Mouse.","Grade 5 Creators were notoriously proud and conceited. It was unlikely that this one truly believed Winter would dare to confront him. Subduing such a Grade 5 Creator would undoubtedly pose a significant challenge, but Lin Yuan was determined to seize this opportunity.","“Autumn, send me to Winter’s place. Take this Thoughts Letter Paper. If any faction contacts you, subdue those factions that have gathered together.”","In Lin Yuan’s eyes, the Grade 5 Creator Winter encountered was even more important than this mid-grade blessed land and the auspicious signs that were about to be born in the blessed land.","...","From afar, Lin Yuan could see Winter confronting a group of people. The aura emitted by this group was not as strong as Winter’s.","However, they were not at a disadvantage at all when facing Winter.","The person in the lead was wearing a long golden robe, thick white embroidered pants, and a pair of long boots with six pearls. This set of clothes looked simple, but the level of spiritual ingredients used was something that Lin Yuan could not compare to.","It had only been less than a year since Lin Yuan came to the Sky Beyond the Clouds from a Class 2 world. Even though he had already cooperated with Fortune Treasure Palace and subdued a Grade 5 Creator, Lin Yuan did not take any resources from Yi He apart from the items to store blessed lands.","Lin Yuan’s current resource reserves were inferior to this Grade 5 Creator’s.","Lin Yuan had read many books in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, including the ancient books that had been passed down by the Bloodians for hundreds of thousands of years.","It could be seen that this person was extraordinary.","Apart from Grade 5 Creators, there was probably no other group that could use the silk spat out by Holy Spirit Eternal Night Cry Silkworms to make luxurious clothes.","Not only was this person dressed very luxuriously, but he also had an excellent appearance. His aura was oppressive, and he had a powerful aura. It was obvious this person was the Grade 5 Creator that Winter had mentioned!","Winter bowed to Lin Yuan.","“Young Master, you’re here. This Grade 5 Creator wants to talk to you.”","When Winter spoke to Lin Yuan, his tone was extremely respectful.","Winter’s attitude toward Lin Yuan surprised the Grade 5 Creator.","Zhong Zhiyu was there because he had long discovered there was a high chance that an auspicious sign of heaven and earth would appear there.","Be it the auspicious signs of heaven and earth or this mid-grade blessed land, Zhong Zhiyu was quite interested.","Originally, Zhong Zhiyu wanted to keep a low profile and hide his identity. Zhong Zhiyu’s concealment of his identity had gone extremely smoothly until a few moments ago. However, after meeting Winter, Zhong Zhiyu’s identity could not be hidden anymore.","Zhong Zhiyu was very surprised by Winter’s strength. As a Grade 5 Creator, Zhong Zhiyu was a top-notch big shot with outstanding strength.","In the end, a person far stronger than him suddenly appeared, forcing him to use his Grade 5 Creator identity to deal with him.","Such an expert actually bowed to a young man with such a respectful attitude. This young man was not even 50 years old yet. Zhong Zhiyu was surprised by Lin Yuan’s identity. What kind of identity did a young man have to have such a person accompanying him?","Zhong Zhiyu restrained his arrogant attitude. Given Winter’s strength and Lin Yuan’s age, Lin Yuan’s faction did not lack Grade 5 Creators.","Otherwise, he would definitely not have such an attitude when facing him.","Before Zhong Zhiyu could speak, a servant in gorgeous clothes behind him spoke. “Why aren’t you greeting my Lord? Your guard wanted to attack my Lord just now. He—”","This servant had been by Zhong Zhiyu’s side for a long time. This servant was extremely good at flattering and winning Zhong Zhiyu’s favor, so the latter had always kept this servant close.","Zhong Zhiyu was thinking about how he should treat Lin Yuan. Although this young man was not a Grade 5 Creator, he was abnormally noble.","In his faction, he might be able to command Grade 5 Creators.","If not for that, this faction would not have arranged for such a powerful retainer to follow this young man. Furthermore, there were two of them!","Before Zhong Zhiyu could speak, his retainer spoke first and he said the same thing.","Zhong Zhiyu raised his hand and slapped the retainer’s head. With a crack, the retainer’s head shrank back.","A pinnacle Holy Spirit lifeform wouldn’t succumb to such a blow, but undoubtedly, their roots must have suffered severe damage!","Zhong Zhiyu’s actions communicated his stance to Lin Yuan. Simultaneously, he employed this strategy to safeguard his retainer’s life. Otherwise, should his retainer’s words displease Lin Yuan, he might order Winter to execute the retainer, with Zhong Zhiyu possibly unable to intervene.","Moreover, if the retainer were slain and Zhong Zhiyu found himself powerless, he would struggle to maintain control over his subordinates in the future!","“My retainer needs to be disciplined. Don’t mind him. Your guard released his aura to force me to submit. I want to ask you what’s going on!”","Lin Yuan chuckled and replied fiercely even though Zhong Zhiyu’s attitude was very good.","“If you weren’t a Grade 5 Creator, you would be dead now! I’ve taken a fancy to this auspicious and mid-grade blessed land that is about to be born. All the factions who want to fight for the auspicious and mid-grade blessed land will die if they don’t submit!”","Zhong Zhiyu’s face betrayed his anger.","This guy in front of him was so domineering at such a young age. These words were equivalent to not giving him any respect at all.","However, Lin Yuan’s words made Zhong Zhiyu even more afraid. At the same time, he knew he would most likely be in adversity in the following conversation!","No matter how noble a Grade 5 Creator’s identity was, it was only an identity. If it was in Honor Absent Palace, Zhong Zhiyu would not give Lin Yuan any respect and would not need to be afraid.","However, if the other party really attacked him at Coiling Dragon Mountain, he would not be able to do anything. As long as everything was dealt with cleanly, it would be difficult to leave any evidence behind.","At that moment, Zhong Zhiyu knew he could not avoid this topic. Lin Yuan had mentioned the word ‘submit’ as soon as he arrived. Evidently, he would only be satisfied when he submitted to him.","Zhong Zhiyu looked at Lin Yuan and asked solemnly, “What do you mean? You want me to submit so that you can give me a way out? Haha, I think I misunderstood!”","Zhong Zhiyu wanted to change the topic but did not expect Lin Yuan’s answer.","“Do you know what the happiest thing for me has been since coming to Coiling Dragon Mountain? It’s discovering your existence. Your life can only continue if you submit to me. Since you mentioned wanting to talk, let’s discuss submission!”","Lin Yuan gestured for Zhong Zhiyu to speak directly.","Zhong Zhiyu felt choked by Lin Yuan. He did want to talk about it, but it was definitely not a subject of submission.","Why should I, a Grade 5 Creator, submit? Why should I submit?","Previously, Zhong Zhiyu had always been held in high regard, regardless of his location.","However, upon arriving at Coiling Dragon Mountain, he felt like he had been cornered by a ferocious dog, its menacing fangs poised to strike.","These individuals boasted mysterious backgrounds, yet they dared to threaten someone of Zhong Zhiyu’s stature—a Grade 5 Creator.","Clearly, they intended to keep this confrontation under wraps. Refusal to comply could spell a dire outcome for him.","With a deep breath, Zhong Zhiyu turned his gaze toward Lin Yuan, his silence speaking volumes.","His retinue remained silent as well, fully aware of the consequences. Zhong Zhiyu had recently even struck down his most trusted retainer, a display that foreboded ill regardless of the validity of his actions.","Though accustomed to wielding power over others, Zhong Zhiyu’s followers were not oblivious to the gravity of the situation. This was no longer a scenario they could intervene in.","As their eyes locked, Lin Yuan exuded an aura so commanding that even Zhong Zhiyu felt its weight pressing down on him.","In the end, Zhong Zhiyu asked solemnly, “You don’t know my ability. Are you sure that if you attack me, the news won’t spread?”","Lin Yuan shrugged. “There’s nothing absolute in this world. I don’t know how capable you are, but since I dare to do such a thing, I naturally have confidence! If you’re unwilling to submit, I’ll bear the consequences of killing you here. You don’t have to worry about this!”","When Lin Yuan said that, Zhong Zhiyu’s aura relaxed like a deflated ball.","“I, Zhong Zhiyu, traveled extensively and became a Grade 5 Creator 40,000 years ago. I didn’t expect to fail and become someone else’s subordinate one day! This might be the tribulation that I deserve!”","Lin Yuan looked at Zhong Zhiyu’s defeated expression and said with a smile, “How do you know this is a calamity and not an opportunity? Perhaps after this incident, you will be able to improve further!”","Zhong Zhiyu felt strong confidence from Lin Yuan’s words. Moreover, from Lin Yuan’s attitude toward him, Zhong Zhiyu could tell that Lin Yuan valued him. Apart from being valued, there was no other reverence or respect.","There might not be any opportunities for him to join Lin Yuan, but he would be able to find out this young man’s secrets!","“I’m a Grade 5 Creator after all. There must be some benefits for me to join you, right? I wonder what benefits you can give me?”","Before visiting Zhong Zhiyu, Lin Yuan pondered a crucial question: What could he offer a Grade 5 Creator?","After careful consideration, Lin Yuan realized that besides the Lifespan Mouse, he possessed nothing of greater value to a Grade 5 Creator.","Indeed, Morbius had yet to mature, and the resources from the Spirit Lock spatial zone were, at best, Grade 5 Creator level.","Nevertheless, few things in the world eluded a Grade 5 Creator’s grasp.","If there was one exception, it was lifespan. Otherwise, individuals like Yi He wouldn’t be in such dire straits.","Lin Yuan wasn’t privy to Zhong Zhiyu’s lifespan, yet he trusted that a person of Zhong Zhiyu’s insight would recognize the Lifespan Mouse’s worth upon seeing it. Thus, possessing the Lifespan Mouse should suffice when dealing with a Grade 5 Creator.","Rather than unveiling the Lifespan Mouse immediately, Lin Yuan changed the subject and inquired, “Since you’re considering joining forces with me, let’s formally introduce ourselves. I’m Lin Yuan, Sky City’s City Lord. This is Winter, and the companion accompanying us is Autumn. I’m a little curious about your lifespan.”","Zhong Zhiyu had already resigned himself to his fate and wished to join Lin Yuan. Were someone else to ask about his lifespan, he would staunchly refuse to divulge such private information, likely reacting with frustration.","This question was deeply personal to an expert and not easily broached. Even a close confidant asking such a question could evoke aversion.","Zhong Zhiyu had never contemplated concealing his lifespan from Lin Yuan.","“I’m now a high-grade Grade 5 Creator and the owner of Sacred Feather Villa. 45,000 years ago, my strength successfully improved. I still have more than 10,000 years of lifespan left! But to be honest, I’m also at the age where I have to search for spiritual ingredients to increase my lifespan. I’ll inevitably have to go out and find a way to increase my lifespan after joining you. I hope you can forgive me for this!”","As he spoke, Zhong Zhiyu felt a little melancholic. This was because Zhong Zhiyu knew very well that even if he kept searching for more than 10,000 years, he could only increase his lifespan by a few thousand years at most."]},{"number":2994,"title":"Chapter 2994: Double Grade 5!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2994: Double Grade 5!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The end of his lifespan could be seen at a glance! It did not feel good to be able to see the end of this lifespan at a glance!","Before Zhong Zhiyu grew up, he had seen too many outstanding people die in the torrent of time. Zhong Zhiyu knew his current situation very well. In the next 10,000 years, it was difficult for him to take another step forward.","In the past, as the master of the Holy Feather Villa, Zhong Zhiyu was all-powerful outside and unwilling to admit this.","However, Zhong Zhiyu had become a prisoner who was about to be controlled by Lin Yuan. Even his freedom would be taken away, and his aura had weakened. It was no longer as imposing as before.","Zhong Zhiyu felt he had to explain this to Lin Yuan in advance.","Zhong Zhiyu knew Lin Yuan valued him because he was a Grade 5 Creator. If he were not one, Lin Yuan would not have come to see him.","Zhong Zhiyu chose to submit and work for Lin Yuan in the future, but he could not spend all his time and energy to be this tool!","Zhong Zhiyu’s words not only let Lin Yuan know that Zhong Zhiyu was indeed in a predicament in terms of lifespan but that he was quite honest with him as well.","“If you choose to join me, you will become a Class 5 Creator under Sky City. I won’t restrict your freedom if you join Sky City, but there’s no need to find spiritual ingredients that can increase your lifespan!”","Upon hearing that, Zhong Zhiyu was stunned. For a moment, he did not completely understand what Lin Yuan meant.","When Lin Yuan said that he would not restrict his freedom, Zhong Zhiyu could not help but relax.","However, what did Lin Yuan mean when he said he was not allowed to search for spiritual ingredients that could increase one’s lifespan? If he didn’t look for spiritual ingredients to increase his lifespan, how could he extend it? Could it be that Lin Yuan was afraid he would waste time searching for spiritual ingredients that could increase his lifespan?","When Zhong Zhiyu thought of this possibility, he looked at Lin Yuan with a look of desperation.","Lin Yuan sensed the change in Zhong Zhiyu’s expression and knew he had misunderstood him.","However, Lin Yuan did not point it out immediately. He had already become an expert in psychological control. It would be much better to let Zhong Zhiyu know about the Lifespan Mouse later and resolve his worries.","“Why? I’m willing to join you, but are you saying you’re unwilling to extend my lifespan?”","Lin Yuan didn’t say anything. Instead, he glanced at Winter.","Winter immediately understood Lin Yuan’s implication and replied, “No core members in Sky City seek methods to extend their lifespan. It’s because longevity isn’t a concern for us.”","With a gesture towards the sky, Winter continued. “Joining Sky City means achieving immortality, not just dreaming of it. With endless lifespan, there’s no need to seek further means of prolonging life.”","Though Zhong Zhiyu acknowledged Winter’s power, he couldn’t help but scoff at the notion. “Do you take me for a fool? Endless lifespan is nothing but a fantasy. If it were possible, even ants could become giants! Surely, the vast Sky Beyond the Clouds would have changed by now!”","Lin Yuan anticipated Zhong Zhiyu’s skepticism. Without encountering the Lifespan Mouse, he would have shared the sentiment.","“Our trust seems lacking,” Lin Yuan remarked. “I propose a test. If I prove my claim, then release your holy spirit and submit to me. If not, you’re free to leave without coercion. What do you think?”","Zhong Zhiyu’s eyelids fluttered at Lin Yuan’s challenge. Realization dawned: Lin Yuan wasn’t bluffing. There truly existed a means to attain eternal life!","With a racing heart, Zhong Zhiyu contemplated. Before Lin Yuan’s influence, he’d have dismissed such an offer outright. Now, however, the prospect seemed irresistible.","Although he still did not believe Lin Yuan’s words, Zhong Zhiyu was already somewhat convinced.","“If you can really let me obtain an endless lifespan, so what if I release the holy spirit for you to control?”","With that, Zhong Zhiyu released his holy spirit.","Just as Zhong Zhiyu released his holy spirit, Lin Yuan heard the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen exclaim, “Master, his holy spirit is very suitable to nurture holy maids! His fire- and lightning-type holy spirit should be considered the best among the fire- and lightning-type holy spirits!”","Lin Yuan rejected the notion without thinking.","What a joke. No matter how suitable Zhong Zhiyu’s holy spirit was to nurture a holy maid, the value of a holy maid was definitely inferior to a Grade 5 Creator!","Lin Yuan waved at Zhong Zhiyu, signaling him to come closer.","When Zhong Zhiyu arrived, Lin Yuan took out the Lifespan Mouse and looked at him with a smile. With Zhong Zhiyu’s ability, he should be able to see the depths of the Lifespan Mouse at a glance and know that it could provide an endless lifespan.","Lin Yuan smiled when he saw Zhong Zhiyu tense up at the Lifespan Mouse’s sight.","“I think I should be able to control your holy spirit now!”","Lin Yuan began to control Zhong Zhiyu’s holy spirit.","While Lin Yuan was controlling Zhong Zhiyu’s holy spirit, the latter did not resist and allowed Lin Yuan’s holy spirit to mark it.","Zhong Zhiyu looked at the Lifespan Mouse with a complicated gaze. After a while, he lowered his head and said, “From now on, I will be a member of Sky City. Please guide me! If you need me to follow you from now on, I will disband my Sacred Feather Villa. It is only my private organization. I don’t like crowds by nature, so I didn’t form a Creator group like other Grade 5 Creators.”","If Zhong Zhiyu had a Creator group under his command like Yi He, Lin Yuan would really be reluctant to bring him along.","Zhong Zhiyu did not have a Creator group like Yi He, so Lin Yuan did not have to worrv so much.","“Contract the Lifespan Mouse first. After contracting it, return to the Holy Feather Villa to organize the resources and bring your subordinates. Then, return as soon as possible and meet me. I will stay here first to explore the mid-grade blessed land that is about to be born here. Remember to take care of your subordinates. Don’t spread the information about the Lifespan Mouse!”","Lin Yuan’s words were equivalent to telling Zhong Zhiyu to keep him by his side.","Zhong Zhiyu already understood the Lifespan Mouse’s situation. Although this Lifespan Mouse was extremely weak, it could infinitely increase the lifespan of the contractor by replenishing vitality.","The contract between the Lifespan Mouse and the contractor was equivalent to connecting their lifespans. Whether it was the Lifespan Mouse or the contractor, the other party would die directly.","Being controlled by the holy spirit did not mean that one’s life and death were controlled by the other party. However, if the contracted Lifespan Mouse fell into the hands of others, it meant that one’s life would be controlled in the future.","Zhong Zhiyu smiled bitterly. Lin Yuan’s words were not a question but a request. He had no right to say no!","Zhong Zhiyu placed the Lifespan Mouse in Lin Yuan’s hand.","“It won’t take long for me to return to the Holy Feather Villa to gather supplies and dispatch troops. I’ll be able to return within seven days.","“These people under my command were all nurtured by me since I was young. They all have the same tongue as me and will not spout nonsense. You can rest assured about this!","“From now on, I will be under your command just like Winter is. Why don’t we call you Young Master like he does?”","Since Zhong Zhiyu had been forced to join Lin Yuan, he would not put on a long face and go against Lin Yuan. It was stupid to resist when his life was already in the hands of others.","If Zhong Zhiyu wanted to make such a choice, he might as well fall out with Lin Yuan from the start.","“It will take me about a week to explore this mid-grade blessed land. I will still be here before you return.","“You’re much older than me, so I’ll call you Uncle Zhong!","“Uncle Zhong, although you haven’t established a Creator group, you should know a lot of Creators. If you know any Creators who are about to reach the end of their lifespan, you can introduce them to me. If Sky City establishes a Creator group, I can allow you to be the team leader!”","When Zhong Zhiyu heard that, he vaguely guessed his thoughts.","Lin Yuan still possessed additional Lifespan Mice, intending to utilize them to exert control over more high-grade Creators.","Zhong Zhiyu was acquainted with several Creators on the brink of their lifespans. After all, many Creators began seeking spiritual ingredients to prolong their lives when they had between 10,000 to 20,000 years remaining. “Young Master, I am aware of Creators nearing the end of their lifespan. I’ll reach out to them and explore if they’re open to trading freedom for an opportunity to extend their existence. I’ll brief them beforehand before bringing them to you.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s plan to assemble a Creator team, Zhong Zhiyu was appointed as the team leader.","Zhong Zhiyu was geared up to recruit more Creators into Sky City.","Unbeknownst to Zhong Zhiyu, Sky City harbored only two Grade 5 Creators, with one currently absent. As the lone Grade 5 Creator beside Lin Yuan, he held the highest capability among Sky City’s residents.","Concerned about the intense pressure of leading the team, Zhong Zhiyu anticipated unwavering support from those he brought into Sky City.","Lin Yuan was delighted when Zhong Zhiyu volunteered to clarify the situation to the Creators, foreseeing it would alleviate much hassle.","Handing Zhong Zhiyu a ramet of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower and a Thoughts Letter Paper, Lin Yuan introduced them, “We usually communicate via the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. This paper will facilitate communication with all Sky City’s core members once you’re with us.”","Zhong Zhiyu solemnly stowed away the ramet and the Thoughts Letter Paper, fully aware that he would be bound to Sky City for life.","When they arrived at Sky City, Zhong Zhiyu was prepared to build a good relationship with the core members of Sky City. This was extremely beneficial to his development in Sky City!","As for his subordinates, because they were used to tyrannizing others, they would likely cause trouble for him in Sky City.","Zhong Zhiyu was prepared to control his subordinates. If anyone still did whatever they wanted and did not know how to restrain themselves, he would not mind getting rid of these subordinates he had nurtured.","Zhong Zhiyu’s subordinates were both assistants and servants. Yet, Zhong Zhiyu did not have many feelings for these people.","He could get rid of them and choose some talented fellows to nurture.","Zhong Zhiyu had a little hobby that no one knew about. He enjoyed the process of nurturing and training his subordinates.","After Zhong Zhiyu left, Lin Yuan revealed a carefree smile.","Before leaving North of the Lonely River, Lin Yuan was still thinking about how to enrich Sky City’s Creator team.","Not long after he left, Lin Yuan now had two Grade 5 Creators and three Grade 4 Creators under his command!","However, this was only the beginning. Lin Yuan now had many Creator channels, and it was very convenient for Sky City to attract more Creators through these channels.","Winter looked in the direction where Zhong Zhiyu had left and said, “Young Master, this Zhong Zhiyu can be said to be outstanding in both strength and talent. He’s very worthy of you nurturing him in the future!","“From all aspects, Zhong Zhiyu is stronger than Vi He, who you just took under your wing. It’s very difficult to make a Grade 5 Creator submit. Before you came, I thought that attacking was always inevitable. Fortunately, Zhong Zhiyu is smart enough and knows how to bend and be flexible.”","Lin Yuan scratched his head awkwardly. Winter saw him as too omnipotent.","In truth, Lin Yuan lacked the resources to nurture Zhong Zhiyu. To provide resources beneficial to Zhong Zhiyu, he had to await Morbius’s next evolution.","Lin Yuan now had the option to select feys to spirit lock. Without selecting more, Morbius wouldn’t evolve either.","Lin Yuan’s spirit-locked feys were the Jasmine Lily, Blackie, Purple Afterglow, Sky Sea, Green Vine, the Realm Abyss Red Lotus, the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom, and the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake.."]},{"number":2995,"title":"Chapter 2995 Snake House Spirit Tamer!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2995 Snake House Spirit Tamer!","....","Morbius’ Spirit Lock had only reached Suzerain.","Morbius could already continue to spirit-lock new feys. If it was suitable, Lin Yuan would prepare to spirit-lock the auspicious sign that was about to be born.","It would become Morbius’ Sovereign fey.","Previously, Lin Yuan had not been in a hurry to nurture Morbius because he felt that the spirit-locked feys he would encounter in the Sky Beyond the Clouds would be of a higher level than those he had encountered in the main world.","Lin Yuan hadn’t been in the Sky Beyond the Clouds for a long time. As he was in a hurry to establish his faction there, he did not put too much thought into nurturing feys.","As a result, Lin Yuan had only contracted one fey, the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake.","Many of the star pirates that Lin Yuan had captured were given to the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake as bait. It would use the Six Flowers Curse to turn those star pirates into sub-snakes and then absorb or control them.","This allowed the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake to reach pinnacle Sovereign. It was only a step away from World Emperor/Divine Kingdom!","While Lin Yuan was communicating with Zhong Zhiyu, the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake had asked Lin Yuan to evolve its grade, but Lin Yuan had rejected it.","He sensed the aura of the restriction and found that it had not weakened.","Lin Yuan had handed the matter of subduing the other species to Autumn, so he decided to nurture the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake there.","Its bloodline had already reached a bottleneck. In the process of advancing to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake’s bloodline had a high chance of transforming.","Lin Yuan released the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake. It wrapped around Lin Yuan’s forearm like an armband, and the energy on the surface of his body surged.","The summoned snake took the initiative to communicate with Lin Yuan, “Master, the energy from the star pirates you gave me is too potent. My body’s energy has maxed out, making control difficult. Could you offer some pure spirit qi to aid my bloodline transformation? I also need ingredients rich in soul energy to bolster my soul during evolution.”","The Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake clearly informed Lin Yuan of its needs. It left Lin Yuan’s body, and no longer restricted its energy. Instead, it allowed the energy in its body to surge out.","Lin Yuan took out numerous spirit qi crystals and the soul-type spiritual ingredients he had obtained from Fortune Treasure Palace.","Lin Yuan was not stingy in nurturing his feys.","If Zhong Zhiyu was by Lin Yuan’s side, he would be shocked by the resources that Lin Yuan had provided for the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake.","Lin Yuan had provided it with Grade 4 Creator resources, and Zhong Zhiyu could also allocate them.","However, these resources should not be used on a creature that had not even reached the World Emperor grade. Such resources were enough to nurture pinnacle Holy Spirit experts!","Using such advanced resources on a low-level creature was a form of pampering. At the same time, it showed that Lin Yuan did not care about such resources.","Winter was very envious of the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake as it evolved peacefully under Lin Yuan’s care.","Winter had seen its growth along the way.","The Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake had not suffered at all ever since Lin Yuan had taken a fancy to it. However, this Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake had done well, and the abilities and exclusive skills it had obtained were excellent enough.","Lin Yuan used True Data to investigate the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake, which was only one step away from the Divine Kingdom level.","Compared to before, the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake had obtained a new ability and two exclusive skills.","The Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake’s new skill was called Snake Swarm Soul Lock.","[Snake Swarm Soul Lock]: In battle, the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake transfers its soul into the body of one or several snake-type creatures it controls. When these snake-type lifeforms stare at the target, if the target’s soul is stronger than their own, they can interfere with the target’s soul and restrict the target’s movements. If the target’s soul is weaker than theirs, they will directly freeze the target’s soul and put the target in a state of suspended animation (Locking the soul consumes a lot of their soul energy. Every time they use it, their soul will be in a weakened state for a period of time).","Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake’s Sovereign Snake Swarm Soul Lock was a type of control ability. This control ability was not only powerful but also unexpected. Even if the enemy knew the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake’s ability, they did not know which snake creature in the community would attack and control the target.","Apart from Snake Swarm Soul Lock, the new exclusive skills were Banner Snake Enlightenment and Poisonous Wave.","[Banner Snake Enlightenment]: Specify a snake-type lifeform that you control and turn this snake-type lifeform into a snake-type banner. The snake-type banner will be enhanced by the snake-type lifeforms in the range. It will increase the attack defense speed, energy recovery, and some unique abilities of the snake-type lifeform. Moreover, the snake-type banner will absorb the vitality of the dead and injured creatures in the range and then heal the snake-type lifeforms.","[Poisonous Wave]: When the target has more than three types of snake venom, ignore the target’s resistance to poison and directly detonate the effect of the snake venom, disintegrating the target’s body.","Banner Snake Enlightenment was a kind of compatibility range healing and amplification ability. It could greatly increase the overall combat ability of the snake group.","Such a three-dimensional enhancement in attack and defense speed was already quite uncommon. The snake banner formation not only bolstered attack and defense speed but also accelerated energy recovery and endurance while enhancing certain abilities.","Typically, snake-type organisms weren’t proficient in close combat. Rather, they excelled in diverse functions and poison attacks.","Augmenting the capabilities of snake-type organisms could potentially lead to a significant transformation in their strength.","Banner Snake Enlightenment significantly boosted the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake’s abilities by a minimum of 50%!","Yet, alongside this enhancement, the snake acquired Poisonous Wave, a power that rivaled Banner Snake Enlightenment and, in some respects, surpassed it.","Essentially, every snake controlled by the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake gained the capacity to poison its targets. Injecting more than three types of toxins into an enemy during battle was a straightforward task. Once the target fell victim to three or more poisons, Poisonous Wave triggered, unleashing immeasurable damage.","Initially, many snake venoms took time to manifest their effects in battle. Instant detonation of venom effectively accelerated its potency, causing delayed effects to erupt immediately.","Additionally, Poisonous Wave could bypass the target’s poison resistance.","As a creature’s strength increased, so did its resistance to poison. This explained why snake species were at a disadvantage against stronger opponents.","With the removal of the target’s poison resistance, snake species were free from this constraint in battle!","While Lin Yuan observed the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake’s newfound abilities and exclusive skills, it continued to progress steadily.","Winter obstructed the aura emitted by the evolving snake while assisting it in resisting the World Cleansing.","Although the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake’s size remained largely unchanged, its body emitted a more ethereal light, its color deepening.","Simultaneously, the snake’s bloodline metamorphosis imbued it with a noble aura.","Winter said softly, “Young Master, it will take at least four to five hours for your Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake to transform completely. Its transformation is already a shoo-in. You don’t have to worry. The light shrouding its body hasn’t dissipated because it is absorbing the originally overflowing energy in its body. By absorbing this overflowing energy, it can consolidate its bloodline and strength.”","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake’s bloodline.","[Fey Name]: Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake","[Fey Species]: Snake Pupils/Illusion Snake","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (1/10)","[Fey Type]: Soul","[Fey Quality]: Elementary Divine Kingdom","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Snake Eyes]: Controls other snake-species feys through its eyes. When its soul energy is enough to suppress other snake-species feys, it can induce them to contract or sacrifice it (Contract allows control over the snake-type lifeforms. As long as the targeted snake-type lifeforms’ spiritual power does not exceed its own, it will not escape its control. When sacrificing the targeted snake-type lifeforms, it can obtain the energy from its body and use its flesh to strengthen its own physical fitness).","[Snake Coiling Defense]: Coiled its body together, allowing the entire snake body to become one. When it is attacked, it can shrink its body and increase its defense to the greatest extent.","[Soul Forging Armor]: When the soul energy is combined with the snake-species fey’s bloodline, it will form an armor that interweaves with the bloodline on the surface of the body. Not only can it resist physical attacks, but it also has a certain resistance to elemental damage.","[Life Prolonging Shedding]: Under the circumstances of using the Snake Coiling Defense, if the target pierces through the defense and poses a threat to its life, it will instinctively undergo a snake shedding to avoid fatal damage. Each snake shedding weakens the body and diminishes a certain amount of soul strength.","[Swift Snake Shadow]: Increases the snake-species feys under its control, allowing them to react and attack more quickly.","[Violent Venom Burst]: Activate the snake venom in the target’s body, causing the slow-acting snake venom to instantly activate its poison effect and cause timely damage to the target. The poison damage to the target will be converted into healing energy to heal the army of snakes.","[Snake Devouring Rampage]: The snake-type feys under its control will devour each other and increase the strength of the main body in a superimposed manner. It will also cause the devouring main body to enter a berserk state and sacrifice itself to attack the enemy. At the end of its life, its body will explode, and the damage will be equivalent to its full strength attack at its peak.","[Fearless Snake Heart]: All the targets in the snake group will be fearless. The snake heart is as tough as iron and has a certain chance of being immune to mental, soul, and mind abilities. When facing a powerful enemy, even if the enemy uses bloodline deterrence, it can still reveal 100% of its strength.","[Snake Swarm Soul Lock]: In battle, the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake transfers its soul into the body of one or several snake-type creatures it controls. When these snake-type lifeforms stare at the target, if the target’s soul is stronger than their own, they can interfere with the target’s soul and restrict the target’s movements. If the target’s soul is weaker than theirs, they will directly freeze the target’s soul and put the target in a state of suspended animation (Locking the soul consumes a lot of their soul energy. Every time they use it, their soul will be in a weakened state for a period of time).","[Soul Box of the Ancestral Snake]: Use its soul energy to weave the soul box and separate a portion of its soul to place in the soul box. When the enemy attacks and causes its own death, the silent soul in the soul box will revive and develop into a new individual.","Exclusive Skill:","[Six Flowers Curse]: Through the Six Flowers Curse in the eye, whenever the target’s body is invaded by poison related to the target, a snake flower will grow from the wound. When the number of snake flowers reaches six, the target’s bloodline will be forcefully changed, turning the target into a sub-snake.","[Control Strengthening]: When contracting a snake-species fey, the contract will be bound to the target’s soul. Once bound to the target’s soul, if the contract is shaken by external influences, the contract will spontaneously sacrifice the target to prevent it from breaking free from its control.","[Brahma Snake Totem]: Transform the totem into a copy on the contractor’s body. The contractor will share the worship of the snake creatures. It can perfectly control the snake creatures it controls and obtain the faith power of these snake creatures.","[Totem Snake Transformation]: Every time a snake-type lifeform undergoes a metamorphosis, a portion of the snake-type lifeform’s subsequent metamorphosis potential will be transferred to the contractor, helping the contractor’s physique and bloodline to undergo a metamorphosis.","[Banner Snake Enlightenment]: Specify a snake-type lifeform that you control and turn this snake-type lifeform into a snake-type banner. The snake-type banner will be enhanced by the snake-type lifeforms in the range. It will increase the attack defense speed, energy recovery, and some unique abilities of the snake-type lifeform. Moreover, the snake-type banner will absorb the vitality of the dead and injured creatures in the range and then heal the snake-type lifeforms.","[Poisonous Wave]: When the target has more than three types of snake venom, ignore the target’s resistance to poison and directly detonate the effect of the snake venom, disintegrating the target’s body.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Snake House Spirit Tamer]: When the snake-type lifeform it controls reaches a certain level of strength, a snake spirit fruit will condense in the soul of the snake-type lifeform it controls. The snake-type lifeform that condenses the snake spirit fruit can contract and control other snake-type lifeforms, causing both sides to become symbiotic."]},{"number":2996,"title":"Chapter 2996 Mobius: Totem Tree Spirit!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2996 Mobius: Totem Tree Spirit!","....","When the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, its bloodline had already transformed into the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake.","The Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s prowess was evident from its name, primarily governing other snake-species feys.","The new World Emperor ability, Soul Box of the Ancestral Snake, had a powerful life-saving capability.","By expending its soul energy, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake could craft a soul box. Subsequently, it risked soul injury to divide a portion of its soul, placing it within the soul box, which could be stored anywhere.","Upon the snake’s death, the split soul within the box would activate, regenerating into a new Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake from within the soul box. The newborn snake retained its original abilities but operated at diminished energy levels until fully recharged.","Lin Yuan could safeguard the soul box within Sky City, ensuring the snake’s protection even in death.","Once a formidable fey like the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake secured its survival, its battlefield value soared!","In addition to gaining a new ability upon reaching the World Emperor grade, the snake finally obtained its divine kingdom ability after ascending to that level.","Snake House Spirit Tamer was particularly unique, rendering all snake lifeforms under the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s control as spirit contractors. It wielded dictatorial control over them, effectively bolstering the divine kingdom’s power by empowering every snake under its command.","Snake lifeforms contracted with other beings contributed to the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s strength, diversifying its abilities.","Sky City had never had any external departments. The Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake might be able to develop this external department with the power of the divine kingdom.","If Lin Yuan aimed to amplify the longevity of the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s snake lifeforms using Snake House Spirit Tamer, the optimal approach involved endowing the beings contracted by the snake lifeforms with formidable strength and combat prowess.","The prime candidates for this were the star pirates!","Those star pirates who roamed the Sky Beyond the Clouds boasted exceptional combat skills. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have endured countless skirmishes.","Lin Yuan’s plan was to track down star pirates far and wide. Initially, he hunted them to feed the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","This strategy would ensure a steady stream of resources for upgrading her holy maids.","However, due to the star pirates’ swift pace, Lin Yuan had amassed a considerable stockpile of their corpses.","He enlisted Yun Qingyang and several major star pirate group leaders under his command. This move would only escalate the number of hunted star pirate groups in the future.","Rather than outright eliminating these pirates, Lin Yuan opted to select a few exceptional ones to be controlled via Snake House Spirit Control. By contracting these powerful pirates with the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake, they could serve as external units. These units faced intermittent peril, resulting in a high mortality rate.","Controlling snakes was effortless for the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake—it could even transmute star pirates into subordinate snakes. This ensured immediate replenishment of these units, notwithstanding their considerable energy consumption.","Unfazed by the prospect of death, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake could lead these units directly.","Upon concluding his observation of the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s new abilities, the radiant glow surrounding it faded entirely.","After advancing, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake did not choose to transform into a human. Instead, it used its original form to wrap around Lin Yuan’s forearm.","If the patterns adorning the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake’s body were intricate and peculiar, those on the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s body could only be described as mesmerizingly psychedelic. While its body exhibited resplendent hues, focusing on it produced a dazzling effect.","As Lin Yuan gazed at the psychedelic patterns on the snake’s surface, he experienced a surreal sensation, as though the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake blended seamlessly with its surroundings.","Winter couldn’t help but sigh. “Young Master, if this Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake wasn’t your contracted fey but an entity born in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, with its current foundation, it could surely evolve into a true behemoth! Its impact would surpass even that of the most formidable mice infestation.”","With Winter’s experience, having discerned the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s abilities, he already understood its impact and value.","Lin Yuan responded with a noncommittal smile. “I plan to release the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake in the future and allow it to develop autonomously. After all, there’s ample margin for error. Even if the team is wiped out outside, they can start anew!”","If Lin Yuan intended for the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake to lead Sky City’s external department, he undoubtedly needed to cultivate its abilities.","Practice always proved the most effective method for honing skills.","Winter couldn’t help but ponder that Lin Yuan’s approach to contracting feys in this lifetime was entirely distinct from his previous one. This suggested that Lin Yuan’s future development would diverge significantly from his past.","As Lin Yuan’s follower, Winter was exceedingly curious about how far Lin Yuan could ascend in this lifetime.","“Young Master, the auspicious level of heaven and earth that is about to be born in the blessed land is probably higher than I thought. Otherwise, it would be impossible for it not to break the restriction after such a long time. We’ll have to wait a little longer!”","Lin Yuan smiled. “The higher the level of auspiciousness in the world, the greater the benefits for me. Coincidentally, Autumn has yet to complete his control over all the factions in Coiling Dragon Mountain.”","Lin Yuan’s expression turned serious.","“Winter, what do you think the initial grade of this auspicious sign born in a mid-level blessed land will be? Is it convenient for me to contract it?”","Winter hurriedly explained, “Young Master, the auspicious signs of heaven and earth have just been born. According to the classification of the main world, it will be Normal grade. However, it will absorb the resources in the blessed land and grow to the Divine Kingdom level in a few hours. In a few days, it will reach the Holy Spirit level.","“If you want to contract it, you just have to seal the energy in this blessed land from the beginning and prevent this auspicious heaven and earth from absorbing it. Then, you can contract this auspicious sign in a few minutes.","“I’ll seal the energy in the blessed land, and Autumn will lead you to investigate the location of the auspicious signs. If you’re lucky, you can do it.”","Even Winter could not give Lin Yuan a full guarantee on this matter. After all, the area of a mid-grade blessed land was too large, and there was too little time for Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan nodded. He felt that luck was the thing he had lacked the least thus far. If Lin Yuan lacked luck, he would not have grown to this extent.","At present, Lin Yuan cared very little about gains and losses. There were many outstanding resources in the world, and they did not necessarily have to be obtained by him.","It would be best if he could contract this auspicious sign. If he could not, Lin Yuan would raise this auspicious sign on Season Cycle and help it grow. This auspicious sign would definitely repay this area of North of the Lonely River as it grew.","In the main world, Morbius had just grown to Suzerain/Myth.","Morbius’ Spirit Lock Replenishment allowed it to replenish the next grade of the spirit-locked fey.","This was also the reason Morbius could reach Suzerain/Myth Breed when it had only spirit-locked seven feys!","Morbius had last spirit-locked the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake, which had reached the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. Morbius had also grown, and its grade had increased to Sovereign becoming a Sovereign/Creation fey.","Lin Yuan had not checked Morbius’ data for a long time.","[Fey Name]: Morbius","[Fey Species]: ???","[Fey Grade]: Sovereign (6/10)","[Fey Type]: Mystery","[Fey Quality]: Creation I","Abilities:","[True Data]: All complicated information that is invisible to the eye is turned into data. Information that is turned into data might contain truth that cannot be distinguished on the surface.","[Calm Mind]: Passive ability. Effects of Calm Mind can be improved according to the fey’s grade. Calm Mind can stabilize the mind and has a certain probability of resisting negative conditions.","[Spirit Qi Condensation]: Gather the spirit qi in the air and Spirit Lock spatial zone. The gathered spirit qi will form spirit qi crystals that can enhance feys and source-type lifeforms.","[Spirit Lock Filling]: An empty spirit lock slot will be filled and Morbius’ evolution and improvement will not be affected. Multiple grade slots can be filled and a spirit locked fey’s evolution limit can also be removed","Exclusive Skill:","[Spirit Lock]: Morbius’ spatial zone can be used to nurture feys. The initial grade of the fey that Morbius’ spatial zone can nurture must not be higher than Morbius’ grade. Morbius isn’t able to increase its grade by itself, so its grade will be increased along with the fey’s grade that it nurtures.","[Pure Land of Bliss]: The Spirit Lock spatial zone will produce soil that is great for recovering near-death fey’s injuries. The fey’s recovery time will be determined by the grade of Morbius and the dying fey.","[Klein Hub]: Swallow and bind the dimensional hub that connects to the dimensional world into the Spirit Lock spatial zone. During the binding process, the lifeforms and items in the Spirit Lock spatial zone will enter the connected dimensional world. However, the dimensional world’s lifeforms will not be able to enter the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","[14 Totem Seeds]: The seeds of 14 totems can be given to 14 separate species. The 14 species will use their faith and power sources to incubate the totem seeds and enable them to grow into totem trees. The species will then be engraved on the neck as totems. Once a species is carved onto the neck, the entire species’ lifeform rank will be raised and given a unique totem ability.","[Totem Tree Spirit]: The totem tree that grows from the 14 totems can give birth to tree spirits. The tree spirits will completely increase the species represented by the totem tree that grows from the 14 totems. When the tree spirit absorbs enough totem power and transforms it into a mystic realm, the mystic realm can undergo a complete bloodline transition for the totem it belongs to.","[Normal Spirit Lock]:","Jasmine Lily (Bud of Mountain Jade): World Emperor V/Beginner Divine Kingdom","[Elite Spirit Lock]:","Five-Clawed Spirit Dragon: World Emperor IV/Beginner Divine Kingdom","[Bronze Spirit Lock]:","Purple Afterglow Beauty Goddess Butterfly: World Emperor III/Beginner Divine Kingdom","[Silver Spirit Lock]","Praying Universe Soul Whale: World Emperor VI/Beginner Divine Kingdom","[Gold Spirit Lock]","Perfect Touch Wisteria: World Emperor X/Beginner Divine Kingdom","[Platinum Spirit Lock]","Realm Abyss Red Lotus: Sovereign I/Eternal X","[Diamond Spirit Lock]","Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom: World Emperor II/Beginner Divine Kingdom","Suzerain Spirit Lock:","Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake: World Emperor I/Beginner Divine Kingdom","Morbius’ Totem Tree Spirit and its 14 Totem Seeds, acquired through its evolution to Creation Breed, were intricately linked. This could be seen as an extension of the 14 Totem Seeds.","It aimed to fortify all aspects of the 14 totem seeds, facilitating a comprehensive bloodline transition for the entire species.","Lin Yuan had chosen only one species to benefit from 14 Totem Seeds: the Hundred Questions Beasts.","The bloodline of the Hundred Questions Beasts was already exceptionally potent, with each one being on par with a Creator.","Although Genius’ ability had already reached the level of a Grade 4 Creator, this was by no means its limit.","Should the totem seed of the Hundred Questions Beasts mature into a totem tree and manifest as a tree spirit, it would turn into a spirit realm.","The collective enhancement of the Hundred Questions Beasts’ bloodlines would undoubtedly result in a significant boost to their Creator-like abilities!","Lin Yuan felt a swell of pride as he gazed upon the Sovereign/Creation Morbius.","Autumn’s voice transmission sounded in Lin Yuan’s mind. “Young Master, I’ve already completely controlled all the factions in Coiling Dragon Mountain. I’ve kept those factions that are willing to submit and eliminated the unwilling ones!","“Do you want to inspect these forces now? In a while, you won’t encounter any obstacles in the process of contracting the auspicious signs of heaven and earth!”","Lin Yuan knew that Autumn had spent a lot of effort to control all the factions in such a short period.","“Autumn, you’ve worked hard. Bring the factions under your control to look for me now. Let them declare their loyalty to the Faith Tree one by one.","“After I contract that auspicious sign of heaven and earth, I’ll let them leave when we explore this mid-grade blessed land and bring the other members of the factions to Coiling Dragon Mountain. When they return, our exploration of the mid-grade blessed land will come to an end.”","Lin Yuan was more or less anxious to return to North of the Lonely River.","This was because Wen Yu should be able to hold the Astronomical Parliament now!"]},{"number":2997,"title":"Chapter 2997: Business Flourishing Flower!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2997: Business Flourishing Flower!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The Astronomical Parliament was related to Lin Yuan’s future development plans in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. If it was unnecessary, Lin Yuan would not want the Astronomical Parliament to be affected.","Although what Lin Yuan was doing was not as important as the Astronomical Parliament itself, it was definitely much more important than one parliamentary meeting.","Lin Yuan sent a message to Wen Yu, asking her to hold the parliamentary meeting after he returned.","The Astronomical Parliament’s Star Spirit Seat required the power of willpower and laws to be used. Apart from Lin Yuan, others had to pay a huge price to provide this power of willpower and laws. In order to nurture the members who had just joined the Astronomical Parliament, resources would definitely be provided.","Autumn wasted no time gathering a big group to Lin Yuan’s side. Each individual who had journeyed to Coiling Dragon Mountain in pursuit of the blessed land stood as an unparalleled elite within their faction.","Though their numbers were modest, these individuals represented the apex of their faction’s combat prowess.","At a glance, one could discern the presence of over 500 factions converging here.","Yet, from Lin Yuan’s perspective, these factions perceived him not as a fellow warrior but as an indomitable force, akin to an iron-blooded demon!","Autumn’s devastating assault had decimated more than 3/4 of Coiling Dragon Mountain’s forces, with Lin Yuan as its orchestrator.","As the brought factions cast furtive glances his way, none dared meet his gaze directly.","Autumn walked to Lin Yuan’s side and bowed as he said, “Young Master, all those who are willing to submit to you are here! I’ve already reprimanded them before coming. They’re all very obedient. You can give them orders directly!”","Winter glanced at Autumn. With Autumn’s personality of not wanting to make any mistakes in front of Lin Yuan, the admonishment Autumn spoke of was definitely extraordinary. It seemed these people had suffered a lot before coming here!","Lin Yuan took out the Faith Tree that was more than 10,000 meters tall and asked, “Autumn, Lan Lu followed you to help you control those forces. How did it go along the way?”","When Autumn heard Lin Yuan mention Lan Lu, he said fairly, “Young Master, Lan Lu is not strong enough to be of much help. However, when facing those already willing to submit, Lan Lu helped me count the people in these forces and register them. Apart from me, Lan Lu can be said to be the person who knows these forces the best.","Lin Yuan looked up at Lan Lu, who happened to meet his gaze and quickly lowered his head.","Lan Lu did not know why Lin Yuan would suddenly ask about him. It was probably a good thing and not a bad thing.","Lan Lu had tried his best along the way, hoping to perform well in front of Lin V1","Even though Lan Lu felt that it might be a good thing for Lin Yuan to look for him, he was still extremely nervous.","“Autumn, you have more important things to do. Apart from you, Lan Lu knows these forces the best. Let Lan Lu watch these forces as they pledge loyalty to the Faith Tree. When the restriction is broken, we can move at any time!”","The height of Lin Yuan’s Tree of Faith showed how many species he controlled.","Lin Yuan’s voice was not loud, but everyone present was an expert with extraordinary strength. Naturally, they could hear Lin Yuan’s words.","Lan Lu brimmed with excitement. Lin Yuan’s words elevated him to a significant role, showcasing the members’ loyalty to the Faith Tree and instantly boosting his standing.","In this crucial moment, Lin Yuan didn’t opt for the strongest faction member— he chose Lan Lu, signaling he didn’t prioritize sheer strength.","This presented Lan Lu with a remarkable chance for growth, despite any perceived weaknesses!","Initially, the powerhouses among the gathered factions underestimated Lan Lu, viewing him as lacking strength.","Yet, his assignment to the pivotal role of assessing controlled forces alongside Autumn was due to his compliance. They hadn’t anticipated his selection amidst such eminent company.","Lan Lu’s luck was truly in!","With his status clarified, anyone daring to disparage Lan Lu openly was courting trouble!","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s directive, Autumn turned to Lan Lu, positioned behind him, and remarked, “Young Master’s decision places you in a fortunate position. Seize this opportunity and ensure you don’t disappoint him. Otherwise, you’ll face my wrath!”","Lan Lu hurriedly expressed his stance, “Thank you, Lord, for giving me this opportunity. It’s my honor! I’ll try to do everything perfectly!”","After saying that, Lan Lu immediately began to take his notebook and command specific factions to declare their loyalty to the Faith Tree.","Lan Lu had already heard that Lin Yuan would lead Autumn and Winter to take control of the blessed land.","After Lin Yuan left with Winter and Autumn, Lan Lu was really afraid that he would not be able to control the situation.","In order to prevent this from happening, Lan Lu prioritized making those powerful forces swear allegiance. This way, even if anything happened after Lin Yuan left, these powerful factions that had sworn allegiance would be able to control the situation!","In less than four hours, more than half of the factions had pledged their loyalty to the Faith Tree.","The height of the Faith Tree had increased from more than 10,000 meters to 23,000 meters.","The faith contributed by these experts made the fruits of the Faith Tree even fuller.","Lan Lu prioritized the loyalty of those powerful forces which already proved Lan Lu’s wisdom.","At that moment, a powerful aura surged out from the blessed land.","Accompanying this powerful aura was abundant spirit qi and elemental energy of various attributes.","Lin Yuan thought, The restriction formed by the auspicious signs has finally opened!","The moment the restriction was broken, the energy in Winter’s body suddenly shot out, and an extremely cold intent spread between heaven and earth.","This energy did not target the members present but made them feel as if they had fallen into an ice cave. It was as if their souls had been completely frozen at that moment!","Under the terrifying coldness released by Winter, be it spirit qi or various types off elemental energy, they all stopped flowing.","The moment Winter released his aura, hundreds of millions of golden leaves surged out of Autumn’s body.","Autumn brought Lin Yuan into this mid-grade blessed land. Every leaf released from Autumn’s body was like an explorer, helping him determine the location of the auspicious sign of heaven and earth.","This time, Lin Yuan’s luck was indeed as good as before. In just half a minute, Autumn confirmed the location of this auspicious sign and brought Lin Yuan to it.","Lin Yuan originally thought that this auspicious sign would be an animal, but he did not expect it to be a plant!","This auspicious tree looked extremely ordinary from the outside. There were seven to eight fat and wide leaves growing on a leaf stem that was nearly half a meter long. These leaves were gradually discolored and darker towards the edges, giving off an unhealthy feeling.","If Autumn had not confirmed the identity of this plant, Lin Yuan would not have been able to confirm that this ordinary-looking plant was an auspicious sign!","Lin Yuan used Morbius to Spirit Lock this auspicious sign that had not even reached the Bronze. At the same time, he checked its data.","[Fey Name]: Business Flourishing Flower","[Fey Species]: Peach/Rose [Fey Grade]: Elite (9/10) [Fey Type]: Wood [Fey Quality]: Epic","Abilities:","[Overflowing Domain]: Let the ground you take root in contain a large amount of vitality. This vitality can increase the strength of all living beings here and increase the speed at which you absorb energy and your bloodline transforms. [Flower Nurturing]: When a flower blooms on its own, the flower can amplify the living beings in the area, making it easier for these living beings to nurture bloodlines. Even if a species that can’t nurture descendants eats a flower it bears, it can definitely nurture descendants.","When Lin Yuan beheld the two abilities, shock coursed through him. The Business Flourishing Flower was an Elite fey!","An Elite fey wielded astonishing power. It was no wonder it was hailed as an auspicious sign!","Each of these abilities could benefit a party, albeit in differing ways.","Overflowing Domain possessed a sweeping amplification prowess. Within its radius, all living beings could accelerate their strength growth.","In essence, it augmented the potential of life within its domain.","The Business Flourishing Flower’s Overflow Domain not only bolstered the growth and strength of other beings but also facilitated their bloodline transformation.","If Lin Yuan planted the Business Flourishing Flower on Season Cycle to collaborate with the higher faerie, the beings there could periodically undergo a metamorphosis, synergizing with Season Cycle and the Cleansing Breath Soil!","As for the Elite Flower Nurturing, it ensured bloodline continuation. The flowers it yielded resolved the challenge of reproducing many species’ bloodlines.","For instance, the Nine-Headed Snakes often faced bloodline continuity issues, resorting to child theft.","If the Nine-Headed Snakes acquired a Business Flourishing Flower, coupled with Flower Nurturing, their numbers and strength would surge dramatically!","In a species’ developmental hierarchy, the tougher the reproduction challenge, the loftier the bloodline tier.","Lin Yuan marveled at the joy powerful species would experience upon discovering the Business Flourishing Flower!","It had been quite some time since Lin Yuan had nurtured an Elite fey.","After Elite feys reached Epic, they could obtain three exclusive skills after advancing to Bronze.","Lin Yuan could choose from the three exclusive skills and choose the one that suited his needs the most.","As the contractor of the spirit-locked Business Flourishing Flower, Lin Yuan could use its ability. It was most important to suit Lin Yuan’s needs!","Heaven and Earth feys grew extremely quickly. After Lin Yuan removed the restriction on the Business Flourishing Flower, it immediately evolved to Silver.","After advancing to Bronze, three young leaves grew out of the stem of the flower that was half a meter tall. In the middle of the leaves was a bud the size of a green bean.","When Lin Yuan saw this, he thought, It’s not difficult for this Business","Flourishing Flower to bloom. It has already grown buds during the process of evolving to Bronze!","Lin Yuan was about to choose from the three exclusive skills.","The first exclusive skill was called Overdraft Evolution.","[Overdraft Evolution]: Mobilize the potential of the lifeforms within the range. Induce the potential of these lifeforms in advance and let them evolve in a short period, quickly increasing their bloodline and strength (Increasing the growth speed of the lifeform in advance will affect the upper limit of the lifeform’s future growth).","Overdraft Evolution could allow Lin Yuan to nurture a group of capable generals under his command. However, this method of nurturing would affect the future.","Lin Yuan was very clear that overdrawing one’s future in exchange for short-term benefits would only bring disadvantages to the growth of a life.","If Lin Yuan was in a difficult situation and was targeted by an enemy, he would need to find a way to break out of the situation through martial force.","In that case, Lin Yuan might choose Overdraft Evolution for the Business Flourishing Flower.","However, everything was going smoothly for Lin Yuan. Be it Sky City or the faith country, they were both developing.","There was really no need for Lin Yuan to overdraft and evolve.","The second exclusive skill was called Business Support.","[Business Support]: Every living being’s bloodline will successfully transform under the support of their own ability. Feeding their offspring will give them a business mark. The business mark can increase their growth speed. After the business mark reaches level one, the growth of their grade and quality will be unrestricted.","Business Support was an exclusive skill that targeted the Business Flourishing Flower itself.","At present, the Bronze Business Flourishing Flower had an area of nearly one square kilometer.","A square kilometer of land could accommodate hundreds of thousands of living beings.","With the Business Flourishing Flower’s support, these living beings could easily return many business marks to the Business Flourishing Flower, allowing it to evolve in grade and increase its strength.","However, as Morbius continued to improve, it no longer had many restrictions on spirit-locked feys.","Business Support could indeed allow the Business Flourishing Flower to grow rapidly.","However, Lin Yuan would plant the Business Flourishing Flower on Season Cycle, so it would grow very quickly. This made the exclusive skill a little useless.","Lin Yuan continued to investigate the third exclusive skill, Burning Blossom Amplification.","[Burning Blossom Amplification]: Use the flower that blooms on its own to let he flower enter the burning state. After entering the burning state, the flower itself will not be consumed, but it will lose the ability to help other species reproduce. Every flower that enters the burning state will enhance Overflowing Domain.","Overflowing Domain was the basic ability of the Business Flourishing Flower as an auspicious sign. Enhancing this ability was equivalent to increasing the fey’s value.","However, the price of losing the ability to help other species reproduce was more or less too high to let the bloomed flowers enter a burning state.."]},{"number":2998,"title":"Chapter 2998 Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2998 Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly!","....","Lin Yuan attached great importance to the Business Flourishing Flower’s ability to breed powerful and endangered species as the ability made it easier for him to recruit powerful species.","Helping these powerful species strengthen their numbers was sometimes more appealing than helping the experts of the species increase their strength.","Fortunately, the Realm Abyss Red Lotuss lotus seed’s ability was somewhat similar to the Business Flourishing Flower’s ability. In fact, it was more formidable.","Lin Yuan was willing to accept the loss of some Business Flourishing Flowers caused by its entering the burning state.","Burning Flower Enhancement was a little better than Business Support and Overdraft Evolution.","After weighing the pros and cons, Lin Yuan chose the Burning Flower Enhancement.","Looking at the Business Flourishing Flower’s data, it had already become a Bronze/Flawless fey.","[Fey Name]: Business Flourishing Flower","[Fey Species]: Peach/Rose","[Fey Grade]: Bronze (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood","[Fey Quality]: Flawless","Abilities:","[Overflowing Domain]: Lets the ground you take root in contain a large amount of vitality. This vitality can increase the strength of all the living beings here and increase the speed at which you absorb energy and your bloodline transforms.","[Flower Nurturing]: When a flower blooms on its own, the flower can amplify the living beings in the area, making it easier for these living beings to nurture bloodlines. Even if a race that can’t nurture descendants eats a flower that it bears, it can definitely nurture descendants.","Exclusive Skill:","[Burning Flower Enhancement]: Use the flower that blooms on its own to let the flower enter the burning state. After entering the burning state, the flower itself will not be consumed, but it will lose the ability to help other species reproduce. Every flower that enters the burning state will enhance the basic ability, Overflowing Domain.","As auspicious blessings of heaven and earth, the Business Flourishing Flower had just come into existence. Now was its fastest time to advance in grade and quality. However, Lin Yuan had made the Business Flourishing Flower Morbius’ Spirit Lock fey, and he wanted it to evolve into a Fantasy Breed at Bronze.","At present, Lin Yuan had yet to comprehend the Willpower Rune that was compatible with the Business Flourishing Flower. Only when Lin Yuan comprehended the Willpower Rune related to the Business Flourishing Flower could it continue to evolve. For the time being, its current grade and quality could only be suppressed.","Lin Yuan put away the Business Flourishing Flower. His ability to comprehend Willpower Runes was powerful. Over the years, he had been comprehending Willpower Runes one after another. Some of the Willpower Runes could be used to fuse with the Business Flourishing Flower, but Lin Yuan was unwilling to do so.","The Business Flourishing Flower was not only an auspicious blessing of heaven and earth, but it also concerned Morbius’ future growth. He had to nurture it to the best of its ability.","Just as Lin Yuan put away the Business Flourishing Flower, explosions of dense energy erupted all around him, forming successive waves of energy surges. These energy waves continued to spread into the distance, causing the entire mid-grade blessed land to tremble.","Autumn said, “Young Master, this energy was born together with the Business Flourishing Flower. By storing away it, you’ve caused this energy to dissipate into the blessed land.”","Sensing the boundless pure energy surrounding him, Lin Yuan couldn’t help but lament inwardly that this energy was somewhat wasted.","Autumn guessed Lin Yuan’s thoughts and said, “Young Master, the energy that should have been absorbed by the Business Flourishing Flower will nourish the special feys born in this mid-grade blessed land and strengthen them.”","Just as Autumn’s words trailed off, Winter appeared before Lin Yuan, smiling as he spoke. “Looks like everything is going smoothly. This is really great. As far as I know, there are very few people who can contract with the auspicious sign of heaven and earth as its value is often comparable to that of a higher faerie!”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan nodded in agreement. To be fair, the Business Flourishing Flower he had contracted hadn’t fully matured yet, but its current abilities were already comparable to Season Cycle.","“Winter, you might not know this, but the auspicious sign of heaven and earth that Young Master contracted is plant-type, which is more precious than animal-type or insect-type. If properly nurtured, it really isn’t something that ordinary higher faeries can compare to!”","Winter was happy for Lin Yuan and curious when he heard Autumn’s words. How outstanding was it that Lin Yuan had contracted for Autumn to say such words?","Autumn had always wanted to show off before Lin Yuan, but his proud nature often got in the way. He would not praise things that he looked down upon.","Lin Yuan did not continue to talk about the Business Flourishing Flower. Instead, he told Autumn and Winter, “Let’s gather the resources in this mid-grade blessed land first!”","Lin Yuan surveyed his surroundings, taking in the abundance of rare spiritual ingredients scattered about. Not far off, a few mineral veins lay exposed to the open air, their precise ores hinting at a minimum Class 4 designation.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, mineral vein classifications typically adhered to Creator grade standards, dictating the quality of resources they could yield.","These initial observations explained why numerous formidable factions vied to claim mid-grade blessed lands upon their emergence.","Within this mid-grade blessed land, Lin Yuan, Autumn, and Winter were restricted to gathering easily accessible spiritual ingredients, as developing mineral veins necessitated a substantial workforce.","On their journey to gather spiritual ingredients, Winter noticed an open-air ore with a striking pinkish-purple glow in the distance.","“I didn’t expect to stumble upon a Dragon Breath Stone vein in this mid-grade blessed land,” he remarked to Lin Yuan. “If the Barren beast you’ve contracted in this territory aims to elevate its grade, doesn’t it require dragon lungs and phoenix blood?”","“These Dragon Breath Stones might serve as a direct substitute for the dragon lungs in nourishing your Barren beast.","“In case your Barren beast isn’t inclined to consume the Dragon Breath Stone, using it can significantly hasten the cultivation of dragon-species feys of equivalent grade. Judging by the quality of this Dragon Breath Stone vein, the stones it produces are of at least Class 3!","“More than 50% of the Dragon Breath Stones here could reach Class 4, and if luck favors us, we might even yield a Class 5 Dragon Breath Stone.”","He added, “Obtaining these Class 5 Dragon Breath Stones won’t pose a challenge when it comes to exchanging them for Sacred Body Stones at the Creation Conference.","“Many species boasting dragon-species bloodlines exhibit exceptional prowess and possess a keen territorial sense, enabling them to amass abundant resources. Such species place immense value on enhancing their strength, where the benefits of Sacred Body Stones might pale in comparison to those of the Dragon Breath Stone!”","Winter’s expertise surpassed that of Lin Yuan’s, though the latter, having delved into numerous texts, could identify the Dragon Breath Stone vein upon seeing it.","The Dragon Breath Stone held immense value, with Lin Yuan having only glimpsed Class 3 Dragon Breath Stones in Fortune Treasure Palace’s exhibition area.","Lin Yuan could tell that the Dragon Breath Stone was an excellent cultivation resource for Blackie, so he asked Zhan Lu if he had any higher-grade Dragon Breath Stones for sale.","Back then, Zhan Lu had had the intention of befriending Lin Yuan, yet in the end, he had not agree to trade higher-grade Dragon Breath Stones with Lin Yuan.","While Lin Yuan, Autumn, and Winter were collecting the resources that were easy to gather, they were also making records of the resources that were inconvenient to mine.","Lin Yuan had discovered many spirit springs in this mid-grade blessed land, and it was good news for him. His Spirit Lock spatial zone’s Element Well, was lacking a nspirit spring, which could speed up the production of elemental spring water.","The area of the mid-grade blessed land was huge. After exploring for several hours, Lin Yuan did not manage to reach the edge or see any special feys produced in it.","Lin Yuan could not help but ask curiously, “Isn’t it said that the higher the grade of the blessed land, the stronger the exclusivity and danger of the special feys born within it? Why haven’t I seen any special feys after exploring for so long?","“I remember that when Wei Ao introduced that low-grade blessed land, he said that the special feys here would run out of the blessed land and hurt people.”","Autumn explained, “Young Master, it seems like all the special feys in this mid-grade blessed land have gathered together. The fact that they display such a great social characteristic means that these special feys have a high social value and are easier to tame. Young Master, I can sense the aura of feys over there. If you want to see those special feys, you can head west.”","“Let’s continue exploring toward the west as usual. With another three to four hours of exploration, we should be able to encounter them.”","Lin Yuan had to explore the entire mid-grade blessed land, so he was not in a hurry to change his exploration path. He was bound to encounter special feys in this mid-grade blessed land sooner or later.","“Let’s continue exploring. There’s no need to change our route for the special feys.”","Autumn and Winter knew Lin Yuan was extremely curious, but he could suppress his curiosity and complete the exploration step by step. This meant that Lin Yuan was becoming calmer than before, an excellent quality for a leader of a faction to have.","During this time, Lin Yuan sensed no more factions swearing allegiance to the Faith Tree, so he asked Autumn to organize these members to return to their original factions. Those who could move their factions should move there and wait for Lin Yuan to bring them back to North of the Lonely River to live in a new environment.","Those who could not lead the factions to move should remain concealed within their original factions like pieces on a chessboard. Lin Yuan would provide these people with resources so that they could become the rulers of the faction step by step.","It was not a bad thing to leave some factions outside. They were entrenched near Coiled Dragon Mountain, allowing Lin Yuan to understand the information there.","...","After exploring all the way, Lin Yuan finally saw what the special feys that had been born in this mid-grade blessed land looked like. They were all in human form, but their bodies were petite. Female feys were between 1.4 to 1.5 meters tall, and male feys were usually less than 1.7 meters tall. These feys all looked outstanding, but their entire eyeballs were glowing white, looking very strange.","When Lin Yuan discovered these special feys, they also discovered him.","Lin Yuan, Autumn, and Winter were considered invaders to these special feys.","As a few sharp whistles sounded, the eyes of these special feys began to emit a large amount of fluorescent light.","Lin Yuan did not feel anything under the protection of Autumn and Winter, but it was obvious that these special feys were attacking him.","Lin Yuan turned to look at Autumn and Winter.","Winter didn’t say anything. He was prepared to give the opportunity to Autumn.","Autumn would be leading the Hunting Group on missions outside for a long period and would not be able to accompany Lin Yuan. Even if Autumn wanted to showcase himself before Lin Yuan, he did not have many chances. Hence, Winter very considerately gave Autumn the opportunity.","Upon seeing Winter remaining silent, Autumn hurriedly spoke. “Young Master, this species possesses a unique ocular ability. It doesn’t cause spirit or soul trauma, but rather an extremely peculiar form of consciousness annihilation.","“This ability is challenging to avoid. If you want to resist it, you have to be much stronger than these feys or use your body composition to resist it. The special feys in this mid-grade blessed land have great potential and are worth nurturing!”","Upon hearing Autumn’s description, Lin Yuan gained a rough understanding of the situation of these special feys. Their value could not be solely demonstrated just by attacking.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to investigate these special feys.","These extraordinary creatures were known as Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies and were insect-type. Their distinct appearance stemmed from undergoing mimicry.","The primary attack method of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly centered around eye techniques, boasting formidable combat prowess capable of catching opponents off guard. Even opponents of equal stature had little chance to react before succumbing to these creatures.","However, the physical fragility of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly made it susceptible to external damage.","Lin Yuan’s fascination lay not in the feys’ offensive capabilities, but rather in their exceptional intelligence. True Data revealed that the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies’ eyes operated at over 170 times the speed of typical intelligent feys. Placing such an intelligent creature within the faction could elevate it to a managerial role, overseeing factional affairs.","Currently, the faith country suffered from a shortage of managers. Su Yiren and Luo Lan had already initiated efforts to cultivate skilled individuals in Sky City. However, this process would take time, making it challenging for them to provide immediate assistance to Su Yiren and Luo Lan."]},{"number":2999,"title":"Chapter 2999: The Insect Queen’s Request!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2999: The Insect Queen’s Request!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The lack of managers in the faith country greatly restricted its development.","These Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies were like blank sheets of paper, unable to understand the situation outside. However, Lin Yuan could use Genius to instantly grow these intelligent Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies and directly invest them in the management of the faith country. They were no less helpful to Lin Yuan than the resources nurtured in this blessed land.","With Lin Yuan’s current abilities, it was very easy for him to obtain resources.","However, Lin Yuan had no way of obtaining a top-notch manager like the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies. What Lin Yuan needed to do next was to subdue these Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies.","Winter also saw the value of these Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies and knew that Lin Yuan was definitely thinking about how to recruit them.","Winter said at the right time, “Young Master, if you want to subdue this special species born in a mid-grade blessed land, you don’t have to use force. You only need to find their nest and control the mother of this species. Generally speaking, elite social feys born in blessed lands are produced by a mother.","“This mother’s strength is usually the strongest within the species. Judging from the strength of these feys, we can assume that the strength of the mother has most likely reached the pinnacle Holy Spirit level. Blessed lands below the high-grade will not give birth to feys whose strength exceeds the Holy Spirit level. If those species from outside enter the blessed land to explore and encounter the special species born within, they would most likely be eliminated. With the powerful ocular ability of this species, even people whose strength exceeds the Holy Spirit level will suffer if they rashly encounter them!”","Lin Yuan asked in an extremely serious tone, “Winter, can these Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies’ mother have absolute control over these feys they give birth to? I’m preparing to nurture these Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies to invest in the faith country and manage every region of the faith country. More than ability, what I require from them is exceptional stability. I don’t want them deployed in a way that could lead to potential safety hazards.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Winter’s response was remarkably precise, “Young Master, I can guarantee that the Insect Queen has absolute control over the insect-type units it gives birth to. The reason why the Insect Queen is always the strongest among the species is because when it gave birth to these children, it set up the Genetic Lock in their bodies.”","“However, controlling this Insect Queen might not be easy. Born within the mid-grade blessed land, it has held a high position since birth and can be considered the most prominent figure within the entire mid-grade blessed land. It’s precisely because it’s like a piece of white paper that it doesn’t understand the situation outside, so it’s very difficult to understand the benefits you promised. It might not even care about your threat.”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Since it doesn’t know what’s going on in the outside world, we’ll let it know. As a highly intelligent fey, it’s impossible for it not to be curious about the outside world. If, even when its strength is fully suppressed and its life is in jeopardy, it remains indecisive, then it is utterly unqualified to manage the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies!”","Lin Yuan had extremely high confidence in the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly’s","Insect Queen.","Lin Yuan thought of something and continued to ask Winter, “Winter, typically, when the Insect Queen of an insect-type species dies, another individual in the species will usually evolve into an Insect Queen. Hence, I assume that after the Insect Queen of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies dies, an individual’s Genetic Lock will be unlocked, correct?”","Winter thought for a moment and said, “Young Master, while such occurrences are quite common, I can’t confirm whether the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies follow the same pattern. I suggest that when controlling the Insect Queen, it’s best not to have any thoughts of getting rid of it. If, by any chance, the Insect Queen dies and the continuity of the species cannot be ensured, the gains won’t make up for the losses!","“Moreover, under normal circumstances, the Insect Queen can decide if it wants to open the Genetic Lock. If it chooses to seal the Genetic Lock before its death, it’s very likely that this special species will lose the possibility of increasing its population!”","Upon hearing Winter’s words, Lin Yuan pursed his lips and inwardly hoped the Insect Queen of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly could clearly assess the situation.","While Lin Yuan was conversing with Winter, the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies had discovered that their attacks had no effect on the invaders. They began to negotiate with Lin Yuan and the others.","However, the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies used their own language, so Lin Yuan could not understand what they meant. Autumn and Winter also couldn’t facilitate communication between Lin Yuan and the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies. They were afraid that the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies would suddenly attack Lin Yuan in the dark.","“Young Master, if there’s anything you want to communicate with these Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies, just tell me. I’ll help you send a voice transmission to them directly.”","Lin Yuan asked Autumn, “Autumn, can you confirm the location of the Insect Queen?”","Autumn and Winter hurriedly said, “Young Master, give us some time to explore. We will definitely be able to find the Insect Queen’s location. For elite social species, the leader typically occupies the central area.”","“In that case, let’s explore the location of this Insect Queen ourselves. There’s no need to communicate with them. I don’t want the Insect Queen to have too much information about us before I see it.’","Upon hearing this, Autumn and Winter no longer hid their auras and released their auras at the same time. The aura released by the both of them could be considered a shock to the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly’s Insect Queen.","Before seeing the Insect Queen, Autumn and Winter wanted to make it aware of the disparity between them. Their aura would not harm these Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies, but it restricted their movements.","Autumn and Winter led Lin Yuan in a carpet search. Before they could find the location of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly’s Insect Queen, a woman dressed differently from the other female Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies appeared in front of them.","She let out an obscure and awkward sound.","Autumn received a voice transmission from the female Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly and said to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, she said that you don’t have to spend so much effort to find her. She took the initiative to come out and see you. She also asked why we are invading her home.”","Lin Yuan addressed Autumn and said, “Autumn, tell her that we’re much stronger than her. Instead of sending a voice transmission, it’s better for us to have a chance to communicate directly. It will also let her understand this world more clearly!”","The fact that the Insect Queen of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies took the initiative to appear indicated that she was highly intelligent. When faced with the invasion of a powerful enemy, she did not wait to die. Instead, she wanted to take the initiative to negotiate. To a certain extent, this was the Insect Queen of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly showing weakness. Since the Insect Queen of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly was willing to show weakness, it meant that she was aware of her current situation. This reassured Lin Yuan that his subsequent communication with the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies would proceed smoothly.","Autumn conveyed Lin Yuan’s words through a voice transmission to the Insect","Queen. The Insect Queen hesitated for a moment before nodding in agreement.","Just as Lin Yuan had expected, the Insect Queen of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly was very clear about her current circumstance.","The Insect Queen of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly knew that engaging in conflict with the three individuals before her at this moment would only bring negative consequences upon herself.","Moreover, the Insect Queen was very interested in the situation in the outside world that Lin Yuan had mentioned. From the moment she saw Lin Yuan and the others, she knew that this blessed land was not the whole world.","Previously, the Insect Queen had already explored the entire blessed land and had not discovered the presence of Lin Yuan and the others.","The higher the intelligence of a fey, the more it would desire to understand the world around it. The more the Insect Queen of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly understood the situation in the outside world, the more clear she would be about their situation in the ecology of the world.","When Lin Yuan saw that the Insect Queen of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly had agreed, he summoned Genius.","Lin Yuan wanted Genius to tell the Insect Queen of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly everything apart from the information and knowledge about the main world.","Genius had to bear the risk of sending a message to the Wisdom Eye Brain","Dragonfly’s Queen Insect as Genius’ strength was far weaker than hers. If the Insect Queen targeted Genius when it sent the information, Genius’ safety would definitely be greatly impacted. It might even lead to Genius’ death. Therefore, Lin Yuan had always been extremely careful and prudent when he asked Genius to impart information to others. This time was no exception for Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan couldn’t guarantee that the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly’s Insect Queen wouldn’t attack Genius, but he could let Autumn and Winter eliminate her before she could attempt to cause any harm.","In Lin Yuan’s heart, the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly’s Insect Queen was not as important as Genius. There was no comparison between the two.","Genius activated its exclusive skill, Connected Tails, under Lin Yuan’s instructions and connected to the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly’s Insect Queen.","The Insect Queen didn’t do anything to resist and simply let Genius transmit a large amount of knowledge and information into her mind.","The eyes of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly’s Insect Queen underwent consecutive changes. It was obvious that she was unfamiliar and shocked by the information and knowledge Genius had transmitted.","In just 20 minutes, the Insect Queen of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly transformed from a newbie who only knew the situation inside the blessed land into a seasoned expert who knew the Sky Beyond the Clouds very well.","Due to Lin Yuan’s intention to heavily rely on the Insect Queen of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly, he instructed Genius to meticulously transmit information about the faith country and the Sky City, along with various languages.","Genius hurriedly said to Lin Yuan after transmitting the message through Connected Tails, “Lin Yuan, Genius is researching in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. It was just discussing with a few Hundred Questions Beasts how to update the potion formula. After sending her the message, Genius should be able to go back!”","Recently, Genius had been putting more and more effort into researching Creators. Apart from resting, Genius had basically spent all its time improving the abilities of Creators. After spending so much time and effort, Genius’ Creator-related abilities had improved greatly. Once Genius’ Creator’s ability was enhanced, it would be able to teach the other members of the Hundred Questions Beast Army and also enhance their abilities.","Just as Lin Yuan was about to agree to let Genius go back, he heard the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly’s Insect Queen speak in an obscure voice. “I didn’t expect this world to be so huge. I’ve always been like a frog at the bottom of a well, thinking that this environment is the entire world. I’ve underestimated everything. You’ve come here to tell me so much information. I guess you want to subdue me and make me your subordinate. I know that I’m powerless to resist you, but I’m also looking forward to the Sky City you’re in. As long as you agree to one condition, I’m willing to submit to you. Furthermore, with my species’ ability, I can give some benefits to the fey in your arms. Even if I can’t help their bloodline transform, it shouldn’t be a problem to successfully enhance them to the divine kingdom level. By the way, my name is Zhi Ling.”","After saying that, Zhi Ling bowed to Lin Yuan according to the knowledge in her mind to express her respect.","After Zhi Ling absorbed Genius’ knowledge and information, Lin Yuan knew that everything would go smoothly. However, he did not expect things to go so smoothly. Without needing him to say anything, Zhi Ling had already pledged her allegiance to him.","As expected, this Insect Queen, which was more than a hundred times smarter than ordinary fets, was indeed smart enough. Not only did she choose to submit, but she also took the initiative to make some requests for her own benefits.","Lin Yuan had taken in Zhi Ling and the entire Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies as his subordinates. However, he had no intention to make them his servants. Instead, he intended to make them the managers of the faith country.","Usually, ordinary members of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly interacted with Su Yiren and Luo Lan, the two core members of Sky City.","Zhi Ling, the Insect Queen of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly, would become a core member of Sky City like Keira. Lin Yuan would satisfy her needs.","At present, Lin Yuan was curious about Zhi Ling’s request. He was even more curious about how Zhi Ling had used her own abilities to help Genius evolve to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom level.","It had to be known that because of Genius’ bloodline, it was extremely difficult for it to increase its grade and quality. Even now, Lin Yuan was still letting Genius accumulate.","Lin Yuan looked at Zhi Ling and said in a very serious tone, “Zhi Ling, if you have any requests, you can tell me directly. As long as your request does not negatively affect Sky City, I can agree to it!”","Upon hearing his words, Zhi Ling said firmly, “I’m the Insect Queen, the actual manager of the species. I’ve joined you, so I need to ensure my status as the manager of the species. I cannot accept the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies breaking away from my control. I only have one request. Since you’ve passed so much information and knowledge to me, it means that you value the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies very much. Therefore, there’s no need for me to make requests concerning the development of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies.”","Zhi Ling’s request was very simple. Lin Yuan arranged for the Wisdom Eye","Brain Dragonfly to manage the faith country and connect with Su Yiren and Luo Lan. However, Luo Lan and Su Yiren would only have a normal hierarchical relationship with the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies and would not control them.","The Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonfly’s members were very intelligent.. Lin Yuan would not be at ease if he did not let Zhi Ling manage them!"]},{"number":3000,"title":"Chapter 3000: Comprehensive Deduction!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3000: Comprehensive Deduction!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","If a highly intelligent individual had any crooked thoughts within a huge group, it was very likely to cause an immeasurable impact. Moreover, those Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies were not just a few scattered units.","Based on Lin Yuan’s investigation of the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies, there should be between 500 and 1,000 members. Moreover, after Lin Yuan gained control of Zhi Ling, he would also help her expand the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies’ population.","Lin Yuan had already given orders to Su Yiren and Luo Lan to delay the development of the faith country because he could clearly feel that the rate of expansion of the faith country had exceeded Sky City’s current management ability.","If this continued, it would eventually lead to problems. Slowing down the development and expansion of the faith country was equivalent to reducing the speed of collection of faith power. Now that he had the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies under his command, the development of the faith country could continue to accelerate.","If Su Yiren and Luo Lan knew that they had found such good helpers like the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies, they would definitely be very excited.","“Zhi Ling, I can agree to your request. Rest assured that my promise to you is not just a temporary appeasement, but a commitment I will honor. But if I agree to your request, you have to promise me that you can manage the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies well and not make any serious mistakes.","“If you make a serious mistake in the process of managing the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies, I will revoke the rights given to you and arrange for someone to supervise you.”","Upon hearing that Lin Yuan had agreed to her request, Zhi Ling heaved a sigh of relief. When she made this request, she was not as resolute as she appeared to be. Instead, she was very apprehensive. Even if Lin Yuan did not agree, Zhi Ling could not possibly bring the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies to their demise. In the face of her hard-earned promise, Zhi Ling felt extremely cherished.","Zhi Ling released her holy spirit and allowed it to come before Lin Yuan in a submissive manner.","Lin Yuan did not hold back and controlled Zhi Ling’s holy spirit. Right on the heels of that, he took out a Lifespan Mouse and handed it to Zhi Ling.","“Your species has a long lifespan, but it will reach its end sooner or later. If you contract this Lifespan Mouse, you will obtain an endless lifespan in the future.","That way, you can better showcase your value.”","Zhi Ling was pleasantly surprised and looked at Lin Yuan in disbelief. The higher the intelligence of a species, the more they understood the importance of lifespan.","However, Zhi Ling was not a Creator, so she could not comprehend the significance of Lin Yuan giving her the Lifespan Mouse to contract.","Under Zhi Ling’s control, the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies would become the management of the faith country. This was extremely important, hence Lin Yuan needed to exercise double control over their management to ensure that he could effectively control Zhi Ling.","Zhi Ling happily received the Lifespan Mouse. Fearing that Lin Yuan might change his mind, she promptly contracted it. After Zhi Ling completed her contract with the Lifespan Mouse, Lin Yuan took it away.","“The core members of Sky City also contract the Lifespan Mouse. I will keep your Lifespan Mouse for safekeeping. It will use resources containing abundant vitality to feed these Lifespan Mice. As the contractor, you can sense its lifespan reserves!”","Even though Zhi Ling was not a Creator, she understood Lin Yuan’s intention of taking away the Lifespan Mouse and managing it. However, she did not think much of it. Zhi Ling had joined Lin Yuan and Sky City, but she had never thought of betraying Sky City in the future.","On the contrary, after understanding Sky City’s situation, Zhi Ling was prepared to develop well in Sky City, especially now that she had obtained an endless lifespan. In the long years in the future, Zhi Ling was looking forward to seeing how far she and Sky City could go.","After knowing that the core members of Sky City had an endless lifespan, Zhi Ling was prepared to interact with them and try to build a good relationship.","Regarding loyalty and performance, Zhi Ling did not continue the topic and asked Lin Yuan instead, “Lord, do you need me to help your companion evolve? After a while, I will undergo a metamorphosis. After the metamorphosis, I won’t be able to help you!”","Apart from currying favor with Lin Yuan, Zhi Ling also wanted to thank Genius. She was very grateful for the knowledge Genius had imparted to her, allowing her to understand the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds and the mysterious and dangerous world outside. Zhi Ling was now trying to repay Genius.","Genius needed to withstand danger if it wanted to evolve. With Zhi Ling’s support, it was a good thing for Genius regardless of whether it could successfully evolve. Naturally, Lin Yuan would not reject such a request!","Lin Yuan lowered his head to look at Genius in his arms and said gravely,","“Genius, your chance has come. I’m afraid I can’t let you return to the Spirit Lock spatial zone to complete the concoction. If you can successfully evolve this time, your future path as a Creator will definitely be smoother than now!”","When Genius heard Zhi Ling mention that it was helpful to her, it looked at Lin Yuan and Zhi Ling eagerly—it was looking forward to its evolution!","Genius and Chimey were the first to follow Lin Yuan, but they had yet to reach the Divine Kingdom level. Compared to Chimey, Genius’ evolution in grade and quality was much slower.","When Genius first came to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it had completed a grade and quality upgrade. However, Chimey had just reached Creation Breed. Its grade was still at Suzerain, and it had yet to evolve.","Lin Yuan had been in the Sky Beyond the Clouds for almost a year. Genius had only advanced from Suzerain to Sovereign. Its quality had also evolved from Creation I to Creation VII, but it had yet to reach the pinnacle of Creation Breed.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to check Genius. [Fey Name]: Highest Access Fate-Knowing Beast [Fey Species]: Fantasy-cat-genus/fantasy-cat-species r Fey Grade]: Sovereign (0/10)","[Fey Type]: Spiritual/Soul [Fey Quality]: Creation VII","Abilities:","[Memory Deduction]: When recalling something, it will be able to remember every minuscule detail. From this, it will be able to organize the information and infer the truth.","[Crowded Cat]: If it can control cat-species feys and convince the cats to crowd around it, it will be able to become affiliated with all of the cat-species feys’ elements and bodies. Every time the cat-species feys crowd around, it will be weak for some time.","[Spiritual Energy Expansion]: Transfer the spiritual energy into an emergency bank for the contractor. Even though the contractor cannot willfully use Spiritual Energy Expansion to increase his own store of spiritual energy, he can use it to defend himself against spiritual energy damage.","[Master of Cats]: As the new leader of cat-species feys, it can use spiritual energy to form contracts with other cat-species feys, control their lives, and share in their spiritual power.","[Soul Permutation]: Use and change different spiritual energies into soul power.","[Tail Trigger]: When using soul power, a tail can be sacrificed to increase the soul power. Without any tails, Tail Trigger cannot be used.","[True Knowledge Analysis]: Use spiritual energy to envelop an entity and the composition of the entity will be analyzed. Entities that have been combined will be analyzed separately. After the analysis, there will be a confirmation from the heavenly will to ascertain accuracy.","[Comprehensive Deduction]: After using the True Knowledge Analysis to analyze something, it is possible to anchor many things that have been analyzed by the True Knowledge Analysis at the same time and use the revelations of the heavens to infer the corresponding connection between these things.","Exclusive Skill:","[Tool Transformation]: Capable of transforming into a tool for the contractor to use.","[Tail of Fate]: 1. Connected Tails: According to the number of tails, lives can be connected. The connected lives can share thinking and intention. 2. Highest Access Tail: Combine all the tails into one. If it craves for knowledge enough, it can sacrifice its spiritual energy to communicate with the heavens and request for an answer.","[Sky Fate Attachment]: The affiliation with heavenly will will be deepened and the fate of the heavenly will will be attached to it to elevate its chances of success when concocting spirit fluids or when performing other actions.","[Linked Fate Protection]: Link the fate of the cat-species lifeforms under its control with fortune. A network will be formed that will protect all the cat-species lifeforms. When the cat-species lifeforms under its protection are evolved, its own spiritual energy will increase and its store of spiritual energy will increase as well.","The new skill that Genius had obtained after his grade evolution was called Comprehensive Deduction. This Sovereign ability was not only able to connect with the Suzerain ability, True Knowledge Analysis, but it was also a strengthened version of True Knowledge Analysis.","True Knowledge Analysis allowed Genius to analyze things thoroughly. Even if this thing was a compound existence, it could still separate the effects and use the guidance of the heavens to determine whether the conclusion was correct or not.","Comprehensive Deduction allowed Genius to better use these analyzed things and seek the correlation between many things. This was the fundamental reason why Genius had been focusing on reproducing the various potion formulas recently!","The knowledge that Genius transmitted to Zhi Ling did not include Genius’ situation with the Hundred Questions Beasts. Zhi Ling might have treated Genius as an ordinary spiritual-type or soul-type fey.","Lin Yuan did not think that Zhi Ling could really help Genius reach World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. As long as Zhi Ling could help Genius evolve into Sovereign/lmmortal, Lin Yuan would already be very satisfied.","Genius was equivalent to a Grade 4 Creator. If Genius’ strength improved further, Genius would reach the level of pinnacle Grade 4 Creator, or even comparable to a Grade 5 Creator!","“Zhi Ling, if you can help Genius increase its grade and quality, you’ll be doing me a huge favor. In the future, I will help you increase the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies’ population and strength.”","When Zhi Ling heard Lin Yuan’s words, she felt that she was being looked down upon. It was as if Lin Yuan did not think she could help Genius reach","World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. This was the first thing Zhi Ling had done for Lin Yuan. She wanted Lin Yuan to see her in a new light.","Zhi Ling raised her hand and tapped the center of her forehead. A majestic and gentle power that was a mix of spirit and soul surged out of Zhi Ling’s body and entered Genius’ body.","Genius realized that it could directly absorb this mingled force of spirit and soul. It knew how to seize the opportunity and hurriedly focused on absorbing the energy.","While Genius was absorbing the spirit and soul energy, the surrounding spirit qi gathered towards it. It was obvious that Genius urgently needed pure spirit qi.","Lin Yuan took out numerous spirit qi crystals and crushed them. He let the spiritual qi flow towards Genius like a tide.","The input of a stream of pure spirit qi instantly increased Genius’ absorption speed of the energy released by Zhi Ling. Lin Yuan could sense that Genius’ strength was slowly increasing.","Before providing Genius with energy, Zhi Ling thought that improving Genius was an easy task. However, now that she was really helping Genius, Zhi Ling felt like she was holding a pipe and pouring water into a dam. After pouring in for so long, the dam showed no signs of filling up.","Fortunately, she had accumulated a lot of spiritual and soul energy, so she might as well provide it to the cat-type creature in Lin Yuan’s arms before her metamorphosis. In any case, the energy was not very beneficial to her transformation.","Seeing that Genius had failed to evolve by a grade and quality after so long, Zhi","Ling was certain she had no way of helping Genius reach World","Emperor/Divine Kingdom. However, she could still increase Genius’ grade and quality.","Lin Yuan had promised her that he would help her increase the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies’ population and strength if she could help Genius.","While enhancing the Wisdom Eye Brain Dragonflies’ strength could make her more powerful, Zhi Ling was more concerned about Lin Yuan’s willingness to help expand the population. The larger the population, the more rewards Zhi Ling would receive from its members. It would be easier for Zhi Ling to obtain faith power in the future!","With Zhi Ling and Lin Yuan’s selfless investment, Genius finally reached pinnacle Sovereign X/Creation VIII, welcoming the World Cleansing.","Looking at the World Cleansing, Lin Yuan thought that Genius’ evolution to","Immortal triggered a World Cleansing on a much larger scale than other feys attaining Eternal power.."]}]);
